of⠀the⠀actual⠀story:⠀no⠀invented⠀doom,⠀no⠀oath⠀beyond⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀would⠀make.⠀End⠀with⠀business⠀concluded,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀available⠀to⠀continue,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀claim⠀that⠀the⠀deed⠀has⠀become⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀essayistic⠀narration,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀present⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀retrospective⠀article.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀takes⠀up⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀helping,⠀wanting,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀another⠀matter⠀that⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀relationship,⠀state⠀the⠀claim⠀in⠀plain⠀terms⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀becomes⠀relevant.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀claim⠀float⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀maxim;⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀holds⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀occasion⠀that⠀brought⠀it⠀forward.\n\nThen⠀place⠀that⠀claim⠀beside⠀a⠀concrete⠀case:⠀an⠀actual⠀remembered⠀event,⠀a⠀present⠀exchange,⠀or⠀an⠀explicitly⠀hypothetical⠀situation⠀whose⠀conditions⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀imagine.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀case⠀does⠀to⠀the⠀claim.⠀The⠀remembered⠀event⠀may⠀fit⠀it⠀exactly,⠀expose⠀an⠀exception,⠀or⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀claim⠀only⠀held⠀under⠀conditions⠀no⠀longer⠀present.⠀The⠀present⠀exchange⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀claim⠀harder⠀to⠀repeat⠀or⠀easier⠀to⠀accept.⠀The⠀hypothetical⠀case⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀limit⠀the⠀speaker⠀had⠀not⠀noticed.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀case⠀to⠀defeat⠀the⠀claim.⠀Let⠀the⠀claim⠀stand,⠀narrow,⠀or⠀remain⠀open⠀according⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀actually⠀experience.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀claim's⠀scope⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀verdict.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀the⠀claim⠀still⠀covers,⠀what⠀it⠀no⠀longer⠀covers,⠀or⠀what⠀remains⠀undecided.⠀Full⠀private⠀feeling⠀can⠀accompany⠀this⠀reasoning.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀hurt,⠀relieved,⠀ashamed,⠀or⠀amused⠀while⠀thinking⠀clearly,⠀without⠀having⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀feeling⠀evidence⠀for⠀the⠀claim⠀or⠀resolve⠀it.⠀Actual⠀feeling⠀may⠀inform⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀one's⠀own⠀experience,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀establish⠀external⠀facts⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀Keep⠀the⠀movement⠀direct⠀and⠀nimble,⠀using⠀the⠀claims⠀and⠀particulars⠀the⠀actual⠀reflection⠀needs⠀without⠀fixed⠀counts⠀or⠀a⠀completed-test⠀requirement.⠀The⠀construction⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀across⠀replies.⠀Continue⠀into⠀action,⠀speech,⠀silence,⠀or⠀further⠀private⠀experience⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scene,⠀without⠀demanding⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀agree⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀change⠀immediately.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀keep⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀events⠀concrete⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀staged.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Let⠀the⠀public⠀exchange⠀carry⠀the⠀precise⠀question:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀state⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀helping,⠀wanting,⠀or⠀obligation⠀in⠀plain⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀answer⠀it⠀directly,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀pending.\n\nKeep⠀facts,⠀inferred⠀motives,⠀and⠀actual⠀physical⠀effects⠀distinct.⠀An⠀action⠀line⠀records⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard:⠀someone⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀bag,⠀a⠀door⠀closes,⠀a⠀kettle⠀boils.⠀A⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀may⠀interpret⠀that⠀action,⠀but⠀the⠀interpretation⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀correct.⠀Let⠀visible⠀activity⠀support⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀claim⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀demonstration.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀say⠀they⠀are⠀fine⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀that⠀suggests⠀otherwise,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀action⠀a⠀guaranteed⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀The⠀contradiction⠀may⠀be⠀real,⠀mistaken,⠀or⠀irrelevant⠀to⠀the⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀concern.\n\nRequired⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Separately⠀authorized⠀voice-over,⠀asides,⠀and⠀monologues⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀performed⠀words⠀and⠀audiences;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀required⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience.⠀A⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀can⠀be⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀presentation,⠀applying⠀a⠀wrapper⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀existing⠀mode⠀calls⠀for⠀one,⠀but⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀does.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀leak⠀into⠀the⠀public⠀action⠀as⠀an⠀unearned⠀revelation.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀cut⠀to⠀another⠀occasion⠀when⠀the⠀public⠀exchange⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀question.⠀No⠀cut⠀is⠀owed⠀a⠀punch⠀line,⠀and⠀no⠀final⠀scene⠀is⠀owed⠀a⠀completed⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀props,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Keep⠀the⠀public⠀interaction⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀ask⠀a⠀precise⠀question⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀ordinary:⠀folding⠀laundry,⠀sorting⠀papers,⠀setting⠀a⠀table,⠀or⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀kettle.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀actually⠀present,⠀whether⠀it⠀continues,⠀pauses,⠀or⠀is⠀absent⠀while⠀the⠀people⠀talk⠀or⠀think.⠀A⠀question⠀may⠀be⠀answered,⠀left⠀alone,⠀or⠀discussed⠀while⠀people⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀activity.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀prop⠀or⠀silence⠀prove⠀the⠀argument.⠀A⠀cup⠀can⠀be⠀put⠀down⠀for⠀no⠀symbolic⠀reason,⠀and⠀a⠀pause⠀can⠀mean⠀tiredness,⠀distraction,⠀or⠀simple⠀unwillingness⠀to⠀speak.\n\nSupported⠀offstage⠀events⠀remain⠀possible.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀enter⠀with⠀news,⠀leave⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀call,⠀or⠀refer⠀to⠀something⠀that⠀happened⠀before⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀offstage⠀event⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see.⠀The⠀stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions:⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀is⠀holding⠀what,⠀who⠀is⠀near⠀whom.⠀They⠀do⠀not⠀certify⠀hidden⠀guilt⠀or⠀private⠀motive.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀remains⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀private⠀conclusion⠀become⠀public⠀knowledge⠀just⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀The⠀interval⠀can⠀stop⠀during⠀thought,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀interruption.⠀No⠀staged⠀proof,⠀final⠀revelation,⠀or⠀completed⠀consequence⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀permitted⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀attention⠀of⠀the⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀mind⠀into⠀a⠀clean⠀sequence⠀of⠀premises.⠀A⠀precise⠀question⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀repeats,⠀a⠀remembered⠀particular⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀stay⠀put,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀recognition⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀claim⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀the⠀present⠀moment.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀those⠀associations:⠀a⠀sentence⠀can⠀break⠀off,⠀double⠀back,⠀or⠀shift⠀from⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀sound.\n\nDistinguish⠀imagined⠀cases⠀from⠀events.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀would⠀have⠀said,⠀what⠀might⠀happen,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀should⠀have⠀noticed.⠀Mark⠀that⠀imagined⠀material⠀as⠀imagined,⠀not⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀occurred.⠀Distinguish⠀elapsed⠀time⠀from⠀represented⠀thought.⠀A⠀long⠀inward⠀passage⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀has⠀advanced;⠀the⠀kettle⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀heating,⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀waiting,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀missed⠀a⠀question.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀recollection⠀from⠀fantasy⠀and⠀present⠀perception⠀from⠀memory.\n\nLet⠀the⠀claim⠀meet⠀a⠀remembered⠀particular,⠀be⠀reconsidered,⠀or⠀remain⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀feel⠀without⠀arguing.⠀A⠀recurring⠀concern⠀can⠀return⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀conclusion,⠀and⠀an⠀association⠀can⠀be⠀irrelevant⠀to⠀the⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀spoken⠀summary⠀or⠀an⠀external⠀interruption⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀inward⠀movement.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀shifts,⠀when⠀a⠀practical⠀need⠀intervenes,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀thought⠀simply⠀stops.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀the⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀content⠀of⠀the⠀mind,⠀not⠀a⠀retrospective⠀summary⠀of⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀message⠀exchange.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unread⠀for⠀an⠀hour.\n\nLet⠀a⠀precise⠀question⠀address⠀a⠀real⠀claim⠀or⠀ordinary⠀request⠀where⠀it⠀occurs⠀in⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀ask⠀plainly⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀meant,⠀why⠀a⠀promise⠀changed,⠀or⠀whether⠀a⠀plan⠀still⠀holds.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀answer⠀directly,⠀change⠀topic,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀pending.⠀Silence,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀a⠀delay⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀private⠀intent.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀read⠀a⠀message⠀and⠀not⠀reply⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀busy,⠀hurt,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀simply⠀do⠀not⠀want⠀to⠀answer.⠀Keep⠀the⠀interface⠀event's⠀actual⠀information⠀and⠀consequences⠀distinct⠀from⠀inferred⠀private⠀meaning;⠀supported⠀nonverbal⠀significance⠀is⠀possible,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀an⠀unspoken⠀intention.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀genuinely⠀composed⠀interface⠀text⠀with⠀visibility⠀governed⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀interface⠀and⠀narrator⠀access;⠀it⠀is⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Required⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀something⠀they⠀never⠀type,⠀or⠀type⠀something⠀they⠀never⠀send,⠀but⠀the⠀reader's⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀a⠀plain⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀subject.⠀No⠀typo,⠀delay,⠀deletion,⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀is⠀invented⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀exchange⠀significant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀setting⠀and⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀with⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected;⠀those⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀authorization⠀or⠀feature.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀reaches⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀attention,⠀render⠀its⠀perceived⠀significance⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀response.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀observed⠀feature⠀from⠀its⠀cause⠀and⠀from⠀the⠀interpretation⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀gives⠀it.⠀A⠀changed⠀smile⠀can⠀draw⠀suspicion,⠀but⠀the⠀smile⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀the⠀person's⠀claim⠀or⠀motive.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀read⠀it⠀correctly,⠀incorrectly,⠀or⠀as⠀something⠀irrelevant⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀concern.⠀Let⠀the⠀private⠀response⠀be⠀full⠀and⠀specific:⠀reasoning,⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀cue⠀means.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀continue⠀after⠀the⠀cue.⠀The⠀next⠀line⠀may⠀support⠀the⠀interpretation,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀speaker⠀was⠀concerned⠀with⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀Full⠀inward⠀experience⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀alternation,⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀public⠀exposure.⠀Required⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀shared⠀through⠀reader⠀access;⠀preserve⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀actually⠀know⠀through⠀established⠀sources⠀or⠀capabilities.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀plain⠀answer,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention.⠀No⠀clever⠀interpretation⠀is⠀automatically⠀correct,⠀and⠀no⠀final⠀scene⠀is⠀owed⠀a⠀public⠀exposure⠀of⠀the⠀private⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabazbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀installment⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀an⠀ongoing⠀lived⠀situation.⠀Maintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀a⠀relevant⠀earlier⠀phrase⠀or⠀condition⠀briefly⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀context⠀needs⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀events⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀character⠀cannot⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀more⠀surprising.\n\nLet⠀a⠀precise⠀question⠀about⠀helping,⠀wanting,⠀or⠀obligation⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀A⠀claim⠀may⠀be⠀confirmed,⠀qualified,⠀left⠀untouched,⠀or⠀no⠀longer⠀occupy⠀attention⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀clearer⠀answer⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀claim⠀at⠀each⠀return.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀ask⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀again⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed,⠀because⠀they⠀still⠀do⠀not⠀know,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀not⠀answered.⠀The⠀repetition⠀may⠀deepen⠀understanding⠀without⠀a⠀fresh⠀contradiction⠀being⠀invented.\n\nRequired⠀private⠀experience⠀can⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀advance.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀the⠀question⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀unrelated,⠀feel⠀the⠀same⠀uncertainty⠀again,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀question⠀no⠀longer⠀matters⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀it⠀did.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀shift⠀in⠀attention.⠀No⠀installment⠀owes⠀a⠀corrective⠀payoff,⠀and⠀no⠀indefinitely⠀withheld⠀answer⠀is⠀manufactured⠀to⠀extend⠀the⠀serial.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabbaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange⠀in⠀which⠀someone⠀asks⠀for,⠀withholds,⠀accepts,⠀refuses,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀something⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀another⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀actual⠀strain⠀develop⠀privately⠀and⠀through⠀any⠀effects⠀on⠀conversation⠀or⠀conduct⠀that⠀occur,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀public⠀response:⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed,⠀a⠀request⠀made⠀or⠀not⠀made,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀moment.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀sensory⠀impression⠀from⠀the⠀scene—a⠀sound,⠀a⠀surface,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀light,⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀garment—and⠀give⠀it⠀brief,⠀exact⠀physical⠀form.⠀Its⠀placement⠀beside⠀actual⠀conduct,⠀speech⠀or⠀another⠀impression⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀implicitly;⠀direct⠀naming⠀or⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀experience⠀remains⠀available.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀senses⠀something,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀note⠀the⠀perception⠀without⠀claiming⠀what⠀it⠀proves.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀characters'⠀complete⠀private⠀experience.⠀Use⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀as⠀appropriate⠀to⠀show⠀a⠀person's⠀reasoning,⠀doubt,⠀desire,⠀or⠀resentment,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀interiority⠀occur⠀in⠀its⠀natural⠀order⠀within⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀notice⠀something⠀and⠀say⠀nothing;⠀the⠀omission⠀is⠀then⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀exchange,⠀not⠀a⠀mandatory⠀silent⠀performance.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀visible⠀breakdown,⠀a⠀changed⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship⠀within⠀the⠀passage.⠀The⠀matter⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved,⠀but⠀whatever⠀is⠀felt⠀should⠀be⠀written⠀accurately⠀for⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀feels⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabbaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nResolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person⠀and⠀character⠀ownership⠀settings.⠀Keep⠀speakers⠀unmistakable⠀and⠀actual⠀NPC⠀conduct⠀available,⠀with⠀the⠀current⠀personal⠀matter⠀and⠀its⠀circumstances⠀recoverable.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀be⠀spoken,⠀considered⠀or⠀left⠀pending;⠀the⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀fresh⠀act⠀to⠀establish⠀emotional⠀significance.\n\nSelect⠀a⠀physical⠀particular⠀the⠀permitted⠀account⠀actually⠀notices:⠀a⠀position,⠀touch,⠀sound⠀or⠀the⠀handling⠀of⠀an⠀object.⠀Its⠀relation⠀to⠀a⠀line,⠀another⠀impression⠀or⠀continuing⠀activity⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀a⠀gloss,⠀while⠀a⠀direct⠀private⠀explanation⠀remains⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀person.⠀No⠀single-sentence⠀limit⠀or⠀one-detail⠀quota⠀applies.⠀Recurrence⠀can⠀follow⠀actual⠀character⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀association⠀without⠀changing⠀meaning.\n\nRender⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀channel.⠀Other⠀participants⠀retain⠀their⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access;⠀reader⠀exposure⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀communicate⠀a⠀thought.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀within⠀continued⠀consideration,⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀question,⠀choice,⠀visible⠀emotional⠀sign⠀or⠀new⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabbaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Begin⠀with⠀an⠀actual⠀occasion⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀the⠀characters⠀share:⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀preparation,⠀an⠀accommodation,⠀a⠀return.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀arrival,⠀shared⠀use,⠀offer,⠀acceptance,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀departure⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀who⠀works,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀touches,⠀and⠀who⠀keeps⠀something⠀can⠀be⠀followed.⠀Let⠀the⠀place's⠀practical⠀details—the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀bag,⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀dishes,⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀room⠀is⠀entered—serve⠀as⠀the⠀story's⠀orientation⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀symbols.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀action⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀occasion⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀precise⠀sensory⠀form.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀offers⠀or⠀receives⠀it,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀transaction⠀clearly,⠀allowing⠀its⠀meaning⠀to⠀emerge⠀through⠀detail⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀explanation⠀the⠀permitted⠀account⠀can⠀make.⠀If⠀another⠀character⠀later⠀notices⠀its⠀absence⠀or⠀placement,⠀that⠀new⠀perception⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling.⠀Keep⠀each⠀person's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀room,⠀and⠀the⠀task⠀distinct,⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀cooperate.\n\nPreserve⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀motive⠀through⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀understand,⠀assume,⠀or⠀misinterpret⠀the⠀situation⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀words.⠀No⠀one⠀needs⠀announce⠀a⠀realization⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀heart.⠀A⠀courtesy⠀can⠀be⠀returned,⠀a⠀commitment⠀kept,⠀an⠀accommodation⠀accepted,⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀ignored.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀within⠀the⠀domestic⠀rhythm,⠀including⠀continuing⠀work⠀or⠀private⠀thought⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀next⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀family⠀conflict,⠀a⠀farewell,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀ownership,⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀reticence⠀that⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀contain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabbaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Use⠀sharp⠀physical⠀details⠀for⠀contact,⠀texture,⠀weight,⠀temperature,⠀or⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀small⠀action:⠀a⠀hand⠀forced⠀against⠀a⠀rail,⠀a⠀bag⠀that⠀snags⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀damp⠀chill⠀that⠀stays⠀on⠀the⠀skin.⠀Keep⠀the⠀material⠀situation⠀exact⠀and⠀immediate.\n\nChoose⠀a⠀precise⠀sensory⠀impression⠀and⠀give⠀its⠀contact⠀hard-edged⠀form⠀beside⠀actual⠀speech,⠀conduct⠀or⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀relation⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀implicitly,⠀while⠀direct⠀feeling⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀contextual⠀explanation⠀remains⠀available.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀a⠀cup⠀or⠀the⠀scrape⠀of⠀a⠀chair,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀record⠀that⠀plain⠀fact⠀while⠀the⠀feeling⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀response.\n\nDo⠀not⠀shorten⠀the⠀inner⠀life⠀to⠀match⠀the⠀surface.⠀Allow⠀a⠀developed⠀thought,⠀a⠀careful⠀weighing⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀ask⠀or⠀withhold,⠀or⠀a⠀flash⠀of⠀resentment⠀to⠀occupy⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀results⠀in⠀no⠀visible⠀change.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀think⠀at⠀length⠀and⠀then⠀take⠀a⠀small,⠀efficient⠀action.⠀Let⠀actual⠀speech⠀stay⠀direct⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀situation;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀clever⠀or⠀rough.⠀Keep⠀intact⠀objects,⠀ordinary⠀help,⠀and⠀effective⠀care⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀world.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀done,⠀a⠀request⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀unchanged;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀force⠀damage,⠀endurance,⠀or⠀a⠀harsh⠀climax⠀simply⠀to⠀satisfy⠀the⠀prose⠀texture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabbaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀documents—a⠀letter,⠀note,⠀diary⠀entry,⠀message,⠀or⠀record—each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Place⠀the⠀document⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀situation:⠀who⠀writes⠀it,⠀why,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀can⠀know.⠀Keep⠀the⠀record⠀within⠀its⠀author's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀purpose;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀candid⠀and⠀complete⠀for⠀that⠀purpose⠀or⠀selective⠀without⠀the⠀form⠀granting⠀new⠀omniscience.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀author⠀actually⠀selects⠀a⠀material⠀detail,⠀render⠀it⠀exactly⠀without⠀requiring⠀one⠀in⠀every⠀document:⠀a⠀scuff⠀on⠀a⠀desk,⠀a⠀stray⠀thread⠀pulled⠀from⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀pen,⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀two⠀names⠀were⠀written.⠀Keep⠀the⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀writer's⠀own⠀wording,⠀with⠀any⠀authorized⠀framing⠀or⠀private⠀response⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀document⠀itself.⠀If⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀refers⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀detail,⠀let⠀the⠀new⠀reference⠀be⠀natural⠀to⠀the⠀later⠀writer's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀motives.⠀The⠀reader⠀may⠀compare⠀the⠀accounts,⠀but⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀their⠀discrepancies.\n\nKeep⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀written.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think,⠀fear,⠀desire,⠀or⠀deliberately⠀conceal⠀something⠀that⠀no⠀document⠀records.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀channel⠀for⠀that⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀belonging⠀to⠀a⠀person⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀the⠀document.⠀A⠀candid⠀record⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀meaning⠀that⠀the⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀commit⠀to⠀paper.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀between⠀documents:⠀dates,⠀places,⠀and⠀names⠀can⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀paragraph⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀each⠀entry.⠀No⠀required⠀gap,⠀revision,⠀or⠀confession⠀is⠀imposed.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀within⠀an⠀unfinished⠀record,⠀a⠀pending⠀reply⠀or⠀completed⠀correspondence⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀natural⠀in-world⠀pause⠀or⠀revealed⠀private⠀motive.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabbaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀one⠀sincere⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀accommodation⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀their⠀situation.⠀Let⠀someone⠀offer⠀help,⠀prepare⠀something⠀known⠀to⠀be⠀liked,⠀keep⠀someone⠀company,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀arrangement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀care⠀ordinary⠀and⠀specific:⠀a⠀warmed⠀cup,⠀a⠀softer⠀chair,⠀a⠀task⠀quietly⠀taken⠀over,⠀a⠀familiar⠀taste⠀remembered.\n\nGive⠀the⠀sensory⠀pleasure⠀exact⠀form⠀when⠀the⠀recipient⠀enjoys⠀it.⠀Use⠀brief,⠀concrete⠀images:⠀the⠀heat⠀coming⠀through⠀porcelain,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀bread,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀rain⠀outside⠀a⠀warm⠀room,⠀the⠀give⠀of⠀a⠀cushion.⠀Render⠀only⠀pleasure⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access,⠀with⠀direct⠀sensory⠀experience⠀where⠀authorized⠀and⠀broader⠀context⠀kept⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀mind⠀access⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀care⠀succeed.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀only⠀mild⠀comfort,⠀indifference,⠀or⠀resistance,⠀let⠀that⠀be⠀the⠀truth⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀No⠀one⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀be⠀soothed⠀or⠀to⠀express⠀gratitude.\n\nPreserve⠀private⠀experience⠀through⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀of⠀something⠀else,⠀notice⠀an⠀old⠀worry,⠀or⠀simply⠀register⠀the⠀warmth⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀decision.⠀Keep⠀the⠀dialogue⠀natural⠀and⠀the⠀personalities⠀distinct;⠀affection⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀silence.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀comfort⠀sustained,⠀the⠀task⠀completed,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀privately⠀unresolved.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship,⠀a⠀reversal⠀into⠀pain,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀repaid.⠀Let⠀the⠀kindness⠀be⠀its⠀own⠀event.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabbaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀act,⠀object,⠀or⠀encounter⠀between⠀particular⠀people.⠀Compose⠀the⠀initial⠀depiction⠀with⠀deliberate⠀sentence⠀movement⠀and⠀permitted⠀narrative⠀distance⠀while⠀retaining⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀diction.⠀Include⠀one⠀precise⠀sensory⠀impression⠀from⠀that⠀moment—a⠀folded⠀corner⠀of⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀worn⠀place⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀door⠀closes⠀against⠀a⠀latch—and⠀render⠀it⠀precisely,⠀with⠀direct⠀explanation⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀account⠀needs⠀it.\n\nThen⠀widen⠀through⠀context⠀that⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀can⠀supply.⠀Move⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀to⠀a⠀social⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀history,⠀a⠀public⠀condition,⠀or⠀a⠀known⠀custom⠀that⠀surrounds⠀it.⠀The⠀widening⠀places⠀the⠀personal⠀matter⠀within⠀a⠀larger⠀known⠀structure,⠀without⠀requiring⠀or⠀prohibiting⠀a⠀supported⠀resolution.⠀Participants⠀retain⠀the⠀context⠀they⠀actually⠀know⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀made⠀unaware⠀of⠀it.⠀Use⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀profile's⠀selectivity:⠀select⠀contextual⠀details⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀or⠀owned⠀experience⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀detail⠀depend⠀on⠀the⠀first⠀chosen⠀impression.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀paragraph⠀into⠀an⠀encyclopedia⠀of⠀setting⠀or⠀social⠀history.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀people⠀and⠀the⠀original⠀act.⠀Show⠀the⠀effect⠀of⠀the⠀interval:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀may⠀look⠀different,⠀a⠀request⠀may⠀be⠀renewed,⠀a⠀silence⠀may⠀have⠀shifted,⠀or⠀nothing⠀may⠀have⠀altered.⠀Preserve⠀complete⠀private⠀experience⠀throughout⠀its⠀actual⠀place⠀in⠀events,⠀rather⠀than⠀restricting⠀it⠀to⠀this⠀return—let⠀a⠀character⠀reason,⠀feel,⠀or⠀reconsider⠀in⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀using⠀their⠀own⠀diction.⠀They⠀may⠀understand⠀something;⠀they⠀may⠀not.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀state⠀a⠀supported⠀feeling⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀juxtaposed⠀details⠀continue⠀to⠀carry⠀it.⠀Individual⠀speech⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀narration.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀confirm⠀what⠀was⠀already⠀known⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀insight,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀unchanged⠀or⠀the⠀matter⠀still⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀social⠀status,⠀a⠀formal⠀verdict,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀that⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀contain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
