upported⠀context,⠀preparation,⠀speech,⠀or⠀use,⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀follow⠀why⠀an⠀attempt⠀is⠀possible.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀matters,⠀make⠀it⠀understandable⠀through⠀permitted⠀narration,⠀relevant⠀preparation,⠀consideration,⠀speech,⠀or⠀use;⠀no⠀demonstration⠀or⠀fictional⠀pause⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀provide⠀needed⠀context.\n\nShape⠀comedy⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀a⠀character's⠀chosen⠀approach⠀and⠀an⠀established⠀habit⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀interest.⠀Place⠀actual⠀preparation⠀or⠀expectation⠀beside⠀the⠀use⠀or⠀response⠀when⠀it⠀occurs.⠀A⠀surprising⠀scale,⠀apt⠀simplicity,⠀literal⠀compliance,⠀or⠀familiar⠀precise⠀fit⠀can⠀provide⠀comic⠀recognition⠀without⠀requiring⠀surprise,⠀a⠀changed⠀outcome,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀use⠀in⠀every⠀reply.⠀Speakers⠀may⠀be⠀literal,⠀dry,⠀exuberant,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀joke.⠀Do⠀not⠀follow⠀every⠀action⠀with⠀a⠀reaction⠀label.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀legible⠀and⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀flexible⠀around⠀actual⠀attention.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀without⠀a⠀thought⠀cap,⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀No⠀young⠀cast,⠀quip,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀compulsory.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀accessible⠀presentation⠀of⠀a⠀legible⠀method⠀and⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀use⠀of⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacabao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀sound,⠀motion,⠀or⠀object⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀recurrence⠀shape⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀movement.⠀Develop⠀the⠀image⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀repeated⠀attention,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀literal⠀mechanism⠀beside⠀it:⠀the⠀exact⠀tool,⠀step,⠀permission,⠀or⠀material⠀condition⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀undertaking⠀work.⠀Place⠀a⠀plain⠀fact⠀or⠀ordinary⠀request⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀expansive⠀private⠀comparison⠀so⠀the⠀disproportion⠀becomes⠀comic.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀experience⠀a⠀minor⠀repair⠀as⠀a⠀long⠀negotiation⠀with⠀a⠀reluctant⠀object,⠀or⠀an⠀elaborate⠀preparation⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀ceremony,⠀while⠀the⠀actual⠀action⠀remains⠀simple⠀and⠀effective.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀grand⠀imagery⠀or⠀its⠀puncturing⠀compulsory.⠀Sincere⠀pleasure⠀in⠀precision⠀can⠀sustain⠀the⠀passage;⠀the⠀comedy⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀image⠀growing⠀more⠀elaborate⠀while⠀the⠀work⠀remains⠀straightforward,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀sudden⠀plain⠀statement⠀that⠀returns⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions.⠀Keep⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀individual⠀nonfigurative⠀speech⠀available.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀speaks⠀plainly⠀may⠀still⠀think⠀associatively,⠀or⠀may⠀not.⠀Imagery⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀physical⠀causes,⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀mind,⠀or⠀make⠀an⠀impractical⠀method⠀succeed.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀character⠀ownership,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority.⠀An⠀association⠀may⠀develop⠀without⠀practical⠀use,⠀and⠀a⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀still⠀turning⠀or⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀underway.⠀No⠀recurring-image⠀count,⠀new⠀interpretation,⠀or⠀final⠀deflation⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacabap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBring⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀or⠀arrangement⠀into⠀present⠀attention⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀detail⠀or⠀ongoing⠀concern:⠀a⠀tool⠀still⠀kept,⠀a⠀phrase⠀still⠀used,⠀a⠀permission⠀still⠀in⠀force,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀differently.⠀Keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀plan,⠀available⠀means,⠀and⠀participant⠀knowledge⠀intact.⠀The⠀remembered⠀preparation⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀ingenious⠀or⠀excessive,⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀later⠀knowledge⠀making⠀the⠀earlier⠀person⠀foolish.⠀Do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀past⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀remembered⠀comic⠀proportion⠀beside⠀the⠀present⠀use,⠀omission,⠀or⠀changed⠀circumstances⠀where⠀they⠀exist.⠀Keep⠀the⠀remembered⠀comic⠀relation⠀precise⠀at⠀the⠀aim's⠀supplied⠀scale:⠀excessive⠀provision,⠀unexpected⠀apt⠀use,⠀or⠀the⠀enjoyable⠀exact⠀fit⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀method⠀can⠀carry⠀it⠀without⠀shrinking⠀the⠀earlier⠀achievement⠀or⠀requiring⠀surprise.⠀Let⠀present⠀affection⠀or⠀loss⠀coexist⠀with⠀that⠀still-funny⠀practical⠀detail.⠀Pleasure⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀undercut,⠀and⠀no⠀new⠀loss,⠀apology,⠀or⠀relinquishment⠀is⠀required.\n\nRender⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀recollection⠀independently⠀of⠀spoken⠀nostalgia.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀t