ilable⠀uncertainty:⠀a⠀known⠀changed⠀condition,⠀established⠀variability,⠀or⠀an⠀earlier⠀mistaken⠀assumption⠀may⠀explain⠀it,⠀without⠀invented⠀rules⠀or⠀immediate⠀access⠀to⠀an⠀unknown⠀cause.⠀A⠀changed⠀course⠀can⠀follow⠀new⠀information,⠀a⠀preference,⠀or⠀reconsideration⠀of⠀existing⠀knowledge⠀and⠀commitments;⠀no⠀new⠀fact⠀is⠀automatically⠀required.⠀Do⠀not⠀reset⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀later⠀joke⠀land.⠀Keep⠀others'⠀independent⠀lives⠀and⠀knowledge⠀continuous:⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀told⠀something⠀earlier⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀it⠀later,⠀and⠀an⠀absent⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀done⠀something⠀off-page⠀that⠀matters⠀when⠀they⠀return.\n\nFull⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀advancing⠀the⠀setup⠀or⠀producing⠀a⠀punch⠀line.⠀Preserve⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀world,⠀and⠀active⠀output⠀contracts.⠀Episodes⠀may⠀pause⠀inside⠀an⠀attempt,⠀conversation,⠀or⠀thought⠀without⠀a⠀payoff⠀quota,⠀escalating⠀failure,⠀or⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources,⠀and⠀a⠀completed⠀task⠀may⠀simply⠀remain⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLocate⠀the⠀character's⠀vulnerable⠀aim⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀practical⠀request:⠀what⠀they⠀need,⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀they⠀use⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀manageable,⠀and⠀any⠀practical⠀step⠀they⠀actually⠀choose,⠀without⠀assuming⠀that⠀asking⠀requires⠀a⠀protective⠀routine.⠀A⠀procedure,⠀provisional⠀instruction⠀or⠀confident⠀account⠀can⠀shape⠀the⠀request⠀where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀actual⠀person;⠀ordinary⠀direct⠀wording⠀can⠀also⠀establish⠀the⠀comic⠀expectation.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀fragment⠀of⠀that⠀wording⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀difficulty,⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀wording⠀or⠀the⠀permitted⠀narration,⠀without⠀assigning⠀a⠀nervous⠀tic⠀or⠀a⠀defensive⠀function.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀timing⠀or⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀response,⠀whether⠀the⠀language⠀was⠀prepared⠀or⠀spontaneous⠀and⠀whether⠀the⠀answer⠀differs⠀from⠀expectation⠀or⠀fits⠀it⠀exactly.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀answer⠀helpfully,⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀procedure,⠀cooperate⠀with⠀it⠀too⠀literally,⠀or⠀simply⠀pause⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀asker⠀to⠀be⠀humiliated⠀or⠀the⠀answer⠀to⠀fail.⠀The⠀humor⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀detail⠀meeting⠀the⠀exposed⠀need,⠀not⠀from⠀punishing⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀asks.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀fully⠀developed.⠀Render⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀notices,⠀rehearses,⠀withholds⠀or⠀feels⠀at⠀its⠀real⠀place⠀in⠀events,⠀including⠀before⠀or⠀without⠀public⠀speech.⠀The⠀strain⠀can⠀make⠀them⠀over-explain⠀a⠀small⠀step,⠀fixate⠀on⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀instruction⠀as⠀if⠀precision⠀will⠀control⠀the⠀outcome.⠀Let⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀genuine⠀help⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀asker's⠀unresolved⠀hurt;⠀a⠀kind⠀answer⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀cure⠀the⠀need⠀or⠀close⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀relief.⠀The⠀aim⠀or⠀wording⠀may⠀remain⠀privately⠀considered,⠀with⠀no⠀public⠀admission⠀or⠀performed⠀reaction⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀the⠀reply⠀by⠀placing⠀the⠀submitted⠀speech⠀or⠀action⠀inside⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀already⠀trying⠀to⠀accomplish.⠀Name⠀the⠀practical⠀aim⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀contribution⠀its⠀comic⠀context:⠀who⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀arrange,⠀obtain,⠀explain,⠀or⠀avoid⠀something,⠀and⠀what⠀step⠀they⠀believe⠀comes⠀next.⠀Keep⠀the⠀contributed⠀material⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀move⠀in⠀that⠀procedure,⠀not⠀a⠀prompt⠀for⠀the⠀writer⠀to⠀invent⠀a⠀payoff.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀proposes⠀a⠀rule,⠀repeats⠀an⠀instruction,⠀or⠀offers⠀a⠀confident⠀practical⠀account,⠀preserve⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀and⠀show⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀still⠀a⠀proposal⠀or⠀has⠀become⠀an⠀enacted⠀step.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀come⠀from⠀another⠀person's⠀independent⠀purpose:⠀they⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀rule,⠀qualify⠀it,⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀object,⠀or⠀simply⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀task⠀beside⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀mistake,⠀quip,⠀or⠀completed⠀comic⠀result.⠀The⠀procedure⠀may⠀remain⠀pending,⠀and⠀the⠀humor⠀may⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀stated⠀rule⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀actually⠀do⠀next.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀unmistakable⠀and⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀readable.⠀Maintain⠀active⠀NPC⠀lives⠀and⠀all⠀ownership⠀permissions⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀contract.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀attention⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀where⠀authorized,⠀with⠀reader⠀exposure⠀distinguished⠀from⠀actual⠀communication.⠀Other⠀participants⠀retain⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀real⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀rather⠀than⠀learning⠀a⠀thought⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀narrated.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀combination⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism.⠀Locate⠀the⠀comic⠀arrangement⠀through⠀concrete⠀distribution:⠀who⠀handles⠀the⠀object,⠀supplies⠀the⠀information,⠀waits,⠀pays,⠀or⠀grants⠀access,⠀and⠀what⠀participation⠀actually⠀involves,⠀including⠀any⠀cost⠀or⠀convenience⠀in⠀time,⠀effort⠀or⠀standing⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀loss⠀of⠀dignity.⠀Put⠀the⠀stated⠀rationale⠀for⠀the⠀arrangement⠀beside⠀that⠀lived⠀distribution,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀lecture⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀scene⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀rationale⠀is⠀repeated,⠀applied,⠀or⠀quietly⠀contradicted⠀by⠀the⠀practical⠀steps⠀people⠀take.\n\nUse⠀hard⠀rhythmic⠀recurrence⠀to⠀track⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀term⠀across⠀these⠀positions.⠀A⠀word⠀like⠀\"convenient,\"⠀\"temporary,\"⠀\"standard,\"⠀or⠀\"fair\"⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀instruction,⠀a⠀worker's⠀explanation,⠀and⠀a⠀customer's⠀complaint,⠀with⠀its⠀weight⠀remaining⠀stable⠀or⠀changing⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀position⠀and⠀context,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀contrast⠀at⠀every⠀repetition.⠀Let⠀the⠀effects⠀remain⠀contingent⠀on⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀may⠀work,⠀and⠀participants⠀may⠀cooperate⠀knowingly;⠀the⠀satire⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀exact⠀social⠀distribution,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀manufactured⠀corruption⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀exposed⠀hypocrite.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting,⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community.⠀Keep⠀individual⠀private⠀reasons⠀distinct⠀from⠀public⠀explanations.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀arrangement⠀for⠀a⠀motive⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀announce,⠀and⠀another⠀may⠀benefit⠀without⠀noticing⠀the⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀honor⠀code,⠀or⠀national⠀temperament.⠀The⠀comedy⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀observable⠀social⠀machinery⠀and⠀the⠀precise⠀practical⠀language⠀that⠀keeps⠀it⠀running.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀concrete⠀physical⠀fact⠀that⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀current⠀aim:⠀the⠀contact,⠀weight,⠀distance,⠀condition,⠀or⠀bodily⠀effort⠀involved⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do.⠀Write⠀it⠀in⠀forceful⠀outward⠀clauses⠀with⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀object⠀in⠀general⠀terms;⠀name⠀the⠀worn⠀edge,⠀the⠀exact⠀resistance,⠀the⠀sound⠀it⠀makes,⠀or⠀the⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀body⠀that⠀takes⠀the⠀strain.\n\nSet⠀an⠀actual⠀instruction,⠀confident⠀description,⠀or⠀repeated⠀practical⠀rule⠀beside⠀that⠀handling.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀stated⠀procedure⠀and⠀the⠀material⠀reality:⠀a⠀label⠀that⠀promises⠀ease⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀fights⠀a⠀stuck⠀part,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀assumes⠀a⠀clean⠀surface⠀while⠀the⠀object⠀leaves⠀residue,⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀sounds⠀simple⠀until⠀the⠀weight⠀shifts.⠀An⠀exact⠀anticlimax⠀can⠀provide⠀comic⠀scale;⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀consequences⠀without⠀adding⠀or⠀suppressing⠀a⠀catastrophe⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀joke⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀damage,⠀injury,⠀or⠀incompetence⠀to⠀force⠀the⠀joke.\n\nVary⠀the⠀hard⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀reasons⠀or⠀feels⠀at⠀length.⠀A⠀longer⠀sentence⠀can⠀develop⠀actual⠀calculation,⠀feeling⠀or⠀private⠀attention⠀at⠀its⠀real⠀place⠀in⠀events,⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀buildup⠀from⠀physical⠀action.⠀Keep⠀rough⠀speech⠀attached⠀to⠀its⠀speaker;⠀the⠀style⠀supplies⠀no⠀compulsory⠀disgust,⠀taboo⠀inventory,⠀or⠀changed⠀result.⠀The⠀comedy⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀practical⠀claim⠀meeting⠀the⠀physical⠀world⠀at⠀its⠀actual⠀scale.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀instructions,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀explanation,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀with⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀kept⠀for⠀later⠀use.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀merely⠀to⠀vary⠀the⠀presentation.\n\nLet⠀a⠀recorded⠀procedure,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀repeated⠀term⠀frame⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim.⠀The⠀writer's⠀exact⠀wording⠀matters:⠀a⠀numbered⠀step,⠀a⠀confident⠀phrase,⠀a⠀repeated⠀rule,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀claim⠀about⠀how⠀something⠀should⠀be⠀done.⠀Then⠀let⠀a⠀reply,⠀annotation,⠀or⠀practical⠀consequence⠀apply⠀that⠀wording⠀with⠀comic⠀precision⠀when⠀the⠀events⠀support⠀it.⠀A⠀recipient⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀instruction⠀too⠀literally,⠀annotate⠀the⠀wrong⠀step,⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀confident⠀phrase⠀instead⠀of⠀the⠀actual⠀request,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀document⠀unanswered⠀while⠀acting⠀on⠀it⠀anyway.⠀The⠀humor⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀real⠀path⠀between⠀writers⠀and⠀recipients,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀manufactured⠀failed⠀delivery⠀or⠀exposed⠀denial.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀writer's⠀register⠀and⠀needed⠀extent.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀expansive⠀or⠀candid⠀when⠀its⠀author⠀would⠀be;⠀a⠀terse⠀note⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀prove⠀hidden⠀feeling;⠀any⠀interpretation⠀follows⠀actual⠀wording,⠀context,⠀established⠀habits⠀and⠀permitted⠀knowledge.⠀Preserve⠀original⠀text⠀versus⠀later⠀revision,⠀and⠀keep⠀real⠀gaps⠀distinct⠀from⠀invented⠀missing⠀information.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀live⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀render⠀it⠀beyond⠀the⠀artifact:⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀thought⠀while⠀composing,⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀felt⠀while⠀reading,⠀or⠀what⠀neither⠀put⠀in⠀the⠀document.⠀No⠀new⠀document⠀is⠀owed⠀per⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGive⠀an⠀actual⠀offer⠀or⠀shared⠀pleasure⠀concrete⠀particulars:⠀how⠀something⠀is⠀prepared,⠀offered,⠀arranged,⠀or⠀enjoyed.⠀Name⠀a⠀known⠀preference⠀or⠀present⠀need⠀where⠀available,⠀the⠀actual⠀step⠀the⠀person⠀takes⠀and⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀involved,⠀without⠀inventing⠀familiarity.⠀Care⠀may⠀be⠀competent⠀and⠀plainly⠀accepted,⠀or⠀receive⠀another⠀actual⠀response;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀repair⠀anything⠀or⠀prove⠀a⠀hidden⠀bond.\n\nUse⠀a⠀specific⠀instruction,⠀correction,⠀or⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀to⠀let⠀the⠀care⠀take⠀a⠀comic⠀shape⠀at⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀these⠀people.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀insist⠀on⠀the⠀correct⠀order⠀of⠀steps,⠀another⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀same⠀preference⠀each⠀time,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀help⠀while⠀correcting⠀the⠀method.⠀The⠀humor⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀affectionate⠀exactness,⠀not⠀from⠀embarrassment⠀or⠀concealed⠀pain.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀earnest,⠀literal,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀joke.\n\nPreserve⠀private⠀pleasure,⠀refusal,⠀and⠀indifference⠀as⠀actual⠀responses.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀enjoy⠀the⠀care⠀without⠀announcing⠀it,⠀decline⠀it⠀without⠀being⠀punished,⠀or⠀accept⠀it⠀while⠀thinking⠀about⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀Warmth⠀needs⠀no⠀confession,⠀no⠀useful⠀payoff,⠀and⠀no⠀forced⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Keep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBegin⠀from⠀a⠀relevant⠀claim,⠀procedure,⠀or⠀personal⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀active⠀narrator,⠀with⠀the⠀confidence⠀or⠀tentativeness⠀that⠀actually⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀account.⠀Let⠀the⠀paragraph⠀widen⠀deliberately⠀from⠀that⠀formulation⠀into⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator:⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀task,⠀the⠀expectations⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀or⠀the⠀judgment⠀the⠀situation⠀invites.⠀Use⠀sustained⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀quick⠀cut⠀to⠀the⠀punchline.\n\nHold⠀the⠀stated⠀formulation⠀beside⠀the⠀exact⠀particulars⠀that⠀support⠀or⠀qualify⠀it.⠀A⠀repeated⠀practical⠀phrase⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀opening⠀claim⠀and⠀again⠀in⠀the⠀concrete⠀account,⠀retaining⠀its⠀established⠀weight⠀or⠀acquiring⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀proportion⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀context⠀warrants.⠀The⠀comic⠀contrast⠀may⠀be⠀one⠀of⠀scale⠀or⠀ceremony⠀rather⠀than⠀dishonesty:⠀a⠀grand⠀description⠀applied⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀object,⠀a⠀formal⠀procedure⠀followed⠀for⠀a⠀trivial⠀need,⠀a⠀public⠀rationale⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀private⠀act⠀only⠀partly.⠀Let⠀a⠀plain⠀clause⠀provide⠀rhythmic⠀counterweight⠀where⠀that⠀contrast⠀serves⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence,⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀otherwise⠀smooth⠀passage⠀to⠀be⠀disrupted.\n\nPreserve⠀ordinary⠀individual⠀speech⠀and⠀developed⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀formal⠀narration⠀frames⠀the⠀scene;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register⠀or⠀erase⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀thinks⠀while⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀widens.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀within⠀the⠀widening⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀rhetorical⠀loop⠀or⠀final⠀exposure.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀claim⠀still⠀held,⠀qualified,⠀or⠀simply⠀set⠀beside⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀give⠀it⠀its⠀comic⠀scale.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacacah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀by⠀establishing⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀current⠀social⠀act:⠀name⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀why⠀this⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀offered⠀now,⠀and⠀what⠀actual⠀purpose⠀the⠀telling⠀serves,⠀including⠀company⠀or⠀amusement⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀wish⠀to⠀persuade⠀or⠀obtain⠀something.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀remains⠀active⠀during⠀the⠀telling;⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀step,⠀or⠀redirect⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀reply⠀into⠀a⠀debate.\n\nInside⠀the⠀tale,⠀have⠀the⠀teller⠀narrate⠀a⠀concrete⠀procedure⠀or⠀attempted⠀act⠀in⠀exact⠀practical⠀terms.⠀Use⠀the⠀teller's⠀chosen⠀repeated⠀rule,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀fragment⠀as⠀a⠀load-bearing⠀phrase:⠀let⠀it⠀recur⠀where⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀attention⠀or⠀purpose⠀warrants⠀it,⠀including⠀changed⠀steps,⠀ordinary⠀repeated⠀emphasis⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion.⠀The⠀repetition⠀should⠀create⠀timing⠀through⠀placement,⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀true⠀or⠀wise.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀visible⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀teller⠀unreliable.⠀A⠀candid⠀account⠀can⠀still⠀omit⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participant⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀only⠀learned⠀later.⠀When⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀resumes,⠀let⠀any⠀audience⠀response⠀follow⠀their⠀actual⠀interest⠀in⠀sequence,