            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-comedy-02",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Comedy · 02/06",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == comedy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Comedy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 2 of 6. }}{{// Source group: recipes-comedy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPacafal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀early-modern⠀comic/theatrical⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀prose⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀script⠀format.⠀Make⠀relevant⠀actual⠀aims,⠀positions,⠀and⠀utterances⠀legible⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀without⠀inventing⠀excluded⠀private⠀intentions.⠀Show⠀where⠀people⠀stand,⠀what⠀they⠀handle,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀accomplish.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀concrete:⠀a⠀task,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀movement⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀followed.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comedy⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀direct⠀speech⠀and⠀the⠀existing⠀activity.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀repeated⠀line,⠀or⠀a⠀literal⠀response⠀can⠀meet⠀the⠀action⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀performative⠀register⠀on⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀speakers⠀use⠀their⠀own⠀diction;⠀plain⠀talk⠀and⠀stillness⠀are⠀available.⠀No⠀archaic⠀setting,⠀exaggerated⠀speech,⠀prop,⠀or⠀laugh⠀is⠀required.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀as⠀a⠀theatrical⠀device⠀within⠀the⠀prose.⠀A⠀phrase⠀or⠀gesture⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis,⠀making⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment⠀legible⠀without⠀a⠀narrator's⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀through⠀authorized⠀interiority,⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀public⠀words.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀withholds⠀or⠀does⠀not⠀understand⠀can⠀remain⠀unsaid.\n\nLet⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀govern⠀the⠀ending,⠀including⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀stillness,⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀a⠀produced⠀concrete⠀continuation.⠀The⠀aim⠀may⠀be⠀completed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀redirected.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀punchline,⠀a⠀completed⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀reversal.⠀The⠀next⠀action⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀established.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀social⠀realism⠀and⠀chronicle⠀as⠀the⠀construction.⠀Follow⠀an⠀actual⠀shared⠀place,⠀activity,⠀or⠀relation⠀through⠀ordered⠀occasions.⠀Each⠀occasion⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀a⠀specific⠀time,⠀a⠀specific⠀set⠀of⠀people,⠀and⠀a⠀specific⠀task⠀or⠀exchange.⠀Connect⠀the⠀occasions⠀with⠀precise⠀repeated⠀acts⠀or⠀phrases.⠀The⠀repetition⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀familiar⠀accurate⠀response⠀that⠀becomes⠀funny⠀through⠀timing,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀new⠀failure.\n\nRender⠀the⠀exchanges⠀in⠀direct⠀language⠀with⠀exact⠀objects⠀and⠀movements.⠀Keep⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀sense⠀of⠀continuity:⠀what⠀has⠀changed,⠀what⠀has⠀stayed⠀the⠀same,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀knows.⠀Attribute⠀memories⠀and⠀reports⠀to⠀their⠀sources.⠀Community⠀knowledge⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀every⠀person's⠀private⠀mind;⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀narrator⠀access⠀to⠀thoughts⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀other⠀characters⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀effect⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀routine⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀habit,⠀adapt⠀it,⠀or⠀be⠀surprised⠀by⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀familiar⠀situation.⠀The⠀routine⠀need⠀not⠀collapse⠀or⠀humiliate⠀anyone.⠀Actual⠀changes⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀history⠀and⠀can⠀affect⠀the⠀next⠀occasion⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀moral.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀interval⠀boundary,⠀including⠀within⠀an⠀occasion⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀one⠀is⠀known;⠀no⠀new⠀concrete⠀consequence,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀completed⠀arc⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀specific⠀exchange⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀shared⠀place⠀or⠀relation⠀visibly⠀changed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀the⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀at⠀its⠀supplied⠀scale,⠀with⠀clear⠀attribution⠀and⠀orientation.⠀If⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name,⠀object,⠀or⠀mechanic⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀encounter,⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀plain⠀terms⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀use.⠀Do⠀not⠀front-load⠀a⠀glossary⠀or⠀recap⠀machinery.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀speech,⠀activity,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀Render⠀the⠀exchanges⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀practical⠀words.⠀A⠀literal⠀answer,⠀a⠀familiar⠀callback,⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀continuation⠀can⠀create⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀everyone⠀being⠀witty.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀a⠀completed⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀slot.\n\nLet⠀private⠀response⠀remain⠀available⠀through⠀authorized⠀interiority.⠀A⠀character's⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀labeled⠀as⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀or⠀forced⠀to⠀immediately⠀change⠀the⠀visible⠀action.⠀What⠀remains⠀unsaid⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀strain⠀between⠀the⠀public⠀exchange⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀experience.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀continuing⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀a⠀situation⠀whose⠀next⠀action⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀determined.⠀The⠀aim⠀may⠀be⠀advanced,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀redirected.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀The⠀next⠀action⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀concrete⠀situation⠀already⠀established.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀around⠀one⠀exact⠀object,⠀activity,⠀or⠀habitual⠀gesture⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀actually⠀supply.⠀Develop⠀it⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀sound⠀where⠀actual⠀attention⠀takes⠀it,⠀before⠀or⠀within⠀the⠀exchange:⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀extend⠀a⠀clause,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀from⠀the⠀thing⠀itself.⠀The⠀image⠀may⠀be⠀graceful,⠀absurd,⠀or⠀simply⠀persistent,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀or⠀an⠀association⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀share⠀it.⠀Comparisons⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator⠀alone;⠀keep⠀their⠀source⠀in⠀that⠀voice⠀or⠀attention⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀shared⠀character⠀knowledge.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀actual⠀line⠀or⠀continuation⠀beside⠀the⠀developed⠀image.⠀Let⠀the⠀contrast⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀plain⠀practical⠀reply,⠀a⠀direct⠀statement⠀of⠀feeling,⠀or⠀a⠀continuation⠀that⠀ignores⠀the⠀image's⠀weight.⠀The⠀line⠀need⠀not⠀puncture⠀the⠀image.⠀It⠀can⠀confirm⠀it,⠀answer⠀it⠀literally,⠀or⠀carry⠀on⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀while⠀the⠀image⠀stays⠀present.⠀Keep⠀the⠀register⠀shift⠀readable⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it:⠀the⠀syntax⠀may⠀shorten,⠀the⠀sentence⠀may⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀verb,⠀or⠀the⠀speaker⠀may⠀name⠀the⠀object⠀without⠀ornament.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀retain⠀its⠀meaning.⠀If⠀the⠀image⠀returns⠀later,⠀it⠀can⠀acquire⠀a⠀new⠀emphasis⠀from⠀the⠀changed⠀situation,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀joke.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀aim⠀and⠀private⠀feeling.⠀The⠀comedy⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀shaped⠀attention⠀and⠀the⠀plain⠀continuation,⠀not⠀in⠀making⠀the⠀feeling⠀false⠀or⠀the⠀speaker⠀foolish.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀recall⠀one⠀particular⠀act,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀object⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion.⠀Choose⠀a⠀particular⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀noticed⠀or⠀used⠀then,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀past.⠀Present⠀the⠀memory⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀direct⠀language:⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀was⠀trying⠀to⠀do.⠀Keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀aim⠀and⠀pleasure⠀intact.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀fond,⠀inconvenient,⠀or⠀simply⠀persistent.\n\nBring⠀the⠀particular⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation.⠀A⠀familiar⠀object,⠀a⠀repeated⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀again⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀memory.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀response⠀meet⠀it⠀plainly:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀repeat⠀the⠀phrase,⠀recognize⠀the⠀old⠀aim,⠀or⠀continue⠀the⠀current⠀work⠀while⠀the⠀memory⠀stays.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀remembered⠀particular⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀situation.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀to⠀have⠀been⠀foolish⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀feeling⠀to⠀be⠀regret.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀same⠀meaning⠀to⠀remain⠀intact⠀or⠀acquire⠀a⠀new⠀emphasis.⠀If⠀the⠀memory⠀changes⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀statement.⠀If⠀it⠀changes⠀nothing,⠀let⠀that⠀be⠀the⠀point.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀feeling⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀alters⠀no⠀outward⠀response.⠀No⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence⠀or⠀lesson⠀about⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀required⠀merely⠀by⠀the⠀style.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀supported⠀direct⠀reflection⠀in⠀the⠀person's⠀own⠀diction⠀and⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀modern⠀memoir⠀with⠀the⠀participant⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀teller⠀both⠀identifiable⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permissions.⠀The⠀participant's⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀uses⠀the⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀and⠀aims:⠀exact⠀acts,⠀direct⠀speech,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀purpose⠀of⠀the⠀moment.⠀The⠀later⠀teller's⠀part⠀may⠀frame,⠀compare,⠀or⠀recognize⠀a⠀pattern,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀participant's⠀live⠀experience⠀with⠀a⠀retrospective⠀explanation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀later⠀framing⠀create⠀the⠀comic⠀timing⠀through⠀contrast.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀note⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀expected,⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀actually⠀did,⠀or⠀how⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀sounded⠀later.⠀Keep⠀the⠀contrast⠀dry⠀and⠀specific.⠀The⠀earlier⠀feeling⠀remains⠀real:⠀the⠀desire⠀was⠀actually⠀experienced,⠀while⠀any⠀judgment⠀of⠀it⠀follows⠀the⠀real⠀case⠀and⠀narrator's⠀supported⠀perspective⠀rather⠀than⠀automatic⠀approval,⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀mock⠀them.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀times,⠀not⠀from⠀rewriting⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀as⠀a⠀fool.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀actual⠀outcome⠀and⠀knowledge⠀at⠀each⠀time.⠀The⠀composed⠀memoir⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀live⠀mind⠀of⠀participant⠀or⠀teller;⠀required⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation⠀at⠀either⠀authorized⠀time.⠀The⠀later⠀teller⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀did⠀not,⠀but⠀that⠀knowledge⠀cannot⠀be⠀inserted⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment⠀as⠀a⠀premonition⠀or⠀a⠀hidden⠀motive.⠀If⠀the⠀memoir⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀let⠀the⠀return⠀be⠀a⠀continuation⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀joke.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀few⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀aim⠀and⠀the⠀continuation⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀object⠀in⠀use,⠀the⠀action⠀underway,⠀the⠀exact⠀line⠀spoken.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀for⠀the⠀setup.⠀Omit⠀redundant⠀explanation⠀while⠀allowing⠀a⠀repeated⠀description⠀or⠀clarification⠀where⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀context⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀purpose.⠀The⠀omitted⠀material⠀should⠀remain⠀inferable⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀kept,⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀action.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀contrast⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀selected⠀particulars.⠀A⠀plain⠀response⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀carefully⠀placed⠀detail⠀without⠀a⠀transition⠀that⠀announces⠀the⠀joke.⠀The⠀sentence⠀may⠀shorten⠀at⠀the⠀landing,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀fragment.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀wait,⠀look⠀at⠀the⠀object,⠀or⠀say⠀nothing.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀silence⠀carry⠀a⠀hidden⠀meaning⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀one.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀inward⠀experience.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀direct⠀emotional⠀line⠀may⠀remain⠀direct.⠀The⠀minimalist⠀pressure⠀selects⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀scene;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀character's⠀mind⠀shorter⠀or⠀less⠀available.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀forced⠀payoff.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀activity⠀that⠀carries⠀it.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀without⠀pausing⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀scene's⠀comic⠀purpose.⠀Make⠀the⠀actual⠀aim⠀legible⠀through⠀conduct,⠀speech,⠀or⠀authorized⠀private⠀narration⠀as⠀appropriate;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀receive⠀an⠀outward⠀display.\n\nUse⠀particular⠀responses,⠀repeated⠀phrases,⠀or⠀plain⠀continuations⠀to⠀create⠀reversal,⠀anticlimax,⠀or⠀callbacks⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀A⠀reversal⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀change:⠀the⠀expected⠀reply⠀does⠀not⠀come,⠀the⠀task⠀takes⠀a⠀different⠀shape,⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀responds⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀request.⠀An⠀anticlimax⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀work⠀continuing⠀after⠀the⠀expected⠀moment.⠀A⠀callback⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀returning⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀intact⠀or⠀shifted.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀direct⠀disclosure⠀available.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length,⠀state⠀a⠀feeling⠀plainly,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unsaid.⠀The⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀hidden⠀motive,⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀turn⠀in⠀every⠀reply.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀at⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀with⠀the⠀aim⠀still⠀underway⠀or⠀the⠀exchange⠀concluded,⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀forced⠀punch⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀a⠀relevant⠀shared⠀preference,⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀routine⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀participants.⠀Establish⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀use:⠀who⠀says⠀the⠀phrase,⠀who⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀object,⠀who⠀follows⠀the⠀routine,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do.⠀Keep⠀the⠀particular⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀relationship's⠀actual⠀history⠀and⠀present⠀situation,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀trope.\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀meet⠀the⠀response⠀that⠀actually⠀occurs.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀familiar,⠀literal,⠀surprising,⠀or⠀quietly⠀enjoyed.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀timing:⠀the⠀phrase⠀arrives⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀the⠀object⠀is⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀purpose,⠀the⠀routine⠀continues⠀while⠀the⠀conversation⠀changes,⠀or⠀the⠀familiar⠀act⠀receives⠀an⠀unexpected⠀but⠀fitting⠀reply.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀devotion.⠀The⠀callback⠀can⠀confirm⠀the⠀bond,⠀expose⠀a⠀small⠀habit,⠀or⠀simply⠀be⠀shared.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀individual⠀speech⠀intact.⠀Each⠀person⠀may⠀think⠀and⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀register;⠀the⠀relationship's⠀private⠀language⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀interchangeable.⠀A⠀callback⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀secret.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀shared⠀particular's⠀actual⠀state⠀and⠀meaning,⠀including⠀a⠀pending⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange;⠀future⠀use⠀is⠀possible⠀where⠀supported⠀but⠀not⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀retelling⠀gesture:⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀of⠀who⠀did⠀what,⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀community⠀repeats,⠀or⠀an⠀act⠀already⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀person.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀actual⠀means.⠀Show⠀the⠀object⠀used,⠀the⠀work⠀done,⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀spoken.⠀Let⠀the⠀elevated⠀opening⠀meet⠀the⠀plain⠀particulars⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀deed⠀smaller⠀than⠀it⠀was.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀retelling⠀against⠀the⠀actual⠀effort,⠀not⠀from⠀falsifying⠀the⠀act.\n\nLet⠀phrasing⠀recur⠀where⠀actual⠀history⠀or⠀attention⠀brings⠀it⠀back,⠀retaining⠀the⠀same⠀application⠀or⠀developing⠀a⠀new⠀one⠀as⠀the⠀occasion⠀warrants.⠀A⠀designation⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀person⠀does⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀again,⠀when⠀someone⠀else⠀repeats⠀it,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀recalls⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀phrase⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀or⠀agree⠀with⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀act⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀answer⠀the⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀confirm⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀ceremony.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀deed,⠀the⠀person's⠀private⠀experience,⠀and⠀any⠀effort⠀still⠀underway.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀the⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀accurately⠀rather⠀than⠀declared⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀essayistic⠀account⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀position.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀situated⠀observation⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀make⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀or⠀from⠀direct⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀State⠀it⠀in⠀plain,⠀economical⠀language⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀universal⠀lesson.\n\nBring⠀that⠀observation⠀beside⠀a⠀precise⠀case:⠀an⠀actual⠀event,⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀or⠀a⠀clearly⠀hypothetical⠀instance⠀whose⠀aims⠀and⠀reception⠀are⠀legible.⠀Let⠀the⠀case⠀contain⠀exact⠀objects,⠀practical⠀activities,⠀and⠀direct⠀exchanges.⠀The⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀general⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀case⠀can⠀produce⠀dry⠀comic⠀timing,⠀but⠀the⠀claim⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀disproved⠀or⠀abandoned.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀simply⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀claim's⠀actual⠀scope,⠀noting⠀where⠀it⠀held,⠀where⠀it⠀did⠀not⠀apply,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀case⠀left⠀unsettled.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀case⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀completed⠀test,⠀a⠀moral,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀proposition.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀lie⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀serious⠀framing⠀meeting⠀an⠀ordinary,⠀specific⠀continuation.⠀Preserve⠀each⠀person's⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀them⠀all⠀witty⠀or⠀all⠀foolish.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀in⠀its⠀authorized⠀presentation,⠀but⠀another⠀character's⠀mind⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Establish⠀relevant⠀public⠀aims⠀through⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀particulars,⠀while⠀authorized⠀private⠀aims⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀channel:⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀is⠀doing,⠀what⠀object⠀they⠀are⠀handling,⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀they⠀want,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀actually⠀does⠀in⠀response.\n\nUse⠀a⠀cut,⠀a⠀held⠀interval,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀reply⠀to⠀place⠀an⠀expectation⠀beside⠀its⠀continuation.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀observable⠀setup⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀response,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀invented⠀accident,⠀a⠀missed⠀line,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀reaction⠀shot.⠀A⠀cut⠀joins⠀occasions⠀in⠀presentation;⠀physical⠀effects⠀follow⠀actual⠀events⠀and⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀attributed⠀to⠀editing⠀alone.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀voice-over⠀and⠀from⠀anything⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀private⠀reception⠀into⠀a⠀stage⠀direction⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀expression⠀that⠀proves⠀what⠀someone⠀thinks.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀govern⠀the⠀stop,⠀including⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀stillness,⠀or⠀ongoing⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀acknowledgment⠀or⠀punch⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nUse⠀the⠀actual⠀shared⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀public⠀exchange⠀playable,⠀with⠀relevant⠀aims⠀established⠀within⠀narrator⠀access⠀and⠀private⠀purposes⠀left⠀nonspoken⠀where⠀appropriate.⠀Give⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀and⠀objects⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀handled⠀on⠀stage.⠀Let⠀a⠀person⠀continue⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀while⠀speaking,⠀answer⠀literally,⠀or⠀remain⠀still.⠀A⠀pause⠀or⠀an⠀accurately⠀heard⠀line⠀can⠀supply⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀prop⠀to⠀be⠀used,⠀a⠀line⠀to⠀be⠀missed,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀perform⠀a⠀reaction.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carrying⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀direct⠀answer⠀meeting⠀a⠀recognizable⠀intention,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀visible⠀continuation⠀of⠀work⠀while⠀someone⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀response.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀quip⠀or⠀make⠀random⠀interruption⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀comic⠀construction.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀distinct⠀from⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀hear⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀Supported⠀offstage⠀events⠀and⠀unfinished⠀exchanges⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀progress;⠀the⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀joke⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀all⠀speakers.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀braiding⠀its⠀sensory⠀particulars,⠀remembered⠀phrases,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀imagined⠀responses⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀attention.⠀Let⠀a⠀concrete⠀perception⠀orient⠀the⠀comic⠀buildup:⠀the⠀mind⠀notices⠀an⠀exact⠀object,⠀hears⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀or⠀anticipates⠀a⠀specific⠀reply,⠀and⠀the⠀association⠀moves⠀from⠀there.\n\nLet⠀a⠀real⠀line⠀or⠀event⠀meet⠀the⠀expectation⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀receives⠀it.⠀Unheard⠀content⠀remains⠀unknown⠀within⠀narrator⠀access.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀private⠀buildup⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀continuation,⠀but⠀the⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀useful,⠀witty,⠀or⠀destined⠀for⠀speech.⠀It⠀may⠀remain⠀lengthy,⠀unrelated,⠀or⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀its⠀represented⠀extent⠀does⠀not⠀advance⠀external⠀time.\n\nKeep⠀events⠀distinct⠀from⠀recollection⠀and⠀fantasy.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀and⠀an⠀imagined⠀response⠀is⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀said.⠀Preserve⠀each⠀person's⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀universally⠀perceptive⠀or⠀everyone⠀else⠀a⠀straight⠀man.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀answer⠀in⠀full⠀words,⠀another⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀pause.\n\nUse⠀exact⠀transmitted⠀words⠀and⠀actual⠀channel⠀timing⠀to⠀create⠀comic⠀timing.⠀A⠀literal⠀reply,⠀a⠀resumed⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀pattern⠀can⠀meet⠀an⠀actual⠀intention⠀without⠀an⠀invented⠀typo,⠀deletion,⠀outage,⠀or⠀misunderstanding.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀chooses⠀to⠀send,⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀unsent,⠀or⠀the⠀interval⠀between⠀messages.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀genuinely⠀composed⠀interface⠀text,⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Required⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀Preserve⠀narrator⠀and⠀interface⠀visibility:⠀another⠀participant⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀draft⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀it.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀pending⠀reply⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀setting⠀and⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Establish⠀the⠀actual⠀aim⠀and⠀conditions⠀through⠀exact⠀objects,⠀practical⠀activities,⠀and⠀direct⠀speech.⠀Let⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator.\n\nWhere⠀a⠀cue⠀draws⠀authorized⠀attention,⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀full⠀interpretation⠀or⠀feeling.⠀Then⠀let⠀an⠀actual⠀line⠀or⠀continuation⠀meet⠀that⠀private⠀expectation⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀pace.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀accurate⠀reading,⠀a⠀plain⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀still⠀moment⠀meeting⠀the⠀buildup.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀what⠀they⠀think⠀or⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.\n\nDo⠀not⠀transfer⠀private⠀thought⠀automatically⠀through⠀reader⠀access;⠀preserve⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀actually⠀know⠀through⠀established⠀sources⠀or⠀capabilities.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀private⠀response⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀punch⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacafbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀installment⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀a⠀relevant⠀earlier⠀aim,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀response⠀briefly⠀when⠀needed,⠀preserving⠀the⠀actual⠀history⠀and⠀each⠀person's⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀investigation⠀or⠀routine⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.\n\nLet⠀repetition⠀confirm⠀a⠀familiar⠀pattern⠀or⠀alter⠀its⠀context⠀through⠀real⠀events.⠀A⠀repeated⠀exact⠀particular⠀can⠀sustain⠀comic⠀continuity⠀without⠀requiring⠀escalating⠀mishaps⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning⠀at⠀every⠀return.⠀The⠀same⠀phrase⠀may⠀mean⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀again,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀condition⠀may⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀Preserve⠀earlier⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀them⠀for⠀a⠀joke.\n\nRequired⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀advance.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀a⠀payoff⠀perpetually⠀recede⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀correction,⠀reveal,⠀or⠀finished⠀joke⠀at⠀every⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀concrete,⠀recognizable⠀reason⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀admit⠀something,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀someone,⠀whose⠀actual⠀reasons,⠀feeling⠀or⠀self-image⠀give⠀the⠀matter⠀personal⠀weight;⠀no⠀completed⠀private⠀argument⠀or⠀rehearsal⠀is⠀required.⠀Keep⠀that⠀account⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀certainty⠀or⠀conflict:⠀it⠀can⠀defend⠀the⠀person,⠀accuse⠀them,⠀reverse⠀their⠀own⠀conclusion,⠀or⠀entangle⠀their⠀self-image⠀with⠀the⠀material⠀circumstances⠀they⠀are⠀actually⠀in.⠀Do⠀not⠀flatten⠀this⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀anxious⠀mood.⠀Give⠀the⠀actual⠀thought⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀whether⠀plain,⠀sustained,⠀settled⠀or⠀conflicted,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀this⠀character's⠀thought,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀essay⠀on⠀need.\n\nWhere⠀another⠀participant⠀actually⠀responds,⠀follow⠀that⠀reception;⠀the⠀matter⠀may⠀also⠀remain⠀privately⠀anticipated⠀or⠀await⠀an⠀answer.⠀A⠀difference⠀of⠀scale,⠀kind⠀or⠀timing⠀between⠀private⠀anticipation⠀and⠀actual⠀reception⠀can⠀support⠀a⠀comic⠀turn⠀without⠀requiring⠀one⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀interval.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀be⠀accurate,⠀generous,⠀practical,⠀or⠀even⠀aligned⠀with⠀the⠀asker's⠀hope;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀cruel⠀or⠀dismissive⠀to⠀be⠀funny.⠀Show⠀the⠀asker's⠀private⠀reaction⠀to⠀that⠀response,⠀including⠀the⠀possibility⠀that⠀the⠀elaborate⠀self-argument⠀continues,⠀stalls,⠀or⠀becomes⠀irrelevant.⠀Let⠀the⠀difficulty⠀of⠀needing⠀remain⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀answer⠀is⠀easy.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀still⠀feel⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀exposure,⠀the⠀fear⠀of⠀being⠀seen⠀as⠀weak,⠀or⠀the⠀shame⠀of⠀having⠀prepared⠀so⠀much⠀for⠀so⠀little.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀this⠀into⠀a⠀punch⠀line⠀that⠀erases⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀comedy⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀expectation⠀and⠀reception,⠀not⠀in⠀making⠀the⠀asker⠀a⠀fool.⠀The⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀assign⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀as⠀a⠀moral⠀judge⠀or⠀comic⠀foil;⠀their⠀actual⠀role⠀remains,⠀and⠀they⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀habits.⠀If⠀their⠀answer⠀is⠀generous,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀generous⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀fits⠀them,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀comfort.⠀If⠀they⠀misunderstand,⠀let⠀the⠀misunderstanding⠀come⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀actual⠀attention,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀forced⠀plot⠀device.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀matter⠀still⠀privately⠀anticipated,⠀the⠀request⠀unspoken,⠀or⠀the⠀admission⠀made⠀and⠀received⠀with⠀awkward⠀partial⠀comfort.⠀No⠀confession,⠀failed⠀request,⠀self-denunciation,⠀or⠀repaired⠀mood⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀narrative⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀actions,⠀movements,⠀and⠀spoken⠀lines⠀clearly⠀separated⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀doing⠀what.⠀Enter⠀the⠀scene⠀cleanly:⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀one⠀is⠀pursuing⠀in⠀this⠀moment.⠀Comic⠀construction⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀recognizable⠀aims⠀and⠀actual⠀reception,⠀including⠀shared⠀aims,⠀not⠀from⠀random⠀interruption⠀or⠀a⠀string⠀of⠀quips.\n\nWhere⠀an⠀actual⠀character⠀holds⠀a⠀personally⠀important⠀reason,⠀assumption⠀or⠀self-description,⠀let⠀it⠀meet⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀protective⠀self-image⠀for⠀the⠀comic⠀role.⠀This⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀defended⠀moral⠀position,⠀a⠀private⠀theory⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀wants,⠀or⠀a⠀self-image⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀protect.⠀Render⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀spoken⠀or⠀nonspoken⠀channel⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀expressed⠀aloud.⠀Follow⠀any⠀response⠀from⠀another⠀participant's⠀actual⠀priority⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀reply⠀or⠀completed⠀comic⠀turn.⠀That⠀priority⠀can⠀be⠀practical,⠀affectionate,⠀annoyed,⠀or⠀simply⠀different;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀counter-argument.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀can⠀arise⠀when⠀an⠀actual⠀account⠀meets⠀another⠀person's⠀concrete⠀concern,⠀preserving⠀each⠀person's⠀own⠀coherence⠀or⠀conflict⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀elaborate⠀reasoning.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀player⠀ownership,⠀and⠀NPC⠀pursuits.⠀Follow⠀the⠀exact⠀active⠀ownership⠀contract:⠀leave⠀human-owned⠀material⠀open⠀where⠀required,⠀and⠀render⠀only⠀the⠀speech,⠀actions⠀or⠀experience⠀actually⠀supplied⠀or⠀delegated.⠀NPCs⠀should⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives⠀and⠀make⠀choices⠀that⠀fit⠀their⠀established⠀aims.⠀Agreement⠀and⠀competent⠀help⠀are⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀dispute.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀comic⠀foil⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀judge⠀by⠀default.\n\nInclude⠀the⠀full⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀This⠀is⠀actual⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀feeling,⠀not⠀a⠀summary.⠀It⠀may⠀align⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason⠀such⠀as⠀embarrassment,⠀attention,⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀perfectly⠀perceptive⠀or⠀uniformly⠀witty.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀within⠀continuing⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀public⠀activity,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀pause⠀or⠀new⠀direction.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀No⠀dilemma,⠀question,⠀or⠀completed⠀joke⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Ground⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀an⠀actual⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀community⠀arrangement⠀with⠀concrete⠀practical⠀terms:⠀who⠀does⠀what⠀work,⠀who⠀receives⠀what⠀benefit,⠀who⠀owes⠀what⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀how⠀these⠀terms⠀are⠀maintained.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀corrupt⠀institution⠀or⠀a⠀stereotyped⠀social⠀role⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀satire⠀easy.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀how⠀these⠀people⠀actually⠀live⠀with⠀it.\n\nUse⠀a⠀moral⠀claim⠀or⠀self-description⠀that⠀actually⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀the⠀permitted⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀rather⠀than⠀assigning⠀a⠀new⠀justification⠀to⠀a⠀comic⠀role.⠀The⠀claim⠀can⠀be⠀grand,⠀modest⠀or⠀general,⠀with⠀its⠀actual⠀speaker,⠀scope⠀and⠀grounds⠀clear.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀defend,⠀accuse⠀or⠀reconsider⠀through⠀it⠀where⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀reasoning.⠀Place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀concrete⠀distribution:⠀action,⠀a⠀request,⠀private⠀consideration⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀narrative⠀comparison⠀can⠀show⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀who⠀does⠀the⠀work⠀or⠀receives⠀the⠀benefit.⠀No⠀new⠀public⠀use⠀or⠀personal⠀justification⠀is⠀required.\n\nFollow⠀any⠀other⠀participant's⠀actual⠀practical⠀emphasis,⠀with⠀its⠀accuracy⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀grounded⠀in⠀their⠀sources⠀rather⠀than⠀assigned⠀by⠀plainness.⠀The⠀comic⠀contrast⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀scale⠀or⠀emphasis⠀between⠀the⠀grand⠀justification⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀sincere⠀preference⠀it⠀actually⠀serves,⠀or⠀between⠀two⠀different⠀accurate⠀accounts⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀fair.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀is⠀not⠀necessarily⠀wrong,⠀corrupt,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀judge.⠀They⠀may⠀agree⠀with⠀the⠀principle⠀and⠀still⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀immediate⠀question⠀is⠀who⠀carries⠀the⠀box⠀or⠀who⠀gets⠀the⠀extra⠀portion.\n\nKeep⠀all⠀judgment⠀attributed⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀character⠀or⠀narrator.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀a⠀verdict⠀automatic⠀truth⠀through⠀narrative⠀tone;⠀preserve⠀any⠀broader⠀judgment⠀actually⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀permissions.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀of⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀The⠀private⠀argument⠀may⠀be⠀elaborate⠀and⠀serious⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀public⠀exchange⠀is⠀funny.⠀No⠀hypocrisy,⠀public⠀exposure,⠀or⠀collapse⠀of⠀conviction⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀verbs,⠀exact⠀physical⠀positions,⠀and⠀material⠀details⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀task:⠀the⠀grip,⠀the⠀weight,⠀the⠀expense,⠀the⠀wear,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀the⠀action⠀with⠀explanatory⠀transitions.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes⠀be⠀real;⠀if⠀there⠀is⠀danger⠀or⠀cost,⠀make⠀its⠀actual⠀terms⠀concrete⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀visible⠀bodily⠀effect.\n\nRender⠀any⠀actual⠀private⠀argument⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀doing⠀or⠀considering,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀philosophical⠀speech⠀for⠀the⠀author⠀label.⠀This⠀argument⠀can⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀defending,⠀accusing,⠀or⠀reversing⠀their⠀own⠀position.⠀Its⠀extent⠀follows⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀or⠀feeling⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀requirement⠀to⠀be⠀long⠀or⠀brief,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀serious⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀surrounding⠀action⠀is⠀small.⠀Where⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀puts⠀this⠀account⠀beside⠀bodily⠀work,⠀a⠀hard⠀rhythmic⠀transition⠀can⠀make⠀their⠀scale⠀comic;⠀preserve⠀their⠀actual⠀order⠀and⠀allow⠀either⠀to⠀remain⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀rhythmic⠀contrast:⠀the⠀elaborate⠀moral⠀self-account⠀meets⠀the⠀grip,⠀the⠀effort,⠀the⠀expense,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀response⠀of⠀the⠀task.⠀A⠀competent⠀act⠀may⠀vindicate⠀the⠀claim⠀in⠀an⠀unexpectedly⠀literal⠀way.\n\nDo⠀not⠀invent⠀punishment⠀or⠀foolishness⠀to⠀force⠀the⠀joke;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀mistakes,⠀harm⠀or⠀competence⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀The⠀physical⠀work⠀is⠀not⠀there⠀to⠀humiliate⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀to⠀prove⠀that⠀their⠀conviction⠀is⠀empty.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀complete⠀the⠀task⠀well,⠀badly,⠀or⠀with⠀mixed⠀results,⠀but⠀the⠀outcome⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀circumstances.⠀Preserve⠀real⠀danger⠀or⠀wear⠀without⠀inventing⠀either⠀for⠀the⠀joke.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀universal⠀profanity,⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀a⠀collapse⠀of⠀conviction.⠀The⠀private⠀argument⠀may⠀persist,⠀change,⠀or⠀become⠀irrelevant⠀after⠀the⠀physical⠀turn;⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀state⠀determine⠀that.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀note,⠀a⠀record,⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀form.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀all⠀available⠀formats⠀for⠀variety;⠀each⠀record⠀exists⠀because⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀situation⠀would⠀compose⠀it.\n\nUse⠀a⠀document's⠀actual⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀account⠀at⠀a⠀comic⠀scale.⠀Where⠀its⠀writer⠀composes⠀an⠀argument⠀about⠀motives⠀or⠀a⠀self-description,⠀shape⠀it⠀for⠀that⠀actual⠀recipient⠀and⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀self-justification⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀record.⠀They⠀may⠀defend⠀themselves,⠀accuse⠀someone,⠀reverse⠀their⠀own⠀position,⠀or⠀entangle⠀their⠀self-image⠀with⠀the⠀material⠀circumstances.⠀The⠀composition⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀writer's⠀choices:⠀what⠀they⠀include,⠀what⠀they⠀omit,⠀how⠀they⠀frame⠀the⠀event.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀complete⠀living⠀mind⠀of⠀the⠀writer.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀later⠀actual⠀document⠀responds,⠀follow⠀what⠀it⠀takes⠀up;⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀remain⠀pending⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀manufactured⠀to⠀finish⠀the⠀pattern.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀accept⠀the⠀account,⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀simply⠀use⠀the⠀information⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀purpose.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀does⠀with⠀the⠀first⠀one:⠀an⠀accurate⠀practical⠀concern⠀can⠀answer⠀an⠀elaborate⠀moral⠀account⠀without⠀being⠀a⠀counter-argument.⠀The⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀assign⠀the⠀later⠀writer⠀as⠀a⠀moral⠀judge⠀or⠀comic⠀foil;⠀their⠀actual⠀role⠀remains,⠀and⠀they⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀aim⠀and⠀their⠀own⠀reason⠀for⠀writing.\n\nKeep⠀original⠀knowledge,⠀delivery,⠀and⠀reception⠀separate.⠀What⠀the⠀first⠀writer⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀is⠀not⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀second⠀writer⠀later⠀says.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀delayed,⠀misread,⠀or⠀answered⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀first⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀contradiction⠀or⠀an⠀exposure.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀separately⠀at⠀its⠀warranted⠀extent;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀replaced⠀by⠀the⠀documents.⠀No⠀completed⠀exchange⠀or⠀confessional⠀letter⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀occasion⠀around⠀an⠀actual⠀aim⠀in⠀offering,⠀asking⠀for⠀or⠀receiving⠀care.⠀Make⠀the⠀accommodation⠀particular:⠀a⠀known⠀preference,⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀rest,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀taken⠀over⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀choice⠀someone⠀wants⠀respected.⠀An⠀elaborate⠀personal⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀care⠀means⠀can⠀meet⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀thing⠀offered,⠀but⠀a⠀direct⠀request⠀and⠀an⠀accurate,⠀considerate⠀answer⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀funny⠀through⠀timing⠀or⠀scale.\n\nWhere⠀a⠀person⠀actually⠀holds⠀a⠀conviction⠀about⠀duty,⠀independence⠀or⠀accepting⠀help,⠀give⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀its⠀needed⠀extent.⠀It⠀can⠀be⠀settled,⠀conflicted,⠀affectionate⠀or⠀absent⠀from⠀attention;⠀do⠀not⠀supply⠀a⠀defensive⠀theory⠀of⠀deservingness⠀simply⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀comic⠀contrast.⠀A⠀specific⠀act⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀person's⠀account,⠀bypass⠀it⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀pending⠀without⠀humiliation⠀or⠀compulsory⠀self-correction.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀provider's⠀sincere⠀aim⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀recipient's⠀actual⠀response.⠀Care⠀can⠀be⠀welcomed,⠀declined,⠀partly⠀comforting⠀or⠀met⠀with⠀indifference;⠀no⠀pleasure⠀or⠀practical⠀benefit⠀is⠀guaranteed.⠀Render⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permissions⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀gratitude,⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀debate.⠀The⠀situation⠀may⠀continue⠀with⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀or⠀serious⠀concerns⠀intact,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀before⠀a⠀response⠀or⠀payoff⠀without⠀a⠀repaired⠀mood⠀or⠀forced⠀bitter⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Compose⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀broader⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀can⠀hold⠀an⠀attributed⠀claim⠀within⠀its⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀context.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment.⠀This⠀framing⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀summary;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀way⠀of⠀placing⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀their⠀concerns.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀from⠀the⠀cast's⠀spoken⠀language.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀ornate⠀cast⠀speech⠀or⠀a⠀period⠀setting;⠀the⠀characters⠀speak⠀as⠀themselves.\n\nDevelop⠀an⠀actual⠀attributed⠀conviction⠀or⠀personal⠀account⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access,⠀without⠀assigning⠀a⠀new⠀belief⠀or⠀required⠀speech⠀to⠀a⠀character.⠀This⠀account⠀can⠀defend,⠀accuse,⠀reverse,⠀or⠀entangle⠀itself.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀in⠀full,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀resumed,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀allows⠀the⠀argument⠀to⠀occupy⠀real⠀space⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀philosopher.⠀A⠀plain⠀speaker⠀may⠀unsettle⠀an⠀elaborate⠀argument⠀simply⠀by⠀answering⠀it.\n\nWhere⠀an⠀actual⠀reply⠀or⠀response⠀arrives,⠀make⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀argument⠀legible,⠀including⠀confirmation⠀of⠀an⠀unchanged⠀account.⠀The⠀response⠀need⠀not⠀wait⠀for⠀the⠀argument⠀to⠀finish⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀sentence,⠀a⠀small⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀observation.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀refute⠀the⠀argument⠀or⠀appoint⠀a⠀correct⠀moral⠀voice.⠀The⠀comic⠀recognition⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀sustained⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀response.⠀The⠀plain⠀answer⠀may⠀confirm,⠀bypass,⠀or⠀complicate⠀the⠀elaborate⠀account;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀correct⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀plain.⠀Preserve⠀established⠀truth⠀and⠀reliability.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀moral⠀verdict⠀or⠀a⠀punch⠀line⠀per⠀paragraph.⠀Supported⠀judgment⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narrator,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀deciding⠀who⠀was⠀right.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nLocate⠀a⠀teller,⠀actual⠀listeners⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀purpose⠀for⠀the⠀account,⠀including⠀explanation,⠀persuasion,⠀company⠀or⠀entertainment.⠀Let⠀the⠀embedded⠀incident⠀carry⠀a⠀conviction⠀or⠀self-image⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀candid⠀and⠀accurate,⠀or⠀reveal⠀an⠀unintended⠀emphasis⠀within⠀permitted⠀knowledge;⠀no⠀self-accusation,⠀decisive⠀past⠀choice⠀or⠀polished⠀moral⠀lesson⠀must⠀be⠀supplied.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀source⠀and⠀narrative⠀levels⠀clear.⠀Recount⠀what⠀earlier⠀participants⠀actually⠀did,⠀knew⠀and⠀felt⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀sources,⠀distinguishing⠀later⠀learning⠀from⠀earlier⠀motives.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀teller⠀or⠀past⠀participant.⠀A⠀listener's⠀actual⠀practical⠀concern⠀can⠀meet⠀an⠀elaborate⠀interpretation⠀with⠀comic⠀difference⠀of⠀timing⠀or⠀scale,⠀while⠀aligned⠀understanding⠀or⠀sincere⠀help⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀sequence⠀equally⠀well.⠀No⠀audience⠀response⠀or⠀changed⠀relationship⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀telling.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀on⠀both⠀levels⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀channel⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent.⠀Participants⠀retain⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀independent⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀rather⠀than⠀learning⠀everything⠀through⠀the⠀performed⠀account⠀or⠀reader⠀disclosure.⠀The⠀outer⠀occasion⠀can⠀continue,⠀pause⠀or⠀remain⠀pending⠀as⠀events⠀warrant;⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀inside⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀reception⠀without⠀an⠀interruption,⠀new⠀obstacle,⠀completed⠀argument⠀or⠀forced⠀comic⠀result.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modernist⠀absurdist⠀route⠀for⠀this⠀scene,⠀but⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀porting⠀in⠀any⠀German-language⠀national⠀setting.⠀Establish⠀a⠀precise⠀principle,⠀definition⠀or⠀rule⠀actually⠀available⠀to⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀self-justifying⠀belief⠀for⠀the⠀role.⠀Show⠀it⠀as⠀attributed⠀or⠀genuinely⠀known,⠀not⠀as⠀narrator's⠀mockery.⠀Where⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀defends⠀or⠀formulates⠀the⠀principle,⠀render⠀their⠀own⠀reasoning:⠀they⠀may⠀anticipate⠀objections,⠀reverse⠀positions,⠀or⠀entangle⠀themselves⠀because⠀the⠀stakes⠀feel⠀real.\n\nThen⠀follow⠀what⠀actually⠀applying⠀that⠀principle⠀would⠀mean⠀here.⠀Work⠀out⠀the⠀concrete⠀implication⠀step⠀by⠀step:⠀what⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀premise⠀here⠀for⠀this⠀task⠀and⠀these⠀people.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀predicted⠀consequence,⠀obligation⠀or⠀physical⠀necessity,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀premise⠀itself⠀compel⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀comply.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀arbitrary⠀obstruction,⠀a⠀failed⠀system,⠀or⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀trap.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀disproportion⠀between⠀the⠀principle's⠀moral⠀weight⠀and⠀its⠀unexpectedly⠀modest,⠀literal,⠀or⠀useful⠀application.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀their⠀elaborate⠀definition⠀requires⠀them⠀to⠀do⠀a⠀small⠀exact⠀thing,⠀or⠀that⠀their⠀grand⠀rule⠀is⠀satisfied⠀by⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act.\n\nLet⠀other⠀characters⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀concerns.⠀They⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀principle⠀but⠀notice⠀a⠀different⠀next⠀step,⠀or⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀aim.⠀Their⠀actual⠀responses⠀may⠀support⠀reversal,⠀escalation,⠀confirmation⠀or⠀continued⠀setup⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀comic⠀turn⠀or⠀making⠀them⠀debating⠀abstractions.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀facts,⠀setting,⠀and⠀character⠀agency:⠀no⠀automatic⠀absurdism⠀that⠀cancels⠀causality⠀or⠀makes⠀everyone⠀a⠀mouthpiece.\n\nFinally,⠀distinguish⠀anticipated⠀implications⠀from⠀events⠀that⠀actually⠀occur.⠀A⠀character's⠀self-argument⠀may⠀predict⠀disaster,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀deliver⠀a⠀modest⠀outcome.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀fit⠀or⠀mismatch⠀legible⠀and⠀the⠀world⠀consequential,⠀preserving⠀effects⠀when⠀they⠀occur⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀unchanged⠀conditions⠀or⠀an⠀untested⠀premise.⠀No⠀new⠀option⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLet⠀the⠀material⠀place⠀carry⠀Gothic-Punk⠀texture⠀without⠀importing⠀vampire⠀rules⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.⠀Describe⠀the⠀actual⠀place⠀or⠀arrangement⠀in⠀concrete⠀detail,⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀urban⠀location,⠀room⠀or⠀decay:⠀worn⠀surfaces,⠀old⠀fixtures,⠀markers⠀of⠀privilege⠀or⠀decay,⠀the⠀physical⠀signs⠀of⠀inherited⠀authority.⠀Use⠀this⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀shape⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀feels,⠀not⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀hidden⠀corruption.\n\nUse⠀a⠀moral⠀account⠀or⠀self-description⠀that⠀actually⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀person's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀place,⠀without⠀assigning⠀a⠀new⠀conviction⠀for⠀the⠀style.⠀Develop⠀it⠀through⠀Dostoevsky's⠀self-argument:⠀they⠀may⠀defend⠀a⠀principle,⠀accuse⠀themselves⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀failure,⠀reverse⠀a⠀judgment,⠀or⠀entangle⠀their⠀own⠀motives.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀channel⠀and⠀any⠀separately⠀spoken⠀account⠀the⠀person⠀chooses⠀to⠀give.⠀Sincerity,⠀defensiveness⠀or⠀an⠀alibi⠀follows⠀actual⠀character⠀and⠀evidence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀requirement⠀of⠀the⠀style.\n\nThen⠀let⠀that⠀elaborate⠀account⠀meet⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀matter⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀who⠀has⠀access,⠀what⠀care⠀is⠀expected,⠀what⠀small⠀preference⠀or⠀convenience⠀is⠀at⠀stake.⠀The⠀inherited⠀authority⠀(an⠀old⠀rule,⠀a⠀respected⠀tradition,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation)⠀may⠀operate⠀competently⠀and⠀benignly.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀arises⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀moral⠀self-description⠀encounters⠀a⠀literal,⠀practical,⠀or⠀affectionate⠀reality.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀person⠀agonizing⠀over⠀protocol⠀may⠀be⠀offered⠀tea;⠀a⠀grand⠀defense⠀of⠀duty⠀may⠀collapse⠀into⠀explaining⠀why⠀they⠀are⠀late.\n\nAllow⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀to⠀remain⠀intact.⠀A⠀mask⠀need⠀not⠀fall;⠀a⠀secret⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀exposed.⠀The⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀explanation⠀and⠀private⠀practical⠀life⠀is⠀enough.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀motives:⠀reader⠀exposure⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀inform⠀another⠀character;⠀actual⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀remain⠀available.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀while⠀thought,⠀setup⠀or⠀an⠀exchange⠀remains⠀underway.⠀Comic⠀disproportion⠀need⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀interaction⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀unmasking⠀or⠀trap.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route⠀for⠀this⠀scene⠀without⠀relocating⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀imposing⠀a⠀generic⠀Indian⠀family,⠀religion,⠀or⠀community.⠀Present⠀an⠀attributed⠀account⠀from⠀an⠀actual⠀source:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀can⠀bear⠀witness⠀to⠀the⠀event,⠀a⠀found⠀document,⠀or⠀a⠀structured⠀retelling.⠀Fit⠀this⠀account⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator:⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀witness,⠀show⠀their⠀own⠀participation⠀and⠀private⠀experience;⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀receiving⠀a⠀testimony,⠀keep⠀their⠀access⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀claimed⠀memory.\n\nInside⠀the⠀testimony,⠀separate⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀believed,⠀did,⠀and⠀received⠀at⠀the⠀earlier⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀say.⠀They⠀may⠀defend,⠀reconsider⠀or⠀plainly⠀report⠀an⠀original⠀motive⠀or⠀self-image⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀experience,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀present⠀knowledge⠀retroactively⠀become⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀They⠀may⠀honestly⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀decision⠀seemed⠀necessary,⠀while⠀the⠀narrated⠀actions⠀reveal⠀a⠀more⠀modest⠀or⠀practical⠀reality.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀account⠀meets⠀a⠀present⠀response,⠀follow⠀that⠀actual⠀reception;⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀await⠀an⠀answer⠀or⠀remain⠀unfinished.⠀A⠀listener,⠀reader,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀themselves⠀may⠀respond⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀qualification:⠀an⠀exact⠀question,⠀a⠀plain⠀answer,⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis.⠀Comic⠀scale⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀moral⠀explanation⠀and⠀reception,⠀including⠀two⠀accurate⠀accounts⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀recipient⠀to⠀be⠀simpler⠀or⠀correct⠀by⠀default.⠀The⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀realize⠀the⠀full⠀irony;⠀the⠀audience's⠀understanding⠀can⠀create⠀the⠀comic⠀effect.\n\nPreserve⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀as⠀national⠀scenery.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀use⠀the⠀testimonial⠀form⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀purpose—such⠀as⠀answering⠀what⠀happened⠀or⠀choosing⠀to⠀set⠀a⠀record⠀straight—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism⠀for⠀this⠀scene,⠀without⠀adding⠀a⠀diary⠀format⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀Japanese⠀setting,⠀language⠀pattern,⠀or⠀seasonal⠀inventory.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀fully⠀recoverable:⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀people,⠀location,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀done.⠀Ground⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀ordinary⠀social⠀interaction—a⠀request,⠀an⠀offer,⠀a⠀remark,⠀a⠀small⠀task—so⠀readers⠀can⠀track⠀what⠀literally⠀happens.\n\nFocus⠀on⠀one⠀permitted⠀character's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Render⠀that⠀person's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀through⠀Dostoevsky's⠀self-argument:⠀they⠀may⠀justify⠀their⠀own⠀expectation,⠀accuse⠀themselves⠀of⠀assuming⠀too⠀much,⠀reverse⠀their⠀reading⠀of⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀entangle⠀old⠀memories⠀with⠀current⠀words.⠀Let⠀actual⠀self-image,⠀conviction⠀or⠀direct⠀attention⠀shape⠀the⠀interpretation⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀theory⠀or⠀universal⠀overthinking.⠀Show⠀the⠀specific⠀reason⠀why⠀this⠀particular⠀exchange⠀matters⠀to⠀them.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀actual⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀sequence⠀as⠀another⠀person⠀responds,⠀without⠀making⠀a⠀full⠀inner⠀argument⠀a⠀required⠀prelude.⠀They⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀practical,⠀literal,⠀or⠀indifferent⠀than⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀expected—or⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀unexpectedly⠀aligned.⠀Comic⠀scale⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀interpretation⠀and⠀reception:⠀elaborate⠀expectation⠀may⠀meet⠀a⠀simple⠀answer,⠀or⠀accurate⠀anticipation⠀may⠀meet⠀precisely⠀timed⠀agreement.⠀Neither⠀response⠀nor⠀private⠀account⠀is⠀automatically⠀reasonable⠀or⠀required⠀to⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀insult,⠀hidden⠀guilt⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀merely⠀to⠀force⠀comedy;⠀preserve⠀what⠀actual⠀character⠀and⠀circumstances⠀support;⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀entirely⠀sincere.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀interpersonal⠀knowledge.⠀Reader⠀exposure⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀communicate⠀a⠀thought⠀to⠀another⠀participant;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access.⠀Preserve⠀chronology⠀and⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀during⠀continued⠀reception⠀or⠀private⠀thought.⠀Interpretation⠀may⠀remain⠀stable⠀or⠀change⠀when⠀actually⠀supported,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀payoff,⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀collapse.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling⠀for⠀this⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀a⠀supernatural⠀fact⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀it.⠀Instead,⠀arrange⠀several⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀or⠀points⠀of⠀view⠀around⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀or⠀exchange,⠀clearly⠀marked⠀by⠀speaker,⠀time,⠀or⠀source.⠀These⠀voices⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀direct⠀narrative,⠀remembered⠀speech,⠀written⠀notes,⠀or⠀shifts⠀of⠀focalization,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀attribution⠀is⠀unmistakable.\n\nLet⠀each⠀voice⠀carry⠀its⠀actual⠀concern,⠀with⠀conviction,⠀self-image⠀or⠀inner⠀argument⠀where⠀they⠀belong⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀debate⠀in⠀every⠀mind.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀defend⠀a⠀grand⠀moral⠀reason;⠀another⠀may⠀recall⠀only⠀the⠀practical⠀inconvenience;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀be⠀genuinely⠀indifferent.⠀Make⠀each⠀account⠀legible⠀as⠀its⠀owner's⠀actual⠀experience,⠀coherent⠀or⠀conflicted⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀strawman⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀contradiction.⠀Do⠀not⠀merge⠀minds⠀or⠀grant⠀one⠀voice⠀authority⠀by⠀placing⠀it⠀last;⠀all⠀accounts⠀can⠀be⠀accurate⠀but⠀differently⠀scaled.\n\nJuxtapose⠀these⠀accounts⠀nonlinearly⠀if⠀it⠀serves⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀later⠀practical⠀result⠀can⠀appear⠀before⠀the⠀elaborate⠀motive⠀that⠀preceded⠀it,⠀or⠀two⠀simultaneous⠀reactions⠀can⠀interrupt⠀each⠀other.⠀Preserve⠀established⠀facts⠀and⠀any⠀known⠀correct⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀comedy⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀deliberate⠀contrast⠀of⠀scales—the⠀same⠀event⠀is⠀a⠀crisis⠀in⠀one⠀mind⠀and⠀an⠀errand⠀in⠀another—while⠀each⠀account⠀remains⠀legitimate.\n\nMaintain⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀actual⠀permissions⠀of⠀the⠀fiction.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀prohibits⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀mind,⠀use⠀only⠀an⠀attributed⠀external⠀account.⠀Let⠀the⠀arrangement⠀span⠀replies,⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀able⠀to⠀fall⠀within⠀one⠀account⠀before⠀every⠀voice⠀or⠀comic⠀relation⠀is⠀complete.⠀Preserve⠀source⠀and⠀event⠀orientation⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀consensus⠀or⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀actual⠀people,⠀location⠀and⠀aim⠀with⠀the⠀context⠀needed⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀personal⠀conviction⠀or⠀self-description⠀may⠀establish⠀an⠀expectation,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrative⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀assigned⠀as⠀a⠀philosophical⠀role.⠀Introduce⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀circumstance⠀through⠀actual⠀observation,⠀dialogue⠀or⠀authorized⠀explanation⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀information⠀they⠀already⠀know.\n\nUse⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀where⠀speaker,⠀action⠀or⠀focal⠀response⠀needs⠀separation.⠀A⠀developed⠀moral⠀account⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀literal⠀answer,⠀competent⠀act⠀or⠀ordinary⠀preference⠀with⠀comic⠀scale;⠀accurate⠀agreement⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀apt⠀as⠀a⠀supported⠀difference.⠀Let⠀placement⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀readable⠀without⠀a⠀prescribed⠀break⠀immediately⠀after⠀a⠀reply⠀or⠀a⠀reaction⠀paragraph⠀owed⠀next.⠀The⠀actual⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀sequence⠀may⠀put⠀thought⠀before,⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀speech.\n\nGive⠀authorized⠀reasoning,⠀feeling⠀and⠀sensation⠀their⠀needed⠀extent⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀channel,⠀without⠀a⠀limited⠀block⠀or⠀immediate⠀action⠀payoff.⠀Speakers⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀registers⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀person⠀and⠀role⠀remain⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀within⠀setup,⠀continuing⠀thought⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀exchange,⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀after⠀a⠀result.⠀No⠀new⠀practical⠀change,⠀stable⠀pause,⠀joke,⠀corrective⠀reaction⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nDevelop⠀a⠀scene-born⠀image,⠀sound⠀or⠀association⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀recurrence⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permissions.⠀It⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀character's⠀actual⠀moral⠀self-description⠀or⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator's⠀comparison,⠀with⠀the⠀source⠀clear:⠀a⠀duty⠀remembered⠀as⠀a⠀weight,⠀a⠀debt⠀imaged⠀as⠀a⠀thread,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀gathers⠀accusation⠀or⠀affection.⠀Let⠀repetition⠀and⠀variation⠀shape⠀the⠀sentence,⠀with⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀account⠀needs⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀image⠀becomes⠀the⠀argument's⠀body.⠀Place⠀the⠀image⠀beside⠀a⠀plain⠀practical⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀supports⠀it—a⠀shelf⠀that⠀needs⠀straightening,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀faint⠀smell⠀from⠀the⠀next⠀room—and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀carry⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀through⠀implication⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀connection⠀the⠀permitted⠀account⠀can⠀make.⠀The⠀detail⠀need⠀not⠀refute⠀the⠀image;⠀it⠀may⠀merely⠀occupy⠀a⠀different⠀scale,⠀and⠀their⠀juxtaposition⠀can⠀carry⠀comic⠀tension⠀whether⠀the⠀participant⠀notices⠀it⠀or⠀not;⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀source,⠀attention⠀and⠀degree⠀of⠀conviction⠀without⠀requiring⠀equal⠀weight⠀in⠀one⠀mind.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀moral⠀voice⠀present:⠀the⠀image⠀may⠀accuse,⠀defend,⠀entangle,⠀or⠀reverse⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀phrases.⠀If⠀the⠀person⠀argues⠀with⠀himself,⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀turn⠀on⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀the⠀argument.⠀A⠀plain⠀utterance⠀from⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀meet⠀the⠀shaped⠀expectation⠀without⠀having⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀witty⠀deflation⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀verdict.⠀The⠀other⠀speaker's⠀diction⠀remains⠀their⠀own;⠀do⠀not⠀absorb⠀them⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience:⠀associations⠀actually⠀experienced⠀by⠀a⠀character⠀remain⠀their⠀own,⠀not⠀shared⠀with⠀others⠀merely⠀through⠀reader⠀exposure.⠀Their⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀remain⠀available.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀fail⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀to⠀be⠀mocked.⠀The⠀practical⠀encounter⠀may⠀produce⠀laughter,⠀mild⠀discrepancy,⠀or⠀an⠀intensified⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀image's⠀importance;⠀the⠀ending⠀remains⠀contingent.⠀If⠀warmth⠀or⠀fellow-feeling⠀appears,⠀it⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀image's⠀pressure.⠀Avoid⠀manufacturing⠀guilt⠀for⠀ornament⠀and⠀avoid⠀forcing⠀a⠀final⠀deflation.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀the⠀situation,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nConnect⠀an⠀actual⠀present⠀detail⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀conviction,⠀exchange,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀attachment⠀with⠀clear⠀temporal⠀orientation.⠀Show⠀the⠀now-familiar⠀item,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀gesture⠀as⠀it⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀then⠀let⠀its⠀remembered⠀weight⠀surface⠀through⠀association:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀earlier⠀argument,⠀the⠀occasion⠀when⠀the⠀conviction⠀felt⠀urgent,⠀or⠀the⠀unfinished⠀feeling⠀that⠀still⠀accompanies⠀it.⠀Use⠀direct⠀reflection⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀memory⠀without⠀announcing⠀its⠀significance.⠀Keep⠀the⠀boundary⠀clear⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀understood⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀known⠀now;⠀later⠀knowledge⠀may⠀add⠀resonance⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀retroactively⠀grant⠀innocence⠀or⠀erase⠀prior⠀understanding.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀former⠀grand⠀argument⠀to⠀recur⠀through⠀a⠀modest⠀habit⠀or⠀ordinary⠀use.⠀The⠀comic⠀tension⠀emerges⠀when⠀the⠀once-weighty⠀justification⠀attaches⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀current⠀aim—returning⠀a⠀borrowed⠀object,⠀choosing⠀a⠀meal,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀reply—without⠀requiring⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀renounce⠀the⠀original⠀attachment.⠀Humor⠀and⠀longing⠀may⠀coexist;⠀the⠀weight⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀debunked,⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀need⠀not⠀diminish⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀disproportion⠀himself⠀or⠀remain⠀absorbed⠀in⠀the⠀feeling;⠀either⠀is⠀valid.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀accuracy⠀actually⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀memory.⠀Locate⠀any⠀actual⠀error⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀person⠀held⠀it;⠀mark⠀later⠀recognition⠀by⠀its⠀actual⠀sources⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀past⠀or⠀present⠀mistake⠀for⠀comic⠀effect.⠀If⠀the⠀memory⠀was⠀partial⠀or⠀uncertain,⠀keep⠀that⠀uncertainty.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀loss,⠀moral⠀conversion⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀on⠀impermanence⠀merely⠀for⠀the⠀boundary;⠀actual⠀developments⠀remain⠀governed⠀by⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀circumstances.⠀Private⠀reflection⠀may⠀be⠀direct,⠀extensive,⠀or⠀unfinished;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀prove⠀its⠀worth⠀through⠀action,⠀and⠀no⠀final⠀statement⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀means⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀construction:⠀follow⠀a⠀concrete⠀aim⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀supported⠀encounters,⠀each⠀arising⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀situation⠀and⠀world⠀conditions,⠀without⠀requiring⠀resistance.⠀The⠀aim⠀may⠀be⠀material,⠀social,⠀or⠀personal—returning⠀something,⠀making⠀a⠀claim,⠀finishing⠀an⠀errand—but⠀keep⠀it⠀recognizable⠀as⠀it⠀is⠀pursued,⠀paused⠀or⠀legitimately⠀changed⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀person.⠀In⠀each⠀encounter,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀bring⠀whatever⠀convictions⠀or⠀self-justifications⠀actually⠀belong⠀to⠀them:⠀an⠀elaborate⠀moral⠀argument,⠀a⠀defensive⠀reason,⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀self-accusation.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀satire;⠀let⠀the⠀disproportion⠀between⠀the⠀justification⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀concerns⠀of⠀the⠀encounter⠀appear⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue.\n\nStage⠀the⠀meeting⠀of⠀perspectives:⠀another⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀different⠀practical⠀concern,⠀agree⠀sincerely,⠀understand⠀accurately,⠀misunderstand⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀reason,⠀or⠀offer⠀straightforward⠀help.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀scales,⠀not⠀from⠀everyone⠀being⠀a⠀fool⠀or⠀a⠀cheat.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀explains⠀themselves,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀actually⠀does⠀with⠀the⠀explanation—asks⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀offers⠀a⠀small⠀kindness,⠀continues⠀their⠀work—following⠀any⠀actual⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀person's⠀course⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀changed⠀trajectory⠀or⠀moral⠀duel.⠀Keep⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀full⠀needed⠀extent⠀without⠀entering⠀an⠀excluded⠀mind:⠀their⠀reasons,⠀doubts,⠀and⠀self-argument⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀at⠀their⠀actual⠀place⠀before,⠀during⠀or⠀between⠀exchanges⠀at⠀their⠀needed⠀extent.\n\nPreserve⠀local⠀circumstances⠀and⠀knowledge⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied.⠀A⠀plain⠀speaker⠀may⠀unsettle⠀an⠀elaborate⠀argument⠀without⠀becoming⠀the⠀story's⠀moral⠀authority.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀travel,⠀a⠀trickster⠀identity,⠀universal⠀deceit,⠀endless⠀obstruction,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀moral⠀dilemma⠀at⠀every⠀encounter.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀within⠀continued⠀thought,⠀an⠀encounter⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀aim,⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀after⠀completion.⠀No⠀natural⠀pause,⠀fresh⠀practical⠀step⠀or⠀confrontation⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀with⠀economical⠀transitions⠀to⠀make⠀an⠀actual⠀claim⠀and⠀practical⠀circumstance⠀legible.⠀Preserve⠀their⠀actual⠀order⠀and⠀any⠀relevant⠀direct⠀explanation⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀inference⠀alone⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀claim-then-response⠀pair.⠀Where⠀the⠀selected⠀form⠀permits⠀summary,⠀condense⠀redundant⠀framing⠀rather⠀than⠀actual⠀speech⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀whose⠀full⠀extent⠀matters.⠀Keep⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀expresses⠀and⠀the⠀causal⠀connection⠀to⠀any⠀response⠀intact.⠀A⠀meaningful⠀private⠀argument⠀or⠀a⠀genuine⠀feeling⠀may⠀take⠀its⠀required⠀length—do⠀not⠀cut⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀slogan.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀actual⠀claim⠀and⠀response⠀close⠀enough⠀for⠀their⠀comic⠀relation⠀to⠀be⠀readable⠀without⠀duplicated⠀commentary.⠀Preserve⠀whether⠀the⠀claim⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀private⠀and⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀actually⠀occurs;⠀a⠀practical⠀particular⠀can⠀provide⠀the⠀other⠀scale:⠀closing⠀a⠀drawer,⠀handing⠀back⠀exact⠀change,⠀repeating⠀a⠀practical⠀question.⠀The⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀repeat⠀that⠀the⠀scales⠀differ,⠀while⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀remains⠀available;⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀does⠀the⠀work.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀the⠀claim,⠀may⠀understand⠀it⠀fully,⠀or⠀may⠀simply⠀address⠀a⠀different⠀need;⠀plain⠀speech⠀has⠀no⠀automatic⠀moral⠀authority.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀a⠀mute⠀foil.\n\nDo⠀not⠀erase⠀causes,⠀actual⠀expression,⠀or⠀character⠀privacy.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀retreats⠀into⠀thought,⠀show⠀that⠀thought's⠀particular⠀turn⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀clipped⠀cast⠀speech,⠀a⠀silence⠀quota,⠀or⠀a⠀deflating⠀last⠀line.⠀The⠀ending⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved;⠀the⠀comic⠀recognition⠀may⠀occur⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀continues⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀claim⠀sincerely.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nMove⠀naturally⠀among⠀activity,⠀speech,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inward⠀experience⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀pursues⠀a⠀current⠀aim.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀conviction⠀as⠀a⠀thought⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀moment—an⠀actual⠀reason,⠀conviction⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling⠀that⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀or⠀self-justifying⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀mind⠀as⠀they⠀look⠀for⠀something,⠀wait,⠀or⠀begin⠀to⠀explain.⠀Let⠀it⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀texture:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀rehearse⠀the⠀argument⠀while⠀handling⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀address⠀a⠀line⠀to⠀themselves⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀detached⠀lecture⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀the⠀author⠀label;⠀actual⠀extended⠀speech⠀or⠀inward⠀argument⠀retains⠀its⠀needed⠀extent;⠀let⠀the⠀argument⠀emerge⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀material⠀circumstance.\n\nWhere⠀another⠀person⠀actually⠀responds,⠀let⠀that⠀reception⠀meet⠀the⠀argument;⠀a⠀response⠀may⠀remain⠀pending⠀and⠀private⠀anticipation⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀spoken.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀concern,⠀agree⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀scales⠀the⠀argument⠀differently,⠀or⠀simply⠀offer⠀help⠀that⠀bypasses⠀the⠀self-definition.⠀The⠀comic⠀disproportion⠀arises⠀because⠀the⠀character's⠀inner⠀architecture⠀faces⠀a⠀plain⠀actuality—not⠀because⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀is⠀wrong.⠀A⠀plain⠀answer⠀may⠀confirm,⠀qualify,⠀or⠀bypass⠀the⠀argument⠀without⠀deciding⠀its⠀moral⠀worth.⠀The⠀other⠀person's⠀diction⠀and⠀purpose⠀remain⠀their⠀own;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀a⠀device⠀for⠀judging⠀the⠀protagonist.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reasoning⠀available⠀after⠀speech⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀continues⠀to⠀think.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀extend⠀the⠀argument,⠀notice⠀the⠀disproportion,⠀or⠀remain⠀untouched⠀by⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reversal,⠀confession,⠀or⠀lesson.⠀Preserve⠀individual⠀diction,⠀meaningful⠀feeling,⠀and⠀established⠀facts.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀within⠀continued⠀thought,⠀speech⠀or⠀activity,⠀without⠀owing⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀changed⠀conviction,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀as⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀scene⠀selection⠀and⠀callbacks.⠀Choose⠀an⠀occasion⠀and⠀situation⠀that⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀participants'⠀particular⠀bond⠀legible:⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀together,⠀how⠀they⠀address⠀each⠀other,⠀what⠀they⠀return⠀to.⠀A⠀familiar⠀justification—a⠀repeated⠀moral⠀argument,⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀self-description,⠀a⠀shared⠀practical⠀accommodation—can⠀recur⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀circumstance.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀reception⠀this⠀time,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀misunderstanding:⠀one⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀affectionate⠀accuracy,⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀serious⠀reply⠀along⠀a⠀different⠀line,⠀or⠀both⠀may⠀attach⠀different⠀supported⠀meanings⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀phrase.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀character's⠀independent⠀understanding⠀through⠀the⠀sources⠀and⠀private⠀access⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀actually⠀permits,⠀without⠀opening⠀an⠀excluded⠀mind⠀for⠀symmetry.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀bond⠀into⠀a⠀mutual⠀commentary⠀machine⠀or⠀force⠀banter.⠀When⠀a⠀callback⠀occurs,⠀follow⠀its⠀actual⠀reception⠀or⠀non-reception⠀within⠀those⠀permissions:⠀one⠀may⠀feel⠀the⠀obligation,⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀differently,⠀and⠀both⠀may⠀be⠀right.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀comfort⠀full⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise—these⠀are⠀not⠀interruptions⠀of⠀the⠀comedy⠀but⠀its⠀material.⠀If⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀new⠀or⠀the⠀history⠀thin,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀shared⠀shorthand;⠀let⠀a⠀first-time⠀act⠀or⠀response⠀matter⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀without⠀pretending⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀past.\n\nPreserve⠀private⠀knowledge⠀and⠀established⠀history:⠀what⠀each⠀character⠀knows,⠀what⠀they⠀feel,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀actually⠀done⠀together⠀must⠀remain⠀consistent.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀trope⠀roster,⠀confession,⠀repaired⠀bond⠀or⠀status⠀change⠀merely⠀from⠀the⠀style;⠀any⠀actual⠀supported⠀development⠀can⠀stand.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀during⠀thought⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀after⠀a⠀conclusion⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀practical⠀step⠀is⠀available.⠀No⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀is⠀owed⠀here.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀cadence,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀grounded⠀recurrence⠀to⠀give⠀actual⠀deeds⠀a⠀retold⠀shape.⠀Give⠀a⠀deed⠀a⠀compact⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀retold⠀account:⠀who⠀did⠀it⠀and⠀how⠀an⠀actual⠀source⠀remembers⠀or⠀judges⠀it.⠀An⠀attributed⠀declaration⠀can⠀establish⠀moral⠀scale⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀reputation⠀or⠀requiring⠀a⠀fixed⠀opening.⠀Keep⠀the⠀declaration⠀attributed—someone⠀says⠀this,⠀or⠀the⠀chronicle⠀voice⠀distinguishes⠀between⠀the⠀teller's⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀known⠀event.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀practical⠀circumstances:⠀the⠀exact⠀room,⠀the⠀object⠀handled,⠀the⠀unremarkable⠀effort.⠀The⠀comic⠀contrast⠀arises⠀because⠀the⠀remembered⠀moral⠀statement⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀act⠀occupy⠀different⠀scales,⠀but⠀the⠀act⠀remains⠀consequential⠀in⠀the⠀community's⠀account.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀mockery⠀or⠀empty⠀bombast⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀the⠀style;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀speech⠀and⠀judgment⠀where⠀supported;⠀the⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀acted⠀competently⠀and⠀the⠀praise⠀may⠀be⠀deserved.\n\nA⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀at⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀for⠀actual⠀remembered⠀emphasis,⠀familiar⠀repetition⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀application,⠀without⠀requiring⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀If⠀a⠀reputation⠀is⠀offered,⠀show⠀the⠀person⠀living⠀with⠀it⠀in⠀private⠀or⠀in⠀dialogue:⠀their⠀own⠀justification⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀elaborate,⠀more⠀self-doubting,⠀or⠀simpler⠀than⠀the⠀public⠀verdict.⠀Distinguish⠀original⠀motive,⠀later⠀telling,⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀access.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern;⠀this⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.\n\nDo⠀not⠀assign⠀a⠀collective⠀verdict⠀on⠀the⠀story's⠀behalf⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀fixed⠀opening⠀formula.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀within⠀ongoing⠀telling,⠀thought⠀or⠀business,⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀after⠀conclusion⠀or⠀resumption.⠀No⠀next⠀act⠀must⠀become⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered.⠀No⠀completed⠀moral⠀judgment⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacagav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism:⠀let⠀the⠀practical⠀terms⠀of⠀an⠀arrangement⠀appear⠀through⠀concrete⠀work,⠀shared⠀space,⠀care,⠀or⠀time.⠀When⠀someone⠀gives⠀an⠀elaborate⠀moral⠀account⠀of⠀fairness⠀or⠀independence,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀exact⠀preference⠀or⠀task⠀that⠀these⠀people⠀actually⠀follow.⠀Comic⠀scale⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀account⠀meeting⠀the⠀practical⠀life⠀around⠀it,⠀whether⠀their⠀relation⠀is⠀a⠀mismatch⠀or⠀accurate⠀correspondence;⠀agreement⠀and⠀competent⠀cooperation⠀may⠀remain.⠀Keep⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀separate⠀from⠀public⠀explanation:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀character's⠀inward⠀defense⠀or⠀self-accusation⠀alongside⠀another⠀person's⠀actual⠀activity⠀or⠀reception,⠀without⠀requiring⠀usefulness⠀or⠀opening⠀an⠀excluded⠀mind.⠀Reader⠀exposure⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀communicate⠀thought;⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀remain.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀as⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀shrink⠀the⠀situation,⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast,⠀or⠀i