an⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀occasion⠀where⠀someone⠀tells⠀or⠀retells⠀an⠀account⠀to⠀listeners⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀situated⠀interests,⠀including⠀enjoyment⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀Establish⠀why⠀this⠀audience⠀is⠀hearing⠀it⠀now:⠀to⠀secure⠀cooperation,⠀explain⠀a⠀delay,⠀defend⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀request⠀legible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective⠀intact;⠀the⠀teller's⠀performance⠀is⠀an⠀event⠀within⠀that⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀the⠀active⠀narrator.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀movement⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀return.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀selection⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀family⠀story⠀or⠀public⠀version⠀relate⠀to⠀their⠀present⠀purpose,⠀whether⠀deliberate⠀or⠀habitual.⠀Give⠀that⠀embedded⠀account⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀recognizable⠀expectation⠀about⠀a⠀person,⠀place,⠀or⠀outcome.⠀Where⠀the⠀sequence⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀let⠀any⠀actual⠀response⠀follow⠀the⠀listeners'⠀own⠀concerns;⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀also⠀arrive⠀during⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀ongoing⠀private⠀experience.⠀They⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀story,⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀practical⠀matter,⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀considered⠀unimportant,⠀or⠀simply⠀continue⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀doing.⠀Comic⠀timing⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀an⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀intended⠀effect⠀and⠀actual⠀reception.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀competence,⠀foolishness⠀or⠀honesty⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀trait⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀joke.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀levels⠀of⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀omit⠀something⠀out⠀of⠀habit,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀incomplete⠀understanding;⠀the⠀listeners⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀or⠀interpret⠀it⠀accurately.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀can⠀connect⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀without⠀proving⠀the⠀story⠀true⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀single⠀meaning.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀tale,⠀thought,⠀listener⠀response⠀or⠀ordinary⠀business⠀without⠀requiring⠀one⠀to⠀follow⠀or⠀finish⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀or⠀compulsory⠀interruption.⠀The⠀frame-tale⠀form⠀organizes⠀the⠀sequence;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀embedded⠀account⠀to⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀laugh.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀route.⠀When⠀a⠀record⠀is⠀actually⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀scene—a⠀notice,⠀registry⠀entry,⠀official⠀letter,⠀published⠀account,⠀or⠀institutional⠀file—present⠀its⠀wording⠀with⠀attention⠀to⠀its⠀authorship,⠀date,⠀and⠀purpose.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀record⠀into⠀the⠀story's⠀only⠀voice;⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀what⠀an⠀authorized⠀character⠀remembers⠀or⠀observes.\n\nUse⠀the⠀situated⠀relation⠀between⠀a⠀record's⠀wording⠀and⠀remembered⠀particulars⠀for⠀comic⠀scale;⠀agreement⠀can⠀carry⠀it⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀contradiction.⠀An⠀official⠀formulation⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀public⠀event,⠀a⠀family's⠀standing,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀in⠀broad⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀terms.⠀A⠀character's⠀memory⠀can⠀supply⠀the⠀precise⠀domestic⠀or⠀bodily⠀circumstance⠀that⠀accompanied⠀it:⠀the⠀heat⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀was⠀interrupted,⠀the⠀relative⠀who⠀kept⠀repeating⠀the⠀wrong⠀name.⠀Both⠀accounts⠀can⠀be⠀true.⠀Their⠀juxtaposition⠀can⠀carry⠀humor⠀without⠀a⠀discovery⠀of⠀error;⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀errors⠀or⠀discoveries⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀or⠀excluding⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀temporal⠀and⠀evidentiary⠀layers⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character's⠀present⠀knowledge⠀may⠀include⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀later⠀made⠀clear,⠀and⠀current⠀recollection⠀may⠀carry⠀that⠀interpretation;⠀distinguish⠀it⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀actually⠀knew⠀or⠀felt⠀at⠀the⠀earlier⠀time.⠀Rumor,⠀record,⠀memory,⠀and⠀current⠀thought⠀remain⠀separate⠀sources.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀all⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀document.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀prompt⠀reflection,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀a⠀permitted⠀character's⠀live⠀interiority⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀narrator⠀its⠀recorder.⠀No⠀investigation,⠀secret,⠀or⠀compulsory⠀contradiction⠀is⠀required.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀aim⠀or⠀routine⠀that⠀brought⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀together.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nGround⠀the⠀inherited⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀material⠀setting,⠀using⠀urban⠀detail⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀place.⠀If⠀a⠀place,⠀family,⠀title,⠀or⠀institution⠀carries⠀a⠀remembered⠀public⠀meaning,⠀show⠀the⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀that⠀meaning⠀now:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀still⠀sticks,⠀a⠀portrait⠀hung⠀above⠀a⠀copying⠀machine,⠀a⠀rule⠀written⠀in⠀old⠀language⠀on⠀a⠀laminated⠀notice.⠀Let⠀a⠀gathering⠀sentence,⠀actual⠀exchange⠀or⠀developed⠀atmospheric⠀passage⠀connect⠀the⠀historical⠀formulation⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀place⠀and⠀its⠀occupants.\n\nBring⠀that⠀inherited⠀story⠀into⠀contact⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀task,⠀private⠀preference,⠀or⠀practical⠀access⠀condition.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀room,⠀or⠀an⠀exception.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀the⠀grand⠀formulation⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀need:⠀the⠀ceremony⠀that⠀delays⠀a⠀lunch,⠀the⠀privilege⠀that⠀complicates⠀a⠀simple⠀errand,⠀the⠀reputation⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀worked⠀around.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀authority's⠀actual⠀competence⠀or⠀limitations⠀and⠀the⠀claim's⠀established⠀truth⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀humiliation,⠀corruption,⠀or⠀unmasking⠀as⠀the⠀required⠀comic⠀beat.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀shape⠀how⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀experience⠀the⠀meeting.⠀The⠀room's⠀weight,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀paper,⠀the⠀echo⠀of⠀a⠀corridor⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀contrast⠀felt⠀without⠀supplying⠀new⠀supernatural⠀rules⠀or⠀danger.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀sources⠀of⠀the⠀public⠀story⠀and⠀the⠀meaningful⠀private⠀desires⠀that⠀persist⠀beyond⠀it.⠀A⠀social⠀presentation⠀may⠀change⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀voluntary⠀or⠀involuntary⠀context;⠀no⠀such⠀change⠀is⠀required⠀here.⠀Keep⠀the⠀exchange⠀consequential,⠀preserving⠀what⠀actually⠀persists,⠀changes⠀or⠀ends⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀particular⠀result⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀narration⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Keep⠀the⠀account⠀situated⠀in⠀an⠀actual⠀participant⠀or⠀known⠀source⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀into⠀that⠀role.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀testifying⠀person,⠀make⠀the⠀source's⠀identity⠀and⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀events⠀clear⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀terms.\n\nArrange⠀what⠀circulated,⠀what⠀was⠀experienced,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀now⠀with⠀clear⠀attribution⠀and⠀time.⠀A⠀widely⠀repeated⠀version⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀public⠀occasion,⠀a⠀family⠀achievement,⠀or⠀a⠀local⠀scandal⠀in⠀broad⠀terms.⠀The⠀teller's⠀concrete⠀experience⠀can⠀supply⠀a⠀smaller⠀practical⠀concern:⠀who⠀had⠀to⠀pay⠀for⠀the⠀chairs,⠀which⠀relative⠀arrived⠀too⠀early,⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀while⠀the⠀official⠀speech⠀was⠀being⠀prepared.⠀Neither⠀account⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀false.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀circulated⠀language⠀and⠀experienced⠀particulars⠀for⠀comic⠀recognition.⠀Accurate⠀differences⠀of⠀emphasis⠀can⠀carry⠀it⠀without⠀an⠀exposure,⠀while⠀any⠀actual⠀error⠀or⠀discovery⠀keeps⠀its⠀supported⠀place.\n\nPreserve⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀and⠀present⠀private⠀feeling.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀already⠀understand⠀the⠀comic⠀gap⠀or⠀may⠀recount⠀it⠀without⠀amusement.⠀Later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀not⠀rewrite⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀earlier⠀time.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀confession,⠀or⠀lesson.⠀The⠀testimonial⠀form⠀organizes⠀the⠀telling,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀consequences⠀remain⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Stay⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion,⠀habits,⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀attention⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀encountering⠀a⠀familiar⠀saying,⠀name,⠀or⠀account.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀association⠀actually⠀enters⠀attention,⠀show⠀its⠀particular⠀source:⠀a⠀family⠀usage,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀explanation,⠀a⠀schoolroom⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀event⠀they⠀witnessed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀remembered⠀association⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀reception.\n\nA⠀current⠀perception,⠀private⠀association⠀or⠀next⠀actual⠀action⠀or⠀reply⠀can⠀give⠀the⠀phrase⠀a⠀different⠀scale⠀or⠀confirm⠀an⠀enjoyable⠀pattern.⠀Earlier⠀association⠀and⠀a⠀next⠀public⠀response⠀are⠀not⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀hear⠀the⠀familiar⠀words⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀ordinary—paying⠀for⠀a⠀ticket,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀call,⠀measuring⠀a⠀doorway—and⠀the⠀practical⠀context⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀phrase's⠀public⠀weight⠀comically⠀disproportionate.⠀Or⠀the⠀person⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀phrase⠀deliberately⠀and⠀receive⠀an⠀accurate,⠀unimpressed⠀response.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀reception,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀universal⠀public⠀verdict⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀misunderstanding.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀person's⠀real⠀feeling⠀intact⠀beyond⠀the⠀comic⠀use⠀of⠀the⠀recurrence.⠀The⠀phrase⠀may⠀carry⠀affection,⠀irritation,⠀grief,⠀or⠀pride,⠀and⠀that⠀weight⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀scene's⠀humor.⠀No⠀diary⠀artifact,⠀quietness,⠀or⠀seasonal⠀scenery⠀is⠀imposed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀actual⠀world⠀facts,⠀with⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀for⠀each⠀mind⠀to⠀which⠀access⠀is⠀authorized.⠀The⠀realism⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀precise⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀phrase's⠀known⠀history⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀present⠀experience,⠀including⠀unchanged⠀or⠀unfinished⠀feeling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaham::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Move⠀among⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀and⠀times⠀through⠀clear⠀source⠀markers:⠀a⠀remembered⠀conversation,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀a⠀family⠀explanation,⠀a⠀later⠀private⠀reflection.⠀Let⠀a⠀phrase,⠀name,⠀or⠀concern⠀connect⠀them⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀connection⠀explicit⠀in⠀every⠀section.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀recognize⠀the⠀recurrence⠀through⠀the⠀material⠀itself.\n\nRender⠀each⠀account's⠀actual⠀scale⠀and⠀source⠀faithfully,⠀including⠀established⠀errors⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀without⠀inventing⠀either.⠀One⠀may⠀treat⠀the⠀occasion⠀as⠀a⠀public⠀event,⠀another⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀errand,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀memory.⠀Their⠀facts⠀and⠀interpretations⠀may⠀agree.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀presentation⠀order⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀of⠀scale:⠀the⠀grand⠀version⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀detail,⠀or⠀the⠀private⠀memory⠀preceding⠀the⠀public⠀formulation⠀it⠀quietly⠀corrects.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀contradiction⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀comparison.⠀The⠀juxtaposition⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀comic⠀operation.\n\nKeep⠀chronology⠀and⠀knowledge⠀intact.⠀A⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀participant⠀did⠀not,⠀but⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀written⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀account.⠀Preserve⠀each⠀voice's⠀distinct⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀with⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience⠀for⠀all⠀minds⠀permitted⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀No⠀fixed⠀number⠀of⠀voices⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀polyphonic⠀form⠀organizes⠀the⠀telling;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀shared⠀consciousness⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀the⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀that⠀organizes⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀a⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another,⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀space⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀one,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀paragraphing.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name,⠀public⠀account,⠀or⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀give⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀understand⠀its⠀use.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀it,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀supply⠀a⠀brief⠀gathered⠀history,⠀or⠀the⠀dialogue⠀may⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀phrase⠀functions⠀for⠀these⠀people.⠀Give⠀explanation⠀the⠀development⠀needed⠀for⠀actual⠀understanding⠀or⠀preparation,⠀including⠀before⠀action⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀causal⠀order.⠀Cut⠀redundant⠀exposition⠀without⠀making⠀its⠀prose⠀length⠀consume⠀fictional⠀time⠀or⠀excluding⠀meaningful⠀private⠀association.\n\nUse⠀paragraph⠀rhythm⠀to⠀connect⠀expectation⠀and⠀reception.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀in⠀one⠀paragraph⠀and⠀answered⠀in⠀the⠀next,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀recalled⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀performs⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task.⠀Let⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀causal⠀order⠀of⠀action⠀and⠀private⠀association.⠀Each⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀amused,⠀accurate,⠀or⠀uninterested.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀rotation⠀or⠀a⠀response⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world⠀and⠀cast⠀age;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀first⠀person,⠀universal⠀quips,⠀new⠀mechanics⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀closing⠀hook.⠀The⠀scene's⠀pace⠀carries⠀the⠀comedy,⠀not⠀a⠀checklist⠀of⠀beats.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀sound,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀image⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀develop⠀through⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀and⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀or⠀public⠀account⠀enters⠀authorized⠀attention,⠀give⠀enough⠀actual⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀cues⠀to⠀orient⠀it;⠀a⠀current⠀repeater,⠀first⠀source⠀or⠀specific⠀trigger⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀available.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀become⠀a⠀general⠀communal⠀memory⠀without⠀a⠀source.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀turn⠀by⠀meeting⠀the⠀gathered⠀resonance⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀or⠀practical⠀detail.⠀A⠀change⠀of⠀register⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀joke⠀without⠀invalidating⠀the⠀image;⠀an⠀actual⠀correction⠀is⠀also⠀available⠀when⠀supported.⠀A⠀phrase⠀remembered⠀as⠀solemn⠀may⠀return⠀beside⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate⠀being⠀propped⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀saying⠀may⠀arrive⠀just⠀as⠀someone⠀asks⠀for⠀the⠀salt.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀feeling⠀and⠀the⠀image's⠀supported⠀significance;⠀a⠀plain⠀detail⠀may⠀alter⠀their⠀apparent⠀scale⠀or⠀confirm⠀a⠀familiar⠀relation⠀without⠀requiring⠀either⠀change.\n\nKeep⠀figurative⠀association⠀distinct⠀from⠀literal⠀world⠀facts.⠀If⠀a⠀house⠀'remembered'⠀its⠀former⠀occupants,⠀distinguish⠀figurative⠀association⠀from⠀any⠀literal⠀memory⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀actually⠀grants⠀the⠀house;⠀the⠀lyrical⠀wording⠀alone⠀establishes⠀no⠀new⠀power.⠀Let⠀each⠀speaker's⠀diction⠀remain⠀their⠀own;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀cast's⠀speech.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀association⠀or⠀feeling⠀continues;⠀no⠀collapse⠀of⠀the⠀image,⠀magical⠀event,⠀or⠀punch⠀line⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀an⠀actual⠀present⠀detail⠀call⠀up⠀a⠀phrase,⠀joke,⠀or⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀known⠀personal⠀history.⠀Show⠀what⠀remains⠀recognizable⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀really⠀changed.⠀A⠀once-public⠀joke⠀may⠀return⠀through⠀a⠀modest⠀habit:⠀the⠀same⠀nickname⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀reason,⠀the⠀same⠀toast⠀offered⠀at⠀a⠀smaller⠀table,⠀the⠀same⠀complaint⠀repeated⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀the⠀original⠀remedy.\n\nKeep⠀later⠀recollection⠀distinct⠀from⠀prior⠀experience.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀now⠀what⠀no⠀one⠀knew⠀then,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀place⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge⠀inside⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene.⠀Preserve⠀genuine⠀former⠀pleasure⠀and⠀accurate⠀memories.⠀The⠀humor⠀and⠀the⠀longing⠀coexist;⠀neither⠀cancels⠀the⠀other,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀announce⠀impermanence⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀past⠀was⠀better⠀or⠀worse⠀than⠀it⠀was.\n\nAllow⠀full⠀private⠀reflection⠀to⠀linger⠀without⠀turning⠀into⠀action,⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀time.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀holding⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀and⠀its⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀together.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀loss,⠀innocence,⠀or⠀new⠀understanding⠀to⠀make⠀time⠀visible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀construction⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Follow⠀the⠀actual⠀person⠀as⠀they⠀pursue⠀a⠀supplied⠀aim⠀through⠀supported⠀encounters,⠀carrying⠀only⠀the⠀accounts⠀or⠀formulations⠀they⠀really⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀trickster⠀role,⠀a⠀deceptive⠀institution,⠀or⠀an⠀obstruction⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀supply.\n\nLet⠀a⠀saying⠀or⠀account⠀circulate⠀through⠀attributed⠀sources.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀take⠀up⠀a⠀phrase⠀for⠀an⠀unexpectedly⠀practical⠀purpose;⠀another⠀may⠀use⠀it⠀exactly⠀as⠀intended⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀situation.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀relation⠀for⠀comic⠀recognition:⠀the⠀same⠀formula⠀can⠀organize⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation⠀and⠀a⠀dispute⠀over⠀a⠀broken⠀shutter,⠀and⠀the⠀comedy⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀exact⠀use⠀each⠀speaker⠀makes⠀of⠀it.⠀Attribute⠀circulation⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀a⠀rumor⠀as⠀common⠀memory.⠀