reader⠀must⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀tell⠀which⠀is⠀which.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀timing⠀arise⠀inside⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀movement.⠀A⠀phrase⠀remembered⠀with⠀ceremonial⠀weight⠀may⠀collide⠀with⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀meal⠀or⠀the⠀effort⠀of⠀opening⠀a⠀door.⠀A⠀private⠀wording⠀may⠀return⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀scale⠀than⠀its⠀public⠀use.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀mind⠀a⠀community:⠀unavailable⠀words⠀and⠀minds⠀stay⠀unavailable⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.\n\nLet⠀private⠀feeling⠀develop⠀at⠀its⠀real⠀extent⠀without⠀a⠀decision,⠀public⠀joke,⠀or⠀fictional-time⠀charge⠀based⠀on⠀prose⠀length.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀remain⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀association,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀there.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nKeep⠀sender-attributed⠀messages,⠀actual⠀recipients,⠀and⠀relevant⠀interface⠀events⠀clear.⠀Let⠀a⠀familiar⠀formulation⠀return⠀through⠀what⠀someone⠀really⠀composes⠀or⠀sends.⠀Its⠀next⠀actual⠀reception⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀literal,⠀or⠀delightfully⠀apt⠀without⠀a⠀typo⠀or⠀misunderstanding.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀use⠀the⠀new⠀sender⠀gives⠀the⠀phrase,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀recipient's⠀reply⠀to⠀it.\n\nA⠀forwarded⠀account⠀remains⠀sourced⠀material,⠀not⠀firsthand⠀memory⠀or⠀proof⠀of⠀receipt⠀by⠀everyone.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀a⠀sender⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀only⠀forwarded.⠀If⠀a⠀phrase⠀circulates⠀through⠀a⠀group,⠀show⠀who⠀actually⠀received⠀it⠀and⠀who⠀responds;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀whole⠀channel⠀share⠀one⠀reaction.\n\nSeparate⠀drafts,⠀transmission,⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀the⠀sender's⠀feeling.⠀Retain⠀full⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀channel,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀sequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀delay,⠀deletion,⠀response⠀quota,⠀or⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀occur⠀before⠀sending⠀or⠀receiving.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀illustrated⠀scene⠀through⠀concise⠀setting⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Let⠀a⠀supported⠀visual⠀detail⠀attract⠀attention⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀remembered⠀formulation:⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀or⠀an⠀expression⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀moment.⠀Then⠀follow⠀the⠀particular⠀thought,⠀feeling,⠀or⠀exchange⠀through⠀which⠀the⠀phrase⠀returns⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀or⠀enjoyably⠀familiar⠀scale.\n\nA⠀face⠀is⠀an⠀observation,⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀a⠀motive.⠀The⠀association⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀shared.⠀Focal⠀narration⠀may⠀recognize⠀a⠀public⠀phrase⠀and⠀privately⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀personal⠀occasion,⠀while⠀the⠀dialogue⠀continues⠀on⠀another⠀track.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀illustrated⠀expression⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator⠀or⠀require⠀every⠀cue⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀matching⠀thought⠀and⠀line.\n\nLet⠀the⠀rhythm⠀move⠀among⠀scene-setting,⠀speech,⠀and⠀focal⠀response⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀cue-thought-dialogue⠀cycle.⠀A⠀background⠀detail⠀may⠀anchor⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀a⠀phrase⠀without⠀any⠀character⠀commenting⠀on⠀it.⠀A⠀spoken⠀line⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀visual⠀cue.⠀Preserve⠀narrator,⠀world,⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀form.\n\nDo⠀not⠀activate⠀images,⠀branching⠀menus,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀closing⠀reaction.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀partial⠀recognition⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacahbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nBriefly⠀recover⠀the⠀relevant⠀earlier⠀phrase⠀or⠀occasion⠀when⠀needed⠀for⠀re-entry,⠀preserving⠀what⠀was⠀really⠀said,⠀learned,⠀changed,⠀or⠀left⠀pending.⠀A⠀later⠀use⠀can⠀reveal⠀another⠀practical⠀scale⠀or⠀repeat⠀a⠀familiar⠀successful⠀joke.⠀Novelty⠀and⠀escalation⠀are⠀not⠀owed;⠀the⠀comic⠀significance⠀can⠀accumulate⠀through⠀accurate⠀recurrence.\n\nKeep⠀remembered,⠀reported,⠀and⠀current⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment,⠀hear⠀it⠀reported⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀present,⠀or⠀use⠀it⠀now⠀without⠀knowing⠀its⠀full⠀history.⠀Allow⠀actual⠀previous⠀understanding⠀to⠀persist.⠀Do⠀not⠀reset⠀competence⠀or⠀retroactively⠀alter⠀an⠀earlier⠀event⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀callback⠀land.\n\nLet⠀independent⠀lives⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀callback.⠀The⠀recurring⠀formulation⠀may⠀enter⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀working,⠀caring⠀for⠀another⠀person,⠀or⠀pursuing⠀a⠀separate⠀aim.⠀Meaningful⠀private⠀experience⠀continues⠀beyond⠀the⠀joke.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀association.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀reset⠀of⠀competence,⠀a⠀retroactive⠀altered⠀event,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀hook.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀ordinary⠀work⠀or⠀a⠀partial⠀recognition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀admit,⠀ask,⠀apologize,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀something⠀difficult,⠀find⠀the⠀exact⠀word,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀practical⠀fact⠀on⠀which⠀that⠀request⠀turns.⠀Write⠀the⠀moment⠀around⠀that⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀around⠀a⠀general⠀emotional⠀state:⠀the⠀specific⠀chair⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀sit⠀in,⠀the⠀precise⠀amount⠀they⠀cannot⠀say,⠀the⠀one⠀sentence⠀they⠀repeat⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀safer⠀than⠀the⠀sentence⠀they⠀need.⠀Let⠀the⠀interval⠀before,⠀during,⠀and⠀after⠀the⠀request⠀hold⠀actual⠀strain,⠀anticipation,⠀or⠀direct⠀warmth.⠀A⠀plainly⠀apt⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀it⠀lands⠀against⠀that⠀held⠀weight,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀need⠀is⠀mocked⠀or⠀deflated.\n\nUse⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀selected⠀particular⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀risked⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀arrived.⠀A⠀meaningful⠀gap⠀can⠀do⠀comic⠀work:⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀answers⠀the⠀practical⠀half⠀of⠀the⠀request⠀and⠀leaves⠀the⠀emotional⠀half⠀standing⠀in⠀the⠀silence.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀redundant⠀gloss⠀to⠀the⠀interval;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀explanation,⠀direct⠀admission,⠀or⠀private⠀recognition⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀feeling⠀remain⠀full⠀and⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀contract,⠀including⠀spontaneous⠀asking,⠀known⠀motives,⠀and⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀comedy⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀timing⠀and⠀the⠀particular,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀required⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀deflation⠀of⠀the⠀need.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀present⠀aim⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀speakers⠀immediately⠀legible.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀world⠀active:⠀other⠀participants⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives,⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀aims,⠀and⠀respond⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀rather⠀than⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀finish.⠀Build⠀comic⠀situations⠀from⠀these⠀owned⠀contributions,⠀with⠀any⠀narrator⠀commentary⠀retaining⠀its⠀actual⠀voice⠀and⠀permissions⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀the⠀situated⠀sequence.\n\nSelect⠀the⠀concrete⠀detail⠀that⠀makes⠀an⠀actual⠀contribution⠀legible⠀beside⠀a⠀preceding⠀expectation.⠀A⠀character⠀sets⠀down⠀the⠀wrong⠀object,⠀answers⠀the⠀question⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀asked,⠀or⠀performs⠀the⠀exact⠀helpful⠀act⠀that⠀reveals⠀they⠀misunderstood⠀the⠀request.⠀Let⠀that⠀particular⠀arrive⠀through⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement,⠀then⠀leave⠀room⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀participants'⠀real⠀responses:⠀aligned⠀habits,⠀contrasting⠀assumptions,⠀or⠀simple⠀continuation.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀terse,⠀withhold⠀known⠀thought,⠀take⠀player⠀control,⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀response,⠀reversal,⠀question,⠀or⠀new⠀obstacle⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀interval⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀comic⠀sequence;⠀the⠀next⠀contribution⠀can⠀follow⠀naturally⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀underway.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling.⠀Give⠀each⠀occasion⠀an⠀intelligible⠀aim⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀episode⠀move⠀through⠀that⠀aim⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀arc,⠀a⠀new⠀encounter,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀outcome.⠀Select⠀the⠀particular⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀action⠀on⠀which⠀the⠀occasion's⠀comic⠀timing⠀turns:⠀the⠀same⠀bowl⠀returned⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀shelf,⠀the⠀formal⠀greeting⠀delivered⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀the⠀repeated⠀instruction⠀that⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀the⠀circumstances⠀have⠀changed.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀exists,⠀make⠀the⠀relevant⠀continuity⠀readable⠀through⠀that⠀detail's⠀present⠀use.⠀An⠀object⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context,⠀a⠀phrase⠀pass⠀to⠀another⠀speaker,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀act⠀produce⠀a⠀different⠀result;⠀an⠀unchanged⠀familiar⠀use⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀funny⠀through⠀precise⠀recurrence.⠀Make⠀that⠀relation⠀readable⠀without⠀redundant⠀gloss⠀while⠀preserving⠀actual⠀narrative⠀explanation⠀or⠀inward⠀recognition.⠀A⠀first⠀occasion⠀needs⠀no⠀invented⠀prior⠀episode;⠀it⠀simply⠀establishes⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀may⠀return⠀later.⠀Keep⠀the⠀real⠀community⠀and⠀narrator⠀intact,⠀with⠀no⠀required⠀martial⠀plot,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀forced⠀closure.⠀Known⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀beyond⠀what⠀is⠀publicly⠀said,⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nPut⠀the⠀relevant⠀weight,⠀grip,⠀distance,⠀sound,⠀or⠀cost⠀in⠀concrete⠀verbs⠀beside⠀what⠀someone⠀actually⠀expected⠀or⠀attempted.⠀Write⠀the⠀object's⠀resistance,⠀the⠀body's⠀effort,⠀the⠀material⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀task:⠀the⠀lid⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀turn,⠀the⠀step⠀that⠀is⠀farther⠀than⠀it⠀looked,⠀the⠀package⠀heavier⠀than⠀the⠀sender⠀claimed.⠀Let⠀that⠀practical⠀particular⠀arrive⠀cleanly⠀for⠀comic⠀recognition,⠀including⠀an⠀accurately⠀anticipated⠀familiar⠀fit⠀when⠀the⠀expectation⠀is⠀met⠀exactly.⠀Compress⠀repeated⠀transitions⠀so⠀the⠀selected⠀fact⠀lands⠀with⠀force⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀buried⠀in⠀connective⠀explanation.\n\nLet⠀sentence⠀length⠀and⠀roughness⠀follow⠀the⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀moment's⠀actual⠀pressure.⠀A⠀developed⠀inward⠀passage⠀remains⠀available⠀for⠀actual⠀feeling,⠀attention,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀change⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀serve⠀the⠀joke.⠀A⠀short⠀clause⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀already⠀legible;⠀thought⠀extent⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀brevity⠀quota.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀injury,⠀failure,⠀violence,⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀hard-bitten⠀attitude.⠀Real⠀effort⠀and⠀pain⠀keep⠀their⠀actual⠀weight,⠀but⠀the⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀material⠀fact⠀and⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀expectation,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀the⠀world⠀uniformly⠀punishing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nUse⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scene,⠀with⠀its⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀made⠀clear.⠀Let⠀the⠀document's⠀own⠀register⠀carry⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀report's⠀official⠀phrasing,⠀a⠀letter's⠀careful⠀politeness,⠀a⠀journal's⠀private⠀shorthand.⠀Place⠀an⠀exact⠀phrase⠀or⠀notation⠀where⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀record's⠀broader⠀context⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀later⠀reply⠀becomes⠀readable.⠀The⠀comic⠀gap⠀may⠀be⠀simple⠀precision⠀rather⠀than⠀concealment:⠀the⠀writer⠀records⠀the⠀wrong⠀date,⠀the⠀recipient⠀answers⠀the⠀only⠀question⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀asked,⠀the⠀marginal⠀note⠀contradicts⠀the⠀formal⠀paragraph⠀above⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀writer's⠀register⠀and⠀needed⠀extent.⠀A⠀terse⠀letter⠀is⠀not⠀required,⠀and⠀a⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀its⠀actual⠀purpose⠀demands.⠀Keep⠀original⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀later⠀annotation,⠀and⠀keep⠀full⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀records.⠀No⠀second⠀record,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revelation⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀comedy⠀can⠀rest⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀timing⠀of⠀its⠀uptake.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nAttend⠀to⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀makes⠀care⠀particular:⠀a⠀known⠀or⠀expressed⠀preference,⠀a⠀chosen⠀accommodation,⠀an⠀available⠀pleasure.⠀Write⠀the⠀helper's⠀actual⠀approach⠀beside⠀that⠀detail.⠀The⠀friend⠀brings⠀the⠀wrong⠀tea⠀because⠀they⠀remembered⠀a⠀preference⠀from⠀years⠀ago;⠀the⠀colleague⠀reserves⠀the⠀quiet⠀desk⠀because⠀they⠀noticed⠀without⠀being⠀told;⠀the⠀sibling⠀sets⠀out⠀the⠀good⠀blanket⠀before⠀the⠀guest⠀arrives.⠀Let⠀the⠀interval⠀of⠀reception⠀carry⠀enjoyment,⠀familiar⠀recognition,⠀or⠀quiet⠀amusement.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀offered⠀particular⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀receiving⠀it,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀joke⠀at⠀anyone's⠀expense.\n\nKeep⠀real⠀preference⠀knowledge⠀and⠀independent⠀voices⠀intact.⠀The⠀recipient⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀care,⠀miss⠀it,⠀accept⠀it,⠀or⠀simply⠀enjoy⠀it⠀without⠀comment.⠀Help⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀secretly⠀planned,⠀accepted,⠀thanked,⠀or⠀transformative.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀can⠀be⠀long,⠀direct,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀contract.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀amusement⠀coexist⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀payoff,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀occasion's⠀permitted⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀context.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀frame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀distance:⠀the⠀room's⠀arrangement,⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀household,⠀the⠀public⠀expectation⠀that⠀has⠀gathered⠀around⠀this⠀meeting.⠀Within⠀that⠀ample⠀frame,⠀place⠀a⠀distilled⠀phrase⠀or⠀factual⠀detail⠀against⠀the⠀context.⠀The⠀formal⠀invitation⠀contains⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀service;⠀the⠀carefully⠀prepared⠀speech⠀turns⠀on⠀a⠀single⠀word⠀that⠀means⠀something⠀different⠀to⠀the⠀audience;⠀the⠀ceremonial⠀object⠀is⠀set⠀down⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀order.\n\nLet⠀the⠀surrounding⠀interval⠀and⠀subsequent⠀supported⠀attention⠀make⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀legible.⠀Gu's⠀precise⠀selection⠀need⠀not⠀fragment⠀the⠀formal⠀paragraph,⠀force⠀terse⠀speech,⠀change⠀the⠀reader's⠀expectation,⠀or⠀culminate⠀in⠀a⠀deflating⠀last⠀line.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀proportion⠀between⠀the⠀composed⠀context⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀particular⠀placed⠀within⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀all⠀authorized⠀explanation⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀occasion:⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀why⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀speaking⠀now,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀want⠀from⠀the⠀account.⠀Let⠀precise⠀selection⠀give⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀its⠀shape⠀while⠀the⠀teller⠀keeps⠀their⠀actual⠀register,⠀purposes,⠀and⠀needed⠀extent.⠀A⠀detail⠀can⠀matter⠀through⠀enjoyment,⠀a⠀private⠀association,⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀concern⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀the⠀listeners'⠀immediate⠀interests;⠀no⠀universally⠀terse⠀telling⠀is⠀required.⠀A⠀listener's⠀interruption,⠀glance,⠀question,⠀or⠀silence⠀can⠀create⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀inner⠀account;⠀the⠀interval⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀does⠀with⠀it⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀comic⠀construction.\n\nSelect⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀for⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀frame.⠀Its⠀recurrence⠀may⠀carry⠀changed⠀weight⠀or⠀familiar⠀recognition⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀return⠀or⠀visible⠀audience⠀effect⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀listener⠀taking⠀the⠀tale⠀more⠀literally⠀than⠀the⠀teller⠀intended,⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀blind⠀spot⠀about⠀which⠀detail⠀matters,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀audience⠀already⠀knowing⠀the⠀ending⠀and⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀reach⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀change⠀anyone's⠀opinion⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀practical⠀result.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀level's⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀omit⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀a⠀listener⠀can⠀notice⠀an⠀implication⠀the⠀teller⠀never⠀intended.⠀Private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀spoken⠀tale⠀moves⠀forward;⠀an⠀unsaid⠀reaction⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀telling⠀without⠀becoming⠀public⠀knowledge.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀within⠀ongoing⠀telling,⠀listening,⠀or⠀permitted⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀pause⠀or⠀conclusion.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀stop⠀inside⠀the⠀fiction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWork⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀developmental⠀realist⠀route.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀encounter⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀participant⠀holds⠀a⠀recognizable⠀expectation⠀about⠀belonging,⠀competence,⠀or⠀responsibility:⠀a⠀person⠀expects⠀to⠀be⠀included,⠀to⠀manage⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀to⠀be⠀taken⠀seriously.⠀Render⠀the⠀expectation⠀through⠀the⠀participant's⠀actual⠀preparation,⠀speech,⠀or⠀private⠀reasoning⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀theme