y⠀that⠀returns⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀angle,⠀or⠀a⠀perception⠀that⠀keeps⠀drawing⠀attention.⠀Comic⠀proportion⠀can⠀emerge⠀inside⠀the⠀mind:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀grand⠀claim⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀very⠀small⠀practical⠀fact,⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀duty⠀has⠀outlasted⠀the⠀situation⠀that⠀produced⠀it,⠀or⠀that⠀two⠀sincerely⠀held⠀beliefs⠀cannot⠀both⠀fit⠀the⠀same⠀afternoon.⠀The⠀recognition⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀the⠀claim,⠀produce⠀an⠀answer,⠀or⠀return⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀outward⠀action.\n\nUse⠀precise⠀declarative⠀placement⠀and⠀meaningful⠀intervals⠀to⠀shape⠀the⠀inward⠀movement⠀without⠀forbidding⠀actual⠀sustained⠀rumination,⠀fluent⠀argument,⠀or⠀expansive⠀feeling.⠀A⠀distilled⠀image⠀can⠀interrupt⠀or⠀focus⠀the⠀consideration.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀attributable;⠀any⠀broader⠀narrative⠀context⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀permissions⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀person's⠀knowledge⠀merely⠀by⠀being⠀rendered.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀full⠀extent⠀of⠀permitted⠀private⠀experience,⠀including⠀uncertainty⠀that⠀stays⠀unresolved.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀consideration,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀feeling⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀resting⠀point⠀or⠀conclusion.⠀Neither⠀a⠀pause⠀nor⠀a⠀still-unanswered⠀question⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaial::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀early-modern⠀comic/theatrical⠀telling⠀route⠀as⠀narrative⠀construction,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀script⠀format.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀actually⠀see⠀or⠀hear.⠀Then⠀select⠀one⠀exact⠀action,⠀entrance,⠀or⠀line⠀and⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀an⠀expectation⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀made⠀legible:⠀a⠀person⠀expects⠀a⠀particular⠀arrival,⠀a⠀particular⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀performance⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀role.\n\nLet⠀clear⠀access⠀and⠀placement⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀notice.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀action⠀coming⠀before⠀another⠀character⠀does;⠀the⠀reader⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀expose.⠀Use⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement⠀to⠀deliver⠀the⠀selected⠀particular,⠀then⠀hold⠀a⠀meaningful⠀gap⠀before⠀or⠀after⠀it.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀expected⠀fitting⠀act⠀arriving⠀exactly⠀as⠀anticipated,⠀from⠀the⠀interval⠀being⠀shorter⠀or⠀longer⠀than⠀the⠀participants⠀assumed,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀repeated⠀wording⠀whose⠀meaning⠀shifts⠀through⠀placement⠀alone.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀stock⠀fool,⠀obligatory⠀trick,⠀closed⠀gag,⠀new⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀terse⠀cast.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀prose⠀form⠀and⠀narrator⠀distance.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀borrow⠀theatrical⠀timing⠀without⠀becoming⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀or⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Actual⠀private⠀knowledge⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀exposes;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀more,⠀less,⠀or⠀differently⠀than⠀the⠀visible⠀exchange⠀suggests.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀before,⠀during,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀action,⠀line,⠀or⠀private⠀passage.⠀No⠀delivery⠀of⠀the⠀selected⠀detail,⠀in-world⠀pause,⠀or⠀still-pending⠀expectation⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀end⠀the⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀polyphonic⠀or⠀nonlinear⠀telling⠀route.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀account⠀or⠀moment⠀to⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀time:⠀a⠀character's⠀earlier⠀recollection,⠀a⠀later⠀report,⠀a⠀bystander's⠀version,⠀or⠀a⠀document's⠀record.⠀The⠀order⠀of⠀presentation⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀needs⠀of⠀the⠀comic⠀construction⠀rather⠀than⠀chronology,⠀but⠀each⠀segment⠀must⠀remain⠀legible⠀as⠀belonging⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀and⠀moment.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀recurring⠀concrete⠀particular:⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀a⠀repeated⠀errand.⠀Place⠀it⠀in⠀differently⠀situated⠀accounts⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀what⠀each⠀source⠀emphasizes.⠀One⠀account⠀may⠀treat⠀the⠀particular⠀as⠀trivial⠀while⠀another⠀treats⠀it⠀as⠀decisive;⠀one⠀may⠀remember⠀it⠀accurately⠀while⠀another's⠀emphasis⠀reveals⠀a⠀blind⠀spot;⠀two⠀compatible⠀accounts⠀may⠀simply⠀disagree⠀about⠀its⠀size.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀comparison⠀itself,⠀without⠀requiring⠀agreement,⠀a⠀liar,⠀a⠀new⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀convergence.\n\nUse⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement⠀and⠀meaningful⠀gaps⠀within⠀each⠀segment⠀so⠀the⠀polyphony⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀pile⠀of⠀competing⠀summaries.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀source⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀original⠀time⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀same⠀source⠀knows⠀later.⠀Full⠀authorized⠀minds⠀remain⠀available;⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀public⠀knowledge⠀merely⠀because⠀another⠀account⠀appears.⠀Keep⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀rules⠀intact;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀marvelous⠀reading.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀within⠀an⠀ongoing⠀account,⠀juxtaposition,⠀or⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀pause⠀or⠀conclusion.⠀No⠀completed⠀comparison⠀or⠀changed⠀weight⠀across⠀accounts⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaian::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀name⠀the⠀location,⠀the⠀participants,⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀aim⠀in⠀the⠀opening⠀lines.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀by⠀anchoring⠀each⠀new⠀position⠀to⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀practical⠀detail.⠀If⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀mechanism⠀is⠀unfamiliar,⠀introduce⠀it⠀through⠀actual⠀explanation,⠀preparation,⠀observation,⠀or⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀glossary⠀pause.⠀Orient⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀actual⠀positions⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀activity⠀within⠀narrator⠀access,⠀distinguishing⠀an⠀apparent⠀aim⠀from⠀a⠀privately⠀known⠀or⠀still-unknown⠀one;⠀clarity⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀disclosing⠀unavailable⠀motives.\n\nUse⠀flexible⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀to⠀locate⠀the⠀salient⠀action⠀or⠀phrase⠀beside⠀an⠀expectation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀expect⠀a⠀particular⠀answer,⠀a⠀particular⠀result,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀reaction;⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀or⠀reply⠀arrives⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement.⠀Let⠀a⠀meaningful⠀gap⠀follow⠀it,⠀with⠀the⠀gap⠀filled⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀response,⠀another⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀continuation,⠀or⠀the⠀simple⠀next⠀step⠀of⠀the⠀task.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀precise⠀response⠀arriving⠀exactly⠀as⠀expected,⠀from⠀the⠀expectation⠀being⠀met⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀proportion,⠀or⠀