t⠀prove⠀immediately⠀useful.⠀Render⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀actual⠀state⠀directly⠀where⠀permitted,⠀or⠀let⠀an⠀inference⠀arise⠀from⠀selected⠀context⠀where⠀appropriate;⠀neither⠀explicit⠀feeling⠀nor⠀private⠀recognition⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀concealed.⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀gaps⠀are⠀intervals⠀of⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀concealed⠀focal⠀knowledge;⠀the⠀reader⠀may⠀complete⠀the⠀connection,⠀but⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀awareness⠀remains⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.\n\nUse⠀brief⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀turn.⠀A⠀direct⠀clause⠀may⠀set⠀the⠀expectation,⠀and⠀another⠀may⠀show⠀its⠀particular⠀realization.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀clipped⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀witty⠀retort,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀deflation.⠀The⠀comic⠀relation⠀can⠀be⠀exact⠀and⠀quiet:⠀the⠀expectation⠀still⠀present,⠀the⠀actual⠀fact⠀still⠀itself,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀continuing⠀without⠀a⠀punchline.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaias::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nFollow⠀the⠀actual⠀activity⠀through⠀speech,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene's⠀ordinary⠀movement⠀establish⠀the⠀aim,⠀the⠀habit,⠀or⠀the⠀blind⠀spot⠀before⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀becomes⠀readable.⠀Avoid⠀redundant⠀gloss⠀on⠀the⠀joke⠀while⠀preserving⠀actual⠀explanation⠀or⠀private⠀recognition;⠀explanatory⠀prose⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fictional⠀pause.⠀The⠀telling⠀particular⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail,⠀a⠀direct⠀line,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀action⠀whose⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀aim⠀emerges⠀across⠀a⠀meaningful⠀interval.\n\nSelect⠀that⠀particular⠀with⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀exactness.⠀A⠀brief⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀moment⠀where⠀expectation⠀and⠀actuality⠀meet.⠀A⠀meaningful⠀interval⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀fit⠀or⠀surprise⠀recognizable⠀without⠀redundant⠀commentary,⠀while⠀any⠀actual⠀explicit⠀narrative⠀judgment⠀keeps⠀its⠀own⠀permissions⠀and⠀purpose.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀familiar⠀exactness,⠀an⠀anticlimax,⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀reversal,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀finished⠀revelation.⠀What⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀recognition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀mind⠀continuing⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀circumstances.⠀Needed⠀connective⠀explanation⠀and⠀independent⠀voices⠀remain⠀available.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀interval⠀cryptic,⠀every⠀sentence⠀short,⠀or⠀every⠀ending⠀a⠀turning⠀point.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀situation⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀the⠀aim⠀still⠀pursued,⠀and⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀present⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀and⠀recurrent⠀particulars⠀that⠀fulfill⠀the⠀supplied⠀bond's⠀specific⠀promise,⠀whether⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀another⠀established⠀relation.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀small⠀act⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people:⠀something⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀says,⠀something⠀they⠀both⠀recognize,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀reference⠀with⠀a⠀history⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀established⠀or⠀can⠀make⠀legible.\n\nPlace⠀that⠀familiar⠀particular⠀at⠀a⠀meaningful⠀interval⠀where⠀its⠀real⠀shared⠀or⠀private⠀significance⠀can⠀be⠀funny.⠀The⠀callback⠀may⠀confirm⠀an⠀old⠀joke,⠀expose⠀a⠀habit,⠀or⠀land⠀differently⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀has⠀changed⠀its⠀proportion.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀comedy.⠀The⠀humor⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀exact⠀recognition:⠀both⠀people⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀phrase⠀means,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀that⠀meaning⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀moment.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀selective⠀movement⠀within⠀the⠀relationship⠀scene.⠀A⠀brief⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀can⠀deliver⠀the⠀callback;⠀a⠀meaningful⠀gap⠀can⠀let⠀its⠀weight⠀settle⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀exchange.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀and⠀independent⠀motives⠀available.⠀Keep⠀private⠀language⠀attributable⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀participants⠀while⠀allowing⠀any⠀explanation⠀or⠀context⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀provide;⠀presentation⠀alone⠀grants⠀no⠀extra⠀shared⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀callback⠀still⠀echoing⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀unchanged,⠀without⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀repaired⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀promise.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrasing.⠀Establish⠀the⠀act⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀source⠀of⠀its⠀retelling:⠀who⠀did⠀it,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀and⠀which⠀features⠀the⠀teller⠀or⠀established⠀community⠀remembers.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀communal⠀familiarity⠀or⠀reputation⠀merely⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀retold⠀cadence.⠀Then⠀place⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀detail⠀beside⠀that⠀remembered⠀form.⠀The⠀precise⠀term⠀can⠀confirm⠀the⠀praise⠀while⠀making⠀its⠀proportion⠀funny:⠀a⠀smaller,⠀stranger,⠀or⠀more⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀term⠀may⠀alter⠀the⠀account's⠀proportion,⠀or⠀a⠀precisely⠀fitting⠀familiar⠀detail⠀may⠀make⠀an⠀accurate⠀telling⠀funny⠀without⠀diminishing⠀the⠀deed.\n\nKeep⠀reputation⠀attached⠀to⠀its⠀real⠀source.⠀The⠀original⠀person's⠀unspoken⠀effort,⠀pleasure,⠀or⠀private⠀awareness⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀communal⠀account.⠀Being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀or⠀bold⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀act⠀felt⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀automatic.⠀Let⠀a⠀brief⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀hold⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀retold⠀declaration⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion.⠀A⠀meaningful⠀gap⠀can⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀difference⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀mocking⠀either⠀side.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀mock⠀hero,⠀an⠀earned⠀epithet,⠀a⠀humiliating⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀legendary⠀verdict⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀within⠀ongoing⠀telling,⠀original⠀or⠀retrospective⠀private⠀experience,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀source's⠀real⠀knowledge⠀and⠀any⠀established⠀communal⠀account⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀new⠀legend,⠀dismissal,⠀or⠀continuing⠀public⠀telling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaiav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀inside⠀the⠀actual⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀arrangement⠀already⠀supplied.⠀Establish⠀who⠀has⠀time,⠀who⠀uses⠀a⠀space,⠀who⠀makes⠀a⠀request,⠀and⠀who⠀enjoys⠀a⠀routine⠀through⠀concrete⠀movement:⠀a⠀person⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀bag,⠀waits⠀for⠀the⠀kettle,⠀reads⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀on