            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == comedy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Comedy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 3 of 6. }}{{// Source group: recipes-comedy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPacakbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀continuous⠀social⠀occasion,⠀carrying⠀the⠀actual⠀people,⠀their⠀offered⠀courtesies,⠀and⠀their⠀current⠀practical⠀work⠀across⠀installments.⠀Recover⠀earlier⠀wording⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀new⠀reply⠀needs⠀it:⠀a⠀promised⠀bowl⠀that⠀returns,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀welcome⠀repeated⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances,⠀a⠀particular⠀family⠀estimate⠀that⠀now⠀meets⠀a⠀changed⠀arrangement.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀continuity.⠀A⠀courteous⠀phrase⠀can⠀recur⠀with⠀a⠀stable⠀meaning,⠀be⠀recognized⠀accurately,⠀or⠀gain⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀application;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀fresh⠀misunderstanding⠀for⠀a⠀joke.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀already⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀and⠀about⠀the⠀situation.\n\nGive⠀setup,⠀a⠀present⠀offer⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀reception⠀the⠀extent⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀ongoing⠀occasion⠀needs;⠀no⠀reception⠀is⠀owed⠀before⠀the⠀setup⠀can⠀remain⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept,⠀defer,⠀answer⠀literally,⠀or⠀continue⠀an⠀unrelated⠀task;⠀thought⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀remain⠀available⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀convention.⠀A⠀long⠀interval⠀may⠀contain⠀ordinary⠀labor,⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀shared⠀object.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀within⠀continuing⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀public⠀activity,⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀changed⠀relationship,⠀new⠀option,⠀or⠀closing⠀joke.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nGive⠀the⠀request,⠀admission,⠀withholding⠀or⠀offer⠀its⠀actual⠀personal⠀cost.⠀Where⠀shared⠀history,⠀reputation⠀or⠀public⠀obligation⠀bears⠀on⠀that⠀cost,⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀connection:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀find⠀it⠀difficult⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀skill⠀they⠀are⠀reputed⠀to⠀possess,⠀or⠀to⠀accept⠀help⠀from⠀someone⠀whose⠀goodwill⠀they⠀already⠀trust.⠀Duty⠀and⠀attachment⠀may⠀align;⠀no⠀prior⠀breach,⠀imagined⠀refusal⠀or⠀loyalty⠀test⠀is⠀needed.\n\nArrange⠀comic⠀timing⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀wording,⠀preparation⠀and⠀reception⠀of⠀the⠀exchange.⠀An⠀elaborate⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀owed⠀may⠀meet⠀a⠀plain,⠀helpful⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀response⠀may⠀arrive⠀exactly⠀when⠀both⠀people⠀expect⠀it.⠀Give⠀the⠀technique⠀or⠀practical⠀terms⠀enough⠀clarity⠀for⠀that⠀relation⠀to⠀be⠀recognizable.⠀The⠀joke⠀need⠀not⠀embarrass⠀anyone,⠀and⠀a⠀serious⠀or⠀unamused⠀response⠀remains⠀possible.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀permitted⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀including⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀extensive⠀reflection⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀that⠀changes⠀no⠀action.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀be⠀easy⠀or⠀awkward,⠀refusal⠀may⠀have⠀any⠀supported⠀reason,⠀and⠀reception⠀may⠀remain⠀pending.⠀Keep⠀the⠀encounter⠀spacious⠀enough⠀for⠀its⠀real⠀activity,⠀explanation⠀and⠀relationships,⠀following⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀speech,⠀thought⠀or⠀action⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀an⠀answer,⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀an⠀unsettled⠀bond.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀clear⠀location,⠀movement⠀and⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Keep⠀each⠀participant's⠀actual⠀aim⠀legible,⠀whether⠀they⠀seek⠀help,⠀pursue⠀an⠀obligation,⠀enjoy⠀company⠀or⠀attend⠀to⠀an⠀unrelated⠀concern.⠀A⠀known⠀method,⠀remembered⠀promise⠀or⠀public⠀reputation⠀can⠀establish⠀an⠀expectation;⠀show⠀whose⠀expectation⠀it⠀is⠀instead⠀of⠀treating⠀the⠀description⠀as⠀the⠀person's⠀motive⠀or⠀guaranteed⠀capacity.\n\nLet⠀the⠀current⠀use⠀of⠀that⠀method⠀or⠀promise⠀supply⠀comic⠀timing⠀where⠀the⠀sequence⠀supports⠀it.⠀A⠀solemn⠀undertaking⠀may⠀be⠀met⠀by⠀a⠀precise⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀familiar⠀competence⠀may⠀produce⠀an⠀exactly⠀anticipated,⠀enjoyable⠀result.⠀Give⠀execution⠀and⠀explanation⠀their⠀needed⠀space.⠀Help,⠀refusal,⠀failure,⠀success⠀and⠀pending⠀response⠀follow⠀actual⠀capacity,⠀willingness⠀and⠀events,⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀rescuer⠀or⠀reaction.\n\nKeep⠀NPCs⠀active⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀lives⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀player's⠀ownership⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀The⠀narrator⠀and⠀each⠀speaker⠀retain⠀their⠀supplied⠀voices⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Full⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀belongs⠀alongside⠀the⠀public⠀interval⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation,⠀including⠀thought⠀that⠀never⠀becomes⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀remark.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀actual⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀experience;⠀no⠀natural⠀pause,⠀completed⠀joke,⠀new⠀complication⠀or⠀question⠀to⠀the⠀player⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀to⠀situate⠀an⠀actual⠀encounter⠀within⠀an⠀ongoing⠀sequence⠀of⠀human⠀occasions.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀the⠀matter⠀that⠀brings⠀them⠀together⠀in⠀direct,⠀accessible⠀narration.⠀Give⠀travel,⠀work,⠀explanation⠀or⠀social⠀exchange⠀room⠀where⠀present,⠀without⠀reducing⠀a⠀consequential⠀event⠀to⠀a⠀domestic⠀errand⠀or⠀inventing⠀a⠀journey⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀form.\n\nWhere⠀a⠀prior⠀undertaking,⠀learned⠀method⠀or⠀designation⠀returns,⠀connect⠀its⠀known⠀history⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀use⠀made⠀of⠀it⠀now.⠀A⠀reputation⠀for⠀precision⠀may⠀become⠀comic⠀when⠀that⠀precision⠀answers⠀a⠀surprisingly⠀exact⠀request;⠀a⠀familiar⠀application⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀enjoyable⠀without⠀surprise.⠀Attribute⠀public⠀estimates⠀and⠀distinguish⠀them⠀from⠀actual⠀ability⠀and⠀private⠀motive.⠀The⠀telling⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀an⠀expansive⠀account⠀to⠀a⠀plain⠀detail,⠀making⠀the⠀comic⠀scale⠀legible⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀loss⠀of⠀dignity.\n\nLink⠀occasions⠀through⠀actual⠀continuing⠀people,⠀commitments⠀and⠀consequences.⠀A⠀recurrence⠀may⠀confirm⠀an⠀existing⠀relation⠀or⠀acquire⠀another⠀use,⠀but⠀every⠀episode⠀need⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀reputation,⠀complete⠀a⠀payoff⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀situation.⠀Preserve⠀real⠀competence,⠀error⠀and⠀character⠀mockery⠀where⠀established.⠀Keep⠀the⠀supplied⠀narrator,⠀community⠀and⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀arrive⠀within⠀an⠀ongoing⠀occasion⠀without⠀settlement,⠀relocation,⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀an⠀imported⠀martial⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀verbs,⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀method⠀and⠀physical⠀circumstances⠀readable.⠀Select⠀the⠀contact,⠀effort⠀or⠀material⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀task:⠀how⠀something⠀is⠀held,⠀how⠀a⠀practiced⠀movement⠀is⠀checked,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀operation⠀requires.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀real⠀forces⠀and⠀costs⠀without⠀adding⠀wear,⠀injury⠀or⠀equipment⠀failure⠀for⠀texture.\n\nPut⠀a⠀supported⠀reputation⠀or⠀expectation⠀beside⠀the⠀precise⠀work⠀it⠀meets.⠀A⠀method⠀learned⠀for⠀one⠀consequential⠀purpose⠀may⠀serve⠀a⠀modest⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀at⠀its⠀full⠀established⠀scale⠀may⠀fit⠀the⠀reputation⠀exactly.⠀Let⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀emphasize⠀that⠀relation:⠀an⠀accumulating⠀account⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀direct⠀action⠀clause,⠀while⠀a⠀deliberate⠀physical⠀sequence⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀familiar⠀success⠀funny.⠀Actual⠀failure,⠀restraint⠀or⠀an⠀efficient⠀solution⠀keeps⠀its⠀place;⠀no⠀unnecessary⠀elaboration⠀or⠀guaranteed⠀success⠀is⠀owed.\n\nGive⠀meaningful⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀their⠀actual⠀extent⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Bodily⠀tells⠀can⠀accompany⠀that⠀experience⠀when⠀they⠀occur,⠀but⠀cannot⠀replace⠀it⠀or⠀prove⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀Speakers⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀diction.⠀Shift⠀rhythm⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀real⠀attention⠀and⠀events,⠀and⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀work⠀or⠀inward⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀completion,⠀recognized⠀mismatch⠀or⠀a⠀loyalty⠀crisis.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCompose⠀the⠀sequence⠀using⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀forms⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀world:⠀letters,⠀reports,⠀inventories,⠀notices,⠀diary⠀entries,⠀or⠀annotations.⠀Each⠀document⠀is⠀an⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀limitations;⠀it⠀reflects⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀knows,⠀chooses⠀to⠀record,⠀or⠀believes⠀the⠀recipient⠀needs⠀to⠀read.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective;⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀adds⠀no⠀access,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀access⠀already⠀authorized.\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀comic⠀premise⠀across⠀documents.⠀A⠀reputation,⠀promise,⠀or⠀account⠀of⠀skill⠀appears⠀in⠀one⠀record—perhaps⠀a⠀recommendation,⠀a⠀memorial,⠀or⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀instructions.⠀A⠀later⠀record⠀takes⠀up⠀that⠀premise⠀in⠀a⠀practical⠀way:⠀a⠀recipient⠀asks⠀a⠀modest⠀favor⠀based⠀on⠀the⠀grand⠀description,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀answers⠀the⠀question⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀scale.⠀The⠀humor⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀exact⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀language⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀actions⠀of⠀the⠀second.⠀For⠀instance,⠀a⠀lofty⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀person's⠀ability⠀may⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀shopping⠀list,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀a⠀small⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀note⠀of⠀thanks⠀for⠀something⠀embarrassingly⠀simple.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀misunderstanding;⠀the⠀writers⠀may⠀understand⠀each⠀other⠀fully⠀and⠀still⠀produce⠀the⠀comic⠀contrast.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀boundaries⠀of⠀each⠀document.⠀Delivery⠀delays,⠀receipts,⠀editorial⠀notes,⠀or⠀later⠀annotations⠀can⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀when⠀they⠀matter.⠀A⠀later⠀hand⠀may⠀correct,⠀underline,⠀or⠀comment⠀on⠀an⠀earlier⠀record,⠀adding⠀another⠀comic⠀layer.⠀But⠀keep⠀knowledge⠀separate:⠀a⠀character's⠀response⠀follows⠀their⠀actual⠀access,⠀including⠀relevant⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀or⠀reports⠀rather⠀than⠀receipt⠀of⠀this⠀particular⠀document⠀alone,⠀and⠀private⠀live⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀letter.⠀Keep⠀all⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀presentation,⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀document⠀and⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀new⠀wrapper.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀composition,⠀delivery,⠀reception⠀or⠀continuing⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀meaningful⠀correspondence⠀break,⠀new⠀tone,⠀completed⠀exchange⠀or⠀rescue⠀debt⠀is⠀not⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nCenter⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀chosen⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation:⠀a⠀favorite⠀food,⠀a⠀repaired⠀object,⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference,⠀or⠀a⠀comfortable⠀routine.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters'⠀personalities⠀remain⠀intact—one⠀may⠀be⠀fussy,⠀another⠀matter-of-fact;⠀one⠀may⠀enjoy⠀the⠀fuss,⠀another⠀may⠀pretend⠀not⠀to.⠀Show⠀the⠀pleasure⠀of⠀the⠀act⠀itself,⠀not⠀just⠀its⠀outcome:⠀the⠀way⠀something⠀is⠀wrapped,⠀the⠀satisfaction⠀of⠀getting⠀a⠀small⠀detail⠀right.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀element⠀from⠀a⠀reputation⠀or⠀solemn⠀undertaking⠀that⠀is⠀set⠀beside⠀this⠀modest⠀care.⠀A⠀character⠀known⠀for⠀great⠀achievements⠀may⠀take⠀unusual⠀pains⠀over⠀a⠀trivial⠀preference,⠀or⠀a⠀formal⠀promise⠀may⠀be⠀fulfilled⠀through⠀an⠀unexpectedly⠀loving⠀small⠀gesture.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀an⠀affectionate⠀mismatch⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀exact⠀fit:⠀the⠀care⠀is⠀real,⠀the⠀recipient⠀may⠀be⠀surprised⠀or⠀quietly⠀pleased,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀needs⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀joke.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀mockery;⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀affectionate⠀teasing⠀or⠀sharper⠀response⠀in⠀its⠀supported⠀context.\n\nKeep⠀skill,⠀willingness,⠀and⠀permission⠀distinct.⠀Someone⠀may⠀offer⠀help⠀that⠀is⠀welcome⠀but⠀not⠀needed,⠀or⠀provide⠀a⠀specific⠀service⠀without⠀taking⠀over.⠀Let⠀recipients⠀contribute,⠀object,⠀or⠀add⠀their⠀own⠀preferences.⠀Preserve⠀privacy⠀and⠀disagreement,⠀with⠀full⠀meaningful⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀it⠀changes⠀conduct.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀everyone⠀agrees⠀or⠀that⠀established⠀problems⠀vanish.⠀If⠀there⠀is⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀warmth,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀sincere⠀but⠀not⠀obligatory—no⠀required⠀gratitude,⠀confession,⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀enjoyment⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀the⠀recipient⠀settling⠀in,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀return⠀of⠀care⠀beginning.⠀No⠀dependence⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀loyalty⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀actual⠀encounter⠀within⠀the⠀history⠀or⠀social⠀context⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Let⠀a⠀reputation,⠀obligation⠀or⠀alliance⠀gather⠀through⠀concrete⠀prior⠀decisions⠀and⠀attributed⠀accounts⠀where⠀relevant.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀others⠀expect⠀from⠀actual⠀skill,⠀willingn