achment,⠀including⠀supported⠀limitations⠀or⠀changes.⠀A⠀capable⠀person⠀may⠀do⠀exactly⠀what⠀is⠀asked⠀without⠀hesitation.⠀The⠀humor⠀need⠀not⠀mock⠀anyone;⠀it⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precision⠀with⠀which⠀a⠀practiced⠀helper⠀navigates⠀the⠀domestic⠀task,⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀loyalty⠀and⠀private⠀efficiency,⠀or⠀the⠀slight⠀mismatch⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀promised⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀needed.\n\nAvoid⠀assigning⠀a⠀permanent⠀rescuer⠀and⠀dependent.⠀Over⠀time,⠀roles⠀may⠀shift;⠀a⠀person⠀helped⠀today⠀may⠀help⠀tomorrow.⠀The⠀writing⠀should⠀preserve⠀each⠀person's⠀independence⠀and⠀reluctance⠀or⠀eagerness⠀as⠀their⠀own.⠀If⠀the⠀scene's⠀authority⠀contract⠀permits,⠀show⠀the⠀private⠀thoughts⠀behind⠀a⠀choice⠀to⠀help,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀help⠀itself⠀remain⠀outward⠀and⠀concrete.\n\nGround⠀dialogue⠀in⠀individual⠀voices.⠀Not⠀everyone⠀speaks⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀formality.⠀A⠀young⠀person⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀phrase⠀with⠀blunt⠀practical⠀language;⠀an⠀elder⠀may⠀use⠀proverbs;⠀a⠀tradesperson⠀may⠀say⠀almost⠀nothing.⠀These⠀differences⠀may⠀support⠀gentle⠀comedy;⠀any⠀meaning⠀of⠀respect⠀or⠀disrespect⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀and⠀usage,⠀not⠀the⠀speaker's⠀age⠀or⠀occupation⠀alone.\n\nUse⠀concrete⠀setting⠀and⠀objects⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀lived⠀arrangement,⠀including⠀practical⠀use,⠀atmosphere⠀or⠀personally⠀meaningful⠀attention.⠀A⠀crowded⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀shared⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀market⠀stall—show⠀the⠀physical⠀space⠀through⠀actions:⠀who⠀has⠀to⠀step⠀around⠀whom,⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀puts⠀a⠀load⠀down,⠀what⠀they⠀wipe⠀their⠀hands⠀on.⠀Such⠀movements⠀can⠀make⠀domestic⠀realism⠀tangible,⠀while⠀meaningful⠀description⠀or⠀private⠀attention⠀may⠀develop⠀without⠀serving⠀an⠀immediate⠀task.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience,⠀especially⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀in⠀public⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀feel⠀while⠀helping.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀agree⠀aloud⠀and⠀privately⠀wish⠀they⠀were⠀elsewhere;⠀another⠀may⠀say⠀nothing⠀while⠀actually⠀enjoying⠀the⠀work.⠀Interiority⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀visible⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀c