a⠀forced⠀laugh.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stakes⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀tone⠀is⠀comedic.⠀A⠀request⠀for⠀help,⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀injury,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀obligation⠀matters⠀to⠀these⠀people.⠀The⠀writing⠀should⠀not⠀dissolve⠀consequences⠀into⠀farce.⠀Comic⠀timing⠀can⠀exist⠀within⠀a⠀scene⠀that⠀also⠀contains⠀fear,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀anger.\n\nMake⠀dynamic⠀delivery⠀legible:⠀pacing,⠀pause,⠀and⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀speakers.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀and⠀sentence⠀length⠀to⠀shape⠀how⠀a⠀line⠀lands.⠀A⠀short,⠀plain⠀reply⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀formal⠀address⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀comic⠀beat.⠀A⠀character⠀beginning⠀to⠀speak,⠀then⠀not⠀speaking,⠀is⠀a⠀beat.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀guide⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀that⠀timing.\n\nRepresent⠀all⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀the⠀public⠀business—exasperation,⠀amusement,⠀worry,⠀tenderness—may⠀be⠀rendered⠀in⠀prose⠀without⠀being⠀announced.⠀It⠀remains⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀mind,⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀others⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀substitute⠀a⠀public⠀performance⠀for⠀required⠀interiority,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀a⠀character⠀access⠀to⠀another's⠀private⠀thoughts⠀merely⠀through⠀the⠀telling;⠀preserve⠀only⠀access⠀actually⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀active⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling⠀around⠀an⠀actual⠀deed,⠀undertaking⠀or⠀encounter.⠀Arrange⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀and⠀times⠀with⠀clear⠀source⠀markers:⠀a⠀participant's⠀experience,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀later⠀memory⠀or⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀authorized⠀account.⠀A⠀return⠀may⠀revisit⠀familiar⠀material,⠀confirm⠀another⠀account⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis;⠀novelty⠀is⠀not⠀owed⠀on⠀each⠀shift.\n\nMake⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀reputation,⠀particular⠀technique⠀and⠀the⠀act's⠀human⠀circumstances⠀visible⠀through⠀juxtaposition.⠀A⠀public⠀account⠀of⠀loyalty⠀may⠀stand⠀beside⠀a⠀participant's⠀precise⠀practical⠀concern,⠀and⠀both⠀may⠀be⠀accurate.⠀Their⠀scale⠀may⠀differ⠀or⠀fit⠀exactly.⠀Comic⠀timing⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀those⠀supported⠀positions⠀meet⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀liar,⠀hidden⠀motive⠀or⠀diminished⠀deed.⠀Where⠀accounts⠀disagree⠀in⠀fact,⠀interpretation⠀or⠀feeling,⠀keep⠀that⠀disagreement⠀attached⠀to⠀its⠀source⠀while⠀preserving⠀established⠀events.\n\nGive⠀actual⠀shared⠀history,⠀attachment⠀and⠀obligation⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀each⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀alliance.⠀Keep⠀original⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀later⠀interpretation⠀and⠀grant⠀nonspoken⠀access⠀only⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀perspective;⠀no⠀collective⠀mind⠀follows⠀from⠀a⠀chorus⠀of⠀reports.⠀Full⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀continue⠀within⠀or⠀alongside⠀the⠀account⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀any⠀segment,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀comparison,⠀natural⠀pause⠀or⠀advance⠀in⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀actual⠀situation⠀with⠀readable⠀orientation⠀to⠀people,⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀concern.⠀Make⠀spatial⠀changes⠀clear⠀as⠀they⠀occur,⠀and⠀introduce⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀method,⠀reputation⠀or⠀prior⠀promise⠀with⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀understand⠀its⠀use.⠀Explanation⠀can⠀come⠀through⠀speech,⠀narration⠀or⠀authorized⠀recollection⠀in⠀the⠀real⠀causal⠀order,⠀including⠀preparation⠀before⠀action;⠀neither⠀a⠀first-paragraph⠀inventory⠀nor⠀repeated⠀exposition⠀of⠀already⠀familiar⠀facts⠀is⠀required.\n\nUse⠀paragraph⠀rhythm⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀particular⠀expectation⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀reception⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀A⠀practiced⠀skill⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀surprisingly⠀exact⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀method⠀may⠀work⠀just⠀as⠀anticipated.⠀Give⠀execution⠀its⠀real⠀detail⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀mishap,⠀a⠀miniature⠀task,⠀a⠀masterful⠀result⠀or⠀universal⠀quips.⠀Characters⠀keep⠀their⠀actual⠀registers,⠀capacities⠀and⠀reasons,⠀and⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀retains⠀its⠀existing⠀powers⠀and⠀limits.\n\nLet⠀generous⠀scene⠀movement⠀include⠀activity,⠀explanation,⠀relationships⠀and⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience.⠀An⠀inward⠀passage⠀or⠀remembered⠀obligation⠀may⠀develop⠀extensively⠀without⠀producing⠀a⠀visible⠀change,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀keeps⠀the⠀authorized⠀person⠀and⠀access.⠀Paragraph⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀measure⠀fictional⠀elapsed⠀time.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀continuation⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀setup-response-reaction⠀cycle,⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀a⠀completed⠀laugh⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀must⠀remain⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene's⠀rhythm⠀and⠀imagery⠀carry⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀a⠀known⠀method,⠀promise,⠀or⠀shared⠀history⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀gesture⠀now⠀before⠀the⠀viewpoint.⠀A⠀recurring⠀sound⠀or⠀image⠀may⠀gather⠀weight⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph:⠀the⠀same⠀word⠀that⠀once⠀belonged⠀to⠀a⠀solemn⠀undertaking⠀can⠀return⠀beside⠀a⠀modest⠀errand,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀can⠀let⠀that⠀juxtaposition⠀register⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Build⠀the⠀comic⠀scale⠀through⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀sentence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀punchline⠀that⠀must⠀follow⠀the⠀image.⠀A⠀plain⠀statement⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀may⠀meet⠀the⠀shaped⠀expectation⠀and⠀confirm⠀it⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀qualify⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀hears⠀an⠀old⠀phrase⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀someone's⠀current⠀speech,⠀let⠀the⠀association⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀narrator's⠀memory⠀and⠀permission;⠀another⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀genuine⠀feeling,⠀actual⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀individual⠀cast⠀speech.⠀The⠀lyrical⠀treatment⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀fail,⠀the⠀loyalty⠀to⠀be⠀mocked,⠀or⠀the⠀private⠀attachment⠀to⠀become⠀public.⠀Nonspoken⠀experience⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀comparison⠀or⠀public⠀payoff.\n\nGive⠀the⠀encounter⠀enough⠀scenic⠀movement⠀for⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀to⠀remain⠀legible:⠀who⠀is⠀attempting⠀what,⠀what⠀method⠀or⠀obligation⠀is⠀in⠀play,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀relates⠀to⠀the⠀known⠀history.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀motion⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀name⠀rather⠀than⠀narrating⠀every⠀step.⠀Let⠀the⠀comic⠀disproportion⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀shaped⠀expectation⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀act,⠀whether⠀that⠀act⠀is⠀deft,⠀clumsy,⠀affectionate,⠀or⠀merely⠀practical.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀underway,⠀leaving⠀the⠀association⠀available⠀without⠀forcing⠀it⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀laugh.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀recall⠀a⠀particular⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀through⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀tool,⠀the⠀cadence⠀of⠀a⠀phrase,⠀the⠀route⠀once⠀taken⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances.⠀Source⠀the⠀memory⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀character⠀and⠀represent⠀its⠀retained⠀detail⠀and⠀limitations⠀faithfully,⠀including⠀any⠀supported⠀error⠀without⠀rewriting⠀the⠀original⠀event.⠀The⠀same⠀skill⠀may⠀now⠀serve⠀an⠀unexpectedly⠀modest⠀concern,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀act⠀may⠀remain⠀enjoyably⠀apt,⠀and⠀the⠀comic⠀effect⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀that⠀exact⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀undertaking⠀once⠀meant⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀requires.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀loss,⠀obsolete⠀competence,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀on⠀impermanence⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀callback⠀land.\n\nPreserve⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀actually⠀changed.⠀A⠀remembered⠀attachment⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀private⠀feeling⠀while⠀the⠀outward⠀business⠀proceeds;⠀the⠀reflection⠀may⠀be⠀direct⠀and⠀extensive⠀without⠀changing⠀conduct⠀or⠀ending⠀in⠀a⠀joke.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀shape⠀the⠀reflection⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀treatment⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀conclude⠀by⠀announcing⠀that⠀everything⠀is⠀passing⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀loyalty⠀has⠀decayed.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable.\n\nGive⠀the⠀encounter⠀room⠀for⠀its⠀actual⠀activity,⠀explanation⠀and⠀relationships,⠀including⠀travel⠀where⠀present.⠀The⠀reflective⠀movement⠀may⠀pause⠀the⠀practical⠀action,⠀but⠀the⠀practical⠀action⠀remains⠀consequential:⠀a⠀promise,⠀technique,⠀or⠀public⠀obligation⠀still⠀has⠀its⠀particular⠀demands.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀and⠀remembered⠀expectation⠀for⠀comic⠀recognition⠀at⠀their⠀actual⠀scales,⠀allowing⠀a⠀familiar⠀exact⠀fit⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀difference;⠀private⠀feeling⠀can⠀coexist⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀recognition.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀business⠀still⠀underway,⠀the⠀attachment⠀unspoken,⠀or⠀the⠀familiar⠀method⠀once⠀again⠀in⠀use,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀statement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacalaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀modern⠀memoir:⠀a⠀situated⠀later⠀account⠀by⠀an⠀actual⠀source⠀who⠀remembers⠀the⠀event,⠀with⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀kept⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀action.⠀Let⠀the⠀memoirist's⠀purpose⠀and⠀position⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀recalled,⠀emphasized,⠀or⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀background.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator⠀remains⠀the⠀one⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀scene;⠀the⠀memoir⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds⠀or⠀replace⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀with⠀a⠀retrospective⠀summary.\n\nLet⠀a⠀remembered⠀undertaking⠀gather⠀context⠀before⠀an⠀exact⠀practical⠀detail⠀reveals⠀its⠀comic⠀scale.⠀The⠀memoirist⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀public⠀reputation,⠀the⠀solemn⠀promise,⠀or⠀the⠀impressive⠀method⠀as⠀it⠀appeared⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀then⠀record⠀a⠀particular⠀gesture,⠀object⠀or⠀exchange⠀at⠀its⠀actual⠀scale,⠀whether⠀it⠀confirms⠀the⠀account⠀or⠀supplies⠀another⠀comic⠀proportion.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀earlier⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀belated⠀wisdom.⠀The⠀memoirist⠀may⠀now⠀see⠀the⠀comedy⠀more⠀clearly⠀than⠀the⠀participants⠀did,⠀but⠀the⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀must⠀remain⠀what⠀it⠀was.\n\nKeep⠀reputation⠀and⠀private⠀motive⠀able⠀to⠀agree.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀was⠀as⠀skilled⠀or⠀loyal⠀as⠀the⠀reputation⠀claimed,⠀and⠀that⠀the⠀comic⠀disproportion⠀lay⠀in⠀the⠀occasion,⠀the⠀expectation,⠀or⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀use⠀of⠀that⠀skill.⠀No⠀exile,⠀confession,⠀or⠀moral⠀correction⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀memoir's⠀retrospective⠀voice⠀may⠀be⠀reflective,⠀satirical,⠀or⠀plain,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀the⠀voice⠀of⠀its⠀actual⠀author.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀recollection,⠀