Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀actually⠀be⠀staged.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀around⠀an⠀attractive⠀object:⠀how⠀people⠀set⠀it⠀down,⠀protect⠀it,⠀admire⠀it,⠀pass⠀it,⠀or⠀work⠀around⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀space.\n\nLet⠀the⠀object's⠀sensory⠀qualities⠀appear⠀through⠀playable⠀business⠀rather⠀than⠀camera⠀directions.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀test⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bowl,⠀smooth⠀a⠀cloth,⠀hold⠀a⠀bottle⠀up⠀to⠀the⠀light,⠀or⠀move⠀a⠀chair⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀display⠀in⠀view.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀should⠀record⠀what⠀an⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀actors⠀can⠀do,⠀not⠀what⠀a⠀camera⠀would⠀frame.⠀The⠀valued⠀surface⠀becomes⠀comic⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀handling:⠀one⠀person⠀treats⠀the⠀object⠀as⠀precious,⠀another⠀stacks⠀papers⠀on⠀it,⠀another⠀carries⠀it⠀with⠀practiced⠀efficiency.⠀Accurate⠀coordination⠀is⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀a⠀mishap⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀people⠀and⠀circumstances;⠀the⠀humor⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀attention⠀the⠀object⠀receives.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀in⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀voice⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀business.⠀A⠀line⠀about⠀the⠀object's⠀beauty⠀or⠀its⠀remembered⠀origin⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction⠀about⠀where⠀it⠀should⠀go⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀while⠀someone⠀wipes⠀a⠀mark⠀from⠀it.⠀The⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀hands⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀witty⠀or⠀turn⠀the⠀object⠀into⠀a⠀prop⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀dropped⠀or⠀broken⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀laugh.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀performed⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀a⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀sensation.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀attachment,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀divided⠀desire,⠀write⠀that⠀interiority⠀in⠀its⠀proper⠀channel⠀rather⠀than⠀disguising⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀even⠀during⠀speech,⠀handling,⠀or⠀thought,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀result⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀beat⠀that⠀resolves⠀the⠀atta