ontinuing⠀attention,⠀a⠀half-formed⠀association,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀present⠀action⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀realization,⠀altered⠀feeling,⠀or⠀closing⠀joke.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀actually⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀writer⠀puts⠀into⠀a⠀message⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀actually⠀takes⠀up⠀in⠀reply.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀texture,⠀a⠀color,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀at⠀length;⠀another⠀may⠀answer⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀buried⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀message,⠀or⠀recognize⠀the⠀sensory⠀detail⠀exactly,⠀or⠀ask⠀about⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀None⠀of⠀these⠀responses⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀misreading.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀composed⠀message's⠀weight⠀and⠀the⠀reply's⠀actual⠀focus,⠀not⠀in⠀proving⠀one⠀person⠀shallow⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀excessive.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀status⠀of⠀every⠀text⠀clear.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀composed⠀message⠀from⠀a⠀sent⠀one,⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀a⠀received⠀one,⠀and⠀a⠀received⠀message⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀actually⠀understands.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Describe⠀an⠀attachment⠀only⠀as⠀description⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀actually⠀contains⠀a⠀sent⠀file;⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀image⠀or⠀receipt⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Select⠀actual⠀delays,⠀edits⠀or⠀receipts⠀where⠀they⠀contribute⠀to⠀the⠀exchange,⠀its⠀timing⠀or⠀the⠀person's⠀attention;⠀they⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀knowledge⠀or⠀available⠀action.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀sensation⠀and⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀channel,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀A⠀character's⠀jealousy,⠀pleasure,⠀or⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀an⠀ongoing⠀exchange,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀or⠀a⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀response,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀reply,⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀joke.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaoba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀with⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Choose⠀a⠀background,⠀object,⠀or⠀expression⠀reference⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀and⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀anchor⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀between⠀an⠀item's⠀felt⠀value⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀reception.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cue⠀be⠀purposeful⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative.⠀A⠀chipped⠀glaze,⠀a⠀too-bright⠀display,⠀a⠀hand⠀hovering⠀near⠀a⠀dish,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀doorway⠀can⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀valued⠀surface⠀an⠀exact⠀ordinary⠀scale.⠀The⠀focal⠀prose⠀should⠀register⠀the⠀cue⠀through⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀actual⠀attention:⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀any⠀actual⠀association,⠀and⠀any⠀action⠀they⠀actually⠀take⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀next⠀move⠀being⠀owed.⠀Accurate⠀pleasure⠀and⠀continued⠀attention⠀are⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀discrepancy.⠀The⠀cue⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀hidden⠀feeling⠀or⠀certify⠀desire.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀rhythm⠀flexible.⠀A⠀cue⠀may⠀open⠀the⠀scene,⠀return⠀during⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀background⠀while⠀the⠀exchange⠀moves⠀forward.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀fixed⠀cycle⠀of⠀cue,⠀thought,⠀and⠀reply.⠀Let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀remain⠀in⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀voice,⠀with⠀one⠀character's⠀attachment⠀to⠀the⠀object⠀sitting⠀beside⠀another's⠀practical⠀or⠀indifferent⠀response.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀coexistence,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀reaction⠀portrait⠀that⠀tells⠀the⠀reader⠀what⠀to⠀conclude.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀order⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀channel.⠀A⠀character's⠀memory,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀sensory⠀pleasure⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀interiority,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀expression⠀label⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀generated⠀images⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀of⠀this⠀style;⠀separately⠀supplied⠀authorship⠀and⠀feature⠀permissions⠀remain⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀dialogue,⠀focal⠀attention,⠀or⠀private⠀thought⠀without⠀a⠀final⠀reaction⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀payoff.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaobb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀installment⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀A⠀continuing⠀sensory⠀attachment⠀can⠀give⠀returning⠀objects⠀and⠀places⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀resetting⠀their⠀established⠀significance.\n\nRecover⠀actual⠀prior⠀context⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀ongoing⠀occasion.⠀If⠀a⠀valued⠀item⠀or⠀remembered⠀place⠀returns,⠀bring⠀back⠀the⠀specific⠀detail⠀that⠀matters⠀now:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀bowl,⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀light⠀fell⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀last⠀person⠀who⠀handled⠀the⠀object.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀merely⠀as⠀automatic⠀recap;⠀an⠀actual⠀recollection⠀or⠀account⠀can⠀still⠀take⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀including⠀a⠀complete⠀telling⠀when⠀authorized.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀participants⠀already⠀know;⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀rediscover⠀the⠀object's⠀importance⠀or⠀rehearse⠀its⠀origin⠀for⠀the⠀reader.\n\nLet⠀the⠀return⠀produce⠀a⠀precise⠀practical⠀use,⠀an⠀unchanged⠀affection,⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀scale.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀object⠀being⠀treated⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀care⠀in⠀a⠀situation⠀that⠀now⠀makes⠀that⠀care⠀disproportionate,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀attachment⠀persisting⠀without⠀drama⠀while⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues⠀around⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fresh⠀jealous⠀doubt⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀complication⠀each⠀time⠀the⠀object⠀appears.⠀Setup,⠀handling,⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀span⠀replies,⠀with⠀the⠀current⠀installment⠀carrying⠀only⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀boundary⠀natural⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀scene.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀ordinary⠀activity,⠀a⠀partially⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀continuing⠀private⠀thought⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀result,⠀an⠀altered⠀bond,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀joke.⠀The⠀through-line⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue⠀because⠀the⠀attachment,⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀priorities⠀are⠀still⠀present,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀installment⠀has⠀manufactured⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀specific⠀request⠀or⠀withheld⠀need⠀that⠀already⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀Give⠀the⠀need⠀its⠀actual⠀context⠀in⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀prose:⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀a⠀belief⠀about⠀reasonable⠀conduct⠀or⠀the⠀exact⠀present⠀wording⠀may⠀explain⠀its⠀cost⠀where⠀supported,⠀without⠀requiring⠀all⠀three⠀or⠀inventing⠀a⠀prior⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀the⠀need⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀confession⠀of⠀pain.\n\nWhen⠀another⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀habit⠀invokes⠀what⠀is⠀usual,⠀proper,⠀or⠀considerate,⠀place⠀that⠀accepted⠀explanation⠀beside⠀the⠀actual⠀request.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀literal⠀answer⠀that⠀satisfies⠀the⠀stated⠀rule⠀while⠀missing⠀the⠀need,⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀understanding⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀easily,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀supported⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀character's⠀careful⠀phrasing⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀actually⠀hears.⠀Keep⠀any⠀fit⠀or⠀discrepancy⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀every⠀reply⠀into⠀a⠀quip.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀private⠀feeling⠀in⠀plain⠀language.⠀Direct⠀pain,⠀embarrassment,⠀relief,⠀or⠀resentment⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀act⠀differently⠀or⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀repair.⠀A⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward⠀comfort⠀may⠀follow,⠀or⠀the⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀shame,⠀cowardice,⠀failed⠀care,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀bond⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀tone.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀character⠀ownership,⠀and⠀world⠀facts;⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀shapes⠀the⠀comedy⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀humiliating⠀answer⠀or⠀a⠀tragic⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀clear⠀spatial⠀movement.⠀Let⠀each⠀participant⠀pursue⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀habits.⠀When⠀someone⠀invokes⠀what⠀is⠀usual,⠀proper,⠀or⠀expected,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀use⠀that⠀follows⠀in⠀the⠀exchange:⠀an⠀exact⠀cooperation,⠀a⠀familiar⠀repetition,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀application⠀of⠀the⠀rule⠀that⠀fits⠀one⠀person's⠀aim⠀better⠀than⠀another's.⠀Use⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀accepted⠀explanation⠀and⠀actual⠀conduct⠀for⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀revealed⠀hypocrite⠀or⠀a⠀punchline;⠀any⠀real⠀discovery⠀keeps⠀its⠀supported⠀place.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀NPC's⠀aim⠀and⠀understanding⠀independent.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀usual⠀explanation⠀sincerely⠀while⠀another⠀applies⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀need;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀fit⠀without⠀every⠀character⠀sharing⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀player⠀ownership,⠀and⠀the⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀actual⠀fictional⠀interiority,⠀not⠀a⠀hidden⠀note⠀to⠀the⠀player.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀within⠀continuing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀life.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀completed⠀comic⠀response,⠀or⠀changed⠀plan⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀reply.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request⠀can⠀remain⠀open⠀without⠀stalling⠀supported⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Choose⠀a⠀situated⠀arrangement⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀community:⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀fairness,⠀courtesy,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀or⠀proper⠀conduct⠀that⠀people⠀can⠀state⠀in⠀plain⠀terms.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀observe⠀the⠀particular⠀terms⠀by⠀which⠀that⠀arrangement⠀actually⠀operates.⠀Show⠀who⠀performs⠀which⠀part⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal,⠀including⠀what⠀the⠀stated⠀rule⠀covers⠀or⠀actually⠀leaves⠀open.⠀Clean⠀observation⠀and⠀attributable⠀speech⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀available⠀for⠀comic⠀recognition⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀exposure⠀or⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀recognition⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀accepted⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀operation.⠀The⠀fit⠀may⠀be⠀exact⠀and⠀still⠀funny,⠀as⠀when⠀a⠀courtesy⠀is⠀performed⠀with⠀perfect⠀form⠀and⠀no⠀practical⠀effect.⠀Or⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀may⠀be⠀real,⠀as⠀when⠀a⠀fair⠀procedure⠀distributes⠀work⠀or⠀blame⠀unevenly⠀while⠀everyone⠀continues⠀to⠀call⠀it⠀fair.⠀Let⠀agreement⠀and⠀disagreement⠀both⠀remain⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀exploitation,⠀a⠀public⠀unmasking,⠀or⠀a⠀collective⠀verdict.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀help,⠀motives,⠀and⠀costs.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀cooperate⠀sincerely,⠀benefit⠀from⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀suffer⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀fixed⠀type.⠀Use⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀already⠀supplied⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀regional⠀scenery.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀available;⠀the⠀social⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀private⠀experience.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀contact,⠀effort,⠀or⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀concrete.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀an⠀accepted⠀account⠀calls⠀something⠀simple,⠀dignified,⠀routine,⠀or⠀well⠀managed,⠀place⠀that⠀claim⠀against⠀the⠀exact⠀operation⠀it⠀describes.⠀The⠀comic⠀force⠀comes⠀from⠀rhythm⠀and⠀scale:⠀a⠀short⠀claim⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀particular⠀weight,⠀sequence,⠀or⠀resistance⠀of⠀the⠀real⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀official⠀phrase⠀meeting⠀one⠀plain⠀material⠀fact.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fit⠀or⠀discrepancy⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀operation⠀itself.⠀The⠀work⠀may⠀be⠀exactly⠀as⠀routine⠀as⠀claimed⠀and⠀still⠀comic⠀through⠀the⠀precision⠀of⠀the⠀detail.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀competent,⠀tired,⠀amused,⠀or⠀indifferent.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀wear,⠀failure,⠀or⠀injury⠀for⠀texture,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀physical⠀detail⠀into⠀a⠀symbol⠀of⠀social⠀damage.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience.⠀A⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀resentment,⠀or⠀private⠀recognition⠀may⠀be⠀developed⠀in⠀clean⠀language⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀clipped⠀emotional⠀label⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀tell.⠀Vary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀when⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀needed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀character⠀ownership;⠀the⠀compressed⠀style⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀the⠀stakes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nUse⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀report,⠀journal⠀entry,⠀notice,⠀annotation,⠀or⠀other⠀record⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Let⠀each⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀concealment⠀follow⠀its⠀author's⠀situation.⠀When⠀a⠀document⠀uses⠀an⠀ordinary⠀formulation⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀proper,⠀fair,⠀or⠀expected,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀what⠀another⠀record⠀or⠀annotation⠀really⠀takes⠀up.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀accurate⠀compliance,⠀an⠀apt⠀literal⠀application,⠀or⠀a⠀courteous⠀form⠀that⠀performs⠀one⠀practical⠀job⠀while⠀another⠀record⠀shows⠀the⠀actual⠀result.\n\nArrange⠀the⠀sequence⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀records⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀one.⠀Gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀may⠀reveal⠀events,⠀but⠀keep⠀original⠀text⠀and⠀actual⠀prior⠀access⠀distinct.⠀A⠀later⠀annotation⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀writer⠀knew.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀contradictory⠀file,⠀hidden⠀conspiracy,⠀or⠀correspondence⠀endpoint⠀to⠀supply⠀the⠀comic⠀turn.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀full⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀artifacts.⠀A⠀document⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀records,⠀not⠀the⠀complete⠀mind⠀of⠀the⠀writer.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀remains⠀actual⠀fictional⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀documents.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀composition,⠀circulation,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀correspondence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀exact⠀care⠀and⠀pleasure⠀people⠀choose⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀situation.⠀Show⠀the⠀particular⠀preference,⠀the⠀actual⠀attempt⠀to⠀serve⠀it⠀and⠀its⠀reception,⠀including⠀ease⠀or⠀small⠀enjoyment⠀where⠀it⠀occurs;⠀appreciation⠀and⠀success⠀are⠀not⠀guaranteed.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀observe⠀these⠀details⠀in⠀clean,⠀plain⠀language⠀without⠀declaring⠀everyone⠀good⠀or⠀foolish.⠀Affection⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀solemn⠀rule⠀of⠀hospitality,⠀a⠀modest⠀habit,⠀or⠀an⠀accepted⠀social⠀expectation⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀a⠀person's⠀actual⠀preference.⠀The⠀comic⠀relation⠀can⠀be⠀apt,⠀as⠀when⠀a⠀formal⠀courtesy⠀happens⠀to⠀deliver⠀exactly⠀the⠀comfort⠀someone⠀wanted,⠀or⠀surprising,⠀as⠀when⠀a⠀well-meant⠀custom⠀meets⠀a⠀preference⠀its⠀performer⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate.⠀Let⠀the⠀fit⠀or⠀mismatch⠀remain⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀the⠀institution.\n\nPreserve⠀disagreement,⠀sincerity,⠀unappreciated⠀effort,⠀and⠀developed⠀private⠀feeling⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀story⠀permits.⠀Comfort⠀needs⠀no⠀gratitude,⠀repair,⠀or⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀institution⠀is⠀secretly⠀benevolent.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀enjoy⠀the⠀care⠀and⠀still⠀hold⠀a⠀private⠀reservation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀character⠀ownership⠀intact;⠀the⠀warm⠀treatment⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀or⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀frame⠀a⠀situated⠀convention⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀available⠀history⠀and⠀judgment.⠀Establish⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀community⠀accepts⠀as⠀proper,⠀fair,⠀or⠀ordinary,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀that⠀accepted⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀concrete⠀conduct⠀it⠀describes.⠀Keep⠀claims⠀distinct⠀from⠀facts:⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀the⠀arrangement⠀means,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀shows⠀remain⠀separable.\n\nRelate⠀the⠀convention⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀act⠀or⠀authorized⠀private⠀association.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀a⠀broad⠀social⠀phrase⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀small⠀operation⠀it⠀names,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀composed⠀account⠀continues⠀smoothly⠀while⠀the⠀conduct⠀beneath⠀it⠀resists⠀the⠀account.⠀Plain⠀wording⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀formal⠀arc;⠀cast⠀speech⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀ceremonial,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀judgment⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀verdict.\n\nAllow⠀historical⠀or⠀inward⠀development⠀to⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀convention,⠀miss⠀another⠀part,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀resolve.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀outward⠀return,⠀a⠀concluding⠀social⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀understanding.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀character⠀ownership,⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀interiority;⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀the⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀by⠀establishing⠀the⠀present⠀telling⠀as⠀an⠀event:⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀or⠀social⠀purpose⠀the⠀account⠀serves⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀choose⠀and⠀arrange⠀material⠀from⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀need⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀comedy.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀may⠀secure⠀attention,⠀justify⠀a⠀request,⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀simply⠀fill⠀an⠀expected⠀interval;⠀its⠀selection⠀can⠀suggest⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀treats⠀as⠀normal,⠀but⠀that⠀inference⠀remains⠀subject⠀to⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀context,⠀including⠀critical⠀or⠀strategic⠀selection.\n\nCompose⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀register,⠀using⠀clean⠀surrounding⠀narration⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀selection⠀and⠀its⠀ordinary⠀assumptions⠀legible.⠀Let⠀an⠀accepted⠀phrase⠀for⠀duty,⠀respect,⠀economy,⠀or⠀good⠀management⠀meet⠀the⠀particular⠀act⠀it⠀names.⠀The⠀comedy⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀conventional⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀lived⠀detail:⠀a⠀ceremony⠀described⠀as⠀proper⠀while⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀is⠀cramped,⠀a⠀favor⠀described⠀as⠀generous⠀while⠀the⠀recipient's⠀need⠀is⠀smaller⠀or⠀different,⠀a⠀rule⠀described⠀as⠀fair⠀while⠀its⠀application⠀follows⠀a⠀personal⠀habit.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀redundant⠀announcement⠀of⠀discrepancy⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀actual⠀remark⠀or⠀private⠀recognition.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀response,⠀whether⠀amusement,⠀agreement,⠀confusion⠀or⠀polite⠀inattention,⠀occur⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀actual⠀events.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct.⠀The⠀teller⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀may⠀add⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since,⠀but⠀a⠀listener's⠀inference⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀private⠀experience,⠀render⠀the⠀teller's⠀or⠀listener's⠀live⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀without⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀performed⠀aside⠀for⠀the⠀audience.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀return⠀across⠀the⠀telling,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀connect⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀to⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀true.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀The⠀audience⠀need⠀not⠀interrupt,⠀the⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀complete,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀need⠀be⠀persuaded⠀or⠀exposed.⠀The⠀continuation⠀may⠀simply⠀be⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀of⠀the⠀telling,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀outer⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀a⠀modernist⠀and⠀absurdist⠀construction.⠀Begin⠀with⠀an⠀actual⠀rule,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀habitual⠀procedure⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀world:⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀serving,⠀accounting,⠀greeting,⠀working,⠀or⠀settling⠀a⠀small⠀matter.⠀Follow⠀the⠀procedure⠀through⠀its⠀concrete⠀local⠀steps⠀in⠀plain,⠀legible⠀syntax.⠀Give⠀each⠀step⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀attitude,⠀whether⠀routine,⠀serious,⠀alarmed⠀or⠀otherwise⠀supported;⠀make⠀the⠀sequence⠀itself⠀carry⠀comic⠀weight⠀without⠀prescribing⠀how⠀they⠀must⠀feel⠀about⠀it.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀accept⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀establishes⠀as⠀fact.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀call⠀a⠀step⠀necessary,⠀proper,⠀or⠀efficient⠀while⠀the⠀narrated⠀action⠀shows⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀merely⠀customary,⠀or⠀the⠀step⠀may⠀work⠀exactly⠀as⠀intended⠀and⠀still⠀produce⠀a⠀disproportionate⠀result.⠀The⠀comedy⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀between⠀the⠀procedure's⠀stated⠀purpose⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀use⠀or⠀reception:⠀a⠀form⠀completed⠀with⠀care⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀decision⠀already⠀made,⠀a⠀precaution⠀observed⠀to⠀protect⠀an⠀object⠀no⠀one⠀needs,⠀a⠀polite⠀formula⠀delivered⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀scale.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀impossible⠀rule,⠀a⠀sudden⠀obstruction,⠀or⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀setting⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀absurdity;⠀the⠀procedure⠀must⠀be⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.\n\nKeep⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀steady⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀sequence⠀to⠀remain⠀legible.⠀A⠀longer⠀sentence⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀step's⠀full⠀course;⠀a⠀short⠀clause⠀may⠀mark⠀its⠀completion.⠀Let⠀clean⠀observation⠀make⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀operation⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act,⠀allowing⠀actual⠀confirmation⠀or⠀criticism⠀without⠀requiring⠀exposure,⠀an⠀explanatory⠀verdict⠀or⠀a⠀concluding⠀moral.⠀Private⠀experience,⠀where⠀authorized,⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀participant's⠀genuine⠀reasoning⠀or⠀discomfort⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀critic⠀of⠀the⠀procedure.\n\nThe⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀procedure⠀is⠀still⠀underway.⠀No⠀one⠀must⠀refuse,⠀fail,⠀or⠀recognize⠀the⠀absurdity⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nGive⠀the⠀actual⠀place⠀and⠀its⠀authority⠀material⠀presence⠀before⠀and⠀during⠀the⠀comic⠀turn.⠀Describe⠀the⠀actual⠀room,⠀object,⠀custom⠀or⠀title⠀through⠀its⠀particular⠀place⠀in⠀people's⠀attention⠀and⠀conduct,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀detail⠀serve⠀a⠀task.⠀Atmosphere⠀may⠀occupy⠀attention⠀without⠀an⠀immediate⠀task⠀function:⠀a⠀cold⠀corridor,⠀a⠀worn⠀ceremonial⠀chair,⠀a⠀locked⠀cabinet,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀with⠀automatic⠀deference.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀concrete⠀and⠀preserve⠀how⠀people⠀actually⠀accommodate,⠀ignore,⠀resist⠀or⠀benefit⠀from⠀it.\n\nIntroduce⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀when⠀an⠀accepted⠀public⠀form⠀meets⠀a⠀precise⠀private⠀preference⠀or⠀practical⠀act.⠀A⠀title⠀may⠀be⠀observed⠀with⠀care⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀wants⠀only⠀a⠀small⠀favor;⠀a⠀custom⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀lengthy⠀gesture⠀before⠀a⠀mundane⠀errand;⠀an⠀old⠀privilege⠀may⠀apply⠀awkwardly⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀need.⠀The⠀fit⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀too⠀exact⠀or⠀because⠀it⠀misses⠀by⠀a⠀small,⠀legible⠀margin.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀humiliation⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀task;⠀competent⠀help⠀and⠀sincere⠀attachment⠀remain⠀possible,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀with⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀helpful,⠀indifferent,⠀or⠀unaware.\n\nKeep⠀power,⠀permission,⠀and⠀motive⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀obey⠀a⠀form⠀without⠀respecting⠀it,⠀or⠀respect⠀it⠀without⠀understanding⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀clean⠀observation⠀can⠀expose⠀the⠀arrangement⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act,⠀but⠀no⠀character⠀must⠀announce⠀the⠀exposure.⠀Where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀private⠀experience,⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀desire,⠀discomfort,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀that⠀accompanies⠀the⠀public⠀performance;⠀a⠀social⠀presentation⠀may⠀change⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀voluntary⠀or⠀involuntary⠀context,⠀or⠀remain⠀intact⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀lie.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀faction⠀rules⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers⠀merely⠀for⠀the⠀style;⠀retain⠀any⠀forces⠀and⠀culture⠀already⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀the⠀encounter,⠀with⠀the⠀form⠀observed,⠀the⠀request⠀made,⠀or⠀the⠀ordinary⠀errand⠀still⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀testimonial⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀form.⠀Attribute⠀the⠀source⠀clearly:⠀who⠀is⠀remembering,⠀for⠀whom,⠀and⠀at⠀what⠀distance⠀from⠀the⠀events.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source's⠀actual⠀speech⠀or⠀narrative⠀register,⠀and⠀use⠀clean⠀presentation⠀of⠀the⠀particular⠀lived⠀details⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀account's⠀social⠀position⠀legible.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀source⠀or⠀may⠀frame⠀the⠀source's⠀account,⠀but⠀the⠀source's⠀knowledge⠀remains⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀experienced,⠀heard,⠀or⠀later⠀learned.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comedy⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀a⠀conventional⠀name⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀lived⠀practice⠀it⠀labels.⠀A⠀word⠀like⠀help,⠀respect,⠀work,⠀duty,⠀or⠀celebration⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀sincerely⠀while⠀the⠀remembered⠀act⠀is⠀smaller,⠀stranger,⠀more⠀practical,⠀or⠀differently⠀motivated⠀than⠀the⠀name⠀suggests.⠀Let⠀the⠀source⠀recall⠀the⠀practice⠀without⠀insisting⠀on⠀its⠀meaning:⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀fit⠀the⠀conventional⠀term⠀closely,⠀or⠀the⠀fit⠀may⠀be⠀comic⠀precisely⠀because⠀both⠀the⠀name⠀and⠀the⠀act⠀are⠀accurate⠀but⠀disproportionate.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀confession,⠀newly⠀discovered⠀injustice⠀or⠀imported⠀family⠀structure⠀for⠀this⠀route;⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀disclosure,⠀discovery⠀or⠀relationship⠀the⠀story⠀supports.\n\nDistinguish⠀remembered⠀experience⠀from⠀current⠀telling⠀and⠀later⠀understanding.⠀A⠀source⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀happened⠀then,⠀what⠀it⠀seemed⠀to⠀mean⠀then,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀now⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀earlier⠀limit.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀private⠀experience,⠀render⠀all⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀distinguishing⠀live⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling⠀from⠀the⠀remembered⠀account⠀and⠀preserving⠀permitted⠀earlier⠀experience⠀too;⠀a⠀memory⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀performed⠀speech⠀for⠀a⠀current⠀audience.\n\nThe⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀unfinished,⠀the⠀source⠀pausing,⠀or⠀the⠀frame⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀occasion.⠀No⠀completed⠀moral⠀or⠀changed⠀conclusion⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Follow⠀one⠀person's⠀actual⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀feeling⠀in⠀causal⠀order⠀as⠀they⠀encounter⠀a⠀familiar⠀explanation,⠀request,⠀or⠀expectation.⠀Follow⠀the⠀actual⠀course⠀of⠀attention⠀and⠀events:⠀thought⠀may⠀precede⠀a⠀chosen⠀action,⠀continue⠀during⠀speech,⠀or⠀arise⠀from⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀sensory⠀trigger.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀any⠀outward/inward⠀sequence⠀or⠀brief⠀recognition⠀before⠀every⠀quick⠀response.\n\nMake⠀the⠀particular⠀reception⠀precise⠀enough⠀for⠀comic⠀timing,⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀accurate,⠀mistaken⠀or⠀otherwise⠀supported;⠀no⠀error⠀or⠀hidden⠀flaw⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀expectation⠀exactly⠀and⠀find⠀it⠀disproportionate,⠀may⠀accept⠀it⠀sincerely⠀while⠀noticing⠀a⠀small⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀may⠀apply⠀it⠀literally⠀to⠀a⠀situation⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀fit.⠀Correct⠀understanding⠀is⠀as⠀possible⠀as⠀error,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀self-deceived.⠀Use⠀clean⠀language⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀particular⠀reasoning⠀and⠀any⠀accepted⠀belief⠀legible⠀without⠀a⠀generic⠀social⠀verdict;⠀the⠀belief⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀false.\n\nPreserve⠀fallible⠀inference⠀and⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reason⠀from⠀incomplete⠀information,⠀revise⠀a⠀first⠀impression,⠀or⠀hold⠀two⠀feelings⠀at⠀once.⠀Where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits,⠀render⠀extended⠀thought⠀before⠀action,⠀including⠀the⠀ordinary⠀work⠀of⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀quietness,⠀a⠀private-to-public⠀sequence,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀conclusion;⠀the⠀person⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀understanding⠀they⠀began⠀with.\n\nThe⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀the⠀reception,⠀before⠀any⠀reply,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀expectation⠀still⠀in⠀place.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀response⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀occasion⠀already⠀established⠀or⠀newly⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀arrange⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀of⠀that⠀occasion⠀across⠀the⠀sequence,⠀using⠀nonlinear⠀returns⠀where⠀they⠀serve⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀without⠀a⠀minimum⠀number⠀of⠀accounts⠀in⠀each⠀response.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀account⠀to⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀mark⠀its⠀time⠀clearly⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀place⠀it:⠀before⠀the⠀occasion,⠀during⠀it,⠀after⠀it,⠀or⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀return.⠀The⠀sources⠀may⠀be⠀participants,⠀observers,⠀or⠀people⠀who⠀heard⠀about⠀the⠀occasion,⠀but⠀each⠀account⠀remains⠀that⠀person's⠀own.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀wording⠀reveal⠀each⠀source's⠀position⠀without⠀turning⠀that⠀position⠀into⠀omniscient⠀truth.⠀One⠀source⠀may⠀call⠀an⠀arrangement⠀proper,⠀another⠀may⠀call⠀it⠀convenient,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀describe⠀only⠀the⠀physical⠀work⠀it⠀required.⠀The⠀comedy⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀of⠀these⠀compatible⠀or⠀conflicting⠀uses:⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀phrase⠀can⠀mean⠀a⠀ceremony⠀to⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀an⠀errand⠀to⠀another,⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀can⠀be⠀remembered⠀at⠀different⠀scales.⠀Facts⠀and⠀interpretations⠀may⠀agree⠀while⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀accounts⠀still⠀produces⠀the⠀comic⠀effect.\n\nPreserve⠀established⠀events⠀and⠀separate⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀source⠀could⠀not,⠀but⠀the⠀earlier⠀source's⠀ignorance⠀remains⠀real.⠀A⠀familiar⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀occasion⠀need⠀not⠀add⠀new⠀information⠀or⠀refute⠀an⠀earlier⠀version.⠀Where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀private⠀experience,⠀render⠀each⠀permitted⠀source's⠀actual