u,⠀romance⠀route,⠀or⠀closing⠀reaction⠀is⠀supplied.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀thought⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀earlier⠀wording⠀or⠀conditions⠀only⠀where⠀re-entry⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀brief⠀exact⠀recall⠀of⠀a⠀prior⠀phrase,⠀object⠀or⠀arrangement⠀can⠀be⠀enough;⠀omit⠀redundant⠀reconstruction⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀history⠀or⠀private⠀recollection⠀the⠀present⠀experience⠀actually⠀needs.\n\nPreserve⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀received,⠀done,⠀and⠀left⠀pending.⠀A⠀familiar⠀exact⠀repetition⠀can⠀be⠀comic,⠀and⠀so⠀can⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀application⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀account.⠀A⠀callback⠀need⠀not⠀reveal⠀a⠀fresh⠀cost,⠀a⠀hypocrite,⠀or⠀a⠀damaged⠀relationship.⠀The⠀recurring⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀normal⠀may⠀simply⠀meet⠀another⠀ordinary⠀use,⠀and⠀the⠀humor⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀that⠀fit⠀without⠀escalation.\n\nKeep⠀independent⠀lives⠀and⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀joke.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀concerned⠀with⠀work,⠀food,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀or⠀an⠀unrelated⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀recurring⠀account⠀continues.⠀No⠀reset,⠀escalating⠀exposure,⠀completed⠀miniature⠀chapter,⠀or⠀ending⠀hook⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nStage⠀the⠀request,⠀apology,⠀admission,⠀or⠀return⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀means⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀character:⠀where⠀they⠀are⠀positioned,⠀who⠀can⠀hear⠀them,⠀what⠀words⠀they⠀have⠀prepared⠀or⠀discarded,⠀and⠀what⠀help⠀or⠀obstacle⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀supplies.⠀Make⠀the⠀practical⠀approach⠀specific⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀effort⠀being⠀spent,⠀not⠀only⠀the⠀feeling⠀behind⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀remain⠀present⠀inside⠀the⠀attempt.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀badly,⠀resent⠀the⠀need,⠀fear⠀the⠀answer,⠀or⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀response⠀that⠀made⠀this⠀approach⠀harder.⠀Render⠀that⠀private⠀state⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀without⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀shorten,⠀resolve,⠀or⠀visibly⠀alter⠀the⠀outward⠀action.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀manage⠀to⠀do⠀is⠀itself⠀comic⠀material,⠀but⠀the⠀feeling⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀punchline⠀to⠀be⠀dismissed.\n\nTime⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀effort⠀and⠀reception⠀for⠀comedy.⠀A⠀carefully⠀prepared⠀approach⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀completely⠀different⠀concern;⠀an⠀awkward⠀opening⠀can⠀receive⠀a⠀direct,⠀practical⠀answer;⠀a⠀long-delayed⠀admission⠀can⠀land⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀occupied⠀with⠀something⠀ordinary.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀participants⠀and⠀their⠀habits⠀determine⠀the⠀reception.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀rejection,⠀a⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀a⠀breakthrough.⠀A⠀successful⠀asking,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀or⠀a⠀response⠀that⠀changes⠀nothing⠀may⠀all⠀end⠀the⠀interval.\n\nLet⠀actual⠀memories⠀inform⠀the⠀present⠀approach⠀or⠀accompany⠀its⠀feeling⠀and⠀attention⠀without⠀requiring⠀practical⠀usefulness⠀or⠀an⠀altered⠀next⠀act.⠀A⠀remembered⠀response⠀can⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀hesitates,⠀chooses⠀a⠀particular⠀wording,⠀or⠀expects⠀a⠀particular⠀outcome,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀relived⠀as⠀a⠀flashback⠀or⠀corrected⠀by⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀in⠀the⠀past⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀develop⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀done⠀now.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀current⠀aim,⠀the⠀positions⠀of⠀the⠀active⠀participants,⠀and⠀the⠀means⠀already⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀so⠀each⠀contribution⠀is⠀clear.⠀Resolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract:⠀the⠀owned⠀character⠀acts,⠀speaks,⠀and⠀thinks⠀within⠀the⠀permissions⠀already⠀established,⠀while⠀other⠀participants⠀remain⠀available⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀owners⠀to⠀play.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀interval⠀develop⠀from⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀habits,⠀aims,⠀and⠀blind⠀spots.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀pursue⠀a⠀recognizable⠀goal⠀with⠀a⠀method⠀that⠀fits⠀their⠀history,⠀capacity,⠀or⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀others.⠀Cooperation,⠀conflict,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀misunderstanding⠀are⠀all⠀usable;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀quip⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀random⠀interruption⠀to⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀comic⠀construction.⠀An⠀actual⠀old⠀encounter⠀may⠀explain⠀present⠀attention⠀or⠀develop⠀feeling⠀beyond⠀immediate⠀action.⠀Render⠀that⠀memory⠀at⠀its⠀warranted⠀extent,⠀briefly⠀or⠀in⠀an⠀extended⠀recollection,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀flashback⠀or⠀limiting⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀contextual⠀note.\n\nKeep⠀NPCs⠀pursuing⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀aims.⠀They⠀may⠀help,⠀resist,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀continue⠀their⠀ordinary⠀business.⠀Their⠀actions⠀and⠀speech⠀are⠀public⠀scene⠀material;⠀their⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀separate⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀player⠀character⠀or⠀other⠀cast⠀members.⠀Likewise,⠀the⠀player⠀character's⠀known⠀motives⠀are⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀and⠀actual⠀access⠀permit.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀of⠀the⠀active⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀player⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀make⠀a⠀choice,⠀or⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀delivered⠀joke,⠀a⠀new⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀close⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀with⠀the⠀situation⠀left⠀coherent⠀and⠀ready⠀to⠀resume.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Ground⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀in⠀a⠀definite⠀social⠀arrangement:⠀who⠀has⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀resource,⠀role,⠀place,⠀or⠀opportunity,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀arrangement⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀people⠀involved.⠀Keep⠀the⠀supplied⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀adding⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀honor⠀system,⠀or⠀national⠀speech⠀pattern.\n\nStage⠀each⠀character's⠀use⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement⠀clearly.⠀Show⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀get,⠀keep,⠀avoid,⠀or⠀return,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀means⠀they⠀have⠀for⠀doing⠀so.⠀Comic⠀proportion⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀fit⠀of⠀compatible⠀habits,⠀a⠀real⠀collision,⠀legitimate⠀competing⠀aims,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀mistaken⠀assumption⠀about⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀from⠀random⠀interference.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀competent⠀and⠀still⠀funny⠀because⠀their⠀competence⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀history⠀and⠀a⠀particular⠀stake.\n\nLet⠀the⠀personal⠀basis⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀remain⠀legible.⠀A⠀character's⠀aim⠀should⠀connect⠀to⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀need⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀them.⠀Let⠀actual⠀memory⠀inform⠀conduct⠀or⠀continuing⠀private⠀feeling⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀flashback⠀or⠀lesson;⠀an⠀extended⠀recollection⠀remains⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀experience.⠀The⠀emotional⠀significance⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀is⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀comic.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narration.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀fears,⠀hopes,⠀or⠀remembers⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀others⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀visible⠀effect.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀expose⠀corruption,⠀defeat⠀a⠀hierarchy,⠀deliver⠀a⠀moral,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀social⠀outcome.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement⠀still⠀in⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀comic⠀recognition⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nStage⠀the⠀attempt⠀through⠀the⠀physical⠀particulars⠀that⠀actually⠀matter:⠀the⠀grip,⠀reach,⠀weight,⠀cost,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀material⠀resistance⠀involved⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀economical⠀transitions.⠀Construct⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀material⠀action,⠀with⠀any⠀narrative⠀commentary⠀retaining⠀its⠀real⠀voice⠀and⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀that⠀construction.\n\nRelate⠀the⠀chosen⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀person.⠀The⠀method⠀should⠀fit⠀the⠀character's⠀real⠀capacity,⠀aim,⠀or⠀relevant⠀remembered⠀experience.⠀An⠀exact⠀competent⠀fit⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀funny⠀as⠀a⠀mismatch⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀why⠀this⠀person⠀would⠀do⠀it⠀this⠀way.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀damage⠀or⠀failure⠀to⠀create⠀stakes;⠀keep⠀supplied⠀pain⠀and⠀risk⠀proportional⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀establish.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm.⠀Compressed⠀movement⠀can⠀give⠀way⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀private⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀or⠀feeling⠀needs⠀it.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀pressure-oriented,⠀not⠀a⠀ban⠀on⠀thought⠀or⠀a⠀quota⠀of⠀short⠀sentences.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀state⠀determine⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀prose.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀emotional⠀basis⠀present⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀visible⠀payoff.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀from⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀need,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀that⠀private⠀state⠀at⠀length.⠀The⠀comic⠀interval⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀attempt⠀underway,⠀completed,⠀or⠀interrupted,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀setback,⠀triumph,⠀or⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀journal⠀entry,⠀report,⠀note,⠀or⠀other⠀record.⠀Establish⠀who⠀wrote⠀it,⠀for⠀what⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀composed.⠀Let⠀the⠀document's⠀register⠀belong⠀to⠀its⠀author,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator.\n\nMake⠀the⠀relevant⠀action,⠀available⠀means,⠀or⠀stated⠀account⠀legible⠀inside⠀that⠀writer's⠀register.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀chooses⠀to⠀record,⠀emphasize,⠀omit,⠀or⠀misunderstand,⠀and⠀from⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀the⠀document⠀reveals.⠀A⠀prior⠀shared⠀phrase⠀or⠀account⠀may⠀meet⠀its⠀present⠀use⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀contradiction⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀document⠀to⠀explain⠀it.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀privately⠀felt.⠀The⠀record⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀put⠀down;⠀full⠀live⠀feeling,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀unstated⠀motive⠀remain⠀separate⠀and⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀the⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀transparent⠀window⠀into⠀the⠀writer's⠀complete⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀the⠀document's⠀uptake⠀remain⠀open.⠀A⠀recipient⠀may⠀read⠀it,⠀ignore⠀it,⠀misread⠀it,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀it⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀aims.⠀No⠀revelation,⠀useful⠀correction,⠀completed⠀artifact,⠀or⠀changed⠀opinion⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀document⠀composed,⠀sent,⠀received,⠀or⠀still⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀the⠀comic⠀recognition⠀may⠀rest⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nMake⠀the⠀offered⠀care⠀practically⠀understandable⠀and⠀personally⠀specific.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀helper⠀actually⠀does,⠀with⠀what⠀capacity,⠀known⠀or⠀expressed⠀preference,⠀and⠀available⠀means.⠀The⠀kindness⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀niceness.\n\nStage⠀the⠀reception⠀clearly⠀enough⠀for⠀affectionate⠀recognition.⠀The⠀recipient⠀may⠀respond⠀with⠀capable⠀familiarity,⠀a⠀spontaneous⠀fit,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀inattention.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀fit⠀between⠀the⠀care⠀and⠀the⠀person:⠀a⠀perfectly⠀chosen⠀small⠀thing,⠀a⠀well-meant⠀effort⠀that⠀misses⠀a⠀known⠀preference,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀performed⠀with⠀unexpected⠀seriousness.⠀Keep⠀the⠀recipient's⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀intact;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.\n\nLet⠀memories⠀inform⠀the⠀helper⠀without⠀inventing⠀knowledge⠀or⠀hidden⠀design.⠀A⠀remembered⠀preference⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀occasion⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀helper⠀chooses⠀this⠀action,⠀but⠀the⠀memory⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀announced,⠀corrected,⠀or⠀relived.⠀The⠀care⠀remains⠀sincere⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀imperfect.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narration.⠀Affection,⠀amusement,⠀frustration,⠀or⠀weariness⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀offered⠀care⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀spoken⠀aloud.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀gratitude,⠀emotional⠀transformation,⠀sacrifice,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀response.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀care⠀offered,⠀accepted,⠀refused,⠀or⠀still⠀underway,⠀and⠀the⠀kindness⠀remains⠀real⠀regardless⠀of⠀the⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀give⠀an⠀actual⠀choice⠀or⠀encounter⠀its⠀permitted⠀social⠀and⠀historical⠀context.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀frame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀surrounding⠀arrangements,⠀customs,⠀or⠀judgments⠀that⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech;⠀the⠀formality⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀architecture⠀of⠀the⠀prose,⠀not⠀the⠀rank⠀of⠀the⠀cast.\n\nMake⠀the⠀practical⠀means⠀and⠀personal⠀stake⠀legible⠀inside⠀that⠀frame.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀with⠀what⠀resources⠀and⠀limits,⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀them.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀composed⠀context⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀conduct:⠀a⠀small⠀personal⠀act⠀can⠀be⠀treated⠀with⠀full⠀formal⠀attention,⠀or⠀a⠀large⠀expectation⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀modest⠀practical⠀result.⠀Keep⠀the⠀staging⠀precise⠀rather⠀than⠀inflating⠀it.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀to⠀inform⠀the⠀present⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀changed⠀judgment.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀supply⠀history⠀or⠀social⠀context⠀that⠀explains⠀why⠀this⠀encounter⠀matters,⠀but⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀choice⠀remains⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀conclude⠀with⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀moral⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀demonstration⠀of⠀growth.\n\nPreserve⠀individual⠀speech,⠀abstract⠀thought,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀composed⠀register⠀does⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀characters⠀into⠀one⠀voice.⠀Private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀visible⠀to⠀others.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀completed,⠀refused,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀with⠀the⠀comic⠀recognition⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀framing⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀actual⠀telling⠀occasion:⠀who⠀speaks,⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀and⠀what⠀brings⠀this⠀account⠀before⠀these⠀listeners.⠀Their⠀attention⠀may⠀be⠀willing,⠀reluctant,⠀distracted,⠀or⠀otherwise⠀situated.⠀The⠀teller's⠀real⠀purpose⠀may⠀be⠀instruction,⠀securing⠀cooperation,⠀entertaining⠀a⠀companion,⠀defending⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀simply⠀sharing⠀time;⠀a⠀lesson⠀is⠀not⠀required.\n\nInside⠀the⠀told⠀account,⠀stage⠀the⠀attempt⠀concretely.⠀Give⠀the⠀central⠀figure⠀a⠀clear⠀practical⠀goal,⠀a⠀specific⠀means,⠀and⠀a⠀personal⠀reason⠀for⠀choosing⠀that⠀means.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀present⠀interest⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀includes:⠀a⠀detail⠀about⠀timing,⠀access,⠀or⠀a⠀companion's⠀habit⠀may⠀be⠀selected⠀because⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀listeners,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀proves⠀a⠀point.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀consistent⠀with⠀their⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀events⠀described.\n\nBuild⠀comic⠀recognition⠀through⠀the⠀frame⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀random⠀interruption.⠀A⠀recurring⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀practical⠀detail⠀can⠀reappear⠀at⠀the⠀outer⠀level⠀and⠀acquire⠀a⠀new⠀proportion⠀because⠀the⠀listeners⠀now⠀know⠀its⠀history.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀implication⠀before⠀the⠀teller⠀does,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀knowingly⠀withhold⠀a⠀detail⠀until⠀it⠀becomes⠀useful.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners⠀remain⠀active:⠀they⠀can⠀ask⠀a⠀concrete⠀question,⠀supply⠀a⠀remembered⠀fact,⠀or⠀respond⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀telling⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀knew⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀A⠀vivid⠀recollection⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀its⠀own⠀accuracy,⠀and⠀a⠀generous⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀while⠀omitting⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀understand.⠀The⠀told⠀act⠀may⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀its⠀actual⠀positions⠀and⠀means⠀are⠀legible,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀teller⠀mocks⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀of⠀authorized⠀people⠀available⠀beyond⠀the⠀told⠀account⠀at⠀either⠀narrative⠀level,⠀including⠀a⠀listener's⠀sustained⠀feeling⠀or⠀a⠀teller's⠀private⠀uncertainty⠀without⠀required⠀usefulness.⠀No⠀interruption,⠀useful⠀advice,⠀revealed⠀motive,⠀changed⠀reception,⠀or⠀in-world⠀pause⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀Introduce⠀an⠀actual⠀record,⠀object,⠀or⠀recollection⠀with⠀its⠀source⠀time⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀character's⠀access⠀to⠀it:⠀a⠀file⠀read⠀years⠀later,⠀a⠀receipt⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀private⠀reason,⠀a⠀remembered⠀announcement,⠀a⠀note⠀passed⠀through⠀someone⠀else's⠀hands.⠀The⠀document⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀exhibit;⠀it⠀enters⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀person's⠀attention⠀and⠀purpose.\n\nRelate⠀the⠀record's⠀contents⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀person's⠀understanding⠀or⠀conduct.⠀Place⠀the⠀document⠀beside⠀actual⠀present⠀conduct,⠀attention,⠀attachment,⠀or⠀uncertainty;⠀no⠀external⠀task⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀make⠀its⠀historical⠀presence⠀meaningful.⠀The⠀comedy⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀or⠀fit⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀source⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀doing,⠀wanting,⠀or⠀remembering.⠀A⠀familiar⠀detail⠀may⠀confirm⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀knew,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀acquire⠀a⠀new⠀comic⠀proportion⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀discovery,⠀correction,⠀or⠀useful⠀next⠀step⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀meaningful.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀source's⠀knowledge⠀boundaries⠀explicit.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀convey⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀says⠀without⠀staging⠀a⠀reading⠀gesture;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀its⠀contents⠀from⠀memory,⠀from⠀a⠀summary,⠀or⠀from⠀direct⠀access.⠀The⠀record⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀unsupported⠀knowledge⠀to⠀anyone,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀read⠀a⠀document⠀and⠀still⠀feel⠀something⠀the⠀document⠀does⠀not⠀state.⠀Let⠀the⠀record's⠀language⠀remain⠀its⠀own:⠀an⠀official⠀notice,⠀a⠀private⠀note,⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀remark⠀should⠀not⠀all⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀narrator.\n\nWhen⠀actual⠀action⠀occurs,⠀stage⠀its⠀practical⠀and⠀personal⠀terms⠀clearly.⠀A⠀chosen⠀means⠀follows⠀the⠀person's⠀real⠀capacity,⠀history,⠀information,⠀and⠀relationships⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀invented⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀useful⠀effect⠀from⠀the⠀document.⠀Historical⠀attention⠀may⠀remain⠀meaningful⠀without⠀an⠀act⠀or⠀choice.⠀The⠀record⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀familiar⠀habit⠀legible,⠀expose⠀a⠀blind⠀spot⠀without⠀punishing⠀it,⠀or⠀show⠀that⠀an⠀old⠀arrangement⠀is⠀still⠀active⠀in⠀a⠀comic⠀way.⠀No⠀correction,⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀changed⠀plan⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaqaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nStage⠀the⠀actual⠀access⠀through⠀which⠀old⠀authority⠀meets⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀room,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀role,⠀a⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀debt.⠀Make⠀the⠀practical⠀terms⠀concrete⠀before⠀the⠀comedy⠀develops.⠀Who⠀may⠀enter,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀asked,⠀what⠀is⠀owed,⠀what⠀is⠀inherited,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀merely⠀assumed⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀actual⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrative⠀context,⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀demonstration⠀or⠀ban⠀on⠀explanatory⠀summary.\n\nPut⠀the⠀personal⠀significance⠀of⠀that⠀access⠀beside⠀real⠀practical⠀conduct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀sincerely⠀courteous,⠀freely⠀offer⠀trust,⠀or⠀feel⠀actual⠀ambivalence⠀while⠀still⠀pursuing⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim.⠀Let⠀that⠀combination⠀carry⠀comic⠀proportion:⠀the⠀gravity⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀or⠀role⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀person's⠀habits,⠀blind⠀spots,⠀or⠀private⠀desires⠀disappear.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀fit⠀between⠀the⠀formal⠀arrangement⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀moving⠀through⠀it,⠀without⠀requiring⠀mockery.⠀Any⠀actual⠀satirical⠀judgment⠀or⠀character⠀ridicule⠀remains⠀available⠀within⠀its⠀voice⠀and⠀circumstances.\n\nUse⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀color⠀experience,⠀not⠀to⠀prove⠀motive.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀room,⠀an⠀unsettling⠀ritual,⠀or⠀a⠀damaged⠀object⠀can⠀matter⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀function⠀and⠀history.⠀A⠀character's⠀unease,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀attraction⠀may⠀accompany⠀their⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀without⠀certifying⠀that⠀someone⠀else⠀is⠀trustworthy⠀or⠀dangerous.⠀Keep⠀private⠀desire⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀observe.\n\nLet⠀relationship⠀terms⠀remain⠀actual.⠀A⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀fall.⠀A⠀sincere⠀courtesy⠀can⠀be⠀met⠀with⠀sincerity,⠀a⠀freely⠀offered⠀trust⠀can⠀be⠀accepted,⠀and⠀an⠀ambivalent⠀person⠀can⠀act⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀ambivalence.⠀No⠀betrayal,⠀authority⠀collapse,⠀moral⠀correction,⠀or⠀changed⠀outcome⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
