e⠀present⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀a⠀literal⠀reply⠀or⠀familiar⠀callback⠀land⠀as⠀the⠀comic⠀turn.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀expect⠀a⠀dramatic⠀recognition⠀and⠀receive⠀a⠀practical⠀answer;⠀an⠀old⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀context;⠀a⠀serious⠀agreement⠀may⠀be⠀fulfilled⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀satisfies⠀everyone⠀while⠀remaining⠀small.⠀Full⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀available—the⠀character⠀can⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀memory⠀while⠀the⠀exchange⠀continues—but⠀no⠀reveal⠀or⠀confession⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀beat.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀setup⠀unfinished⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it.⠀The⠀aim⠀may⠀remain⠀partly⠀unmet,⠀the⠀remembered⠀account⠀only⠀half-relevant,⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀still⠀ahead.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀punchline,⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀direct⠀accessibility,⠀not⠀a⠀young⠀cast⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀slot.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀from⠀a⠀scene-born⠀image,⠀sound,⠀or⠀name⠀whose⠀associations⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀follow⠀without⠀making⠀those⠀associations⠀govern⠀the⠀world.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀shape⠀an⠀expectation⠀around⠀a⠀familiar⠀activity:⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀gather⠀weight⠀through⠀its⠀rhythm,⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀another⠀occasion,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀may⠀arrive⠀with⠀a⠀story⠀already⠀attached⠀to⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀or⠀an⠀association⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀permitted⠀viewpoint,⠀and⠀let⠀plain⠀statements⠀interrupt⠀the⠀shaped⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀direct⠀movement.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀comic⠀turn⠀by⠀letting⠀an⠀actual⠀utterance,⠀action,⠀or⠀continuation⠀meet⠀that⠀shaped⠀expectation⠀as⠀it⠀actually⠀occurs,⠀predicted⠀or⠀otherwise,⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀unexpected⠀outcome.⠀A⠀literal⠀reply,⠀a⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀an⠀unchanged⠀habit⠀can⠀land⠀against⠀the⠀elevated⠀or⠀associative⠀phrasing⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀fail⠀or⠀the⠀remembered⠀story⠀to⠀be⠀corrected.⠀The⠀contrast⠀belongs⠀to⠀timing⠀and⠀emphasis,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀the⠀image's⠀falseness.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀real⠀cause⠀of⠀the⠀event:⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀late⠀because⠀of⠀traffic,⠀the⠀lyrical⠀repetition⠀of⠀the⠀word⠀\"late\"⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀traffic⠀a⠀symbolic⠀punishment.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀viewpoint⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀is⠀highly⠀shaped.⠀The⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀feeling⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀attention,⠀remaining⠀actual⠀experience⠀owned⠀by⠀that⠀person.⠀Figurative⠀or⠀direct⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀it⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀voice⠀without⠀substituting⠀ornament⠀for⠀what⠀is⠀felt.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀hear⠀the⠀image⠀unless⠀they⠀are⠀its⠀source⠀or⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀them⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀comic⠀expectation⠀resolves;⠀a⠀shaped⠀passage⠀can⠀pause⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀a⠀continuing⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀payoff,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀recognition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀recall⠀a⠀particular⠀promise,⠀phrase,⠀habit,⠀or⠀object⠀whose⠀earlier⠀meaning⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀Reconstruct⠀the⠀earlier⠀person's⠀actual⠀aim⠀and⠀understanding⠀at⠀the⠀time:⠀what⠀they⠀wanted,⠀what⠀they⠀knew,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀thing⠀mattered.⠀Do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀that⠀earlier⠀motive⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀funnier⠀or⠀more⠀poignant.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀detail—a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀an⠀unchanged⠀phrase—rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀exact⠀remembered⠀particular⠀beside⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀comic⠀effect⠀come⠀from⠀their⠀coexistence.⠀An⠀unchanged⠀habit⠀may⠀now⠀look⠀odd⠀without⠀being⠀wrong;⠀a⠀literal⠀response⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀without⠀breaking⠀it;⠀a⠀familiar⠀recognition⠀may⠀be⠀affectionate⠀and⠀dry⠀at⠀once.⠀The⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀earlier⠀feeling⠀to⠀have⠀been⠀a⠀mistake,⠀the⠀present⠀person⠀to⠀have⠀outgrown⠀it,⠀or⠀the⠀memory⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀regret.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀may⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀passage,⠀but⠀neither⠀is⠀compulsory.\n\nAllow⠀direct⠀reflection⠀where⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀permit⠀it,⠀but⠀keep⠀private⠀feeling⠀distinct⠀from⠀any⠀lesson⠀the⠀character⠀draws.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀phrase⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀and⠀still⠀use⠀it,⠀or⠀may⠀find⠀that⠀it⠀fits⠀differently⠀now.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀association⠀is⠀still⠀unfolding;⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀before⠀the⠀character⠀resolves⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀means,⠀and⠀no⠀completed⠀emotional⠀turn⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaraq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀modern⠀memoir⠀with⠀the⠀participant⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀teller⠀clearly⠀situated⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permissions.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀recount⠀the⠀actual⠀aim,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀response⠀the⠀person⠀had⠀then,⠀including⠀any⠀name,⠀tale,⠀promise,⠀or⠀local⠀story⠀that⠀mattered⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀leak⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀participant's⠀understanding,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀revise⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀present⠀account⠀can⠀score⠀a⠀point⠀against⠀it.\n\nUse⠀temporal⠀vantage⠀for⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀correction;⠀an⠀actual⠀supported⠀correction⠀can⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀rewriting⠀earlier⠀experience.⠀The⠀later⠀teller⠀may⠀confirm⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀story⠀was⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀participant⠀believed,⠀may⠀qualify⠀a⠀detail⠀without⠀overturning⠀the⠀whole⠀account,⠀or⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀significance⠀open.⠀A⠀dry⠀aside,⠀a⠀plain⠀restatement,⠀or⠀an⠀unchanged⠀phrase⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀humor⠀without⠀requiring⠀humiliation,⠀superior⠀judgment,⠀or⠀a⠀confession⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀was⠀foolish.⠀The⠀joke⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀lived⠀by⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀knows,⠀but⠀the⠀earlier⠀experience⠀remains⠀a⠀real⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀setup⠀for⠀retrospective⠀mockery.\n\nKeep⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀composed⠀recollection⠀at⠀either⠀authorized⠀time.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀enters⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment,⠀render⠀the⠀participant's⠀actual⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀as⠀they⠀occurred;⠀if⠀it⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀later⠀teller,⠀render⠀the⠀present⠀reflection⠀as⠀a⠀distinct⠀act⠀of⠀memory.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀teller⠀finishes⠀comparing⠀the⠀two⠀times,⠀and⠀no⠀completed⠀verdict⠀on⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀few⠀exact⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀aim⠀and⠀its⠀continuation⠀legible:⠀the⠀name,⠀act,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀object⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀relevant⠀history⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀A⠀single⠀repeated⠀particular⠀can⠀imply⠀a⠀larger⠀comic⠀account⠀without⠀being⠀explained.⠀Let⠀direct⠀clauses⠀carry⠀the⠀movement,⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀omission⠀of⠀redundant⠀explanation⠀to⠀leave⠀the⠀inference⠀available⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀delete⠀causality.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀actual⠀feeling⠀and⠀reasoning⠀at⠀their⠀warranted⠀extent⠀without⠀a⠀contribution⠀or⠀usefulness⠀gate;⠀do⠀not⠀cut⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀inward⠀or⠀extended.\n\nLet⠀a⠀plain⠀reply⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀particular⠀sustain⠀the⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀changing⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀same⠀name⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀again⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀weight;⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀may⠀appear⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀significance;⠀a⠀literal⠀answer⠀may⠀land⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀established⠀the⠀expectation.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀exactness⠀of⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀against⠀the⠀actual⠀continuation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀concealed⠀meaning⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀uncovered.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀detail⠀to⠀grow,⠀reverse,⠀or⠀pay⠀off⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀shown⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀merely⠀omitted.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀direct⠀clause⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀selection⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀notices,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀summary.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀precede⠀any⠀payoff;⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀a⠀continuing⠀action,⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question⠀can⠀end⠀the⠀response⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀comic⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaras::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀organize⠀the⠀passage:⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀doing,⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀notices,⠀and⠀what⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀memory⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀second⠀tale⠀or⠀a⠀lore⠀summary⠀whenever⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀place⠀appears.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀name,⠀place,⠀promise,⠀or⠀object⠀has⠀relevant⠀history,⠀let⠀its⠀current⠀use⠀shape⠀a⠀recognizable⠀expectation⠀or⠀response⠀in⠀direct⠀narration.⠀The⠀history⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀brief⠀recollection,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀character⠀handles⠀the⠀object,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀a⠀sourced⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀hidden⠀truth⠀the⠀scene⠀must⠀uncover.⠀A⠀literal⠀reply,⠀a⠀familiar⠀pattern,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀story's⠀weight⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀without⠀allowing⠀resemblance⠀alone⠀to⠀rewrite⠀world⠀facts⠀or⠀character⠀aims.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀story,⠀prophecy,⠀or⠀other⠀force⠀established⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀world;⠀a⠀literary⠀echo⠀by⠀itself⠀does⠀not⠀impose⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀comedy⠀grounded⠀in⠀aims⠀and⠀reception⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀personal⠀emotional⠀turn⠀alone.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀pursue⠀a⠀recognizable⠀goal,⠀meet⠀an⠀actual⠀response,⠀and⠀produce⠀the⠀comic⠀effect⠀through⠀timing,⠀habit,⠀or⠀blind⠀spot⠀without⠀undergoing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Private⠀experience⠀may⠀accompany⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀or⠀resolved.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀and⠀no⠀completed⠀recognition,⠀callback,⠀or⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀a⠀repeated⠀name,⠀phrase,⠀preference,⠀or⠀act⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀history,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Let⠀that⠀particular⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀shared⠀story⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀scene:⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀reach⠀for⠀a⠀known⠀preference,⠀or⠀repeat⠀an⠀act⠀the⠀other⠀recognizes.⠀The⠀recognition⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀bond.⠀Familiar⠀agreement⠀and⠀literal⠀help⠀are⠀available⠀outcomes;⠀the⠀joke⠀does⠀not⠀depend⠀on⠀someone⠀failing⠀to⠀understand.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀participant's⠀private⠀association⠀their⠀own.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀origin⠀of⠀the⠀phrase⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀simply⠀uses⠀it;⠀one⠀may⠀attach⠀weight⠀to⠀an⠀object⠀the⠀other⠀treats⠀as⠀ordinary;⠀one⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀callback⠀affectionate⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀finds⠀it⠀dry⠀or⠀mildly⠀annoying.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀an⠀authorized⠀viewpoint's⠀association⠀without⠀granting⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀the⠀participants⠀legendary⠀roles⠀or⠀make⠀their⠀shared⠀history⠀a⠀myth⠀that⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀must⠀live⠀up⠀to.\n\nLet⠀the⠀callback⠀retain⠀its⠀same⠀meaning⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀supports.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀need⠀not⠀mark⠀a⠀milestone,⠀reveal⠀a⠀hidden⠀motive,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀relationship's⠀temperature.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀shared⠀recognition⠀is⠀still⠀unfolding,⠀before⠀either⠀participant⠀names⠀what⠀the⠀callback⠀means⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀will⠀lead⠀to.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀recurrent⠀phrasing⠀around⠀an⠀established⠀act,⠀promise,⠀or⠀attributed⠀remembrance.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀by⠀the⠀deed⠀for⠀which⠀they⠀are⠀remembered,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀kept⠀it⠀alive.⠀Expand⠀from⠀the⠀declaration⠀into⠀the⠀actual⠀intentions,⠀words,⠀and⠀activity⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀remembered⠀weight⠀meets⠀the⠀real⠀means⠀and⠀habits⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀involved.\n\nLet⠀a⠀plain⠀reply⠀or⠀an⠀accurate⠀recurring⠀designation⠀carry⠀the⠀comic⠀timing.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀agree⠀with⠀the⠀account,⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀use⠀the⠀familiar⠀designation⠀without⠀ceremony.⠀The⠀humor⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀the⠀public⠀account⠀against⠀the⠀actual⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀moment,⠀not⠀from⠀mockery⠀of⠀the⠀deed⠀or⠀from⠀shrinking⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀done.⠀An⠀errand⠀remains⠀an⠀errand⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀history;⠀a⠀remembered⠀kindness⠀remains⠀a⠀kindness⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀recipient⠀is⠀unimpressed.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀scale,⠀private⠀experience,⠀and⠀unfinished⠀efforts.⠀The⠀teller's⠀access⠀must⠀stay⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀about⠀the⠀public⠀account⠀remains⠀their⠀own.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀agree⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀account⠀uninterrupted;⠀no⠀new⠀reputation⠀shift,⠀public⠀correction,⠀or⠀completed⠀legend⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀folktale-inflected⠀narration⠀in⠀direct,⠀familiar⠀terms,⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀recounting⠀something⠀that⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀course⠀of⠀a⠀day.⠀Let⠀a⠀condition,⠀promise,⠀or⠀saying⠀appear⠀early⠀and⠀plainly:⠀someone⠀states⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀true,⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀do⠀if⠀a⠀thing⠀occurs,⠀or⠀what⠀an⠀object⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀mean.⠀Do⠀not⠀decorate⠀it⠀with⠀portent.⠀The⠀statement⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀something⠀a⠀person⠀would⠀actually⠀say⠀while⠀pursuing⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim.\n\nLet⠀the⠀stated⠀condition⠀return⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀choices⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀facts.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀fulfill⠀it⠀literally⠀while⠀missing⠀its⠀intended⠀spirit,⠀recognize⠀it⠀too⠀late,⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀occasion,⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀condition⠀no⠀longer⠀fits,⠀or⠀fulfill⠀it⠀knowingly⠀just⠀as⠀everyone⠀expected.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀saying's⠀story-like⠀shape⠀and⠀the⠀actual,⠀consequential⠀way⠀it⠀lands.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀world⠀rearrange⠀itself⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀pattern.⠀If⠀the⠀condition⠀returns⠀once⠀and⠀then⠀fades,⠀that⠀is⠀enough;⠀a⠀third⠀repetition⠀is⠀not⠀owed.\n\nKeep⠀a⠀relevant⠀larger⠀story⠀present⠀through⠀actual⠀attention,⠀direct⠀context,⠀or⠀a⠀sourced⠀recollection,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀full⠀retelling⠀or⠀banning⠀explanation.⠀A⠀name,⠀object,⠀or⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀account,⠀and⠀a⠀character's⠀reaction⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀they⠀feel⠀that⠀weight.⠀Let⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀respond⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀habits:⠀literally,⠀dryly,⠀warmly,⠀or⠀without⠀noticing⠀the⠀pattern⠀at⠀all.⠀Preserve⠀all⠀established⠀world⠀forces.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀condition⠀settled,⠀still⠀pending,⠀or⠀quietly⠀abandoned⠀as⠀the⠀characters⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaraw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀actually⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀world⠀carry⠀the⠀comic⠀situation:⠀an⠀object⠀placed⠀where⠀someone⠀will⠀see⠀it,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀a⠀familiar⠀act⠀performed⠀under⠀new⠀conditions.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀readable⠀and⠀the⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.\n\nLet⠀a⠀visible⠀detail⠀recall⠀a⠀larger⠀account⠀with⠀relevant⠀context⠀or⠀actual⠀narration⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀and⠀scene⠀support⠀it,⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀compulsory⠀flashback.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀look⠀at⠀an⠀object,⠀hesitate⠀at⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀repeat⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀seen⠀before.⠀The⠀action⠀line⠀records⠀what⠀is⠀observable;⠀the⠀meaning⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀preserved⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀setting,⠀without⠀being⠀replaced⠀by⠀voice-over⠀or⠀dialogue.⠀Separately⠀authorized⠀performed⠀words⠀can⠀communicate⠀an⠀association,⠀while⠀the⠀live⠀private⠀channel⠀remains.⠀Reader⠀access⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀give⠀the⠀cast⠀that⠀knowledge;⠀preserve⠀each⠀character's⠀actual⠀sources⠀and⠀capabilities.\n\nUse⠀a⠀cut⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀interval⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀story-weighted⠀expectation⠀beside⠀an⠀actual⠀response.⠀The⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀anticipation⠀to⠀its⠀deflation,⠀from⠀a⠀grand⠀statement⠀to⠀a⠀mundane⠀consequence,⠀or⠀from⠀one⠀character's⠀confident⠀plan⠀to⠀another's⠀unrelated⠀activity.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀juxtaposition,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀punch⠀line⠀delivered⠀by⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Keep⠀the⠀editing⠀separate⠀from⠀physical⠀causes:⠀a⠀cut⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀an⠀event⠀happen,⠀and⠀a⠀held⠀interval⠀does⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀result.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀occurred.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀stage⠀directions⠀that⠀an⠀actor⠀could⠀follow.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀carry⠀the⠀comedy.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀confident⠀statement⠀while⠀struggling⠀with⠀a⠀coat,⠀deliver⠀a⠀formal⠀promise⠀while⠀holding⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object,⠀or⠀explain⠀a⠀grand⠀plan⠀while⠀another⠀person⠀quietly⠀completes⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀they⠀were⠀discussing.⠀The⠀physical⠀business⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀consequential,⠀not⠀decorative.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀or⠀name⠀carry⠀comic⠀history⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀use⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space.⠀Someone⠀may⠀pick⠀up⠀an⠀item⠀that⠀mattered⠀in⠀an⠀earlier⠀account⠀and⠀use⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀mundane⠀purpose,⠀or⠀speak⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀means⠀more⠀to⠀one⠀person⠀than⠀another.⠀The⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀object⠀and⠀hears⠀the⠀line;⠀the⠀private⠀resonance⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀preserved⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀setting⠀without⠀being⠀replaced⠀by⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀Separately⠀authorized⠀performance⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀words⠀and⠀audience;⠀actual⠀character⠀knowledge⠀follows⠀established⠀sources⠀and⠀capabilities,⠀not⠀merely⠀what⠀this⠀scene⠀has⠀said⠀or⠀shown.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀spatial⠀continuity⠀working⠀for⠀the⠀comedy.⠀An⠀entrance⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀plan,⠀an⠀exit⠀can⠀leave⠀a⠀statement⠀hanging,⠀and⠀a⠀pause⠀can⠀let⠀a⠀literal⠀response⠀land.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀prop⠀to⠀pay⠀off⠀or⠀every⠀expectation⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀visible⠀result.⠀Supported⠀offstage⠀events⠀remain⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀being⠀forced⠀onstage.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀simply⠀continuing⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaray::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀permitted⠀mind,⠀braiding⠀perception,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀private⠀words,⠀remembered⠀accounts,⠀and⠀imagined⠀continuations⠀as⠀they⠀actually⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀attention.⠀Keep⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀responsive⠀to⠀that⠀movement:⠀a⠀sudden⠀thought⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀sentence,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀may⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action,⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀sound⠀may⠀pull⠀the⠀mind⠀back⠀from⠀an⠀imagined⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀only⠀imagined.\n\nLet⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀ordinary⠀act⠀suggest⠀a⠀tale-shaped⠀possibility⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀world⠀follow⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀imagine⠀how⠀a⠀promise⠀would⠀play⠀out,⠀recall⠀how⠀a⠀saying⠀once⠀applied,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀resembles⠀a⠀story⠀they⠀know.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀that⠀private⠀expectation⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀occurs.⠀The⠀imagined⠀continuation⠀may⠀settle,⠀persist,⠀or⠀recede.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀it⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀result,⠀a⠀moral,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀return.\n\nKeep⠀real⠀lines⠀entering⠀only⠀as⠀received.⠀Another⠀person's⠀speech⠀arrives⠀as⠀sound⠀and⠀words,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀continuation⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀has⠀already⠀written.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀it⠀accurately,⠀mishear⠀it,⠀or⠀respond⠀from⠀the⠀wrong⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀memory,⠀invention,⠀and⠀present⠀event⠀throughout.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀mind⠀still⠀moving,⠀the⠀expectation⠀unresolved,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀simply⠀attending⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaraz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀exchange⠀as⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀type⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀with⠀careful⠀punctuation⠀or⠀none⠀at⠀all.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀message⠀order⠀legible⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀who⠀is⠀responding⠀to⠀what.\n\nLet⠀a⠀relevant⠀reference⠀carry⠀a⠀shared⠀story⠀into⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀requiring⠀everyone⠀to⠀understand⠀it.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀name,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀object⠀reference⠀that⠀means⠀something⠀particular⠀to⠀them.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀reply⠀literally,⠀recognize⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀pause,⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀topic,⠀or⠀continue⠀with⠀an⠀unrelated⠀practical⠀question.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀actual⠀reception,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀invented⠀typing⠀error⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀delay.⠀Receipt⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀understanding,⠀and⠀a⠀delivered⠀message⠀does⠀not⠀reveal⠀the⠀sender's⠀full⠀motive.\n\nKeep⠀genuine⠀drafts,⠀delivered⠀words,⠀and⠀live⠀private⠀thought⠀distinct⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀interface⠀visibility.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀history;⠀it⠀is⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀recipient's⠀interpretation⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀know⠀through⠀available⠀evidence,⠀communication,⠀or⠀established⠀access;⠀a⠀message⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀prove⠀the⠀sender's⠀full⠀private⠀state.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀message⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀topic⠀resumed,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀simply⠀putting⠀the⠀phone⠀down⠀and⠀continuing⠀their⠀day.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nSet⠀the⠀scene⠀concisely⠀and⠀attribute⠀dialogue⠀clearly,⠀moving⠀among⠀scene-setting,⠀spoken⠀lines,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀moment.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀Let⠀the⠀public⠀exchange⠀establish⠀relevant⠀observable⠀conditions⠀and⠀stated⠀aims.⠀A⠀private⠀aim⠀or⠀expectation⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀channel,⠀and⠀excluded⠀motives⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀supplied.\n\nLet⠀a⠀cue⠀draw⠀authorized⠀attention⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀name,⠀an⠀expression,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀and⠀feel⠀its⠀larger⠀account⠀behind⠀it.⠀Render⠀that⠀resonance⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀full⠀private⠀experience,⠀kept⠀separate⠀from⠀observable⠀facts⠀and⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀know.⠀The⠀cue⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀accurate⠀known⠀account,⠀a⠀private⠀invention,⠀or⠀an⠀uncertain⠀memory.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀continuation⠀meets⠀that⠀resonance:⠀the⠀expected⠀meaning⠀may⠀land⠀literally,⠀miss⠀entirely,⠀or⠀apply⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀what⠀they⠀think⠀or⠀whether⠀they⠀are⠀joking.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀story⠀and⠀say⠀nothing,⠀respond⠀dryly,⠀or⠀continue⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀task.⠀No⠀new⠀image,⠀branching⠀menu,⠀or⠀changed⠀understanding⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀occurred.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacarbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀a⠀relevant⠀earlier⠀name,⠀aim,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀response⠀briefly⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀needs⠀it,⠀preserving⠀the⠀actual⠀history⠀and⠀each⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀earlier⠀investigation⠀or⠀exchange⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀connection.\n\nLet⠀repetition⠀carry⠀comic⠀continuity⠀without⠀promising⠀a⠀completed⠀pattern.⠀A⠀remembered⠀particular⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀intact,⠀change⠀context⠀as⠀circumstances⠀shift,⠀or⠀recede⠀as⠀the⠀characters⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀recognition,⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀applied⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀situation,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀quiet⠀failure⠀of⠀an⠀expected⠀return⠀to⠀matter.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀hidden⠀reveal⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀recurrence⠀feel⠀significant,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀stretch⠀a⠀foretold⠀payoff⠀across⠀installments⠀merely⠀to⠀extend⠀the⠀serial.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀advance⠀the⠀pattern.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment,⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀notice⠀a⠀connection⠀without⠀acting⠀on⠀it.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀No⠀answer,⠀task,⠀joke,⠀or⠀larger⠀story⠀must⠀finish⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀difficult⠀admission,⠀request,⠀or⠀return⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀present⠀need,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀setup⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀punchline.⠀Let⠀the⠀permitted⠀narration⠀explain⠀why⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀that⠀person's⠀own⠀terms,⠀preserving⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀role⠀independently:⠀what⠀they⠀hope,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀withholding,⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀answer⠀would⠀cost⠀them⠀to⠀hear.⠀Keep⠀that⠀reasoning⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀occasion,⠀with⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀sustained⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀nothing⠀is⠀spoken⠀aloud.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀proportion⠀come⠀from⠀placing⠀that⠀inward⠀account⠀beside⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀circumstance.⠀A⠀developed⠀comparison⠀can⠀meet⠀an⠀ordinary⠀fact⠀that⠀fits⠀precisely:⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀answer⠀the⠀actual⠀request,⠀offer⠀the⠀wrong⠀help,⠀continue⠀a⠀household⠀task,⠀or⠀remain⠀unaware⠀of⠀the⠀scale⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀permitted⠀account⠀has⠀given⠀the⠀moment.⠀The⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀elaborated⠀need⠀and⠀any⠀concrete⠀reply⠀can⠀carry⠀comic⠀proportion,⠀including⠀accurate⠀fit⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀mismatch,⠀mockery,⠀correction⠀or⠀relief.⠀The⠀feeling⠀stays⠀sincere⠀while⠀the⠀situation⠀supplies⠀its⠀own⠀smaller⠀or⠀more⠀ordinary⠀scale.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀actual⠀certainty⠀and⠀fallibility⠀of⠀the⠀relevant⠀judgment.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀overestimate⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀notices,⠀misread⠀a⠀considerate⠀answer,⠀or⠀qualify⠀their⠀own⠀comparison⠀as⠀they⠀speak⠀or⠀think.⠀Different⠀relationships⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀says⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀character;⠀their⠀spoken⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀their⠀full⠀thought.⠀Allow⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀to⠀coexist⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession,⠀an⠀apology,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀mood⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀thought,⠀speech,⠀or⠀activity;⠀no⠀new⠀interpretation⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀turn⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nResolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀contribution⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀ownership⠀contract⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀clear⠀attribution.⠀Place⠀it⠀among⠀the⠀actual⠀participants'⠀ongoing⠀aims⠀and⠀activities,⠀leaving⠀human-owned⠀material⠀open⠀where⠀required.⠀NPCs⠀may⠀agree,⠀help⠀precisely,⠀misunderstand⠀for⠀a⠀real⠀reason⠀or⠀remain⠀absorbed⠀in⠀another⠀concern⠀rather⠀than⠀existing⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀clever⠀answer.\n\nLet⠀the⠀permitted⠀narration⠀notice,⠀explain,⠀remember⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀contribution⠀comic⠀scale.⠀Keep⠀that⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀person⠀independent⠀of⠀the⠀participants.⠀An⠀actual⠀spoken⠀explanation⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀practical⠀reply;⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀narrative⠀account⠀can⠀instead⠀sit⠀beside⠀what⠀participants⠀do⠀without⠀their⠀hearing⠀or⠀responding⠀to⠀it.⠀Accurate⠀alignment,⠀sincere⠀help⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀gap⠀can⠀supply⠀timing⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀mismatch⠀or⠀polished⠀payoff.\n\nRender⠀each⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀sensation⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀at⠀the⠀needed⠀extent.⠀Reader⠀exposure⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀communicate⠀this⠀material,⠀and⠀participants⠀retain⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access.⠀Thought⠀may⠀align⠀with⠀speech⠀or⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀during⠀ongoing⠀private⠀experience,⠀speech⠀or⠀work,⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀option,⠀direction⠀or⠀completed⠀reception.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Make⠀the⠀arrangement⠀concrete⠀through⠀who⠀contributes,⠀benefits,⠀waits,⠀decides,⠀or⠀is⠀expected⠀to⠀know⠀the⠀rules.⠀Ground⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀setting,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied,⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀terms⠀shown⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relevant⠀language⠀and⠀social⠀context⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀cast⠀or⠀setting⠀merely⠀to⠀illustrate⠀the⠀tradition.\n\nLet⠀a⠀source-owned⠀explanation⠀or⠀comparison⠀place⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀terms⠀beside⠀its⠀actual⠀use.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀who⠀follows⠀the⠀rule,⠀who⠀works⠀around⠀it,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀costs⠀in⠀time⠀and⠀attention,⠀and⠀may⠀qualify⠀the⠀comparison⠀as⠀they⠀go.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀precision:⠀an⠀accurate⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀arrangement⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀without⠀hypocrisy,⠀corruption,⠀or⠀an⠀exposed⠀hidden⠀cost.⠀Fair⠀cooperation⠀and⠀a⠀plainly⠀stated⠀term⠀are⠀available⠀outcomes.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀explanatory⠀relation.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀feel⠀affection,⠀irritation,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀reduce⠀to⠀a⠀satirical⠀point.⠀Keep⠀the⠀participants'⠀priorities⠀distinct,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀arrangement⠀remain⠀unchanged⠀or⠀the⠀account⠀unfinished⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀No⠀confession,⠀reform,⠀or⠀completed⠀social⠀judgment⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀ordinary⠀aim⠀through⠀concrete⠀effort:⠀weight,⠀wear,⠀cost,⠀grip,⠀movement,⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀physical⠀stakes⠀the⠀scene⠀supports.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions,⠀cutting⠀redundant⠀framing⠀between⠀actions.⠀Keep⠀the⠀rhythm⠀varied;⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀precise⠀movement⠀or⠀a⠀necessary⠀pause,⠀while⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀can⠀land⠀a⠀material⠀fact.⠀Do⠀not⠀shorten⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀thought⠀to⠀fit⠀the⠀style.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀explanation⠀or⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀estimate⠀sit⠀beside⠀what⠀the⠀activity⠀entails.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀aim⠀in⠀developed⠀terms⠀while⠀the⠀work⠀itself⠀is⠀smaller,⠀heavier,⠀slower,⠀or⠀more⠀exact⠀than⠀the⠀account⠀suggests.⠀The⠀comic⠀relation⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀accurate⠀or⠀differing⠀scale:⠀the⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀right⠀about⠀the⠀task⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀working⠀much⠀harder⠀than⠀the⠀explanation⠀implies,⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀may⠀fit⠀the⠀explanation⠀exactly.⠀No⠀dropped⠀object,⠀injury,⠀rough⠀speech,⠀or⠀failed⠀explanation⠀is⠀required.\n\nRetain⠀meaningful⠀reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀at⠀full⠀needed⠀extent.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀speculate,⠀remember⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀within⠀its⠀permissions⠀while⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀activity⠀continues,⠀pauses⠀or⠀stays⠀pending;⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀an⠀embodied⠀participant.⠀Actual⠀duration⠀follows⠀events⠀and⠀attention,⠀not⠀sentence⠀length;⠀an⠀actual⠀interval⠀of⠀thinking⠀or⠀deliberation⠀may⠀take⠀time,⠀independently⠀of⠀how⠀many⠀words⠀render⠀it.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀work⠀or⠀reflection⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀result⠀or⠀changed⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Each⠀record⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀would⠀know⠀at⠀that⠀moment⠀and⠀conceals⠀or⠀selects⠀according⠀to⠀that⠀situation.⠀Keep⠀chronology⠀and⠀delivery⠀clear;⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀may⠀reveal⠀events⠀across⠀entries⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nLet⠀an⠀account⠀explain⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀in⠀the⠀writer's⠀own⠀voice.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀notice,⠀speculate,⠀remember,⠀or⠀continue⠀an⠀activity⠀in⠀the⠀document,⠀and⠀the⠀selected⠀wording⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀comic⠀scale.⠀Where⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀actually⠀appears,⠀it⠀takes⠀up⠀the⠀earlier⠀wording⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀own⠀purpose:⠀it⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀explanation,⠀select⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀from⠀it,⠀take⠀it⠀literally,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀matter⠀unanswered.⠀The⠀humor⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀later⠀document⠀takes⠀up,⠀not⠀from⠀requiring⠀a⠀disagreement,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀correspondence.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀composed⠀record⠀and⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀letter⠀or⠀journal⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀records,⠀not⠀automatically⠀their⠀complete⠀mind.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀document⠀rather⠀than⠀pretending⠀the⠀document⠀is⠀the⠀full⠀thought.⠀Earned⠀warmth⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀records⠀themselves.⠀No⠀reply⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange⠀is⠀mandatory⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSelect⠀an⠀actual⠀offering,⠀helpful⠀act,⠀or⠀small⠀pleasure⠀and⠀spend⠀attention⠀on⠀its⠀personal⠀particulars⠀where⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀know⠀them.⠀Write⠀the⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀the⠀practical⠀care,⠀and⠀the⠀ease⠀it⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀provide⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette⠀that⠀replaces⠀the⠀comedy.⠀Keep⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀explain⠀or⠀elaborate⠀the⠀care⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀terms.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀widen⠀the⠀significance⠀of⠀the⠀kindness,⠀while⠀an⠀accurate⠀practical⠀preference⠀supplies⠀another⠀scale:⠀the⠀recipient⠀may⠀care⠀about⠀the⠀exact⠀temperature,⠀the⠀wrong⠀flavor,⠀the⠀timing,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀consider.⠀The⠀comic⠀relation⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀precise⠀fit⠀or⠀mismatch,⠀not⠀from⠀mocking⠀the⠀affection.⠀The⠀care⠀can⠀be⠀earnest⠀and⠀the⠀explanation⠀sincere⠀without⠀hidden⠀pain⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀about⠀caring⠀too⠀much.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀recipient's⠀actual⠀acceptance,⠀refusal,⠀partial⠀comfort,⠀or⠀indifference⠀open.⠀Full⠀private⠀feeling⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀gratitude,⠀confession,⠀or⠀an⠀improvement⠀in⠀mood.⠀A⠀participant's⠀spoken⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀their⠀whole⠀thought,⠀and⠀different⠀relationships⠀may⠀shape⠀that⠀person's⠀expression.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀role⠀independently⠀rather⠀than⠀assigning⠀them⠀that⠀spoken⠀turn.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀care⠀or⠀conversation;⠀no⠀completed⠀comfort⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀locate⠀an⠀actual⠀statement,⠀offer,⠀or⠀activity⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀history⠀and⠀judgment.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀widen⠀the⠀particular⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀or⠀a⠀qualified⠀comparison,⠀keeping⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀The⠀framing⠀is⠀the⠀style;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.\n\nLet⠀the⠀widened⠀scale⠀give⠀the⠀particular⠀its⠀comic⠀proportion,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀terms⠀when⠀the⠀passage⠀reaches⠀that⠀point.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀aim⠀in⠀developed⠀terms⠀while⠀the⠀actual⠀offer,⠀task,⠀or⠀reply⠀remains⠀smaller,⠀more⠀exact,⠀or⠀differently⠀timed⠀than⠀the⠀account⠀suggests.⠀The⠀estimate⠀may⠀remain⠀accurate,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀may⠀confirm⠀it.⠀The⠀humor⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀framed⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀it⠀returns⠀to,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀required⠀deflation⠀or⠀lesson.\n\nKeep⠀ordinary⠀cast⠀speech⠀distinct⠀from⠀formal⠀narration.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀certainty⠀or⠀fallibility⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀judgment;⠀the⠀comparison⠀may⠀be⠀qualified⠀when⠀warranted⠀or⠀remain⠀accurate⠀and⠀unchanged.⠀A⠀reply⠀boundary⠀may⠀occur⠀inside⠀the⠀explanation,⠀during⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀particular,⠀or⠀in⠀ongoing⠀activity;⠀no⠀completed⠀comic⠀payoff⠀or⠀moral⠀summary⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nLocate⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀actual⠀listeners⠀at⠀the⠀current⠀stage⠀of⠀the⠀occasion,⠀before⠀or⠀during⠀speech⠀as⠀supplied,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀occasion⠀concrete:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀practical⠀or⠀social⠀need⠀keeps⠀them⠀there,⠀and⠀why⠀this⠀person⠀has⠀chosen⠀to⠀tell⠀this⠀incident⠀now.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀entertaining,⠀explaining,⠀delaying,⠀defending,⠀or⠀simply⠀filling⠀a⠀shared⠀interval,⠀but⠀make⠀the⠀reason⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀relevant⠀direct⠀explanation⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀access.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller⠀select⠀an⠀actual⠀remembered⠀incident,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀comparison⠀according⠀to⠀that⠀occasion.⠀A⠀narrator's⠀conversational⠀qualifications—\"the⠀part⠀I⠀always⠀get⠀wrong,\"⠀\"she⠀meant⠀it⠀kindly,⠀I⠀think,\"⠀\"it⠀was⠀not⠀as⠀dramatic⠀as⠀it⠀sounds\"—can⠀supply⠀comic⠀timing⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀teller⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrative⠀voice⠀uses⠀such⠀wording;⠀no⠀narrator⠀biography⠀or⠀habitual⠀error⠀is⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀example.⠀The⠀listeners⠀need⠀not⠀share⠀the⠀teller's⠀estimate.⠀One⠀may⠀recognize⠀the⠀event⠀accurately,⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀interested⠀in⠀a⠀practical⠀detail,⠀and⠀one⠀may⠀miss⠀the⠀point⠀entirely;⠀their⠀different⠀purposes⠀create⠀the⠀friction⠀without⠀requiring⠀anyone⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀punchline.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀role⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀teller,⠀whether⠀the⠀roles⠀coincide⠀or⠀differ.⠀Render⠀full⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀at⠀each⠀permitted⠀level,⠀separately⠀from⠀performed⠀telling;⠀reader⠀disclosure⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀inform⠀listeners,⠀whose⠀actual⠀sources⠀and⠀access⠀remain⠀available.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀participant,⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀spoken⠀performance⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀still⠀carry⠀private⠀thought,⠀memory,⠀or⠀qualification⠀that⠀the⠀listeners⠀do⠀not⠀hear.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀the⠀teller,⠀preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀aloud⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀while⠀speaking.⠀Earlier⠀participants⠀in⠀the⠀recounted⠀incident⠀knew⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀then;⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀have⠀learned⠀more⠀since,⠀and⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀inserted⠀into⠀the⠀remembered⠀moment.\n\nLet⠀actual⠀listener⠀attention⠀shape⠀the⠀live⠀occasion⠀where⠀it⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀telling,⠀including⠀steady⠀interest⠀or⠀silence;⠀interruptions,⠀questions⠀and⠀visible⠀inattention⠀remain⠀contingent⠀rather⠀than⠀required.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀teller⠀keeps⠀circling⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀certifies⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀remain⠀underway⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary,⠀with⠀a⠀listener's⠀attention⠀shifting⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀thought⠀still⠀developing,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀effect⠀or⠀changed⠀audience.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀developmental⠀realism:⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀present⠀practice⠀or⠀interpretation⠀carries⠀the⠀trace⠀of⠀how⠀they⠀actually⠀acquired⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀explains,⠀performs,⠀or⠀defends⠀something,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀supply⠀the⠀concrete⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀that⠀shaped⠀the⠀understanding—a⠀first⠀attempt,⠀a⠀source⠀they⠀trusted,⠀a⠀mistake⠀they⠀still⠀remember,⠀or⠀a⠀competence⠀they⠀built⠀without⠀formal⠀instruction.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀lesson⠀that⠀corrected⠀them.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀modest⠀origin⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀confidence,⠀or⠀between⠀the⠀elaborate⠀origin⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀casual⠀use.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀learned⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing⠀thoroughly,⠀learned⠀the⠀right⠀thing⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀reason,⠀or⠀learned⠀something⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀applies⠀and⠀still⠀apply⠀it⠀with⠀complete⠀sincerity.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀explain⠀what⠀was⠀retained,⠀what⠀was⠀misunderstood,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀uncertain,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀present⠀correction⠀or⠀a⠀milestone⠀of⠀growth.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀conversational⠀voice⠀carry⠀the⠀developmental⠀explanation:⠀\"I⠀learned⠀it⠀from⠀my⠀aunt,⠀who⠀learned⠀it⠀from⠀a⠀pamphlet,\"⠀or⠀\"the⠀first⠀time⠀I⠀tried,⠀I⠀assumed⠀the⠀hard⠀part⠀was⠀the⠀part⠀everyone⠀watched.\"⠀Such⠀first-person⠀wording⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀participant's⠀quoted⠀account⠀or⠀a⠀narrator⠀whose⠀actual⠀role⠀supports⠀that⠀experience;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀narrator⠀biography⠀from⠀the⠀example.⠀The⠀explanation⠀can⠀arrive⠀before,⠀during,⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀present⠀action,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀qualified⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀reconstruction⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀objective⠀history.⠀Preserve⠀unknown⠀history⠀where⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀unknown,⠀allowing⠀newly⠀introduced⠀material⠀only⠀within⠀active⠀authorship⠀and⠀existing⠀facts;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀mentor⠀or⠀formative⠀scene⠀merely⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀pattern.\n\nFull⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀mid-attempt,⠀mid-explanation,⠀or⠀mid-recollection,⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀practice⠀still⠀underway⠀and⠀the⠀earlier⠀learning⠀still⠀being⠀sorted⠀into⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀taught⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene's⠀comedy⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀an⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀practical⠀aim,⠀including⠀precise⠀fit⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀collision.⠀The⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀old⠀permission,⠀a⠀maintained⠀custom,⠀a⠀room⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀purpose⠀no⠀one⠀now⠀performs,⠀or⠀a⠀title⠀that⠀still⠀opens⠀doors.⠀The⠀present⠀aim⠀may⠀be⠀ordinary:⠀getting⠀a⠀document⠀signed,⠀finding⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀sit,⠀borrowing⠀a⠀tool,⠀asking⠀for⠀an⠀exception.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀make⠀both⠀sides⠀concrete⠀and⠀consequential⠀without⠀inventing⠀supernatural⠀powers⠀or⠀secret⠀corruption.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀candid⠀explanation⠀to⠀make⠀their⠀actual⠀relation⠀legible,⠀whether⠀distance⠀or⠀accurate⠀alignment.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀matters⠀to⠀them,⠀why⠀they⠀still⠀keep⠀it,⠀or⠀why⠀they⠀never⠀questioned⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀explanation⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀need⠀makes⠀it⠀disproportionate.⠀A⠀supported⠀qualification⠀or⠀an⠀accurate⠀comparison⠀can⠀give⠀comic⠀timing.⠀Firsthand⠀wording⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀participant⠀account⠀or⠀a⠀narrator⠀whose⠀supplied⠀role⠀permits⠀it,⠀for⠀example:⠀\"the⠀room⠀was⠀built⠀for⠀a⠀ceremony⠀that⠀took⠀four⠀hours;⠀I⠀needed⠀it⠀for⠀ten⠀minutes,\"⠀or⠀\"the⠀permission⠀had⠀outlived⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀granted⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀door⠀still⠀recognized⠀the⠀name.\"\n\nKeep⠀the⠀place's⠀material⠀detail⠀emotionally⠀legible.⠀The⠀worn⠀threshold,⠀the⠀locked⠀cabinet,⠀the⠀portrait⠀no⠀one⠀moves,⠀or⠀the⠀modern⠀light⠀switch⠀installed⠀beside⠀the⠀old⠀sconce⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀history⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀symbol⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀decoded.⠀Direct⠀feeling⠀remains⠀available:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀genuinely⠀moved⠀by⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀and⠀still⠀need⠀it⠀to⠀work⠀for⠀a⠀present,⠀smaller⠀purpose.⠀Competent⠀use⠀and⠀sincere⠀attachment⠀are⠀as⠀valid⠀as⠀resentment⠀or⠀mockery.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀but⠀no⠀unmasking⠀is⠀required;⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀remain⠀formal,⠀affectionate,⠀or⠀distracted⠀throughout.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀encounter⠀still⠀underway,⠀the⠀present⠀need⠀still⠀unmet,⠀and⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀still⠀exerting⠀its⠀particular⠀weight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀philosophical⠀inward⠀narration:⠀an⠀actual⠀remark,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀remembered⠀concern⠀enters⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀and⠀develops⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀reasons⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling.⠀Keep⠀the⠀personal⠀inquiry⠀and⠀its⠀connections⠀legible⠀without⠀deleting⠀actual⠀associations,⠀interruptions⠀or⠀fragmented⠀feeling.⠀A⠀sustained⠀line⠀of⠀consideration⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀passage,⠀but⠀the⠀person's⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀uniformly⠀linear⠀or⠀polished.\n\nLet⠀a⠀comparison⠀expand⠀to⠀comic⠀scale⠀without⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀collapse.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀observation—\"this⠀queue⠀is⠀like⠀a⠀family⠀argument\"—and⠀then⠀follow⠀the⠀comparison⠀further⠀than⠀the⠀situation⠀requires:⠀the⠀queue⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀elders,⠀its⠀own⠀silences,⠀its⠀own⠀rules⠀about⠀who⠀may⠀speak.⠀The⠀exact⠀present⠀circumstance⠀supplies⠀the⠀proportion:⠀the⠀queue⠀is⠀still⠀a⠀queue,⠀the⠀errand⠀is⠀still⠀an⠀errand,⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀inward⠀elaboration⠀runs⠀beside⠀that⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it.\n\nThe⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀qualified⠀as⠀it⠀develops:⠀\"not⠀exactly⠀like⠀a⠀family⠀argument;⠀in⠀a⠀family⠀argument⠀someone⠀eventually⠀admits⠀they⠀are⠀hungry.\"⠀Accurate⠀recognition⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀remain⠀available.⠀The⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀reach⠀a⠀new⠀insight,⠀refute⠀themselves,⠀or⠀complete⠀an⠀argument.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀sheer⠀sincerity⠀and⠀extent⠀of⠀the⠀inward⠀inquiry⠀applied⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀matter.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀thought's⠀actual⠀timing.⠀It⠀may⠀precede⠀speech,⠀follow⠀it,⠀or⠀run⠀through⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀mark⠀that⠀relation⠀clearly.⠀No⠀outward⠀decision,⠀apology,⠀or⠀completed⠀argument⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary;⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀working⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀continues⠀around⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀reflective⠀prose⠀miscellany:⠀distinct,⠀source-owned⠀observations⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion⠀arranged⠀in⠀sequence,⠀each⠀opening⠀into⠀explanation,⠀memory,⠀comparison,⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀single⠀lesson⠀to⠀link⠀them.⠀The⠀comic⠀resonance⠀comes⠀from⠀their⠀adjacency—what⠀one⠀observation⠀sits⠀beside⠀and⠀what⠀returns⠀later⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀theme.\n\nSelect⠀observations⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀or⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention.⠀One⠀passage⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀colleague⠀arranges⠀papers;⠀another⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀different⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀meant⠀something⠀else;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀always⠀checks⠀the⠀window⠀before⠀sitting⠀down.⠀Keep⠀observed⠀facts⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀selecting⠀mind's⠀interpretations,⠀preserving⠀each⠀account's⠀actual⠀accuracy,⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀error.⠀The⠀humor⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀selecting⠀mind,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀punchline⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀item.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀conversational⠀voice⠀carry⠀the⠀movement⠀between⠀items:⠀\"I⠀noticed⠀the⠀papers⠀first,⠀because⠀she⠀always⠀does⠀that⠀when⠀she⠀is⠀pretending⠀to⠀listen,\"⠀or⠀\"the⠀window⠀was⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀the⠀one⠀in⠀my⠀grandmother's⠀kitchen,⠀which⠀is⠀not⠀relevant⠀except⠀that⠀I⠀thought⠀of⠀it.\"⠀A⠀qualification⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀precisely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀honest⠀about⠀its⠀own⠀irrelevance.\n\nMark⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀clearly⠀without⠀imposing⠀dated⠀diary⠀entries⠀or⠀inventing⠀a⠀participant⠀narrator.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀was⠀not⠀present,⠀ground⠀the⠀observation⠀in⠀actual⠀sources⠀or⠀narrator⠀permissions⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀witness⠀or⠀requiring⠀physical⠀attendance⠀for⠀otherwise⠀authorized⠀knowledge.⠀Full⠀inward⠀experience⠀may⠀develop⠀within⠀a⠀single⠀item⠀and⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀across⠀replies;⠀the⠀miscellany⠀need⠀not⠀reach⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀reflection⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling:⠀arrange⠀actual⠀accounts⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀event⠀or⠀object⠀across⠀clearly⠀marked⠀times⠀and⠀sources,⠀with⠀each⠀explanation⠀in⠀its⠀owner's⠀register.⠀The⠀accounts⠀need⠀not⠀contradict;⠀the⠀comic⠀effect⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀their⠀different⠀placements,⠀purposes,⠀and⠀scales.\n\nA⠀later⠀practical⠀use⠀may⠀sit⠀beside⠀an⠀earlier⠀comparison.⠀One⠀person⠀remembers⠀the⠀event⠀as⠀the⠀day⠀they⠀learned⠀something;⠀another⠀remembers⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀day⠀they⠀lost⠀a⠀particular⠀object;⠀a⠀third,⠀years⠀later,⠀uses⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀for⠀an⠀entirely⠀ordinary⠀purpose⠀and⠀explains⠀it⠀without⠀reference⠀to⠀either⠀memory.⠀Simultaneous⠀concerns⠀may⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀with⠀different⠀or⠀aligned⠀meanings:⠀one⠀participant⠀is⠀worried⠀about⠀the⠀cost,⠀another⠀about⠀the⠀impression,⠀another⠀about⠀a⠀detail⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀noticed.\n\nMark⠀each⠀account's⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀clearly⠀in⠀the⠀prose—\"years⠀later,⠀she⠀would⠀say,\"⠀\"at⠀the⠀time,⠀he⠀understood⠀it⠀as,\"⠀\"the⠀record⠀from⠀that⠀week⠀shows\"—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀who⠀knew⠀what⠀when.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀facts⠀and⠀reliability:⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀retroactively⠀grant⠀that⠀knowledge⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀participant.⠀Documents⠀remain⠀composed⠀accounts⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀authors⠀and⠀purposes,⠀distinct⠀from⠀full⠀private⠀experience.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀complete⠀voice⠀roster⠀or⠀a⠀reconciled⠀verdict⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀reply.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀with⠀one⠀account⠀still⠀unfolding⠀or⠀another⠀still⠀to⠀come.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀range⠀and⠀the⠀grounds⠀of⠀any⠀summary,⠀including⠀knowledge⠀that⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀beyond⠀the⠀participants.⠀A⠀concluding⠀position⠀does⠀not⠀gain⠀authority⠀merely⠀by⠀coming⠀last,⠀but⠀genuine⠀narrator⠀knowledge⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀reduced⠀to⠀another⠀fallible⠀participant⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀aim⠀is⠀currently⠀underway,⠀using⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀the⠀reader⠀actually⠀needs.⠀Introduce⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀through⠀supported⠀narration,⠀observation,⠀or⠀speech—a⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀term⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀noticing,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀demonstrate⠀a⠀mechanism⠀through⠀use,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀already⠀informed⠀characters⠀to⠀ask⠀questions⠀merely⠀to⠀deliver⠀exposition.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀someone⠀moves,⠀when⠀the⠀group⠀shifts⠀location,⠀or⠀when⠀attention⠀turns⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀it⠀without⠀rereading.⠀Use⠀clear⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀at⠀actual⠀shifts⠀of⠀speaker,⠀action,⠀or⠀private⠀response,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀fixed⠀rhythm.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀scale⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀precise⠀practical⠀explanation⠀or⠀comparison⠀placed⠀beside⠀the⠀scene's⠀visible⠀facts.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀an⠀ordinary⠀procedure⠀with⠀disproportionate⠀care,⠀or⠀compare⠀a⠀small⠀object⠀to⠀something⠀much⠀larger⠀while⠀remaining⠀entirely⠀sincere.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀qualify⠀the⠀comparison⠀conversationally:⠀\"the⠀machine⠀was⠀the⠀size⠀of⠀a⠀suitcase⠀and⠀sounded⠀like⠀a⠀much⠀larger⠀machine⠀that⠀had⠀given⠀up.\"⠀The⠀humor⠀is⠀legible⠀because⠀the⠀scene's⠀spatial⠀and⠀practical⠀details⠀are⠀already⠀clear;⠀the⠀comparison⠀has⠀something⠀exact⠀to⠀be⠀measured⠀against.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀surprise,⠀joke,⠀or⠀reaction⠀beat⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀paragraph.⠀Full⠀inward⠀experience⠀retains⠀its⠀extent,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀setup⠀still⠀underway,⠀attention⠀still⠀held,⠀or⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀still⠀developing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀comparison⠀begin⠀in⠀something⠀the⠀narrator⠀actually⠀notices⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀occasion:⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀has⠀just⠀used.⠀Follow⠀that⠀image⠀through⠀the⠀paragraph⠀by⠀sound⠀and⠀syntax⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀stacking⠀new⠀adjectives.⠀Let⠀a⠀word⠀echo⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀clause,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀repeated⠀vowel⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀qualification,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀habit⠀of⠀explaining⠀or⠀qualifying⠀the⠀comparison⠀remain⠀audible⠀inside⠀the⠀shaped⠀prose.\n\nUse⠀the⠀developed⠀image⠀to⠀give⠀an⠀ordinary⠀aim⠀or⠀blind⠀spot⠀comic⠀proportion.⠀The⠀proportion⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀image's⠀persistence,⠀from⠀its⠀exact⠀mismatch⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀scale,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀sincere⠀attempt⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀fit.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀comparison⠀to⠀fail⠀or⠀the⠀speaker⠀to⠀be⠀corrected.⠀An⠀accurate⠀comparison⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀too⠀elaborate⠀for⠀the⠀occasion,⠀because⠀it⠀returns⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀plain⠀fact⠀beside⠀it⠀is⠀suddenly⠀very⠀small.⠀Place⠀that⠀plain⠀material⠀in⠀actual⠀sequence:⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀syntactic⠀turn,⠀a⠀short⠀direct⠀clause⠀naming⠀the⠀real⠀object,⠀cost,⠀or⠀task⠀can⠀land⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀without⠀deflating⠀the⠀feeling⠀the⠀image⠀carried.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀image's⠀emotional⠀meaning⠀available.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀genuinely⠀fond⠀of⠀the⠀thing⠀compared,⠀genuinely⠀worried,⠀or⠀genuinely⠀trying⠀to⠀understand.⠀The⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀mock⠀that⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀different⠀speakers⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀registers;⠀the⠀lyrical⠀development⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀prose,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀character's⠀dialogue.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀image's⠀comic⠀use,⠀including⠀reasoning⠀that⠀continues⠀after⠀the⠀comparison⠀has⠀done⠀its⠀work.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀that⠀continued⠀attention⠀or⠀activity⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀clever⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀open⠀a⠀particular⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀through⠀an⠀authorized⠀memory⠀or⠀account.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀remembering⠀person:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀render,⠀explain⠀or⠀qualify⠀the⠀recollection⠀within⠀their⠀actual⠀access⠀without⠀acquiring⠀a⠀participant⠀biography.⠀Keep⠀what⠀the⠀occasion⠀meant⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀then⠀distinct⠀from⠀retained⠀knowledge,⠀later⠀understanding⠀and⠀present⠀interpretation.⠀Newly⠀introduced⠀recollection⠀remains⠀available⠀within⠀active⠀authorship⠀and⠀established⠀history.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀remembered⠀account⠀beside⠀the⠀exact⠀present⠀circumstance⠀to⠀give⠀it⠀comic⠀proportion.⠀An⠀explanation⠀may⠀once⠀have⠀seemed⠀elaborate,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀accurately,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀may⠀preserve⠀a⠀personal⠀importance⠀another⠀participant⠀does⠀not⠀share.⠀The⠀source-owned⠀comparison⠀can⠀sustain⠀its⠀meaning⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀change,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀earlier⠀understanding⠀false⠀or⠀requiring⠀loss,⠀regret⠀or⠀self-mockery.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀still⠀care⠀deeply⠀while⠀the⠀current⠀scale⠀is⠀funny.\n\nLet⠀any⠀actual⠀present⠀pleasure,⠀direct⠀feeling⠀or⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀coexist⠀with⠀remembrance.⠀Give⠀authorized⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀sensation⠀their⠀needed⠀extent⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀change⠀no⠀visible⠀action;⠀performed⠀reminiscence⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀nonspoken⠀experience.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀reflection,⠀speech⠀or⠀activity,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀comparison,⠀new⠀interpretation,⠀resumed⠀task⠀or⠀final⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀through⠀the⠀modern⠀memoir⠀route.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀composing⠀the⠀account,⠀for⠀what⠀occasion⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀when⠀the⠀composition⠀occurs⠀relative⠀to⠀the⠀events.⠀The⠀memoirist⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀separate⠀composing⠀figure;⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀access⠀independently⠀where⠀they⠀differ.⠀Let⠀the⠀memoir's⠀purpose⠀shape⠀selection⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀passage.\n\nLet⠀the⠀memoirist⠀explain⠀an⠀earlier⠀aim,⠀affection,⠀or⠀comparison⠀in⠀their⠀current⠀register.⠀They⠀may⠀retain⠀the⠀knowledge⠀they⠀had⠀then,⠀add⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀later,⠀and⠀mark⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀do⠀not⠀know.⠀Use⠀accurate⠀qualification⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀needs⠀it⠀without⠀requiring⠀self-exposure⠀or⠀forbidding⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀actually⠀chooses⠀to⠀disclose:⠀the⠀writer⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀believed,⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀actually⠀said,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀does⠀not⠀show.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀memoirist's⠀present⠀selection⠀and⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀foolish.⠀An⠀elaborate⠀plan⠀remembered⠀beside⠀its⠀actual⠀small⠀occasion,⠀a⠀comparison⠀that⠀once⠀seemed⠀exact,⠀or⠀a⠀habit⠀explained⠀with⠀too⠀much⠀care⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀while⠀the⠀account⠀remains⠀candid.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀composed⠀memoir⠀distinct⠀from⠀full⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀memoir⠀records⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chooses⠀to⠀record;⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀may⠀still⠀supply⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀that⠀the⠀memoir⠀does⠀not⠀include.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀the⠀memoir⠀form⠀to⠀replace⠀that⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀the⠀memoir's⠀ongoing⠀composition,⠀with⠀the⠀writer⠀still⠀selecting⠀or⠀qualifying,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀valuation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀preserve⠀the⠀people,⠀their⠀aim,⠀and⠀the⠀causes⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀occasion.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀place⠀an⠀actual⠀conversational⠀estimate⠀beside⠀an⠀exact⠀circumstance:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀thought⠀the⠀task⠀would⠀involve,⠀what⠀someone⠀said⠀it⠀would⠀cost,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀comparison⠀implied,⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀concrete⠀fact.⠀Let⠀the⠀actual⠀fit⠀or⠀difference⠀between⠀estimate⠀and⠀fact⠀carry⠀comic⠀proportion⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀gap.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀redundant⠀framing⠀around⠀that⠀relation;⠀the⠀two⠀clauses⠀can⠀stand⠀next⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀proportion.\n\nRetain⠀the⠀explanation⠀or⠀qualification⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀estimate's⠀actual⠀meaning⠀legible.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator's⠀comparison⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀memory,⠀habit,⠀or⠀relationship,⠀include⠀that⠀in⠀plain⠀terms⠀rather⠀than⠀leaving⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀inference.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀thought-length⠀quota⠀or⠀require⠀every⠀inward⠀movement⠀to⠀be⠀compressed⠀into⠀implication.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain⠀conversationally⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀while⠀the⠀account⠀keeps⠀actual⠀activity⠀recoverable;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀narrator⠀a⠀bodily⠀participant⠀unless⠀that⠀is⠀their⠀supplied⠀role.\n\nKeep⠀speakers⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers.⠀The⠀minimalist⠀treatment⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀character's⠀dialogue.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀at⠀their⠀actual⠀extent.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀continued⠀attention⠀or⠀activity⠀without⠀a⠀polished⠀closing⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀sustained⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀people⠀are⠀doing,⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀explanation⠀or⠀comparison⠀arise⠀from⠀an⠀actual⠀source⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀something⠀someone⠀just⠀said,⠀an⠀object⠀being⠀handled,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion.⠀The⠀explanation⠀may⠀be⠀accurate.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀mistaken⠀claim⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀correction⠀to⠀produce⠀the⠀comedy.\n\nLet⠀comic⠀timing⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀ongoing⠀activity.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀offer⠀an⠀elaborate⠀account⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀continues⠀unchanged,⠀or⠀may⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀just⠀as⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀gives⠀a⠀plain⠀reply⠀that⠀fits⠀it⠀exactly.⠀A⠀practical⠀reply,⠀an⠀accurate⠀shared⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀continuing⠀ordinary⠀task⠀can⠀supply⠀the⠀comic⠀scale.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀earnest⠀feeling⠀may⠀remain⠀present⠀inside⠀that⠀timing;⠀the⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀mock⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀narrator⠀role⠀and⠀participant⠀knowledge⠀separately.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀motive⠀or⠀private⠀reasoning⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Keep⠀spoken⠀and⠀private⠀content⠀distinct⠀according⠀to⠀each⠀character's⠀actual⠀relation⠀and⠀habit.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀ongoing⠀thought⠀or⠀activity,⠀with⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀moving,⠀without⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀direction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀the⠀occasion⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀participants.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀pair⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀history⠀the⠀material⠀does⠀not⠀establish.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀existing⠀bond⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀do,⠀say,⠀remember,⠀or⠀avoid.⠀A⠀familiar⠀explanation⠀may⠀return⠀where⠀the⠀participants⠀would⠀actually⠀know⠀it;⠀a⠀first-time⠀kindness⠀may⠀fit⠀the⠀relationship⠀with⠀earnest⠀accuracy.⠀Let⠀the⠀comic⠀scale⠀come⠀from⠀that⠀fit:⠀a⠀participant⠀who⠀actually⠀knows⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀habit⠀responds⠀before⠀the⠀explanation⠀finishes,⠀or⠀the⠀first-time⠀gesture⠀is⠀received⠀with⠀exact,⠀source-owned⠀seriousness.\n\nThe⠀same⠀person⠀may⠀phrase⠀a⠀thought⠀differently⠀or⠀identically⠀with⠀different⠀people⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀real⠀relation.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀explain⠀more⠀to⠀one⠀person,⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀for⠀another,⠀or⠀say⠀nothing⠀at⠀all.⠀No⠀hidden⠀feeling⠀or⠀strategic⠀concealment⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀difference⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀ordinary⠀familiarity,⠀respect,⠀irritation,⠀or⠀the⠀simple⠀fact⠀that⠀one⠀person⠀already⠀knows⠀the⠀background.⠀Keep⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀person's⠀spoken⠀reply⠀is⠀short⠀or⠀different⠀from⠀the⠀thought,⠀preserving⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀access⠀independently.\n\nGive⠀relevant⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀comfort⠀its⠀full⠀private⠀extent.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀feel⠀warmly⠀toward⠀someone⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀remains⠀funny,⠀or⠀may⠀resent⠀a⠀familiar⠀interruption⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀acknowledgment,⠀a⠀payoff,⠀or⠀a⠀status⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀occasion⠀still⠀underway⠀and⠀the⠀bond's⠀particular⠀promise⠀still⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀an⠀actual⠀deed⠀or⠀exchange⠀its⠀retold⠀place⠀through⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀and⠀recurring⠀sourced⠀wording.⠀The⠀declaration⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀establish⠀its⠀actual⠀scope,⠀confirming⠀or⠀qualifying⠀it⠀as⠀supported:⠀the⠀conditions⠀under⠀which⠀the⠀deed⠀was⠀done,⠀the⠀practical⠀concern⠀that⠀interrupted⠀it,⠀or⠀the⠀qualification⠀the⠀person⠀involved⠀would⠀add.\n\nLet⠀the⠀conversational⠀account⠀sit⠀inside⠀the⠀retold⠀cadence.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀deed's⠀conditions,⠀qualify⠀its⠀designation,⠀or⠀remember⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀praise⠀false⠀or⠀supplying⠀a⠀collective⠀reputation.⠀Comic⠀proportion⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀remembered⠀designation⠀and⠀the⠀deed,⠀including⠀precise⠀fit⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀gap:⠀someone⠀is⠀called⠀dependable⠀for⠀a⠀task⠀they⠀complained⠀through,⠀or⠀an⠀elaborate⠀phrase⠀attaches⠀to⠀a⠀very⠀small⠀act.⠀The⠀designation⠀may⠀remain⠀accurate;⠀the⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀wrong.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀or⠀keep⠀its⠀meaning⠀stable⠀when⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence.⠀Keep⠀earlier⠀motive,⠀later⠀account,⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀present⠀explanation⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀establish⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀continuity⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀differences.⠀A⠀remembered⠀designation⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀deed⠀still⠀underway⠀or⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀being⠀qualified,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀valuation⠀or⠀a⠀fresh⠀opening⠀formula.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀participant⠀state⠀a⠀general⠀claim⠀about⠀the⠀current⠀aim,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀habit⠀in⠀plain⠀conversational⠀terms:⠀what⠀usually⠀happens,⠀what⠀someone⠀is⠀like,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀task⠀ought⠀to⠀go.⠀Then⠀move⠀to⠀one⠀concrete⠀observed⠀or⠀remembered⠀case⠀that⠀tests⠀the⠀claim.⠀The⠀case⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀specific⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀a⠀present⠀attempt,⠀or⠀an⠀explicitly⠀hypothetical⠀instance⠀the⠀narrator⠀offers⠀as⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀thinking.⠀Keep⠀the⠀case's⠀grounds⠀legible:⠀what⠀was⠀tried,⠀what⠀was⠀noticed,⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.\n\nLet⠀the⠀examination⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀manuscript⠀voice's⠀ordinary⠀movement⠀of⠀speculation,⠀qualification,⠀and⠀practical⠀detail.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀case⠀seems⠀to⠀support⠀the⠀claim,⠀notice⠀a⠀particular⠀that⠀complicates⠀it,⠀or⠀remember⠀another⠀occasion⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀comparison.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀contrary⠀evidence⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀reversal.⠀The⠀claim⠀may⠀remain⠀confirmed⠀and⠀unchanged,⠀survive⠀with⠀a⠀qualification,⠀stay⠀provisional⠀or⠀be⠀set⠀aside⠀without⠀being⠀disproved.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀general⠀statement⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀case,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀the⠀claim⠀collapse.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀terms⠀when⠀the⠀movement⠀reaches⠀that⠀point:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀restate⠀the⠀claim⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀qualification,⠀acknowledge⠀what⠀the⠀case⠀did⠀not⠀settle,⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀account⠀follow⠀actual⠀continued⠀activity⠀while⠀the⠀claim⠀remains⠀open;⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀its⠀bodily⠀participant.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀argument.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀feeling,⠀attention⠀to⠀another⠀person,⠀or⠀practical⠀concern⠀can⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀examination⠀without⠀being⠀reduced⠀to⠀evidence.⠀The⠀case⠀or⠀return⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world⠀consequential⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀aim⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀involved⠀still⠀matter;⠀the⠀essayistic⠀scaffold⠀organizes⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀a⠀detached⠀lecture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀actually⠀changes.⠀Let⠀a⠀conversational⠀explanation⠀or⠀comparison⠀sit⠀beside⠀real⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀business:⠀someone⠀continues⠀handling⠀an⠀object,⠀another⠀person⠀enters⠀or⠀leaves,⠀a⠀task⠀proceeds⠀while⠀the⠀speaker⠀talks.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀spoken⠀account⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀block⠀shows,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀required⠀mismatch⠀or⠀reaction⠀shot.⠀The⠀action⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀account,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀simply⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀explanation⠀runs.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀temporal⠀relations.⠀Actual⠀spoken⠀delivery⠀takes⠀whatever⠀time⠀its⠀words,⠀pace⠀and⠀pauses⠀involve,⠀possibly⠀alongside⠀other⠀activity.⠀Narration⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀that⠀duration,⠀and⠀a⠀short⠀action⠀block⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀sustained⠀interval.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀Render⠀authorized⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀as⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀channel,⠀distinct⠀from⠀separately⠀permitted⠀voice-over.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀private⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀interval⠀ends.⠀A⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀speaker⠀still⠀explaining⠀can⠀all⠀close⠀the⠀response⠀without⠀a⠀payoff,⠀cut,⠀or⠀reaction⠀shot.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀camera⠀commands⠀beyond⠀what⠀the⠀selected⠀sequence⠀needs.⠀Keep⠀the⠀people⠀pursuing⠀recognizable⠀aims⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots;⠀the⠀screenplay⠀form⠀organizes⠀presentation,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀wit⠀cycle.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nBlock⠀real⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀objects,⠀distances,⠀and⠀continuing⠀tasks⠀around⠀speaker-attributed⠀lines.⠀Let⠀a⠀conversational⠀explanation⠀or⠀practical⠀comparison⠀meet⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do⠀on⠀the⠀shared⠀stage:⠀someone⠀reaches⠀for⠀an⠀object,⠀another⠀person⠀holds⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀task⠀continues⠀while⠀the⠀speaker⠀talks.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀spoken⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀business,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀required⠀pause,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀laugh⠀cue.⠀Coordination⠀and⠀sincere⠀help⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀comic⠀as⠀friction⠀when⠀they⠀meet⠀the⠀explanation⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀scale⠀or⠀the⠀right⠀moment.\n\nKeep⠀pauses⠀and⠀gestures⠀meaningful⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀context⠀and⠀permitted⠀knowledge⠀support⠀them.⠀A⠀pause⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀signal⠀realization,⠀guilt,⠀or⠀withheld⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀each⠀speaker's⠀lines⠀fit⠀their⠀relationship⠀and⠀immediate⠀task;⠀different⠀characters⠀can⠀be⠀witty,⠀literal,⠀dry,⠀exuberant,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀joke.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀performers⠀of⠀wit.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀nonspoken⠀channel.⠀An⠀authorized⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀separate⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀audience;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀private⠀thought.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀thought,⠀speech,⠀or⠀work⠀without⠀a⠀conclusion,⠀laugh⠀cue,⠀or⠀completed⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world⠀consequential⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀aim⠀to⠀remain⠀playable.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nBraid⠀actual⠀perception,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀remembered⠀phrases,⠀and⠀private⠀words⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀follow⠀a⠀comparison⠀as⠀it⠀arises:⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀may⠀call⠀up⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀may⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀a⠀speculation⠀may⠀continue⠀into⠀a⠀qualification⠀or⠀turn⠀aside⠀when⠀another⠀perception⠀interrupts.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀itself,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀forced⠀failed⠀analogy⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀thought⠀at⠀every⠀interval.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀expand⠀an⠀ordinary⠀concern,⠀return⠀to⠀it,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unresolved.\n\nDistinguish⠀present⠀fact,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀fantasy⠀while⠀allowing⠀actual⠀physical⠀activity⠀alongside⠀inward⠀attention.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀real⠀object,⠀remember⠀a⠀past⠀occasion,⠀imagine⠀a⠀possible⠀outcome,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand⠀without⠀the⠀prose⠀losing⠀orientation.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀markers⠀to⠀show⠀which⠀is⠀which.⠀Meaningful⠀feeling⠀and⠀reasoning⠀keep⠀their⠀extent;⠀prose⠀length⠀alone⠀neither⠀consumes⠀time⠀nor⠀forces⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀action.⠀A⠀long⠀associative⠀passage⠀can⠀occupy⠀a⠀brief⠀interval,⠀and⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀can⠀accompany⠀sustained⠀work.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀particular⠀mind's⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots.⠀The⠀authorized⠀person⠀may⠀explain⠀inwardly,⠀speculate,⠀qualify⠀or⠀miss⠀an⠀implication⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀state;⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀access⠀independently.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀association⠀witty⠀or⠀every⠀perception⠀a⠀setup.⠀The⠀movement⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀circumstances⠀recoverable⠀while⠀attention⠀develops⠀or⠀wanders,⠀including⠀reverie⠀that⠀changes⠀no⠀outward⠀option;⠀the⠀associative⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀renewed⠀focus⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀shaped⠀by⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀and⠀current⠀relationships.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀comparison⠀at⠀length,⠀send⠀a⠀direct⠀answer,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀draft⠀unfinished;⠀another⠀may⠀reply⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀word,⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀recognizes⠀the⠀comparison⠀accurately.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀composed,⠀what⠀is⠀sent,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀selects⠀to⠀answer,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀required⠀misunderstanding.⠀A⠀real⠀reply⠀can⠀recognize⠀the⠀explanation⠀accurately⠀or⠀pick⠀out⠀a⠀different⠀detail.\n\nMark⠀composed,⠀sent,⠀received⠀and⠀understood⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀authored⠀sequence;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀supply⠀subtext⠀or⠀display⠀the⠀format.⠀A⠀delay,⠀edit,⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀attachment⠀appears⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Full⠀nonspoken⠀thought⠀is⠀separate⠀from⠀drafts⠀and⠀transmitted⠀words;⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀remain⠀pending⠀without⠀an⠀edit,⠀clarification,⠀or⠀completed⠀joke.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀go⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀draft⠀may⠀stay⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀arrive⠀after⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Keep⠀each⠀person's⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots⠀intact.⠀The⠀world⠀remains⠀consequential⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀aim⠀to⠀matter;⠀the⠀transcript⠀organizes⠀presentation,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀wit⠀cycle.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nChoose⠀a⠀background,⠀object,⠀or⠀expression⠀reference⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀and⠀orient⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀focal⠀prose⠀around⠀it.⠀The⠀cue⠀anchors⠀the⠀moment:⠀a⠀narrator⠀or⠀permitted⠀mind⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀it⠀suggests,⠀explain⠀why⠀it⠀matters,⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀it⠀brings⠀to⠀mind.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀illustrated⠀reference⠀and⠀the⠀conversational⠀explanation,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀the⠀image⠀proof⠀of⠀a⠀motive.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀attract⠀attention,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀someone⠀thinks⠀or⠀intends.\n\nLet⠀actual⠀attention⠀move⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀cue-thought-dialogue⠀order.⠀The⠀focal⠀mind⠀may⠀stay⠀with⠀the⠀cue⠀while⠀someone⠀speaks,⠀meet⠀a⠀practical⠀response,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀cue⠀after⠀an⠀exchange.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀supplied⠀ownership;⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀reveals⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀menus,⠀images,⠀or⠀final⠀reactions⠀merely⠀from⠀the⠀style.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀and⠀the⠀world⠀consequential.⠀The⠀illustrated⠀scene⠀organizes⠀presentation,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀wit⠀cycle⠀or⠀a⠀romance⠀route.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀cue⠀still⠀present,⠀the⠀explanation⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀activity⠀continuing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacasbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nRecover⠀the⠀current⠀people,⠀aim,⠀and⠀known⠀context⠀only⠀as⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀present⠀installment.⠀A⠀comparison⠀or⠀explanation⠀may⠀recur⠀unchanged,⠀be⠀accurately⠀recognized,⠀or⠀receive⠀a⠀supported⠀qualification⠀without⠀resetting⠀knowledge⠀or⠀inventing⠀a⠀fresh⠀problem.⠀The⠀comic⠀through-line⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀exact⠀recurrence,⠀stable⠀emphasis⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀scale⠀when⠀a⠀familiar⠀term⠀or⠀habit⠀returns,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀polished⠀payoff⠀in⠀every⠀installment.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nLet⠀earnest⠀affection,⠀practical⠀learning,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀continue⠀alongside⠀humor.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain,⠀speculate,⠀remember,⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀while⠀the⠀activity⠀already⠀underway⠀continues.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀no⠀option.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀accompany⠀a⠀task⠀without⠀altering⠀its⠀course;⠀a⠀feeling⠀may⠀remain⠀unspoken⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀cliffhanger.\n\nKeep⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue⠀legible⠀across⠀replies.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀within⠀setup,⠀thought,⠀or⠀ongoing⠀activity⠀without⠀a⠀hook,⠀result,⠀or⠀changed⠀direction.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀The⠀serial⠀form⠀organizes⠀continuity,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀reversal⠀or⠀completion⠀at⠀every⠀installment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacataa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLet⠀a⠀character's⠀need⠀enter⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀they⠀choose⠀for⠀it:⠀a⠀qualification,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀a⠀label⠀they⠀contest,⠀or⠀a⠀definition⠀they⠀offer⠀before⠀anyone⠀asks.⠀Use⠀the⠀scope⠀of⠀those⠀words⠀meeting⠀the⠀actual⠀situation⠀for⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀trivial⠀or⠀the⠀speaker⠀ridiculous.⠀A⠀request⠀can⠀be⠀too⠀narrow,⠀too⠀broad⠀or⠀precisely⠀apt;⠀an⠀exact⠀fit⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀friction,⠀and⠀actual⠀foolishness⠀keeps⠀its⠀supported⠀place.\n\nArrange⠀the⠀real⠀reception⠀for⠀comic⠀timing.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀agree⠀accurately,⠀take⠀the⠀wording⠀literally,⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀term⠀while⠀accepting⠀the⠀need,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀request⠀pending⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀verbal⠀cleverness⠀into⠀authority:⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀phrases⠀something⠀well⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀win,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀phrases⠀it⠀badly⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀lose.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀verbal⠀habits⠀distinct,⠀and⠀let⠀some⠀characters⠀be⠀plain,⠀halting,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀wordplay.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀beneath⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀that⠀admitting⠀this⠀need⠀matters,⠀that⠀the⠀wording⠀was⠀chosen⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀survivable,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀phrase⠀carries⠀private⠀history.⠀That⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀hear⠀and⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀performs.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward⠀or⠀easy,⠀and⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀strain⠀or⠀relieve⠀it⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀experience.⠀No⠀compulsory⠀self-deception,⠀changed⠀bond,⠀victorious⠀objection,⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀need⠀is⠀still⠀exposed⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀still⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nKeep⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀clear⠀movement⠀between⠀speakers.⠀When⠀a⠀term,⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀or⠀correction⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀show⠀what⠀each⠀participant⠀actually⠀does⠀with⠀it:⠀one⠀may⠀accept⠀it,⠀one⠀may⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀aim,⠀one⠀may⠀ignore⠀it⠀while⠀pursuing⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀comedy⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀meeting⠀those⠀independent⠀purposes,⠀not⠀from⠀everyone⠀joining⠀the⠀same⠀verbal⠀contest.\n\nGive⠀NPCs⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀aims⠀and⠀verbal⠀densities.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀literal,⠀dry,⠀exuberant,⠀or⠀indifferent⠀to⠀the⠀wordplay,⠀and⠀their⠀response⠀should⠀follow⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀the⠀joke.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀well-phrased⠀objection⠀or⠀definition⠀grant⠀authority⠀over⠀the⠀scene;⠀what⠀actually⠀happens⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀participants'⠀choices⠀and⠀the⠀established⠀world,⠀not⠀on⠀who⠀speaks⠀most⠀cleverly.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀player⠀ownership,⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀interiority.⠀Private⠀thought,⠀feeling,⠀and⠀reasoning⠀remain⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀contract,⠀and⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀automatically⠀available⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀continue⠀through⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary;⠀no⠀completed⠀debate,⠀question,⠀or⠀changed⠀term⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling.⠀Situate⠀each⠀occasion⠀in⠀direct,⠀readable⠀prose,⠀keeping⠀place⠀and⠀activity⠀legible⠀alongside⠀the⠀verbal⠀encounter⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀causal⠀order.⠀Link⠀a⠀known⠀term,⠀label,⠀or⠀formulation⠀to⠀its⠀present⠀use⠀when⠀it⠀returns:⠀a⠀designation⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀episode⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀applied⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀object,⠀a⠀different⠀person,⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀under⠀changed⠀circumstances.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comedy⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀application⠀of⠀the⠀recurring⠀wording⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion.⠀A⠀literal⠀use⠀may⠀be⠀unexpectedly⠀apt,⠀or⠀a⠀speaker⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀term⠀now⠀covers⠀something⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀intend.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀anyone⠀foolish⠀simply⠀for⠀using⠀the⠀term;⠀the⠀fit⠀between⠀words⠀and⠀concrete⠀situation⠀can⠀carry⠀humor⠀without⠀humiliation,⠀while⠀any⠀actual⠀embarrassment⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀verbal⠀habits⠀distinct,⠀and⠀let⠀some⠀characters⠀use⠀plain⠀or⠀practical⠀language.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀original⠀wording,⠀its⠀source,⠀and⠀the⠀real⠀permissions⠀of⠀each⠀encounter.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀said⠀earlier⠀remains⠀what⠀they⠀said,⠀and⠀later⠀uses⠀do⠀not⠀silently⠀rewrite⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀renamed⠀role,⠀a⠀new⠀objection,⠀a⠀complete⠀episode,⠀or⠀an⠀imported⠀martial⠀setting.⠀The⠀active⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀occasion⠀still⠀available⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀pattern.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀contact,⠀effort,⠀and⠀sequence⠀readable.⠀Connect⠀a⠀definition⠀or⠀objection⠀with⠀its⠀actual⠀material⠀use⠀in⠀causal⠀order,⠀without⠀making⠀thought⠀brief⠀or⠀accelerating⠀events:⠀the⠀term⠀names⠀a⠀task,⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀condition,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀shows⠀what⠀happens⠀when⠀that⠀wording⠀meets⠀the⠀physical⠀act.⠀An⠀exact⠀success⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀rhythm⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀supported⠀mismatch;⠀the⠀fit⠀between⠀words⠀and⠀concrete⠀operation⠀can⠀carry⠀comedy⠀whether⠀the⠀act⠀succeeds⠀or⠀actually⠀fails,⠀without⠀forcing⠀either⠀result.\n\nKeep⠀wordplay⠀distinct⠀from⠀practical⠀means.⠀A⠀well-phrased⠀definition⠀grants⠀no⠀material⠀effect,⠀permission,⠀or⠀authority⠀by⠀itself;⠀any⠀actual⠀power⠀speech⠀has⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀world,⠀consent,⠀or⠀authority,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀must⠀preserve⠀those⠀sources.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes⠀remain⠀real⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀encounter⠀into⠀injury⠀or⠀survival⠀pressure.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀term⠀and⠀the⠀act,⠀or⠀feel⠀the⠀strain⠀of⠀the⠀work,⠀without⠀a⠀sentence⠀quota⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀tell⠀replacing⠀inward⠀experience.⠀Vary⠀the⠀rhythm:⠀make⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀economical⠀and⠀give⠀meaningful⠀reasoning,⠀feeling⠀or⠀association⠀its⠀actual⠀extent,⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀the⠀experience⠀takes.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀When⠀a⠀definition,⠀correction,⠀or⠀carefully⠀scoped⠀promise⠀appears⠀in⠀one⠀record,⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀take⠀up⠀its⠀exact⠀wording:⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀term,⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀case,⠀annotate⠀it,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀it⠀competently.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀fit⠀between⠀original⠀phrasing⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀document's⠀actual⠀use⠀for⠀comedy,⠀whether⠀the⠀first⠀author⠀was⠀accurate⠀or⠀actually⠀mistaken;⠀no⠀error⠀is⠀required.\n\nMark⠀original⠀text,⠀later⠀revision,⠀and⠀recipients⠀distinctly.⠀What⠀a⠀document⠀said⠀at⠀its⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀remains⠀what⠀it⠀said;⠀a⠀later⠀annotation⠀or⠀reply⠀does⠀not⠀silently⠀change⠀the⠀earlier⠀terms.⠀Keep⠀each⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀concealment⠀tied⠀to⠀its⠀author's⠀situation,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀artifacts.⠀A⠀letter,⠀report,⠀or⠀journal⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀records,⠀not⠀their⠀complete⠀live⠀mind;⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀contract.⠀No⠀contradiction⠀quota,⠀invented⠀file,⠀or⠀completed⠀correspondence⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀sequence⠀may⠀continue⠀through⠀a⠀document⠀left⠀unfinished⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀still⠀pending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacataf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀actual⠀preferences,⠀kindness,⠀and⠀enjoyment.⠀When⠀a⠀term⠀for⠀help,⠀a⠀familiar⠀objection,⠀or⠀a⠀playful⠀qualification⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀let⠀it⠀meet⠀the⠀precise⠀care⠀being⠀offered:⠀a⠀lovingly⠀literal⠀response⠀to⠀a⠀request,⠀an⠀apt⠀known⠀joke⠀between⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀correction⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀care⠀fit⠀better.⠀Make⠀the⠀exchange's⠀particularity⠀carry⠀comedy⠀without⠀requiring⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀failed⠀kindness,⠀and⠀preserve⠀any⠀such⠀event⠀that⠀actually⠀occurs.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀person's⠀register,⠀capacity,⠀and⠀willingness.⠀Neither⠀the⠀recipient⠀nor⠀the⠀helper⠀must⠀perform⠀wit;⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀plain,⠀tired,⠀or⠀simply⠀enjoying⠀the⠀moment⠀without⠀joining⠀the⠀wordplay.⠀Affection⠀remains⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀or⠀privacy⠀can⠀stay⠀intact.\n\nDevelop⠀meaningful⠀private⠀feeling⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀goes⠀unnoticed.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀exactness⠀of⠀the⠀care,⠀the⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀or⠀their⠀own⠀relief⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀No⠀guaranteed⠀gratitude,⠀corrected⠀wording,⠀or⠀dependence⠀is⠀supplied;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀ease.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀frame⠀a⠀definition,⠀label,⠀or⠀objection⠀through⠀the⠀history⠀and⠀social⠀context⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Use⠀available⠀provenance,⠀prior⠀applications⠀or⠀the⠀current⠀user's⠀apparent⠀meaning⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀term;⠀its⠀origin⠀or⠀full⠀history⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀known,⠀and⠀an⠀inferred⠀intention⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀fact.⠀Keep⠀each⠀actual⠀version⠀and⠀source⠀legible:⠀a⠀quoted⠀phrase,⠀a⠀remembered⠀use,⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀remain⠀distinct,⠀and⠀later⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀silently⠀revise⠀what⠀was⠀said.\n\nRelate⠀the⠀wording⠀to⠀conduct⠀or⠀authorized⠀private⠀association⠀where⠀the⠀narrative⠀supports⠀it.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀composed⠀account⠀meeting⠀the⠀exact⠀current⠀use:⠀a⠀term⠀with⠀a⠀long⠀history⠀may⠀now⠀apply⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀domestic⠀act,⠀or⠀a⠀carefully⠀scoped⠀definition⠀may⠀cover⠀more⠀than⠀its⠀speaker⠀intended.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀cast's⠀speech⠀uniformly⠀elaborate;⠀formal⠀narration⠀is⠀the⠀style,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀that⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register.\n\nLet⠀thought⠀or⠀contextual⠀development⠀continue⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀without⠀an⠀outward⠀return,⠀a⠀superior⠀definition,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀joke.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀weighing⠀the⠀term's⠀scope,⠀or⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀pause⠀while⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀access⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nSet⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀event:⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom,⠀on⠀what⠀occasion,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀the⠀account⠀to⠀do⠀for⠀that⠀audience.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀pursued⠀through⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀telling⠀itself—securing⠀patience,⠀winning⠀approval,⠀delaying⠀a⠀decision,⠀or⠀making⠀a⠀companion⠀look⠀a⠀certain⠀way—without⠀making⠀the⠀audience⠀passive.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller⠀introduce⠀a⠀definition,⠀label,⠀or⠀qualification⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account.⠀Keep⠀its⠀exact⠀wording⠀visible.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀supported⠀gap⠀between⠀that⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀listeners'⠀actual⠀use⠀for⠀comic⠀timing:⠀one⠀may⠀accept⠀it⠀too⠀literally,⠀one⠀may⠀apply⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀one⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate,⠀and⠀one⠀may⠀simply⠀attend⠀to⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀telling⠀continues.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀reject⠀the⠀framing⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀be⠀exposed.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀listener's⠀independent⠀knowledge⠀and⠀attention.⠀A⠀listener⠀can⠀recognize⠀the⠀teller's⠀intended⠀effect⠀and⠀still⠀respond⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀habit⠀or⠀stake.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀speaks,⠀let⠀their⠀own⠀verbal⠀habits⠀shape⠀the⠀interruption,⠀objection,⠀or⠀acceptance.⠀Keep⠀a⠀correction's⠀actual⠀effect⠀and⠀the⠀original⠀wording⠀distinct;⠀it⠀may⠀clarify⠀a⠀familiar⠀expectation,⠀change⠀one⠀or⠀leave⠀reception⠀pending.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀actual⠀activity⠀available⠀around⠀the⠀embedded⠀account.⠀People⠀may⠀eat,⠀work,⠀wait,⠀or⠀watch⠀the⠀door⠀while⠀the⠀story⠀proceeds.⠀Where⠀the⠀sequence⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀frame,⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀may⠀connect⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀the⠀audience's⠀actual⠀concerns.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀also⠀arrive⠀during⠀the⠀tale⠀or⠀private⠀experience,⠀without⠀a⠀return⠀or⠀completed⠀lesson.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀shifted⠀application,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀anything.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀telling⠀grant⠀the⠀teller⠀authority⠀over⠀the⠀listeners.⠀A⠀vivid⠀account⠀may⠀affect⠀speech⠀or⠀agreement⠀through⠀actual⠀reception.⠀Do⠀not⠀reset⠀knowledge⠀or⠀compel⠀belief⠀merely⠀for⠀the⠀telling,⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀actual⠀authority⠀or⠀world⠀power⠀that⠀supports⠀an⠀effect.⠀Preserve⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀for⠀teller⠀and⠀listeners⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀form,⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀performed⠀aloud.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modernist⠀absurdist⠀construction⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀method.⠀Let⠀a⠀speaker⠀make⠀a⠀claim⠀or⠀definition⠀whose⠀own⠀stated⠀conditions,⠀exceptions⠀and⠀qualifications⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀into⠀a⠀literal⠀application⠀the⠀speaker⠀may⠀understand⠀and⠀intend⠀or⠀find⠀unexpected.⠀Keep⠀the⠀construction⠀visible:⠀the⠀wording⠀should⠀fold⠀back⠀on⠀itself⠀through⠀a⠀literal⠀application,⠀a⠀self-including⠀rule,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀revision⠀that⠀continues,⠀clarifies⠀or⠀resolves⠀the⠀underlying⠀issue.\n\nPlace⠀that⠀construction⠀beside⠀actual⠀conduct.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀declare⠀a⠀rule⠀and⠀then⠀perform⠀the⠀exact⠀action⠀the⠀rule⠀appears⠀to⠀forbid,⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀blind⠀spot,⠀deliberate⠀exception,⠀hypocrisy⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀reason⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀imposed⠀flaw.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀definition⠀and⠀act⠀on⠀it⠀with⠀perfect⠀consistency,⠀producing⠀a⠀result⠀that⠀is⠀comic⠀because⠀the⠀terms⠀were⠀honored⠀rather⠀than⠀broken.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀speaker⠀to⠀lose⠀the⠀argument⠀or⠀recognize⠀the⠀absurdity.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀life⠀intact.⠀Preserve⠀people's⠀actual⠀understanding,⠀choices⠀and⠀recognizable⠀aims,⠀including⠀competent⠀use,⠀refusal⠀or⠀supported⠀misunderstanding⠀rather⠀than⠀imposed⠀general⠀confusion.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀verbal⠀construction⠀and⠀its⠀encounter⠀with⠀behavior,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀confusion⠀imposed⠀on⠀the⠀world.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀competent⠀at⠀a⠀task⠀while⠀remaining⠀unable⠀to⠀see⠀what⠀their⠀own⠀sentence⠀commits⠀them⠀to.\n\nLet⠀different⠀speakers⠀have⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits.⠀One⠀may⠀revise⠀a⠀definition⠀repeatedly,⠀another⠀may⠀quote⠀it⠀back⠀exactly,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀ignore⠀the⠀wording⠀and⠀answer⠀the⠀practical⠀need⠀behind⠀it.⠀Their⠀responses⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀blind⠀spots⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀shared⠀philosophical⠀register.\n\nPreserve⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀form.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀privately⠀notice⠀a⠀contradiction⠀without⠀announcing⠀it,⠀or⠀may⠀fail⠀to⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see.⠀Verbal⠀construction⠀alone⠀grants⠀no⠀new⠀power;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀authority,⠀consent⠀and⠀established⠀world⠀powers⠀through⠀which⠀speech⠀can⠀have⠀consequences.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacataj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nGive⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀its⠀authority⠀material⠀presence⠀within⠀the⠀actual⠀course⠀of⠀the⠀encounter,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀verbal⠀contest⠀or⠀a⠀setting-first⠀sequence.⠀Let⠀the⠀room,⠀building,⠀or⠀institution⠀show⠀its⠀age⠀and⠀its⠀current⠀use:⠀a⠀formal⠀title⠀carved⠀over⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀now⠀opens⠀onto⠀a⠀storage⠀area,⠀a⠀procedure⠀inherited⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀era⠀and⠀still⠀followed⠀for⠀reasons⠀no⠀one⠀states,⠀an⠀invitation⠀whose⠀wording⠀promises⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion⠀can⠀hold.\n\nLet⠀a⠀spoken⠀or⠀written⠀term⠀set⠀an⠀expectation.⠀A⠀title,⠀invitation,⠀or⠀carefully⠀scoped⠀obligation⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀when⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀meets⠀a⠀private⠀preference,⠀a⠀practical⠀need,⠀or⠀a⠀habit⠀the⠀term's⠀original⠀authority⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate.⠀Keep⠀the⠀wordplay⠀from⠀becoming⠀permission:⠀a⠀clever⠀reading⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀rule⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access,⠀consent,⠀or⠀authority⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀gives⠀it.⠀Actual⠀powers,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀consequences⠀keep⠀their⠀real⠀effects.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀public⠀wording⠀and⠀private⠀desire.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀formal⠀term⠀in⠀company⠀while⠀privately⠀applying⠀it⠀to⠀something⠀smaller,⠀warmer,⠀or⠀more⠀immediate.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀fit⠀between⠀that⠀private⠀application⠀and⠀the⠀official⠀scope⠀of⠀the⠀word.⠀Let⠀atmosphere⠀and⠀inward⠀desire⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀weight⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀practical⠀payoff⠀or⠀a⠀confession.\n\nKeep⠀cast⠀voices⠀distinct.⠀One⠀speaker⠀may⠀treat⠀the⠀old⠀term⠀with⠀careful⠀literalness,⠀another⠀with⠀affectionate⠀misuse,⠀another⠀with⠀open⠀indifference.⠀Their⠀verbal⠀habits⠀should⠀follow⠀their⠀own⠀stakes⠀in⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀its⠀authority,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀gothic⠀register.⠀Social⠀presentation⠀may⠀change⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀voluntary⠀or⠀involuntary⠀context,⠀and⠀may⠀remain⠀intact;⠀no⠀scheduled⠀unmasking⠀is⠀required.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀corruption,⠀unmasking,⠀or⠀a⠀tiny⠀errand⠀as⠀the⠀comic⠀engine.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀remain⠀comic⠀while⠀the⠀authority⠀stays⠀intact,⠀the⠀task⠀stays⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀preference⠀remains⠀private.⠀Preserve⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀form,⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀anyone⠀says⠀aloud.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀lyric⠀and⠀philosophical⠀inwardness⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀method.⠀Choose⠀an⠀actual⠀meaningful⠀term⠀from⠀the⠀scene—a⠀word⠀someone⠀has⠀spoken,⠀a⠀designation⠀the⠀narrator⠀carries,⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀category⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀permitted⠀person—and⠀let⠀it⠀gather⠀memories,⠀sensations,⠀and⠀questions⠀in⠀that⠀person's⠀own⠀diction.⠀The⠀reflection⠀should⠀stay⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀general⠀meditation.\n\nLet⠀a⠀plain⠀detail⠀or⠀private⠀qualification⠀meet⠀the⠀term's⠀apparent⠀scope.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀aptness⠀or⠀disproportion:⠀a⠀grand⠀word⠀arriving⠀beside⠀a⠀small⠀remembered⠀object,⠀a⠀formal⠀category⠀brushing⠀against⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀a⠀definition⠀that⠀fits⠀one⠀moment⠀exactly⠀and⠀another⠀moment⠀not⠀at⠀all.⠀The⠀thought⠀remains⠀personally⠀significant⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀fit⠀is⠀funny.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀better⠀definition⠀or⠀resolve⠀the⠀disproportion.\n\nPreserve⠀literal⠀facts⠀and⠀actual⠀conviction.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀believe⠀the⠀term⠀sincerely⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀its⠀comic⠀scope.⠀Fallible⠀uncertainty⠀is⠀available:⠀the⠀permitted⠀person⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀memory,⠀qualify⠀a⠀claim⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀word⠀meant⠀something⠀different⠀earlier,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀that⠀person.⠀These⠀revisions⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀mind's⠀habits,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀compulsory⠀self-correction⠀beat.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀inward⠀experience⠀specific⠀to⠀its⠀permitted⠀mind⠀and⠀render⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀authorized⠀person,⠀distance⠀and⠀presentation.⠀If⠀the⠀permitted⠀person⠀is⠀practical,⠀the⠀reflection⠀may⠀move⠀through⠀tasks⠀and⠀objects;⠀if⠀they⠀are⠀given⠀to⠀comparison,⠀the⠀associations⠀may⠀unfold⠀more⠀elaborately.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀a⠀philosopher.⠀The⠀reflection⠀requires⠀no⠀maxim,⠀public⠀debate,⠀creed,⠀paradox,⠀or⠀outward⠀response,⠀though⠀actual⠀spoken⠀expressions⠀remain⠀available⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for⠀them.\n\nPreserve⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀form.⠀The⠀inward⠀account⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀anyone⠀else⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀visible⠀action⠀to⠀justify⠀its⠀presence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀early-modern⠀comic/theatrical⠀telling⠀in⠀prose.⠀Treat⠀each⠀spoken⠀label,⠀qualification,⠀or⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀performed⠀event⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀timing.⠀Let⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀arrive⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀and⠀others⠀are⠀already⠀doing:⠀a⠀grand⠀term⠀delivered⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀carrying⠀a⠀box,⠀a⠀careful⠀correction⠀offered⠀to⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀has⠀already⠀left⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀definition⠀completed⠀just⠀as⠀the⠀object⠀it⠀names⠀falls⠀over.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀wording⠀beside⠀supported⠀movement⠀and⠀ongoing⠀activity.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀literal⠀fit⠀or⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀the⠀spoken⠀term⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀occurring⠀beside⠀it.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀gratuitous⠀commentary⠀break⠀while⠀preserving⠀actual⠀meaningful⠀narration;⠀let⠀action⠀continue⠀through⠀speech⠀or⠀pause⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀real⠀priorities⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀A⠀task⠀may⠀be⠀completed,⠀abandoned,⠀or⠀resumed⠀later⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀punchline.\n\nKeep⠀individual⠀diction⠀distinct.⠀One⠀speaker⠀may⠀use⠀elaborate⠀formal⠀phrasing,⠀another⠀a⠀single⠀flat⠀word,⠀another⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀revises⠀only⠀one⠀small⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀original⠀claim.⠀Their⠀verbal⠀habits⠀should⠀follow⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀blind⠀spots⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀shared⠀theatrical⠀register.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀archaic⠀speech⠀or⠀a⠀stage-personality⠀cast⠀onto⠀every⠀character.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀form.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀privately⠀notice⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀a⠀word⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀without⠀announcing⠀it,⠀or⠀may⠀fail⠀to⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀render⠀that⠀inward⠀awareness⠀in⠀the⠀permitted⠀presentation⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.\n\nLet⠀the⠀prose⠀carry⠀the⠀timing⠀through⠀sentence⠀order⠀and⠀paragraph⠀breaks.⠀A⠀delayed⠀qualification⠀can⠀land⠀after⠀the⠀action⠀has⠀already⠀moved⠀on;⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀arrive⠀too⠀late⠀for⠀its⠀intended⠀effect.⠀These⠀are⠀available⠀comic⠀tools,⠀not⠀compulsory⠀beats.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀business⠀unfinished⠀and⠀the⠀term⠀still⠀hanging⠀in⠀the⠀air.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀around⠀an⠀actual⠀encounter,⠀marking⠀each⠀actual⠀source⠀and⠀version⠀clearly,⠀including⠀original⠀speech,⠀repetition⠀or⠀later⠀revision⠀where⠀present,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀all⠀three.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀original⠀wording⠀from⠀a⠀later⠀attribution⠀or⠀correction.\n\nLet⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀do⠀the⠀comic⠀work.⠀Two⠀speakers⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀same⠀term⠀with⠀compatible⠀but⠀different⠀scopes:⠀one⠀means⠀the⠀formal⠀category,⠀another⠀means⠀the⠀particular⠀object⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀them,⠀a⠀third⠀means⠀what⠀the⠀term⠀implied⠀years⠀ago.⠀Use⠀exact⠀attributed⠀applications⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀for⠀comedy⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀liar⠀or⠀competing⠀realities.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀events⠀and⠀supplied⠀world⠀rules,⠀with⠀accounts⠀allowed⠀to⠀agree,⠀differ⠀or⠀contain⠀supported⠀error.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀attributed⠀voice⠀distinct.⠀A⠀quoted⠀account⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀its⠀actual⠀speaker:⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀precise,⠀another⠀expansive,⠀another⠀given⠀to⠀small⠀corrections⠀that⠀change⠀the⠀emphasis⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀facts.⠀Their⠀verbal⠀habits⠀should⠀follow⠀their⠀own⠀stakes⠀in⠀the⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀uniform⠀polyphonic⠀register.\n\nPreserve⠀prior⠀understanding⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀public⠀accounts.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀known⠀something⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀that⠀no⠀later⠀account⠀includes,⠀or⠀may⠀privately⠀revise⠀their⠀own⠀memory⠀without⠀telling⠀anyone.⠀The⠀nonlinear⠀arrangement⠀can⠀move⠀across⠀time,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀knew⠀or⠀make⠀later⠀knowledge⠀retroactive.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀minimum⠀number⠀of⠀voices⠀per⠀response⠀or⠀new⠀information⠀on⠀every⠀return.⠀A⠀single⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀enough⠀when⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀exact⠀phrase⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀use.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved,⠀with⠀the⠀formulation⠀still⠀circulating⠀among⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀heard⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀scene⠀cleanly:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀concern⠀is⠀already⠀underway.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow,⠀with⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀separating⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀who⠀is⠀doing⠀what⠀while⠀the⠀words⠀are⠀exchanged.\n\nIntroduce⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀term⠀or⠀definition⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀wording⠀recoverable⠀where⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀reception;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀respond⠀from⠀already⠀established⠀knowledge⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀quotation⠀preceding⠀every⠀response⠀or⠀private⠀reaction.⠀A⠀literal⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀without⠀being⠀a⠀quip:⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀apply⠀the⠀term⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀object,⠀another⠀may⠀accept⠀it⠀with⠀perfect⠀seriousness,⠀another⠀may⠀revise⠀only⠀one⠀small⠀part⠀of⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀response⠀follow⠀from⠀that⠀character's⠀habits⠀and⠀current⠀aim⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀compulsory⠀joke.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀scope.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀later⠀repeats⠀or⠀revises⠀the⠀term,⠀keep⠀the⠀original⠀visible⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀changed.⠀A⠀correction⠀may⠀change⠀an⠀expectation⠀or⠀clarify⠀what⠀was⠀already⠀understood;⠀preserve⠀the⠀original⠀wording⠀and⠀actual⠀reception.\n\nGive⠀explanation,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀feeling⠀their⠀needed⠀extent.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀or⠀extended⠀according⠀to⠀who⠀they⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀term⠀means⠀to⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀reaction⠀rotation,⠀a⠀short-thought⠀quota,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀hook.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀definition⠀still⠀in⠀play⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀still⠀underway.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator⠀and⠀cast⠀age⠀intact.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀hyperverbal⠀or⠀impose⠀a⠀register⠀because⠀of⠀age;⠀preserve⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀capacity.⠀Preserve⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀form,⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀anyone⠀says⠀aloud.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀scene-born⠀phrase⠀develop⠀through⠀rhythm,⠀recurrence,⠀and⠀authorized⠀association.⠀When⠀a⠀speaker⠀defines,⠀objects⠀to,⠀or⠀revises⠀a⠀term,⠀preserve⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀so⠀the⠀paragraph⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀its⠀sound⠀or⠀image⠀without⠀changing⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀claimed.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀may⠀gather⠀comic⠀resonance⠀because⠀a⠀later⠀literal⠀use⠀fits⠀its⠀figurative⠀weight⠀exactly,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀plain⠀act⠀beside⠀it⠀reveals⠀a⠀real⠀discrepancy.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀collapse⠀into⠀a⠀punchline;⠀it⠀may⠀remain⠀meaningful⠀or⠀unfinished.\n\nDistinguish⠀sound⠀resemblance,⠀figurative⠀meaning,⠀and⠀literal⠀claims.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀drawn⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀for⠀its⠀shape⠀while⠀another⠀person⠀hears⠀only⠀its⠀practical⠀scope,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀follow⠀either⠀attention⠀without⠀making⠀everyone⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀figurative⠀register.⠀Let⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀or⠀concrete⠀detail⠀meet⠀the⠀resonant⠀phrase⠀with⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀visible⠀mismatch.⠀That⠀meeting⠀can⠀carry⠀comedy⠀without⠀a⠀correction,⠀while⠀an⠀actual⠀revision⠀that⠀improves⠀the⠀wording⠀retains⠀its⠀supported⠀place.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀diction⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀intact.⠀Lyrical⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration's⠀syntax⠀and⠀attention,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀universal⠀habit⠀of⠀wit.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀literal,⠀dry,⠀exuberant,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀image.⠀Preserve⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀scene's⠀actual⠀duration;⠀an⠀associative⠀paragraph⠀can⠀unfold⠀while⠀ordinary⠀business⠀continues,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀still⠀in⠀motion⠀rather⠀than⠀completed⠀or⠀returned⠀outward.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nConnect⠀present⠀wording⠀to⠀a⠀known⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀through⠀actual⠀recollection⠀or⠀association.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase⠀returns⠀in⠀actual⠀speech⠀or⠀private⠀recollection,⠀use⠀the⠀speaker's⠀or⠀focal⠀character's⠀available⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀including⠀what⠀remains⠀familiar⠀or⠀has⠀actually⠀changed.⠀Its⠀first⠀use⠀and⠀full⠀history⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀known.⠀Keep⠀the⠀original⠀phrase⠀and⠀any⠀later⠀gloss⠀distinct.⠀The⠀comedy⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀unchanged⠀joke⠀still⠀fitting⠀its⠀old⠀object,⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀exact⠀use⠀now⠀meeting⠀a⠀different⠀practical⠀situation,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀new⠀proportion⠀the⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀acquires⠀beside⠀present⠀life.\n\nPreserve⠀genuine⠀former⠀pleasure⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀weight⠀of⠀unfinished⠀attachment.⠀A⠀remembered⠀formulation⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀regret⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀past⠀understanding.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀clearly⠀or⠀partially,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀that⠀memory⠀for⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀actually⠀does.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀loss,⠀a⠀revised⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀belated⠀realization⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀return⠀meaningful.⠀The⠀earlier⠀attachment⠀remains⠀what⠀it⠀was,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀use⠀is⠀comic.\n\nLet⠀the⠀reflective⠀movement⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀teller's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction.⠀A⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀may⠀prompt⠀recollection,⠀but⠀the⠀recollection⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀completed⠀judgment.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀still⠀carrying⠀its⠀old⠀weight⠀beside⠀its⠀current⠀use,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀occasion⠀available⠀without⠀announcing⠀impermanence⠀or⠀requiring⠀a⠀better⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacataq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modern⠀memoir⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀includes⠀a⠀composed⠀retrospective⠀account,⠀attribute⠀its⠀author,⠀intended⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀independent⠀of⠀the⠀memoirist:⠀the⠀story⠀may⠀quote⠀or⠀summarize⠀the⠀memoir,⠀but⠀the⠀memoirist's⠀later⠀knowledge⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀become⠀the⠀present⠀characters'⠀knowledge,⠀though⠀actual⠀reading,⠀reports⠀or⠀other⠀supported⠀access⠀can⠀convey⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀an⠀original⠀definition,⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀then⠀knew,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀quotation⠀or⠀revision.⠀An⠀unchanged⠀accurate⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀comic⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀correction,⠀because⠀the⠀later⠀composition⠀can⠀frame⠀the⠀earlier⠀term⠀without⠀altering⠀its⠀original⠀scope.\n\nLet⠀the⠀memoirist's⠀register⠀and⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀remain⠀available⠀beyond⠀the⠀artifact.⠀The⠀memoir⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀document,⠀not⠀a⠀complete⠀record⠀of⠀the⠀writer's⠀mind.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀moves⠀from⠀the⠀memoir⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀preserve⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes.⠀A⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀or⠀contradiction⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀can⠀meet⠀the⠀memoir's⠀earlier⠀wording⠀with⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀real⠀discrepancy,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀can⠀carry⠀comedy⠀without⠀a⠀belated⠀confession⠀or⠀superior⠀understanding,⠀while⠀actual⠀disclosure⠀or⠀later⠀knowledge⠀keeps⠀its⠀place.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀exile,⠀completed⠀retrospective⠀judgment,⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀relationship⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀memoir⠀meaningful.⠀The⠀memoirist⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀uncertain⠀about⠀it,⠀or⠀simply⠀recording⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀purpose.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀still⠀underway⠀and⠀the⠀memoir's⠀relation⠀to⠀it⠀unresolved,⠀leaving⠀the⠀later⠀account⠀available⠀without⠀rewriting⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀knew.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀wording,⠀speaker,⠀and⠀concrete⠀detail⠀that⠀make⠀actual⠀scope⠀and⠀reception⠀intelligible.⠀When⠀a⠀term⠀is⠀defined,⠀challenged,⠀or⠀revised,⠀preserve⠀the⠀exact⠀prior⠀wording⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀changed⠀and⠀what⠀remained.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details.⠀The⠀comedy⠀may⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀literal⠀fit⠀between⠀a⠀phrase⠀and⠀the⠀act⠀it⠀names,⠀or⠀by⠀a⠀real⠀discrepancy⠀left⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀explained.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀gloss⠀that⠀repeats⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀showed.\n\nKeep⠀meaningful⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀intact.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀extended⠀reasoning,⠀feeling⠀or⠀association⠀around⠀a⠀definition⠀or⠀objection;⠀preserve⠀that⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀no⠀act,⠀explains⠀no⠀response⠀and⠀produces⠀no⠀comic⠀payoff.⠀Individual⠀verbosity⠀remains⠀available:⠀one⠀speaker⠀may⠀be⠀elaborate⠀while⠀another⠀is⠀terse,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀imitate⠀either.⠀Do⠀not⠀trim⠀a⠀genuine⠀explanation⠀merely⠀to⠀shorten⠀the⠀reply,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀conceal⠀feeling⠀behind⠀clipped⠀sentences⠀as⠀a⠀fixed⠀style.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀acts⠀beyond⠀verbal⠀claims.⠀A⠀correction⠀may⠀change⠀what⠀someone⠀says⠀without⠀changing⠀what⠀they⠀did,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀distinction⠀through⠀one⠀concrete⠀detail.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀phrase⠀and⠀its⠀application⠀still⠀in⠀view,⠀without⠀a⠀deflating⠀last⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀result⠀imposed⠀as⠀a⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀active⠀scene⠀can⠀continue⠀past⠀the⠀boundary⠀with⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀still⠀available⠀for⠀later⠀use.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nMove⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience.⠀When⠀a⠀term⠀is⠀defined,⠀challenged,⠀or⠀revised,⠀preserve⠀the⠀exact⠀prior⠀wording⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀reception⠀in⠀causal⠀order:⠀who⠀actually⠀received⠀it⠀by⠀a⠀supported⠀means,⠀what⠀response⠀occurs⠀or⠀remains⠀pending,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀understanding⠀or⠀ongoing⠀thought.⠀A⠀familiar⠀agreement⠀or⠀a⠀literal⠀answer⠀can⠀carry⠀comedy⠀without⠀a⠀winner⠀or⠀a⠀misunderstanding.⠀Comic⠀timing⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀relation⠀between⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀aims,⠀habits⠀or⠀blind⠀spots,⠀with⠀exact⠀agreement⠀as⠀possible⠀as⠀social⠀friction.\n\nKeep⠀words,⠀acts,⠀and⠀private⠀understanding⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀definition⠀publicly⠀while⠀privately⠀noticing⠀its⠀limits,⠀or⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀term⠀without⠀announcing⠀their⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀difference⠀through⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience,⠀but⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀know⠀it.⠀Give⠀personal⠀history⠀and⠀thought⠀their⠀real⠀extent:⠀a⠀recollection⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀present⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀speaker⠀may⠀pause⠀to⠀reconsider⠀a⠀word,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀commentary⠀break⠀or⠀a⠀debate.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀joke,⠀a⠀changed⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀exchange⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀still⠀underway,⠀with⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀available⠀for⠀later⠀use⠀and⠀the⠀participants'⠀separate⠀understandings⠀still⠀in⠀motion.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀perspective⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀duration;⠀prose⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀how⠀much⠀fictional⠀time⠀has⠀passed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀scenes⠀and⠀callbacks⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀participants,⠀including⠀group⠀bonds⠀where⠀the⠀premise⠀includes⠀them.⠀An⠀established⠀label,⠀joke,⠀or⠀qualification⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀particular⠀preference⠀or⠀act⠀with⠀comic⠀precision.⠀The⠀comedy⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀shared⠀term⠀used⠀exactly⠀as⠀both⠀participants⠀understand⠀it,⠀from⠀one⠀person's⠀revision⠀of⠀the⠀term⠀meeting⠀the⠀other's⠀actual⠀habit,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀applied⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀situation⠀without⠀changing⠀its⠀private⠀meaning.⠀Sincere⠀mutual⠀understanding⠀can⠀be⠀funny;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀to⠀produce⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀public⠀wording,⠀actual⠀permission,⠀and⠀each⠀person's⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀shared⠀phrase⠀in⠀company⠀while⠀another⠀person⠀privately⠀hears⠀its⠀fuller⠀history,⠀and⠀that⠀difference⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀without⠀becoming⠀public⠀knowledge.⠀When⠀a⠀term⠀is⠀revised,⠀preserve⠀the⠀earlier⠀wording⠀so⠀the⠀callback⠀remains⠀legible.⠀The⠀bond's⠀promise⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀through⠀scene⠀selection⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀or⠀a⠀required⠀confession.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀secrecy,⠀jealousy,⠀rescue⠀debt,⠀a⠀defeated⠀speaker,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀label⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible.⠀One⠀participant⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀permanent⠀verbal⠀winner.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀shared⠀language⠀still⠀in⠀use,⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀underway,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀available⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀occasion⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀deliberate⠀cadence,⠀and⠀grounded⠀recurring⠀wording⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀account.⠀When⠀a⠀title⠀or⠀description⠀is⠀given,⠀let⠀it⠀meet⠀specific⠀conduct⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀speaker's⠀qualification⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it.⠀The⠀comedy⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀remembered⠀designation⠀that⠀names⠀a⠀real⠀deed⠀precisely⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀speaker⠀objects⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀act⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀motive⠀behind⠀it.⠀Deserved⠀praise⠀and⠀ordinary⠀diction⠀remain⠀possible;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀heroic⠀inflation⠀or⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀epithet⠀at⠀every⠀entrance;⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀play⠀or⠀conflict⠀the⠀scene⠀supports.\n\nKeep⠀original⠀events,⠀later⠀telling,⠀and⠀private⠀motives⠀separate.⠀The⠀chronicle's⠀account⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀shows⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀or⠀why⠀it⠀happened.⠀A⠀later⠀retelling⠀can⠀preserve⠀the⠀deed⠀while⠀altering⠀its⠀proportion,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀difference⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀later⠀understood.⠀A⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀remembered⠀act⠀remains⠀the⠀same.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀opening⠀every⠀reply,⠀a⠀mock⠀duel,⠀a⠀new⠀epithet,⠀or⠀a⠀communal⠀verdict.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀a⠀continuing⠀deed,⠀telling⠀or⠀private⠀experience,⠀whether⠀business⠀is⠀concluded⠀or⠀underway;⠀no⠀next⠀modest⠀act⠀or⠀legendary⠀status⠀must⠀be⠀supplied.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀perspective⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale;⠀the⠀saga⠀cadence⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀the⠀size⠀of⠀the⠀deeds.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀essayistic⠀narrative⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀voice:⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀situated⠀proposition⠀about⠀a⠀word,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀category⠀that⠀one⠀character⠀has⠀actually⠀used⠀or⠀accepted.⠀The⠀proposition⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀enough⠀that⠀its⠀scope⠀can⠀be⠀tested⠀against⠀a⠀concrete⠀case⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀established⠀circumstances.⠀The⠀case⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀event,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀habit,⠀a⠀prior⠀statement,⠀or⠀a⠀hypothetical⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀explicitly⠀mark⠀as⠀hypothetical.\n\nCompare⠀the⠀original⠀term's⠀stated⠀scope⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀case⠀actually⠀includes,⠀keeping⠀the⠀original⠀recoverable⠀and⠀distinct⠀from⠀any⠀correction⠀that⠀actually⠀occurs.⠀An⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀supported⠀gap⠀can⠀carry⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀an⠀imposed⠀error⠀or⠀mockery.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀confirmation,⠀a⠀qualification⠀that⠀actually⠀narrows,⠀widens⠀or⠀clarifies⠀the⠀term's⠀scope,⠀or⠀an⠀open⠀question⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀term⠀now⠀covers.⠀The⠀original⠀wording,⠀its⠀source,⠀and⠀the⠀status⠀of⠀the⠀case⠀remain⠀intact;⠀a⠀later⠀qualification⠀does⠀not⠀silently⠀rewrite⠀what⠀was⠀first⠀said.\n\nKeep⠀all⠀authorized⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀available⠀in⠀their⠀active⠀presentation,⠀independently⠀of⠀whether⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀participant.⠀A⠀permitted⠀thinker⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀relation⠀earlier⠀or⠀during⠀the⠀comparison,⠀or⠀remain⠀undecided.⠀Other⠀characters⠀need⠀not⠀share⠀that⠀recognition.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀public⠀lesson,⠀change⠀conduct,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀superior⠀definition.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀comparison⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀the⠀proposition⠀qualified⠀but⠀not⠀refuted,⠀or⠀the⠀case⠀simply⠀left⠀beside⠀the⠀term⠀it⠀actually⠀fits⠀or⠀qualifies.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacataw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Establish⠀a⠀term⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀character⠀states⠀a⠀definition,⠀gives⠀an⠀instruction,⠀or⠀names⠀a⠀category⠀while⠀the⠀action⠀block⠀shows⠀the⠀available⠀material⠀around⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀omniscient⠀voice-over⠀merely⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀term;⠀preserve⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀performed⠀narration⠀without⠀replacing⠀nonspoken⠀experience.\n\nJuxtapose⠀the⠀term⠀with⠀its⠀real⠀use⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀scale.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀stated⠀definition⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀situation⠀that⠀tests⠀it,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀beat⠀can⠀let⠀the⠀term⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀action⠀that⠀contradicts⠀or⠀complicates⠀it.⠀The⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀misfit⠀between⠀wording⠀and⠀available⠀material⠀can⠀carry⠀comedy⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀reaction⠀shot,⠀embarrassment⠀or⠀announced⠀failure;⠀actual⠀supported⠀events⠀remain⠀available.⠀A⠀literal⠀fit⠀may⠀be⠀comic⠀without⠀any⠀character⠀commenting⠀on⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀across⠀cuts:⠀do⠀not⠀erase⠀an⠀earlier⠀established⠀fact⠀or⠀supported⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀location⠀changes,⠀and⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀forgetting⠀or⠀later⠀change⠀the⠀story⠀supports.⠀Keep⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀voice-over⠀and⠀dialogue;⠀required⠀interiority⠀remains⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material,⠀not⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀precede⠀reception⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀demonstration.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀before⠀anyone⠀responds⠀to⠀the⠀juxtaposition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀and⠀supported⠀objects.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀exact⠀wording⠀land⠀beside⠀an⠀actual⠀act,⠀reply,⠀or⠀pause⠀occurring⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀shared⠀stage⠀space.⠀The⠀stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀what⠀is⠀physically⠀present⠀and⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀done⠀with⠀it;⠀the⠀spoken⠀line⠀establishes⠀the⠀term,⠀qualification,⠀or⠀objection.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀their⠀coexistence,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀separate⠀commentary.\n\nA⠀term's⠀delivery⠀may⠀meet⠀an⠀act⠀that⠀makes⠀its⠀scope⠀recognizable:⠀someone⠀says⠀a⠀category⠀while⠀performing⠀the⠀action⠀that⠀falls⠀outside⠀it,⠀or⠀offers⠀a⠀definition⠀while⠀holding⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀complicates⠀it.⠀The⠀physical⠀business⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀contrast⠀with⠀the⠀line;⠀an⠀exact⠀fit⠀can⠀be⠀just⠀as⠀comic.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀new⠀prop,⠀a⠀visible⠀reaction,⠀or⠀a⠀character's⠀failure⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀moment⠀work.\n\nCast⠀registers⠀remain⠀individual.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀precisely,⠀dryly,⠀or⠀exuberantly⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀established⠀habits.⠀Actual⠀explanatory⠀remarks⠀are⠀permitted⠀when⠀they⠀fit⠀the⠀speaker.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀performed⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues;⠀an⠀aside⠀has⠀an⠀audience⠀and⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose,⠀while⠀private⠀thought⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material.⠀No⠀laughter,⠀visible⠀reaction,⠀or⠀in-world⠀pause⠀is⠀needed⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀line⠀and⠀business⠀still⠀held⠀together.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nFollow⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀actual⠀associations⠀as⠀the⠀presentation⠀form.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀through⠀that⠀particular⠀mind,⠀with⠀clear⠀ownership⠀and⠀enough⠀source⠀or⠀time⠀cues⠀to⠀distinguish⠀current⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀and⠀fantasy.⠀The⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀associations,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀still⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀tell⠀what⠀is⠀happening,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀imagined.\n\nLet⠀a⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀or⠀remembered⠀wording⠀meet⠀something⠀else⠀inside⠀the⠀braid:⠀a⠀bodily⠀particular,⠀a⠀sound⠀resemblance,⠀an⠀unrelated⠀preference,⠀or⠀a⠀current⠀perception.⠀That⠀meeting⠀can⠀carry⠀comedy⠀without⠀correcting⠀the⠀character;⠀any⠀actual⠀correction⠀keeps⠀its⠀supported⠀place.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀hold⠀an⠀accurate⠀conviction⠀while⠀the⠀association⠀exposes⠀the⠀term's⠀odd⠀scope,⠀or⠀the⠀thought⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished.⠀Self-correction⠀is⠀not⠀compulsory;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀juxtaposition,⠀miss⠀it,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀original⠀concern⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀quotation,⠀memory,⠀and⠀current⠀event⠀distinct.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀shifts⠀between⠀minds,⠀preserve⠀each⠀mind's⠀separate⠀ownership⠀rather⠀than⠀merging⠀them.⠀Prose⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀set⠀fictional⠀elapsed⠀time;⠀actual⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events⠀still⠀have⠀their⠀real⠀duration.⠀No⠀revised⠀thought,⠀public⠀reply,⠀or⠀realization⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀braid,⠀with⠀the⠀term⠀still⠀sitting⠀beside⠀the⠀sensation⠀or⠀memory⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀strange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacataz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀message⠀exchange⠀with⠀real⠀sender⠀attribution,⠀recipients,⠀and⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter:⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀revise⠀carefully,⠀another⠀may⠀send⠀immediately,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀draft⠀unsent.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀composed⠀message⠀meet⠀its⠀actual⠀receipt⠀or⠀reply.⠀A⠀literal⠀response⠀can⠀expose⠀the⠀scope⠀of⠀the⠀original⠀term,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀qualification⠀can⠀arrive⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment⠀for⠀the⠀sender⠀but⠀the⠀right⠀moment⠀for⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀comic⠀turn⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀actual⠀transmission⠀and⠀reception,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀sender's⠀private⠀revisions⠀being⠀transmitted⠀automatically.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀remains⠀untransmitted⠀through⠀that⠀channel;⠀any⠀knowledge⠀of⠀its⠀contents⠀must⠀come⠀through⠀actual⠀sending⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀means⠀of⠀access,⠀not⠀merely⠀from⠀the⠀narration⠀showing⠀it.\n\nPrior⠀knowledge⠀survives⠀beyond⠀the⠀channel.⠀Receipt⠀alone⠀proves⠀no⠀motive⠀or⠀agreement,⠀and⠀a⠀reply's⠀mere⠀existence⠀does⠀not⠀confirm⠀shared⠀understanding;⠀its⠀actual⠀content⠀and⠀other⠀available⠀evidence⠀may⠀support⠀that⠀conclusion.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀composition:⠀the⠀sender's⠀private⠀thought⠀before⠀sending,⠀the⠀recipient's⠀private⠀thought⠀after⠀reading,⠀and⠀any⠀other⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀remain⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀precede⠀sending⠀or⠀reception⠀without⠀an⠀invented⠀delay⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀message⠀still⠀unsent,⠀a⠀reply⠀still⠀unread,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀simply⠀left⠀where⠀it⠀is.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Use⠀a⠀supported⠀object,⠀background⠀detail,⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀to⠀anchor⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀exact⠀wording⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀use.⠀The⠀cue⠀is⠀a⠀purposeful⠀reference,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nWhere⠀a⠀supported⠀cue⠀directs⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀term,⠀follow⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀reception;⠀the⠀term⠀may⠀also⠀arrive⠀through⠀speech⠀or⠀another⠀established⠀means⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀visual⠀cue.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀implication,⠀misread⠀it,⠀or⠀miss⠀the⠀joke⠀entirely.⠀The⠀cue⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀understanding,⠀and⠀an⠀expression⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀Comic⠀timing⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀an⠀exact⠀fit⠀or⠀supported⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀wording⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀cue⠀makes⠀present,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cue-thought-line⠀cycle⠀where⠀every⠀visual⠀detail⠀must⠀produce⠀a⠀private⠀comment⠀and⠀then⠀a⠀spoken⠀reply.\n\nPreserve⠀fallible⠀inference,⠀established⠀facts,⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀is⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀private⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀No⠀image,⠀menu,⠀romance⠀route,⠀or⠀closing⠀reaction⠀is⠀activated.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀cue⠀still⠀present⠀and⠀the⠀term⠀still⠀unexamined⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀used⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacatbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀prior⠀terms⠀briefly⠀where⠀re-entry⠀needs⠀them.⠀When⠀a⠀term⠀returns,⠀distinguish⠀its⠀original⠀wording⠀from⠀an⠀actual⠀later⠀revision.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀accepted⠀the⠀term,⠀refused⠀it,⠀learned⠀something⠀about⠀its⠀scope,⠀or⠀left⠀the⠀question⠀pending;⠀that⠀history⠀stays⠀intact⠀across⠀installments.\n\nA⠀familiar⠀accurate⠀application⠀can⠀stay⠀funny⠀without⠀novelty.⠀The⠀callback⠀works⠀because⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀scope⠀are⠀still⠀recognizable,⠀not⠀because⠀a⠀new⠀contradiction⠀has⠀been⠀invented.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀revises⠀the⠀term⠀later,⠀show⠀the⠀revision⠀as⠀a⠀later⠀event;⠀do⠀not⠀silently⠀replace⠀the⠀original⠀statement.⠀The⠀same⠀term⠀may⠀now⠀apply⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀concrete⠀case,⠀and⠀the⠀fit⠀or⠀misfit⠀carries⠀the⠀comic⠀turn.\n\nLet⠀independent⠀lives⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀continue⠀beyond⠀the⠀verbal⠀game.⠀Other⠀characters⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀aims,⠀and⠀the⠀recurring⠀term⠀does⠀not⠀organize⠀everyone's⠀attention.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀was⠀learned⠀in⠀earlier⠀installments;⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀a⠀new⠀reply⠀begins.⠀No⠀reset⠀of⠀understanding,⠀new⠀contradiction,⠀rhetorical⠀victory,⠀or⠀ending⠀hook⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀term⠀still⠀in⠀use,⠀still⠀qualified,⠀or⠀simply⠀still⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀cost⠀of⠀asking,⠀admitting,⠀needing,⠀apologizing,⠀or⠀returning.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀prepare,⠀hesitate,⠀or⠀commit⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀diction,⠀and⠀place⠀that⠀movement⠀beside⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀actual⠀response.⠀Comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake⠀for⠀the⠀asker⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀encounter⠀actually⠀unfolds:⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀understand⠀immediately,⠀misunderstand,⠀answer⠀partially,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀request⠀pending.⠀Do⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀exposure⠀into⠀a⠀punchline⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀asker's⠀fear,⠀confidence,⠀or⠀desire⠀merely⠀a⠀setup⠀for⠀someone⠀else's⠀wit.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀The⠀asker's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀can⠀be⠀extensive⠀or⠀fragmentary⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀state,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀before⠀the⠀reply⠀ends.⠀Let⠀strain⠀affect⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀subsequent⠀behavior⠀without⠀requiring⠀failure,⠀mixed⠀feelings,⠀banter,⠀a⠀secret⠀opposite,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀may⠀coexist,⠀and⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward.\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀register⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀A⠀serious⠀request⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀exact,⠀mistimed,⠀over-prepared,⠀or⠀met⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀response,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀feeling⠀is⠀mocked.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀role,⠀perspective,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀output⠀contract.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀approach.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀by⠀resolving⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀and⠀orienting⠀the⠀live⠀situation⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Orient⠀the⠀actual⠀positions⠀and⠀activity,⠀making⠀aims⠀legible⠀within⠀narrator⠀access⠀while⠀distinguishing⠀known⠀motives,⠀apparent⠀purposes,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unknown.⠀Comic⠀construction⠀comes⠀from⠀these⠀owned⠀aims⠀and⠀habits⠀meeting⠀in⠀real⠀time:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀pursue⠀a⠀recognizable⠀goal⠀with⠀a⠀blind⠀spot,⠀another⠀may⠀respond⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀practical⠀concern,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀develop⠀through⠀setup,⠀reversal,⠀escalation,⠀or⠀anticlimax⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀permits.\n\nKeep⠀NPCs⠀active⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀pursuits⠀rather⠀than⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀player's⠀next⠀move.⠀Their⠀responses⠀should⠀follow⠀their⠀established⠀habits,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀current⠀aims,⠀including⠀cooperation,⠀resistance,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀distraction.⠀Preserve⠀player⠀ownership⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective;⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀sets⠀the⠀voice,⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀full⠀under⠀the⠀contract.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀uniform⠀comic⠀voice⠀on⠀every⠀speaker⠀or⠀require⠀every⠀reply⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀quip.\n\nA⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀or⠀thought.⠀No⠀question,⠀obstacle,⠀joke,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀Let⠀the⠀continuation⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀it⠀stands,⠀with⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀still⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Take⠀the⠀supplied⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀public⠀arrangement⠀and⠀make⠀it⠀concrete⠀through⠀allocation:⠀who⠀receives⠀time,⠀access,⠀responsibility,⠀or⠀benefit,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀actually⠀wants⠀from⠀that⠀arrangement.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀aim⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀use⠀a⠀resource,⠀claim⠀a⠀role,⠀or⠀respond⠀to⠀someone⠀else's⠀use⠀of⠀it.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀working⠀cooperation⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀from⠀a⠀contradiction⠀between⠀stated⠀intention⠀and⠀actual⠀practice.\n\nOrder⠀the⠀real⠀uses⠀and⠀responses⠀so⠀the⠀scene⠀develops⠀through⠀setup,⠀reversal,⠀escalation,⠀or⠀anticlimax⠀as⠀the⠀sequence⠀permits.⠀Keep⠀individual⠀voices⠀distinct:⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀literal,⠀another⠀dry,⠀another⠀exuberant,⠀and⠀another⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀joke.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀a⠀quip⠀or⠀let⠀random⠀interruption⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀comic⠀construction.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀actual⠀community,⠀period,⠀and⠀narrator⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀No⠀exposed⠀corruption,⠀stock⠀bureaucracy,⠀moral⠀lesson,⠀altered⠀hierarchy,⠀or⠀hidden⠀author⠀manner⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀satire⠀operates⠀through⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀particular⠀uses⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀generic⠀social⠀type.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world⠀consequential⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀problem⠀to⠀remain⠀playable,⠀and⠀stop⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀comic⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction,⠀compressed⠀transitions,⠀and⠀concrete⠀physical⠀detail.⠀Where⠀the⠀activity⠀supports⠀it,⠀render⠀actual⠀weight,⠀distance,⠀wear,⠀or⠀cost:⠀the⠀heft⠀of⠀an⠀object,⠀the⠀strain⠀of⠀a⠀movement,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀surface,⠀the⠀practical⠀limits⠀of⠀a⠀plan.⠀Use⠀these⠀material⠀particulars⠀to⠀place⠀a⠀character's⠀approach⠀beside⠀its⠀real⠀physical⠀terms.⠀Comic⠀recognition⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀competent⠀exact⠀fit⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀from⠀a⠀supported⠀mishap;⠀the⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀damage,⠀pain,⠀or⠀failure⠀to⠀earn⠀its⠀texture.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀each⠀cast⠀member's⠀register⠀individual.⠀Roughness⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀speaker⠀and⠀situation,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀line.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀literal,⠀dry,⠀exuberant,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀joke.⠀Full⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀extended⠀thought⠀can⠀appear⠀without⠀serving⠀an⠀immediate⠀action;⠀retain⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.\n\nUse⠀useful⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀rather⠀than⠀constant⠀pressure.⠀A⠀compressed⠀transition⠀can⠀sharpen⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀anticlimax,⠀and⠀a⠀slower⠀sentence⠀can⠀let⠀a⠀practical⠀difficulty⠀or⠀an⠀accurate⠀understanding⠀land.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀output⠀contract.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀action⠀or⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀document⠀form,⠀with⠀the⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀clear.⠀Let⠀the⠀document's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀do⠀the⠀comic⠀work:⠀a⠀request⠀that⠀is⠀too⠀precise,⠀a⠀notation⠀that⠀misses⠀the⠀point,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀record⠀placed⠀against⠀a⠀larger⠀practical⠀situation,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀uptake⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀original⠀reads.⠀Accurate⠀records⠀and⠀familiar⠀meanings⠀remain⠀available;⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀document⠀to⠀be⠀inaccurate,⠀self-serving,⠀or⠀terse.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀writer's⠀register⠀and⠀extent.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀long,⠀careful,⠀digressive,⠀or⠀brief⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀author,⠀and⠀its⠀knowledge⠀is⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀that⠀author⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Distinguish⠀original⠀knowledge⠀from⠀later⠀annotation⠀or⠀retrospective⠀knowledge.⠀Gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀can⠀reveal⠀events⠀across⠀entries⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀live⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀composed⠀artifact.⠀The⠀document⠀is⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀records,⠀not⠀automatically⠀their⠀complete⠀private⠀mind.⠀No⠀additional⠀document,⠀contradiction,⠀delivered⠀reply,⠀or⠀revelation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀the⠀composition⠀of⠀a⠀document⠀or⠀before⠀any⠀response⠀to⠀it⠀arrives.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nAttend⠀to⠀a⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀or⠀available⠀pleasure⠀in⠀its⠀practical⠀and⠀personal⠀terms.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀helper⠀actually⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀recipient⠀and⠀what⠀approach⠀they⠀take:⠀a⠀prepared⠀favorite,⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀service,⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀or⠀an⠀offered⠀ease.⠀Comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀placing⠀this⠀particular⠀care⠀beside⠀the⠀real⠀reception.⠀The⠀recipient⠀may⠀accept⠀it,⠀refuse⠀it,⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀or⠀not⠀notice⠀it;⠀sincere⠀help⠀can⠀be⠀spontaneous⠀or⠀planned,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀thanks⠀or⠀improved⠀mood.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Keep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀include⠀manageable⠀friction,⠀a⠀practical⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀disappointment⠀without⠀losing⠀its⠀warmth.\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀each⠀character's⠀own⠀register.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀ongoing⠀care,⠀conversation,⠀or⠀thought.⠀No⠀repair,⠀gratitude,⠀or⠀completed⠀comfort⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀stops.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions,⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀and⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀through⠀relevant⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀occasion⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀mean,⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀meant⠀before,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀believe⠀is⠀at⠀stake.⠀Then⠀place⠀the⠀actual⠀conduct⠀beside⠀that⠀frame.⠀Comic⠀proportion⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀formal⠀expectation⠀and⠀the⠀real⠀exchange,⠀or⠀from⠀an⠀exact⠀fit⠀that⠀the⠀frame⠀makes⠀newly⠀visible.\n\nUse⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀support⠀recognition⠀or⠀a⠀real⠀anticlimax.⠀A⠀sudden⠀quip⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀speaker⠀or⠀narrator,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀neither⠀compulsory⠀nor⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀composed⠀relation.⠀A⠀sustained⠀passage⠀can⠀build⠀the⠀expectation;⠀a⠀compressed⠀sentence⠀can⠀release⠀it;⠀a⠀delayed⠀observation⠀can⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀consequence⠀land.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀changed⠀belief,⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀resolution.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀established⠀narrator's⠀diction⠀and⠀each⠀character's⠀distinct⠀spoken⠀register.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀style;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀impose⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech,⠀or⠀universal⠀irony.⠀Serious⠀stakes⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀remain⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀social⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀the⠀telling⠀by⠀establishing⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀and⠀why⠀this⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀given⠀now.⠀The⠀purpose⠀may⠀be⠀persuasion,⠀entertainment,⠀delay,⠀warning,⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀mixture⠀of⠀these,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀concrete⠀enough⠀to⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀includes⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀listeners⠀receive⠀it.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀A⠀person⠀retelling⠀an⠀event⠀will⠀foreground⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀their⠀aim,⠀repeat⠀the⠀phrase⠀that⠀carried⠀weight⠀for⠀them,⠀or⠀skip⠀the⠀part⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀notice.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners'⠀live⠀attention⠀create⠀the⠀timing:⠀they⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀laugh⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀become⠀distracted,⠀or⠀understand⠀the⠀point⠀accurately⠀while⠀still⠀responding⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀way.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀witty⠀exchange,⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀revealed⠀secret.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct.⠀The⠀embedded⠀account⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀participants,⠀sequence,⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀outer⠀frame⠀has⠀a⠀present⠀audience⠀whose⠀reactions⠀belong⠀to⠀them.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀levels,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀connect⠀the⠀teller's⠀emphasis⠀to⠀the⠀listeners'⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀true⠀or⠀complete.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀access.⠀The⠀teller's⠀performed⠀speech⠀is⠀distinct⠀from⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀teller,⠀listeners,⠀or⠀other⠀authorized⠀people;⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀any⠀of⠀them.⠀A⠀listener's⠀visible⠀response⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀reveal⠀their⠀full⠀thought.⠀Let⠀private⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀amusement⠀continue⠀without⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀become⠀spoken⠀or⠀resolved⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀any⠀natural⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀including⠀mid-account⠀or⠀during⠀a⠀listener's⠀reaction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modernist⠀absurdist⠀construction⠀as⠀the⠀narrative⠀method.⠀Identify⠀a⠀premise,⠀classification,⠀rule,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀that⠀the⠀scene's⠀world⠀actually⠀supplies:⠀a⠀procedure,⠀a⠀social⠀expectation,⠀a⠀formal⠀distinction,⠀or⠀an⠀instruction⠀someone⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀follow.⠀State⠀or⠀expose⠀that⠀premise⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀its⠀terms.\n\nThen⠀follow⠀the⠀premise's⠀actual⠀implications⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀comes⠀from⠀accurate⠀fit,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀a⠀modest⠀consequence⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀terms⠀themselves.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀apply⠀a⠀rule⠀correctly⠀and⠀produce⠀an⠀absurd⠀result,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀rule's⠀wording⠀does⠀not⠀cover⠀the⠀situation⠀at⠀hand,⠀or⠀treat⠀a⠀trivial⠀matter⠀with⠀the⠀full⠀apparatus⠀the⠀premise⠀demands.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀premise⠀to⠀fail,⠀trap⠀someone,⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀flawed⠀institution⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀scene⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀premise⠀implies⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀occurs.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀imagine⠀an⠀implication,⠀argue⠀for⠀it,⠀or⠀resist⠀it⠀without⠀the⠀world⠀confirming⠀that⠀version.⠀Let⠀each⠀character⠀retain⠀their⠀actual⠀understanding,⠀shared⠀or⠀different,⠀and⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀recognizable⠀aims⠀through⠀the⠀arrangement⠀without⠀requiring⠀unequal⠀knowledge.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀register⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀mechanisms.⠀Private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀beyond⠀what⠀is⠀useful⠀to⠀the⠀comic⠀sequence.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀an⠀implication⠀still⠀unfolding,⠀a⠀character's⠀dawning⠀recognition,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀continuation⠀of⠀the⠀activity;⠀no⠀completed⠀demonstration,⠀changed⠀plan,⠀or⠀agreement⠀that⠀the⠀terms⠀are⠀reasonable⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLocate⠀the⠀scene's⠀inherited⠀authority,⠀social⠀mask,⠀or⠀private⠀desire⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀relationships.⠀This⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀old⠀title,⠀a⠀formal⠀expectation,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀maintained⠀public⠀image,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀want⠀that⠀sits⠀awkwardly⠀beside⠀present⠀life.⠀Establish⠀its⠀actual⠀weight⠀before⠀the⠀comic⠀contrast⠀appears.\n\nPut⠀an⠀actual⠀request,⠀habit,⠀or⠀practical⠀term⠀beside⠀that⠀gravity,⠀preserving⠀its⠀supplied⠀stakes.⠀The⠀comedy⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀collision:⠀someone⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀matter⠀with⠀mundane⠀practicality,⠀apply⠀an⠀old⠀form⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀inconvenience,⠀or⠀pursue⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀through⠀channels⠀designed⠀for⠀public⠀performance.⠀Make⠀the⠀contrast⠀legible⠀without⠀requiring⠀fraud⠀exposure⠀or⠀punishment⠀of⠀sincerity.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀discoveries⠀and⠀consequences⠀when⠀supported;⠀comic⠀treatment⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀the⠀authority's⠀real⠀effects.\n\nUse⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀not⠀to⠀prove⠀motive⠀or⠀menace.⠀A⠀formal⠀room,⠀worn⠀object,⠀or⠀careful⠀performance⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀comic⠀collision⠀sharper⠀because⠀its⠀texture⠀is⠀real.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀descriptive⠀intensity⠀substitute⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀do⠀and⠀want.\n\nPreserve⠀trust⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀as⠀they⠀actually⠀stand.⠀A⠀mask⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀place,⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀or⠀shift⠀partially;⠀no⠀fallen⠀mask,⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀moral⠀correction⠀is⠀required.⠀Full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀continues⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀request,⠀an⠀unread⠀reaction,⠀or⠀the⠀ordinary⠀continuation⠀of⠀the⠀encounter.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀situated⠀participant⠀testimony⠀as⠀the⠀narrative⠀method.⠀Convey⠀an⠀actual⠀participant's⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀comic⠀occasion⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀form,⠀without⠀automatically⠀making⠀the⠀narrator⠀that⠀participant.⠀The⠀testimony⠀has⠀a⠀source,⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀being⠀given,⠀and⠀a⠀purpose:⠀someone⠀is⠀telling⠀this⠀to⠀someone⠀else⠀for⠀a⠀reason,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀reason⠀is⠀only⠀to⠀share⠀the⠀memory.\n\nDistinguish⠀three⠀layers⠀as⠀the⠀account⠀unfolds.⠀What⠀the⠀participant⠀perceived⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀original⠀occasion.⠀What⠀they⠀report⠀later⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀telling.⠀What⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀reader⠀can⠀presently⠀infer⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present.⠀A⠀particular⠀emphasis,⠀familiar⠀detail,⠀or⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀chose⠀to⠀notice⠀or⠀retell,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀contested⠀credibility⠀hearing,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀interpretation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀be⠀accurate⠀or⠀fallible⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀character⠀supports.⠀A⠀participant⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀wrong⠀detail,⠀omit⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀embarrassed⠀them,⠀or⠀describe⠀the⠀event⠀with⠀perfect⠀accuracy⠀and⠀still⠀make⠀it⠀funny⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀timing.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀testimony⠀to⠀be⠀unreliable⠀or⠀every⠀listener⠀to⠀doubt⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀articulated.⠀The⠀participant's⠀present⠀feeling⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀private⠀reaction⠀may⠀continue⠀beyond⠀the⠀spoken⠀account⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀permit,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀narrator⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀granting⠀access⠀to⠀every⠀mind.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀the⠀telling,⠀after⠀a⠀listener's⠀response,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀participant⠀is⠀still⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀include⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaual::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀early-modern⠀comic/theatrical⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀narrative⠀method⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀prose⠀medium.⠀Make⠀the⠀real⠀positions,⠀access,⠀and⠀sequence⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀legible⠀first:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀stand⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀one⠀another,⠀and⠀what⠀expectation⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀set⠀up.\n\nThen⠀place⠀an⠀actual⠀line,⠀entrance,⠀or⠀action⠀against⠀that⠀supported⠀expectation.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀accurate⠀placement:⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀the⠀plain⠀thing⠀everyone⠀was⠀avoiding,⠀arrives⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀their⠀absence⠀had⠀been⠀arranged⠀around,⠀or⠀performs⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀with⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀a⠀staged⠀entrance.⠀Familiar⠀accurate⠀timing⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀without⠀a⠀stock⠀fool,⠀a⠀mistake,⠀or⠀a⠀trick.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀prop⠀solely⠀to⠀force⠀the⠀comic⠀beat⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀delivered⠀reaction;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀objects⠀and⠀developments⠀the⠀story⠀supports.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀distinct⠀registers⠀of⠀the⠀cast.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀with⠀theatrical⠀formality⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀literal,⠀dry,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀performance.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀note⠀the⠀public⠀placement⠀without⠀adopting⠀a⠀script⠀format⠀or⠀making⠀every⠀line⠀sound⠀rehearsed.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀feeling⠀and⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀channels.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀privately⠀thinks⠀or⠀feels⠀remains⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀or⠀what⠀others⠀can⠀observe.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀a⠀placed⠀line,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀entrance,⠀or⠀the⠀interval⠀after⠀an⠀action⠀before⠀anyone⠀responds;⠀no⠀completed⠀gag⠀or⠀in-world⠀pause⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀social⠀realism⠀through⠀chronicle⠀as⠀the⠀narrative⠀method.⠀Order⠀the⠀actual⠀shared⠀occurrence,⠀its⠀participants,⠀and⠀any⠀later⠀reports⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀now⠀saying⠀what⠀about⠀it.⠀Keep⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀attribution⠀clear⠀enough⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀event⠀from⠀the⠀account:⠀a⠀public⠀claim⠀made⠀afterward⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀did⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comedy⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀public⠀claims,⠀personal⠀aims,⠀and⠀concrete⠀consequences.⠀Someone⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀event⠀in⠀terms⠀that⠀flatter⠀their⠀role⠀while⠀the⠀narrated⠀sequence⠀shows⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀did.⠀A⠀coordinated⠀effort⠀may⠀succeed⠀through⠀ordinary⠀confusion.⠀A⠀familiar⠀result⠀may⠀arrive⠀unchanged⠀despite⠀elaborate⠀public⠀explanation.⠀Successful⠀coordination⠀and⠀unchanged⠀routine⠀are⠀available⠀comic⠀outcomes;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀scandal,⠀exposure,⠀false⠀consensus,⠀or⠀a⠀verdict.\n\nRetain⠀the⠀community's⠀particular⠀history⠀and⠀setting⠀as⠀supplied.⠀The⠀chronicle's⠀social⠀texture⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀place,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀shared⠀references⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀imported⠀national⠀temperament⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀scope⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀public⠀record.⠀What⠀a⠀participant⠀felt⠀or⠀thought⠀during⠀the⠀event⠀remains⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀access,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀later⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀it.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀the⠀sequence,⠀between⠀event⠀and⠀report,⠀or⠀while⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀given;⠀no⠀magical⠀event⠀or⠀completed⠀public⠀judgment⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀real⠀location,⠀participants,⠀and⠀current⠀activity⠀cleanly.⠀Give⠀unfamiliar⠀terms⠀or⠀mechanisms⠀through⠀necessary⠀permitted⠀context,⠀preparation,⠀observation,⠀or⠀use,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀glossary.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀movement,⠀entrances,⠀and⠀changed⠀positions⠀easy⠀to⠀track.⠀A⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀can⠀be⠀oriented⠀without⠀moving⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀inventing⠀a⠀new⠀physical⠀location.\n\nPace⠀actual⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Break⠀around⠀dialogue⠀so⠀speakers⠀are⠀unmistakable,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀sit⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀paragraph⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀character.⠀The⠀comic⠀situation⠀comes⠀from⠀people⠀pursuing⠀recognizable⠀aims⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots:⠀an⠀expectation⠀meets⠀an⠀actual⠀response,⠀a⠀preparation⠀meets⠀the⠀wrong⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀continues⠀through⠀a⠀new⠀complication.\n\nLet⠀reactions⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀owners.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀another⠀angry,⠀another⠀literal,⠀another⠀amused;⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀uniform⠀comic⠀voice⠀or⠀make⠀everyone⠀quippy.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀uncertain,⠀delayed,⠀or⠀entirely⠀private⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀punchline.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀inward⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀Continuing⠀activity⠀may⠀reach⠀the⠀response⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀result,⠀demonstration,⠀or⠀closing⠀hook.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action,⠀a⠀character's⠀dawning⠀recognition,⠀or⠀the⠀ordinary⠀next⠀step⠀of⠀the⠀routine.⠀First⠀person,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀requirements⠀of⠀this⠀form.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀image⠀or⠀sound⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀then⠀develop⠀it⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀its⠀shape,⠀texture,⠀or⠀timing⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀adding⠀adjectives.⠀The⠀image⠀may⠀be⠀ordinary:⠀a⠀chair⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀stay⠀level,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀opening⠀before⠀the⠀speaker⠀has⠀finished.⠀Extend⠀it⠀through⠀syntax⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀catch⠀on⠀it,⠀adjust⠀to⠀it,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀adjust.⠀A⠀recurring⠀sound⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀intends⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀room⠀actually⠀does.\n\nPlace⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀or⠀concrete⠀detail⠀where⠀that⠀developed⠀attention⠀meets⠀the⠀character's⠀aim.⠀Build⠀the⠀comic⠀effect⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀the⠀syntax⠀has⠀prepared,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀punchline⠀or⠀sudden⠀deflation;⠀either⠀may⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀voice⠀and⠀sequence⠀support⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀relation,⠀ignore⠀it,⠀or⠀respond⠀to⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀collapse,⠀the⠀speaker⠀to⠀gain⠀insight,⠀or⠀the⠀tone⠀to⠀shift⠀from⠀pleasure⠀to⠀regret.⠀If⠀the⠀scene's⠀feeling⠀is⠀warm,⠀the⠀image⠀can⠀remain⠀warm;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀strained,⠀the⠀strain⠀can⠀persist⠀through⠀the⠀rhythm.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀established⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀cast's⠀separate⠀diction.⠀Lyrical⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker's⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀talks⠀plainly⠀should⠀still⠀talk⠀plainly⠀while⠀the⠀prose⠀around⠀them⠀carries⠀the⠀image.⠀Preserve⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀real⠀extent;⠀a⠀developed⠀association⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Metaphor⠀and⠀sound⠀pattern⠀describe⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀attention;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀create⠀events,⠀change⠀what⠀another⠀character⠀knows,⠀or⠀make⠀an⠀unspoken⠀inference⠀public.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀association,⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀still⠀turning⠀and⠀no⠀return⠀or⠀payoff⠀yet⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀present⠀particular⠀open⠀a⠀real⠀recollection,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀original⠀occasion,⠀the⠀remembered⠀version,⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀view⠀distinct.⠀The⠀original⠀event⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀funny⠀because⠀a⠀person⠀wanted⠀something⠀small⠀and⠀exact:⠀a⠀particular⠀seat,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀a⠀routine⠀performed⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀order.⠀The⠀remembered⠀version⠀may⠀have⠀smoothed⠀or⠀sharpened⠀that⠀detail.⠀The⠀current⠀view⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀without⠀declaring⠀the⠀earlier⠀aim⠀foolish⠀or⠀the⠀earlier⠀pleasure⠀false.\n\nUse⠀the⠀comic⠀exactness⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀as⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀survives⠀change.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀still⠀recognize⠀the⠀precise⠀way⠀a⠀voice⠀cracked,⠀a⠀plate⠀was⠀set⠀down,⠀or⠀a⠀plan⠀fell⠀apart,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀Let⠀that⠀recognition⠀sit⠀beside⠀present⠀absence⠀or⠀continuing⠀attachment⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasure;⠀embarrassment⠀can⠀remain⠀embarrassment.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀loss⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀supply,⠀shrink⠀the⠀earlier⠀aim⠀into⠀foreshadowing,⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀narrator⠀wiser⠀by⠀default.⠀Any⠀actual⠀learning⠀or⠀continuing⠀uncertainty⠀follows⠀the⠀person's⠀real⠀history⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀identity.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀cast's⠀separate⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀reflection⠀may⠀recall⠀what⠀someone⠀said⠀without⠀granting⠀later⠀knowledge⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀feeling⠀keeps⠀its⠀full⠀extent⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀an⠀outward⠀act,⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀an⠀improved⠀mood,⠀or⠀a⠀resting⠀point.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀reflection,⠀with⠀the⠀comparison⠀still⠀open⠀and⠀no⠀resolution⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modern⠀memoir⠀route.⠀Convey⠀an⠀actual⠀participant's⠀authored⠀recollection⠀through⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator⠀and⠀form,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀that⠀participant⠀or⠀a⠀memoirist⠀by⠀default.⠀Keep⠀the⠀account⠀situated⠀rather⠀than⠀substituting⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀of⠀a⠀tradition.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀particulars⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀and⠀gives⠀them⠀present⠀emphasis,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀happened⠀then⠀from⠀how⠀the⠀teller⠀words⠀it⠀now.⠀A⠀remembered⠀aim⠀can⠀be⠀exact⠀and⠀limited:⠀getting⠀through⠀a⠀doorway,⠀keeping⠀a⠀promise,⠀avoiding⠀a⠀particular⠀relative's⠀question.⠀Construct⠀comedy⠀through⠀the⠀selection⠀and⠀arrangement⠀of⠀actual⠀particulars,⠀preserving⠀any⠀exaggeration⠀or⠀lesson⠀the⠀source⠀actually⠀offers⠀without⠀requiring⠀either.\n\nLet⠀the⠀original⠀experience⠀keep⠀its⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀feeling.⠀Do⠀not⠀retroactively⠀give⠀the⠀earlier⠀participant⠀knowledge⠀learned⠀later.⠀Preserve⠀whatever⠀they⠀actually⠀knew,⠀accurately⠀anticipated,⠀or⠀could⠀access⠀then⠀under⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀rules.⠀Later⠀commentary⠀may⠀add⠀interpretation,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀could⠀have⠀noticed⠀or⠀intended⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀recorder's⠀actual⠀register⠀and⠀any⠀supported⠀memory⠀gaps.⠀A⠀gap⠀can⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀chair⠀but⠀not⠀who⠀spoke⠀next.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀confession,⠀exile,⠀regret,⠀moral⠀summary,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀writing⠀scene.⠀The⠀memoir⠀form⠀is⠀the⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀plot⠀demand.⠀Keep⠀authorized⠀live⠀private⠀feeling⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀composed⠀record;⠀the⠀record⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀record,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀present⠀mind.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀recollection,⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀still⠀selecting⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀commentary⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀details⠀that⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀the⠀actual⠀aim,⠀the⠀relevant⠀circumstance,⠀and⠀its⠀reception.⠀One⠀exact⠀particular⠀can⠀do⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀list:⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀a⠀pause,⠀the⠀one⠀word⠀a⠀person⠀repeats.⠀Put⠀those⠀details⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀them⠀remain⠀inferable.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀wants⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour⠀and⠀a⠀radio⠀audibly⠀starts⠀beside⠀them,⠀the⠀actual⠀sound⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀inferable⠀without⠀redundant⠀gloss;⠀merely⠀placing⠀an⠀unused⠀radio⠀there⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀an⠀interruption.\n\nCut⠀repeated⠀framing⠀and⠀redundant⠀explanation,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀history,⠀explicit⠀recognition,⠀emotional⠀repetition,⠀or⠀extended⠀thought⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀needs.⠀A⠀long⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀exact⠀rather⠀than⠀padded.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable,⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀Keep⠀the⠀available⠀cause,⠀attention,⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀legible⠀within⠀narrator⠀access⠀without⠀inventing⠀an⠀unknown⠀motive⠀or⠀requiring⠀every⠀private⠀reason⠀to⠀be⠀disclosed.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀each⠀speaker's⠀diction⠀individual.⠀Minimalist⠀prose⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀deadpan,⠀clipped⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀hidden⠀focal⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀at⠀length,⠀explain⠀too⠀much,⠀or⠀miss⠀the⠀point⠀entirely.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀closing⠀deflation,⠀a⠀terse⠀punchline,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀situation⠀still⠀in⠀motion⠀and⠀the⠀comic⠀relation⠀visible⠀but⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nMove⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀sequence⠀intelligible⠀under⠀the⠀established⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective,⠀shifting⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀as⠀the⠀moment⠀requires.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀event⠀order⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀presentation.⠀Let⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀stay⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀sequence:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀wants,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀about⠀it,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀actually⠀receives⠀it.⠀Paragraphing⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀turns.⠀A⠀new⠀paragraph⠀may⠀begin⠀when⠀attention⠀shifts⠀from⠀the⠀plan⠀to⠀the⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀noticed⠀too⠀late.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀and⠀reversals⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀real⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀A⠀callback⠀can⠀work⠀when⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀returns⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀or⠀the⠀precise⠀familiar⠀fit⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀supports;⠀a⠀reversal⠀works⠀when⠀the⠀established⠀situation⠀changes⠀direction.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀either⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀beat.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀habit⠀and⠀its⠀result,⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀two⠀people⠀are⠀pursuing⠀different⠀aims⠀with⠀complete⠀sincerity.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀actual⠀register,⠀setting,⠀and⠀consequences.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀is⠀the⠀established⠀one,⠀not⠀a⠀covert⠀named-author⠀cadence⠀or⠀a⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀observer.⠀Distinct⠀speakers⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀diction.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀keeps⠀its⠀real⠀extent⠀and⠀may⠀remain⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀No⠀universal⠀understatement,⠀new⠀obstacle,⠀lesson,⠀or⠀complete⠀comic⠀beat⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀exchange⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action,⠀with⠀the⠀situation⠀still⠀developing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀current⠀and⠀remembered⠀moments⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀the⠀story⠀supplies.⠀If⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀rivalry,⠀choose⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀rivalry⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀contest⠀of⠀habit⠀or⠀attention;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀affection,⠀choose⠀scenes⠀where⠀care⠀takes⠀its⠀particular⠀actual⠀form,⠀capable⠀or⠀imperfect⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀flaw.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀The⠀premise⠀itself⠀decides⠀which⠀repeated⠀moments⠀and⠀private⠀phrases⠀matter.\n\nLet⠀owned⠀language⠀and⠀habits⠀carry⠀comic⠀recognition.⠀Two⠀people⠀who⠀know⠀each⠀other⠀well⠀may⠀share⠀a⠀shorthand⠀that⠀misfires,⠀or⠀one⠀may⠀predict⠀the⠀other's⠀response⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀surprised⠀by⠀the⠀delivery.⠀Genuine⠀difference⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀funny⠀as⠀shared⠀understanding:⠀one⠀person's⠀careful⠀plan⠀meets⠀the⠀other's⠀unrelated⠀priority.⠀Keep⠀the⠀humor⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀banter⠀or⠀making⠀one⠀person⠀the⠀straight⠀man⠀by⠀default.\n\nPreserve⠀first⠀encounters⠀without⠀fabricated⠀history.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀begins⠀before⠀the⠀characters⠀know⠀each⠀other,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀shared⠀past⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀callback.⠀Preserve⠀wider⠀relationships;⠀the⠀selected⠀bond⠀does⠀not⠀shrink⠀the⠀world⠀to⠀two⠀people.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀feeling⠀keeps⠀its⠀full⠀extent;⠀rendering⠀it⠀alone⠀grants⠀no⠀extra⠀cast⠀knowledge,⠀while⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀communication⠀and⠀permitted⠀mental⠀access⠀remain⠀intact.⠀No⠀stock⠀trope,⠀misunderstanding,⠀confession,⠀repair,⠀or⠀status⠀change⠀must⠀occur⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀comic⠀possibility⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀cadence⠀of⠀retelling⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀communal⠀legend.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀act⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀it,⠀then⠀supply⠀the⠀actual⠀means⠀and⠀consequences⠀with⠀enough⠀precision⠀for⠀comic⠀proportion.⠀The⠀declaration⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀and⠀still⠀incomplete:⠀someone⠀is⠀remembered⠀for⠀the⠀time⠀they⠀fixed⠀the⠀door,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀includes⠀the⠀wrong⠀tool,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀watching,⠀and⠀the⠀door⠀coming⠀off⠀again.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀wording⠀to⠀make⠀an⠀actual⠀relation⠀within⠀the⠀account⠀recognizable,⠀whether⠀its⠀application⠀changes⠀or⠀stays⠀familiar.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀link⠀repeated⠀attempts⠀or⠀return⠀across⠀the⠀telling⠀of⠀one⠀act;⠀no⠀second⠀attempt⠀or⠀newly⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀required.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀source's⠀memory⠀stay⠀visible.⠀The⠀person⠀who⠀did⠀the⠀thing⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀inconvenience⠀while⠀others⠀remember⠀the⠀result,⠀and⠀both⠀versions⠀can⠀be⠀true⠀without⠀a⠀final⠀verdict.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀real⠀narrator's⠀scope⠀and⠀the⠀original⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀reputation.⠀Being⠀remembered⠀as⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀fixed⠀the⠀door⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀fixing⠀was⠀cheerful,⠀easy,⠀or⠀voluntary.⠀Authorized⠀inner⠀life⠀keeps⠀its⠀actual⠀extent⠀and⠀is⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀public⠀account.⠀Rendering⠀it⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀community⠀knowledge,⠀while⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀communication⠀and⠀permitted⠀mental⠀access⠀remain⠀intact.⠀No⠀humble⠀deed,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀oath,⠀or⠀finished⠀verdict⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀ongoing⠀telling⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀thought,⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀domestic⠀arrangement⠀already⠀supplied:⠀who⠀uses⠀which⠀space,⠀when⠀a⠀routine⠀happens,⠀what⠀belongs⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀how⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀preference⠀crosses⠀those⠀lines.⠀Let⠀each⠀person⠀pursue⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀fit⠀or⠀friction⠀among⠀those⠀uses,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀national⠀temperament⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀mishap.\n\nTime⠀the⠀encounter⠀around⠀real⠀practical⠀sequence.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀prepare,⠀wait,⠀return,⠀discover,⠀or⠀continue⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀while⠀another⠀person's⠀expectation⠀runs⠀ahead⠀or⠀behind.⠀Let⠀competent⠀cooperation⠀work⠀without⠀hidden⠀resentment.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀help⠀accurately,⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀or⠀follow⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀purpose,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀remain⠀comic⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀stumble,⠀a⠀secret,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange.\n\nKeep⠀knowledge⠀particular.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀know⠀where⠀the⠀item⠀is⠀kept;⠀another⠀may⠀assume⠀a⠀different⠀use⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀space.⠀Show⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀actually⠀see,⠀hear,⠀or⠀remember,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀established⠀voice⠀carry⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀attention.⠀A⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀response⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀comic⠀beat⠀when⠀it⠀lands⠀against⠀the⠀arrangement⠀already⠀in⠀view.\n\nDo⠀not⠀assign⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀mood⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀active⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀No⠀new⠀chore⠀around⠀every⠀attempt,⠀improved⠀bond,⠀or⠀delivered⠀punchline⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀relevant⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀circumstance⠀beside⠀actual⠀conduct.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀position,⠀continue⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀enter⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀heading⠀and⠀action⠀block⠀establish⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀available⠀to⠀see⠀and⠀hear.⠀Build⠀comic⠀recognition⠀through⠀that⠀observable⠀relation,⠀with⠀a⠀reaction⠀shot⠀or⠀performed⠀gag⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀supports⠀it;⠀neither⠀is⠀required.\n\nUse⠀a⠀cut⠀or⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀place⠀two⠀preparations⠀side⠀by⠀side,⠀reveal⠀what⠀a⠀speaker⠀cannot⠀see,⠀or⠀move⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step.⠀An⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀arrive⠀before,⠀during,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀line,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀a⠀proof⠀of⠀motive⠀or⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀knows.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀remains⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀not⠀automatically⠀dialogue⠀or⠀cast⠀knowledge.⠀Separately⠀authorized⠀voice-over⠀is⠀its⠀own⠀performed⠀channel⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀required⠀private⠀experience;⠀retain⠀both⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀calls⠀for⠀them.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀one⠀thing⠀while⠀saying⠀another,⠀or⠀think⠀and⠀say⠀the⠀same⠀thing;⠀the⠀reason⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀person's⠀attention,⠀habit,⠀or⠀relationship.\n\nDo⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀demonstration,⠀delivered⠀punchline,⠀or⠀fictional⠀pause.⠀Competent⠀continuation⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀comic⠀as⠀a⠀supported⠀surprise.⠀The⠀active⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀playable⠀space.⠀Make⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀positions,⠀objects,⠀and⠀stillness⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀an⠀actor⠀can⠀perform⠀the⠀business.⠀Let⠀a⠀line⠀meet⠀the⠀practical⠀action⠀of⠀the⠀space:⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀answer⠀while⠀folding,⠀hold⠀a⠀cup⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀or⠀continue⠀toward⠀a⠀door⠀as⠀another⠀speaker⠀makes⠀a⠀request.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀speech⠀and⠀business,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀manufactured⠀stumble,⠀prop,⠀or⠀interruption.\n\nLet⠀timing⠀and⠀repetition⠀work⠀through⠀ordinary⠀response.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀repeat⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀plain⠀answer,⠀or⠀complete⠀a⠀task⠀while⠀another⠀person⠀waits.⠀Competent⠀cooperation⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀without⠀hidden⠀resentment⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀failure.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀delivered⠀gag,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀plan⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀separate⠀from⠀performed⠀asides⠀or⠀monologues⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀for⠀its⠀actual⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀audience;⠀it⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀reception.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀character's⠀separate⠀live⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀whose⠀presentation⠀alone⠀gives⠀the⠀cast⠀no⠀extra⠀access.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀settings.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nFollow⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀actual⠀associative⠀movement⠀through⠀the⠀scene.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀private⠀wording,⠀remembered⠀experience,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀as⠀they⠀arise⠀for⠀that⠀particular⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀the⠀associations:⠀a⠀sound⠀can⠀pull⠀up⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀can⠀turn⠀into⠀an⠀old⠀argument,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀plan.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀established⠀present⠀events⠀from⠀recollection,⠀anticipation,⠀or⠀fantasy.\n\nLet⠀comic⠀recognition⠀arise⠀inside⠀that⠀traffic.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀they⠀expected⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀happening,⠀remember⠀a⠀previous⠀attempt,⠀or⠀hear⠀their⠀own⠀private⠀wording⠀collide⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀moment.⠀Humor⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀long⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀rumination.⠀The⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀solution,⠀a⠀changed⠀belief,⠀or⠀an⠀outward⠀return.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀grant⠀the⠀narrator⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀Keep⠀the⠀established⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀settings.⠀Prose⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀fictional⠀elapsed⠀time;⠀actual⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events⠀govern⠀duration.⠀The⠀active⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀continuing⠀thought,⠀perception,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacauaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀in⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀register⠀and⠀extent.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀terse,⠀elaborate,⠀literal,⠀dry,⠀exuberant,⠀or⠀uninterested⠀in⠀the⠀joke,⠀and⠀their⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀a⠀request,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀remembered⠀wording⠀meet⠀actual⠀uptake:⠀accurate⠀agreement,⠀a⠀real⠀misunderstanding,⠀a⠀plain⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀that