installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nPlace⠀an⠀actual⠀costly⠀request⠀beside⠀a⠀relevant⠀social⠀account⠀of⠀independence,⠀duty,⠀apology⠀or⠀help.⠀Attribute⠀that⠀account⠀to⠀its⠀real⠀speaker,⠀community⠀context⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrator;⠀the⠀requester⠀need⠀not⠀personally⠀hold⠀a⠀theory⠀about⠀needing⠀or⠀claim⠀to⠀be⠀fine.⠀Keep⠀the⠀account⠀and⠀actual⠀asking⠀close⠀enough⠀for⠀their⠀particular⠀relation⠀to⠀be⠀readable.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀practical⠀fit⠀between⠀them—a⠀request⠀that⠀is⠀accurate⠀but⠀badly⠀timed,⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀independence⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀specific⠀small⠀dependence,⠀an⠀apology⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀wrong⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀hurt⠀while⠀still⠀being⠀sincerely⠀meant.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀claim⠀to⠀be⠀false⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀hidden;⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀falsehood⠀or⠀withholding⠀the⠀person⠀and⠀circumstances⠀support.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀know⠀exactly⠀what⠀they⠀need⠀and⠀still⠀find⠀the⠀asking⠀costly.⠀Render⠀the⠀inward⠀cost⠀directly:⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀speaking,⠀the⠀rehearsed⠀sentence⠀that⠀comes⠀out⠀altered,⠀the⠀relief⠀or⠀shame⠀after⠀the⠀words⠀are⠀out.⠀Let⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀develop⠀as⠀it⠀actually⠀does,⠀remaining⠀unresolved⠀or⠀reaching⠀a⠀real⠀understanding⠀without⠀either⠀result⠀being⠀required.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀repaired⠀bond,⠀or⠀a⠀lighter⠀mood.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀exchange.\n\nTime⠀the⠀comic⠀recognition⠀through⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀response.⠀A⠀precise⠀practical⠀answer⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀through⠀its⠀exact⠀familiar⠀fit,⠀an⠀unexpected⠀but⠀apt⠀offer,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀difference⠀of⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀need⠀and⠀provide⠀the⠀requested⠀help⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀wrong⠀focus⠀or⠀unwanted⠀response.⠀Keep⠀each⠀character's⠀relationship⠀to⠀language⠀distinct.⠀One⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀careful⠀official⠀terms,⠀another⠀in⠀blunt⠀practical⠀ones,⠀another⠀may⠀avoid⠀naming⠀the⠀need⠀at⠀all.⠀The⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀translate⠀every⠀gap⠀into⠀a⠀joke.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀world's⠀consequences.⠀The⠀need⠀remains⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀funny.⠀A⠀failed⠀or⠀awkward⠀request⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀happens⠀next⠀without⠀being⠀punished⠀by⠀the⠀narrative.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀grow,⠀learn,⠀or⠀earn⠀relief⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀by⠀resolving⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀and⠀orienting⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀aim⠀is⠀underway.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀so⠀each⠀speaker's⠀contribution⠀is⠀clear⠀without⠀stage-direction⠀clutter.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀interval⠀from⠀a⠀stated⠀expectation,⠀role,⠀or⠀claim⠀meeting⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀conduct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀announce⠀how⠀something⠀is⠀done,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀owed,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀would⠀never⠀do,⠀with⠀actual⠀conduct⠀or⠀authorized⠀consideration⠀placing⠀that⠀account⠀in⠀context⠀when⠀it⠀occurs;⠀a⠀complete⠀demonstration⠀need⠀not⠀arrive⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀For⠀example:⠀the⠀competent⠀person⠀doing⠀the⠀task⠀slightly⠀wrong⠀on⠀purpose,⠀the⠀official⠀explanation⠀colliding⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀reality,⠀the⠀group⠀cooperating⠀accurately⠀while⠀each⠀member⠀understands⠀the⠀plan⠀differently.⠀Accurate⠀cooperation⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀funny⠀as⠀a⠀gap.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀participant⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator⠀on⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀active⠀NPCs⠀pursuing⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives.⠀They⠀may⠀help,⠀resist,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀continue⠀an⠀unrelated⠀task⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀aims.⠀Their⠀choices⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀serve⠀the⠀player's⠀interpretation⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Preserve⠀player⠀ownership⠀and⠀distinct⠀voices.⠀Render⠀each⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀including⠀thoughts⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀surface⠀in⠀speech.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀manufactured⠀obstacle,⠀correction,⠀witty⠀exchange,⠀response,⠀or⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀continue⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀unresolved⠀aim,⠀an⠀ongoing⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀interval.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Ground⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀an⠀actual⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀public⠀arrangement⠀by⠀showing⠀who⠀has⠀time,⠀access,⠀responsibility,⠀or⠀benefit.⠀Let⠀the⠀comedy⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀that⠀arrangement⠀sitting⠀beside⠀its⠀real⠀use:⠀a⠀rule⠀announced⠀for⠀everyone⠀but⠀followed⠀only⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀wrote⠀it,⠀a⠀shared⠀duty⠀that⠀falls⠀to⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀cannot⠀refuse,⠀a⠀public⠀virtue⠀that⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀describe⠀a⠀private⠀convenience.\n\nDo⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀unjust⠀system,⠀representative⠀victim,⠀or⠀forced⠀exposure.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀competent.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀precise⠀fit—the⠀person⠀best⠀suited⠀to⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀also⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀least⠀wants⠀it—or⠀from⠀personal⠀preferences⠀that⠀make⠀a⠀sensible⠀rule⠀absurd⠀in⠀practice.⠀Give⠀the⠀satire⠀a⠀particular⠀basis⠀in⠀how⠀these⠀people⠀use⠀this⠀arrangement.⠀A⠀broader⠀judgment⠀may⠀remain⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator⠀or⠀character⠀makes⠀it,⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀concrete⠀social⠀behavior⠀with⠀a⠀stock⠀moral.\n\nPreserve⠀individual⠀motives⠀and⠀narrator⠀access.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀rule⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀have⠀nothing⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀its⠀stated⠀purpose,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀hypocrite.⠀Render⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀where⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀it,⠀including⠀thoughts⠀that⠀contradict⠀the⠀public⠀account.⠀Keep⠀the⠀supplied⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀period⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.\n\nNo⠀changed⠀hierarchy⠀or⠀moral⠀correction⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement⠀still⠀in⠀place,⠀the⠀mismatch⠀still⠀visible,⠀and⠀the⠀participants⠀still⠀living⠀with⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀concrete⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀action⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀explanatory⠀padding,⠀letting⠀the⠀physical⠀facts⠀carry⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀load,⠀the⠀wear⠀on⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀where⠀something⠀is⠀and⠀where⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀be.⠀Where⠀the⠀task⠀supports⠀it,⠀give⠀the⠀material⠀particulars⠀real⠀texture—the⠀resistance⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀surface,⠀the⠀effort⠀in⠀a⠀repeated⠀motion.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comedy⠀from⠀the⠀terms⠀people⠀give⠀an⠀arrangement⠀meeting⠀its⠀practical⠀handling.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀job⠀as⠀simple,⠀a⠀schedule⠀as⠀reasonable,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀as⠀reliable,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀detail⠀shows⠀the⠀actual⠀work⠀involved.⠀The⠀fit⠀can⠀be⠀accurate⠀and⠀still⠀funny:⠀the⠀job⠀is⠀simple,⠀but⠀only⠀if⠀done⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀order⠀that⠀nobody⠀mentioned;⠀the⠀schedule⠀is⠀reasonable,⠀but⠀only⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀also⠀have⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀materials.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀broken⠀equipment,⠀a⠀failed⠀plan,⠀or⠀suffering⠀to⠀force⠀the⠀joke.\n\nKeep⠀competence⠀and⠀supplied⠀stakes⠀intact.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀good⠀at⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀still⠀find⠀the⠀official⠀description⠀of⠀it⠀absurd.⠀Roughness⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀speaker,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀as⠀a⠀universal⠀abrasive⠀voice.⠀When⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀or⠀feeling⠀needs⠀space,⠀let⠀the⠀longer⠀thought⠀or⠀inward⠀passage⠀stand⠀without⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀act.⠀The⠀rhythm⠀can⠀shift⠀between⠀compressed⠀action⠀and⠀extended⠀attention⠀where⠀the⠀material⠀or⠀emotional⠀weight⠀justifies⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nUse⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀document⠀form—letter,⠀report,⠀record,⠀note,⠀or⠀other⠀authored⠀artifact—with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Let⠀the⠀document's⠀stated⠀terms⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀real⠀context⠀or⠀later⠀uptake⠀that⠀gives⠀it⠀comic⠀proportion.⠀An⠀exact⠀instruction⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀the⠀recipient⠀follows⠀it⠀precisely⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀author⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate.⠀A⠀courteous⠀note⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀the⠀courtesy⠀is⠀technically⠀correct⠀and⠀practically⠀useless.⠀A⠀report⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀its⠀official⠀language⠀describes⠀an⠀event⠀that⠀everyone⠀involved⠀experienced⠀differently.\n\nAccurate⠀records⠀need⠀no⠀hidden⠀flaw.⠀The⠀document⠀can⠀be⠀truthful,⠀competent,⠀and⠀well-intentioned,⠀and⠀the⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀it⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀situation⠀actually⠀requires.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀secret⠀error,⠀a⠀forged⠀signature,⠀or⠀a⠀concealed⠀motive⠀into⠀every⠀record.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀later⠀annotation,⠀marginal⠀note,⠀or⠀appended⠀reply⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀own⠀composition⠀moment⠀and⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀which⠀may⠀remain⠀unchanged;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀rewrite⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀author⠀knew⠀or⠀wrote.⠀Keep⠀each⠀writer's⠀register⠀distinct:⠀an⠀official⠀report⠀sounds⠀different⠀from⠀a⠀personal⠀letter,⠀and⠀neither⠀should⠀collapse⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice.\n\nRender⠀full⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀artifact⠀where⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀requires⠀it.⠀The⠀document⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀record;⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀uncertain,⠀more⠀affectionate,⠀more⠀irritated,⠀or⠀more⠀aware⠀than⠀the⠀written⠀words.⠀No⠀second⠀document,⠀corrective⠀note,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀completed⠀correspondence⠀cycle⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀preference,⠀accommodation,⠀or⠀small⠀pleasure⠀that⠀makes⠀an⠀offered⠀kindness⠀real.⠀Use⠀the⠀helper's⠀actual⠀knowledge:⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀the⠀chair⠀they⠀prefer,⠀the⠀task⠀they⠀hate⠀that⠀someone⠀else⠀quietly⠀does.⠀Let⠀the⠀care⠀be⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀belong⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀gesture⠀of⠀comfort.\n\nPosition⠀a⠀relevant⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀help⠀means⠀beside⠀its⠀practical⠀delivery⠀and⠀reception.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀announce⠀that⠀they⠀are⠀being⠀looked⠀after,⠀that⠀they⠀never⠀accept⠀help,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀small⠀favor⠀is⠀nothing,⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀actual⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀care:⠀the⠀helper⠀doing⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing⠀with⠀complete⠀sincerity,⠀the⠀recipient⠀accepting⠀a⠀kindness⠀they⠀just⠀denied⠀needing,⠀the⠀group's⠀shared⠀understanding⠀of⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀looks⠀inefficient⠀to⠀an⠀outsider⠀but⠀works⠀perfectly⠀for⠀them.\n\nRecognized⠀competent⠀care⠀and⠀spontaneous⠀offers⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀without⠀a⠀forgotten⠀worker⠀or⠀hidden⠀cost.⠀The⠀helper⠀can⠀be⠀good⠀at⠀helping⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀their⠀method⠀is⠀particular.⠀The⠀recipient⠀can⠀be⠀genuinely⠀comforted⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀their⠀gratitude⠀takes⠀an⠀unexpected⠀form.⠀Do⠀not⠀discredit⠀the⠀care⠀or⠀the⠀claim⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀joke.\n\nPreserve⠀sincerity,⠀privacy,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀feeling.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀grateful⠀and⠀annoyed⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time,⠀or⠀comforted⠀by⠀something⠀they⠀would⠀never⠀admit⠀to⠀wanting.⠀Keep⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀No⠀thanks,⠀improvement,⠀repayment,⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair⠀must⠀precede⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀situate⠀the⠀occasion⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀be:⠀a⠀formal⠀duty,⠀a⠀family⠀custom,⠀a⠀professional⠀role,⠀a⠀public⠀occasion.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀decoration;⠀it⠀supplies⠀the⠀description⠀that⠀the⠀actual⠀behavior⠀will⠀meet.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀relevant⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀role⠀or⠀arrangement⠀beside⠀the⠀person's⠀real⠀conduct.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀official⠀account⠀of⠀how⠀something⠀is⠀done,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀this⠀person⠀does⠀it.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀that⠀movement:⠀the⠀qualification⠀can⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀precise⠀clause⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀long⠀sentence,⠀or⠀the⠀accurate⠀fit⠀can⠀emerge⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀small⠀observed⠀details⠀that⠀confirm,⠀clarify,⠀or⠀genuinely⠀qualify⠀the⠀opening⠀description⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀revision.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀false⠀claim,⠀a⠀public⠀exposure,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀quip.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀cast⠀voices⠀distinct.⠀The⠀composed⠀frame⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register;⠀the⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀plain⠀practical⠀language⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀maintains⠀its⠀formal⠀distance,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀those⠀registers⠀can⠀itself⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀comedy.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.\n\nPreserve⠀serious⠀stakes⠀and⠀full⠀inward⠀extent.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀while⠀the⠀underlying⠀situation⠀remains⠀consequential.⠀Render⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀including⠀thoughts⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀surface⠀in⠀speech⠀or⠀action.⠀No⠀high-status⠀setting,⠀omniscient⠀expansion,⠀or⠀changed⠀interpretation⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀first:⠀who⠀is⠀telling,⠀to⠀whom,⠀where,⠀and⠀what⠀immediate⠀need⠀or⠀pleasure⠀makes⠀this⠀telling⠀happen.⠀The⠀teller⠀is⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀register,⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀narrator.⠀The⠀listeners⠀are⠀also⠀particular:⠀one⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀the⠀story,⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀meal,⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀using⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀avoid⠀another⠀conversation.⠀Let⠀their⠀attention⠀and⠀interruptions⠀be⠀real⠀social⠀behavior⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀chorus⠀of⠀reactions.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀account,⠀show⠀people⠀pursuing⠀recognizable⠀aims⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀claims⠀a⠀role,⠀explains⠀a⠀rule,⠀or⠀describes⠀how⠀an⠀institution⠀works,⠀place⠀that⠀stated⠀account⠀beside⠀what⠀the⠀tale's⠀people⠀actually⠀do.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀fit⠀or⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀practical⠀reality:⠀a⠀procedure⠀described⠀as⠀solemn⠀may⠀be⠀performed⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀find⠀a⠀lost⠀shoe;⠀a⠀reputation⠀for⠀wisdom⠀may⠀rest⠀on⠀one⠀lucky⠀decision⠀and⠀a⠀great⠀deal⠀of⠀nodding.⠀Make⠀recognition⠀available⠀through⠀the⠀conduct⠀without⠀redundant⠀gloss,⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀actual⠀explanatory⠀speech⠀or⠀private⠀recognition⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀voice.\n\nUse⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀manage⠀knowledge⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀select,⠀omit,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀details⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀position⠀and⠀purpose.⠀A⠀listener⠀can⠀ask⠀about⠀timing,⠀access,⠀or⠀sequence,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀answer⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀confidently⠀wrong.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀tale's⠀participants⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Render⠀full⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀for⠀authorized⠀people⠀at⠀either⠀level,⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀performs⠀or⠀listeners⠀visibly⠀show;⠀a⠀long⠀feeling⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀needs⠀no⠀immediate⠀use.⠀A⠀later⠀understanding⠀does⠀not⠀retroactively⠀become⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀Repeated⠀phrases⠀or⠀objects⠀may⠀connect⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels,⠀but⠀their⠀recurrence⠀should⠀help⠀the⠀reader⠀notice⠀a⠀change⠀or⠀a⠀pattern,⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀true.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀respond⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀lesson.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀already⠀understand⠀the⠀point,⠀disagree⠀with⠀it,⠀or⠀remain⠀distracted⠀by⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀practical⠀business,⠀continued⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀mood,⠀or⠀simply⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀ends.⠀No⠀corrected⠀belief,⠀useful⠀moral,⠀or⠀natural⠀pause⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀unresolved⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀actually⠀doing,⠀at⠀both⠀levels⠀of⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modernist/absurdist⠀construction⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀real⠀rule,⠀classification,⠀official⠀claim,⠀or⠀institutional⠀arrangement⠀that⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀know⠀or⠀observe.⠀State⠀its⠀terms⠀plainly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀arrangement⠀says⠀it⠀does.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀hostile⠀bureaucracy⠀or⠀a⠀trap;⠀build⠀the⠀absurdist⠀relation⠀through⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀stated⠀logic⠀meeting⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀circumstances.⠀Its⠀stated⠀logic⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀world⠀law;⠀actual⠀outside⠀causes⠀and⠀the⠀supplied⠀mechanisms⠀remain⠀operative.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀terms⠀into⠀their⠀application.⠀Distinguish⠀three⠀levels:⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀claim⠀states,⠀what⠀people⠀imagine⠀it⠀implies,⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀happens⠀when⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀tries⠀to⠀live⠀with⠀it.⠀The⠀comedy⠀arises⠀from⠀a⠀precise⠀fit⠀or⠀a⠀genuine⠀contradiction⠀among⠀these⠀levels.⠀A⠀form⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀signature⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀exist;⠀a⠀classification⠀may⠀sort⠀a⠀person⠀into⠀a⠀category⠀that⠀changes⠀their⠀access⠀to⠀lunch;⠀a⠀claim⠀of⠀efficiency⠀may⠀produce⠀a⠀queue⠀that⠀exists⠀only⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀queue.⠀Give⠀any⠀contradiction⠀a⠀concrete⠀local⠀basis⠀while⠀preserving⠀a⠀broader⠀judgment⠀or⠀complaint⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator⠀or⠀character⠀is⠀entitled⠀to⠀make.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀characters'⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority⠀distinct.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀treat⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀vocabulary⠀as⠀natural⠀and⠀complete.⠀Another⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀while⠀clearly⠀meaning⠀something⠀else.⠀A⠀third⠀may⠀simply⠀be⠀trying⠀to⠀get⠀home⠀before⠀the⠀rain.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator⠀on⠀the⠀absurdity.⠀The⠀humor⠀often⠀works⠀best⠀when⠀one⠀person⠀remains⠀entirely⠀practical⠀while⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀stated⠀terms⠀continue⠀to⠀operate⠀beside⠀them.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀actual⠀stakes⠀and⠀mechanisms⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.⠀The⠀absurdist⠀construction⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀real⠀consequences,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀arrangement⠀to⠀fail,⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀correct⠀it,⠀or⠀anyone⠀to⠀learn⠀a⠀lesson.⠀The⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀consideration⠀or⠀action.⠀Private⠀attention⠀remains⠀available⠀beyond⠀its⠀immediate⠀usefulness:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀notice⠀the⠀contradiction,⠀feel⠀the⠀inconvenience,⠀or⠀think⠀about⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀stops,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLocate⠀a⠀real⠀title,⠀privilege,⠀public⠀image,⠀or⠀private⠀desire⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀material⠀relationships.⠀The⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀old,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀actual⠀within⠀the⠀story:⠀a⠀family⠀name,⠀a⠀position,⠀a⠀reputation,⠀a⠀claim⠀to⠀access,⠀or⠀a⠀role⠀that⠀shapes⠀how⠀people⠀address⠀one⠀another.⠀The⠀present-life⠀intimacy⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀friendship,⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀working⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀want⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀fit⠀the⠀public⠀image.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampires,⠀factions,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers;⠀use⠀the⠀portable⠀treatment⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀colliding⠀with⠀present⠀life.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀account⠀given⠀of⠀the⠀authority⠀beside⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do⠀or⠀ask⠀for.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀a⠀precise⠀familiar⠀fit⠀or⠀gap.⠀A⠀title⠀may⠀demand⠀formality⠀while⠀its⠀holder⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀unstick⠀a⠀window.⠀A⠀public⠀image⠀of⠀control⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀habit⠀of⠀losing⠀keys.⠀A⠀privilege⠀may⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀still⠀produce⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀obligation.⠀Build⠀humor⠀through⠀particular⠀conduct⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀authority⠀to⠀be⠀fraudulent.⠀Any⠀actual⠀fraud,⠀discovery⠀or⠀satirical⠀judgment⠀retains⠀its⠀supported⠀context.⠀The⠀mask⠀need⠀not⠀fall,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀behind⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀a⠀hypocrite.\n\nUse⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀shape⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀motive⠀evidence.⠀Urban⠀material⠀detail,⠀private⠀desire,⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀encounter⠀feel⠀charged⠀or⠀uneasy⠀without⠀explaining⠀why⠀someone⠀acted.⠀A⠀dim⠀hallway⠀or⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀matters⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀function⠀and⠀history,⠀not⠀merely⠀through⠀mood.⠀Keep⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀know.⠀A⠀private⠀desire⠀may⠀be⠀fully⠀present⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀while⠀remaining⠀invisible⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀addressed.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀freely⠀offered⠀or⠀earned⠀trust,⠀full⠀desire,⠀and⠀established⠀powers.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀complicated⠀intimacy.⠀No⠀unmasking,⠀betrayal,⠀concealed⠀kindness,⠀authority⠀collapse,⠀or⠀lesson⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀unresolved⠀tension⠀between⠀the⠀public⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀particular,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀lyric/philosophical⠀inwardness⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Follow⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀question⠀about⠀fairness,⠀duty,⠀care,⠀or⠀belonging.⠀The⠀question⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀situation⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀position,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀essay⠀topic.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀return⠀deliberately⠀to⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀real⠀case,⠀or⠀a⠀hypothetical⠀particular⠀to⠀test⠀the⠀scope⠀of⠀the⠀question.⠀A⠀return⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀refrain⠀imposed⠀on⠀every⠀paragraph;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀considered⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀thought⠀needs⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀inward⠀movement⠀to⠀place⠀a⠀social⠀claim⠀beside⠀actual⠀or⠀imagined⠀particulars.⠀A⠀rule⠀about⠀duty⠀may⠀be⠀tested⠀against⠀a⠀remembered⠀afternoon,⠀a⠀hypothetical⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀of⠀who⠀will⠀carry⠀the⠀tea.⠀A⠀precise⠀qualification⠀or⠀unchanged⠀familiar⠀understanding⠀can⠀carry⠀comedy⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀thinker's⠀humiliation.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀self-recognition,⠀error⠀or⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀excluding⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀reach⠀no⠀new⠀insight,⠀or⠀may⠀reach⠀one⠀that⠀is⠀partial⠀and⠀still⠀true.⠀Keep⠀claims⠀and⠀world⠀facts⠀distinct:⠀a⠀remembered⠀event⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀principle,⠀and⠀an⠀imagined⠀case⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.\n\nLet⠀the⠀prose⠀sustain⠀the⠀question⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀deliberate⠀attention.⠀Lyrical⠀movement⠀can⠀develop⠀an⠀image⠀or⠀a⠀comparison⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀thinker⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀the⠀question⠀more⠀present.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀provide⠀contrast.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀inwardness⠀into⠀constant⠀solemnity.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀practical,⠀irritated,⠀amused,⠀or⠀hungry⠀while⠀thinking.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀feeling,⠀abstract⠀thought,⠀and⠀uncertainty.⠀No⠀mandatory⠀hypocrisy,⠀superior⠀thinker,⠀bodily⠀cue,⠀new⠀insight,⠀outward⠀result,⠀or⠀mental⠀pause⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀question⠀remains⠀open,⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀considering⠀a⠀case,⠀or⠀while⠀ordinary⠀life⠀interrupts⠀the⠀reflection.⠀The⠀comedy⠀and⠀the⠀thought⠀can⠀coexist⠀without⠀either⠀canceling⠀the⠀other.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀diary⠀with⠀reflective⠀notes⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀The⠀recorder⠀is⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀situation,⠀writing⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀time⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀purposes.⠀The⠀entry⠀selects⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀would⠀actually⠀record:⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀said,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀was⠀announced,⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀was⠀supposed⠀to⠀happen,⠀or⠀an⠀observed⠀act.⠀The⠀selection⠀is⠀not⠀neutral.⠀It⠀follows⠀the⠀recorder's⠀habits,⠀preoccupations,⠀and⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀worth⠀noting.\n\nPlace⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀how⠀things⠀ought⠀to⠀work⠀beside⠀the⠀recorder's⠀actual⠀notation.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀juxtaposition.⠀A⠀rule⠀may⠀be⠀written⠀down⠀in⠀full,⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀note⠀that⠀nobody⠀followed⠀it.⠀A⠀routine⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀as⠀orderly,⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀what⠀actually⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀margins.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀recorded⠀because⠀it⠀sounded⠀official,⠀with⠀a⠀later⠀note⠀about⠀what⠀it⠀turned⠀out⠀to⠀mean.⠀Let⠀the⠀recorder's⠀register⠀carry⠀the⠀recognition.⠀The⠀humor⠀need⠀not⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀theory⠀or⠀a⠀corrected⠀belief;⠀it⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀stated⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀note.\n\nKeep⠀original⠀composition,⠀later⠀annotations,⠀and⠀present⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct.⠀The⠀original⠀entry⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀recorder⠀knew⠀and⠀chose⠀to⠀write⠀at⠀that⠀time.⠀A⠀later⠀annotation⠀may⠀add⠀knowledge,⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀feeling,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀marked⠀as⠀later.⠀The⠀present⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀the⠀composed⠀entry.⠀An⠀unsent⠀or⠀unfinished⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀transcript⠀of⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀diary⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀recorder⠀actually⠀feels⠀or⠀knows⠀now.\n\nDo⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀seasonal⠀inventory,⠀quiet⠀temperament,⠀new⠀revelation,⠀hidden⠀original⠀motive,⠀or⠀completed⠀entry⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-sentence,⠀break⠀off⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀reason,⠀or⠀continue⠀into⠀a⠀reflective⠀note⠀that⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀notation,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀recorder⠀to⠀resolve⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀polyphonic/nonlinear⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀account⠀or⠀moment⠀to⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀time.⠀A⠀source⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀character,⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀remembered⠀scene,⠀or⠀a⠀narrator's⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀always⠀know⠀whose⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀presented⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀belongs.⠀Do⠀not⠀merge⠀the⠀sources⠀into⠀one⠀neutral⠀summary.⠀Construct⠀comedy⠀through⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀of⠀attributed⠀accounts⠀while⠀retaining⠀any⠀explanation⠀or⠀factual⠀judgment⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀authority;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀replace⠀those⠀situated⠀accounts.\n\nSelect⠀an⠀actual⠀repeated⠀detail⠀or⠀claim⠀that⠀different⠀sources⠀notice⠀differently.⠀The⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀routine,⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀act.⠀One⠀source⠀may⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀central;⠀another⠀may⠀mention⠀it⠀only⠀because⠀it⠀blocked⠀a⠀doorway;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀remember⠀it⠀inaccurately⠀while⠀still⠀reporting⠀something⠀true.⠀Place⠀these⠀accounts⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀the⠀real⠀emphases.⠀The⠀humor⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀each⠀source⠀finds⠀worth⠀recording⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀detail⠀actually⠀does⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀original⠀and⠀later⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀A⠀source⠀who⠀speaks⠀from⠀memory⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀now⠀than⠀they⠀knew⠀then,⠀and⠀that⠀difference⠀must⠀be⠀visible.⠀A⠀later⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀retroactively⠀change⠀an⠀earlier⠀one.⠀Sources⠀can⠀agree⠀accurately⠀or⠀disagree⠀as⠀supported⠀by⠀their⠀positions⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Neither⠀equal⠀truthfulness⠀nor⠀an⠀exposed⠀liar⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀verdict.\n\nPreserve⠀narrator⠀authority⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀minds.⠀The⠀polyphonic⠀structure⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀or⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀Each⠀source's⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀No⠀completed⠀baseline,⠀convergence,⠀verdict,⠀or⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀one⠀account⠀remains⠀unfinished⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀assembled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀the⠀real⠀location,⠀participants,⠀and⠀activity⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀moments⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀and⠀where.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀track:⠀when⠀someone⠀moves,⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀shifts,⠀or⠀when⠀an⠀object⠀changes⠀hands,⠀make⠀the⠀movement⠀legible⠀without⠀over-describing.⠀Provide⠀unfamiliar⠀terms⠀or⠀mechanisms⠀through⠀permitted⠀context,⠀preparation,⠀observation,⠀or⠀use.⠀A⠀name⠀or⠀rule⠀can⠀be⠀presented⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀needs⠀it,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀detached⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀A⠀beat⠀of⠀action⠀can⠀stand⠀on⠀its⠀own.⠀A⠀spoken⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀reaction⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀character.⠀Private⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀amused,⠀or⠀practical⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀common⠀voice⠀or⠀turn⠀every⠀reply⠀into⠀a⠀quip.\n\nTime⠀a⠀relevant⠀expectation⠀or⠀explanation⠀against⠀actual⠀conduct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀how⠀a⠀procedure⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀work,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀actually⠀happens.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀stated⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀reception.⠀Familiar⠀agreement⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀without⠀a⠀correction:⠀two⠀people⠀may⠀both⠀know⠀the⠀rule⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀follow⠀it⠀for⠀entirely⠀different⠀reasons.⠀A⠀blind⠀spot⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀remains⠀unaware⠀of⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀aims⠀at⠀their⠀supplied⠀scale,⠀character-owned⠀reaction,⠀and⠀full⠀inward⠀extent.⠀The⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀escalate⠀into⠀a⠀larger⠀crisis⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀delivered⠀response.⠀No⠀young⠀cast,⠀first⠀person,⠀demonstration,⠀quip,⠀or⠀closing⠀hook⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀unresolved⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀situation⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀it⠀are⠀actually⠀doing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWork⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀object,⠀sound,⠀or⠀phrase⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀recurrence⠀organize⠀the⠀paragraph.⠀Let⠀recurrence⠀develop⠀its⠀felt⠀relation⠀through⠀syntax:⠀a⠀plainly⠀named⠀detail⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀rhythmic⠀or⠀figurative⠀extension,⠀confirming⠀familiar⠀weight⠀or⠀changing⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀attention⠀supports.⠀No⠀fixed⠀first/then⠀pattern⠀or⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀comic⠀turn⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀social⠀description⠀and⠀actual⠀use.⠀When⠀an⠀official⠀phrase,⠀role,⠀or⠀procedure⠀enters,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀physical⠀thing⠀that⠀gives⠀it⠀its⠀real⠀scope:⠀the⠀official⠀name⠀for⠀a⠀machine⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀noise⠀it⠀makes,⠀the⠀roster⠀of⠀a⠀committee⠀next⠀to⠀who⠀actually⠀carries⠀the⠀chairs.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀ironic⠀correction;⠀the⠀right⠀relation⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀qualified,⠀or⠀simply⠀funny⠀through⠀precise⠀fit.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀associations⠀attributable⠀and⠀within⠀access.⠀If⠀a⠀metaphor⠀unfolds,⠀it⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀perspective⠀of⠀the⠀selected⠀teller,⠀not⠀the⠀author's⠀wit,⠀and⠀must⠀not⠀add⠀world⠀facts.⠀Use⠀syntax⠀to⠀create⠀comic⠀timing:⠀a⠀longer⠀clause⠀building⠀expectation,⠀then⠀a⠀short⠀concrete⠀clause⠀that⠀lands⠀the⠀practical⠀particular;⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀declaration⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀proliferation⠀of⠀detail⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀situation.⠀Maintain⠀cast-voice⠀variation;⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀lyrical⠀cadence,⠀another⠀in⠀plain⠀practical⠀terms.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀world's⠀behavior⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀every⠀speaker⠀sounding⠀like⠀the⠀narrator.\n\nAllow⠀private⠀interiority⠀and⠀serious⠀feeling⠀to⠀coexist⠀with⠀comedy.⠀A⠀character's⠀anger,⠀anxiety,⠀or⠀tenderness⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀flattened⠀for⠀the⠀joke.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀association,⠀without⠀returning⠀to⠀action⠀or⠀announcing⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀particular⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀past⠀association:⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀kind⠀of⠀weather,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀still⠀uses,⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀differently.⠀Let⠀the⠀movement⠀into⠀memory⠀follow⠀that⠀thread⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀the⠀past.⠀In⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀preserve⠀the⠀original⠀person's⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀accurate⠀understanding⠀or⠀blind⠀spots⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀either⠀comic⠀blindness⠀or⠀retrofitted⠀wisdom.⠀The⠀comedy⠀often⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀precision⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀social⠀claim—what⠀someone⠀said⠀the⠀work⠀was⠀for,⠀what⠀the⠀group⠀believed⠀it⠀meant—set⠀against⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀can⠀still⠀touch.⠀No⠀new⠀loss⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀remembered⠀claim⠀may⠀remain⠀perfectly⠀accurate⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀funny⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀has⠀a⠀different⠀practical⠀weight.\n\nThe⠀narrator's⠀recollection⠀is⠀fallible:⠀a⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀wrong,⠀a⠀date⠀vague,⠀a⠀motive⠀guessed.⠀Let⠀that⠀uncertainty⠀stay⠀visible⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀teller.⠀Direct⠀reflection⠀may⠀sit⠀alongside⠀an⠀actual⠀sensory⠀present;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀one⠀erase⠀the⠀other.⠀Serious⠀feeling⠀remains⠀serious:⠀affection,⠀grief,⠀or⠀anger⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀comic⠀recognition,⠀and⠀the⠀humor⠀must⠀not⠀reduce⠀them⠀to⠀a⠀punchline.⠀Let⠀sentence⠀movement⠀and⠀actual⠀attention⠀carry⠀attachment⠀and⠀comic⠀exactness⠀at⠀their⠀warranted⠀extent.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀reflection⠀or⠀another⠀actual⠀phase⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀pause,⠀moral,⠀return,⠀or⠀improved⠀mood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀construction.⠀Advance⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀encounters⠀linked⠀by⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀recognizable⠀continuing⠀aim,⠀not⠀by⠀arbitrary⠀obstacles.⠀Give⠀relevant⠀local⠀arrangements⠀their⠀actual⠀terms⠀and⠀any⠀explanation⠀the⠀source⠀provides;⠀a⠀gatekeeper,⠀supplier,⠀neighbor⠀or⠀official⠀need⠀not⠀make⠀a⠀speech⠀or⠀have⠀a⠀complete⠀rationale⠀for⠀the⠀encounter.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀precision⠀of⠀that⠀explanation—its⠀internal⠀logic,⠀its⠀practical⠀use,⠀its⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀physical⠀reality—without⠀requiring⠀the⠀protagonist⠀to⠀misunderstand.⠀Any⠀actual⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀accurate⠀grasp⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀person's⠀real⠀reception.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀be⠀helped,⠀ignored,⠀or⠀delayed,⠀and⠀an⠀encounter⠀may⠀advance,⠀qualify,⠀satisfy⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀aim⠀unchanged.⠀No⠀per-encounter⠀progress,⠀hostile⠀system,⠀or⠀universal⠀fraud⠀is⠀required.\n\nKeep⠀resources,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀relationships⠀continuous⠀across⠀the⠀sequence.⠀What⠀the⠀protagonist⠀learned⠀in⠀one⠀encounter⠀can⠀inform⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀triumph.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀shift⠀between⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀scene;⠀full⠀inner⠀experience⠀is⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀and⠀serious⠀feeling⠀is⠀not⠀sacrificed⠀for⠀satire.⠀When⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀habits⠀or⠀blind⠀spots⠀shape⠀the⠀encounter,⠀make⠀them⠀legible⠀through⠀actual⠀sequence⠀or⠀permitted⠀explanation⠀and⠀private⠀recognition⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀label.⠀The⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀can⠀occur⠀inside⠀any⠀encounter⠀or⠀continuation;⠀no⠀journey's⠀end,⠀moral⠀correction,⠀or⠀changed⠀result⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀stated⠀claim,⠀practical⠀fact,⠀or⠀actual⠀response⠀whose⠀relation⠀makes⠀this⠀comic⠀situation⠀inferable,⠀retaining⠀context⠀already⠀established⠀where⠀sufficient.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀without⠀redundant⠀framing;⠀no⠀fixed⠀three-element⠀or⠀three-sentence⠀beat⠀is⠀required.⠀For⠀example,⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀appears⠀in⠀one⠀sentence,⠀the⠀tool⠀in⠀someone's⠀hand⠀in⠀the⠀next,⠀and⠀the⠀quiet⠀correction⠀in⠀a⠀third;⠀no⠀commentary⠀on⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀them⠀is⠀needed.⠀If⠀the⠀claim⠀is⠀accurate,⠀leave⠀it⠀accurate:⠀\"the⠀water⠀rose\"⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀\"the⠀bucket⠀was⠀there\"⠀without⠀insisting⠀that⠀anyone⠀was⠀deluded.⠀Particular⠀fit⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀humor⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀lie;⠀actual⠀falsehood⠀or⠀its⠀supported⠀exposure⠀remains⠀available.\n\nCut⠀repeated⠀context⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀genuinely⠀redundant.⠀Keep⠀any⠀emotion⠀or⠀private⠀recognition⠀at⠀the⠀length⠀its⠀owner⠀needs;⠀minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀demand⠀short⠀thoughts⠀or⠀deadpan⠀feelings.⠀A⠀long⠀thinking⠀sentence⠀is⠀permitted⠀if⠀its⠀content⠀matters⠀now.⠀Use⠀specific⠀nouns⠀and⠀verbs:⠀the⠀worn⠀handle,⠀the⠀borrowed⠀ladder,⠀the⠀rolled⠀sleeve.⠀Omit⠀redundant⠀transition⠀announcements⠀while⠀retaining⠀needed⠀orientation,⠀causality,⠀and⠀actual⠀narrative⠀voice.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀final⠀clause—mid-thought,⠀mid-task,⠀mid-exchange—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀summing-up,⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀actual⠀explanatory⠀or⠀inward⠀conclusion⠀the⠀scene⠀supports.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience,⠀using⠀actual⠀attention⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrative⠀context⠀to⠀make⠀transitions⠀intelligible⠀without⠀assigning⠀the⠀narrator's⠀perspective⠀to⠀a⠀character.⠀When⠀a⠀role,⠀procedure,⠀or⠀claim⠀matters,⠀make⠀its⠀actual⠀terms⠀legible⠀through⠀use,⠀preparation,⠀discussion,⠀or⠀permitted⠀consideration,⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀demonstration:⠀the⠀meeting⠀as⠀it⠀runs⠀over⠀time,⠀the⠀borrowed⠀uniform⠀as⠀it⠀fits⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀the⠀announced⠀policy⠀as⠀someone⠀asks⠀a⠀practical⠀question.⠀The⠀comedy⠀lies⠀in⠀that⠀use—its⠀accurate⠀fit,⠀its⠀qualified⠀exception,⠀its⠀silent⠀negotiation—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀narrator's⠀aside⠀about⠀absurdity;⠀any⠀actual⠀aside⠀or⠀explicit⠀judgment⠀may⠀still⠀contribute⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀character⠀voices⠀individual.⠀The⠀person⠀who⠀knows⠀a⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀works⠀around⠀it⠀keep⠀their⠀actual⠀registers,⠀which⠀may⠀differ⠀or⠀overlap;⠀neither⠀automatically⠀becomes⠀a⠀vehicle⠀for⠀uniform⠀narrator⠀wit.⠀Let⠀practical⠀competence⠀and⠀serious⠀feeling⠀stand⠀without⠀a⠀joke⠀attached.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective⠀permits,⠀but⠀internal⠀reaction⠀is⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Do⠀not⠀ironize⠀every⠀emotion.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀exchange,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀perception;⠀no⠀conclusive⠀beat,⠀correction,⠀or⠀new⠀development⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀real⠀conduct⠀and⠀whatever⠀context⠀or⠀summary⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀provide.⠀If⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀affection,⠀show⠀the⠀small⠀relevant⠀acts:⠀one⠀remembers⠀the⠀other's⠀order,⠀one⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀tool.⠀If⠀it⠀is⠀rivalry,⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀competing⠀aims⠀and⠀any⠀real⠀shared⠀habits⠀without⠀inventing⠀symmetry⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀point⠀of⠀difference.⠀Use⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀private⠀language,⠀callbacks⠀or⠀history⠀where⠀present;⠀a⠀first⠀encounter⠀needs⠀no⠀invented⠀past⠀and⠀the⠀bond⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀limited⠀to⠀two⠀people.⠀Shared⠀understanding⠀or⠀actual⠀difference⠀can⠀carry⠀humor⠀without⠀requiring⠀one⠀person⠀always⠀right⠀and⠀another⠀always⠀wrong.⠀Preserve⠀whatever⠀real⠀differences⠀in⠀knowledge⠀or⠀competence⠀the⠀story⠀supplies.\n\nPlace⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀say⠀the⠀relation⠀means⠀beside⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀do.⠀The⠀declaration⠀may⠀be⠀perfectly⠀accurate⠀and⠀still⠀funny⠀because⠀it⠀lands⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀moment:⠀\"we⠀always⠀share⠀the⠀work\"⠀said⠀while⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀doing⠀all⠀the⠀carrying.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀hypocrisy;⠀capable⠀help,⠀familiar⠀division,⠀and⠀honest⠀affection⠀can⠀be⠀just⠀as⠀comic⠀through⠀precise⠀fit.⠀Keep⠀the⠀bond's⠀serious⠀moments⠀serious.⠀Let⠀a⠀callback⠀have⠀its⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀whether⠀familiar⠀enjoyment,⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀emphasis⠀or⠀a⠀punchline;⠀no⠀changed⠀depth⠀or⠀meaning⠀is⠀required.⠀Render⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀ownership⠀and⠀narrator⠀permissions,⠀separately⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀say⠀or⠀show.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀relationship⠀may⠀continue,⠀change⠀or⠀end⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀events;⠀no⠀status⠀change,⠀confession⠀or⠀forward⠀movement⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀opening⠀that⠀signals⠀retelling:⠀\"They⠀still⠀speak⠀of⠀the⠀day,\"⠀\"It⠀is⠀said⠀that,\"⠀\"The⠀repair⠀that⠀held.\"⠀Let⠀a⠀phrase⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀deed⠀recur⠀where⠀its⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀meaningful,⠀with⠀familiar⠀or⠀new⠀application.⠀It⠀may⠀connect⠀parts⠀of⠀one⠀remembered⠀act⠀or⠀actual⠀repeated⠀occasions;⠀no⠀new⠀use,⠀ongoing⠀external⠀task,⠀or⠀epithet⠀at⠀every⠀entrance⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀retold⠀description⠀and⠀the⠀real⠀doing⠀remain⠀distinct:⠀the⠀elevated⠀line⠀from⠀the⠀community⠀account⠀sits⠀beside⠀the⠀practical⠀terms—the⠀waiting,⠀the⠀mending,⠀the⠀borrowed⠀strength,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀actually⠀held⠀the⠀rope—and⠀the⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀exact⠀relation.⠀Praise⠀can⠀be⠀entirely⠀true⠀and⠀still⠀funny⠀if⠀the⠀language⠀of⠀legend⠀meets⠀the⠀particular⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent.⠀Keep⠀the⠀attributed⠀account's⠀actual⠀source⠀knowledge⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permissions.⠀A⠀public⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀know⠀every⠀private⠀motive,⠀but⠀actual⠀communicated⠀knowledge⠀and⠀supported⠀access⠀remain;⠀full⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀rendered⠀separately⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀says,⠀without⠀shrinking⠀the⠀deed.⠀The⠀people⠀involved⠀remain⠀people,⠀not⠀statues.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀reference⠀or⠀a⠀modest⠀next⠀act;⠀no⠀verdict⠀that⠀the⠀deed⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀forever⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀folktale-inflected⠀telling:⠀establish⠀a⠀real⠀role-description,⠀standing⠀request,⠀or⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀early,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀conduct⠀of⠀particular⠀people⠀sit⠀beside⠀it.⠀The⠀role-description⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀posted⠀notice,⠀a⠀household⠀saying,⠀a⠀job⠀title,⠀a⠀public⠀reputation,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀instruction.⠀Keep⠀it⠀specific⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀users⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀magical⠀law.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀fit⠀or⠀contrast⠀in⠀the⠀movement⠀from⠀the⠀repeated⠀words⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀behavior⠀around⠀them.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀fulfill⠀the⠀description⠀exactly⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀the⠀words⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate,⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀request⠀so⠀literally⠀that⠀the⠀gap⠀becomes⠀visible,⠀or⠀may⠀continue⠀competent⠀private⠀work⠀while⠀the⠀public⠀description⠀lags⠀behind.⠀Make⠀the⠀actual⠀fit⠀or⠀mismatch⠀legible⠀within⠀narrator⠀access⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀or⠀turning⠀the⠀person⠀into⠀an⠀emblem.⠀What⠀is⠀funny⠀is⠀a⠀particular⠀mind⠀meeting⠀a⠀general⠀description,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀lesson⠀about⠀tradition⠀or⠀modernity.\n\nAllow⠀recognition⠀and⠀routine⠀to⠀remain⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀can⠀recur⠀as⠀a⠀cue,⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀complaint,⠀or⠀an⠀honestly⠀applied⠀rule.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀invented⠀role,⠀hidden⠀helper,⠀fixed⠀count,⠀reward,⠀or⠀failed⠀task.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀contract;⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀focal⠀thought⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀episode⠀is⠀folktale-shaped.⠀If⠀a⠀real⠀supernatural⠀or⠀magical⠀mechanism⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀world,⠀use⠀only⠀that⠀mechanism.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀activity,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion⠀without⠀paying⠀a⠀trial,⠀reward,⠀or⠀correction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀each⠀block⠀focused⠀on⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀imagined⠀viewer:⠀movement,⠀position,⠀object⠀use,⠀speech,⠀practical⠀work,⠀and⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀shared⠀space.\n\nPlace⠀an⠀actual⠀statement,⠀displayed⠀claim,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀established⠀expectation⠀beside⠀what⠀the⠀screen⠀shows⠀during⠀or⠀immediately⠀after⠀it.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀exact⠀confirmation,⠀literal⠀execution,⠀a⠀small⠀habitual⠀adjustment,⠀or⠀a⠀real⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀visible⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀action⠀block⠀announce⠀the⠀joke.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀the⠀actual⠀conduct⠀beside⠀its⠀description,⠀including⠀fully⠀stated⠀and⠀accurately⠀anticipated⠀work;⠀no⠀omitted⠀condition⠀is⠀required.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀needs⠀a⠀spatial⠀or⠀temporal⠀transition,⠀comparison,⠀or⠀change⠀of⠀action⠀emphasis;⠀a⠀cut⠀need⠀not⠀move⠀to⠀another⠀place.⠀A⠀supported⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀claim⠀in⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀in⠀another,⠀or⠀from⠀an⠀order⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀carrying⠀it⠀out.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀may⠀supply⠀an⠀actual⠀continuing⠀task⠀or⠀presence.⠀Keep⠀full⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation⠀format,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀distinct⠀from⠀dialogue,⠀footage,⠀and⠀voice-over.⠀Presented⠀thought⠀alone⠀grants⠀no⠀automatic⠀character⠀knowledge;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀communication,⠀world⠀channels,⠀and⠀permitted⠀mental⠀access.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀speaker's⠀register⠀and⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀channels.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀reaction⠀shot,⠀mishap,⠀exposed⠀hypocrisy,⠀delivered⠀punchline,⠀or⠀fictional⠀pause⠀before⠀ending.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀unspoken⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀positions,⠀objects,⠀and⠀blocking⠀that⠀a⠀company⠀could⠀perform.⠀Keep⠀the⠀practical⠀business⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀shared⠀space:⠀who⠀is⠀near⠀the⠀table,⠀holding⠀the⠀list,⠀watching⠀the⠀door,⠀or⠀continuing⠀the⠀routine⠀work⠀while⠀a⠀claim⠀or⠀request⠀is⠀being⠀made.\n\nBring⠀a⠀real⠀statement,⠀order,⠀public⠀promise,⠀or⠀familiar⠀explanation⠀into⠀contact⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀already⠀doing⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀it.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀can⠀arrive⠀through⠀literal⠀compliance,⠀competent⠀cooperation,⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀line⠀settle,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀action⠀that⠀qualifies⠀the⠀words⠀without⠀being⠀a⠀hidden⠀irony.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀arrangement⠀is⠀simple⠀while⠀another⠀quietly⠀handles⠀the⠀part⠀the⠀words⠀left⠀out.⠀Give⠀each⠀cast⠀member⠀a⠀distinct⠀relation⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀common⠀witty⠀register.\n\nKeep⠀purposeful⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues⠀actual⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀an⠀audience⠀in⠀the⠀imagined⠀production;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀private⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀required⠀interiority⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀ownership⠀contract,⠀clearly⠀nonspoken⠀and⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀other⠀characters⠀merely⠀through⠀presentation.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀communication,⠀world⠀mechanisms⠀and⠀active⠀permissions⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀added⠀knowledge⠀event.⠀Objects⠀and⠀stillness⠀should⠀be⠀meaningful,⠀but⠀a⠀prop⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀motive⠀or⠀character.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀stumble,⠀broken⠀object,⠀public⠀exposure,⠀delivered⠀joke,⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange⠀before⠀the⠀end.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀or⠀thought,⠀with⠀the⠀stage⠀business⠀left⠀underway.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀and⠀follow⠀how⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀actually⠀move⠀into⠀each⠀other.⠀Let⠀transitions⠀follow⠀actual⠀associative⠀movement,⠀including⠀logical⠀links⠀or⠀reasoning⠀when⠀they⠀arise⠀within⠀that⠀traffic⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀the⠀passage⠀to⠀argument⠀alone:⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀notice⠀may⠀surface⠀because⠀a⠀hand⠀is⠀cold,⠀a⠀familiar⠀instruction⠀may⠀return⠀because⠀someone's⠀footstep⠀repeats,⠀or⠀an⠀official⠀explanation⠀may⠀collide⠀with⠀the⠀sensation⠀of⠀standing⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀queue.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀social⠀description⠀or⠀familiar⠀claim⠀to⠀recur⠀where⠀attention⠀takes⠀it.⠀It⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀remembered⠀language,⠀shorthand,⠀a⠀line⠀the⠀character⠀no⠀longer⠀fully⠀believes,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀with⠀uncomfortable⠀completeness.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀contact⠀between⠀the⠀shared⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀lived⠀particular:⠀the⠀policy,⠀the⠀plaque,⠀the⠀promise,⠀the⠀household⠀saying,⠀the⠀job⠀title,⠀the⠀apology⠀script.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀the⠀mind⠀superior⠀insight⠀merely⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀joke⠀or⠀force⠀it⠀to⠀recognize⠀a⠀mismatch⠀as⠀funny.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀skill,⠀self-image⠀and⠀understanding,⠀including⠀real⠀expertise⠀or⠀error.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀the⠀whole⠀collision⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀mental⠀bump,⠀a⠀physical⠀shrug,⠀or⠀a⠀serious⠀private⠀question.\n\nDistinguish⠀actual⠀events⠀from⠀fallible⠀memory⠀and⠀imagined⠀cases.⠀A⠀remembered⠀version⠀may⠀be⠀edited⠀by⠀need⠀or⠀habit,⠀an⠀imagined⠀reply⠀may⠀have⠀its⠀own⠀texture,⠀and⠀a⠀real⠀sensory⠀detail⠀may⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀wrong⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀tell⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now.⠀Full⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀rumination⠀may⠀remain⠀unchanged;⠀no⠀self-deception,⠀correction,⠀outward⠀act,⠀polished⠀inner⠀wit,⠀or⠀useful⠀conclusion⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀within⠀continuing⠀thought,⠀and⠀actual⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events⠀determine⠀their⠀own⠀duration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀in⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀register⠀and⠀extent.⠀One⠀may⠀type⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀another⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀with⠀careful⠀punctuation,⠀another⠀with⠀none.⠀Keep⠀those⠀habits⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀sender⠀witty⠀or⠀every⠀message⠀clipped.\n\nPlace⠀a⠀request,⠀instruction,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀standing⠀claim⠀beside⠀the⠀actual⠀uptake⠀that⠀follows⠀in⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀literal⠀reply,⠀a⠀competent⠀adjustment⠀the⠀original⠀message⠀did⠀not⠀mention,⠀a⠀recipient⠀acting⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀understanding,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀gap⠀between⠀an⠀announcement⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀exchange.⠀Show⠀actual⠀transmitted⠀uptake⠀through⠀the⠀messages;⠀other⠀supported⠀reception⠀or⠀action⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀clearly⠀separate⠀context⠀under⠀the⠀narrator's⠀real⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀explanatory⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀reply⠀to⠀prove⠀uptake.⠀If⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀present⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀keep⠀knowledge⠀channels⠀intact.\n\nKeep⠀composing,⠀sending,⠀receipt,⠀reading,⠀editing,⠀and⠀delays⠀separate.⠀A⠀delay⠀or⠀short⠀reply⠀is⠀a⠀transmission⠀fact,⠀not⠀a⠀proof⠀of⠀motive,⠀annoyance,⠀indifference,⠀or⠀deception.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀status,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀preserve⠀full⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀format⠀and⠀attribution.⠀Use⠀only⠀timestamps,⠀attachments,⠀channel⠀changes,⠀or⠀receipts⠀that⠀carry⠀information⠀for⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀typo,⠀mistaken⠀recipient,⠀correction,⠀sent⠀answer,⠀or⠀changed⠀plan⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀during⠀a⠀visible⠀composing⠀state,⠀or⠀within⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience,⠀leaving⠀the⠀exchange⠀inconclusive.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacayba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀sequence.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀know⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀particular⠀object,⠀surface,⠀background⠀detail,⠀or⠀expression⠀currently⠀carries⠀attention.\n\nUse⠀an⠀actual⠀cue⠀to⠀place⠀a⠀claim,⠀expectation,⠀or⠀response⠀in⠀its⠀concrete⠀setting.⠀A⠀notice⠀may⠀hang⠀above⠀a⠀counter,⠀a⠀gesture⠀may⠀accompany⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀may⠀sit⠀inside⠀a⠀request's⠀phrasing.⠀Let⠀the⠀cue⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀terms⠀around⠀the⠀words:⠀the⠀size⠀of⠀the⠀thing,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀instruction⠀and⠀the⠀task,⠀the⠀face⠀that⠀is⠀genuinely⠀comfortable⠀with⠀a⠀statement⠀another⠀person⠀finds⠀enormous.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀accurate⠀fit⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀supported⠀contrast;⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀meeting⠀a⠀familiar⠀description⠀may⠀be⠀funny⠀without⠀any⠀new⠀realization.\n\nPresent⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀format.⠀A⠀face⠀or⠀background⠀cue⠀alone⠀proves⠀no⠀motive,⠀and⠀presented⠀thought⠀grants⠀no⠀automatic⠀knowledge⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀character⠀agency.⠀A⠀face⠀may⠀be⠀tired,⠀pleased,⠀indifferent,⠀or⠀concerned;⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀person⠀behind⠀the⠀cue⠀keep⠀that⠀private⠀extent.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀fixed⠀cycle⠀of⠀backgrounds,⠀expressions,⠀or⠀reactions.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀this⠀style⠀is⠀selected;⠀preserve⠀any⠀separate⠀feature⠀or⠀authorization⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀line,⠀during⠀focal⠀thought,⠀or⠀within⠀continuing⠀activity⠀without⠀a⠀delivered⠀correction,⠀confession,⠀or⠀new⠀expression⠀label.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacaybb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nKeep⠀the⠀current⠀through-line⠀legible⠀without⠀starting⠀each⠀installment⠀by⠀explaining⠀the⠀whole⠀story.⠀Recover⠀only⠀the⠀earlier⠀claim,⠀practical⠀term,⠀relationship⠀fact,⠀or⠀physical⠀condition⠀needed⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀present⠀activity.⠀A⠀standing⠀arrangement⠀or⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀restated⠀briefly⠀because⠀a⠀character⠀would⠀actually⠀restate⠀it,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀simply⠀show⠀up⠀in⠀the⠀work⠀being⠀done.\n\nCarry⠀real⠀consequences,⠀knowledge,⠀resources,⠀unfinished⠀requests,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀lives⠀forward.⠀A⠀later⠀use⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀claim⠀can⠀confirm⠀a⠀familiar⠀pattern⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀relation:⠀the⠀sign⠀is⠀still⠀misleading,⠀the⠀procedure⠀still⠀requires⠀a⠀particular⠀step,⠀the⠀team⠀still⠀interprets⠀the⠀instruction⠀in⠀two⠀ways.⠀Let⠀recognition⠀build⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀seen⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀forgotten⠀facts,⠀failed⠀institutions,⠀or⠀new⠀obstacles⠀to⠀restart⠀a⠀joke.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀actual⠀arrangements,⠀not⠀from⠀repeating⠀a⠀setup⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀earlier⠀installment⠀did⠀not⠀happen.\n\nGive⠀full⠀private⠀passages⠀their⠀actual⠀extent;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀plot⠀utility⠀or⠀an⠀immediate⠀outward⠀consequence.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀advance⠀concrete⠀work,⠀knowledge,⠀or⠀relationship,⠀but⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀public⠀or⠀inward⠀experience⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀corrected⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀complication⠀at⠀every⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀one⠀person's⠀actual⠀concern:⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀ask,⠀admit,⠀or⠀keep⠀private⠀within⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀or⠀encounter,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀pre-existing⠀cost.⠀Give⠀the⠀concern⠀precise⠀terms,⠀whether⠀privately⠀considered,⠀candidly⠀asked⠀or⠀directly⠀admitted.⠀It⠀can⠀concern⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀promise,⠀debt,⠀habit⠀or⠀expectation⠀at⠀its⠀supplied⠀scale;⠀no⠀small⠀literal⠀answer⠀is⠀required.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reasons⠀about⠀the⠀concern,⠀follow⠀their⠀actual⠀terms⠀candidly;⠀feeling⠀can⠀also⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀deliberation.⠀They⠀may⠀test⠀the⠀exact⠀terms⠀of⠀an⠀expectation,⠀notice⠀where⠀the⠀terms⠀fit⠀and⠀where⠀they⠀fail,⠀or⠀pursue⠀an⠀implication⠀past⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀wants⠀the⠀discussion⠀to⠀end.⠀This⠀reasoning⠀is⠀comic⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀exact⠀and⠀independent,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀witty⠀performance;⠀deliberate⠀humor⠀remains⠀available⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀person.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀responds⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀actual⠀interests:⠀they⠀may⠀answer⠀plainly,⠀cooperate,⠀misunderstand,⠀deflect,⠀or⠀refuse⠀the⠀inquiry⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀debating⠀partner.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀inside⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀strain⠀of⠀needing⠀an⠀answer,⠀withholding⠀a⠀fuller⠀admission,⠀or⠀hearing⠀a⠀difficult⠀reply⠀can⠀remain⠀wholly⠀inward.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀visible⠀effect,⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀argument.⠀Where⠀the⠀actual⠀person⠀feels⠀both,⠀warmth⠀and⠀hurt⠀may⠀coexist:⠀an⠀accurate⠀answer⠀can⠀still⠀wound,⠀and⠀a⠀kind⠀response⠀can⠀still⠀avoid⠀the⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀repair,⠀rupture,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀plan.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀thought,⠀speech⠀or⠀activity,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀question⠀or⠀feeling⠀to⠀stay⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reply⠀inside⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀readable⠀physical⠀positions,⠀and⠀continuing⠀activity.⠀Take⠀up⠀an⠀actual⠀relevant⠀claim,⠀request,⠀instruction⠀or⠀private⠀question,⠀whether⠀newly⠀voiced⠀or⠀already⠀present.⠀Where⠀someone⠀pursues⠀clarification,⠀follow⠀its⠀concrete⠀terms:⠀what⠀exactly⠀was⠀meant,⠀what⠀the⠀words⠀require,⠀what⠀would⠀satisfy⠀them,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀arrangement⠀already⠀provides.\n\nUse⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀let⠀different⠀participants⠀respond⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀habits.⠀One⠀may⠀answer⠀literally,⠀one⠀may⠀agree⠀without⠀examining⠀the⠀terms,⠀one⠀may⠀ignore⠀the⠀question⠀and⠀continue⠀working,⠀and⠀one⠀may⠀offer⠀genuine⠀help.⠀The⠀comic⠀movement⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀exactness⠀meeting⠀these⠀ordinary⠀responses,⠀not⠀from⠀everyone⠀becoming⠀a⠀debater⠀or⠀scoring⠀points.⠀Allow⠀agreement⠀and⠀accurate⠀fit⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀mismatch.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀during⠀the⠀exchange,⠀without⠀automatically⠀making⠀it⠀audible⠀or⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀cast;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀disclosure,⠀sources⠀and⠀established⠀capabilities.⠀Thought⠀can⠀continue⠀through⠀the⠀reply⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀action.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀interval:⠀the⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀the⠀activity⠀may⠀continue,⠀and⠀no⠀participant⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀pause,⠀resume,⠀or⠀change⠀direction⠀for⠀the⠀sake⠀of⠀the⠀ending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Situate⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀actual⠀work,⠀household,⠀or⠀public⠀arrangements,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀character's⠀position⠀in⠀those⠀arrangements⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀say,⠀ask,⠀or⠀do.⠀Develop⠀the⠀comic⠀sequence⠀from⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀expectation⠀that⠀passes⠀between⠀people⠀whose⠀actual⠀positions⠀may⠀differ⠀or⠀be⠀shared:⠀a⠀rule⠀announced⠀by⠀someone⠀with⠀authority,⠀a⠀service⠀promised⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀needs⠀it,⠀or⠀a⠀standard⠀invoked⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀meet⠀it.\n\nLet⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀clarify⠀how⠀the⠀norm⠀fits⠀or⠀fails⠀in⠀this⠀particular⠀case.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀actually⠀requires,⠀who⠀it⠀applies⠀to,⠀or⠀how⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀used⠀now.⠀Show⠀real⠀cooperation⠀and⠀self-interest⠀side⠀by⠀side.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀sincerely⠀uphold⠀a⠀norm⠀while⠀arranging⠀an⠀exception⠀for⠀themselves;⠀another⠀can⠀comply⠀accurately⠀while⠀exposing⠀an⠀absurd⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀norm⠀to⠀be⠀false⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀a⠀hypocrite.⠀The⠀comedy⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀precise⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀asserted⠀standard⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀use,⠀not⠀in⠀unmasking.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀concrete:⠀mention⠀the⠀actual⠀work⠀being⠀done,⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀ledger,⠀the⠀shared⠀meal,⠀or⠀the⠀household⠀task.⠀Let⠀the⠀inquiry⠀move⠀through⠀these⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀abstract⠀debate.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀question⠀answered,⠀partially⠀answered,⠀or⠀still⠀pending⠀while⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀exact⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀quickly⠀from⠀a⠀stated⠀expectation⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀object,⠀bodily⠀condition,⠀or⠀act⠀that⠀tests⠀it.⠀The⠀expectation⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀how⠀something⠀works,⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀deserves,⠀what⠀a⠀tool⠀can⠀do,⠀or⠀what⠀an⠀arrangement⠀costs.⠀Place⠀it⠀beside⠀actual⠀handling⠀or⠀use:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀thing,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀equipment,⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀task⠀takes,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀body⠀has⠀to⠀move,⠀or⠀the⠀residue⠀left⠀behind.\n\nRender⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀in⠀their⠀causal⠀order:⠀before,⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀material⠀contact,⠀or⠀wholly⠀privately⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀physical⠀act.⠀They⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀mismatch⠀in⠀plain⠀terms,⠀find⠀that⠀the⠀expectation⠀fits⠀after⠀all,⠀or⠀notice⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀original⠀claim⠀did⠀not⠀mention.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀relation⠀between⠀words⠀and⠀use,⠀not⠀from⠀mockery⠀or⠀manufactured⠀damage.⠀Allow⠀an⠀accurate⠀fit⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀an⠀absurd⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀available⠀whether⠀the⠀outward⠀effect⠀is⠀large,⠀small⠀or⠀entirely⠀absent.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀tired,⠀angry,⠀amused,⠀or⠀worried⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀hardship,⠀rough⠀speech,⠀or⠀physical⠀stakes⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀support.⠀Vary⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀compressed⠀transition⠀can⠀land⠀a⠀comic⠀point,⠀while⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀needed⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀works⠀out⠀why⠀the⠀arrangement⠀fails.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀during⠀the⠀material⠀comparison,⠀thought,⠀speech⠀or⠀handling⠀itself,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion;⠀no⠀completed⠀comparison,⠀reversal⠀or⠀practical⠀result⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀actual⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀composition⠀occasion,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀writing.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀notice,⠀a⠀reply,⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀note,⠀or⠀a⠀letter.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀sake.\n\nLet⠀an⠀exact⠀request,⠀definition,⠀or⠀claim⠀recur⠀across⠀documents.⠀One⠀writer⠀may⠀state⠀a⠀requirement⠀in⠀precise⠀terms;⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀answer⠀those⠀terms⠀literally,⠀apply⠀them⠀to⠀an⠀unintended⠀case,⠀or⠀record⠀an⠀independent⠀observation⠀that⠀tests⠀the⠀original⠀claim.⠀The⠀comic⠀argument⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀documents'⠀actual⠀wording⠀and⠀their⠀reception,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀corrective⠀verdict;⠀actual⠀narrator⠀comment⠀remains⠀available⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀and⠀access.⠀Keep⠀each⠀writer's⠀knowledge⠀bounded⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀composed,⠀received,⠀or⠀could⠀have⠀known⠀at⠀that⠀time.⠀Genuine⠀agreement⠀and⠀accurate⠀compliance⠀remain⠀possible.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀writer⠀composes⠀and⠀their⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀tactful,⠀evasive,⠀exact,⠀or⠀self-serving⠀without⠀revealing⠀the⠀writer's⠀full⠀mind.⠀When⠀required⠀interiority⠀is⠀active,⠀render⠀it⠀separately⠀from⠀the⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀may⠀reveal⠀events⠀across⠀entries,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀corrective⠀verdict⠀after⠀every⠀record.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀document⠀sequence;⠀the⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open⠀in⠀the⠀correspondence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀actual⠀helpful⠀conduct,⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀and⠀comfortable⠀participation.⠀Follow⠀an⠀actual⠀occasion⠀of⠀care⠀at⠀its⠀supplied⠀scale:⠀someone⠀making⠀food,⠀sharing⠀a⠀space,⠀fixing⠀something,⠀remembering⠀a⠀preference,⠀or⠀offering⠀practical⠀help.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀enjoy⠀the⠀particular⠀details⠀of⠀that⠀care⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀lesson;⠀a⠀supported⠀direct⠀reflection⠀can⠀still⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀voice.\n\nAllow⠀an⠀exact⠀question⠀or⠀dry⠀observation⠀to⠀develop⠀around⠀what⠀people⠀enjoy⠀or⠀provide.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀why⠀a⠀routine⠀works,⠀what⠀a⠀preference⠀actually⠀requires,⠀or⠀how⠀much⠀effort⠀a⠀kindness⠀involves.⠀Their⠀candid⠀reasoning⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀precise⠀and⠀independent,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀mocks⠀the⠀care.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀answer⠀plainly,⠀agree,⠀decline⠀the⠀discussion,⠀or⠀continue⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀without⠀becoming⠀an⠀opponent.\n\nPreserve⠀direct⠀affection,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀Kindness⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀everyone⠀to⠀become⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀affection⠀conditional⠀on⠀winning⠀an⠀argument⠀or⠀require⠀gratitude,⠀confession,⠀or⠀repaired⠀feelings.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀care⠀continuing,⠀the⠀question⠀unresolved,⠀or⠀the⠀participants⠀simply⠀enjoying⠀the⠀present⠀moment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀state⠀the⠀relevant⠀social⠀expectation:⠀a⠀custom,⠀regulation,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀will⠀test.⠀Frame⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀access⠀to⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀omniscient⠀moral.⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀scene's⠀particulars⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀expectation⠀meet⠀them.\n\nFollow⠀how⠀the⠀claim⠀applies⠀through⠀precise⠀transitions.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀expectation⠀actually⠀requires,⠀who⠀it⠀covers,⠀or⠀how⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀used⠀in⠀this⠀case.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀supply⠀context,⠀compare⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀with⠀a⠀past⠀one,⠀or⠀offer⠀a⠀judgment⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀make.⠀Keep⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀ordinary:⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀formal⠀register,⠀and⠀the⠀comedy⠀does⠀not⠀depend⠀on⠀making⠀them⠀articulate⠀a⠀thesis.\n\nAllow⠀confirmation⠀and⠀undecided⠀cases.⠀The⠀expectation⠀may⠀fit⠀the⠀particulars⠀exactly,⠀fail⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀way,⠀or⠀remain⠀open⠀to⠀further⠀evidence.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀closing⠀moral,⠀a⠀corrected⠀belief,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀exposed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀developing⠀relation⠀legible⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀proceeds.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀thought⠀or⠀use,⠀with⠀no⠀completed⠀comparison⠀or⠀settled⠀social⠀question⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀teller,⠀audience⠀and⠀telling⠀occasion,⠀with⠀purpose⠀identified⠀within⠀actual⠀narrator⠀access:⠀persuasion,⠀delay,⠀entertainment,⠀warning⠀or⠀explanation.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀remembered,⠀reported,⠀claimed⠀or⠀invented⠀account⠀from⠀the⠀surrounding⠀scene's⠀established⠀facts.⠀Keep⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀concrete⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀audience's⠀attention⠀and⠀interruptions⠀remain⠀possible⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀listener⠀into⠀a⠀corrector.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀account,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀follow⠀one⠀practical⠀detail⠀or⠀candid⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer.⠀Show⠀the⠀exact⠀step⠀where⠀an⠀apparent⠀lesson,⠀rule,⠀or⠀solemn⠀claim⠀meets⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀need,⠀habit,⠀or⠀blind⠀spot.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀precise⠀observation⠀of⠀that⠀collision,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀stock⠀punch⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀exposure⠀of⠀fraud.\n\nTrack⠀actual⠀audience⠀reception⠀across⠀the⠀telling.⠀Listeners⠀may⠀agree,⠀listen⠀quietly,⠀ask⠀a⠀clarifying⠀question,⠀or⠀miss⠀the⠀point⠀entirely.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀narrative⠀levels,⠀but⠀its⠀recurrence⠀should⠀connect⠀the⠀outer⠀and⠀inner⠀situations⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀is⠀true.\n\nLet⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀follow⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀attachments,⠀knowledge⠀and⠀blind⠀spots⠀where⠀they⠀matter,⠀without⠀requiring⠀loyalty⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀omission.⠀A⠀generous⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀while⠀omitting⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀understand.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀knew⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀during⠀telling,⠀listening⠀or⠀private⠀attention,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion;⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson,⠀exposed⠀flaw⠀or⠀audience⠀correction⠀is⠀possible⠀but⠀never⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀one⠀actual⠀procedure,⠀definition,⠀or⠀formal⠀category⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀scene:⠀an⠀application⠀form,⠀a⠀classification⠀rule,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀protocol,⠀a⠀membership⠀criterion,⠀or⠀a⠀similar⠀operative⠀structure.⠀Make⠀its⠀relevant⠀terms⠀readable⠀through⠀use,⠀instruction⠀or⠀consideration;⠀that⠀presentation⠀can⠀itself⠀carry⠀comic⠀recognition⠀without⠀a⠀separate⠀explanatory⠀prelude.\n\nFollow⠀what⠀applying⠀those⠀terms⠀literally⠀permits⠀or⠀requires.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀pursue⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀through⠀the⠀procedure⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots.⠀Comic⠀recog