ng⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Private⠀reasoning⠀can⠀run⠀longer⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀it,⠀and⠀public⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀shorter⠀or⠀longer⠀than⠀the⠀thought⠀behind⠀it.\n\nAn⠀explanation⠀may⠀confirm⠀known⠀terms⠀or⠀support⠀informed⠀non-use.⠀The⠀character⠀who⠀asked⠀the⠀question⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀answer,⠀decide⠀the⠀rule⠀does⠀not⠀apply,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀obstacle⠀or⠀victory.⠀Keep⠀the⠀developing⠀exchange⠀readable⠀while⠀allowing⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀thought⠀or⠀action;⠀no⠀completed⠀clarification,⠀cliffhanger,⠀punch⠀line⠀or⠀lesson⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀concrete⠀comparison⠀develop⠀through⠀actual⠀attention⠀beside⠀the⠀comic⠀question⠀or⠀in⠀later⠀reflection,⠀with⠀its⠀timing⠀and⠀owner⠀clear.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀pursues⠀an⠀aim⠀or⠀defends⠀a⠀habit,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀mind⠀attach⠀an⠀actual⠀sound,⠀image,⠀or⠀owned⠀analogy⠀that⠀shares⠀the⠀question's⠀shape:⠀a⠀repeated⠀knock,⠀a⠀mislabeled⠀drawer,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀looks⠀shorter⠀on⠀paper.⠀Extend⠀the⠀comparison⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀recurrence⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀actually⠀returns⠀to⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀interrupt⠀the⠀figure⠀when⠀the⠀practical⠀point⠀needs⠀to⠀stand⠀undecorated.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀change⠀as⠀new⠀particulars⠀arrive;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀prove⠀the⠀claim⠀wrong⠀or⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀comic⠀reasoning⠀direct⠀and⠀nimble.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer⠀by⠀testing⠀the⠀literal⠀terms⠀against⠀a⠀concrete⠀case:⠀what⠀exactly⠀counts⠀as⠀\"on⠀time,\"⠀\"clean,\"⠀\"a⠀favor,\"⠀or⠀\"temporary.\"⠀Develop⠀the⠀inquiry⠀through⠀particular⠀observations⠀and⠀actual⠀responses,⠀with⠀direct⠀summary⠀or⠀judgment⠀available⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀voice.⠀A⠀real⠀gap⠀can⠀expose⠀absurdity;⠀fitting⠀recognition⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀comic⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀gap⠀or⠀punch⠀line.⠀Help,⠀agreement,⠀and⠀routine⠀success⠀remain⠀available⠀outcomes;⠀the⠀inquiry⠀can⠀find⠀that⠀the⠀expectation⠀fits⠀after⠀all.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀character's⠀own⠀diction.⠀The⠀lyrical⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker.⠀A⠀literal-minded⠀character⠀can⠀answer⠀a⠀figurative⠀passage⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀and⠀that⠀contrast⠀can⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀comedy.⠀Private⠀feelings⠀need⠀no⠀argumentative⠀use:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀image,⠀feel⠀its⠀pull,⠀and⠀still⠀act⠀or⠀speak⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀motive.⠀Keep⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective's⠀access⠀consistent,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀rhythm⠀follow⠀actual⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀pattern⠀of⠀image,⠀rebuttal,⠀and⠀return.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nPlace⠀a⠀concrete⠀earlier⠀claim,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀habit⠀beside⠀current⠀experience⠀through⠀memory⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀an⠀authorized⠀character,⠀with⠀ownership⠀clear.⠀The⠀remembered⠀item⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀test:⠀a⠀rule⠀someone⠀once⠀stated,⠀a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀plan⠀for⠀how⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀a⠀routine⠀would⠀work.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀supply⠀the⠀actual⠀fit.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀explanation⠀still⠀holds,⠀that⠀it⠀covered⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀case,⠀or⠀that⠀it⠀has⠀become⠀irrelevant⠀without⠀anyone⠀announcing⠀the⠀change.⠀Dry⠀recognition⠀is⠀enough;⠀the⠀passage⠀need⠀not⠀conclude⠀that⠀hindsight⠀is⠀superior⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀person⠀was⠀foolish.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀inquiry⠀proceed⠀through⠀the⠀comparison⠀itself.⠀A⠀solemn⠀assumption⠀can⠀be⠀punctured⠀by⠀the⠀plain⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now:⠀the⠀promised⠀convenience,⠀the⠀predicted⠀reaction,⠀the⠀definition⠀of⠀a⠀finished⠀task.⠀Follow⠀the⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀particular⠀mind⠀remembering⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀attachment,⠀irritation,⠀amusement,⠀or⠀unchanged⠀pleasure⠀at⠀full⠀extent,⠀and⠀these⠀feelings⠀can⠀coexist⠀without⠀being⠀resolved⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.⠀No⠀regret,⠀farewell,⠀or⠀announced⠀impermanence⠀is⠀required.\n\nKeep⠀direct⠀reflection⠀available⠀but⠀not⠀mandatory.⠀The⠀narrat