⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀business,⠀speech,⠀thought⠀or⠀telling,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀resumed⠀task,⠀another⠀act⠀or⠀modest⠀scale.⠀No⠀finished⠀deed,⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀corrected⠀reputation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀comic⠀inquiry⠀may⠀simply⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀public⠀phrase⠀covers⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀leaves⠀out,⠀and⠀let⠀both⠀stand.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀essayistic⠀inquiry⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀State⠀an⠀actual⠀narrator-owned⠀or⠀attributed⠀proposition,⠀definite⠀or⠀provisional,⠀in⠀its⠀appropriate⠀terms,⠀then⠀set⠀it⠀beside⠀a⠀concrete⠀observed,⠀remembered⠀or⠀explicitly⠀hypothetical⠀case.⠀Follow⠀what⠀the⠀case⠀actually⠀supports,⠀complicates,⠀or⠀leaves⠀undecided.⠀The⠀inquiry⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀claim,⠀narrow⠀its⠀scope,⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀its⠀stated⠀terms⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀use.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀counterexample,⠀a⠀changed⠀belief,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀verdict.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀comic⠀movement⠀in⠀the⠀precision⠀of⠀the⠀comparison.⠀A⠀solemn⠀formulation⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀small⠀material⠀particular:⠀the⠀rule⠀says⠀everyone⠀must⠀sign,⠀but⠀the⠀pen⠀has⠀been⠀missing⠀since⠀Tuesday.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀pursue⠀the⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀distinguishing⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀seen⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀inferred,⠀assumed,⠀or⠀announced.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀reasoning⠀that⠀accompanies⠀the⠀inquiry,⠀including⠀irritation,⠀amusement,⠀or⠀genuine⠀uncertainty,⠀without⠀requiring⠀feeling⠀to⠀serve⠀the⠀inquiry⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀conclusion.⠀Actual⠀feeling⠀may⠀inform⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀one's⠀own⠀experience,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀prove⠀external⠀facts⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.\n\nUse⠀the⠀essayistic⠀form⠀to⠀control⠀information⠀flow.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀proposition,⠀arrive⠀at⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀case,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀digression.⠀A⠀return⠀can⠀examine⠀or⠀confirm⠀scope,⠀continue⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀reorient⠀the⠀reader,⠀without⠀requiring⠀another⠀test⠀or⠀new⠀understanding.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀an⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀earlier⠀and⠀later⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀An⠀imagined⠀example⠀must⠀remain⠀clearly⠀hypothetical⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀remembered⠀fact.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀inquiry⠀still⠀open,⠀with⠀a⠀precise⠀qualification,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀claim⠀confirmed⠀in⠀a⠀narrower⠀form⠀than⠀its⠀original⠀wording⠀suggested.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀sequence⠀in⠀concise⠀scene⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀only⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀events⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀lines.⠀Let⠀a⠀candid⠀claim⠀meet⠀its⠀actual⠀use⠀or⠀reply⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀scene.⠀The⠀comic⠀qualification⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear:⠀a⠀speaker⠀announces⠀a⠀rule,⠀then⠀performs⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀rule⠀a⠀different⠀practical⠀meaning;⠀an⠀official⠀term⠀meets⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object;⠀a⠀solemn⠀explanation⠀runs⠀against⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀already⠀established.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀to⠀juxtapose⠀separate⠀occasions⠀when⠀the⠀comparison⠀matters.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀place⠀a⠀stated⠀expectation⠀beside⠀its⠀later⠀actual⠀result,⠀or⠀show⠀two⠀people⠀applying⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀to⠀different⠀situations.⠀The⠀cut⠀connects⠀the⠀occasions⠀for⠀the⠀viewer;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀characters⠀witness⠀the⠀connection⠀or⠀cause⠀the⠀later⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀editing⠀to⠀manufacture⠀a⠀physical⠀outcome⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀has⠀not⠀established.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation's⠀nonspoken⠀form,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀performed⠀voice-over,⠀with⠀cast⠀knowledge⠀following⠀actual⠀sources⠀and⠀established⠀capabilities⠀rather⠀than⠀reader⠀access⠀alone.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀claim⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀available⠀to⠀another⠀speaker.⠀Voice-over,⠀when⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀visible⠀result,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀punch⠀line,⠀a⠀reaction⠀shot,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀development.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀positions,⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀actual⠀physical⠀business⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀a⠀plain⠀claim⠀or⠀reply⠀meet⠀what⠀people⠀really⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀spoken⠀proposition⠀and⠀the⠀visible⠀activity:⠀a⠀character⠀explains⠀the⠀correct⠀procedure⠀while⠀another⠀is⠀already⠀doing⠀it⠀differently;⠀a⠀solemn⠀instruction⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀practical⠀need⠀to⠀move⠀a⠀chair,⠀find⠀a⠀pen,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀door.⠀Stillness⠀and⠀accurate⠀cooperation⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀comic⠀as⠀obstruction.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀prop⠀failure,⠀an⠀interruption⠀quota,⠀or⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀to⠀produce⠀the⠀effect.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀spatial⠀continuity⠀meaningful.⠀What⠀one⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀reach,⠀or⠀carry⠀should⠀be⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀spoken⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀can⠀test⠀each⠀other.⠀A⠀line⠀delivered⠀from⠀one⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀stage⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀heard⠀by⠀someone⠀working⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀side;⠀an⠀object⠀moved⠀earlier⠀remains⠀moved.⠀Use⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀a⠀stated⠀rule⠀and⠀actual⠀use⠀visible,⠀including⠀accurate⠀cooperation⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀gap,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀comic⠀types.\n\nKeep⠀performed⠀argument,⠀monologue,⠀and⠀aside⠀distinct⠀from⠀full⠀required⠀private⠀experience.⠀An⠀aside⠀is⠀spoken⠀for⠀an⠀audience,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀presentation's⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀material⠀separately,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀know⠀a⠀private⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀or⠀audience⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀Supported⠀offstage⠀activity⠀remains⠀available⠀through⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀reported⠀action⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀result,⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀gathering⠀or⠀final⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀actual⠀associative⠀movement.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀received⠀words,⠀memory,⠀private⠀wording,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀without⠀reducing⠀the⠀sequence⠀to⠀an⠀orderly⠀debate.⠀Let⠀associations⠀interrupt⠀a⠀question,⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀from⠀an⠀unexpected⠀direction,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀mind's⠀uneven⠀approach⠀to⠀an⠀apparently⠀obvious⠀answer:⠀a⠀solemn⠀phrase⠀keeps⠀resurfacing⠀beside⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀coffee,⠀a⠀remembered⠀rule⠀collides⠀with⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀find⠀a⠀clean⠀shirt,⠀a⠀private⠀objection⠀is⠀abandoned⠀mid-thought⠀when⠀someone⠀speaks.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀direct⠀and⠀nimble⠀inquiry⠀of⠀the⠀author⠀profile⠀inside⠀the⠀associative⠀syntax.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀state⠀a⠀proposition,⠀test⠀it⠀against⠀a⠀concrete⠀particular,⠀and⠀follow⠀what⠀remains⠀supported⠀or⠀undecided—but⠀the⠀testing⠀need⠀not⠀proceed⠀step⠀by⠀step.⠀A⠀qualification⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀returns⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning.⠀Keep⠀imagined⠀cases⠀clearly⠀separate⠀from⠀remembered⠀facts⠀and⠀present⠀events.⠀A⠀hypothetical⠀example⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀memory;⠀a⠀memory⠀is⠀not⠀necessarily⠀evidence⠀for⠀the⠀claim⠀under⠀examination.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀whether⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀answering⠀a⠀speaker,⠀remembering⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀or⠀entertaining⠀a⠀possibility.⠀Prose⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀fictional⠀elapsed⠀time:⠀a⠀long⠀associative⠀passage⠀may⠀occupy⠀a⠀brief⠀pause,⠀while⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀may⠀cover⠀a⠀longer⠀interval.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀insight,⠀a⠀comeback,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀direction.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀with⠀a⠀precise⠀qualification,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀mind⠀simply⠀moving⠀on⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀exchange⠀as⠀sender-attributed⠀sent⠀messages⠀in⠀actual⠀channel⠀order.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀another⠀sends⠀three⠀short⠀messages,⠀a⠀third⠀leaves⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered⠀while⠀continuing⠀a⠀different⠀thread.⠀Track⠀the⠀exact⠀terms⠀people⠀really⠀write⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀replies⠀actually⠀address.⠀Comic⠀reasoning⠀can⠀develop⠀through⠀actual⠀reception,⠀including⠀accurate⠀shared⠀understanding.⠀Where⠀a⠀gap⠀occurs,⠀someone⠀might⠀ask⠀whether⠀the⠀form⠀was⠀submitted⠀and⠀receive⠀confirmation⠀only⠀that⠀the⠀form⠀exists;⠀a⠀solemn⠀instruction⠀receives⠀only⠀a⠀thumbs-up;⠀a⠀precise⠀question⠀is⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀matter.\n\nLet⠀agreement,⠀known⠀meanings,⠀and⠀no⠀reply⠀yet⠀be⠀legitimate⠀outcomes.⠀A⠀recipient⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀message⠀exactly⠀and⠀still⠀answer⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀beside⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀a⠀typo,⠀or⠀a⠀delay⠀to⠀produce⠀the⠀comic⠀effect.⠀Interface⠀events⠀such⠀as⠀receipts,⠀edits,⠀or⠀delays⠀need⠀actual⠀causes⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀inserted⠀to⠀create⠀subtext.\n\nKeep⠀genuine⠀composed⠀drafts⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀thought⠀separate⠀from⠀transmission.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Track⠀actual⠀delivery⠀and⠀visibility⠀rather⠀than⠀assuming⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀received;⠀the⠀writer's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀about⠀it⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript⠀unless⠀separately⠀presented⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation's⠀nonspoken⠀form.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀a⠀completed⠀practical⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀still⠀being⠀composed,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀development.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀scene⠀setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Let⠀a⠀particular⠀question⠀or⠀response⠀meet⠀the⠀focal⠀expectation.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀read⠀a⠀candid⠀line⠀accurately,⠀miss⠀its⠀implication,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀comic⠀movement⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀comparison⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀expects⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀actually⠀says⠀or⠀does:⠀a⠀solemn⠀announcement⠀receives⠀a⠀practical⠀question;⠀a⠀careful⠀explanation⠀is⠀met⠀with⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀addresses⠀only⠀its⠀first⠀clause;⠀a⠀rule⠀is⠀stated,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀speaker⠀has⠀already⠀broken⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀expression⠀and⠀background⠀cues⠀as⠀orientation,⠀not⠀as⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀attract⠀attention,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀knows,⠀intends,⠀or⠀conceals.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀cue⠀and⠀interpret⠀it,⠀with⠀interpretation⠀distinguished⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀supported⠀or⠀known;⠀an⠀accurate⠀conclusion⠀can⠀remain⠀known⠀without⠀treating⠀expression⠀alone⠀as⠀proof.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀of⠀expression,⠀line,⠀and⠀private⠀reaction,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀resolved⠀insight.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀interpretation⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation's⠀nonspoken⠀form⠀where⠀required,⠀without⠀automatically⠀becoming⠀cast⠀knowledge;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀disclosure,⠀evidence⠀and⠀established⠀capabilities.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀line⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀speaker.⠀Scene⠀changes⠀should⠀remain⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀exchange⠀still⠀open,⠀with⠀a⠀precise⠀qualification,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀simply⠀attending⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacazbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀exact⠀earlier⠀terms⠀and⠀circumstances⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀help⠀the⠀present⠀installment.⠀A⠀familiar⠀question,⠀reply,⠀or⠀procedure⠀can⠀continue⠀or⠀recur⠀through⠀actual⠀events.⠀The⠀comic⠀continuity⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀return⠀of⠀a⠀practical⠀claim:⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀is⠀applied⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀object,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀is⠀answered⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀person,⠀the⠀same⠀procedure⠀is⠀followed⠀under⠀conditions⠀that⠀change⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Preserve⠀earlier⠀motives⠀as⠀they⠀actually⠀were.⠀An⠀established⠀change⠀may⠀affect⠀current⠀recall⠀or⠀understanding,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀forgetting⠀merely⠀to⠀restart⠀comic⠀inquiry;⠀a⠀claim⠀that⠀was⠀qualified⠀earlier⠀remains⠀qualified⠀unless⠀new⠀events⠀change⠀it.\n\nLet⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀extend⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀public⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀may⠀continue⠀across⠀installments⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀immediate⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀test.⠀The⠀serial⠀form⠀can⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fresh⠀defect,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀completed⠀test⠀in⠀every⠀installment.⠀A⠀recurring⠀question⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀implication⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀contradiction⠀being⠀invented.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀flexible.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀end⠀during⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀action,⠀or⠀composition.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀an⠀external⠀task⠀or⠀practical⠀decision⠀to⠀justify⠀its⠀place.⠀Prose⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀fictional⠀elapsed⠀time;⠀actual⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events⠀still⠀have⠀their⠀real⠀duration.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀without⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀concrete⠀need,⠀withheld⠀request,⠀apology,⠀or⠀return⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀actually⠀considers,⠀withholds⠀or⠀brings⠀to⠀another,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀public⠀step.⠀Give⠀that⠀effort⠀a⠀precise⠀physical⠀locus:⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀carefully,⠀a⠀sleeve⠀held⠀a⠀beat⠀too⠀long,⠀a⠀chair⠀angled⠀exactly⠀the⠀wrong⠀way,⠀a⠀gift⠀still⠀in⠀its⠀wrapping.⠀Let⠀the⠀selected⠀impression⠀carry⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀a⠀person's⠀need⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀circumstance.⠀Timing⠀or⠀proportion⠀can⠀arise⠀through⠀precise⠀fit⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀supported⠀mismatch,⠀without⠀random⠀interruption⠀supplying⠀the⠀joke.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀detail⠀specific⠀and⠀selectively⠀developed,⠀with⠀the⠀extent⠀the⠀actual⠀account⠀needs.⠀A⠀single⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀interval⠀while⠀the⠀actual⠀emotional⠀cost⠀remains⠀large⠀enough⠀to⠀matter:⠀the⠀too-careful⠀placement⠀is⠀funny⠀because⠀the⠀need⠀behind⠀it⠀is⠀serious⠀to⠀its⠀bearer.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀need⠀ridiculous.⠀The⠀humor⠀arises⠀from⠀timing,⠀emphasis,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀effort⠀and⠀reception,⠀not⠀from⠀dismissing⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake.\n\nLet⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀react⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀purposes⠀and⠀limits.⠀An⠀accurate⠀kindness,⠀a⠀plainly⠀accepted⠀answer,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀or⠀continued⠀uncertainty⠀may⠀all⠀follow.⠀If⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀finally⠀spoken,⠀the⠀comedy⠀can⠀continue⠀into⠀the⠀receiving⠀of⠀it:⠀the⠀wrong⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀sentence⠀thanked,⠀the⠀pause⠀treated⠀as⠀refusal,⠀the⠀relief⠀arriving⠀one⠀gesture⠀late.⠀The⠀private⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀healed⠀mood,⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀change;⠀write⠀the⠀actual⠀present⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀at⠀whatever⠀length⠀its⠀pressure⠀requires.\n\nMove⠀through⠀actual⠀speech,⠀gesture,⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀their⠀real⠀order.⠀A⠀selected⠀impression⠀may⠀recur⠀for⠀actual⠀attention,⠀familiar⠀emphasis,⠀precise⠀timing⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀weight;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀an⠀automatic⠀label⠀for⠀emotion.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀without⠀requiring⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀joke.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nAddress⠀the⠀submitted⠀situation⠀directly,⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀attribution⠀and⠀enough⠀framing⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀a⠀redundant⠀preface.⠀Carry⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀output⠀rules⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀shift⠀the⠀focal⠀owner⠀or⠀resolve⠀a⠀human-owned⠀opening⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀a⠀neutral⠀plot⠀turn.\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀shared⠀interval⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀precise⠀physical⠀particular⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀current⠀aim⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀reception⠀legible⠀within⠀the⠀permitted⠀access:⠀the⠀object⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀holding,⠀the⠀placement⠀of⠀a⠀glass⠀that⠀interrupts⠀a⠀sentence,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀fan⠀starting⠀in⠀the⠀pause⠀after⠀an⠀offer,⠀the⠀exact⠀distance⠀between⠀two⠀chairs.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀impression⠀where⠀actual⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀scene's⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀warrants⠀it,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count⠀or⠀decorative⠀repetition.⠀It⠀becomes⠀comic⠀when⠀its⠀placement⠀clarifies⠀a⠀habit,⠀expectation,⠀or⠀blind⠀spot⠀without⠀anyone⠀needing⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀joke.\n\nAttribute⠀speech⠀plainly⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀register⠀distinct.⠀One⠀may⠀be⠀dry,⠀one⠀literal,⠀one⠀exuberant,⠀one⠀unaware⠀of⠀the⠀mismatch.⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀pursuing⠀their⠀own⠀recognizable⠀purposes.⠀They⠀may⠀offer⠀competent⠀help,⠀accept⠀a⠀proposal⠀directly,⠀decline⠀it,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀concern⠀the⠀others⠀have⠀not⠀noticed.⠀Their⠀practical⠀life⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀punchline.\n\nDo⠀not⠀compress⠀inner⠀experience⠀for⠀speed.⠀Full⠀permitted⠀nonspoken⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀interval⠀at⠀the⠀extent⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀needs.⠀No⠀short-thought⠀rule,⠀no⠀compulsory⠀silent⠀beat,⠀no⠀required⠀misunderstanding.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀run⠀long⠀while⠀a⠀gesture⠀stays⠀still.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀The⠀continuation⠀that⠀follows⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step,⠀a⠀remaining⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀the⠀ordinary⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀situation.⠀No⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀completed⠀joke⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narration⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀regional⠀route.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scene⠀within⠀a⠀concrete⠀shared⠀occasion⠀whose⠀balance⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀proximity,⠀object⠀placement,⠀and⠀who⠀notices⠀what.⠀Let⠀intimate⠀spatial⠀relations⠀organize⠀the⠀narration;⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀action,⠀reflection⠀or⠀world⠀features⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀authorship⠀support.\n\nPlace⠀an⠀actual⠀aim⠀beside⠀physical⠀detail⠀where⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀that⠀relation,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀aim⠀publicly⠀visible:⠀someone⠀moves⠀a⠀bowl⠀to⠀make⠀room⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀exist,⠀stands⠀too⠀close⠀to⠀help,⠀chooses⠀the⠀one⠀chair⠀near⠀an⠀open⠀window,⠀or⠀rearranges⠀a⠀pile⠀that⠀was⠀already⠀arranged.⠀Select⠀the⠀particulars⠀needed⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀legible⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀comic⠀weight⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀intended⠀courtesy⠀or⠀practical⠀purpose⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀reception⠀it⠀meets.⠀Exact⠀agreement⠀can⠀be⠀funny⠀through⠀timing⠀without⠀a⠀misunderstood⠀gesture.\n\nPreserve⠀local⠀language,⠀period,⠀setting,⠀and⠀community⠀as⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀a⠀city⠀backdrop,⠀or⠀a⠀regional⠀habit.⠀The⠀intimacy⠀comes⠀from⠀actual⠀proximity⠀and⠀attention.⠀Familiar⠀knowledge⠀of⠀a⠀drawer,⠀preferred⠀window⠀or⠀particular⠀bowl⠀can⠀matter⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀genuinely⠀available;⠀newcomers⠀need⠀not⠀possess⠀it.\n\nInside⠀that⠀shared⠀physical⠀world,⠀write⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge⠀separately.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀wrong⠀detail,⠀know⠀the⠀right⠀one⠀but⠀act⠀on⠀habit,⠀or⠀understand⠀the⠀aim⠀perfectly⠀and⠀still⠀receive⠀it⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀scale.⠀Let⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀thought⠀occupy⠀the⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation;⠀the⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀infer⠀all⠀feeling⠀from⠀surfaces,⠀and⠀no⠀brief-thought⠀rule⠀applies.\n\nSequence⠀movement⠀by⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀event,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀joke.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀emerges⠀when⠀a⠀selected⠀impression⠀stands⠀beside⠀the⠀actual⠀purpose⠀or⠀its⠀failure.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀with⠀the⠀ongoing⠀situation⠀or⠀private⠀state⠀intact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀ordinary⠀pursuit⠀with⠀forceful,⠀exact⠀verbs⠀and⠀the⠀selected⠀physical⠀particulars⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀account,⠀including⠀felt⠀experience⠀without⠀an⠀immediate⠀practical⠀consequence.⠀Weight,⠀pressure,⠀sound,⠀resistance,⠀or⠀supported⠀wear⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀task⠀has⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀damage,⠀profanity,⠀or⠀danger⠀merely⠀to⠀satisfy⠀the⠀style.⠀A⠀chair⠀leg⠀can⠀stick,⠀a⠀lid⠀can⠀refuse,⠀a⠀sleeve⠀can⠀catch,⠀a⠀box⠀can⠀be⠀exactly⠀too⠀wide⠀for⠀the⠀door;⠀the⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀effort⠀against⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀aim.\n\nPlace⠀an⠀expected⠀ease⠀or⠀valued⠀appearance⠀beside⠀real⠀handling.⠀A⠀jacket⠀may⠀resist⠀the⠀arm⠀or⠀fit⠀with⠀amusing⠀exactness;⠀a⠀carefully⠀saved⠀dish⠀may⠀sit⠀perfectly⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀use,⠀or⠀a⠀measured⠀shelf⠀may⠀fall⠀short⠀when⠀actual⠀conditions⠀support⠀it.⠀Treat⠀this⠀as⠀material⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀moral⠀failure.⠀The⠀relation⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀through⠀precise⠀success⠀or⠀a⠀real⠀difficulty;⠀neither⠀incompetence⠀nor⠀an⠀uncooperative⠀world⠀must⠀be⠀invented.\n\nCompress⠀transitions⠀and⠀redundant⠀framing,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀shorten⠀thought⠀or⠀private⠀sensation⠀by⠀rule.⠀Actual⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀sensation⠀can⠀run⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀state⠀requires.⠀A⠀mentally⠀occupied⠀person⠀may⠀speak⠀before⠀the⠀chair⠀is⠀safe;⠀a⠀patient⠀person⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀loose⠀screw⠀and⠀think⠀through⠀the⠀whole⠀previous⠀evening⠀while⠀the⠀room⠀waits.\n\nUse⠀rhythm⠀changes⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀short⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀can⠀stop⠀a⠀run⠀of⠀physical⠀effort⠀or⠀mark⠀an⠀actual⠀event:⠀the⠀fit⠀succeeds,⠀the⠀cloth⠀tears,⠀the⠀handle⠀comes⠀off,⠀the⠀second⠀attempt⠀works⠀at⠀once.⠀Let⠀the⠀successful⠀outcome⠀be⠀as⠀concretely⠀written⠀as⠀the⠀failed⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀grounded⠀in⠀actual⠀elapsed⠀attention⠀and⠀action,⠀not⠀in⠀prose⠀length.⠀Wait⠀when⠀the⠀characters⠀wait,⠀continue⠀when⠀they⠀continue,⠀and⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀feeling⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀object⠀remains⠀available⠀without⠀being⠀converted⠀into⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀statement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀actual⠀records,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀author,⠀purpose,⠀recipient⠀or⠀intended⠀use,⠀and⠀composition⠀time.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀situation⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀note,⠀letter,⠀list,⠀report,⠀label,⠀message,⠀or⠀another⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀merely⠀to⠀vary⠀the⠀presentation.\n\nSelect⠀precise⠀recorded⠀particulars⠀where⠀they⠀make⠀the⠀writer's⠀actual⠀aim⠀and⠀emphasis⠀legible,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀item⠀count⠀for⠀every⠀record.⠀One⠀writer⠀preserves⠀the⠀exact⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀cup⠀while⠀omitting⠀the⠀requested⠀answer.⠀Another⠀reports⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀key⠀tag⠀in⠀a⠀complaint⠀about⠀an⠀empty⠀office.⠀A⠀list⠀includes,⠀among⠀urgent⠀items,⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀steps⠀from⠀the⠀door⠀to⠀the⠀broken⠀shelf.⠀Let⠀the⠀comic⠀timing⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀each⠀writer⠀records⠀beside⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀accomplish,⠀with⠀any⠀narrator⠀explanation⠀grounded⠀in⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀relevance⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀announcing⠀oddness.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀says⠀from⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀actually⠀knew,⠀felt,⠀or⠀intended.⠀A⠀record⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀message⠀can⠀reach⠀its⠀reader⠀too⠀late⠀or⠀solve⠀a⠀problem⠀the⠀receiver⠀has⠀already⠀forgotten.⠀Use⠀source,⠀delivery,⠀and⠀later⠀learning⠀as⠀concrete⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀omniscient⠀commentary.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀writer's⠀language⠀their⠀own.⠀One⠀may⠀write⠀formally,⠀another⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀with⠀elaborate⠀apology,⠀another⠀with⠀no⠀greeting⠀at⠀all.⠀Let⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀sensation⠀remain⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀story⠀prose⠀at⠀the⠀required⠀extent;⠀a⠀composed⠀record⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀author's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind,⠀and⠀a⠀written⠀sentence⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀felt⠀while⠀writing⠀it.\n\nMaintain⠀continuity⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀discrepancy,⠀a⠀reply,⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀exchange.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀finished⠀and⠀unsent,⠀sent⠀but⠀unread,⠀answered,⠀ignored,⠀or⠀revised.⠀End⠀while⠀composition⠀or⠀reception⠀remains⠀underway⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary⠀falls⠀there.⠀Repeated⠀particulars⠀may⠀return⠀for⠀actual⠀attention⠀or⠀timing,⠀with⠀stable⠀meaning⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀relation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGive⠀the⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀a⠀specific⠀sensory⠀presence.⠀The⠀care⠀is⠀actual⠀and⠀directed:⠀the⠀cup⠀is⠀exactly⠀the⠀temperature⠀the⠀person⠀prefers,⠀the⠀seat⠀faces⠀the⠀one⠀working⠀lamp,⠀the⠀blanket⠀is⠀brought⠀out⠀before⠀the⠀request⠀is⠀finished.⠀Treat⠀the⠀timing⠀or⠀the⠀precision⠀as⠀the⠀comic⠀event:⠀an⠀exact⠀fit⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀through⠀its⠀placement⠀even⠀when⠀accepted⠀without⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀genuinely⠀belated⠀offer⠀can⠀carry⠀another⠀scale.⠀No⠀pause⠀or⠀easier⠀prior⠀solution⠀must⠀be⠀supplied.\n\nLet⠀the⠀selected⠀impression⠀be⠀the⠀carrier⠀of⠀both⠀care⠀and⠀comic⠀proportion.⠀The⠀over-warmed⠀plate,⠀the⠀towel⠀folded⠀to⠀the⠀width⠀of⠀the⠀shelf,⠀the⠀tea⠀left⠀beside⠀the⠀already-emptied⠀cup.⠀Select⠀the⠀actual⠀detail⠀or⠀related⠀particulars⠀that⠀give⠀the⠀occasion⠀its⠀shape.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀decorative⠀inventory,⠀while⠀allowing⠀a⠀supported⠀sequence⠀or⠀montage⠀without⠀a⠀one-detail⠀quota.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀recipient's⠀actual⠀response.⠀They⠀may⠀accept,⠀refuse,⠀feel⠀partial⠀ease,⠀remain⠀distracted,⠀or⠀notice⠀the⠀care⠀only⠀later.⠀Affection⠀may⠀be⠀warmly⠀received⠀without⠀a⠀confession.⠀Agreement⠀need⠀not⠀repair⠀an⠀underlying⠀difficulty.⠀The⠀tone⠀can⠀stay⠀light⠀while⠀an⠀established⠀problem⠀remains⠀present⠀and⠀unresolved.\n\nWrite⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀thought⠀at⠀its⠀natural⠀length.⠀A⠀comfortable⠀person⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀preoccupied;⠀a⠀caring⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀annoyed⠀by⠀the⠀effort⠀they⠀have⠀just⠀made.⠀These⠀can⠀coexist⠀without⠀producing⠀a⠀bitter⠀reversal.⠀No⠀silent⠀gratification,⠀spoken⠀thanks,⠀mood⠀repair,⠀or⠀complete⠀comfort⠀is⠀required.\n\nLet⠀the⠀world⠀remain⠀consequential.⠀The⠀care⠀takes⠀place⠀inside⠀real⠀routines⠀and⠀obligations,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀friction⠀can⠀continue.⠀End⠀wherever⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀leaves⠀the⠀characters,⠀including⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀small⠀pleasure⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBegin⠀with⠀one⠀precise⠀present⠀particular:⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀objects⠀on⠀a⠀desk,⠀the⠀placement⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀chair,⠀the⠀exact⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀spoon⠀against⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀width⠀of⠀an⠀open⠀doorway⠀seen⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀seat.⠀Write⠀it⠀with⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀clarity,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀catalogue,⠀so⠀it⠀can⠀remain⠀the⠀scene's⠀anchor.\n\nThen⠀widen⠀through⠀context⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀narrator,⠀on⠀a⠀deliberate⠀rather⠀than⠀incidental⠀basis.⠀Follow⠀who⠀values⠀the⠀object,⠀what⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀use⠀it⠀belongs⠀to,⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀replaced,⠀or⠀how⠀it⠀stands⠀inside⠀an⠀existing⠀social⠀arrangement.⠀Use⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀connection⠀legible.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀supply⠀history,⠀judgment,⠀or⠀social⠀observation⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀voice⠀permits⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀outside⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract.\n\nLet⠀the⠀widening⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀among⠀aim,⠀expectation⠀and⠀particular⠀legible.⠀Context⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀chair⠀fits⠀someone's⠀preference⠀exactly,⠀why⠀a⠀coat's⠀placement⠀matters⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀spoon's⠀sound⠀recalls,⠀with⠀timing⠀or⠀proportion⠀carried⠀by⠀those⠀sourced⠀relations.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀hierarchy,⠀a⠀wrong⠀placement,⠀a⠀private⠀visit⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀association⠀merely⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀frame.⠀Keep⠀individual⠀characters'⠀speech⠀and⠀thought⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers;⠀formal⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀ornamental⠀or⠀uniform⠀cast⠀language.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀particular⠀when⠀the⠀movement⠀reaches⠀it.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀confirm,⠀qualify,⠀complicate,⠀or⠀quietly⠀deflate⠀the⠀expectation⠀the⠀framing⠀has⠀built.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀return⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀completed⠀joke;⠀the⠀particular⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀understood⠀differently⠀without⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀physical⠀fact.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀private⠀sensation⠀and⠀reasoning⠀at⠀the⠀required⠀length.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀may⠀carry⠀feeling,⠀but⠀a⠀full⠀interior⠀state⠀can⠀be⠀written⠀directly⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀End⠀inside⠀a⠀widened⠀context,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀detail,⠀or⠀a⠀continuing⠀private⠀concern,⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀teller,⠀listeners,⠀and⠀present⠀occasion⠀before⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀begins.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀concrete⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene:⠀securing⠀cooperation,⠀explaining⠀a⠀delay,⠀defending⠀a⠀preference,⠀or⠀entertaining⠀someone⠀whose⠀attention⠀matters.⠀Let⠀that⠀purpose⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀selects⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀omits,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀omission⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀deliberate⠀lie.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀from⠀people⠀pursuing⠀recognizable⠀aims⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀blind⠀spots.⠀The⠀teller's⠀blind⠀spot⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀emphasis:⠀a⠀long,⠀careful⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀minor⠀obstacle⠀while⠀the⠀actual⠀difficulty⠀passes⠀in⠀a⠀clause,⠀or⠀a⠀proud⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀sensible⠀choice⠀that⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀see⠀was⠀unnecessary.⠀The⠀listeners'⠀blind⠀spots⠀remain⠀their⠀own.⠀They⠀may⠀miss⠀the⠀point,⠀fix⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀detail,⠀or⠀accept⠀the⠀story⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀intend.⠀Accurate⠀shared⠀interest⠀is⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀misunderstanding.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀inside⠀the⠀telling.⠀Choose⠀the⠀sound,⠀object,⠀gesture⠀or⠀related⠀particulars⠀that⠀receive⠀the⠀actual⠀teller's⠀emphasis,⠀with⠀recurrence⠀following⠀the⠀telling⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀count⠀or⠀decorative⠀inventory.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀scale:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀first⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀serious⠀obstacle⠀and⠀later⠀as⠀a⠀small,⠀familiar⠀thing.⠀Place⠀that⠀shift⠀beside⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀actual⠀concern.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀selected⠀impression⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀carries⠀the⠀comic⠀proportion;⠀allow⠀relevant⠀direct⠀explanation⠀within⠀the⠀actual⠀narrative⠀voice⠀without⠀adding⠀redundant⠀commentary⠀solely⠀to⠀announce⠀a⠀joke.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀knowledge⠀distinct⠀from⠀both⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀supplies⠀a⠀separate⠀narrator.⠀The⠀performed⠀account⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀required⠀private⠀experience.⠀Render⠀authorized⠀teller⠀or⠀listener⠀nonspoken⠀thought,⠀sensation⠀or⠀feeling⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent⠀outside⠀the⠀spoken⠀tale.\n\nThe⠀telling⠀may⠀remain⠀underway⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀interrupt,⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀finish,⠀or⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀to⠀change⠀direction⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀A⠀listener's⠀continuing⠀attention,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀pause⠀on⠀a⠀selected⠀detail⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀stopping⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀through⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀The⠀scene⠀compares⠀a⠀specific⠀recollection⠀with⠀a⠀source-marked⠀trace:⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀dated⠀note,⠀a⠀photograph,⠀an⠀object's⠀present⠀condition,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀account⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀time.⠀Mark⠀the⠀source's⠀origin⠀and⠀limits⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀what⠀the⠀trace⠀actually⠀establishes⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cannot.\n\nSelect⠀remembered⠀physical⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀comparison⠀precise⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count.⠀Develop⠀actual⠀recollection⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀including⠀a⠀fuller⠀account⠀where⠀meaningful⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀compulsory⠀miniature⠀memory.⠀Then⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀trace.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀precise⠀correspondence⠀the⠀person⠀did⠀not⠀expect,⠀a⠀selective⠀emphasis⠀that⠀enlarges⠀a⠀small⠀detail,⠀or⠀a⠀genuine⠀discrepancy⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀mean⠀the⠀memory⠀was⠀false.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀memory⠀while⠀showing⠀that⠀the⠀remembered⠀scale⠀was⠀wrong.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀person's⠀current⠀aim⠀in⠀view.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀recoverable⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀comparison⠀to⠀serve⠀an⠀aim⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀action.⠀It⠀may⠀bear⠀on⠀an⠀actual⠀purpose⠀such⠀as⠀settling⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀justifying⠀a⠀choice,⠀understanding⠀an⠀old⠀arrangement⠀or⠀completing⠀a⠀task.⠀Any⠀blind⠀spot⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀person,⠀including⠀a⠀record's⠀author⠀where⠀supported;⠀the⠀trace⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀infallible⠀merely⠀by⠀being⠀written.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀read⠀the⠀trace⠀through⠀a⠀habit,⠀miss⠀what⠀it⠀plainly⠀shows,⠀or⠀accept⠀its⠀correction⠀with⠀more⠀or⠀less⠀grace.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀source's⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀knows⠀now.⠀Keep⠀the⠀trace's⠀original⠀content⠀distinct⠀from⠀actual⠀later⠀annotations⠀or⠀revisions.⠀Later⠀learning⠀does⠀not⠀retroactively⠀become⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀knew⠀or⠀wrote⠀at⠀the⠀earlier⠀time.⠀Preserve⠀that⠀boundary⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀comparison⠀is⠀comic.\n\nDo⠀not⠀manufacture⠀decline,⠀fraud,⠀or⠀lost⠀innocence⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀contrast⠀meaningful.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀past⠀was⠀smaller,⠀simpler,⠀or⠀more⠀ordinary⠀than⠀remembered,⠀and⠀that⠀is⠀enough.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀actual⠀and⠀full:⠀render⠀the⠀person's⠀feeling,⠀reasoning,⠀or⠀attachment⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀impression.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀remain⠀incomplete⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLet⠀the⠀supplied⠀place's⠀inherited⠀authority⠀take⠀a⠀concrete⠀material⠀form:⠀a⠀maintained⠀object,⠀an⠀old⠀permission,⠀a⠀room⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀former⠀use,⠀or⠀a⠀procedure⠀that⠀survives⠀because⠀someone⠀still⠀honors⠀it.⠀Give⠀that⠀form⠀its⠀real⠀texture⠀and⠀history⠀through⠀selected⠀physical⠀impressions⠀at⠀the⠀extent⠀needed⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀count⠀or⠀atmospheric⠀inventory.⠀The⠀authority⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀enough⠀to⠀affect⠀the⠀encounter,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorative.\n\nPlace⠀that⠀inherited⠀weight⠀beside⠀the⠀person's⠀current⠀aim.⠀The⠀actual⠀aim⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀ordinary⠀matter⠀such⠀as⠀access,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀sit,⠀a⠀service⠀or⠀an⠀answer;⠀preserve⠀any⠀larger⠀stakes⠀the⠀situation⠀supplies.⠀The⠀comic⠀situation⠀develops⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀need.⠀Competent⠀use⠀may⠀fit⠀the⠀arrangement⠀exactly,⠀and⠀that⠀fit⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀comic⠀as⠀friction.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀procedure⠀perfectly⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀delayed⠀by⠀its⠀ceremonial⠀pace,⠀or⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀serious⠀old⠀formality⠀as⠀a⠀minor⠀inconvenience⠀while⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀maintains⠀it⠀does⠀not.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀blind⠀spots⠀owned.⠀The⠀person⠀pursuing⠀the⠀aim⠀may⠀not⠀see⠀how⠀much⠀of⠀the⠀obstacle⠀is⠀their⠀own⠀habit,⠀or⠀may⠀overestimate⠀the⠀authority's⠀reach.⠀The⠀person⠀representing⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀may⠀not⠀see⠀that⠀its⠀original⠀purpose⠀has⠀passed.⠀Neither⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀corrupt,⠀foolish,⠀or⠀awed.⠀Atmosphere⠀may⠀affect⠀how⠀the⠀encounter⠀feels⠀without⠀proving⠀motive⠀or⠀supplying⠀a⠀supernatural⠀rule.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀intervals.⠀Let⠀selected⠀detail⠀recur⠀where⠀actual⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀encounter⠀warrants⠀it:⠀a⠀key,⠀chair⠀or⠀form⠀may⠀retain⠀familiar⠀meaning⠀or⠀acquire⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀relation.⠀Placement⠀and⠀actual⠀intervals⠀can⠀carry⠀comic⠀timing⠀without⠀a⠀recurrence⠀count,⠀changed⠀meaning⠀or⠀required⠀obstacle.⠀Relevant⠀explanation⠀remains⠀available⠀alongside⠀implication.\n\nFull⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀continuing⠀work⠀remain⠀available.⠀Render⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀thought,⠀desire,⠀or⠀discomfort⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent.⠀No⠀revelation,⠀awkward⠀silence,⠀or⠀failed⠀courtesy⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀encounter⠀may⠀remain⠀underway⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀lyric⠀inward⠀narration.⠀Begin⠀with⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀current⠀contact⠀with⠀one⠀sound,⠀texture,⠀or⠀object,⠀and⠀follow⠀that⠀sensation⠀into⠀an⠀actual⠀memory,⠀wish,⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling.⠀Develop⠀the⠀relation⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀return⠀rather⠀than⠀listing⠀associations.⠀The⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀mind,⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀diction⠀and⠀concerns.\n\nLet⠀the⠀selected⠀sensation⠀hold⠀an⠀actual⠀attachment.⠀The⠀attachment⠀may⠀be⠀to⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀routine,⠀or⠀a⠀former⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀self.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀attachment⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀circumstance.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀moved⠀by⠀the⠀exact⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀cup⠀while⠀someone⠀nearby⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀discuss⠀a⠀schedule,⠀or⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀a⠀remembered⠀texture⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀waits.⠀The⠀plain⠀circumstance⠀stays⠀visible⠀beside⠀the⠀inward⠀movement.\n\nDo⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀the⠀impression.⠀The⠀sensation⠀opens⠀the⠀thought;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀reasoning,⠀intention,⠀or⠀feeling.⠀Render⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀inner⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀including⠀direct⠀feeling⠀that⠀may⠀be⠀certain,⠀affectionate,⠀or⠀conflicted.⠀No⠀sadness⠀or⠀reticence⠀is⠀mandatory.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀person's⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀present.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀recoverable⠀while⠀inward⠀movement⠀develops,⠀without⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀serve⠀an⠀aim⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀task.⠀The⠀blind⠀spot⠀may⠀be⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀treats⠀the⠀attachment⠀as⠀more⠀or⠀less⠀important⠀than⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀warrants,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀plain⠀circumstance⠀can⠀make⠀that⠀proportion⠀comic⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nUse⠀selective⠀impressions⠀and⠀their⠀actual⠀relations⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count⠀of⠀sensations,⠀memories⠀or⠀returns.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀stay⠀with⠀a⠀detail,⠀range⠀through⠀several⠀associations⠀or⠀continue⠀direct⠀feeling⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent.⠀Let⠀the⠀association⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀support⠀a⠀completed⠀meaning.⠀No⠀new⠀understanding⠀or⠀outward⠀step⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀thought⠀may⠀continue⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀reflective⠀prose⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Arrange⠀actual⠀observations⠀of⠀an⠀occasion⠀into⠀distinct⠀prose⠀passages,⠀with⠀each⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀clear.⠀The⠀passages⠀need⠀not⠀form⠀a⠀continuous⠀scene;⠀their⠀adjacency⠀is⠀the⠀structure.⠀A⠀detail⠀may⠀recur⠀unchanged,⠀draw⠀a⠀direct⠀reflection,⠀or⠀sit⠀beside⠀another⠀accurate⠀observation⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀scale.\n\nSelect⠀physical⠀impressions⠀with⠀careful⠀attention⠀to⠀their⠀relation,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count⠀per⠀passage⠀or⠀a⠀brevity⠀rule⠀for⠀actual⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀comic⠀resonance⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀arrangement⠀places⠀side⠀by⠀side:⠀a⠀solemn⠀reflection⠀on⠀a⠀passing⠀season⠀next⠀to⠀a⠀note⠀about⠀a⠀misplaced⠀receipt,⠀a⠀careful⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀object⠀next⠀to⠀its⠀ordinary⠀current⠀use,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀place⠀now⠀occupied⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀routine.⠀Juxtaposition⠀organizes⠀the⠀relation,⠀with⠀relevant⠀source-owned⠀explanation⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀rather⠀than⠀duplicates⠀the⠀account.\n\nKeep⠀observations⠀source-owned,⠀distinguishing⠀established⠀facts⠀from⠀actual⠀uncertain⠀or⠀mistaken⠀interpretations.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀is⠀separate⠀from⠀an⠀observing⠀participant,⠀preserve⠀that⠀distinction.⠀A⠀participant's⠀observation⠀is⠀that⠀person's⠀actual⠀perception,⠀not⠀the⠀narrator's.⠀Each⠀passage⠀may⠀include⠀developed⠀thought⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling;⠀the⠀miscellany⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀brevity⠀or⠀emotional⠀restraint.\n\nLet⠀the⠀people⠀retain⠀their⠀recognizable⠀aims⠀and⠀blind⠀spots.⠀The⠀observer⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀wrong⠀detail,⠀take⠀a⠀small⠀matter⠀seriously,⠀or⠀miss⠀the⠀connection⠀the⠀arrangement⠀makes⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀The⠀occasion⠀itself⠀remains⠀consequential⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀problem⠀to⠀stay⠀playable.\n\nNo⠀theme,⠀dated⠀diary,⠀seasonal⠀inventory,⠀or⠀revelation⠀is⠀compulsory.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀may⠀continue⠀across⠀replies,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀passage⠀still⠀developing⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀observation⠀not⠀yet⠀made.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀actual⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀around⠀an⠀event⠀or⠀object,⠀marking⠀each⠀voice,⠀source,⠀and⠀time⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀move⠀between⠀them⠀without⠀confusion.⠀The⠀accounts⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀different⠀people,⠀different⠀moments,⠀or⠀different⠀kinds⠀of⠀records.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀voice⠀set⠀in⠀one⠀reply.\n\nUse⠀a⠀selected⠀object,⠀gesture⠀or⠀related⠀particulars⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀accounts⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count.⠀Let⠀each⠀account⠀carry⠀its⠀actual⠀attention⠀at⠀the⠀needed⠀extent:⠀one⠀person⠀remembers⠀its⠀weight,⠀another⠀its⠀sound,⠀another⠀its⠀present⠀condition.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀those⠀impressions.⠀An⠀earlier⠀expectation⠀may⠀sit⠀beside⠀a⠀later⠀ordinary⠀use;⠀simultaneous⠀concerns⠀may⠀agree⠀exactly⠀while⠀differing⠀in⠀emphasis.⠀Accurate⠀agreement⠀is⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀difference,⠀and⠀no⠀account⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀wrong.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀mind's⠀permissions⠀and⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀A⠀document⠀remains⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀write,⠀not⠀a⠀full⠀private⠀channel.⠀Narrator⠀disclosure⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀pass⠀knowledge⠀to⠀the⠀participants;⠀their⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀communication,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀remain⠀available.⠀Render⠀actual⠀authorized⠀sensation,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀feeling⠀at⠀their⠀needed⠀extent⠀beyond⠀any⠀composed⠀source.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀person's⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀habit⠀or⠀blind⠀spot,⠀without⠀assigning⠀an⠀error⠀to⠀every⠀account.⠀One⠀account⠀may⠀treat⠀the⠀object⠀as⠀central⠀while⠀another⠀barely⠀notices⠀it;⠀one⠀may⠀overestimate⠀its⠀importance⠀while⠀another⠀has⠀already⠀replaced⠀it.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀makes⠀the⠀proportion⠀comic⠀without⠀any⠀voice⠀announcing⠀the⠀point.\n\nNo⠀shared⠀interpretation⠀or⠀changed⠀judgment⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀polyphony⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀account⠀or⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀time⠀still⠀to⠀come⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Orient⠀the⠀people,⠀space,⠀and⠀actual⠀aim⠀with⠀enough⠀context⠀for⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀objects,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀delay⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀full⠀inventory.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀someone⠀moves,⠀when⠀an⠀object⠀changes⠀hands,⠀or⠀when⠀attention⠀shifts⠀to⠀another⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀plainly.\n\nUse⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀at⠀real⠀changes⠀of⠀speaker,⠀action,⠀or⠀private⠀attention.⠀A⠀break⠀is⠀a⠀structural⠀cue,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀change⠀itself.⠀Let⠀dialogue,⠀handling,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀each⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀readable⠀space⠀without⠀fragmenting⠀every⠀sentence.\n\nSelect⠀the⠀physical⠀impressions⠀needed⠀for⠀precise⠀attention⠀and⠀their⠀relation⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count.⠀Give⠀the⠀selected⠀cue⠀room⠀to⠀carry⠀comic⠀timing:⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀an⠀object⠀with⠀a⠀careful⠀description⠀of⠀its⠀exact⠀weight⠀or⠀texture,⠀then⠀the⠀reply⠀or⠀continued⠀handling⠀is⠀perfectly⠀ordinary.⠀The⠀cue⠀may⠀meet⠀an⠀accurate⠀response,⠀a⠀practical⠀correction,⠀or⠀continued⠀use⠀without⠀surprise.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀after⠀every⠀selected⠀detail.\n\nExplain⠀relevant⠀context⠀through⠀actual⠀narrative⠀access,⠀observation,⠀or⠀speech.⠀If⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀object⠀or⠀arrangement⠀matters,⠀let⠀the⠀explanation⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows,⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀sees,⠀or⠀what⠀someone⠀says,⠀including⠀a⠀relevant⠀narrative⠀aside⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀voice⠀and⠀knowledge⠀permit⠀it,⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀an⠀unrelated⠀explanatory⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator⠀person⠀and⠀cast⠀age⠀as⠀supplied.⠀Full⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀beyond⠀a⠀short⠀reaction⠀block:⠀render⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀thought,⠀feeling,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀setup⠀still⠀developing⠀or⠀a⠀thought⠀still⠀in⠀progress;⠀no⠀punchline,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀physical⠀impression⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene—a⠀sound,⠀a⠀texture,⠀a⠀way⠀an⠀object⠀sits⠀or⠀moves—and⠀let⠀its⠀return⠀follow⠀actual⠀attention⠀through⠀exact⠀recurrence⠀or⠀varied⠀syntax,⠀without⠀an⠀automatic⠀emotional⠀label⠀or⠀mandatory⠀change.⠀The⠀return⠀can⠀lengthen⠀a⠀clause,⠀alter⠀its⠀rhythm,⠀or⠀place⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀handling⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀impression⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀observer;⠀do⠀not⠀give⠀a⠀character⠀a⠀metaphor⠀they⠀would⠀not⠀form.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀that⠀sustained⠀impression⠀and⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀or⠀ordinary⠀particular⠀placed⠀beside⠀it.⠀The⠀plain⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction,⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀an⠀unadorned⠀observation⠀from⠀another⠀person.⠀The⠀humor⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀accurate⠀fit⠀or⠀the⠀visible⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀the⠀developed⠀image⠀and⠀the⠀plain⠀fact,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀compulsory⠀deflation⠀of⠀the⠀image.⠀If⠀the⠀image⠀survives⠀the⠀plain⠀detail⠀unchanged,⠀that⠀survival⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀comic⠀point.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀language⠀separate⠀from⠀cast⠀speech.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀an⠀elaborate⠀impression⠀with⠀a⠀flat⠀practical⠀sentence,⠀and⠀that⠀contrast⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene;⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀joke.⠀Allow⠀direct⠀explanation⠀where⠀it⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀translate⠀every⠀image⠀into⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Private⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀keep⠀their⠀needed⠀extent,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀an⠀image⠀or⠀attention⠀is⠀still⠀developing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nSelect⠀one⠀present⠀physical⠀detail⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrator⠀can⠀connect⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀through⠀actual⠀memory.⠀The⠀connection⠀must⠀be⠀specific:⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀a⠀similar⠀sound,⠀a⠀gesture⠀repeated⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances.⠀Keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀and⠀present⠀moment⠀distinct⠀in⠀time⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀preserving⠀any⠀actual⠀continuity⠀or⠀change⠀of⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀memory⠀silently⠀correct⠀or⠀replace⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀remembered⠀importance⠀beside⠀the⠀detail's⠀ordinary⠀current⠀use.⠀A⠀thing⠀once⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀reason⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀used⠀carelessly,⠀borrowed,⠀repaired,⠀or⠀ignored.⠀The⠀comic⠀proportion⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀coexistence:⠀the⠀earlier⠀attachment⠀remains⠀real⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀proceeds⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀terms.⠀Current⠀pleasure,⠀if⠀present,⠀stays⠀real;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀feeling⠀was⠀mistaken⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀is⠀a⠀betrayal.\n\nAllow⠀private⠀reflection⠀its⠀full⠀needed⠀extent,⠀including⠀direct⠀feeling⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀feel⠀it⠀directly.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀remain⠀important,⠀become⠀less⠀important,⠀or⠀change⠀its⠀meaning⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀person.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀mournful⠀conclusion,⠀a⠀corrected⠀memory,⠀or⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀resolves⠀the⠀comparison.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀modern⠀memoir:⠀a⠀composed⠀retrospective⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀composing⠀occasion⠀and⠀purpose.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀remembering,⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀writing,⠀and⠀why⠀this⠀particular⠀occasion⠀is⠀being⠀recorded.⠀The⠀memoirist⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀a⠀narrator⠀whose⠀role⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀supplies;⠀preserve⠀that⠀actual⠀role⠀and⠀its⠀limits.\n\nSelect⠀a⠀sound,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀object⠀from⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀memoirist's⠀current⠀emphasis⠀shape⠀its⠀placement.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀seemed⠀small⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀pass⠀quickly⠀over⠀something⠀that⠀later⠀proved⠀important,⠀or⠀record⠀an⠀impression⠀whose⠀meaning⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀then.⠀Distinguish⠀three⠀layers:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀experienced⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀afterward,⠀and⠀how⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀word⠀it⠀now.⠀The⠀comic⠀effect⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀any⠀two⠀of⠀these⠀layers—the⠀earlier⠀seriousness⠀beside⠀the⠀later⠀knowledge,⠀or⠀the⠀later⠀knowledge⠀beside⠀the⠀deliberately⠀modest⠀wording.\n\nThe⠀composed⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀sensation.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀interiority,⠀render⠀actual⠀private⠀sensation,⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀at⠀their⠀needed⠀extent⠀beyond⠀the⠀polished⠀record,⠀including⠀experience⠀that⠀neither⠀explains⠀the⠀selection⠀nor⠀changes⠀what⠀is⠀composed.⠀The⠀memoirist⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀self-aware⠀in⠀different⠀measures.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀confession,⠀an⠀exile,⠀a⠀recovered⠀beauty,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀passage.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀keep⠀the⠀occasion,⠀cause,⠀and⠀participants⠀clear.⠀Make⠀each⠀selected⠀detail⠀sensorially⠀exact⠀and⠀source-owned:⠀an⠀object,⠀sound,⠀action,⠀scent,⠀taste⠀or⠀bodily⠀impression⠀may⠀give⠀the⠀relation⠀concrete⠀presence.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀redundant⠀framing.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comic⠀situation⠀by⠀placing⠀an⠀expected⠀or⠀valued⠀detail⠀beside⠀its⠀actual⠀handling⠀or⠀reception.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀prepare⠀something⠀carefully⠀and⠀receive⠀a⠀flat⠀response,⠀or⠀expect⠀a⠀difficulty⠀and⠀find⠀the⠀task⠀already⠀done.⠀The⠀fit⠀may⠀be⠀exact⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀discrepant;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀mismatch.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀selected⠀details⠀does⠀the⠀comic⠀work,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀funny.\n\nRemove⠀duplicated⠀explanation,⠀not⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling.⠀A⠀long⠀thought⠀is⠀acceptable⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀exact⠀material⠀the⠀account⠀needs.⠀Keep⠀cast⠀voices⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀everyone⠀to⠀terse⠀fragments.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀plain⠀statement,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀continuing⠀thought⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀ironic⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀continuous⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀speech,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Keep⠀the⠀current⠀occasion⠀recoverable⠀at⠀each⠀turn;⠀a⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀know⠀where⠀the⠀people⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀movement⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀pause⠀for⠀reflection⠀or⠀a⠀required⠀return⠀to⠀action.\n\nSelect⠀physical⠀impressions⠀that⠀place⠀a⠀person's⠀aim⠀beside⠀real⠀circumstances.⠀The⠀aim⠀may⠀be⠀modest—a⠀meal,⠀a⠀repair,⠀an⠀explanation,⠀a⠀departure—and⠀the⠀circumstances⠀may⠀cooperate⠀exactly,⠀obstruct⠀mildly,⠀or⠀proceed⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀schedule.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀interval⠀between⠀the⠀aim⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀reception⠀or⠀result.⠀A⠀plain⠀answer,⠀exact⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀sustained⠀attention⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀humor⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀expectation.\n\nKeep⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀available.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀the⠀cast's⠀knowledge⠀remain⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀supplies⠀them;⠀reader⠀exposure⠀to⠀a⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀inform⠀another⠀participant,⠀whose⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀remain⠀available.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀ongoing⠀thought⠀or⠀activity,⠀without⠀a⠀result,⠀a⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀the⠀occasion⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀participants.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀pair,⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀a⠀comfort⠀scene⠀that⠀the⠀supplied⠀material⠀does⠀not⠀contain.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀established⠀bond⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀do,⠀say,⠀notice,⠀and⠀avoid⠀in⠀this⠀particular⠀interval.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀phrase⠀or⠀placement⠀recur⠀where⠀its⠀actual⠀source⠀supports⠀it,⠀including⠀one⠀participant's⠀private⠀memory;⠀familiarity⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀collectively⠀shared.⠀A⠀long-established⠀pair⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀shorthand⠀that⠀a⠀new⠀acquaintance⠀would⠀not;⠀a⠀new⠀bond⠀may⠀instead⠀involve⠀a⠀first-time⠀act⠀with⠀no⠀invented⠀familiarity.⠀Recognition⠀follows⠀actual⠀knowledge:⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀another⠀misses,⠀and⠀a⠀missed⠀cue⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀a⠀relationship⠀failure⠀or⠀a⠀comic⠀beat.\n\nGive⠀relevant⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀discovery⠀its⠀full⠀private⠀extent.⠀The⠀selected⠀physical⠀impression⠀can⠀carry⠀different⠀meanings⠀for⠀different⠀participants,⠀and⠀that⠀difference⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀comic⠀material.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀acknowledgment,⠀silence,⠀payoff,⠀or⠀change⠀of⠀relationship⠀status.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀places⠀an⠀actual⠀deed⠀or⠀exchange⠀in⠀a⠀retold⠀frame.⠀The⠀declaration⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀source⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀support—a⠀community⠀saying,⠀a⠀remembered⠀account,⠀a⠀family⠀phrase,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀deliberate⠀cadence—not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Let⠀the⠀declaration⠀name⠀the⠀deed⠀plainly:⠀who⠀did⠀what,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀was⠀taken⠀to⠀mean.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀object,⠀sound,⠀or⠀gesture⠀from⠀the⠀deed⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀make⠀the⠀remembered⠀estimate⠀precise.⠀The⠀designation⠀may⠀fit⠀exactly⠀or⠀need⠀qualification;⠀the⠀comic⠀proportion⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀elevated⠀retelling⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀physical⠀particular.⠀A⠀grand⠀phrase⠀about⠀a⠀repair⠀may⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀specific⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀tool⠀slipping,⠀or⠀a⠀solemn⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀departure⠀may⠀rest⠀on⠀a⠀single⠀ordinary⠀object⠀left⠀behind.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀designation⠀to⠀be⠀wrong⠀or⠀the⠀deed⠀to⠀be⠀mocked;⠀an⠀exact⠀fit⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀humor⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀discrepancy.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀earlier⠀motive,⠀later⠀account,⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀person⠀who⠀acted⠀may⠀have⠀felt⠀something⠀different⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀retelling⠀says,⠀and⠀that⠀difference⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀to⠀the⠀community.⠀Recurrence⠀follows⠀actual⠀telling,⠀attention,⠀or⠀supported⠀tradition;⠀a⠀phrase⠀need⠀not⠀return⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty⠀or⠀acquire⠀a⠀new⠀meaning⠀each⠀time.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀finished⠀deed,⠀a⠀collective⠀reputation,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀valuation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
