            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-comedy-06",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Comedy · 06/06",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == comedy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Comedy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 6 of 6. }}{{// Source group: recipes-comedy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPacbaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀essayistic⠀narration.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀participant⠀state⠀a⠀claim⠀that⠀is⠀actually⠀available⠀to⠀them:⠀a⠀general⠀rule⠀about⠀the⠀household,⠀the⠀season,⠀the⠀office,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀think⠀they⠀understand.⠀Make⠀the⠀claim⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀situation,⠀through⠀direct⠀statement⠀or⠀a⠀source-owned⠀formulation⠀rather⠀than⠀assigning⠀a⠀settled⠀general⠀belief⠀or⠀a⠀need⠀to⠀refute⠀it.\n\nPlace⠀a⠀specific⠀case⠀beside⠀the⠀claim.⠀Use⠀an⠀established⠀observed⠀or⠀remembered⠀case,⠀or⠀an⠀explicitly⠀hypothetical⠀example⠀within⠀the⠀known⠀world⠀and⠀actual⠀narrator⠀access.⠀Keep⠀hypothesis⠀distinct⠀from⠀event⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀contrary⠀evidence⠀merely⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀verdict.⠀Select⠀the⠀physical⠀impressions⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀case⠀concrete:⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀holds⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀interval⠀before⠀an⠀answer,⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀objects⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing.⠀Let⠀those⠀impressions⠀carry⠀the⠀comparison⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.\n\nLet⠀the⠀case⠀test⠀the⠀claim⠀through⠀its⠀own⠀particulars.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀claim,⠀qualify⠀it,⠀or⠀remain⠀provisional.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀refutation⠀or⠀a⠀tidy⠀reversal.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀general⠀statement⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀impression,⠀not⠀from⠀punishing⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀made⠀the⠀claim.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀wrong⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀way⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀sensible⠀in⠀a⠀larger⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀the⠀permitted⠀private⠀experience⠀intact.⠀The⠀essayistic⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀or⠀the⠀actual⠀speaker;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀mind.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀channel⠀and⠀can⠀continue⠀through⠀the⠀argument.⠀The⠀inquiry⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀with⠀action,⠀speech,⠀or⠀thought⠀still⠀underway⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀A⠀return⠀that⠀reaches⠀no⠀final⠀verdict⠀is⠀acceptable⠀when⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀circumstances⠀warrant⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀actually⠀changes.⠀Select⠀one⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀a⠀real⠀utterance⠀or⠀action:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀drawer⠀while⠀someone⠀answers,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀coat⠀is⠀folded⠀during⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀speech,⠀the⠀interval⠀between⠀a⠀question⠀and⠀the⠀movement⠀that⠀follows.⠀The⠀detail⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀prop⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀emphasis.\n\nUse⠀a⠀held⠀shot⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it.⠀A⠀held⠀shot⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀fictional⠀time.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀actually⠀waits,⠀preserve⠀that⠀duration⠀through⠀the⠀real⠀activity,⠀stillness,⠀direct⠀account⠀or⠀private⠀experience;⠀no⠀new⠀public⠀business,⠀speech⠀or⠀external⠀event⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀wait.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀waiting,⠀do⠀not⠀stretch⠀the⠀shot⠀to⠀manufacture⠀a⠀pause.⠀Prose⠀length⠀and⠀editing⠀do⠀not⠀themselves⠀make⠀people⠀wait.\n\nLet⠀interpretations⠀follow⠀context⠀and⠀permitted⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀visible⠀expression⠀or⠀audible⠀tone⠀can⠀draw⠀attention,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀thinks⠀or⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.⠀The⠀reader⠀sees⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀shows;⠀the⠀characters⠀retain⠀what⠀actual⠀positions,⠀histories,⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀make⠀available.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀a⠀selected⠀detail⠀into⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀nonspoken⠀channel,⠀separate⠀from⠀voice-over.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀can⠀remain⠀ongoing⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀without⠀being⠀converted⠀into⠀a⠀line.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀action,⠀a⠀reply,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀No⠀closing⠀joke⠀or⠀completed⠀beat⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nKeep⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀coherent.⠀Entrances,⠀exits,⠀reach,⠀objects,⠀and⠀speech⠀must⠀remain⠀playable:⠀make⠀access⠀to⠀objects,⠀sounds⠀and⠀exits⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀layout,⠀staging⠀and⠀supported⠀abilities.⠀Preserve⠀tools⠀or⠀world-specific⠀capacities⠀where⠀supplied,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀exit⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀door.⠀Let⠀physical⠀business⠀follow⠀actual⠀activity,⠀attention,⠀feeling⠀or⠀circumstances,⠀without⠀requiring⠀every⠀gesture⠀to⠀serve⠀a⠀practical⠀purpose.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀cup,⠀straighten⠀a⠀chair,⠀or⠀remain⠀still⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀moment⠀supplies.\n\nChoose⠀physical⠀business⠀or⠀stillness⠀actually⠀present.⠀Competent⠀coordination⠀is⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀discrepancy.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fumbled⠀object,⠀a⠀mistimed⠀entrance,⠀or⠀a⠀comic⠀collision⠀on⠀every⠀beat.⠀The⠀comedy⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀relation⠀between⠀a⠀selected⠀gesture⠀and⠀the⠀spoken⠀line:⠀someone⠀continues⠀folding⠀a⠀napkin⠀while⠀making⠀a⠀large⠀claim,⠀or⠀stops⠀mid-motion⠀when⠀the⠀claim⠀meets⠀an⠀unexpected⠀plain⠀answer.\n\nTreat⠀a⠀pause⠀as⠀taking⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀cause⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies.⠀A⠀pause⠀may⠀mark⠀attention,⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀completion⠀of⠀a⠀small⠀task,⠀or⠀nothing⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀natural⠀interval⠀between⠀speeches.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀it⠀an⠀automatic⠀emotional⠀meaning.⠀The⠀stage⠀direction⠀records⠀what⠀is⠀observable;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀pause⠀means⠀inside⠀a⠀character.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀authorized⠀asides⠀or⠀monologues.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀audience;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀required⠀private⠀thought.⠀Speaker,⠀actor,⠀and⠀narrator⠀access⠀remain⠀actual:⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀see⠀a⠀gesture,⠀but⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀the⠀thought⠀behind⠀it⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀establishes⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀Thought,⠀speech,⠀or⠀work⠀may⠀remain⠀underway⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀tableau⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nFollow⠀actual⠀perception,⠀sensation,⠀memory,⠀and⠀private⠀words⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀selected⠀impression⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bag,⠀the⠀particular⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀voice.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀carry⠀that⠀impression⠀into⠀an⠀ordinary⠀concern⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀shift.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀sleeve⠀to⠀a⠀stain⠀to⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀mended⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀now⠀seems⠀unnecessary.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀current⠀fact⠀from⠀memory⠀and⠀imagination.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀remembered⠀room⠀at⠀its⠀earlier⠀time⠀from⠀present⠀perception,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀person⠀currently⠀occupies⠀that⠀same⠀place;⠀a⠀feared⠀reply⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀been⠀spoken.⠀The⠀braid⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀another⠀sensation,⠀a⠀spoken⠀word,⠀or⠀the⠀continuation⠀of⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀be⠀dramatic⠀or⠀the⠀association⠀to⠀resolve.\n\nThe⠀association⠀can⠀be⠀warm,⠀direct,⠀certain,⠀or⠀conflicted.⠀No⠀sad⠀turn,⠀external⠀interruption,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀action⠀is⠀mandatory.⠀The⠀comic⠀scale⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀mind's⠀way⠀of⠀holding⠀a⠀small⠀thing⠀beside⠀a⠀large⠀one:⠀a⠀serious⠀resolution⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀sandwich,⠀a⠀grand⠀plan⠀measured⠀against⠀the⠀exact⠀difficulty⠀of⠀opening⠀a⠀window.⠀The⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀laugh⠀at⠀themselves⠀or⠀explain⠀the⠀connection.\n\nPreserve⠀separately⠀authorized⠀access⠀and⠀full⠀extent.⠀Let⠀the⠀chosen⠀mind's⠀associations⠀organize⠀the⠀passage;⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀mind⠀remains⠀available⠀without⠀merging⠀their⠀knowledge⠀or⠀experience.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀channel⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀shortened⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀comic⠀beat.⠀Real⠀duration⠀follows⠀attention⠀and⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀prose⠀length⠀alone.⠀A⠀long⠀associative⠀passage⠀may⠀cover⠀a⠀few⠀seconds⠀of⠀waiting;⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀may⠀cover⠀a⠀completed⠀action.⠀The⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀inside⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement,⠀with⠀no⠀external⠀event⠀or⠀completed⠀thought⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀sends⠀fragments,⠀a⠀third⠀corrects⠀a⠀word⠀after⠀sending.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nSelect⠀a⠀precise⠀written⠀detail⠀and⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀actual⠀reception.⠀A⠀word⠀may⠀recur⠀unchanged⠀and⠀be⠀accurately⠀recognized;⠀a⠀description⠀may⠀meet⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀misunderstanding.⠀The⠀comic⠀timing⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀written⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀does⠀with⠀it:⠀a⠀careful⠀explanation⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀long⠀message⠀read⠀in⠀the⠀interval⠀of⠀a⠀short⠀errand,⠀a⠀precise⠀description⠀met⠀with⠀an⠀equally⠀precise⠀but⠀unrelated⠀correction.⠀No⠀slow⠀reply⠀or⠀misread⠀is⠀required.\n\nDistinguish⠀composed,⠀sent,⠀received,⠀and⠀understood.⠀Sending⠀does⠀not⠀occur⠀merely⠀because⠀text⠀is⠀drafted.⠀An⠀intended⠀recipient⠀may⠀nevertheless⠀access⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀shared⠀screen,⠀source⠀or⠀permission.⠀Distinguish⠀delivery⠀to⠀a⠀device⠀or⠀channel⠀from⠀the⠀recipient⠀reading⠀it;⠀delivered⠀text⠀may⠀remain⠀unread.⠀A⠀message⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀read⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀understood⠀differently⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀sender⠀intended.⠀Let⠀those⠀distinctions⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀sequence⠀rather⠀than⠀collapsing⠀them⠀for⠀a⠀joke.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀thought⠀separate⠀from⠀drafts⠀and⠀messages.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀spend⠀a⠀long⠀private⠀interval⠀considering⠀a⠀short⠀text⠀while⠀it⠀remains⠀unsent;⠀that⠀interiority⠀stays⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀channel⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted.⠀The⠀boundary⠀can⠀fall⠀inside⠀composition⠀or⠀reception⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀joke.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀with⠀a⠀draft⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀unread,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀still⠀forming.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀and⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Select⠀a⠀background,⠀object,⠀or⠀expression⠀reference⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene:⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀table⠀after⠀a⠀meal,⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀a⠀character's⠀head,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀door⠀stands⠀open.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reference⠀purposeful;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nLet⠀focal⠀attention⠀place⠀the⠀cue⠀beside⠀a⠀real⠀expectation,⠀utterance,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀act.⠀The⠀cue⠀may⠀sustain⠀its⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀gain⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀relation⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀arrives.⠀A⠀character's⠀careful⠀arrangement⠀of⠀a⠀desk⠀may⠀sit⠀beside⠀their⠀claim⠀of⠀indifference;⠀the⠀same⠀arrangement⠀may⠀read⠀differently⠀after⠀a⠀message⠀arrives.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀obligatory⠀reaction⠀beat⠀after⠀each⠀cue.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀may⠀simply⠀hold⠀the⠀detail⠀while⠀the⠀dialogue⠀continues.\n\nTreat⠀a⠀face⠀as⠀needing⠀actual⠀context⠀and⠀permitted⠀knowledge⠀for⠀inference.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀draw⠀attention,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀thinks⠀or⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀motive⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀explains⠀them.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀actual⠀order⠀and⠀supplied⠀ownership.⠀Focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀permitted⠀mind⠀and⠀follows⠀the⠀scene's⠀real⠀sequence;⠀a⠀later⠀realization⠀cannot⠀be⠀retroactively⠀inserted⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀No⠀menu,⠀image,⠀or⠀fixed⠀cue-thought-reply⠀cycle⠀arises⠀merely⠀from⠀the⠀style.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀a⠀continued⠀exchange,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀attention⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPacbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Comedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Recover⠀the⠀current⠀aim,⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀and⠀the⠀relevant⠀prior⠀context⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀Avoid⠀repeating⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀merely⠀as⠀automatic⠀recap.⠀A⠀brief⠀reference⠀may⠀suffice⠀for⠀orientation,⠀while⠀an⠀actual⠀recollection,⠀requested⠀account⠀or⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀can⠀take⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀including⠀a⠀complete⠀telling.\n\nLet⠀a⠀selected⠀detail⠀recur⠀for⠀exact⠀timing,⠀familiar⠀emphasis,⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀scale.⠀The⠀same⠀sound,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀may⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀repeats⠀it,⠀because⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀it⠀again,⠀or⠀because⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀shifted⠀with⠀new⠀facts.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀detail⠀a⠀fixed⠀symbol⠀that⠀must⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀rediscover⠀what⠀they⠀already⠀know.⠀If⠀a⠀person⠀previously⠀noticed⠀the⠀loose⠀step,⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀notice⠀it⠀as⠀if⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀thought,⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀available⠀across⠀replies.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length,⠀feel⠀plainly,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀result⠀or⠀clue-like⠀development⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀interval.⠀The⠀comic⠀continuity⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀small⠀aim⠀across⠀installments:⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀still⠀trying⠀to⠀return⠀the⠀same⠀borrowed⠀item,⠀the⠀same⠀household⠀still⠀adjusting⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀new⠀arrangement.⠀No⠀new⠀reversal⠀or⠀completed⠀joke⠀is⠀owed.\n\nLet⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀within⠀setup⠀or⠀continued⠀attention.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀composing⠀a⠀message,⠀still⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀reply,⠀or⠀still⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀mention⠀the⠀thing⠀they⠀noticed.⠀No⠀hook,⠀sad⠀turn,⠀or⠀changed⠀relationship⠀is⠀required.⠀What⠀is⠀underway⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀retain⠀what⠀they⠀already⠀know⠀and⠀feel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
