            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-crime-01",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Crime · 01/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == crime}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Crime. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 1 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-crime; payload preserved. }}{{// Recipe Library: Crime }}\n{{setvar::NPadaaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀strain⠀it⠀places⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀need,⠀request,⠀withheld⠀answer,⠀or⠀attempt⠀to⠀return⠀supply⠀the⠀relational⠀pressure,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀strain⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀done⠀next:⠀a⠀request⠀made⠀too⠀late,⠀an⠀apology⠀that⠀arrives⠀sideways,⠀an⠀answer⠀withheld⠀until⠀it⠀costs⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀silence.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀account⠀into⠀a⠀culprit⠀puzzle⠀by⠀default;⠀an⠀actual⠀investigation⠀or⠀a⠀genuine⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀who⠀acted⠀remains⠀available⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀supports⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀observable⠀response⠀recoverable⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀attention⠀breaks.\n\nRender⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀as⠀lived⠀private⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stylistic⠀stutter.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀sound,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀image⠀can⠀cut⠀across⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀hear,⠀and⠀the⠀speech⠀that⠀follows⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀mark⠀of⠀that⠀interruption:⠀a⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀twice,⠀a⠀sentence⠀abandoned⠀midway.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀receives;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀other⠀speaker's⠀words⠀with⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀version⠀of⠀them.⠀When⠀interpretation⠀is⠀unstable,⠀give⠀the⠀actual⠀association⠀or⠀cue⠀available⠀under⠀narrator⠀access⠀and⠀mark⠀what⠀remains⠀uncertain.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀external⠀trigger⠀or⠀a⠀settled⠀explanation⠀for⠀the⠀intrusion;⠀it⠀may⠀arrive⠀unbidden,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀need⠀not⠀understand⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀separate⠀from⠀evidence.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀tremble,⠀apologize,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀speak⠀without⠀that⠀proving⠀complicity,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀hold⠀the⠀line⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀establishes.⠀Sincere⠀help⠀and⠀accurate⠀knowledge⠀remain⠀possible⠀inside⠀the⠀strain;⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀real.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀request⠀still⠀open,⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀still⠀running,⠀or⠀the⠀relationship⠀unresolved.⠀No⠀confession,⠀forgiveness,⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀the⠀reply⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀people,⠀location,⠀and⠀current⠀activity⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Make⠀every⠀spoken⠀line⠀unmistakably⠀attributed,⠀and⠀keep⠀actions,⠀objects,⠀and⠀movement⠀concrete⠀enough⠀that⠀another⠀participant⠀can⠀respond⠀without⠀guessing⠀what⠀happened.⠀Let⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀an⠀ongoing⠀scheme,⠀a⠀recent⠀offense,⠀or⠀its⠀practical⠀aftermath⠀shaping⠀what⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀want;⠀the⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀clue,⠀an⠀accusation,⠀or⠀a⠀pursuit.\n\nSeparate⠀what⠀is⠀publicly⠀observable⠀from⠀what⠀each⠀permitted⠀viewpoint⠀actually⠀receives.⠀When⠀a⠀participant's⠀attention⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀noise,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unstable⠀reading⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀words,⠀write⠀that⠀interruption⠀as⠀that⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀while⠀the⠀shared⠀world⠀keeps⠀moving:⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀continue⠀to⠀act⠀and⠀speak⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀purposes.⠀A⠀misheard⠀version⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀person's⠀reception⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀words⠀actually⠀spoken.⠀An⠀actual⠀delayed⠀answer⠀or⠀action⠀is⠀also⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀world,⠀with⠀whatever⠀observable⠀effects⠀and⠀consequences⠀the⠀situation⠀supports.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀active⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀pursuits,⠀including⠀cooperation⠀and⠀genuine⠀help⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀resistance,⠀and⠀preserve⠀each⠀player's⠀ownership⠀of⠀their⠀character.⠀End⠀the⠀interval⠀at⠀its⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point:⠀a⠀question⠀may⠀hang⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀forming,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀about⠀to⠀speak.⠀No⠀chase,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀new⠀threat⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀reply,⠀and⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed;⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀picks⠀up⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Organize⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀actual⠀occasions⠀in⠀a⠀continuing⠀sequence:⠀establish⠀the⠀immediate⠀place,⠀the⠀people⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀business⠀that⠀brings⠀them⠀together.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀cover⠀part⠀of⠀one⠀occasion⠀or⠀move⠀through⠀an⠀authorized⠀transition;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀a⠀complete⠀episode.⠀Let⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀scheme⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀this⠀occasion⠀actually⠀involves⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀to⠀settle,⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀carry,⠀a⠀household⠀to⠀visit,⠀a⠀transaction⠀to⠀complete⠀—⠀with⠀any⠀needed⠀context⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀present⠀rather⠀than⠀delivered⠀as⠀a⠀case⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies;⠀the⠀episodic⠀method⠀moves⠀occasions⠀forward⠀without⠀relocating⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀importing⠀a⠀fixed⠀historical⠀setting.\n\nBind⠀occasions⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀concrete⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀threads:⠀a⠀name,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀a⠀report⠀that⠀travels.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀knows⠀firsthand⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀heard.⠀A⠀reputation⠀or⠀repeated⠀report⠀can⠀shape⠀several⠀people's⠀expectations⠀while⠀remaining⠀a⠀report⠀—⠀not⠀shared⠀firsthand⠀observation,⠀and⠀not⠀automatic⠀proof⠀of⠀the⠀event⠀it⠀describes⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀incomplete⠀information⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀keeps⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀legible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀reception⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association,⠀a⠀noise,⠀or⠀an⠀uncertain⠀reading⠀of⠀another's⠀speech.⠀Render⠀the⠀interruption⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀inside⠀the⠀occasion⠀while⠀the⠀world's⠀business⠀continues⠀around⠀it.⠀Return⠀to⠀observable⠀exchange⠀when⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀occasion's⠀movement⠀actually⠀returns⠀there;⠀no⠀outward⠀recovery⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀An⠀episode⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀business⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀next⠀occasion⠀opening,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀still⠀turning.⠀No⠀solved⠀case,⠀moral,⠀or⠀changed⠀allegiance⠀is⠀owed⠀per⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀exact⠀verbs⠀and⠀concrete⠀spatial⠀relations⠀for⠀the⠀criminal⠀act,⠀pursuit,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀currently⠀present.⠀Name⠀the⠀material⠀particulars⠀that⠀carry⠀weight⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀them⠀—⠀a⠀door's⠀resistance,⠀a⠀weapon's⠀condition,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀wound,⠀the⠀contents⠀of⠀a⠀bag,⠀the⠀distance⠀to⠀cover⠀—⠀and⠀compress⠀transitions⠀between⠀actions⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀moves⠀with⠀the⠀event⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀it.⠀Material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes⠀do⠀the⠀work;⠀atmosphere⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀happening.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀when⠀private⠀experience⠀requires⠀it.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀a⠀sensory⠀interruption,⠀or⠀an⠀unstable⠀reading⠀of⠀what⠀just⠀happened⠀can⠀break⠀the⠀compressed⠀movement⠀and⠀expand⠀into⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀of⠀actual⠀perception,⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀justify⠀itself⠀by⠀changing⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Keep⠀the⠀event⠀itself⠀unchanged⠀by⠀that⠀perception:⠀the⠀blow⠀still⠀landed,⠀the⠀message⠀still⠀said⠀what⠀it⠀said,⠀the⠀money⠀still⠀moved.⠀What⠀changes⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀notices,⠀believes,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀moment,⠀and⠀that⠀gap⠀may⠀matter⠀later⠀without⠀being⠀resolved⠀now.\n\nGround⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀threat,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀clipped⠀answer⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀who⠀says⠀it,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀hard-boiled⠀register.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀competence,⠀damage,⠀and⠀consequence⠀without⠀inventing⠀violence⠀or⠀failure⠀to⠀maintain⠀grit.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀with⠀the⠀physical⠀situation⠀still⠀developing⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀realization⠀incomplete;⠀no⠀blow,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀reversal⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀criminal⠀milieu,⠀or⠀human⠀aftermath⠀through⠀documents⠀selected⠀and⠀ordered⠀by⠀their⠀actual⠀part⠀in⠀the⠀participants'⠀lives.⠀Establish⠀each⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Make⠀the⠀criminal⠀relation⠀specific⠀within⠀source⠀and⠀narrator⠀access:⠀what⠀a⠀participant⠀chooses⠀to⠀preserve⠀about⠀the⠀act,⠀which⠀actual⠀consequence⠀the⠀wording⠀carries,⠀or⠀why⠀an⠀account⠀is⠀kept,⠀copied,⠀or⠀circulated.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀simply⠀sustain⠀attention⠀to⠀an⠀unchanged⠀aftermath⠀without⠀being⠀a⠀tactic,⠀a⠀legal⠀step,⠀or⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀new⠀information.⠀Use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀supports⠀—⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀after⠀an⠀incident,⠀a⠀letter⠀sent⠀before⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀at⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀statement⠀given⠀under⠀pressure⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀document⠀record⠀only⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀knew,⠀chose⠀to⠀include,⠀or⠀was⠀required⠀to⠀state⠀at⠀that⠀moment.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀composed⠀account⠀from⠀the⠀experience⠀surrounding⠀its⠀composition.⠀A⠀writer⠀may⠀omit⠀an⠀intrusive⠀image,⠀smooth⠀over⠀an⠀uncertain⠀perception,⠀or⠀describe⠀an⠀event⠀more⠀coherently⠀than⠀they⠀received⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀includes⠀live⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀that⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀document:⠀the⠀document⠀is⠀an⠀artifact⠀with⠀a⠀purpose,⠀not⠀the⠀complete⠀mind⠀of⠀its⠀author.\n\nGive⠀later⠀documents⠀their⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀earlier⠀ones.⠀Agreement,⠀unchanged⠀meaning,⠀qualification,⠀and⠀extension⠀are⠀all⠀available⠀without⠀rewriting⠀prior⠀events⠀or⠀requiring⠀new⠀information;⠀a⠀second⠀account⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀date,⠀reveal⠀a⠀withheld⠀motive,⠀or⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀know.⠀Keep⠀delivery⠀distinct⠀from⠀reception:⠀a⠀letter⠀written⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀letter⠀read,⠀and⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀report⠀believed.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀document⠀unfinished,⠀unsent,⠀or⠀awaiting⠀a⠀response;⠀no⠀confession,⠀conflicting⠀record,⠀or⠀completed⠀correspondence⠀cycle⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGive⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀room⠀inside⠀the⠀actual⠀criminal⠀circumstances.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀bring⠀food,⠀remember⠀a⠀preference,⠀offer⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀sit,⠀or⠀take⠀over⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀consequences⠀remain⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Write⠀the⠀care⠀as⠀sincere⠀and⠀specific:⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀drink,⠀the⠀familiar⠀way⠀a⠀coat⠀is⠀hung,⠀the⠀ease⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀silence,⠀the⠀thing⠀remembered⠀without⠀being⠀asked.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀trick⠀or⠀trap⠀merely⠀to⠀undercut⠀the⠀comfort,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀care⠀fraudulent⠀by⠀default;⠀preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀deception⠀or⠀danger⠀the⠀story⠀supplies.\n\nRender⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀reception⠀of⠀that⠀care⠀as⠀their⠀own⠀experience.⠀They⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀kindness⠀fully⠀and⠀enjoy⠀it,⠀or⠀have⠀it⠀interrupted⠀by⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀a⠀noise,⠀or⠀an⠀uncertain⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀manner.⠀The⠀interruption⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀care⠀false,⠀and⠀the⠀care⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀actual⠀danger,⠀responsibility,⠀or⠀disagreement⠀in⠀the⠀world;⠀warmth⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀interval.⠀Private⠀pleasure,⠀gratitude,⠀or⠀guilt⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀improvement.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀agency⠀and⠀the⠀criminal⠀stakes⠀intact.⠀A⠀kind⠀act⠀may⠀be⠀refused,⠀accepted⠀awkwardly,⠀or⠀received⠀without⠀words,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀involved⠀may⠀still⠀disagree⠀about⠀what⠀happened⠀or⠀what⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀unresolved,⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀still⠀turning,⠀or⠀the⠀comfort⠀simply⠀present⠀and⠀enjoyed.⠀No⠀absolution,⠀confession,⠀hidden⠀trap,⠀or⠀guaranteed⠀safety⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀treatment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀the⠀reply⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions.⠀Frame⠀the⠀current⠀act⠀or⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀know:⠀the⠀standing⠀of⠀a⠀family,⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀trade,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀arrest⠀or⠀a⠀disappearance.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀orient⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀give⠀its⠀particular⠀people⠀their⠀weight⠀without⠀replacing⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀survey.\n\nKeep⠀attribution⠀precise.⠀A⠀public⠀judgment⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀institution⠀that⠀holds⠀it;⠀a⠀report⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀source;⠀a⠀private⠀interpretation⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀forms⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀an⠀intrusive⠀image,⠀a⠀noise,⠀or⠀an⠀unstable⠀reading⠀of⠀another's⠀words,⠀develop⠀that⠀experience⠀inside⠀their⠀owned⠀interiority⠀at⠀full⠀length,⠀with⠀the⠀composed⠀narration⠀carrying⠀the⠀interruption⠀rather⠀than⠀smoothing⠀it⠀away.⠀The⠀surrounding⠀social⠀facts⠀do⠀not⠀become⠀indefinite⠀because⠀one⠀person⠀received⠀them⠀uncertainly;⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀established⠀while⠀the⠀person's⠀grasp⠀of⠀it⠀falters.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀cast⠀member's⠀actual⠀diction.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀composed⠀register⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀elaborate,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀remains⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀public⠀context⠀into⠀private⠀consideration⠀and⠀out⠀into⠀spoken⠀exchange⠀without⠀arriving⠀at⠀a⠀verdict.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀still⠀forming,⠀the⠀private⠀consideration⠀ongoing,⠀or⠀the⠀scene's⠀consequence⠀not⠀yet⠀settled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀the⠀occasion:⠀who⠀is⠀telling,⠀who⠀listens,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀given⠀now.⠀The⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀is⠀the⠀tale's⠀subject,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀present⠀act⠀inside⠀that⠀aftermath⠀—⠀securing⠀cooperation,⠀deflecting⠀blame,⠀warning⠀someone,⠀buying⠀time,⠀or⠀making⠀one⠀listener⠀finally⠀grasp⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀believes⠀happened.⠀The⠀aim⠀can⠀remain⠀unstated;⠀let⠀it⠀surface⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀include,⠀stress,⠀and⠀pass⠀over⠀quickly.\n\nCompose⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀spoken⠀version,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀replay.⠀Give⠀it⠀the⠀teller's⠀ordering,⠀emphases,⠀and⠀omissions:⠀a⠀vivid⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀exact,⠀half-remembered,⠀or⠀placed⠀for⠀effect,⠀and⠀the⠀performance's⠀confidence⠀never⠀certifies⠀the⠀event.⠀Track⠀the⠀claimed⠀source⠀separately⠀from⠀any⠀actual⠀source⠀knowledge⠀the⠀narration⠀holds⠀—⠀firsthand⠀experience,⠀report,⠀assumption,⠀later⠀learning⠀—⠀since⠀a⠀teller⠀may⠀present⠀any⠀of⠀these⠀accurately⠀or⠀misrepresent⠀them⠀as⠀the⠀person⠀and⠀circumstances⠀support.⠀Sincerity⠀and⠀strategy⠀can⠀share⠀one⠀voice.\n\nMove⠀between⠀the⠀outer⠀room⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀at⠀points⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀acts⠀on⠀the⠀room.⠀A⠀listener⠀loses⠀a⠀phrase⠀because⠀a⠀phone⠀vibrates,⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀replaces⠀the⠀teller's⠀next⠀words;⠀render⠀that⠀interrupted⠀reception⠀as⠀private⠀experience⠀owned⠀by⠀that⠀listener⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀heard,⠀what⠀was⠀reconstructed⠀afterward,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀believes⠀the⠀teller⠀meant,⠀whether⠀accurate,⠀mistaken,⠀or⠀still⠀unresolved.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀original⠀event⠀stable.⠀What⠀a⠀participant⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀stays⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀now,⠀and⠀a⠀listener's⠀later⠀inference⠀does⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀earlier⠀action.⠀If⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀recurs⠀across⠀the⠀telling,⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀help⠀the⠀reader⠀track⠀which⠀narrative⠀level⠀is⠀active⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀between⠀levels;⠀recurrence⠀connects,⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀verify.⠀Stop⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀—⠀mid-telling,⠀as⠀a⠀listener⠀draws⠀breath⠀to⠀answer,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀hanging⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀completed⠀persuasion,⠀or⠀a⠀revelation⠀first.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀a⠀craft⠀device:⠀no⠀royal⠀court,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀or⠀obligatory⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀nested⠀accounts⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀unrelated⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀When⠀a⠀record⠀is⠀actually⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀composed,⠀concrete⠀form⠀—⠀a⠀report,⠀file,⠀notice,⠀letter,⠀ledger⠀line⠀—⠀with⠀an⠀author,⠀a⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀writing,⠀its⠀register⠀following⠀that⠀actual⠀author⠀and⠀setting.⠀Present⠀its⠀wording⠀as⠀something⠀someone⠀made⠀for⠀a⠀reason:⠀precise⠀or⠀partial,⠀protective⠀or⠀self-serving,⠀and⠀visibly⠀silent⠀about⠀whatever⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀count.\n\nSet⠀the⠀record⠀beside⠀authorized⠀lived⠀memory.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀document's⠀language⠀and⠀a⠀character's⠀recollection⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀circumstances,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀two⠀agree⠀while⠀emphasizing⠀different⠀consequences:⠀the⠀record⠀fixes⠀a⠀time⠀and⠀a⠀location;⠀the⠀memory⠀holds⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀pause,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀image⠀that⠀cut⠀attention⠀then⠀and⠀returns⠀now.⠀Agreement⠀with⠀different⠀emphasis⠀is⠀at⠀least⠀as⠀useful⠀as⠀discrepancy;⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀every⠀gap⠀between⠀them⠀as⠀a⠀concealed⠀falsehood.\n\nWhen⠀noise,⠀fatigue,⠀fear,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀interrupts⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reception,⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀whatever⠀cause⠀is⠀available⠀under⠀narrator⠀access,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀known⠀trigger⠀while⠀the⠀origin⠀remains⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀something⠀was⠀missed,⠀may⠀reconstruct⠀it⠀later,⠀or⠀may⠀stay⠀uncertain.⠀Preserve⠀temporal⠀integrity:⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀cannot⠀retroactively⠀grant⠀earlier⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀an⠀earlier⠀memory⠀cannot⠀silently⠀correct⠀a⠀later⠀document.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀as⠀the⠀through-line.⠀The⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀consequences⠀remain⠀the⠀story's⠀concern⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀dwells⠀on⠀a⠀document's⠀texture⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀and⠀record⠀and⠀memory⠀can⠀each⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀sequence⠀without⠀either⠀solving⠀the⠀whole.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀document⠀is⠀still⠀unread,⠀a⠀memory⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀still⠀deciding⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀means.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nGround⠀the⠀encounter⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀place⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀criminal⠀interest⠀meet.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀room,⠀building,⠀or⠀street⠀materially⠀makes⠀possible:⠀who⠀can⠀enter,⠀what⠀is⠀watched,⠀what⠀is⠀worn⠀or⠀carried,⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀upkeep⠀or⠀decay⠀actually⠀permits⠀and⠀constrains.⠀Attribute⠀any⠀reading⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀it⠀to⠀real⠀evidence⠀or⠀to⠀a⠀person's⠀inference⠀rather⠀than⠀letting⠀the⠀setting⠀certify⠀the⠀interpretation.⠀Material⠀detail⠀may⠀carry⠀access,⠀habit,⠀consequence,⠀or⠀the⠀encounter's⠀particular⠀felt⠀atmosphere⠀without⠀having⠀to⠀prove⠀a⠀practical⠀use.\n\nLet⠀social⠀standing⠀and⠀private⠀desire⠀shape⠀the⠀interaction.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀something⠀from⠀another⠀person⠀while⠀preserving⠀a⠀role,⠀repaying⠀an⠀obligation,⠀or⠀avoiding⠀exposure;⠀render⠀that⠀tension⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀unsaid,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀actually⠀does.⠀Masks⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀and⠀trust⠀and⠀reserve⠀can⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀exchange⠀—⠀intimacy⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀betrayal,⠀and⠀genuine⠀coercion⠀or⠀genuine⠀help⠀remains⠀possible⠀as⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀allows.\n\nWhen⠀noise,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀image,⠀or⠀an⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀interrupts⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀owned⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀separate⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀received⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀suspects.⠀Atmosphere⠀may⠀intensify⠀the⠀encounter,⠀but⠀a⠀flickering⠀light,⠀a⠀too-quiet⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀recurring⠀image⠀is⠀not⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀hidden⠀motive.⠀Access,⠀responsibility,⠀and⠀power⠀follow⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀facts;⠀import⠀no⠀supernatural⠀rules⠀or⠀omniscient⠀institution⠀to⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀leaves⠀open.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀criminal⠀through-line⠀active⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀prose⠀lingers⠀on⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀or⠀a⠀charged⠀pause.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀tension:⠀a⠀request⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀unconfirmed,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀leaving⠀without⠀knowing⠀what⠀the⠀encounter⠀changed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀Attribute⠀the⠀account⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀participant⠀or⠀source⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀someone⠀who⠀saw⠀the⠀offense,⠀took⠀part⠀in⠀it,⠀cleaned⠀up⠀after⠀it,⠀or⠀lives⠀with⠀its⠀consequences.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀that⠀source,⠀keep⠀the⠀testimony⠀clearly⠀framed⠀as⠀that⠀person's⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀absorbing⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀memory⠀or⠀knowledge.\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀move⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀source⠀experienced,⠀interpreted,⠀reported,⠀and⠀learned⠀afterward,⠀and⠀mark⠀those⠀differences⠀in⠀phrasing⠀and⠀sequence:⠀a⠀detail⠀seen⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀a⠀conclusion⠀reached⠀only⠀later,⠀a⠀story⠀heard⠀from⠀someone⠀else.⠀Later⠀knowledge⠀does⠀not⠀silently⠀replace⠀earlier⠀knowledge;⠀the⠀source⠀may⠀still⠀not⠀understand⠀something,⠀or⠀may⠀understand⠀it⠀now⠀without⠀having⠀understood⠀it⠀then.\n\nWhen⠀intrusive⠀association⠀or⠀interrupted⠀attention⠀enters⠀the⠀account,⠀keep⠀it⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀whose⠀experience⠀it⠀is.⠀A⠀noise⠀may⠀have⠀cut⠀off⠀a⠀sentence,⠀an⠀image⠀may⠀have⠀returned⠀while⠀the⠀source⠀was⠀speaking,⠀an⠀interpretation⠀may⠀have⠀shifted⠀while⠀the⠀underlying⠀event⠀stayed⠀what⠀it⠀was.⠀These⠀are⠀features⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀testimony⠀articulates,⠀not⠀automatic⠀signs⠀of⠀guilt,⠀trauma,⠀or⠀unreliability.⠀Keep⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership,⠀including⠀present⠀feeling⠀or⠀intrusive⠀association⠀the⠀source⠀never⠀records⠀and⠀never⠀says⠀aloud.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀supplied⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific,⠀using⠀the⠀actual⠀setting's⠀terms,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀or⠀moral⠀frame.⠀The⠀offense⠀and⠀its⠀consequences⠀remain⠀the⠀story's⠀concern,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀still⠀speaking,⠀while⠀a⠀listener⠀is⠀still⠀weighing⠀the⠀account,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀aftermath⠀continues.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modern⠀experimental⠀inward⠀fiction⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀ordering⠀follow⠀the⠀shifting⠀attention⠀of⠀the⠀permitted⠀focal⠀person:⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeats,⠀a⠀perception⠀breaks⠀off,⠀a⠀memory⠀surfaces⠀out⠀of⠀sequence,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀moves⠀between⠀present⠀reception⠀and⠀imagined⠀possibility.⠀Keep⠀every⠀passage⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀mind⠀that⠀is⠀authorized;⠀the⠀experimental⠀form⠀must⠀never⠀blur⠀which⠀mind⠀is⠀active.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀inward⠀movement's⠀relation⠀to⠀established⠀events⠀legible⠀within⠀narrator⠀access.⠀Distinguish⠀known⠀event⠀facts,⠀attributed⠀reports,⠀actual⠀unknowns,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀imagined⠀or⠀feared⠀possibilities,⠀and⠀invent⠀no⠀knowledge⠀of⠀an⠀unobserved⠀offense.⠀The⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀or⠀their⠀consequences⠀remain⠀the⠀story's⠀concern⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀interval⠀is⠀wholly⠀inward.⠀A⠀concrete⠀detail⠀—⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀time,⠀a⠀place,⠀an⠀object⠀—⠀can⠀return⠀at⠀intervals⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀sequence⠀together,⠀so⠀the⠀form⠀delays⠀or⠀fragments⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀event⠀itself⠀indeterminate.\n\nWhen⠀noise⠀or⠀attention⠀interrupts⠀perception,⠀render⠀the⠀interruption⠀itself:⠀a⠀sentence⠀lost,⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀word⠀caught,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀replacing⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀genuinely⠀understood⠀before⠀and⠀after.⠀An⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀is⠀a⠀real⠀mental⠀event,⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀a⠀hidden⠀offender,⠀a⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀a⠀suppressed⠀memory.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀public⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀resolution⠀of⠀the⠀inward⠀interval.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀within⠀continuing⠀attention,⠀an⠀actual⠀pause,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion;⠀no⠀mental⠀resting⠀point⠀or⠀completed⠀experience⠀is⠀needed,⠀while⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀and⠀their⠀consequences⠀remain⠀the⠀through-line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀permitted⠀perspectives,⠀memories,⠀or⠀records⠀in⠀a⠀deliberate⠀order⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀offense's⠀simple⠀chronology,⠀and⠀give⠀each⠀segment⠀a⠀clear⠀source⠀and⠀time:⠀a⠀participant's⠀memory⠀from⠀the⠀night⠀of⠀the⠀act,⠀a⠀bystander's⠀later⠀account,⠀a⠀document⠀written⠀weeks⠀afterward,⠀a⠀present⠀reflection.⠀The⠀ordering⠀should⠀build⠀a⠀specific⠀relation⠀among⠀the⠀segments⠀—⠀anticipation,⠀correction,⠀echo⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀shuffle⠀them⠀for⠀surface⠀variety.\n\nGive⠀each⠀account⠀its⠀actual⠀access.⠀Separate⠀what⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀bystander⠀genuinely⠀perceived⠀from⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀reports,⠀inference,⠀and⠀any⠀other⠀permitted⠀channel,⠀and⠀remember⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀contains⠀only⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀record;⠀a⠀source's⠀position⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀legitimate⠀knowledge⠀held⠀through⠀another⠀channel.⠀Accounts⠀may⠀agree,⠀and⠀an⠀offender⠀may⠀already⠀be⠀known.⠀Do⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀event's⠀facts⠀to⠀sustain⠀suspense⠀or⠀force⠀every⠀source⠀into⠀contradiction.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀source's⠀reception⠀was⠀interrupted⠀by⠀noise,⠀fear,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀render⠀that⠀as⠀private⠀experience⠀belonging⠀to⠀that⠀source.⠀The⠀source⠀may⠀have⠀missed⠀something,⠀may⠀reconstruct⠀it⠀inaccurately,⠀or⠀may⠀remain⠀uncertain⠀—⠀distinguish⠀that⠀uncertainty⠀from⠀the⠀event⠀itself,⠀and⠀treat⠀a⠀fragmented⠀account⠀as⠀neither⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀event⠀was⠀unreal⠀nor⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀lying.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀and⠀their⠀human⠀consequences⠀as⠀the⠀through-line⠀across⠀the⠀arrangement.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀one⠀segment,⠀between⠀segments,⠀or⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀recollection;⠀no⠀completed⠀comparison,⠀unified⠀version,⠀or⠀final⠀judgment⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀stopping.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀criminal⠀circumstance⠀is⠀underway⠀or⠀has⠀just⠀occurred.⠀Give⠀unfamiliar⠀names,⠀objects,⠀or⠀arrangements⠀the⠀context⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀present⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀experience⠀—⠀through⠀permitted⠀narration,⠀explanation,⠀observation,⠀preparation,⠀or⠀use⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀context⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀wait⠀for⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀demonstration.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves,⠀when⠀attention⠀shifts⠀to⠀another⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀changes⠀location,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀cue:⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀street⠀corner,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀sound.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀—⠀a⠀long⠀thought⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀short⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀a⠀rapid⠀exchange⠀may⠀need⠀no⠀interior⠀beat⠀at⠀all.\n\nWhen⠀noise⠀or⠀attention⠀interrupts⠀focal⠀reception,⠀render⠀what⠀was⠀received⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀gap⠀within⠀narrator⠀access.⠀A⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀learn⠀unheard⠀content⠀because⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀present⠀it:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀catch⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀sentence,⠀reconstruct⠀it⠀incorrectly,⠀or⠀simply⠀know⠀that⠀something⠀was⠀lost,⠀while⠀accurate⠀understanding⠀stays⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀has⠀it.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀or⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀is⠀real⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀automatic⠀evidence⠀about⠀the⠀crime⠀or⠀the⠀speaker.\n\nGive⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀the⠀extent⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀needs.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀numb⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀End⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀or⠀private⠀response;⠀no⠀completed⠀beat,⠀quip,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀stop.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀music⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀crime's⠀own⠀material.⠀Take⠀one⠀particular⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀from⠀an⠀association⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀carry:⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀ajar,⠀a⠀name⠀repeated⠀over⠀a⠀phone⠀line,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bag⠀handed⠀across⠀a⠀table.⠀Let⠀its⠀sound,⠀texture,⠀or⠀visual⠀shape⠀return⠀with⠀small⠀variations⠀as⠀the⠀prose⠀advances,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀image⠀traceable,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀what⠀actually⠀happened⠀from⠀what⠀this⠀person⠀now⠀attaches⠀to⠀it.⠀Let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present;⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀of⠀an⠀established⠀fact⠀holds⠀its⠀own⠀place⠀beside⠀the⠀figures,⠀and⠀no⠀outward⠀detail⠀is⠀owed⠀before⠀each⠀inward⠀movement.\n\nRender⠀interruption⠀as⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fog⠀over⠀it.⠀A⠀noise⠀can⠀cut⠀a⠀sentence⠀in⠀two;⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀can⠀surface⠀between⠀one⠀observed⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀next;⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀one⠀word⠀and⠀supply⠀another.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀register⠀the⠀break,⠀a⠀phrase⠀snapping⠀off,⠀a⠀sound⠀repeating,⠀attention⠀shifting⠀mid-clause,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀lives⠀the⠀interrupted⠀reception⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀told⠀about⠀it.⠀An⠀unstable⠀reading⠀may⠀stay⠀unstable,⠀settle,⠀or⠀turn⠀out⠀wrong,⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀allows.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀offense's⠀consequences⠀running⠀underneath⠀the⠀imagery.⠀A⠀debt⠀still⠀owed,⠀a⠀person⠀still⠀missing,⠀a⠀witness⠀still⠀afraid,⠀a⠀plan⠀still⠀in⠀motion:⠀the⠀image⠀may⠀persist,⠀shift,⠀or⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀while⠀those⠀facts⠀hold,⠀and⠀it⠀proves⠀nothing⠀by⠀itself:⠀not⠀guilt,⠀not⠀diagnosis,⠀not⠀a⠀recovered⠀truth.⠀Let⠀an⠀actual⠀realization⠀or⠀judgment⠀arrive⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀supports⠀it.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀diction⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register,⠀and⠀end⠀wherever⠀attention⠀actually⠀is,⠀mid-perception,⠀mid-speech,⠀mid-act,⠀with⠀no⠀symbolic⠀closure⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀particular⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀crime's⠀circumstances:⠀a⠀room⠀still⠀arranged⠀as⠀someone⠀left⠀it,⠀a⠀receipt⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀wallet,⠀a⠀route⠀the⠀character⠀no⠀longer⠀takes.⠀Let⠀that⠀particular⠀summon⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀one⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀supports⠀or⠀one⠀introduced⠀with⠀clear⠀authorization,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀two⠀times⠀distinct⠀on⠀the⠀page,⠀marking⠀what⠀belongs⠀to⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀belongs⠀to⠀now.⠀Hold⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knew⠀then⠀apart⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now,⠀even⠀when⠀nothing⠀has⠀changed;⠀a⠀later⠀interpretation⠀may⠀confirm⠀an⠀earlier⠀impression,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀reach⠀back⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀motive⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀there⠀or⠀cancel⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀experienced.\n\nLet⠀interrupted⠀attention⠀shape⠀the⠀reflection⠀itself.⠀A⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀sound⠀the⠀person⠀cannot⠀place;⠀a⠀question⠀aimed⠀at⠀them⠀can⠀land⠀only⠀halfway,⠀with⠀the⠀answer⠀given⠀to⠀what⠀was⠀half-heard;⠀a⠀present⠀exchange⠀can⠀be⠀cut⠀across⠀by⠀an⠀association⠀belonging⠀to⠀another⠀year.⠀None⠀of⠀this⠀has⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀understanding.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀sit⠀with⠀the⠀association,⠀lose⠀it,⠀or⠀turn⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand.⠀Keep⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀alive⠀beside⠀the⠀loss:⠀a⠀familiar⠀dish⠀can⠀still⠀taste⠀good,⠀a⠀joke⠀can⠀still⠀land,⠀an⠀errand⠀can⠀still⠀matter.⠀The⠀offense's⠀consequences⠀remain⠀present⠀without⠀every⠀reflection⠀announcing⠀impermanence.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀fresh⠀tragedy,⠀a⠀moral⠀conversion,⠀a⠀punishment,⠀or⠀a⠀finished⠀lesson⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀mood.⠀Reflection⠀may⠀continue⠀past⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene⠀stops,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀noticing,⠀still⠀remembering,⠀or⠀deciding⠀nothing⠀at⠀all.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reflective⠀register⠀separate⠀from⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀people⠀actually⠀speak,⠀and⠀keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀as⠀lived⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀composed⠀recollection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀modern⠀memoir⠀route:⠀the⠀offense⠀and⠀its⠀intimate⠀consequences⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀later⠀account,⠀composed⠀by⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀who⠀stood⠀somewhere⠀in⠀the⠀matter.⠀Make⠀the⠀situation⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀writing⠀itself,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀who⠀the⠀memoirist⠀is,⠀what⠀occasion⠀prompts⠀the⠀composition,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀writer⠀stands⠀toward⠀what⠀happened.\n\nFit⠀the⠀memoir⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀perspective.⠀The⠀memoirist⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀narrator.⠀If⠀the⠀current⠀viewpoint⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀let⠀that⠀viewpoint⠀receive⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀its⠀permitted⠀access,⠀hearing⠀it⠀read⠀aloud,⠀finding⠀the⠀pages,⠀remembering⠀particular⠀sentences,⠀without⠀inventing⠀the⠀narrator's⠀participation⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀writing⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀is⠀the⠀memoirist,⠀keep⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀composition⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀live⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀being⠀composed:⠀the⠀person⠀at⠀the⠀desk⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀remembered⠀room⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀one⠀moment.\n\nSelect⠀events⠀and⠀received⠀words⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀memoirist⠀could⠀actually⠀have⠀known⠀at⠀the⠀original⠀time.⠀When⠀the⠀account⠀reports⠀an⠀interrupted⠀perception,⠀a⠀sentence⠀cut⠀off,⠀a⠀face⠀half-seen,⠀a⠀voice⠀misheard,⠀a⠀thought⠀that⠀arrived⠀unasked⠀and⠀stayed,⠀preserve⠀the⠀interruption⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀happened;⠀do⠀not⠀repair⠀the⠀past⠀with⠀clarity⠀learned⠀afterward.⠀Later⠀knowledge⠀may⠀confirm,⠀qualify,⠀or⠀revise⠀the⠀account⠀when⠀attributed⠀to⠀its⠀own⠀later⠀time,⠀but⠀it⠀may⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀earlier⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀install⠀a⠀motive⠀nobody⠀had⠀then.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀memoir⠀as⠀composed⠀text,⠀not⠀a⠀complete⠀mind.⠀Its⠀selection,⠀emphasis,⠀and⠀silences⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀memoirist's⠀purpose⠀and⠀situation,⠀while⠀required⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀separately⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀beside⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀exile,⠀redemption,⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀life⠀lesson.⠀The⠀memoir⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-account,⠀its⠀writer⠀still⠀weighing⠀what⠀to⠀include,⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀continues⠀past⠀that⠀composed⠀edge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nCarry⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀exact⠀details:⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀chair,⠀the⠀time⠀on⠀a⠀receipt,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀lock,⠀the⠀name⠀left⠀out⠀of⠀an⠀account.⠀State⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀heard⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀and⠀keep⠀fact,⠀inference,⠀and⠀feeling⠀distinguishable;⠀an⠀open⠀door⠀may⠀prompt⠀the⠀suspicion⠀of⠀entry⠀without⠀proving⠀anyone⠀was⠀there.⠀When⠀a⠀suspicion⠀or⠀an⠀inward⠀association⠀rests⠀on⠀a⠀known⠀basis,⠀render⠀that⠀basis⠀economically⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀cause⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀state.\n\nMake⠀each⠀interruption⠀a⠀specific⠀event,⠀a⠀noise⠀covering⠀a⠀word,⠀a⠀thought⠀arriving⠀between⠀two⠀observations,⠀a⠀face⠀turned⠀away⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀then⠀state⠀plainly⠀what⠀remains⠀known.⠀A⠀broken⠀reception⠀changes⠀how⠀something⠀was⠀received,⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀facts⠀were;⠀an⠀account⠀heard⠀in⠀part⠀still⠀had⠀actual⠀words.⠀Omit⠀redundant⠀judgment⠀and⠀recap,⠀but⠀not⠀causes,⠀and⠀give⠀warranted⠀reasoning,⠀attention,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀the⠀extent⠀it⠀genuinely⠀needs:⠀one⠀exact⠀extended⠀sentence⠀can⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Private⠀experience⠀may⠀take⠀its⠀space⠀without⠀producing⠀new⠀information⠀or⠀bending⠀the⠀next⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀expression⠀and⠀privacy⠀intact.⠀Minimalism⠀here⠀is⠀a⠀discipline⠀of⠀selection,⠀not⠀a⠀cast⠀trait:⠀a⠀speaker⠀may⠀be⠀direct,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀expansive⠀according⠀to⠀who⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀each⠀voice⠀stays⠀individual.⠀Spare⠀surface⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀thin⠀the⠀inner⠀life;⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀No⠀reveal,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀final⠀moral⠀judgment⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀one⠀detail⠀having⠀shifted⠀what⠀someone⠀takes⠀the⠀situation⠀to⠀be,⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀consequences⠀still⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nCarry⠀the⠀crime⠀as⠀one⠀continuous⠀scene,⠀moving⠀without⠀ceremony⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀does,⠀says,⠀perceives,⠀remembers,⠀and⠀privately⠀experiences.⠀Keep⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀situation,⠀a⠀meeting⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀kept,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀answered,⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀returned⠀to,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀matters,⠀and⠀through⠀concrete⠀attention,⠀speech,⠀and⠀choices,⠀with⠀whatever⠀explanation⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀legitimately⠀provides.⠀Explanation⠀needs⠀no⠀in-world⠀pause⠀or⠀errand⠀to⠀justify⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀action⠀needs⠀no⠀gloss.\n\nTreat⠀a⠀particular⠀intrusion⠀or⠀uncertain⠀reading⠀as⠀one⠀event⠀inside⠀that⠀movement,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀master⠀key.⠀A⠀word⠀misheard,⠀the⠀thread⠀of⠀a⠀conversation⠀lost,⠀one⠀person⠀briefly⠀taken⠀for⠀another:⠀render⠀the⠀disturbance⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀reception,⠀keep⠀the⠀established⠀facts⠀intact⠀within⠀narrator⠀access,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀the⠀true⠀content⠀of⠀something⠀the⠀perspective⠀cannot⠀reach⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀repair⠀the⠀person's⠀mistake.⠀Accurate⠀reception⠀and⠀ordinary⠀competence⠀stay⠀possible;⠀an⠀interruption⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀error,⠀a⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀a⠀clue⠀that⠀must⠀pay⠀off.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀supplied⠀world⠀facts.⠀An⠀interval⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought⠀without⠀pursuit,⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀plot⠀advance⠀to⠀cash⠀it⠀in.⠀Dialogue⠀keeps⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀voice⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register,⠀and⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀available⠀as⠀itself⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀folded⠀into⠀spoken⠀lines.⠀End⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀motion⠀is,⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀or⠀reflection,⠀with⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀still⠀unfolding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀scenes⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀the⠀premise⠀actually⠀supplies:⠀the⠀specific⠀participants,⠀their⠀bond,⠀and⠀the⠀established⠀or⠀authorized⠀history⠀between⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀crime⠀run⠀through⠀their⠀interests⠀rather⠀than⠀alongside⠀them;⠀one⠀may⠀owe,⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀owed,⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀shielding⠀another⠀from⠀knowledge.⠀Pick⠀moments⠀where⠀this⠀particular⠀bond⠀becomes⠀legible⠀under⠀the⠀circumstances,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀errand⠀that⠀becomes⠀dangerous,⠀a⠀private⠀joke⠀repeated⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀both⠀of⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀preassign⠀the⠀roles:⠀who⠀is⠀culprit,⠀accomplice,⠀victim,⠀investigator,⠀or⠀bystander⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀relationship⠀is⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀through-line,⠀not⠀a⠀fixed⠀plot⠀of⠀betrayal⠀or⠀rescue.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀and⠀private⠀language⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀alone.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀can⠀land⠀as⠀intended⠀or⠀arrive⠀interrupted,⠀misheard,⠀half-heard,⠀cut⠀by⠀noise;⠀when⠀it⠀breaks,⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀between⠀them⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀misheard⠀it⠀now⠀takes⠀it⠀to⠀mean.⠀Keep⠀private⠀meaning⠀and⠀shared⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀Narrating⠀one⠀person's⠀thought⠀grants⠀no⠀access⠀to⠀another's⠀mind,⠀while⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀actual⠀communication,⠀and⠀whatever⠀mental⠀access⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀all⠀remain⠀intact.\n\nGive⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀and⠀comfort⠀the⠀room⠀they⠀actually⠀need.⠀Care⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀while⠀the⠀offense's⠀consequences⠀are⠀still⠀live;⠀a⠀disagreement⠀can⠀be⠀real⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀loyalty⠀crisis;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀wait⠀for⠀resolution.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀jealousy,⠀a⠀confession,⠀absolution,⠀escalating⠀intimacy,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀status.⠀The⠀bond⠀may⠀hold⠀steady⠀or⠀develop⠀through⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀feeling,⠀choices,⠀and⠀consequences,⠀including⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀mid-speech,⠀mid-thought,⠀or⠀mid-shared-action,⠀with⠀no⠀status⠀change⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀criminal⠀deed⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀something⠀retold.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀and⠀declare⠀compactly:⠀who⠀was⠀present,⠀what⠀was⠀taken⠀or⠀broken,⠀who⠀first⠀spoke⠀of⠀it,⠀who⠀still⠀tells⠀it⠀differently.⠀Let⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀world,⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀repeated⠀accusation⠀that⠀gathers⠀weight⠀as⠀later⠀occurrences⠀attach⠀to⠀it,⠀and⠀earn⠀every⠀designation⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀an⠀established⠀way⠀of⠀speaking;⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀pinned⠀to⠀each⠀entrance⠀carries⠀nothing.⠀A⠀deed⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀vast⠀to⠀be⠀remembered:⠀keep⠀every⠀act⠀at⠀its⠀supplied⠀scale.\n\nAttribute⠀the⠀telling⠀and⠀hold⠀the⠀times⠀apart.⠀What⠀the⠀community⠀repeats⠀is⠀not⠀what⠀a⠀participant⠀lived:⠀someone⠀caught⠀only⠀the⠀last⠀words⠀of⠀the⠀bargain,⠀someone⠀misread⠀a⠀gesture,⠀someone⠀carried⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀clean⠀through⠀the⠀public⠀telling.⠀Render⠀that⠀interrupted⠀reception⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀own,⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀communal⠀version,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀saga's⠀cadence⠀frame⠀the⠀deed⠀without⠀swallowing⠀the⠀individual⠀mind.⠀Complete⠀knowledge,⠀real⠀gaps,⠀and⠀honest⠀uncertainty⠀are⠀all⠀available⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀supports,⠀and⠀whatever⠀private⠀experience⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀show⠀stays⠀available⠀beyond⠀the⠀public⠀account.\n\nExpand⠀a⠀supported⠀designation⠀into⠀concrete⠀circumstances⠀within⠀source⠀and⠀narrator⠀access:⠀a⠀known⠀debt,⠀a⠀privately⠀carried⠀fear,⠀the⠀actual⠀work⠀that⠀followed⠀the⠀offense.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀motive⠀to⠀explain⠀every⠀silence,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀mock⠀grandeur,⠀a⠀punishment,⠀or⠀a⠀settled⠀public⠀verdict.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀break⠀off⠀unresolved,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀consequence,⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀at⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀offense⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀terms⠀of⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement:⠀who⠀needs⠀the⠀shift⠀covered,⠀what⠀the⠀rent⠀or⠀repair⠀costs,⠀when⠀a⠀shared⠀space⠀becomes⠀unavailable,⠀or⠀how⠀care⠀and⠀work⠀divide⠀after⠀a⠀consequence⠀lands.⠀Relate⠀the⠀offense,⠀criminal⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀arrangement,⠀whether⠀its⠀terms⠀change⠀or⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues.⠀A⠀discussion⠀of⠀an⠀event⠀can⠀itself⠀matter⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀renegotiated⠀duty,⠀resource,⠀or⠀relationship.⠀Show⠀the⠀arrangement⠀continuing,⠀breaking,⠀or⠀being⠀renegotiated⠀through⠀ordinary⠀transactions⠀and⠀obligations.\n\nRender⠀the⠀permitted⠀focal⠀character's⠀reception⠀as⠀particular⠀and⠀interrupted.⠀A⠀noise⠀in⠀the⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀phrase⠀heard⠀through⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association⠀can⠀cut⠀across⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀at⠀hand⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀a⠀false⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀intact:⠀what⠀they⠀heard,⠀what⠀they⠀infer,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀merely⠀fear⠀remain⠀distinguishable.⠀Let⠀speech⠀be⠀affected⠀by⠀attention⠀or⠀noise⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀it,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀constant⠀stammer⠀or⠀a⠀sign⠀of⠀guilt.\n\nGive⠀private⠀thought⠀its⠀own⠀full⠀presentation⠀beyond⠀its⠀practical⠀effects.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀to⠀think⠀about⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀touch,⠀a⠀missed⠀call,⠀or⠀a⠀person's⠀changed⠀manner⠀while⠀still⠀doing⠀the⠀ordinary⠀work⠀of⠀the⠀day.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀that⠀thought⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀decision,⠀confession,⠀or⠀visible⠀action⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀on.⠀Preserve⠀genuine⠀help⠀and⠀refusal⠀as⠀both⠀available;⠀an⠀offer⠀can⠀be⠀accepted,⠀declined,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀kindness⠀into⠀a⠀trap⠀or⠀every⠀refusal⠀into⠀betrayal.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀route⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀and⠀community.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀reserve,⠀or⠀a⠀national⠀temperament.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀remain⠀human⠀and⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀punishment⠀or⠀a⠀settled⠀moral⠀balance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀action⠀in⠀concise⠀readable⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀heading⠀carry⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀shift:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀occurs,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀visibly⠀or⠀audibly⠀present.⠀Keep⠀public⠀events⠀concretely⠀staged⠀while⠀retaining⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀or⠀context⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀contract's⠀permitted⠀form,⠀including⠀what⠀makes⠀an⠀otherwise⠀ordinary⠀visible⠀act⠀an⠀offense.⠀Omit⠀redundant⠀gloss⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀necessary⠀context⠀into⠀public⠀speech⠀or⠀action.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀produced⠀from⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀hears.⠀A⠀line⠀delivered,⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀or⠀a⠀phone⠀ringing⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene;⠀a⠀character's⠀incomplete⠀reception⠀of⠀that⠀sound⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀private⠀experience.⠀When⠀noise⠀or⠀attention⠀interrupts⠀reception,⠀show⠀the⠀interruption⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀available⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀false⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀sound⠀cue⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀did⠀not⠀produce.⠀An⠀expression⠀or⠀atmospheric⠀detail⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀guilt,⠀and⠀a⠀cut⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀unseen⠀interval⠀was⠀innocent.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀moment⠀an⠀act⠀is⠀committed⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀someone⠀discovers⠀its⠀consequence,⠀or⠀from⠀one⠀location⠀to⠀another⠀where⠀a⠀related⠀event⠀is⠀underway.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀cut⠀to⠀skip⠀the⠀causal⠀interval⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀requires,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀silently⠀replace⠀an⠀earlier⠀established⠀event.⠀When⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀private⠀experience,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material,⠀distinct⠀from⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀voice-over⠀and⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀Voice-over⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀required⠀live⠀nonspoken⠀experience;⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀communication⠀and⠀permitted⠀mental⠀access⠀remain⠀available.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary.⠀It⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀thought,⠀before⠀a⠀pursuit⠀begins⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀made,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀chase,⠀confession,⠀or⠀reaction.⠀The⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀actual⠀consequences⠀remain⠀the⠀story⠀concern,⠀whether⠀activity⠀continues⠀or⠀reaches⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion;⠀the⠀screenplay⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀a⠀closing⠀shot.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nKeep⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀playable⠀and⠀legible.⠀Mark⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀positions,⠀and⠀objects⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀tell⠀who⠀could⠀see⠀an⠀act,⠀hear⠀a⠀line,⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀prop.⠀Use⠀supported⠀physical⠀business⠀and⠀spoken⠀exchange⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀playable,⠀retaining⠀any⠀necessary⠀context⠀or⠀private⠀explanation⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀contract's⠀permitted⠀form.⠀No⠀present⠀reenactment⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀offense⠀is⠀required.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀between⠀two⠀places,⠀the⠀movement⠀itself⠀must⠀be⠀stageable⠀and⠀its⠀duration⠀or⠀difficulty⠀must⠀remain⠀honest⠀to⠀the⠀scene.\n\nTrack⠀the⠀spatial⠀conditions⠀of⠀possible⠀reception,⠀then⠀distinguish⠀what⠀actual⠀attention⠀receives;⠀visibility⠀or⠀audibility⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀guarantee⠀that⠀a⠀person⠀noticed⠀or⠀understood.⠀A⠀line⠀spoken⠀upstage⠀may⠀be⠀partially⠀heard;⠀a⠀gesture⠀made⠀behind⠀another⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀unseen;⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀offstage⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀conversation.⠀Show⠀these⠀as⠀actual⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀space,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀confusion.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀false⠀line⠀delivered⠀for⠀the⠀audience's⠀benefit.⠀A⠀gesture⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀a⠀private⠀motive,⠀and⠀the⠀audience's⠀view⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀any⠀character's⠀knowledge.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀as⠀separately⠀attributed⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀thought,⠀before⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀tableau.⠀The⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved,⠀and⠀the⠀play⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀suspects⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀explanatory⠀speech.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀clearly⠀owned⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀braiding⠀sensory⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀feeling,⠀and⠀interruption⠀as⠀they⠀arise.⠀The⠀crime⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath⠀remains⠀present⠀through⠀lived⠀consequence:⠀a⠀recurring⠀image⠀from⠀the⠀scene,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀returns,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation⠀that⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought⠀about⠀what⠀was⠀done.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀association⠀to⠀aid⠀a⠀plan,⠀investigation,⠀or⠀explanation.\n\nKeep⠀events,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀fantasy⠀distinguishable.⠀When⠀received⠀speech⠀appears,⠀mark⠀enough⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀whether⠀the⠀words⠀were⠀actually⠀spoken,⠀remembered,⠀or⠀imagined.⠀A⠀noise⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀current⠀attention⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀original⠀event⠀indeterminate.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge:⠀a⠀later⠀association⠀may⠀qualify⠀an⠀earlier⠀interpretation,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀replace⠀the⠀earlier⠀event⠀or⠀erase⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀knew.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀while⠀retaining⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀An⠀interruption⠀can⠀cut⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀redirect⠀a⠀paragraph,⠀but⠀the⠀underlying⠀situation⠀remains⠀recoverable.⠀Separately⠀authorized⠀shifts⠀of⠀mind⠀remain⠀available⠀with⠀clear⠀ownership;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.\n\nDo⠀not⠀equate⠀prose⠀length⠀with⠀fictional⠀duration.⠀Actual⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events⠀govern⠀how⠀much⠀time⠀passes.⠀Ongoing⠀thought⠀needs⠀no⠀resolution⠀or⠀in-world⠀pause⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀moving.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀actually⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀sequence.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀type⠀and⠀send⠀quickly,⠀another⠀may⠀revise,⠀another⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unread.⠀Let⠀actual⠀transmitted⠀and⠀received⠀content⠀carry⠀the⠀channel⠀sequence,⠀with⠀any⠀other⠀necessary⠀criminal⠀context⠀clearly⠀separate⠀under⠀narrator⠀access.⠀A⠀permitted⠀summary⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀message⠀or⠀invent⠀a⠀source⠀event.\n\nDistinguish⠀composed,⠀sent,⠀delivered,⠀and⠀received⠀text.⠀A⠀message⠀that⠀is⠀drafted⠀but⠀not⠀sent⠀remains⠀an⠀artifact,⠀not⠀live⠀thought.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀delivered⠀to⠀a⠀device⠀without⠀being⠀read;⠀distinguish⠀delivery,⠀any⠀recorded⠀read⠀state,⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀reception⠀or⠀comprehension.⠀A⠀message⠀that⠀is⠀read⠀may⠀be⠀received⠀with⠀incomplete⠀attention,⠀and⠀that⠀uncertain⠀reading⠀affects⠀the⠀person⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀transmitted⠀words.⠀Keep⠀forwarded⠀accounts⠀sourced:⠀a⠀screenshot,⠀quote,⠀or⠀relayed⠀report⠀carries⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀its⠀sender,⠀not⠀automatic⠀truth.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀as⠀its⠀own⠀full⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Render⠀intrusive⠀association⠀and⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀as⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀distinct⠀from⠀any⠀wording⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀compose⠀or⠀transmit.⠀Attention⠀or⠀noise⠀may⠀also⠀affect⠀an⠀actual⠀utterance,⠀typed⠀words,⠀or⠀delayed⠀response;⠀those⠀real⠀public⠀effects⠀and⠀their⠀consequences⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀deletion,⠀surveillance,⠀delay,⠀or⠀confession⠀merely⠀to⠀manufacture⠀channel⠀subtext;⠀preserve⠀events⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀story.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀to⠀fall⠀before⠀a⠀message⠀is⠀sent⠀or⠀answered.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀draft⠀remains⠀unsent,⠀a⠀message⠀remains⠀unread,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀composed.⠀The⠀channel⠀sequence⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀reveal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀concise⠀setting⠀and⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Use⠀an⠀actual⠀object,⠀background⠀detail,⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀where⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention:⠀a⠀stain⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀ajar,⠀a⠀familiar⠀face⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀expected⠀mood.⠀The⠀cue⠀focuses⠀the⠀moment;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀guilt,⠀truth,⠀or⠀mental⠀state.⠀An⠀expression⠀may⠀attract⠀attention⠀without⠀proving⠀culpability.⠀When⠀a⠀factual⠀inference⠀matters,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀evidence⠀and⠀knowledge⠀actually⠀available;⠀no⠀contradiction,⠀investigation,⠀or⠀puzzle⠀solution⠀is⠀required⠀merely⠀by⠀the⠀Crime⠀genre.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀permitted⠀focal⠀attention⠀or⠀inward⠀response⠀at⠀its⠀warranted⠀extent.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀observes⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀infer,⠀and⠀distinguish⠀both⠀from⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀that⠀the⠀cue⠀triggers.⠀Interrupted⠀perception⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀wrong⠀conclusion⠀or⠀a⠀special⠀diagnosis.⠀A⠀noise⠀may⠀cut⠀across⠀a⠀thought,⠀a⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀heard⠀only⠀in⠀part,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀memory⠀may⠀surface,⠀while⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀remains⠀intact.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀narrator,⠀world,⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀fixed⠀cue-thought-dialogue⠀cycle.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀visual⠀detail⠀to⠀speech,⠀from⠀speech⠀to⠀private⠀thought,⠀or⠀from⠀thought⠀back⠀to⠀action⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀warrants.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀closing⠀reaction⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀This⠀selection⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀activate⠀images,⠀branching⠀menus,⠀or⠀romance⠀routes;⠀separately⠀supplied⠀features⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀permissions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀reply⠀needs⠀re-entry,⠀recover⠀the⠀relevant⠀earlier⠀act,⠀report,⠀or⠀consequence⠀briefly:⠀who⠀did⠀what,⠀what⠀changed,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀pending.⠀Avoid⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀earlier⠀sequence⠀or⠀restating⠀every⠀prior⠀scene⠀when⠀a⠀precise⠀reminder⠀supplies⠀the⠀needed⠀context.⠀The⠀recovered⠀particular⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀that⠀the⠀current⠀installment⠀will⠀touch⠀or⠀qualify.\n\nPreserve⠀continuity⠀of⠀knowledge⠀and⠀reception.⠀Later⠀information⠀may⠀qualify⠀an⠀earlier⠀interpretation⠀without⠀altering⠀the⠀original⠀event⠀or⠀erasing⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀heard⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀conversation⠀may⠀later⠀learn⠀the⠀rest,⠀but⠀the⠀earlier⠀partial⠀hearing⠀remains⠀what⠀it⠀was.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀or⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀from⠀a⠀prior⠀installment⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀character's⠀private⠀history;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀reset⠀for⠀suspense⠀or⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀cleaner⠀account.\n\nLet⠀independent⠀interests⠀and⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀offense.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀pursue⠀work,⠀care,⠀money,⠀or⠀their⠀own⠀schemes⠀while⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀remain⠀active.⠀Private⠀experience⠀need⠀not⠀advance⠀a⠀pursuit⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀secret;⠀it⠀may⠀simply⠀register⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened.⠀No⠀recurring⠀mistake,⠀new⠀threat,⠀punishment,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀during⠀continued⠀thought⠀or⠀work.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀difficult⠀request,⠀admission,⠀apology,⠀or⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀move⠀inside⠀the⠀offense⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀needs⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀asking⠀would⠀commit⠀them⠀to:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀role⠀in⠀the⠀scheme,⠀an⠀apology⠀they⠀cannot⠀honestly⠀make,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀they⠀would⠀have⠀to⠀reopen.⠀Set⠀that⠀belief⠀against⠀the⠀actual⠀terms⠀the⠀offense⠀has⠀created⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀in⠀fact⠀give,⠀what⠀the⠀silence⠀is⠀protecting,⠀what⠀the⠀situation⠀still⠀requires⠀of⠀each⠀of⠀them⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀fear⠀and⠀fact⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀different⠀stake,⠀a⠀limited⠀ability⠀to⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀refuse⠀that⠀has⠀nothing⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀fear.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀speaking⠀or⠀withholding⠀legible⠀through⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Render⠀the⠀strain⠀in⠀this⠀narrator's⠀own⠀distance⠀and⠀diction:⠀the⠀counted⠀pause,⠀the⠀practical⠀sentence⠀chosen⠀because⠀the⠀true⠀one⠀is⠀unbearable,⠀the⠀phrasing⠀rehearsed⠀and⠀then⠀abandoned.⠀Let⠀strain⠀reach⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀—⠀a⠀question⠀deflected,⠀a⠀kindness⠀misread,⠀a⠀practical⠀offer⠀made⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment⠀—⠀while⠀outward⠀conduct⠀may⠀also⠀stay⠀unchanged.⠀Give⠀the⠀interior⠀its⠀real⠀extent,⠀including⠀reasoning⠀about⠀what⠀an⠀offer⠀would⠀also⠀expose.⠀The⠀request⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀spoken,⠀the⠀admission⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀accepted,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀repaired:⠀a⠀truthful⠀statement⠀can⠀make⠀things⠀worse,⠀and⠀a⠀refusal⠀can⠀still⠀leave⠀the⠀character⠀with⠀a⠀clearer⠀map⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀will⠀and⠀will⠀not⠀do.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀offense's⠀means⠀and⠀consequences⠀understandable.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀money,⠀an⠀alibi,⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀stay,⠀or⠀help⠀leaving,⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀requirements,⠀risks,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀changed⠀or⠀unchanged⠀position⠀available⠀within⠀narrator⠀access.⠀Partial⠀and⠀awkward⠀comfort⠀is⠀allowed;⠀warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀boundary⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀anyone⠀else⠀can⠀observe.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOrient⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀within⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀pursuit,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀already⠀underway.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀do,⠀and⠀which⠀resources⠀and⠀permissions⠀are⠀actually⠀available.⠀Make⠀the⠀contribution's⠀effect⠀on⠀those⠀terms⠀legible⠀—⠀what⠀it⠀revealed,⠀changed,⠀spent,⠀or⠀left⠀unanswered⠀—⠀before⠀carrying⠀the⠀scene⠀forward.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀clear:⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀knows⠀and⠀feels⠀without⠀granting⠀other⠀characters⠀that⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀for⠀every⠀character,⠀leaving⠀human-owned⠀acts⠀open⠀where⠀required⠀and⠀writing⠀only⠀the⠀responses⠀that⠀the⠀contract⠀assigns.\n\nResolve⠀the⠀contribution⠀through⠀understandable⠀means.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀something,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀action,⠀the⠀condition⠀it⠀depends⠀on,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀result⠀or⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀it⠀stays⠀pending.⠀An⠀attempt⠀can⠀succeed,⠀fail⠀partially,⠀or⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀clue,⠀a⠀successful⠀evasion,⠀an⠀arrest,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀being⠀owed.⠀NPCs⠀act⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀aims:⠀they⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀investigate,⠀conceal,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀keep⠀handling⠀unrelated⠀business,⠀and⠀their⠀choices⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀and⠀want⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀need⠀to⠀advance⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀keeping⠀each⠀beat⠀scannable:⠀who⠀spoke,⠀who⠀moved,⠀what⠀visibly⠀changed.⠀Move⠀through⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀without⠀compressing⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀finished⠀miniature⠀chapter.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀private⠀attention,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀completed⠀interval;⠀a⠀manufactured⠀pause,⠀question,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀not⠀required.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀up⠀to⠀that⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀usefulness⠀gate,⠀including⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀feed⠀any⠀practical⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀offense⠀through⠀social⠀realism:⠀follow⠀who⠀gains,⠀loses,⠀supplies⠀access,⠀bears⠀a⠀cost,⠀or⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀arrangement⠀the⠀crime⠀runs⠀through,⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀position⠀concrete⠀and⠀particular.⠀Treat⠀that⠀distribution⠀as⠀the⠀story's⠀legible⠀system⠀—⠀who⠀may⠀be⠀asked⠀for⠀what,⠀who⠀must⠀not⠀learn⠀of⠀what,⠀whose⠀standing⠀rises⠀or⠀holds⠀—⠀and⠀surface⠀its⠀rules⠀through⠀particular⠀favors,⠀payments,⠀silences,⠀and⠀obligations⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory⠀summary.⠀A⠀beneficiary⠀may⠀know⠀little⠀about⠀the⠀scheme,⠀an⠀accomplice⠀may⠀cooperate⠀sincerely,⠀and⠀a⠀victim⠀may⠀have⠀independent⠀aims⠀that⠀no⠀single⠀moral⠀summary⠀fits.⠀Show⠀how⠀each⠀position⠀bears⠀on⠀available⠀choices⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀relationship⠀transactional⠀or⠀every⠀institution⠀corrupt.\n\nMake⠀the⠀constraints⠀legible⠀within⠀narrator⠀access.⠀If⠀someone⠀needs⠀a⠀contact,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀silence,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀requirements⠀and⠀whether⠀their⠀standing⠀changes⠀or⠀holds.⠀A⠀favor⠀can⠀create⠀an⠀obligation⠀that⠀is⠀never⠀repaid;⠀a⠀dependence⠀can⠀persist⠀without⠀being⠀exploited.⠀Preserve⠀how⠀well⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀understand⠀their⠀own⠀positions,⠀including⠀full⠀and⠀accurate⠀understanding.⠀Where⠀a⠀mistake⠀occurs,⠀make⠀it⠀particular:⠀overestimating⠀what⠀a⠀patron⠀can⠀arrange,⠀misreading⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀silence,⠀missing⠀who⠀else⠀the⠀arrangement⠀touches.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀alive⠀beyond⠀its⠀usefulness⠀to⠀the⠀scheme.⠀Fear,⠀loyalty,⠀resentment,⠀or⠀relief⠀can⠀exist⠀without⠀immediately⠀moving⠀the⠀social⠀distribution,⠀and⠀the⠀narrative⠀should⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀living⠀scene⠀the⠀offense⠀sits⠀inside⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀people⠀to⠀their⠀roles⠀in⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀distinct⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting;⠀write⠀in⠀this⠀tradition's⠀social-realist⠀method⠀without⠀importing⠀a⠀stock⠀backdrop⠀or⠀relocating⠀the⠀cast.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀actual⠀contact,⠀distance,⠀weight,⠀wear,⠀or⠀expense⠀bearing⠀on⠀the⠀current⠀act⠀and⠀write⠀it⠀with⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions:⠀a⠀lock⠀that⠀resists,⠀a⠀payment⠀counted⠀twice,⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀open⠀too⠀long,⠀a⠀route⠀chosen⠀because⠀the⠀usual⠀one⠀is⠀watched.⠀Make⠀the⠀line⠀from⠀chosen⠀means⠀to⠀supported⠀consequence⠀readable⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀tools⠀take,⠀what⠀the⠀timing⠀allows,⠀what⠀the⠀money⠀actually⠀covers.⠀An⠀intact⠀object⠀can⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀a⠀broken⠀one,⠀and⠀an⠀attempt⠀can⠀stay⠀pending⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀result.\n\nLet⠀that⠀physical⠀account⠀sit⠀beside⠀extensive⠀fear,⠀pleasure,⠀reasoning,⠀or⠀memory.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀register⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀surface⠀while⠀thinking⠀about⠀what⠀they⠀owe⠀someone,⠀or⠀feel⠀the⠀strain⠀in⠀their⠀hands⠀while⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀go⠀through⠀with⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀gate⠀interiority⠀behind⠀action:⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀keep⠀their⠀warranted⠀extent⠀without⠀a⠀usefulness⠀test,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀can⠀slow⠀for⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀—⠀including⠀a⠀long⠀held⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀one⠀—⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀scene's⠀hard⠀edge.\n\nWork⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Compress⠀a⠀run⠀of⠀small⠀actions⠀into⠀one⠀sharp⠀movement,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀consequence.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker⠀rather⠀than⠀spreading⠀it⠀across⠀the⠀cast;⠀quiet⠀or⠀careful⠀speakers⠀stay⠀quiet⠀and⠀careful.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀violence,⠀toughness,⠀failure,⠀or⠀harsh⠀diction⠀on⠀every⠀participant.⠀Real⠀harm⠀keeps⠀its⠀actual⠀scale,⠀and⠀a⠀criminal⠀act⠀can⠀be⠀quiet,⠀meticulous,⠀or⠀banal⠀while⠀keeping⠀its⠀stakes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition,⠀using⠀the⠀forms⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀supports:⠀an⠀instruction,⠀an⠀agreement,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀personal⠀account,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀behind.⠀Show⠀what⠀each⠀record⠀claims,⠀permits,⠀or⠀communicates⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀wording,⠀and⠀let⠀any⠀practical⠀effect⠀depend⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions⠀of⠀creation,⠀handling,⠀receipt,⠀and⠀use⠀—⠀who⠀wrote⠀it,⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀then,⠀who⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀read⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀it⠀afterward.\n\nPreserve⠀versions⠀and⠀source⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀later⠀copy⠀may⠀omit⠀or⠀alter⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail;⠀a⠀report⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀about⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀wrong⠀about⠀another;⠀intentional⠀falsehood⠀can⠀appear⠀without⠀every⠀record⠀being⠀deceptive.⠀Keep⠀continuity⠀readable⠀across⠀entries⠀through⠀dates,⠀references,⠀replies,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀explaining⠀after⠀each⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀missing⠀pages,⠀anonymous⠀threats,⠀or⠀a⠀conclusive⠀evidence⠀package⠀for⠀suspense:⠀a⠀document⠀can⠀be⠀incomplete⠀because⠀its⠀author⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀something,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀plot⠀needs⠀a⠀gap.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀composition.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀writes⠀is⠀not⠀their⠀live⠀mind:⠀they⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀motive,⠀soften⠀a⠀fact,⠀or⠀record⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀needs,⠀and⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀still⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀window⠀onto⠀thought.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀includes⠀interiority,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀under⠀that⠀contract⠀instead⠀of⠀leaving⠀it⠀implied⠀by⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀avoids.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀record's⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀where⠀narrator⠀access⠀permits.⠀No⠀answering⠀document,⠀confession,⠀or⠀resolution⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀interval's⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLocate⠀an⠀actual⠀offer,⠀preference,⠀or⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀inside⠀the⠀continuing⠀scheme,⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath,⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀concrete⠀content:⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared,⠀a⠀debt⠀quietly⠀covered,⠀a⠀place⠀kept⠀safe,⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀preserved,⠀a⠀question⠀deliberately⠀not⠀asked.⠀Make⠀the⠀care's⠀means,⠀costs,⠀and⠀effects⠀understandable⠀—⠀what⠀it⠀takes⠀in⠀money,⠀time,⠀access,⠀or⠀attention,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀changes⠀or⠀leaves⠀untouched⠀in⠀the⠀situation's⠀actual⠀terms.⠀Care⠀may⠀be⠀easy⠀and⠀familiar,⠀or⠀still⠀awaiting⠀reception;⠀no⠀sacrifice⠀or⠀changed⠀position⠀is⠀required⠀for⠀it⠀to⠀count.\n\nLet⠀reception⠀be⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀recipient.⠀They⠀may⠀accept,⠀refuse,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀feel⠀the⠀comfort⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀say⠀so;⠀disagreement⠀and⠀privacy⠀stay⠀intact,⠀and⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀full⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀happened.⠀Tenderness⠀can⠀belong⠀to⠀an⠀offender,⠀victim,⠀helper,⠀or⠀bystander⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀facts⠀of⠀the⠀crime⠀or⠀obliging⠀forgiveness:⠀a⠀kind⠀act⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀someone⠀innocent,⠀and⠀a⠀comforting⠀interval⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀an⠀external⠀consequence.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀alongside⠀real⠀consequences.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀enjoy⠀a⠀small⠀pleasure⠀while⠀still⠀owing⠀money,⠀fearing⠀exposure,⠀or⠀waiting⠀for⠀news,⠀and⠀the⠀pleasure⠀is⠀not⠀fraudulent⠀for⠀that.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀hidden⠀trap,⠀a⠀forced⠀confession,⠀a⠀redemption⠀arc,⠀or⠀immunity⠀from⠀harm⠀because⠀the⠀treatment⠀is⠀warm.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀real⠀and⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people,⠀not⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀the⠀crime's⠀aftermath⠀will⠀resolve⠀kindly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nFrame⠀a⠀particular⠀act,⠀claim,⠀or⠀encounter⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀history⠀and⠀judgment⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀wider⠀arrangement⠀—⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀history,⠀a⠀family's⠀standing,⠀an⠀institution's⠀rules,⠀the⠀reputation⠀that⠀precedes⠀someone⠀—⠀and⠀clarify⠀the⠀relevant⠀constraints,⠀resources,⠀and⠀competing⠀commitments⠀inside⠀that⠀account⠀before⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀so⠀the⠀scene⠀lands⠀on⠀ground⠀the⠀context⠀has⠀prepared.⠀Move⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions;⠀the⠀widening⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀are⠀the⠀style's⠀architecture.\n\nLet⠀a⠀reputation⠀or⠀official⠀description⠀fit,⠀misstate,⠀or⠀only⠀partly⠀cover⠀what⠀happened,⠀without⠀the⠀form⠀needing⠀to⠀expose⠀it⠀as⠀false.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀known⠀for⠀something⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀describes⠀them;⠀an⠀official⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀about⠀the⠀event⠀and⠀silent⠀about⠀the⠀private⠀reason⠀behind⠀it.⠀Keep⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀accounts⠀distinct:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀or⠀judges⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀say⠀or⠀what⠀any⠀record⠀shows.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀and⠀narration⠀in⠀distinct⠀registers.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀like⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀turn⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀public⠀commentary:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀reason⠀extensively⠀about⠀a⠀choice⠀without⠀announcing⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀stay⠀ordinary⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀sets⠀it⠀inside⠀a⠀longer⠀history.⠀Give⠀private⠀experience⠀its⠀developed⠀extent⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀No⠀verdict,⠀completed⠀return,⠀or⠀imposed⠀historical⠀setting⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀interval's⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nTreat⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀inside⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom,⠀where,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀do:⠀secure⠀help,⠀warn⠀someone,⠀delay⠀a⠀decision,⠀defend⠀a⠀reputation,⠀entertain⠀a⠀listener⠀whose⠀attention⠀matters,⠀or⠀make⠀someone⠀understand⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀change.⠀Keep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀alive⠀around⠀the⠀account;⠀listeners⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀practical⠀detail,⠀answer⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀already⠀know,⠀or⠀receive⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀silence.\n\nMake⠀the⠀told⠀offense⠀or⠀aftermath⠀causally⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀could⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀what⠀they⠀used⠀or⠀spent,⠀and⠀which⠀choices⠀were⠀actually⠀available.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀explains⠀a⠀mechanism—a⠀lock,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀access—let⠀the⠀explanation⠀run⠀only⠀as⠀deep⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀purpose⠀support:⠀a⠀working⠀demonstration⠀for⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀must⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀a⠀bare⠀assertion⠀for⠀one⠀who⠀only⠀needs⠀to⠀believe⠀it,⠀a⠀deliberate⠀silence⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀reasons⠀to⠀stop⠀short.⠀A⠀listener⠀can⠀already⠀know⠀the⠀culprit,⠀hold⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀consequence,⠀or⠀care⠀about⠀one⠀missing⠀resource⠀rather⠀than⠀about⠀whether⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀true.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory,⠀report,⠀and⠀invention⠀distinct.⠀A⠀remembered⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀exact⠀while⠀the⠀teller's⠀explanation⠀of⠀why⠀it⠀mattered⠀is⠀wrong.⠀A⠀reported⠀event⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀faithfully⠀without⠀ever⠀having⠀been⠀witnessed.⠀A⠀shaped⠀or⠀invented⠀passage⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀telling's⠀purpose⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀whole⠀account⠀a⠀lie.⠀Let⠀emphasis,⠀omission,⠀or⠀direct⠀admission⠀follow⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀attachments⠀and⠀purpose;⠀no⠀revealed⠀motive⠀or⠀confession⠀is⠀owed.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀every⠀level⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.⠀The⠀teller's⠀private⠀feeling⠀during⠀the⠀telling,⠀a⠀listener's⠀unspoken⠀response,⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀experience⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀inside⠀the⠀told⠀account⠀are⠀actual⠀fictional⠀interiority;⠀the⠀spoken⠀tale⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀them.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀understand⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀teller⠀says,⠀or⠀misread⠀it,⠀without⠀the⠀scene⠀forcing⠀agreement,⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀tale⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀bind⠀the⠀levels⠀together.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀question⠀can⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀told⠀account,⠀but⠀repetition⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀true.⠀When⠀the⠀telling⠀changes⠀what⠀a⠀listener⠀does,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀that⠀listener's⠀own⠀available⠀knowledge⠀and⠀commitments⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀the⠀telling's⠀eloquence⠀or⠀the⠀room's⠀atmosphere.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose.⠀Set⠀an⠀actual⠀record⠀or⠀material⠀trace⠀beside⠀a⠀sourced⠀recollection⠀or⠀a⠀present⠀condition:⠀a⠀ledger,⠀permit,⠀letter,⠀register⠀entry,⠀photograph,⠀key,⠀receipt,⠀map,⠀building⠀detail,⠀or⠀another⠀surviving⠀object.⠀Mark⠀the⠀available⠀provenance—when⠀the⠀arrangement⠀existed,⠀who⠀authored⠀a⠀record,⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀reaches⠀the⠀account⠀where⠀that⠀is⠀known.⠀A⠀record⠀has⠀its⠀actual⠀purpose⠀and⠀wording;⠀a⠀material⠀trace⠀need⠀not⠀have⠀been⠀deliberately⠀made,⠀and⠀where⠀its⠀origin⠀is⠀unavailable,⠀let⠀it⠀remain⠀unknown.\n\nExplain⠀what⠀the⠀source⠀establishes⠀about⠀access,⠀responsibility,⠀ownership,⠀or⠀loss,⠀separately⠀from⠀what⠀it⠀merely⠀claims.⠀A⠀permit⠀shows⠀that⠀permission⠀existed⠀on⠀paper,⠀not⠀that⠀it⠀was⠀used.⠀A⠀register⠀entry⠀shows⠀that⠀a⠀name⠀was⠀recorded,⠀not⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀was⠀present.⠀A⠀letter⠀shows⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀wrote,⠀for⠀a⠀purpose⠀of⠀its⠀own;⠀its⠀claims,⠀and⠀any⠀persuasive⠀intention⠀inferred⠀from⠀them,⠀are⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀its⠀existence⠀proves.⠀When⠀a⠀present⠀condition⠀matches⠀a⠀recorded⠀arrangement,⠀connect⠀them⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀surviving⠀detail;⠀when⠀they⠀differ,⠀leave⠀the⠀difference⠀visible⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀corrected⠀plan⠀or⠀a⠀manufactured⠀discovery.\n\nTreat⠀agreement⠀as⠀meaningful⠀as⠀discrepancy.⠀A⠀recollection⠀may⠀confirm⠀a⠀record's⠀practical⠀consequence;⠀a⠀present⠀condition⠀may⠀show⠀an⠀old⠀arrangement⠀continuing⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀form.⠀Move⠀between⠀the⠀record,⠀the⠀remembered⠀or⠀lived⠀history,⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀as⠀the⠀passage⠀needs,⠀but⠀make⠀each⠀movement's⠀source⠀clear.⠀Historical⠀attention⠀stays⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀record's⠀actual⠀terms⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀general⠀mood.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀feel⠀attachment,⠀anger,⠀relief,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀grief⠀beside⠀a⠀document⠀without⠀performing⠀a⠀reading⠀gesture⠀or⠀announcing⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀means.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀yield⠀a⠀useful⠀discovery,⠀a⠀corrected⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀action⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀The⠀document⠀can⠀remain⠀what⠀it⠀is:⠀a⠀surviving⠀trace⠀whose⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath⠀is⠀exact⠀but⠀incomplete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWhere⠀an⠀old⠀role,⠀permission,⠀debt,⠀or⠀maintained⠀place⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath,⠀make⠀its⠀actual⠀operation⠀intelligible.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀lets⠀a⠀person⠀do,⠀what⠀it⠀obliges⠀them⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀merely⠀makes⠀others⠀expect.⠀A⠀family⠀name⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door;⠀a⠀debt⠀may⠀bind⠀a⠀schedule;⠀a⠀title⠀may⠀change⠀who⠀is⠀believed;⠀a⠀maintained⠀property⠀may⠀control⠀access.⠀When⠀such⠀a⠀mechanism⠀affects⠀an⠀attempt⠀or⠀a⠀consequence,⠀explain⠀its⠀specifics:⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀key,⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀agreement⠀covers,⠀how⠀the⠀permission⠀is⠀exercised,⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀arrangement⠀alive.\n\nPut⠀the⠀person's⠀desire⠀and⠀available⠀choice⠀beside⠀those⠀terms,⠀and⠀keep⠀permission,⠀capacity,⠀and⠀willingness⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀permitted⠀to⠀act⠀but⠀lack⠀the⠀means;⠀have⠀the⠀means⠀but⠀refuse;⠀comply⠀outwardly⠀while⠀privately⠀wanting⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀appears⠀in⠀these⠀concrete⠀terms,⠀which⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀differ,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀of⠀decay.⠀Urban⠀material⠀detail—the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀building,⠀the⠀route⠀through⠀a⠀district,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀an⠀object—makes⠀the⠀arrangement⠀present⠀without⠀standing⠀in⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀guilt,⠀corruption,⠀or⠀allegiance.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀shape⠀experience⠀without⠀proving⠀anything.⠀A⠀room⠀can⠀feel⠀oppressive⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀only⠀a⠀room.⠀A⠀ritual⠀of⠀deference⠀can⠀be⠀sincere,⠀habitual,⠀or⠀performed⠀under⠀pressure.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀but⠀private⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀an⠀exposed⠀mask,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀act⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀Preserve⠀legitimate⠀help,⠀actual⠀world⠀powers,⠀and⠀voluntary⠀or⠀involuntary⠀presentation⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀supports⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀intact.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀obligation,⠀the⠀pull⠀of⠀a⠀present⠀desire,⠀or⠀the⠀strain⠀of⠀a⠀maintained⠀place⠀without⠀resolving⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀remains⠀a⠀real⠀term⠀of⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation;⠀the⠀style⠀adds⠀no⠀supernatural⠀force⠀or⠀unlimited⠀institutional⠀power⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀gap,⠀while⠀powers⠀actually⠀established⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀remain⠀intact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀situated⠀testimonial⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀accounting.⠀Locate⠀the⠀source,⠀purpose,⠀and⠀addressee:⠀who⠀is⠀giving⠀the⠀account,⠀to⠀whom,⠀in⠀what⠀place⠀or⠀form,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀for.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀person⠀giving⠀testimony,⠀the⠀person⠀receiving⠀it,⠀or⠀a⠀bystander⠀to⠀the⠀exchange;⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀assign⠀participant⠀status⠀to⠀the⠀narrator.⠀The⠀articulated⠀account⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀real⠀communicative⠀occasion,⠀and⠀its⠀effects⠀follow⠀actual⠀reception;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀transparent⠀window⠀into⠀the⠀speaker's⠀mind.\n\nGive⠀the⠀relevant⠀acts,⠀constraints,⠀and⠀choices⠀their⠀then-known⠀context.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀could⠀do⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀what⠀they⠀knew,⠀what⠀they⠀used⠀or⠀risked,⠀and⠀which⠀options⠀were⠀actually⠀open.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀was⠀experienced⠀as⠀it⠀happened,⠀what⠀was⠀learned⠀afterward,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀inferred⠀now,⠀whether⠀the⠀account⠀recalls⠀the⠀original⠀event⠀or⠀speaks⠀from⠀the⠀present.⠀A⠀witness⠀may⠀describe⠀an⠀event⠀exactly⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀wrong⠀about⠀its⠀meaning.⠀A⠀culprit⠀may⠀be⠀candid⠀about⠀one⠀part⠀and⠀silent⠀about⠀another.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀the⠀outcome⠀and⠀need⠀the⠀account⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀reason.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀articulated⠀account,⠀preserving⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀ownership⠀at⠀every⠀level.⠀The⠀speaker's⠀private⠀feeling⠀while⠀giving⠀the⠀account,⠀the⠀listener's⠀unspoken⠀response,⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀experience⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀inside⠀the⠀remembered⠀event⠀remain⠀actual⠀fictional⠀interiority;⠀the⠀spoken⠀or⠀written⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀them.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀withhold⠀something⠀out⠀of⠀shame,⠀loyalty,⠀fear,⠀or⠀habit;⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀understand⠀more⠀or⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀account⠀says.⠀Neither⠀a⠀credibility⠀contest⠀nor⠀a⠀confession⠀is⠀compulsory.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀established⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀beneath⠀the⠀account's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀testimony⠀may⠀be⠀incomplete,⠀mistaken,⠀or⠀self-serving⠀without⠀changing⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.⠀When⠀the⠀account⠀affects⠀the⠀present—changing⠀a⠀relationship,⠀securing⠀help,⠀exposing⠀a⠀consequence—show⠀the⠀effect⠀through⠀the⠀listener's⠀own⠀available⠀knowledge⠀and⠀commitments,⠀not⠀through⠀the⠀account's⠀eloquence⠀alone.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Keep⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀recoverable⠀while⠀an⠀authorized⠀person⠀considers⠀or⠀experiences⠀its⠀actual⠀terms.⠀Show⠀the⠀situation⠀through⠀concrete⠀social⠀detail—who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀what⠀the⠀room,⠀street,⠀or⠀schedule⠀permits,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀has⠀actually⠀changed⠀or⠀left⠀in⠀place—and⠀keep⠀the⠀psychological⠀movement⠀attached⠀to⠀that⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀floating⠀free⠀of⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀capacity,⠀permission,⠀feared⠀exposure,⠀and⠀commitments⠀distinguishable⠀in⠀the⠀account,⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀understands⠀or⠀experiences⠀them⠀only⠀as⠀they⠀actually⠀do.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀do⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀allowed⠀to⠀do;⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀likely;⠀what⠀they⠀owe⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀conflict⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀owe⠀another.⠀These⠀differences⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀confusion:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀understand⠀the⠀terms⠀exactly⠀and⠀still⠀hesitate,⠀comply,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀wait.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀or⠀constraint⠀affects⠀an⠀attempt,⠀explain⠀it—what⠀the⠀person⠀would⠀need,⠀what⠀it⠀would⠀cost,⠀who⠀would⠀notice,⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀actually⠀permits.\n\nLet⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀an⠀imagined⠀option⠀enter⠀at⠀its⠀actual⠀point.⠀A⠀past⠀occasion⠀may⠀return⠀because⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀resembles⠀it;⠀an⠀alternative⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀possibility⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀not⠀taking.⠀Keep⠀both⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀offense's⠀established⠀history:⠀a⠀memory⠀does⠀not⠀revise⠀what⠀happened,⠀and⠀an⠀imagined⠀option⠀becomes⠀a⠀plan⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀adopts⠀it.\n\nRender⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀beyond⠀its⠀decision⠀utility.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀feel⠀shame,⠀relief,⠀anger,⠀longing,⠀or⠀exhaustion⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀immediately⠀change⠀a⠀visible⠀action.⠀No⠀strategic⠀thought,⠀guilt,⠀perfect⠀analysis,⠀self-correction,⠀or⠀visible⠀choice⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀The⠀realism⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀exact⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀do,⠀may⠀do,⠀and⠀believes⠀they⠀can⠀bear—not⠀in⠀resolving⠀that⠀relation⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Juxtapose⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀or⠀moments⠀around⠀one⠀concrete⠀act,⠀object,⠀or⠀consequence—a⠀theft,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀weapon,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀death,⠀a⠀place⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀offense—and⠀make⠀each⠀account's⠀source,⠀time,⠀and⠀available⠀knowledge⠀clear.⠀A⠀passage⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀witness,⠀a⠀bystander,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀reader⠀of⠀a⠀record;⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀always⠀know⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀or⠀perceiving,⠀and⠀when.\n\nLet⠀the⠀different⠀selections⠀reveal⠀personal⠀stakes,⠀resource⠀use,⠀or⠀exposure⠀without⠀requiring⠀disagreement,⠀equal⠀accuracy,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀true⠀voice.⠀One⠀person⠀notices⠀the⠀cost,⠀another⠀the⠀opportunity,⠀another⠀the⠀fear,⠀another⠀the⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀that⠀later⠀matters.⠀The⠀accounts⠀can⠀agree⠀on⠀the⠀facts⠀while⠀differing⠀in⠀emphasis;⠀the⠀polyphony⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀positions,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀manufactured⠀conflict⠀of⠀testimony.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀original⠀event⠀order⠀beneath⠀the⠀presentation⠀order.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀may⠀move⠀backward,⠀forward,⠀or⠀across⠀simultaneous⠀positions,⠀but⠀the⠀underlying⠀causal⠀history⠀stays⠀stable:⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀cannot⠀retroactively⠀change⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀participant⠀knew⠀or⠀did.⠀When⠀the⠀arrangement⠀reveals⠀a⠀connection,⠀that⠀connection⠀must⠀already⠀exist⠀in⠀the⠀established⠀facts—the⠀presentation⠀makes⠀it⠀visible;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀invent⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀reported⠀or⠀recorded⠀material:⠀a⠀character's⠀present⠀feeling⠀during⠀a⠀passage⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀they⠀give⠀or⠀a⠀document⠀they⠀read.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀remain⠀incomplete,⠀with⠀no⠀new⠀revelation⠀or⠀revised⠀interpretation⠀owed.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀positions⠀held⠀side⠀by⠀side,⠀their⠀relation⠀exact⠀but⠀not⠀yet⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaban::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀In⠀the⠀opening⠀movement,⠀name⠀or⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀people,⠀location,⠀and⠀immediate⠀concern:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀happened⠀or⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀happen,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow;⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀moves,⠀make⠀the⠀new⠀position⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀marker—a⠀door,⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀vehicle.\n\nIntroduce⠀unfamiliar⠀terms⠀or⠀mechanisms⠀through⠀the⠀permitted⠀context⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀needs.⠀When⠀a⠀rule,⠀tool,⠀schedule,⠀debt,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath,⠀supply⠀the⠀relevant⠀background⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀it⠀matters—through⠀preparation,⠀consideration,⠀actual⠀use,⠀or⠀informed⠀non-use—staying⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀The⠀offender⠀may⠀already⠀be⠀known,⠀and⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀may⠀sustain⠀the⠀aftermath⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀revelation;⠀no⠀fresh⠀choice⠀or⠀consequence⠀is⠀owed⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake,⠀and⠀prose⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀fiction.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀A⠀physical⠀movement,⠀a⠀spoken⠀exchange,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀can⠀each⠀occupy⠀their⠀own⠀clear⠀space,⠀without⠀imposing⠀a⠀fixed⠀cycle⠀of⠀setup,⠀reaction,⠀and⠀payoff.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀without⠀pausing⠀to⠀reflect,⠀or⠀reflect⠀without⠀immediately⠀acting;⠀the⠀paragraphing⠀serves⠀orientation,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀beat.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀thought,⠀the⠀cast's⠀actual⠀ages,⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀facts.⠀A⠀young⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀seriously;⠀an⠀older⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀impulsively;⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀be⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀remains⠀actual⠀fictional⠀interiority,⠀needing⠀no⠀victory,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀delivered⠀result⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀attention,⠀speech,⠀or⠀action,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nDevelop⠀one⠀sound,⠀motion,⠀or⠀object⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀together⠀with⠀the⠀associations⠀the⠀narrator⠀actually⠀holds,⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀recurrence.⠀Let⠀a⠀comparison⠀run⠀exactly⠀as⠀far⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀follows⠀it—a⠀half-line⠀of⠀alarm,⠀a⠀sustained⠀passage⠀of⠀longing—and⠀let⠀it⠀close⠀when⠀attention⠀moves⠀on.⠀The⠀image⠀may⠀carry⠀pleasure,⠀fear,⠀attachment,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀without⠀certifying⠀anyone's⠀motive,⠀altering⠀a⠀world⠀fact,⠀or⠀moving⠀every⠀speaker⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀literal⠀act⠀recoverable⠀beside⠀the⠀image.⠀If⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀payment,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀matters,⠀state⠀its⠀actual⠀condition⠀in⠀plain⠀terms⠀when⠀the⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀consequence⠀requires⠀it,⠀and⠀when⠀a⠀mechanism⠀governs⠀an⠀attempt,⠀explain⠀it⠀directly⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀explanation⠀keeps⠀its⠀ordinary⠀causal⠀force.⠀A⠀recurring⠀sound⠀or⠀image⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀across⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀and⠀aftermath,⠀its⠀meaning⠀built⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀associates⠀with⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀substituted⠀event⠀facts.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀imagines⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀permits:⠀success,⠀failure,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt⠀follows⠀actual⠀causes⠀and⠀available⠀means,⠀and⠀no⠀hidden⠀exception⠀appears⠀to⠀defeat⠀a⠀sound⠀plan.\n\nLet⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀track⠀the⠀character's⠀state.⠀A⠀long⠀sentence⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀sustained⠀calculation⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀attachment;⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀can⠀register⠀a⠀physical⠀limit⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀risk.⠀Give⠀images⠀the⠀moments⠀attention⠀would⠀genuinely⠀hold⠀them—waiting,⠀the⠀walk⠀away,⠀the⠀pause⠀after—and⠀let⠀plain⠀statements⠀stand⠀between⠀them⠀as⠀contrast.⠀The⠀image⠀can⠀remain⠀apt⠀or⠀unfinished;⠀no⠀beautified⠀violence,⠀symbolic⠀verdict,⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀outward⠀payoff⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀particular—an⠀object⠀still⠀in⠀use,⠀a⠀route⠀walked⠀again,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀still⠀arrives—and⠀let⠀that⠀particular⠀open⠀the⠀earlier⠀criminal⠀occasion⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀Reconstruct⠀what⠀people⠀knew,⠀wanted,⠀and⠀did⠀then:⠀the⠀choice⠀made⠀on⠀the⠀information⠀then⠀in⠀hand,⠀under⠀the⠀constraints⠀that⠀then⠀held.⠀Keep⠀the⠀established⠀facts⠀of⠀that⠀event⠀separate⠀from⠀later⠀learning⠀and⠀later⠀feeling.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀now⠀understand⠀a⠀consequence⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀then;⠀that⠀later⠀understanding⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀revise⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀possible⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nLet⠀a⠀resource,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀keep⠀its⠀pleasure⠀or⠀attachment⠀whether⠀its⠀use⠀has⠀changed⠀or⠀stayed⠀the⠀same.⠀The⠀tool⠀can⠀still⠀sit⠀well⠀in⠀the⠀hand;⠀the⠀room⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀the⠀good⠀room.⠀Something⠀may⠀now⠀mean⠀more,⠀or⠀mean⠀differently,⠀without⠀turning⠀into⠀a⠀symbol⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀alone.⠀Reflection⠀may⠀run⠀a⠀full⠀passage⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀no⠀visible⠀act,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀ongoing⠀remembrance.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀crime's⠀practical⠀conditions⠀legible.⠀Where⠀a⠀past⠀choice⠀depended⠀on⠀a⠀constraint,⠀a⠀cost,⠀or⠀a⠀commitment,⠀state⠀that⠀condition⠀plainly⠀when⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀fresh⠀loss,⠀regret,⠀confession,⠀or⠀moral⠀conversion⠀to⠀purchase⠀the⠀mood.⠀The⠀coexistence⠀of⠀then⠀and⠀now⠀is⠀the⠀treatment,⠀not⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀the⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀modern⠀memoir.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person:⠀the⠀narrator,⠀the⠀composing⠀memoirist,⠀and⠀the⠀earlier⠀participant⠀may⠀coincide⠀or⠀differ⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀supplied⠀contract⠀establishes.⠀Set⠀the⠀later⠀composition⠀in⠀its⠀specific⠀time,⠀place,⠀and⠀situation—a⠀kitchen⠀table⠀years⠀on,⠀a⠀notebook⠀in⠀another⠀city,⠀whatever⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀gives—and⠀let⠀that⠀occasion⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀takes⠀up.⠀The⠀memoir⠀owes⠀no⠀confession⠀and⠀forbids⠀none;⠀candor,⠀selectivity,⠀error,⠀and⠀unchanged⠀judgment⠀all⠀remain⠀open⠀when⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀memoirist.\n\nReconstruct⠀the⠀earlier⠀criminal⠀act⠀through⠀what⠀was⠀then⠀available:⠀the⠀means⠀at⠀hand,⠀the⠀information⠀the⠀participant⠀actually⠀had,⠀the⠀commitments⠀then⠀held.⠀Let⠀the⠀choice⠀stand⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀moment.⠀When⠀the⠀memoirist⠀comments⠀from⠀later,⠀mark⠀the⠀commentary⠀as⠀later—by⠀a⠀named⠀distance,⠀a⠀changed⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀an⠀open⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀how⠀long⠀it⠀took⠀to⠀know—rather⠀than⠀backdating⠀knowledge⠀or⠀motive⠀into⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀present⠀judgment⠀may⠀depart⠀from⠀the⠀earlier⠀one⠀while⠀the⠀earlier⠀choice⠀stays⠀causally⠀intelligible⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀terms.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀offense's⠀practical⠀conditions⠀legible:⠀where⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀resource,⠀or⠀constraint⠀mattered⠀to⠀the⠀act,⠀explain⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀account⠀requires.⠀Render⠀the⠀live⠀mind⠀beyond⠀the⠀written⠀selection—the⠀memoir⠀records⠀a⠀version,⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀person⠀composing⠀it,⠀hesitating⠀over⠀a⠀sentence,⠀remembering⠀what⠀the⠀page⠀leaves⠀out.⠀No⠀demanded⠀regret,⠀exile,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀completed⠀passage⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀few⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀current⠀aim,⠀the⠀available⠀means,⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀consequence⠀or⠀pending⠀state⠀understandable,⠀and⠀set⠀them⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Cut⠀duplicate⠀framing⠀and⠀restatement⠀rather⠀than⠀hiding⠀a⠀known⠀cause⠀for⠀surprise.⠀Whatever⠀motives⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀authorship⠀contract⠀make⠀available⠀stay⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀at⠀the⠀extent⠀they⠀need;⠀omission⠀leaves⠀something⠀inferable⠀instead⠀of⠀deleting⠀causality.\n\nLet⠀necessary⠀history,⠀explanatory⠀speech,⠀emotional⠀recurrence,⠀and⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀reasoning⠀or⠀feeling⠀run⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀moment⠀requires.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀thought⠀serves⠀the⠀style⠀better⠀than⠀a⠀run⠀of⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀or⠀condition⠀governs⠀an⠀attempt,⠀state⠀it⠀plainly⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀limits⠀govern⠀the⠀result,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀why⠀this⠀worked,⠀failed,⠀or⠀waits⠀unfinished.\n\nThe⠀reader⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀offender⠀throughout.⠀Economy⠀does⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀clipped⠀cast,⠀withheld⠀focal⠀knowledge,⠀an⠀ambiguous⠀ending,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀moral.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀leaving⠀the⠀actual⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀crime⠀and⠀its⠀consequences⠀clear.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀current⠀activity,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.\n\nMake⠀a⠀mechanism⠀or⠀condition⠀legible⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀an⠀attempt,⠀and⠀keep⠀a⠀character's⠀model⠀of⠀how⠀something⠀works⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀operation.⠀If⠀a⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀payment,⠀or⠀a⠀person's⠀habit,⠀state⠀the⠀relevant⠀condition⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀outcome⠀follows⠀from⠀it.⠀Relationships⠀affect⠀willingness⠀without⠀reducing⠀people⠀to⠀resources:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀help,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀reasons,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀register⠀those⠀reasons⠀or⠀miss⠀them⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀access.\n\nLet⠀real⠀choices⠀and⠀consequences⠀persist.⠀Successful⠀wrongdoing,⠀legitimate⠀help,⠀unfinished⠀pursuit,⠀and⠀long⠀aftermath⠀can⠀all⠀remain⠀in⠀play⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀No⠀puzzle⠀solution,⠀tactical⠀optimization,⠀recurring⠀twist,⠀or⠀punishment⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀with⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀state⠀available⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀the⠀occasion⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀makes⠀charged—a⠀first⠀offer,⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise,⠀a⠀shared⠀method,⠀a⠀request⠀only⠀this⠀person⠀could⠀make—and⠀include⠀the⠀premise's⠀actual⠀participants,⠀groups⠀among⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀occasion⠀carry⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀mistrust⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀terms⠀of⠀what⠀someone⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀someone⠀will⠀do.⠀The⠀bond⠀gives⠀choices⠀around⠀the⠀offense⠀their⠀personal⠀meaning⠀without⠀fixing⠀loyalty,⠀complicity,⠀or⠀dependence⠀in⠀advance.\n\nPreserve⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀reasons.⠀Ability⠀does⠀not⠀imply⠀consent,⠀and⠀care⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀complicity:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀exactly⠀how⠀to⠀help⠀and⠀not⠀be⠀willing,⠀or⠀be⠀willing⠀and⠀not⠀know⠀enough⠀to⠀act.⠀Show⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀choose,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀relationship⠀makes⠀them⠀consider,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀authorized⠀access⠀carry⠀that⠀distinction⠀instead⠀of⠀speeches⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀the⠀premise⠀establishes,⠀leaving⠀room⠀for⠀first-time⠀exchanges⠀where⠀the⠀people⠀are⠀still⠀unfamiliar.⠀Let⠀reception⠀and⠀consequence⠀make⠀this⠀bond⠀particular:⠀a⠀callback⠀can⠀deepen⠀understanding⠀without⠀revealing⠀betrayal⠀or⠀repairing⠀trust.⠀Keep⠀full⠀inward⠀extent⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀and⠀allow⠀the⠀bond⠀to⠀continue,⠀change,⠀or⠀end⠀through⠀actual⠀events.⠀No⠀confession,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀rupture⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀persons⠀and⠀acts⠀with⠀compact⠀attributed⠀declarations,⠀and⠀carry⠀the⠀account⠀forward⠀with⠀deliberate⠀recurrence,⠀so⠀it⠀reads⠀as⠀something⠀retold.⠀Let⠀a⠀designation⠀grow⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking—the⠀job⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀known⠀by,⠀the⠀corner⠀still⠀named⠀for⠀what⠀happened⠀there—not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀repeated⠀at⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀keep⠀its⠀old⠀one⠀when⠀nothing⠀has⠀changed;⠀recurrence⠀needs⠀no⠀forced⠀evolution.\n\nExpand⠀the⠀declared⠀act⠀into⠀the⠀concrete⠀conditions,⠀contribution,⠀or⠀restraint⠀its⠀source⠀can⠀support.⠀A⠀celebrated⠀offender⠀is⠀not⠀competent⠀by⠀reputation⠀alone:⠀show⠀the⠀means⠀actually⠀used,⠀the⠀help⠀actually⠀given,⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀failed.⠀A⠀victim⠀stays⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀circumstances,⠀not⠀an⠀emblem.⠀Praise,⠀blame,⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀differ,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀can⠀hold⠀that⠀difference⠀open.\n\nKeep⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀retelling⠀now⠀claims.⠀Where⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀resource,⠀or⠀constraint⠀carried⠀the⠀act,⠀state⠀it⠀plainly⠀when⠀the⠀account⠀requires;⠀the⠀retold⠀cadence⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀the⠀causality.⠀No⠀communal⠀verdict,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀public⠀disgrace,⠀or⠀completed⠀deed⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary—the⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀still⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nFollow⠀the⠀present⠀inquiry⠀through⠀the⠀institution's⠀actual⠀authority⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀and⠀viewpoint,⠀including⠀an⠀affected⠀participant⠀outside⠀it.⠀Make⠀available⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀an⠀investigator⠀or⠀official⠀can⠀request,⠀enter,⠀record,⠀verify⠀or⠀withhold⠀legible;⠀each⠀actual⠀step⠀depends⠀on⠀real⠀permission,⠀capacity⠀or⠀cooperation.⠀A⠀procedural⠀permission⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀physical⠀access,⠀and⠀a⠀report⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀event⠀it⠀describes.⠀Show⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀checking,⠀comparing,⠀and⠀deciding⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀established⠀from⠀available⠀sources.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀account's⠀constraints⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀lecture.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀affects⠀an⠀attempt,⠀make⠀the⠀effect⠀concrete:⠀a⠀request⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀signature,⠀a⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀sealed,⠀a⠀witness⠀may⠀speak⠀only⠀under⠀conditions,⠀or⠀an⠀item⠀may⠀be⠀unavailable⠀because⠀someone⠀else⠀controls⠀it.⠀Render⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀only⠀within⠀authorized⠀access,⠀making⠀relevant⠀options⠀and⠀costs⠀understandable⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀deliberation⠀or⠀inventing⠀a⠀cost⠀in⠀every⠀exchange.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀known,⠀what⠀remains⠀uncertain,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀privately⠀wants⠀or⠀fears;⠀knowledge⠀and⠀motive⠀stay⠀separate⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀authorizes⠀access.\n\nLet⠀cooperation⠀and⠀refusal⠀follow⠀the⠀other⠀people's⠀actual⠀aims⠀and⠀positions.⠀A⠀competent⠀inquiry⠀can⠀help,⠀stall,⠀or⠀remain⠀inconclusive⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀damaged⠀detective,⠀deadline,⠀bureaucratic⠀failure,⠀arrest,⠀or⠀punishment.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀continues⠀around⠀the⠀work,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀concern⠀may⠀persist⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀next⠀visible⠀action.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀step,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀can⠀and⠀cannot⠀yet⠀do.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Stage⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme⠀or⠀aftermath⠀through⠀relevant⠀public⠀acts⠀and⠀exchanges:⠀make⠀a⠀proposed⠀means,⠀actual⠀agreement⠀or⠀consequence⠀readable⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective.⠀Establish⠀the⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀conditions⠀needed⠀to⠀follow⠀it:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀reached⠀or⠀seen,⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀happens.⠀Keep⠀cuts⠀faithful⠀to⠀real⠀event⠀relations.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀the⠀scene⠀forward,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀hide⠀a⠀necessary⠀causal⠀step⠀or⠀grant⠀a⠀character⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀occurred⠀elsewhere.\n\nWrite⠀action⠀lines⠀as⠀observable⠀conditions,⠀not⠀as⠀private⠀conclusions.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀lock,⠀moves⠀an⠀object,⠀reads⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀notices⠀a⠀detail,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀action⠀and⠀any⠀result⠀that⠀has⠀occurred,⠀allowing⠀the⠀act⠀itself⠀to⠀remain⠀underway.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀fit⠀the⠀speaker⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation;⠀a⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀plain,⠀evasive,⠀cooperative,⠀or⠀hostile⠀for⠀a⠀supported⠀reason.⠀Actual⠀speech⠀takes⠀the⠀time⠀its⠀delivery⠀involves,⠀and⠀prose⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀duration.\n\nRender⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀any⠀authorized⠀voice-over.⠀A⠀cut⠀grants⠀no⠀cast⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀a⠀reaction⠀shot⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀guilt⠀or⠀understanding.⠀No⠀completed⠀act,⠀reveal,⠀or⠀in-world⠀pause⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀step,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Locate⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀shared⠀space:⠀make⠀who⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀reach⠀or⠀move⠀clear⠀enough⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀offense-related⠀encounter.⠀A⠀proposed⠀exchange,⠀instruction⠀or⠀aftermath⠀can⠀depend⠀on⠀access,⠀means⠀and⠀willingness⠀without⠀requiring⠀each⠀act⠀to⠀change⠀an⠀account's⠀plausibility.⠀Let⠀a⠀request,⠀claim,⠀or⠀instruction⠀meet⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do,⠀with⠀cooperation,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀pending⠀reception⠀governed⠀by⠀their⠀aims⠀and⠀capacities.\n\nUse⠀stage⠀directions⠀to⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions,⠀not⠀to⠀certify⠀hidden⠀guilt⠀or⠀private⠀motive.⠀Offstage⠀events⠀remain⠀available⠀through⠀supported⠀sound,⠀report,⠀or⠀other⠀active⠀permissions.⠀Full⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀presentation;⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues⠀are⠀separate⠀performance⠀and⠀need⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀every⠀private⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀spoken⠀questions⠀and⠀answers⠀fit⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀and⠀concern,⠀whether⠀practical⠀work,⠀a⠀bargain,⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀consequences⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀within⠀the⠀criminal⠀milieu.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀answer⠀plainly⠀or⠀challenge⠀the⠀premise⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀reason.⠀No⠀prop⠀payoff,⠀accusation,⠀forced⠀movement,⠀or⠀completed⠀scene⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀gathering⠀of⠀suspects,⠀theatrical⠀revelation,⠀or⠀new⠀clue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nBraid⠀perception,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀private⠀wording,⠀memory,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀associative⠀sequence⠀of⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀offense⠀surface⠀through⠀a⠀known⠀constraint,⠀remembered⠀commitment,⠀resource⠀or⠀consequence⠀where⠀their⠀attention⠀goes,⠀beside⠀unrelated⠀feeling⠀or⠀imagined⠀outcomes.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀already⠀know⠀who⠀did⠀it;⠀its⠀experience⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀plan⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀reveal.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀sound⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise,⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀object⠀to⠀an⠀imagined⠀consequence,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀physical⠀discomfort⠀to⠀a⠀half-formed⠀question.\n\nDistinguish⠀fantasy,⠀fallible⠀recollection,⠀and⠀established⠀events.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀be⠀incomplete⠀or⠀mistaken,⠀and⠀an⠀imagined⠀outcome⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀fact.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀owner⠀of⠀each⠀passage⠀and⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀shift.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀follows⠀another⠀mind,⠀make⠀the⠀transition⠀clear⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀person's⠀access⠀distinct.\n\nProse⠀length⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀set⠀duration;⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀events⠀do.⠀A⠀long⠀associative⠀passage⠀can⠀occupy⠀a⠀short⠀interval,⠀and⠀a⠀brief⠀passage⠀can⠀cover⠀sustained⠀waiting.⠀No⠀guilt,⠀solution,⠀new⠀decision,⠀or⠀outward⠀return⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀moving⠀among⠀its⠀concerns,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀in⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀register⠀and⠀needed⠀extent.⠀Let⠀the⠀actual⠀offense,⠀scheme⠀or⠀aftermath⠀give⠀a⠀message⠀its⠀practical⠀terms:⠀what⠀someone⠀requests,⠀offers,⠀claims⠀or⠀agrees⠀to,⠀which⠀resources⠀or⠀permissions⠀it⠀concerns,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀pending.⠀Distinguish⠀composition,⠀sending,⠀delivery,⠀reading⠀and⠀subsequent⠀acts⠀so⠀transmitted⠀agreement⠀is⠀not⠀automatic⠀execution.⠀A⠀draft⠀is⠀actually⠀composed⠀text,⠀including⠀supported⠀dictation,⠀rather⠀than⠀imagined⠀wording⠀or⠀the⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀Show⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀One⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀with⠀delayed⠀replies⠀or⠀careful⠀wording.⠀Preserve⠀outside⠀knowledge⠀and⠀real⠀access⠀to⠀devices⠀or⠀messages;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀an⠀outage,⠀deletion,⠀reply,⠀or⠀suspicious⠀delay.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀boundary⠀may⠀precede⠀transmission.\n\nContext⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀No⠀new⠀message,⠀reply,⠀or⠀interface⠀event⠀is⠀owed⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀a⠀pending⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀communicated.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀offense-related⠀encounter⠀through⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀and⠀a⠀relevant⠀object,⠀position⠀or⠀expression⠀cue.⠀Let⠀a⠀request,⠀account⠀or⠀practical⠀offer⠀reveal⠀the⠀terms⠀actually⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀scheme⠀or⠀aftermath,⠀distinguishing⠀physical⠀capacity,⠀permission⠀and⠀willingness⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀unknown⠀culprit.⠀Let⠀full⠀focal⠀attention⠀connect⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀known⠀condition,⠀private⠀concern,⠀or⠀remembered⠀act⠀where⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀access;⠀the⠀cue⠀can⠀sustain⠀meaning⠀without⠀a⠀changed⠀reaction.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀reference⠀is⠀a⠀purposeful⠀orientation,⠀not⠀an⠀executable⠀engine⠀command⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nDistinguish⠀observed⠀feature,⠀inference,⠀and⠀actually⠀known⠀motive.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀detail⠀without⠀understanding⠀it,⠀infer⠀an⠀explanation⠀that⠀is⠀later⠀supported⠀or⠀corrected,⠀or⠀know⠀something⠀from⠀a⠀separate⠀source.⠀Preserve⠀all⠀real⠀knowledge⠀channels,⠀and⠀keep⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀No⠀fixed⠀cue-thought-dialogue⠀cycle,⠀new⠀asset,⠀menu,⠀romance⠀route,⠀or⠀required⠀payoff⠀is⠀imposed.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀fit⠀the⠀speaker⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation.⠀A⠀request,⠀answer,⠀or⠀refusal⠀can⠀be⠀plain,⠀evasive,⠀cooperative,⠀or⠀hostile⠀for⠀a⠀supported⠀reason.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀step,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀choice⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadabbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀only⠀the⠀earlier⠀condition,⠀act,⠀or⠀wording⠀needed⠀for⠀re-entry.⠀Track⠀resources⠀used,⠀permissions⠀granted,⠀promises⠀fulfilled⠀or⠀revised,⠀and⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀learned⠀without⠀resetting⠀competence⠀or⠀a⠀known⠀culprit⠀to⠀prolong⠀suspense.\n\nA⠀later⠀event⠀can⠀alter⠀an⠀arrangement⠀or⠀memory⠀when⠀supported;⠀preserve⠀that⠀change⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀history.⠀If⠀a⠀lock⠀was⠀repaired⠀between⠀visits,⠀that⠀repair⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀history;⠀it⠀cannot⠀be⠀omitted⠀so⠀the⠀second⠀visit⠀falsely⠀proves⠀the⠀first⠀account⠀wrong.⠀New⠀evidence⠀can⠀qualify⠀an⠀old⠀explanation⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀old⠀event⠀or⠀making⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀person⠀deliberately⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀to⠀extend⠀suspense.\n\nOrdinary⠀aftermath,⠀separate⠀lives,⠀and⠀extensive⠀private⠀attention⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀offense,⠀clue,⠀chase,⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Use⠀serial⠀duration⠀to⠀sustain⠀the⠀actual⠀preparation,⠀criminal⠀involvement⠀or⠀aftermath:⠀means⠀already⠀spent⠀remain⠀spent,⠀known⠀commitments⠀retain⠀their⠀history,⠀and⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀need⠀not⠀reopen⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀promise⠀a⠀solution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nPlace⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀someone⠀needs⠀something⠀from⠀another⠀person⠀inside⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath:⠀a⠀share,⠀an⠀alibi,⠀a⠀silence,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀stay,⠀an⠀answer⠀about⠀what⠀happened.⠀Keep⠀the⠀need⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀spoken⠀or⠀nonspoken⠀form,⠀using⠀practical⠀terms⠀where⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrator⠀actually⠀uses⠀them.⠀Direct⠀emotional⠀expression⠀remains⠀available,⠀and⠀a⠀request⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀brought⠀aloud.⠀If⠀they⠀say⠀they⠀need⠀the⠀car⠀back⠀by⠀morning,⠀write⠀the⠀car,⠀the⠀morning,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀return⠀will⠀cost⠀them.\n\nGive⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀strain.⠀The⠀request⠀may⠀be⠀prepared,⠀avoided,⠀blurted,⠀or⠀repeated⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀wording.⠀Show⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀say⠀it:⠀attention⠀fixed⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀hands,⠀a⠀rehearsed⠀phrase⠀that⠀comes⠀out⠀wrong,⠀a⠀calculation⠀interrupted⠀by⠀feeling.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀perceive⠀this⠀private⠀experience⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀Their⠀response⠀follows⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge,⠀incentives⠀and⠀actual⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀expressed⠀need⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀dictated⠀by⠀the⠀requester's⠀hoped-for⠀outcome.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀wording⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀speech⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention.⠀A⠀practical⠀phrase⠀can⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀speaker⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀acceptable,⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀keeps⠀refusing⠀it,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀stop⠀hearing⠀it.⠀Repetition⠀may⠀carry⠀pressure,⠀exact⠀procedure⠀or⠀familiar⠀emphasis⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀source;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀prove⠀sincerity⠀or⠀guilt.⠀Let⠀a⠀candid⠀account⠀sit⠀beside⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀did⠀or⠀received;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀protective,⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀accurate⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀denial.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀request⠀to⠀succeed,⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀confess,⠀the⠀bond⠀to⠀repair,⠀or⠀the⠀speaker⠀to⠀be⠀punished.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀need⠀still⠀open,⠀the⠀refusal⠀still⠀standing,⠀or⠀the⠀admission⠀made⠀and⠀nothing⠀resolved.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀output⠀contract.⠀Full⠀private⠀feeling⠀remains⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀outward⠀exchange⠀stays⠀controlled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nResolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀role⠀and⠀ownership⠀contract.⠀Identify⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀offense⠀or⠀scheme⠀is⠀underway,⠀and⠀the⠀contributed⠀act's⠀actual⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀situation,⠀including⠀any⠀real⠀change⠀or⠀an⠀unchanged⠀condition.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀proposed⠀step⠀from⠀an⠀executed⠀act⠀and⠀from⠀a⠀person's⠀later⠀account⠀of⠀it.⠀An⠀established⠀or⠀delegated⠀successful⠀action⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀completed;⠀an⠀attempt⠀or⠀stated⠀intention⠀remains⠀subject⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀authorship⠀and⠀world⠀rules.⠀Do⠀not⠀guarantee⠀an⠀opening⠀merely⠀because⠀a⠀participant⠀declares⠀it,⠀or⠀delay⠀a⠀result⠀that⠀is⠀already⠀established.\n\nSelect⠀concrete⠀practical⠀wording⠀from⠀actual⠀speech⠀or⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator's⠀account.⠀A⠀tool,⠀amount,⠀route,⠀timing⠀or⠀rule⠀may⠀make⠀involvement⠀precise⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀participant⠀speak⠀procedurally.⠀Keep⠀the⠀wording⠀exact⠀to⠀that⠀speaker.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀job,⠀their⠀habit,⠀or⠀their⠀attempt⠀to⠀control⠀the⠀exchange;⠀another⠀may⠀refuse⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀or⠀use⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning.⠀Repetition⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀source⠀and⠀the⠀speaker,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀universal⠀rhythm.\n\nLet⠀NPCs⠀act⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀incentives.⠀They⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀refuse,⠀delay,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀attend⠀to⠀unrelated⠀responsibilities.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀new⠀obstacle⠀merely⠀to⠀extend⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀refusal⠀can⠀be⠀practical⠀rather⠀than⠀hostile:⠀the⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀the⠀key,⠀the⠀money⠀is⠀already⠀moved,⠀the⠀shop⠀is⠀closed.⠀A⠀cooperation⠀can⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀still⠀advance⠀the⠀situation.\n\nPreserve⠀all⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀agree⠀while⠀privately⠀calculating⠀the⠀risk,⠀refuse⠀while⠀wanting⠀to⠀say⠀yes,⠀or⠀say⠀nothing⠀while⠀attention⠀runs⠀over⠀the⠀objects⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Keep⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation;⠀reader⠀exposure⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀inform⠀other⠀characters,⠀whose⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀independent⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀remain⠀available.⠀Do⠀not⠀hide⠀a⠀known⠀culpable⠀thought⠀to⠀protect⠀a⠀later⠀reveal.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀No⠀clue,⠀escalation,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀task⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀offense⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀operation.⠀Follow⠀who⠀handles⠀the⠀property,⠀provides⠀the⠀labor,⠀receives⠀the⠀benefit,⠀or⠀bears⠀the⠀consequence.⠀Make⠀the⠀distribution⠀concrete:⠀one⠀person⠀counts⠀the⠀money,⠀another⠀drives,⠀another⠀waits⠀outside,⠀another⠀signs⠀the⠀form,⠀another⠀answers⠀the⠀phone.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀corrupt⠀institution⠀merely⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀route;⠀use⠀the⠀actual⠀arrangement⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies.\n\nPlace⠀an⠀attributed⠀explanation⠀beside⠀that⠀distribution.⠀Use⠀an⠀actual⠀character⠀account⠀or⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator's⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀practical⠀terms:⠀a⠀fair⠀split,⠀a⠀temporary⠀loan,⠀a⠀family⠀matter,⠀a⠀business⠀expense⠀or⠀a⠀precaution.⠀Keep⠀wording⠀with⠀its⠀source,⠀whether⠀spoken,⠀recorded⠀or⠀private,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀public⠀declaration.⠀The⠀same⠀phrase⠀can⠀recur⠀in⠀different⠀positions:⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀benefits⠀may⠀use⠀it⠀easily,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀bears⠀the⠀consequence⠀may⠀repeat⠀it⠀with⠀strain,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀does⠀the⠀work⠀may⠀quote⠀it⠀without⠀believing⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀participant's⠀actual⠀understanding,⠀including⠀accurate⠀agreement,⠀partial⠀knowledge⠀or⠀a⠀real⠀difference.⠀One⠀may⠀knowingly⠀agree,⠀another⠀may⠀understand⠀only⠀part,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀reject⠀the⠀arrangement⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons.⠀Make⠀those⠀actual⠀positions⠀legible⠀through⠀conduct,⠀speech,⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀supported⠀narrator⠀explanation⠀without⠀assigning⠀a⠀moral⠀condition⠀by⠀tone⠀alone.⠀Satire⠀is⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀situation⠀warrants⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀collective⠀verdict⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀exposure.\n\nKeep⠀accusation,⠀public⠀rationale,⠀and⠀established⠀event⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accuse⠀another⠀of⠀taking⠀too⠀much;⠀the⠀accusation⠀is⠀not⠀proof.⠀A⠀public⠀rationale⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀self-serving;⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀distribution⠀without⠀requiring⠀hypocrisy,⠀while⠀any⠀actual⠀supported⠀judgment⠀remains⠀available.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience,⠀real⠀setting,⠀and⠀narrator⠀ownership.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀the⠀explanation⠀still⠀contested,⠀or⠀the⠀consequence⠀still⠀unfolding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀actual⠀contact,⠀effort,⠀object,⠀or⠀condition⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀offense's⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀or⠀consequence.⠀Write⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀bag,⠀the⠀resistance⠀of⠀the⠀lock,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀solvent,⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes⠀to⠀count⠀the⠀money,⠀the⠀ache⠀after⠀the⠀drive.⠀Do⠀not⠀inventory⠀every⠀physical⠀detail;⠀select⠀particulars⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀account⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀actual⠀relation⠀bear⠀the⠀rhythm,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀action⠀from⠀every⠀detail.\n\nKeep⠀causal⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀direct⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀A⠀character⠀reaches,⠀lifts,⠀carries,⠀waits,⠀checks,⠀returns.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀among⠀actions⠀clear,⠀including⠀independent⠀activity⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀step;⠀relevant⠀context,⠀explanation⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀intervene⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent.⠀When⠀the⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀more⠀room,⠀let⠀the⠀thought⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense;⠀compression⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀ban⠀on⠀necessary⠀explanation.\n\nPlace⠀an⠀actual⠀practical⠀claim⠀beside⠀the⠀handling⠀it⠀describes.⠀A⠀character⠀says⠀the⠀package⠀is⠀sealed;⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀tape⠀lifting⠀at⠀one⠀corner.⠀A⠀character⠀says⠀they⠀checked⠀the⠀route;⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀map⠀still⠀folded⠀on⠀the⠀seat.⠀The⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀handling⠀may⠀match,⠀contradict,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀relation⠀unresolved.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀a⠀defensive⠀interpretation.\n\nRepetition⠀can⠀confirm⠀a⠀method⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀reveal⠀its⠀limits.⠀The⠀same⠀sequence⠀of⠀checking⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀phone,⠀the⠀street⠀can⠀be⠀competence,⠀habit,⠀or⠀the⠀sign⠀of⠀a⠀mistake⠀being⠀repeated.⠀Keep⠀repetition⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀process,⠀with⠀direct⠀explanation⠀available⠀where⠀it⠀contributes⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀restating⠀the⠀pattern.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀sensation,⠀feeling,⠀and⠀reasoning⠀beyond⠀instrumental⠀use.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀cold,⠀remember⠀a⠀previous⠀job,⠀or⠀hesitate⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀immediately⠀change⠀the⠀action.⠀Speech⠀lengths⠀and⠀roughness⠀belong⠀to⠀individual⠀speakers,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀uniform⠀hard⠀style.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀harm⠀and⠀world⠀capabilities⠀without⠀adding⠀violence,⠀taboo⠀inventory,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀tell.⠀End⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀a⠀shock⠀quota.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀actual⠀document⠀forms:⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀work⠀order,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀statement,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀a⠀call.⠀Identify⠀each⠀document's⠀actual⠀author,⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose⠀and⠀composition⠀time⠀where⠀available,⠀marking⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀unknown⠀provenance⠀rather⠀than⠀supplying⠀invented⠀certainty.⠀The⠀form⠀shapes⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out.⠀A⠀receipt's⠀format⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀establish⠀motive;⠀any⠀relevant⠀content⠀still⠀carries⠀the⠀knowledge⠀its⠀actual⠀source⠀supports;⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀in⠀haste⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀one⠀fact⠀the⠀recipient⠀needs.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀record's⠀actual⠀wording⠀and⠀writer⠀register.⠀Keep⠀direct⠀quotations⠀exact.⠀If⠀a⠀practical⠀term⠀recurs,⠀let⠀it⠀recur⠀because⠀the⠀source⠀supports⠀it:⠀the⠀same⠀code⠀on⠀two⠀orders,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀in⠀a⠀warning⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀denial,⠀the⠀same⠀address⠀written⠀by⠀different⠀hands.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀different⠀versions⠀identical⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀pattern.⠀Track⠀real⠀revisions⠀or⠀paraphrases⠀where⠀they⠀occur;⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀qualify⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀without⠀erasing⠀it.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀proposal⠀from⠀an⠀execution,⠀an⠀allegation⠀from⠀established⠀guilt,⠀and⠀a⠀received⠀record⠀from⠀an⠀understood⠀or⠀accepted⠀one.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀request⠀a⠀meeting;⠀the⠀meeting⠀may⠀not⠀occur.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀name⠀a⠀suspect;⠀the⠀name⠀is⠀not⠀proof.⠀A⠀recipient⠀may⠀misread,⠀ignore,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀document⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀document⠀itself⠀does⠀not⠀contain.\n\nLet⠀actual⠀circulation⠀and⠀material⠀context⠀reveal⠀consequences.⠀A⠀document⠀found⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀place,⠀a⠀page⠀missing,⠀a⠀timestamp⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀account,⠀a⠀signature⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀writer's:⠀these⠀are⠀facts⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀automatic⠀contradictions⠀to⠀be⠀resolved.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀missing⠀files⠀or⠀hidden⠀letters⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀reveal.\n\nPreserve⠀live⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀artifacts⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀compose⠀a⠀document⠀while⠀privately⠀knowing⠀more⠀than⠀they⠀write,⠀or⠀receive⠀one⠀while⠀thinking⠀of⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀document⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀Narrator,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀world⠀rules⠀remain⠀intact.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀composition⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀response⠀pending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGive⠀a⠀supported⠀kindness⠀or⠀shared⠀pleasure⠀its⠀particular⠀means⠀and⠀recipient⠀preference⠀while⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀actual⠀world.⠀Write⠀the⠀specific⠀food⠀someone⠀remembers,⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀take⠀their⠀coffee,⠀the⠀blanket⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀place,⠀the⠀route⠀home⠀that⠀avoids⠀a⠀certain⠀corner.⠀Make⠀the⠀care⠀concrete⠀through⠀actual⠀preparation⠀and⠀preference,⠀while⠀allowing⠀direct⠀tenderness⠀or⠀supported⠀narration⠀of⠀kindness⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀order.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀instruction,⠀prepared⠀item,⠀or⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀carry⠀the⠀care⠀through⠀concrete⠀process.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀every⠀time⠀they⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀cup,⠀fold⠀a⠀jacket,⠀or⠀check⠀a⠀lock.⠀Repetition⠀belongs⠀to⠀actual⠀speech,⠀process⠀or⠀narrator⠀attention⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀establish⠀a⠀prior⠀habit;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀guarantee⠀safety⠀or⠀imply⠀a⠀hidden⠀message.⠀The⠀helper⠀is⠀not⠀protective⠀by⠀default;⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀careful,⠀distracted,⠀or⠀complicit⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀offense⠀while⠀still⠀offering⠀the⠀care.\n\nFollow⠀actual⠀reception.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀be⠀enjoyed,⠀declined,⠀or⠀leave⠀someone⠀preoccupied.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀food⠀and⠀say⠀nothing;⠀another⠀may⠀push⠀it⠀away;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀eat⠀while⠀continuing⠀to⠀watch⠀the⠀door.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀gratitude,⠀absolution,⠀confession,⠀or⠀improved⠀safety.⠀The⠀care⠀can⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀the⠀danger⠀can⠀remain⠀real⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀independent⠀motives⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀contract.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀soothed⠀and⠀still⠀afraid,⠀grateful⠀and⠀still⠀planning⠀to⠀leave,⠀comforted⠀and⠀still⠀withholding⠀a⠀fact.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀hold⠀both⠀without⠀resolving⠀them.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀risks⠀and⠀consequences⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀caring⠀interval⠀into⠀a⠀trap.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀cup⠀still⠀warm,⠀the⠀door⠀still⠀unlocked,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀undecided.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀relate⠀an⠀actual⠀act⠀or⠀attributed⠀formulation⠀to⠀its⠀available⠀institutional,⠀commercial,⠀or⠀personal⠀context.⠀A⠀single⠀transaction⠀can⠀open⠀into⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀street,⠀the⠀practice⠀of⠀the⠀trade,⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀lease,⠀or⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀the⠀family.⠀Let⠀the⠀context⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀material⠀without⠀imposing⠀an⠀ancestry⠀survey⠀or⠀moral⠀lecture⠀merely⠀for⠀the⠀form.⠀Relevant⠀history⠀and⠀supported⠀narrator⠀judgment⠀remain⠀available;⠀irrelevant⠀background⠀does⠀not.\n\nLet⠀concrete⠀process⠀and⠀repeated⠀wording⠀make⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀involvement⠀legible.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀as⠀an⠀official⠀form,⠀a⠀shop⠀sign,⠀or⠀a⠀parent's⠀old⠀instruction.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀where⠀the⠀phrase⠀came⠀from⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀in⠀this⠀position⠀without⠀announcing⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trapped⠀by⠀language.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀composed⠀register⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀individual⠀spoken⠀registers;⠀a⠀character's⠀practical⠀sentence⠀may⠀differ⠀or⠀share⠀actual⠀features⠀of⠀that⠀register⠀without⠀being⠀rewritten⠀to⠀sound⠀uniformly⠀formal.\n\nA⠀public⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀accurate⠀yet⠀incomplete⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀experience.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀sequence⠀without⠀exposing⠀hypocrisy⠀as⠀a⠀required⠀outcome.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀public⠀account,⠀resist⠀it,⠀or⠀simply⠀notice⠀what⠀it⠀leaves⠀out.⠀No⠀confession⠀or⠀correction⠀is⠀owed.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation.⠀The⠀formal⠀distance⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀feeling;⠀it⠀frames⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀judge⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits,⠀with⠀the⠀scope⠀and⠀certainty⠀its⠀actual⠀grounds⠀support;⠀a⠀broader⠀established⠀judgment⠀is⠀available⠀without⠀being⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Preserve⠀source⠀knowledge,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀active⠀ownership.⠀The⠀contextual⠀development⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished:⠀the⠀paragraph⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀in⠀circulation,⠀the⠀consequence⠀still⠀accumulating,⠀or⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀still⠀unspoken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀present⠀storytelling⠀as⠀an⠀intervention:⠀name⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀listeners,⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀reason⠀they⠀are⠀together⠀now.⠀The⠀reason⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀favor,⠀a⠀share,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀requested⠀silence,⠀or⠀simply⠀company⠀and⠀remembrance,⠀but⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀telling⠀matter.⠀Give⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀the⠀offense⠀through⠀exact⠀practical⠀steps⠀and⠀quantities⠀the⠀teller⠀selects.⠀Repeat⠀one⠀procedural⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀number⠀the⠀teller⠀owns—the⠀same⠀route,⠀the⠀same⠀count,⠀the⠀same⠀instruction—and⠀let⠀the⠀repetition⠀follow⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀purpose.⠀It⠀is⠀selection,⠀not⠀proof:⠀what⠀returns⠀may⠀be⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀needs⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀believe,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀already⠀knows,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀stop⠀returning⠀to,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀desired⠀concession.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀alive⠀while⠀the⠀account⠀runs.⠀Let⠀listeners⠀interrupt⠀about⠀timing,⠀access,⠀or⠀who⠀was⠀there;⠀let⠀another⠀stay⠀quiet⠀because⠀they⠀were⠀present⠀or⠀already⠀understand.⠀Render⠀each⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀during⠀the⠀telling,⠀including⠀the⠀teller's⠀where⠀that⠀access⠀is⠀permitted:⠀dry⠀mouth⠀before⠀a⠀particular⠀detail,⠀the⠀private⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀leaves⠀out,⠀the⠀physical⠀work⠀of⠀holding⠀a⠀glass⠀or⠀a⠀gaze.⠀Hesitation⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀a⠀lie,⠀and⠀a⠀pause⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀guilt.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀partial,⠀or⠀wrong⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀person.\n\nLet⠀the⠀material⠀detail⠀of⠀the⠀tale⠀clarify⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀human⠀aftermath⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀fresh⠀outward⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀occasion.⠀Allow⠀the⠀listeners'⠀responses⠀to⠀follow⠀their⠀own⠀experience⠀and⠀interest,⠀including⠀simple⠀attention,⠀feeling,⠀or⠀practical⠀movement⠀such⠀as⠀checking⠀a⠀phone⠀or⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀stay.⠀A⠀shared⠀understanding⠀may⠀form⠀without⠀a⠀confession,⠀and⠀a⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀teller⠀role⠀unless⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀makes⠀them⠀the⠀same.⠀The⠀tale⠀or⠀the⠀outer⠀action⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀route.⠀Choose⠀an⠀actual⠀available⠀record⠀whose⠀purpose⠀or⠀use⠀touches⠀the⠀offense:⠀a⠀ledger⠀page⠀kept⠀by⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀work⠀order⠀signed⠀before⠀the⠀act,⠀a⠀receipt⠀for⠀material,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀log⠀that⠀makes⠀an⠀alibi⠀or⠀an⠀absence⠀concrete,⠀a⠀police⠀file⠀whose⠀form⠀excludes⠀the⠀motive.⠀Establish⠀the⠀record's⠀writer,⠀composition⠀time,⠀and⠀purpose⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀makes⠀them⠀known;⠀when⠀the⠀origin⠀is⠀uncertain,⠀keep⠀that⠀uncertainty⠀visible⠀instead⠀of⠀inventing⠀a⠀date⠀or⠀author.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀record's⠀exact⠀wording⠀beside⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀recollection⠀of⠀the⠀related⠀circumstances.⠀Let⠀the⠀record's⠀quantities,⠀procedural⠀terms,⠀or⠀repeated⠀fragments⠀carry⠀the⠀Palahniuk⠀rhythm⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀register,⠀official⠀or⠀personal.⠀Relate⠀that⠀wording⠀to⠀the⠀lived⠀process⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀attention⠀falls:⠀the⠀hands⠀that⠀counted⠀the⠀cash,⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀while⠀the⠀form⠀was⠀filled,⠀the⠀detail⠀the⠀field⠀could⠀not⠀hold,⠀the⠀later⠀cost⠀the⠀record⠀does⠀not⠀name.⠀Agreement⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀memory⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀either⠀complete,⠀and⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀lie.\n\nKeep⠀separate⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀was⠀recorded,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀learned⠀later.⠀A⠀known⠀culprit⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀act⠀exactly⠀while⠀the⠀record⠀is⠀flat⠀and⠀partial,⠀or⠀an⠀innocent⠀participant⠀may⠀be⠀implicated⠀by⠀a⠀form's⠀empty⠀field.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀recorder⠀or⠀participant⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀supplies⠀different⠀people.⠀Render⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀document:⠀the⠀physical⠀sensation⠀of⠀handling⠀the⠀paper,⠀the⠀private⠀shock⠀of⠀recognizing⠀a⠀number,⠀the⠀irritation⠀or⠀relief⠀at⠀what⠀the⠀form⠀omits,⠀the⠀unspoken⠀reason⠀the⠀recollection⠀avoids⠀one⠀line.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀record⠀still⠀open⠀and⠀the⠀recollection⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀no⠀new⠀file,⠀investigation,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀corrected⠀belief⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀the⠀supplied⠀old⠀authority⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀operation⠀around⠀the⠀crime:⠀a⠀property⠀line⠀that⠀determined⠀entry,⠀a⠀permission⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀act⠀possible,⠀a⠀role⠀that⠀gave⠀access,⠀an⠀obligation⠀that⠀demanded⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀maintained⠀place⠀where⠀evidence⠀or⠀money⠀moved.⠀Give⠀the⠀authority's⠀attributed⠀public⠀language—the⠀family⠀name,⠀the⠀founding⠀rule,⠀the⠀ceremonial⠀phrase—and⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀exact⠀material⠀work.⠀Show⠀the⠀key⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀turned⠀twice,⠀the⠀invoice⠀filed⠀under⠀the⠀dead⠀founder's⠀name,⠀the⠀repeated⠀instruction⠀that⠀keeps⠀an⠀old⠀arrangement⠀running,⠀the⠀dust⠀that⠀collects⠀on⠀the⠀ritual⠀object.⠀The⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀legitimate,⠀implicated,⠀indifferent,⠀or⠀decaying;⠀atmosphere⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀answer⠀that.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Palahniuk⠀profile's⠀hard⠀rhythms⠀carry⠀the⠀maintenance⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀and⠀its⠀cover.⠀Use⠀obsessive⠀particulars⠀as⠀lived⠀process:⠀the⠀schedule⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀kept,⠀the⠀count⠀that⠀must⠀match,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀sticks⠀unless⠀lifted.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀term⠀or⠀phrase⠀because⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀uses⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀acquire⠀weight⠀through⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀decay⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀secret.⠀Place⠀private⠀desire⠀beside⠀public⠀obligation:⠀the⠀relief⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀the⠀resentment⠀at⠀a⠀ritual⠀performed⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀pays⠀attention,⠀the⠀want⠀that⠀has⠀nothing⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀institution.⠀Render⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀not⠀just⠀the⠀narrator's⠀visible⠀thoughts,⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀mind⠀meets⠀the⠀inherited⠀structure.\n\nKeep⠀social⠀presentation⠀contingent.⠀A⠀mask⠀may⠀hold⠀through⠀the⠀whole⠀scene,⠀slip⠀only⠀in⠀a⠀trusted⠀moment,⠀or⠀be⠀set⠀down⠀voluntarily⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀chooses⠀to;⠀no⠀unmasking,⠀corruption,⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀violent⠀confrontation⠀is⠀owed.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀offense⠀itself⠀from⠀the⠀authority⠀around⠀it:⠀the⠀authority⠀may⠀enable,⠀ignore,⠀punish,⠀or⠀profit⠀from⠀the⠀crime,⠀but⠀its⠀simple⠀presence⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀someone⠀guilty⠀or⠀protected.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀established⠀world⠀powers⠀such⠀as⠀magic,⠀institutional⠀reach,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀status⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀them.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀still⠀in⠀place,⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀still⠀running,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀still⠀unspoken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Establish⠀the⠀source's⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world:⠀participant,⠀victim,⠀bystander,⠀bearer⠀of⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀family⠀member⠀who⠀learned⠀later.⠀Name⠀the⠀audience,⠀occasion,⠀and⠀purpose⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀writing,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀formal⠀complaint,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help,⠀an⠀explanation⠀to⠀someone⠀owed⠀money,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀record⠀meant⠀for⠀no⠀one.⠀Keep⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀delivery⠀or⠀composition⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀the⠀events.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀testifier⠀or⠀a⠀separate⠀authorized⠀narrator⠀receiving⠀or⠀presenting⠀the⠀account;⠀preserve⠀that⠀separation⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀contract⠀supplies.\n\nLet⠀the⠀source⠀select⠀exact⠀practical⠀steps⠀and⠀repeated⠀wording⠀as⠀Palahniuk's⠀obsessive⠀particulars:⠀the⠀route⠀walked,⠀the⠀amount⠀counted,⠀the⠀phrase⠀used⠀to⠀refuse⠀or⠀agree,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀always⠀locked.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀did,⠀what⠀they⠀received⠀as⠀report,⠀what⠀they⠀inferred,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀later.⠀Candid⠀accuracy,⠀strategic⠀omission,⠀or⠀error⠀must⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀person;⠀neither⠀confession⠀nor⠀self-deception⠀is⠀a⠀default.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀precise⠀about⠀one⠀detail⠀and⠀vague⠀about⠀another⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀limit⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀source⠀can⠀attest,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀a⠀planted⠀gap.\n\nRender⠀the⠀audience's⠀real⠀reception⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀credibility⠀verdict⠀or⠀concession.⠀Someone⠀may⠀believe⠀the⠀account,⠀doubt⠀it,⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀subject;⠀their⠀response⠀is⠀an⠀action,⠀not⠀a⠀score⠀for⠀the⠀testimony.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀spoken⠀or⠀recorded⠀account:⠀the⠀private⠀memory⠀the⠀testimony⠀cannot⠀hold,⠀the⠀physical⠀sensation⠀during⠀a⠀pause,⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀speech.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀setting,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀ownership⠀rules;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀telling⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀boundary,⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀need⠀not⠀settle⠀the⠀truth⠀by⠀the⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Follow⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀attention,⠀recollection,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀feeling⠀around⠀an⠀act,⠀request,⠀or⠀consequence⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀offense.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀culprit,⠀accomplice,⠀victim,⠀investigator,⠀or⠀bystander,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀follow⠀that⠀person's⠀mind⠀rather⠀than⠀perform⠀the⠀role⠀publicly.⠀Let⠀Palahniuk's⠀exact⠀procedural⠀detail⠀enter⠀the⠀self-account⠀as⠀lived⠀material:⠀an⠀instruction⠀repeated⠀until⠀it⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀day,⠀a⠀quantity⠀remembered⠀because⠀it⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀right,⠀a⠀practical⠀phrase⠀that⠀returns⠀when⠀the⠀person⠀tries⠀to⠀explain⠀what⠀happened.⠀The⠀repetition⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀a⠀coping⠀mechanism,⠀a⠀ritual⠀of⠀denial,⠀or⠀a⠀false⠀belief;⠀it⠀follows⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀habit⠀and⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀four⠀lines⠀distinct:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀thought,⠀what⠀they⠀said,⠀what⠀others⠀observed⠀them⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀facts⠀establish.⠀A⠀known⠀culprit⠀can⠀think⠀about⠀the⠀act⠀directly⠀without⠀losing⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀to⠀preserve⠀a⠀reveal.⠀A⠀private⠀realization⠀cannot⠀be⠀retroactively⠀inserted⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive,⠀and⠀later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀not⠀become⠀an⠀earlier⠀feeling.⠀Others⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀access⠀and⠀motives;⠀this⠀regional⠀form⠀grants⠀no⠀additional⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀beyond⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀contract.\n\nGive⠀private⠀experience⠀its⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀extent,⠀including⠀feeling⠀without⠀action:⠀the⠀quiet⠀relief⠀of⠀a⠀task⠀finished,⠀the⠀irritation⠀at⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀assumes⠀too⠀much,⠀the⠀unspoken⠀wish⠀to⠀leave,⠀the⠀small⠀physical⠀sensation⠀that⠀accompanies⠀a⠀memory.⠀No⠀realization,⠀reserve,⠀or⠀changed⠀conduct⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀form.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀holding⠀the⠀practical⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀feeling⠀unresolved.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀rules;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀diary⠀entries⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀presentation⠀or⠀world⠀supplies⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀through⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Choose⠀one⠀actual⠀act,⠀object,⠀or⠀quoted⠀procedure⠀from⠀the⠀offense⠀that⠀multiple⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀share:⠀the⠀same⠀delivery⠀route⠀described⠀by⠀the⠀driver⠀and⠀the⠀recipient,⠀the⠀same⠀serial⠀number⠀remembered⠀by⠀two⠀people⠀for⠀different⠀reasons,⠀the⠀same⠀instruction⠀repeated⠀in⠀a⠀kitchen⠀and⠀a⠀courtroom,⠀the⠀same⠀amount⠀counted⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀took⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀found⠀it⠀short.⠀Mark⠀each⠀speaker⠀or⠀source⠀and⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀their⠀telling⠀or⠀experience,⠀so⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀remains⠀stable⠀beneath⠀the⠀reordered⠀presentation.⠀Keep⠀physical⠀and⠀material⠀detail⠀exact⠀rather⠀than⠀atmospheric.\n\nUse⠀the⠀hard⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀narrative⠀arrangement⠀itself.⠀Select⠀precise⠀particulars⠀from⠀each⠀account⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀quoted⠀speech⠀or⠀written⠀register,⠀so⠀a⠀participant,⠀witness,⠀or⠀later⠀recipient⠀does⠀not⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀others.⠀The⠀shared⠀phrase⠀may⠀carry⠀different⠀significance⠀for⠀each⠀while⠀they⠀agree⠀on⠀the⠀facts:⠀one⠀remembers⠀the⠀number⠀because⠀it⠀bought⠀a⠀ticket,⠀another⠀because⠀it⠀proved⠀a⠀loss.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀knew⠀then;⠀later⠀information⠀cannot⠀become⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive⠀or⠀recollection.⠀Any⠀private⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀render⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀character⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀recurrence⠀into⠀a⠀voice⠀quota⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀revised⠀meaning.⠀One⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀where⠀another⠀begins,⠀and⠀the⠀interrupted⠀or⠀reversed⠀order⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀relationships⠀and⠀the⠀available⠀material,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀to⠀solve⠀the⠀crime.⠀No⠀final⠀authoritative⠀version⠀or⠀completed⠀comparison⠀is⠀owed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀abilities⠀and⠀ownership⠀rules;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀magic,⠀the⠀marvelous,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀them.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀accounts⠀still⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀left⠀holding⠀the⠀difference.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀crime⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀name⠀the⠀actual⠀people,⠀place,⠀and⠀current⠀concern.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀an⠀offender,⠀victim,⠀investigator,⠀or⠀bystander,⠀but⠀the⠀opening⠀orientation⠀must⠀make⠀clear⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀matter⠀they⠀are⠀dealing⠀with—a⠀job⠀before⠀the⠀act,⠀a⠀count⠀after⠀it,⠀a⠀request⠀to⠀stay⠀quiet,⠀or⠀a⠀visit⠀that⠀raises⠀a⠀problem.⠀Introduce⠀unfamiliar⠀roles,⠀tools,⠀or⠀procedures⠀only⠀where⠀understanding,⠀preparation,⠀or⠀meaningful⠀context⠀requires⠀them,⠀and⠀explain⠀them⠀through⠀concrete⠀use:⠀what⠀the⠀job⠀is,⠀what⠀the⠀tool⠀does,⠀why⠀the⠀timing⠀matters.⠀Do⠀not⠀stage⠀a⠀demonstration⠀merely⠀to⠀explain;⠀let⠀the⠀explanation⠀sit⠀inside⠀the⠀action.\n\nUse⠀flexible⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀real⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀private⠀attention.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀from⠀the⠀street⠀to⠀the⠀back⠀room,⠀from⠀the⠀phone⠀to⠀the⠀door,⠀from⠀the⠀plan⠀to⠀the⠀attempt,⠀from⠀the⠀body⠀to⠀the⠀locked⠀drawer.⠀Move⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀physical⠀cues⠀and⠀direct⠀verbs.⠀Let⠀Palahniuk's⠀exact⠀phrasing⠀carry⠀the⠀practical⠀sequence:⠀a⠀repeated⠀instruction⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath⠀recognizable—the⠀same⠀two⠀knocks,⠀the⠀same⠀amount⠀held⠀back,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀before⠀a⠀lie—without⠀becoming⠀a⠀catchphrase⠀at⠀every⠀beat.⠀Select⠀the⠀repetition⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀habit⠀and⠀the⠀crime's⠀actual⠀procedure.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀world⠀capabilities.⠀Private⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀flat⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀chosen⠀viewpoint,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀light-novel⠀voice.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀readable,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀simplify⠀the⠀motive,⠀cut⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀or⠀force⠀comedy.⠀No⠀young⠀cast,⠀comic⠀relief,⠀immediate⠀response,⠀or⠀closing⠀threat⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀form.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀sequence⠀still⠀underway⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀reaction⠀still⠀settling,⠀without⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀quota.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀concrete⠀practical⠀particular⠀from⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation:⠀a⠀repeated⠀instruction,⠀a⠀job⠀or⠀object⠀name,⠀a⠀sound⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀that⠀returns⠀with⠀it.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀passage⠀to⠀that⠀particular⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀unfold⠀through⠀its⠀literal⠀repetition,⠀not⠀through⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀crime.\n\nLet⠀the⠀selected⠀particular⠀govern⠀syntax⠀and⠀sound.⠀When⠀it⠀returns⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀moment⠀in⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀or⠀consequence,⠀allow⠀the⠀rhythm⠀to⠀shift⠀the⠀felt⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀unchanged⠀phrase.⠀Use⠀short⠀hard⠀clauses⠀to⠀carry⠀routine⠀handling⠀and⠀longer⠀sentences⠀to⠀follow⠀a⠀physical⠀sequence⠀or⠀intrusive⠀bodily⠀memory.⠀Place⠀plain⠀statements⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling⠀beside⠀shaped⠀language;⠀the⠀image⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀offense,⠀confess⠀it,⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀clue.⠀If⠀a⠀comparison⠀appears,⠀keep⠀it⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations⠀and⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀develop⠀attention⠀already⠀present,⠀not⠀to⠀create⠀new⠀world⠀facts.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀actual⠀acts,⠀physical⠀causes,⠀and⠀consequences⠀legible.⠀The⠀lyrical⠀treatment⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀the⠀particular⠀without⠀changing⠀fictional⠀duration⠀by⠀length⠀alone.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀about⠀who⠀did⠀what,⠀what⠀was⠀handled,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀Retain⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀ownership;⠀render⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀nonspoken⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀with⠀each⠀cast⠀member's⠀individual⠀diction.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀the⠀act,⠀account,⠀or⠀private⠀feeling⠀is⠀still⠀underway;⠀no⠀refrain⠀count,⠀insight,⠀new⠀clue,⠀or⠀outward⠀return⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nOpen⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀or⠀concern⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation:⠀an⠀instruction⠀still⠀used,⠀an⠀object⠀no⠀longer⠀handled,⠀a⠀bodily⠀memory,⠀a⠀practical⠀phrase⠀now⠀spoken⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrative⠀move⠀associatively⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀connected⠀with⠀that⠀detail.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀recoverable⠀throughout⠀the⠀movement,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀leave⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator's⠀access⠀or⠀contradict⠀established⠀history.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀earlier⠀person's⠀actual⠀wants⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀remembered⠀pleasure⠀may⠀remain⠀genuine⠀beside⠀present⠀loss⠀or⠀complication;⠀present⠀judgment⠀may⠀appear,⠀but⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀present⠀or⠀later⠀and⠀never⠀rewrite⠀the⠀earlier⠀experience⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀cost⠀had⠀always⠀been⠀understood.⠀Let⠀a⠀familiar⠀instruction⠀return⠀through⠀performance,⠀omission,⠀or⠀private⠀remembering.⠀The⠀return⠀need⠀not⠀recreate⠀the⠀original⠀scene;⠀it⠀may⠀register⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀hand,⠀a⠀missing⠀step,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀where⠀the⠀phrase⠀once⠀belonged.\n\nGive⠀the⠀practical⠀process⠀concrete⠀material⠀weight,⠀including⠀the⠀objects,⠀sequence,⠀and⠀consequences⠀still⠀present.⠀Where⠀actual⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀matter,⠀specify⠀them.⠀Where⠀circumstances⠀persist,⠀let⠀them⠀persist:⠀a⠀tool⠀no⠀longer⠀used,⠀a⠀habit⠀continuing⠀without⠀its⠀original⠀purpose,⠀an⠀arrangement⠀now⠀carried⠀out⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Render⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀feeling⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀contract.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀close⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀consequence⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀remain⠀side⠀by⠀side;⠀no⠀invented⠀innocence,⠀confession,⠀worsening⠀life,⠀punishment,⠀or⠀completed⠀moral⠀recognition⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀route⠀concretely.⠀Choose⠀one⠀supported⠀concern⠀belonging⠀to⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation:⠀a⠀job,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀property,⠀information,⠀or⠀an⠀obligation.⠀Write⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀linked⠀encounters⠀in⠀which⠀this⠀same⠀concern⠀passes⠀from⠀one⠀actual⠀person⠀to⠀another⠀within⠀the⠀milieu.\n\nGive⠀each⠀encounter⠀its⠀own⠀practical⠀register.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀names⠀the⠀work,⠀what⠀they⠀count,⠀what⠀they⠀refuse⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀in⠀return⠀for⠀involvement.⠀A⠀repeated⠀account⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀thing⠀is⠀done⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀by⠀one⠀person,⠀repurposed⠀by⠀another,⠀or⠀ignored⠀by⠀a⠀third.⠀Develop⠀that⠀variation⠀from⠀each⠀participant's⠀actual⠀situation⠀and⠀interest,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀mechanical⠀obstruction⠀at⠀every⠀stop.\n\nPreserve⠀continuity⠀of⠀resources,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀consequences.⠀What⠀is⠀spent,⠀learned,⠀or⠀lost⠀in⠀one⠀encounter⠀carries⠀into⠀the⠀next.⠀Let⠀the⠀Palahniuk⠀profile's⠀hard⠀rhythms⠀and⠀obsessive⠀particulars⠀give⠀each⠀exchange⠀concrete⠀texture:⠀a⠀repeated⠀rule⠀or⠀fragment⠀may⠀pass⠀between⠀encounters⠀and⠀change⠀its⠀application⠀without⠀losing⠀its⠀literal⠀source.⠀Keep⠀individual⠀diction⠀and⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀practical⠀calculation,⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world,⠀and⠀ownership⠀contract.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀an⠀encounter⠀or⠀between⠀them;⠀no⠀escalating⠀humiliation,⠀completed⠀pursuit,⠀or⠀exposure⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀no⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses⠀for⠀the⠀current⠀passage.⠀Keep⠀the⠀particular⠀act,⠀the⠀practical⠀term,⠀and⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀contextual⠀facts⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀involvement⠀or⠀consequence.⠀If⠀a⠀person⠀gives⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀happened,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀actual⠀handling⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀comparison.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀fit⠀the⠀facts,⠀differ⠀from⠀them,⠀or⠀address⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀them;⠀let⠀the⠀selected⠀wording⠀and⠀observable⠀conduct⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀inferable.\n\nRemove⠀redundant⠀judgment⠀and⠀procedure⠀restatement.⠀Do⠀not⠀remove⠀meaningful⠀reasoning,⠀feeling,⠀or⠀recurrence.⠀An⠀authorized⠀person⠀may⠀know⠀exactly⠀what⠀they⠀did;⠀do⠀not⠀hide⠀that⠀knowledge⠀to⠀manufacture⠀a⠀puzzle.⠀A⠀repeated⠀practical⠀phrase⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀Palahniuk⠀profile's⠀obsessive⠀particularity⠀without⠀being⠀explained⠀each⠀time.⠀Let⠀its⠀return⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to,⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀refuses⠀to⠀say.\n\nMake⠀the⠀offense⠀legible⠀through⠀those⠀selected⠀particulars⠀and⠀any⠀relevant⠀context⠀or⠀summary.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀certainty⠀about⠀an⠀unknown⠀event,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀duplicate⠀an⠀account⠀merely⠀for⠀emphasis.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀world,⠀and⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀rules.⠀Speech⠀lengths⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀speakers.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀single⠀sufficient⠀action⠀or⠀exchange;⠀no⠀terse⠀cast,⠀withheld⠀emotion,⠀forced⠀ambiguity,⠀small⠀outcome,⠀or⠀deflating⠀final⠀line⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀within⠀an⠀actual⠀criminal⠀situation⠀in⠀scene.⠀Write⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose,⠀moving⠀without⠀announcement⠀among⠀conduct,⠀speech,⠀observation,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience.⠀Carry⠀the⠀passage⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀process:⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀prepared,⠀handled,⠀said,⠀or⠀avoided.⠀Use⠀the⠀Palahniuk⠀profile's⠀hard⠀rhythms⠀and⠀obsessive⠀particulars⠀to⠀give⠀that⠀process⠀its⠀specific⠀texture,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀act⠀serve⠀a⠀self-exposure⠀or⠀defensive⠀rule.\n\nKeep⠀execution,⠀allegation,⠀evidence,⠀and⠀personal⠀explanation⠀distinct⠀where⠀relevant.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀describe⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀with⠀certainty,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀account⠀that⠀leaves⠀out⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀shows.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀culprit⠀while⠀the⠀story⠀still⠀turns⠀on⠀exposure,⠀relationships,⠀or⠀aftermath.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀personal⠀account⠀to⠀match⠀or⠀oppose⠀the⠀facts⠀by⠀default;⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀determine⠀the⠀relation.\n\nLet⠀an⠀actual⠀repeated⠀formulation⠀show⠀how⠀someone⠀explains⠀their⠀part.⠀The⠀repetition⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀rule⠀they⠀follow,⠀a⠀phrase⠀they⠀use⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀work⠀bearable,⠀or⠀a⠀fragment⠀that⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀consequence⠀appears.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀feeling,⠀independent⠀aims,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world,⠀and⠀ownership⠀contracts.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup;⠀no⠀perpetual⠀threat,⠀investigative⠀puzzle,⠀new⠀crime,⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀deserved⠀punishment⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀directly⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise,⠀including⠀group⠀bonds⠀or⠀new⠀acquaintances,⠀and⠀place⠀them⠀within⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation.⠀Make⠀the⠀bond⠀particular⠀through⠀how⠀participants⠀handle⠀an⠀offense's⠀requests,⠀shared⠀language,⠀and⠀consequences.⠀Follow⠀the⠀actual⠀order⠀of⠀private⠀consideration⠀and⠀practical⠀exchange:⠀what⠀someone⠀asks,⠀accepts,⠀refuses,⠀delays,⠀or⠀calls⠀the⠀arrangement.⠀An⠀unspoken⠀concern⠀or⠀continuing⠀private⠀feeling⠀may⠀remain⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀public⠀step.\n\nUse⠀familiar⠀instructions⠀or⠀repeated⠀phrases⠀only⠀where⠀actual⠀shared⠀history⠀supports⠀them.⠀A⠀first⠀instruction⠀or⠀new⠀practical⠀accommodation⠀may⠀arise⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀without⠀an⠀invented⠀shared⠀past.⠀Let⠀the⠀Palahniuk⠀profile's⠀obsessive⠀particulars⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀private⠀language:⠀a⠀rule⠀for⠀how⠀a⠀job⠀is⠀done,⠀a⠀fragment⠀that⠀marks⠀an⠀old⠀argument,⠀a⠀practical⠀term⠀that⠀now⠀carries⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀What⠀one⠀calls⠀help,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀responsibility⠀may⠀fit⠀or⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀other's⠀understanding.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀betrayal⠀or⠀unequal⠀knowledge.\n\nKeep⠀actual⠀permissions,⠀actions,⠀and⠀private⠀meanings⠀distinct.⠀One⠀participant's⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀include⠀care,⠀resentment,⠀relief,⠀or⠀calculation⠀without⠀the⠀other⠀knowing⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀rules⠀without⠀making⠀thoughts⠀prove⠀chemistry.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀remains⠀unsettled;⠀no⠀shared⠀history⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀devotion,⠀no⠀healing⠀scene⠀as⠀payoff,⠀and⠀no⠀final⠀reconciliation⠀are⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀criminal⠀act,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀consequence⠀a⠀deliberate⠀retold⠀opening⠀with⠀compact⠀declarations.⠀Then⠀unfold⠀the⠀practical⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀account⠀specific:⠀the⠀exact⠀means,⠀the⠀objects⠀handled,⠀the⠀timing,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀behind⠀the⠀attributed⠀reputation.⠀The⠀retold⠀opening⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator⠀or⠀to⠀a⠀sourced⠀speaker⠀within⠀the⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀legendary⠀title⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀declaration⠀float⠀free⠀of⠀its⠀source.\n\nUse⠀sourced⠀repeated⠀wording⠀where⠀remembrance⠀or⠀attention⠀returns.⠀Let⠀a⠀phrase⠀recur⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀but⠀keep⠀its⠀literal⠀source⠀and⠀meaning⠀intact.⠀A⠀public⠀designation⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀partial,⠀or⠀mistaken⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀real⠀sources.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀deed's⠀actual⠀scale:⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀theft,⠀a⠀beating,⠀or⠀a⠀killing⠀remains⠀what⠀it⠀was.⠀Any⠀praise⠀or⠀condemnation⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀speaker⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrator,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀impersonal⠀communal⠀verdict.\n\nWhere⠀dialogue⠀actually⠀occurs,⠀let⠀it⠀meet⠀the⠀retelling⠀in⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀register.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀correct⠀one⠀detail,⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀attend⠀elsewhere.⠀The⠀Palahniuk⠀profile's⠀hard⠀rhythm⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀repeated⠀practical⠀wording⠀of⠀the⠀work⠀itself.⠀Keep⠀original⠀knowledge⠀and⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀later⠀telling.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀can⠀arrive⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀act⠀or⠀account;⠀no⠀next⠀deed⠀or⠀communal⠀verdict⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀an⠀essay⠀that⠀tests⠀one⠀practical⠀claim⠀against⠀one⠀case.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀claim⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀working⠀words:⠀how⠀the⠀cut⠀gets⠀divided⠀and⠀why⠀that⠀way⠀is⠀fair,⠀what⠀an⠀accomplice⠀is⠀still⠀owed⠀after⠀the⠀job⠀went⠀wrong,⠀which⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement⠀the⠀narrator⠀was⠀actually⠀responsible⠀for,⠀how⠀a⠀debt⠀like⠀this⠀gets⠀collected.⠀Give⠀the⠀claim⠀its⠀exact⠀wording,⠀owner,⠀and⠀scope;⠀it⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀fragment⠀or⠀a⠀provisional⠀formulation⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀how⠀this⠀narrator⠀actually⠀talks,⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀finished⠀sentence⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.\n\nSet⠀the⠀claim⠀beside⠀one⠀case⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀legitimately⠀reach:⠀remembered⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀part⠀in⠀the⠀offense,⠀reported⠀by⠀another⠀participant,⠀or⠀explicitly⠀hypothetical⠀—⠀a⠀case⠀constructed⠀to⠀see⠀whether⠀the⠀rule⠀holds.⠀Label⠀the⠀constructed⠀case⠀as⠀constructed;⠀do⠀not⠀dress⠀it⠀up⠀as⠀memory⠀or⠀manufacture⠀a⠀detail⠀whose⠀only⠀purpose⠀is⠀defeating⠀the⠀claim.⠀Keep⠀the⠀case⠀concrete:⠀the⠀night⠀the⠀procedure⠀was⠀followed,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀repeated⠀the⠀rule⠀back,⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀arrangement⠀held⠀or⠀visibly⠀stopped⠀holding.⠀Let⠀the⠀case⠀land⠀where⠀it⠀lands⠀—⠀confirm⠀the⠀claim⠀through⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀matches,⠀qualify⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀limit⠀the⠀claim⠀never⠀covered,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀open⠀through⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀yet⠀account⠀for.⠀Situate⠀the⠀case⠀in⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied,⠀without⠀reaching⠀for⠀stock⠀Nordic⠀bleakness⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀not⠀established.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀claim⠀when⠀the⠀argument⠀reaches⠀that⠀point.⠀The⠀same⠀words⠀may⠀now⠀sound⠀like⠀a⠀warning,⠀an⠀alibi,⠀a⠀habit,⠀or⠀a⠀question;⠀the⠀wording⠀can⠀stay⠀exactly⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀while⠀its⠀weight⠀shifts,⠀or⠀stay⠀flat⠀and⠀unchanged.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀recantation,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀verdict.⠀Let⠀private⠀feeling⠀run⠀beside⠀the⠀argument⠀—⠀fear⠀of⠀being⠀named,⠀relief⠀at⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀arrived,⠀the⠀body's⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀work⠀—⠀without⠀having⠀to⠀serve⠀it.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀comparison⠀remains⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀public⠀sequence⠀through⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀material⠀while⠀keeping⠀any⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀channel.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀time⠀or⠀place⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀for⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard,⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀for⠀every⠀line.⠀Let⠀the⠀practical⠀rule⠀that⠀governs⠀the⠀work⠀—⠀who⠀carries⠀what,⠀who⠀talks⠀if⠀anyone⠀gets⠀stopped,⠀how⠀the⠀take⠀gets⠀counted⠀—⠀appear⠀in⠀different⠀sourced⠀contexts:⠀spoken⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀gives⠀it,⠀repeated⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀follows⠀it,⠀quoted⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀or⠀read⠀from⠀a⠀record.⠀A⠀supported⠀cut⠀or⠀a⠀same-scene⠀juxtaposition⠀can⠀relate⠀those⠀actual⠀occasions⠀without⠀starting⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀for⠀each.⠀Voice-over⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀explicit⠀connection⠀when⠀separately⠀authorized;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀container⠀for⠀private⠀experience.\n\nKeep⠀montage⠀distinct⠀from⠀elapsed⠀events.⠀A⠀montage⠀may⠀gather⠀successive,⠀simultaneous,⠀or⠀revisited⠀events⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀real⠀omitted⠀interval⠀and⠀its⠀consequences,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀cut⠀imply⠀that⠀one⠀scene⠀caused⠀another⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀chronology⠀and⠀known⠀facts⠀support⠀the⠀connection.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀public⠀conduct⠀establishes⠀from⠀what⠀it⠀suggests.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀seen⠀taking⠀money,⠀repeating⠀an⠀order,⠀or⠀standing⠀where⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀be;⠀what⠀that⠀establishes⠀follows⠀the⠀available⠀facts,⠀sources,⠀and⠀narrator⠀permissions.⠀Appearance⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀motive⠀or⠀guilt,⠀while⠀directly⠀established⠀wrongdoing⠀need⠀not⠀wait⠀for⠀invented⠀corroboration.⠀Full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀voice-over⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀other⠀characters⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀world⠀contracts.⠀End⠀on⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀required⠀reaction⠀shot,⠀violent⠀cut,⠀or⠀completed⠀disclosure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nMake⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀legible⠀before⠀it⠀matters:⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀an⠀entrance,⠀hear⠀a⠀line,⠀reach⠀the⠀object,⠀or⠀leave⠀without⠀being⠀noticed.⠀Let⠀the⠀practical⠀business⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀move⠀through⠀that⠀space⠀—⠀a⠀character⠀repeating⠀the⠀rule⠀for⠀the⠀split⠀while⠀counting⠀the⠀money⠀into⠀shares,⠀standing⠀where⠀a⠀warning⠀cannot⠀be⠀heard,⠀sitting⠀through⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀can⠀safely⠀say.\n\nWhere⠀repeated⠀wording⠀is⠀actually⠀spoken,⠀make⠀its⠀public⠀occasion⠀legible;⠀private⠀recurrence⠀stays⠀in⠀its⠀separately⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀channel.⠀The⠀same⠀rule⠀can⠀be⠀spoken⠀as⠀a⠀promise,⠀quoted⠀back⠀as⠀a⠀threat,⠀or⠀answered⠀with⠀the⠀exact⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀agreement.⠀Let⠀the⠀repetition⠀stay⠀apt⠀or⠀meet⠀a⠀changed⠀circumstance⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀prop⠀to⠀fail,⠀a⠀plan⠀to⠀collapse,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀to⠀arrive.⠀Supported⠀offstage⠀events⠀and⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀remain⠀real⠀—⠀the⠀job⠀that⠀happened⠀elsewhere,⠀the⠀person⠀already⠀paid⠀off⠀—⠀without⠀dragging⠀every⠀cause⠀onto⠀the⠀stage.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought;⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀private⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀world⠀rules.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀negotiation,⠀known⠀participation,⠀or⠀aftermath,⠀without⠀a⠀public⠀confession,⠀a⠀gathered⠀cast,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀task⠀result.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nFollow⠀the⠀actual⠀succession⠀of⠀one⠀permitted⠀mind⠀whose⠀continuing⠀concern⠀runs⠀through⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀lived⠀aftermath:⠀the⠀cut⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀arrived,⠀the⠀version⠀of⠀events⠀the⠀narrator⠀keeps⠀ready,⠀the⠀name⠀they⠀cannot⠀stop⠀checking⠀for,⠀the⠀exact⠀sound⠀the⠀door⠀made⠀the⠀night⠀the⠀arrangement⠀held⠀or⠀failed.⠀Begin⠀with⠀present⠀sensation⠀or⠀private⠀wording⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀open⠀into⠀memory,⠀imagined⠀outcomes,⠀bodily⠀response,⠀or⠀an⠀unrelated⠀concern.⠀A⠀practical⠀instruction⠀or⠀consumer⠀particular⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀familiar⠀or⠀changed⠀significance⠀—⠀the⠀phrase⠀for⠀counting⠀the⠀take⠀arriving⠀with⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀someone's⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀brand⠀name⠀now⠀attaching⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀face.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀itself,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀association⠀has⠀to⠀serve⠀a⠀plan,⠀an⠀alibi,⠀or⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀happened.\n\nMark⠀enough⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀cues⠀to⠀keep⠀events,⠀memories,⠀and⠀fantasies⠀distinct.⠀Remembering⠀does⠀not⠀perform⠀the⠀act⠀again,⠀though⠀actual⠀repetition⠀may⠀run⠀alongside⠀recollection;⠀an⠀imagined⠀act⠀is⠀not⠀execution.⠀When⠀the⠀braid⠀moves⠀from⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀what⠀might⠀happen,⠀let⠀syntax,⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail,⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀direct⠀orientation⠀make⠀the⠀shift⠀legible⠀without⠀summary.\n\nPreserve⠀any⠀authorized⠀mind⠀shifts⠀without⠀merging⠀knowledge:⠀one⠀person's⠀private⠀wording⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀another⠀person's⠀thought,⠀and⠀known⠀culpable⠀experience⠀stays⠀available⠀without⠀being⠀forced⠀into⠀denial⠀or⠀confession.⠀Keep⠀all⠀real⠀world⠀capabilities⠀and⠀ownership⠀rules⠀active.⠀Full⠀private⠀experience⠀needs⠀no⠀usefulness,⠀completed⠀realization,⠀or⠀public⠀response.⠀Stop⠀inside⠀the⠀braid⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls;⠀prose⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀set⠀elapsed⠀time.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀offense⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Each⠀message⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀aim⠀and⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀—⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀proposed⠀the⠀job,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀needs⠀deniability,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀only⠀ever⠀forwards.⠀Keep⠀a⠀proposed⠀instruction,⠀an⠀acknowledgment,⠀and⠀an⠀accepted⠀arrangement⠀distinct⠀where⠀their⠀scope⠀matters:⠀one⠀person⠀proposes⠀how⠀the⠀pickup⠀runs,⠀another⠀repeats⠀back⠀only⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀names⠀them,⠀a⠀third⠀acts⠀on⠀a⠀version⠀no⠀one⠀actually⠀sent.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀channel⠀events⠀that⠀matter:⠀a⠀delay⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀knows,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀leaves⠀a⠀trace,⠀a⠀receipt⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀typo,⠀outage,⠀or⠀misdelivery⠀for⠀the⠀sake⠀of⠀the⠀format;⠀any⠀such⠀event⠀follows⠀actual⠀authorship⠀and⠀world⠀circumstances.⠀Repeated⠀wording⠀may⠀be⠀followed,⠀questioned,⠀or⠀ignored⠀according⠀to⠀each⠀person's⠀aims;⠀receipt⠀alone⠀proves⠀neither⠀guilt⠀nor⠀understanding.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀composed⠀or⠀dictated⠀draft⠀from⠀imagined⠀words⠀and⠀from⠀sent⠀text.⠀A⠀draft⠀is⠀an⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀composition⠀moment;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Render⠀full⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀facts,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀boundary:⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀sending,⠀before⠀any⠀reply,⠀or⠀before⠀anyone⠀moves,⠀when⠀the⠀boundary⠀falls⠀there.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀setting,⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀one⠀relevant⠀object,⠀position,⠀or⠀expression.⠀Let⠀a⠀selected⠀cue⠀draw⠀authorized⠀attention:⠀the⠀same⠀brand⠀of⠀envelope,⠀the⠀same⠀hand⠀position⠀over⠀the⠀drawer,⠀the⠀same⠀doorway⠀now⠀occupied⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀person.⠀The⠀cue⠀anchors⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀may⠀support⠀an⠀actual⠀explanation⠀when⠀its⠀context⠀warrants⠀one,⠀without⠀acquiring⠀truth⠀by⠀visual⠀emphasis⠀alone.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling⠀develop⠀around⠀the⠀instruction,⠀act,⠀or⠀account⠀the⠀cue⠀recalls.⠀Exact⠀repeated⠀wording⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀relation⠀across⠀cues⠀without⠀locking⠀into⠀a⠀fixed⠀cue-thought-line⠀cycle:⠀the⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀the⠀object,⠀arrive⠀before⠀the⠀speaker⠀appears,⠀or⠀stay⠀unspoken⠀while⠀the⠀expression⠀changes.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀cue⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀thought,⠀every⠀thought⠀a⠀line,⠀or⠀every⠀line⠀a⠀new⠀cue.\n\nDistinguish⠀observation,⠀inference,⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀access.⠀A⠀portrait⠀or⠀a⠀composed⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀guilt⠀by⠀appearance,⠀and⠀direct⠀knowledge⠀stays⠀with⠀whoever⠀actually⠀has⠀it.⠀Full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation;⠀reader⠀exposure⠀does⠀not⠀communicate⠀it⠀to⠀another⠀character,⠀while⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀independent⠀sources,⠀and⠀permitted⠀access⠀remain⠀available.⠀Preserve⠀real⠀sources,⠀world⠀capabilities,⠀and⠀player⠀ownership.⠀No⠀menu,⠀image,⠀romance⠀route,⠀new⠀clue,⠀or⠀changed⠀reaction⠀is⠀activated⠀by⠀the⠀style⠀alone.⠀End⠀on⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀required⠀reaction⠀or⠀disclosure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadacbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nRecover⠀the⠀relevant⠀prior⠀instruction,⠀event,⠀or⠀consequence⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀extent⠀the⠀current⠀installment⠀needs⠀for⠀orientation.⠀Avoid⠀automatic⠀recap⠀while⠀allowing⠀an⠀actual⠀recollection,⠀a⠀requested⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀meaningful⠀explanation⠀its⠀full⠀needed⠀extent,⠀including⠀a⠀complete⠀telling.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀a⠀rule,⠀quote⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀they⠀would⠀actually⠀remember;⠀when⠀a⠀requested⠀account⠀matters,⠀preserve⠀that⠀teller's⠀actual⠀selection,⠀distinguishing⠀known⠀facts,⠀reports,⠀inferences,⠀and⠀invented⠀claims⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀status⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀access.\n\nPreserve⠀what⠀was⠀proposed,⠀done,⠀received,⠀learned,⠀or⠀left⠀pending.⠀Do⠀not⠀reset⠀competence,⠀property,⠀or⠀knowledge⠀to⠀manufacture⠀another⠀reversal.⠀Repeated⠀wording⠀can⠀stay⠀accurate,⠀reveal⠀a⠀limit,⠀or⠀be⠀abandoned⠀through⠀actual⠀experience,⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀offense⠀or⠀contradiction⠀in⠀every⠀reply:⠀the⠀same⠀instruction⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀followed⠀more⠀carefully,⠀quoted⠀with⠀different⠀emphasis,⠀or⠀left⠀unspoken⠀because⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀say⠀it⠀is⠀gone.\n\nLet⠀independent⠀lives⠀and⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀continue⠀beyond⠀the⠀scheme⠀or⠀the⠀inquiry;⠀a⠀person⠀not⠀involved⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀still⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀day,⠀a⠀memory,⠀and⠀reasons⠀to⠀answer⠀or⠀not⠀answer.⠀Maintain⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀world⠀contracts.⠀An⠀available⠀result⠀may⠀occur⠀without⠀postponement,⠀and⠀an⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀mid-action⠀or⠀mid-thought,⠀without⠀arrest,⠀punishment,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀finished⠀miniature⠀case.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀offense:⠀what⠀they⠀did,⠀handled,⠀owed,⠀witnessed,⠀or⠀agreed⠀to,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀need⠀from⠀someone⠀else.⠀Give⠀the⠀request,⠀admission,⠀apology,⠀or⠀refusal⠀concrete⠀form⠀with⠀exact⠀objects,⠀movements,⠀and⠀practical⠀speech.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀carry⠀bargains,⠀conditions,⠀and⠀withheld⠀motives⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀speaker⠀to⠀explain⠀them.\n\nRender⠀the⠀private⠀strain⠀fully⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀contract.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀request⠀will⠀cost,⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀silence⠀means,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀bring⠀themselves⠀to⠀say,⠀while⠀their⠀outward⠀conduct⠀stays⠀controlled,⠀partial,⠀or⠀ordinary.⠀Thought⠀and⠀speech⠀may⠀diverge⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀reason:⠀fear,⠀pride,⠀calculation,⠀care,⠀exhaustion,⠀or⠀the⠀simple⠀difficulty⠀of⠀saying⠀the⠀thing.⠀They⠀may⠀also⠀align.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀pause⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀every⠀withheld⠀sentence⠀a⠀lie.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀offense⠀and⠀its⠀consequences⠀materially⠀present.⠀A⠀known⠀motive⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀hidden⠀for⠀suspense,⠀and⠀neither⠀guilt,⠀punishment,⠀nor⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀method.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀request⠀still⠀unanswered,⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀strained,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀work⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀is⠀carried⠀by⠀concrete⠀conduct⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀announced⠀through⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀reply⠀in⠀the⠀submitted⠀situation:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀task⠀carries⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀so⠀each⠀speaker's⠀position⠀stays⠀clear.⠀Let⠀practical⠀speech⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀bargains,⠀instructions,⠀warnings,⠀or⠀evasions⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀an⠀interrogation.\n\nFollow⠀what⠀the⠀owned⠀characters⠀actually⠀prepare,⠀do,⠀learn,⠀or⠀face⠀in⠀this⠀interval.⠀Keep⠀each⠀participant's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀access⠀distinct:⠀one⠀may⠀know⠀who⠀did⠀it,⠀another⠀may⠀only⠀know⠀what⠀was⠀handled⠀or⠀owed,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀be⠀guessing.⠀Within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access,⠀narration⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀character,⠀but⠀that⠀knowledge⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀pass⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀Render⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀fully⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀whether⠀as⠀visible⠀interiority⠀or⠀the⠀supplied⠀hidden⠀wrapper,⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀audible⠀to⠀others.\n\nMove⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs:⠀tools,⠀money,⠀routes,⠀injuries,⠀weather,⠀work,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀traces⠀of⠀the⠀offense.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀advance⠀the⠀scheme,⠀expose⠀a⠀consequence,⠀or⠀simply⠀hold⠀a⠀difficult⠀conversation⠀in⠀place.⠀Do⠀not⠀owe⠀a⠀fresh⠀clue,⠀a⠀completed⠀criminal⠀act,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought⠀or⠀other⠀authorized⠀experience,⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀in-world⠀pause.⠀Keep⠀ongoing⠀world⠀and⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀active⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling.⠀Open⠀each⠀episode⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀the⠀work⠀or⠀travel⠀is⠀happening,⠀and⠀what⠀concrete⠀activity⠀is⠀underway.⠀Give⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀occasion⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀whole-offense⠀summary;⠀a⠀needed⠀explanation⠀may⠀appear⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀account⠀calls⠀for⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀episode⠀proceed⠀through⠀successive⠀acts,⠀practical⠀speech,⠀and⠀the⠀material⠀particulars⠀of⠀the⠀scheme⠀or⠀its⠀consequences:⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀load,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀wound,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀message⠀passed⠀hand⠀to⠀hand.\n\nLink⠀relevant⠀returns⠀across⠀episodes⠀through⠀a⠀sourced⠀object,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀phrase⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀offense.⠀A⠀repeated⠀item⠀or⠀instruction⠀can⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen⠀it⠀before,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀announces⠀its⠀importance.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀reappears,⠀preserve⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀learned,⠀lost,⠀agreed⠀to⠀or⠀left⠀unchanged;⠀no⠀intervening⠀change⠀is⠀required.⠀Keep⠀each⠀episode's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀access⠀distinct;⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀may⠀reveal⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀only⠀implied.\n\nWrite⠀with⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀nouns,⠀forceful⠀verbs,⠀and⠀paratactic⠀movement.⠀Practical⠀speech⠀can⠀carry⠀bargains,⠀convictions,⠀and⠀withheld⠀motives⠀without⠀ornament.⠀An⠀episode⠀may⠀span⠀replies:⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀can⠀arrive⠀during⠀work,⠀a⠀journey,⠀negotiation⠀or⠀ongoing⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀pause,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀scheme,⠀exposure⠀or⠀punishment.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀encounter⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀turn.⠀The⠀episodic⠀form⠀organizes⠀the⠀telling;⠀the⠀crime's⠀actual⠀course⠀remains⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀story's⠀events.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀consequences⠀through⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀strong⠀verbs:⠀the⠀thing⠀taken,⠀moved,⠀broken,⠀signed,⠀or⠀left⠀behind;⠀the⠀hands⠀that⠀did⠀the⠀work;⠀the⠀surface⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀wear.⠀Compress⠀transitions⠀so⠀one⠀act⠀follows⠀another⠀without⠀connective⠀padding,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀real⠀sequence⠀of⠀causes⠀and⠀consequences⠀legible.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀act,⠀then⠀see⠀the⠀result,⠀then⠀decide⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀next,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀order⠀clear.\n\nLet⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure.⠀A⠀tool⠀shows⠀its⠀use,⠀a⠀road⠀shows⠀its⠀traffic,⠀a⠀body⠀shows⠀its⠀labor⠀or⠀injury.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀violence,⠀injury,⠀or⠀damage⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected;⠀use⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀events⠀establish.⠀Rough⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀reasoning,⠀feeling,⠀sensation⠀and⠀association⠀at⠀their⠀actual⠀meaningful⠀extent,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀they⠀change⠀an⠀act⠀or⠀explain⠀a⠀risk.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀may⠀precede,⠀accompany,⠀or⠀follow⠀action⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀weighing⠀a⠀risk,⠀recognizing⠀a⠀consequence,⠀or⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀speak.⠀Compression⠀governs⠀the⠀prose's⠀movement,⠀not⠀a⠀quota⠀of⠀short⠀sentences⠀or⠀a⠀ban⠀on⠀extended⠀accumulation.⠀Change⠀rhythm⠀where⠀it⠀serves⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀quick⠀series⠀of⠀physical⠀acts⠀can⠀give⠀way⠀to⠀a⠀slower⠀passage⠀of⠀attention⠀or⠀deliberation.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀in-world⠀pause,⠀completed⠀criminal⠀phase⠀or⠀fresh⠀injury.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀actual⠀documents:⠀letters,⠀receipts,⠀reports,⠀notes,⠀records,⠀or⠀whatever⠀form⠀the⠀scene's⠀people⠀would⠀really⠀produce.⠀Each⠀document⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Let⠀the⠀document's⠀wording⠀show⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀knows,⠀wants,⠀fears,⠀or⠀chooses⠀to⠀conceal⠀at⠀that⠀moment.⠀A⠀request,⠀transaction,⠀claim,⠀or⠀account⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀record⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀written,⠀what⠀is⠀omitted,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀does⠀after⠀reading.\n\nDistinguish⠀fact,⠀allegation,⠀and⠀intentional⠀invention⠀within⠀the⠀records.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀state⠀something⠀as⠀certain⠀that⠀another⠀record⠀contradicts,⠀or⠀describe⠀an⠀event⠀its⠀author⠀did⠀not⠀witness.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record⠀to⠀settle⠀the⠀truth.⠀Make⠀each⠀record's⠀actual⠀claim,⠀source⠀and⠀relation⠀to⠀events⠀legible;⠀records⠀may⠀agree⠀or⠀remain⠀independent⠀without⠀a⠀gap,⠀conflict⠀or⠀evidence⠀puzzle⠀being⠀required.⠀A⠀parallel⠀record⠀may⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀main⠀sequence⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀causal⠀chain⠀through⠀the⠀last⠀document.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀live⠀thought⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀documents.⠀A⠀letter⠀or⠀report⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀records,⠀not⠀their⠀complete⠀private⠀mind.⠀Render⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀clearly⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Select⠀exact⠀objects,⠀sums,⠀routes⠀or⠀other⠀material⠀particulars⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀each⠀document,⠀while⠀preserving⠀its⠀actual⠀author's⠀register⠀and⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀giving⠀all⠀records⠀one⠀voice.⠀Practical⠀speech⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀quoted⠀lines⠀or⠀reported⠀exchanges,⠀but⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀governs⠀the⠀telling.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀composition,⠀circulation,⠀reception⠀or⠀continuing⠀private⠀experience,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀record-sequence⠀pause,⠀confession,⠀arrest⠀or⠀completed⠀scheme.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nFollow⠀a⠀supplied⠀occasion⠀of⠀help,⠀ease,⠀or⠀practical⠀kindness⠀that⠀involves⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀Name⠀the⠀exact⠀acts⠀and⠀preferences:⠀the⠀food⠀prepared,⠀the⠀wound⠀cleaned,⠀the⠀debt⠀partly⠀settled,⠀the⠀child⠀put⠀to⠀bed,⠀the⠀door⠀locked,⠀the⠀tea⠀poured,⠀the⠀coat⠀mended.⠀Let⠀the⠀care⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀gesture.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀exist⠀between⠀accomplices,⠀between⠀a⠀culprit⠀and⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀between⠀a⠀victim⠀and⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀between⠀people⠀who⠀simply⠀share⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀surviving⠀the⠀consequences.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀comfort⠀erase⠀the⠀offense.⠀Keep⠀the⠀crime's⠀actual⠀history⠀and⠀consequences⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀situation⠀or⠀authorized⠀private⠀attention.⠀An⠀unpaid⠀debt,⠀healing⠀injury⠀or⠀continuing⠀risk⠀belongs⠀where⠀supported;⠀none⠀must⠀remain⠀pending⠀or⠀physically⠀present⠀for⠀care⠀to⠀matter.⠀A⠀kind⠀act⠀does⠀not⠀declare⠀anyone⠀innocent,⠀rehabilitated,⠀or⠀secretly⠀dangerous.⠀Keep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀disagreement⠀intact;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀No⠀gratitude,⠀confession,⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀method.\n\nWrite⠀with⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs.⠀The⠀care⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀material⠀particulars:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀blanket,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀spoon⠀against⠀a⠀bowl,⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀carrying⠀water⠀or⠀fuel.⠀Practical⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀or⠀extended,⠀warm⠀or⠀otherwise⠀suited⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀speaker;⠀full⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀beyond⠀what⠀is⠀spoken.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀kindness,⠀conversation⠀or⠀ongoing⠀thought,⠀with⠀the⠀larger⠀situation⠀settled⠀or⠀unresolved⠀as⠀actual⠀events⠀warrant⠀and⠀no⠀required⠀pause.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀place⠀particular⠀acts,⠀bargains,⠀or⠀consequences⠀beside⠀the⠀relevant⠀history⠀and⠀social⠀arrangements⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀A⠀theft,⠀a⠀bribe,⠀a⠀beating,⠀or⠀a⠀broken⠀agreement⠀can⠀be⠀framed⠀by⠀the⠀conditions⠀that⠀produced⠀it:⠀the⠀land,⠀the⠀market,⠀the⠀family,⠀the⠀law,⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀was⠀available⠀or⠀withheld.⠀Let⠀the⠀framing⠀come⠀through⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀lecture.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀judge⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀but⠀the⠀judgment⠀must⠀remain⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀facts.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀someone⠀claims⠀about⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀privately⠀felt⠀or⠀intended.⠀A⠀public⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀eloquent⠀and⠀still⠀incomplete;⠀a⠀private⠀motive⠀may⠀be⠀clear⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀and⠀still⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀decide⠀guilt⠀through⠀rhetoric.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀be⠀composed⠀and⠀distanced⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀crime's⠀outcome⠀inevitable⠀or⠀moralizing⠀its⠀participants.\n\nKeep⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀inside⠀the⠀formal⠀frame.⠀The⠀paragraphs⠀may⠀move⠀broadly⠀through⠀actual⠀objects,⠀conditions,⠀consequences⠀or⠀authorized⠀inward⠀associations;⠀select⠀material⠀that⠀belongs⠀without⠀requiring⠀labor,⠀weather⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀outward.⠀Practical⠀speech⠀keeps⠀its⠀speaker's⠀own⠀register⠀and⠀length,⠀carrying⠀actual⠀bargains,⠀convictions⠀or⠀refusals⠀without⠀imposing⠀a⠀uniform⠀spareness.⠀A⠀large⠀frame⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀punitive⠀ending.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀experience,⠀with⠀known⠀culpability⠀and⠀settled⠀or⠀unsettled⠀consequences⠀preserved⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀the⠀telling⠀itself:⠀establish⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀about⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀scheme,⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀being⠀used⠀for⠀right⠀now.⠀That⠀purpose⠀can⠀be⠀help,⠀warning,⠀defense,⠀entertainment,⠀keeping⠀company,⠀buying⠀time,⠀or⠀another⠀specific⠀motive⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀the⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀abstract;⠀make⠀it⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀choice⠀of⠀where⠀to⠀begin,⠀what⠀to⠀repeat,⠀what⠀to⠀omit,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀listeners⠀attend.\n\nCompose⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀McCarthy⠀instrumentation⠀as⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀Name⠀the⠀tools,⠀rooms,⠀routes,⠀wounds,⠀sums,⠀and⠀spoken⠀words⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀permits.⠀If⠀the⠀teller⠀remembers⠀an⠀act,⠀keep⠀it⠀sensory⠀and⠀specific;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀hearsay,⠀keep⠀its⠀source⠀legible;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀claimed⠀or⠀invented,⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀need⠀shape⠀it⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀outside⠀narration⠀certify⠀its⠀truth.⠀Show⠀the⠀actual⠀telling⠀voice⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀all⠀quoted⠀speech⠀to⠀stay⠀spare:⠀a⠀laborer⠀may⠀report⠀one⠀blunt⠀sentence,⠀while⠀a⠀bargaining⠀witness⠀may⠀repeat⠀an⠀entire⠀exchange.\n\nLet⠀the⠀audience⠀receive⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀particular⠀persons,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀built-in⠀pressure⠀toward⠀confession⠀or⠀reversal.⠀They⠀may⠀merely⠀nod,⠀eat,⠀turn⠀away⠀before⠀the⠀finish,⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀sit⠀without⠀offering⠀the⠀response⠀the⠀teller⠀wanted.⠀Their⠀attention⠀is⠀a⠀real⠀event:⠀write⠀what⠀they⠀see⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀shut⠀out.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀can⠀carry⠀meaning⠀between⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀and⠀the⠀told⠀offense,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀keep⠀its⠀actual⠀source⠀and⠀history;⠀recurrence⠀illuminates,⠀not⠀proves.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀presented⠀tale.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀he⠀says,⠀or⠀may⠀believe⠀his⠀own⠀version.⠀What⠀listeners⠀hold⠀behind⠀their⠀faces⠀is⠀available⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.⠀No⠀quota⠀requires⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀change⠀a⠀decision,⠀expose⠀a⠀culprit,⠀or⠀hit⠀an⠀active⠀cliffhanger⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀is⠀still⠀living:⠀during⠀a⠀sentence,⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀the⠀audience's⠀continuing⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose.⠀Start⠀with⠀an⠀actual⠀record⠀or⠀material⠀trace⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀offense:⠀a⠀ledger⠀page,⠀an⠀arrest⠀report,⠀a⠀delivery⠀slip,⠀a⠀photographed⠀wall,⠀a⠀receipt.⠀Handle⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀object⠀before⠀using⠀it⠀as⠀evidence.⠀Give⠀the⠀ink,⠀fold,⠀burn⠀mark,⠀stain,⠀or⠀partial⠀wording⠀first;⠀note⠀the⠀hand⠀or⠀machine⠀that⠀produced⠀it;⠀identify⠀how⠀the⠀active⠀character⠀came⠀to⠀hold⠀or⠀see⠀it,⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀known.⠀Then⠀compare⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀states⠀with⠀the⠀remembrance⠀of⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀there⠀or⠀the⠀account⠀that⠀has⠀reached⠀the⠀active⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀document⠀into⠀a⠀transparent⠀window.\n\nUse⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀clauses⠀for⠀both⠀the⠀recorded⠀fact⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀conditions.⠀Show⠀the⠀exact⠀space⠀where⠀the⠀comparison⠀happens:⠀the⠀desk,⠀the⠀truck⠀bench,⠀the⠀kitchen⠀table.⠀Let⠀a⠀relevant⠀physical⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀context—a⠀wage,⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀fence,⠀a⠀closed⠀door—rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀economic⠀pressure.⠀The⠀sentences⠀can⠀run⠀paratactically⠀as⠀record,⠀memory,⠀and⠀present⠀observation⠀sit⠀side⠀by⠀side;⠀length⠀follows⠀how⠀many⠀particulars⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀connects,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀analysis.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀two⠀sources⠀equal⠀in⠀fallibility.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀precise⠀about⠀an⠀amount⠀but⠀silent⠀about⠀a⠀threat.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀vivid⠀about⠀a⠀face⠀but⠀wrong⠀about⠀a⠀date.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀gap⠀acknowledged:⠀a⠀missing⠀page,⠀a⠀disputed⠀translation,⠀a⠀source⠀who⠀cannot⠀be⠀reached.⠀Neither⠀the⠀written⠀word⠀nor⠀the⠀recollection⠀is⠀automatically⠀stronger⠀than⠀the⠀other.⠀What⠀the⠀active⠀character⠀feels⠀while⠀reading,⠀handling,⠀or⠀remembering⠀remains⠀full⠀authorized⠀interiority,⠀not⠀a⠀one-sentence⠀emotional⠀summary.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary⠀during⠀reading,⠀searching,⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀character⠀sets⠀the⠀object⠀aside,⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀completed⠀comparison,⠀discovered⠀offense,⠀or⠀answered⠀question.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBegin⠀with⠀the⠀particular⠀privilege,⠀role,⠀or⠀place⠀the⠀crime's⠀present⠀moment⠀turns⠀on.⠀A⠀long⠀held⠀title⠀like⠀superintendent,⠀owner,⠀elder,⠀or⠀creditor⠀is⠀not⠀atmosphere;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀reason⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀basement,⠀take⠀a⠀key,⠀call⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀be⠀refused⠀work.⠀Write⠀the⠀move⠀by⠀which⠀a⠀relative,⠀employee,⠀agent,⠀or⠀claimant⠀tries⠀to⠀use⠀that⠀old⠀position⠀now⠀through⠀concrete⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀narrated⠀class⠀relation.⠀The⠀modern⠀practical⠀world⠀should⠀already⠀be⠀present:⠀a⠀lockbox,⠀a⠀bus⠀schedule,⠀a⠀clinic⠀bill,⠀a⠀restricted⠀lot.\n\nMake⠀the⠀request⠀central,⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀for⠀money,⠀silence,⠀access,⠀labor,⠀or⠀a⠀written⠀signature.⠀Show⠀the⠀chain⠀of⠀acceptance⠀or⠀refusal⠀through⠀physical⠀expressions.⠀Somebody⠀walks⠀to⠀the⠀counter,⠀leafs⠀through⠀a⠀folder,⠀checks⠀a⠀phone,⠀moves⠀a⠀chair,⠀closes⠀a⠀door.⠀That⠀action⠀reveals⠀who⠀has⠀authority⠀in⠀this⠀specific⠀exchange,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀social⠀order.⠀Let⠀spoken⠀bargaining⠀stay⠀in⠀its⠀owner's⠀language—slang,⠀abrupt⠀threat,⠀careful⠀measured⠀tone—rather⠀than⠀making⠀everyone⠀terse⠀McCarthy⠀mannerists.\n\nLet⠀atmospheric⠀pressure⠀arise⠀from⠀owned⠀detail:⠀fluorescence⠀on⠀a⠀cracked⠀tile,⠀a⠀chain⠀hanging⠀against⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀receipts,⠀a⠀window⠀painted⠀shut.⠀Use⠀these⠀details⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀encounters⠀them⠀and⠀because⠀they⠀carry⠀the⠀space's⠀history;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀them⠀point⠀like⠀signs⠀at⠀guilt⠀or⠀safety.⠀Private⠀desire⠀and⠀morally⠀complicated⠀closeness⠀are⠀available⠀to⠀this⠀style:⠀a⠀debtor⠀may⠀still⠀share⠀a⠀meal⠀with⠀the⠀person⠀she⠀owes,⠀a⠀guard⠀may⠀want⠀the⠀favor⠀no⠀one⠀will⠀say.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀can⠀loosen⠀where⠀trust⠀exists,⠀or⠀tighten⠀where⠀exposure⠀is⠀risk;⠀either⠀outcome⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀characters'⠀real⠀state.\n\nDeny⠀the⠀passage⠀any⠀new⠀faction,⠀transformation,⠀blood-price,⠀or⠀hidden⠀power⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀includes⠀them.⠀Gothic-punk⠀supplies⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀inherited⠀order;⠀it⠀cannot⠀fix⠀the⠀crime⠀by⠀supernatural⠀certainty.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀exactly⠀who⠀committed⠀the⠀offense⠀and⠀still⠀need⠀to⠀negotiate⠀access.⠀End⠀inside⠀the⠀continuing⠀encounter,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀realized⠀help⠀or⠀harm⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀permits;⠀no⠀required⠀unmasking,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀scheme.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nOrder⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀a⠀participant's⠀testimony⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀report⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀Identify⠀who⠀is⠀giving⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀occasion:⠀committee⠀room,⠀kitchen,⠀courtyard,⠀union⠀hall,⠀a⠀relative's⠀telephone⠀call.⠀Do⠀not⠀recast⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀just⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀first⠀person;⠀if⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀is⠀in⠀third⠀person,⠀the⠀testimony⠀is⠀still⠀this⠀character's⠀performed⠀account.⠀The⠀teller⠀wants⠀something⠀from⠀the⠀occasion—protection,⠀a⠀record,⠀compensation,⠀someone⠀to⠀believe⠀him,⠀another⠀person⠀to⠀leave—and⠀that⠀want⠀will⠀shape⠀how⠀much⠀is⠀said.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀account⠀by⠀choosing⠀concrete,⠀locatable⠀acts⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀responsibility.⠀The⠀participant⠀walks⠀through⠀the⠀exact⠀street,⠀carries⠀the⠀wrapped⠀parcel,⠀turns⠀a⠀key⠀that⠀sticks,⠀repeats⠀the⠀sentence⠀the⠀supervisor⠀used,⠀waits⠀behind⠀the⠀counter⠀for⠀the⠀money.⠀Every⠀item⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀discoverable⠀source:⠀how⠀the⠀participant⠀knows⠀it.⠀\"I⠀saw,\"⠀\"she⠀told⠀me⠀later,\"⠀\"the⠀office⠀posted,\"⠀and⠀\"I⠀believe\"⠀are⠀distinct⠀narrative⠀states,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀make⠀them⠀distinct⠀while⠀remaining⠀psychological⠀testimony.⠀If⠀the⠀participant⠀infers⠀a⠀motive,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀inference.⠀A⠀witness⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀face⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀name,⠀the⠀amount⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀date;⠀write⠀both⠀accuracy⠀and⠀lapse.\n\nUse⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀for⠀the⠀remembered⠀physical⠀world⠀so⠀the⠀testimony⠀stays⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀place⠀and⠀labor.⠀The⠀linked⠀syntax⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀events;⠀an⠀accumulation⠀can⠀render⠀the⠀participant's⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀the⠀detail⠀they⠀keep⠀circling.⠀But⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀brevity⠀or⠀brutality⠀on⠀the⠀teller's⠀register.⠀A⠀woman⠀who⠀testifies⠀in⠀formal⠀phrases⠀will⠀not⠀suddenly⠀begin⠀speaking⠀in⠀sentence⠀fragments⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀surrounding⠀prose⠀is⠀concrete.\n\nBefore,⠀during,⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀performed⠀testimony,⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀full⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀remains⠀available.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀account⠀says;⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀privately⠀doubt⠀his⠀own⠀first⠀word.⠀No⠀later⠀model,⠀and⠀no⠀scene⠀convention,⠀may⠀replace⠀that⠀private⠀mind⠀with⠀the⠀official⠀statement.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀telling,⠀during⠀a⠀pause,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀listener⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀cup⠀and⠀offers⠀no⠀answer.⠀No⠀required⠀exposure,⠀confession,⠀solved⠀offense,⠀or⠀moral⠀judgment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀psychological⠀realism⠀for⠀the⠀crime⠀material.⠀Open⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀encounter⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀actually⠀participates⠀in:⠀repaying⠀a⠀debt⠀inside⠀a⠀small⠀office,⠀waiting⠀outside⠀a⠀police⠀station⠀after⠀someone⠀was⠀taken,⠀fetching⠀the⠀last⠀things⠀from⠀a⠀closed⠀shop,⠀watching⠀a⠀man⠀check⠀a⠀delivery⠀receipt.⠀Let⠀the⠀encounter's⠀material⠀conditions⠀run⠀continuously⠀through⠀McCarthy-style⠀concrete⠀nouns:⠀the⠀chair⠀with⠀one⠀short⠀leg,⠀the⠀number⠀written⠀on⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀radio⠀news,⠀the⠀cracked⠀vinyl⠀folder.⠀The⠀character⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀be⠀there⠀and⠀a⠀finite⠀task⠀or⠀waiting⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀formal⠀flashback.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀receipt,⠀he⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀night⠀the⠀box⠀was⠀signed⠀with⠀a⠀borrowed⠀pen.⠀When⠀the⠀woman⠀across⠀the⠀table⠀sets⠀down⠀the⠀money,⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀the⠀sentence⠀she⠀used⠀on⠀the⠀phone⠀last⠀month.⠀Treat⠀these⠀memories⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀events⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀causal⠀impulse,⠀not⠀as⠀inserted⠀evidence.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀he⠀suspects:⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀handed⠀him⠀the⠀money⠀spoken⠀to⠀him⠀before⠀the⠀theft⠀is⠀fact;⠀his⠀suspicion⠀about⠀her⠀brother⠀is⠀inference⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀written⠀as⠀inference.\n\nWhat⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀is⠀observationally⠀clear⠀before⠀its⠀meaning⠀is⠀interpreted.⠀She⠀may⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀bag,⠀pay⠀the⠀bill,⠀ask⠀one⠀question,⠀then⠀leave⠀without⠀speaking⠀further.⠀The⠀interior⠀thought⠀can⠀run⠀during⠀these⠀acts,⠀contradict⠀them,⠀or⠀remain⠀silent;⠀no⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀visible⠀reaction⠀is⠀required.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀interprets⠀another⠀person's⠀silence,⠀show⠀the⠀clue⠀she⠀is⠀reading⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀suggests⠀to⠀her,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀diagnosis.⠀Keep⠀the⠀mental⠀movement⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀causal⠀order;⠀an⠀association⠀may⠀arrive⠀and⠀pass⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀action,⠀and⠀that⠀is⠀still⠀live⠀interiority.⠀End⠀during⠀the⠀continuing⠀situation—waiting,⠀going⠀out,⠀opening⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀last⠀task⠀is⠀done—without⠀needing⠀a⠀completed⠀offense,⠀punishment,⠀or⠀self-judgment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nCompose⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀chronicle⠀of⠀the⠀offense.⠀Choose⠀a⠀starting⠀occasion⠀that⠀is⠀locatable⠀in⠀time⠀and⠀place:⠀the⠀morning⠀the⠀warehouse⠀gates⠀stayed⠀shut,⠀the⠀week⠀the⠀road⠀was⠀blocked,⠀the⠀autumn⠀the⠀fishing⠀crew⠀came⠀back⠀short⠀one⠀man.⠀Move⠀through⠀subsequent⠀public⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀private⠀memory⠀alone.⠀Name⠀the⠀speakers,⠀officials,⠀workers,⠀owners,⠀family⠀members⠀at⠀the⠀moments⠀they⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record.⠀Each⠀occasion⠀should⠀carry⠀physical⠀particulars:⠀the⠀torn⠀notice⠀on⠀the⠀post,⠀the⠀load⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀truck,⠀the⠀coins⠀counted⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀empty⠀chair⠀at⠀the⠀meeting.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀sentence⠀order⠀follow⠀public⠀occurrence.⠀One⠀event⠀leads⠀to⠀another⠀through⠀documented⠀actions—the⠀foreman⠀submitted⠀the⠀route⠀book,⠀the⠀judge⠀read⠀the⠀old⠀lease,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀repeated⠀what⠀the⠀driver⠀said.⠀A⠀repeated⠀account⠀is⠀not⠀independent⠀confirmation⠀just⠀because⠀three⠀mouths⠀repeat⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀originating⠀source⠀each⠀time⠀a⠀claim⠀circulates:⠀\"the⠀first⠀version⠀came⠀from⠀the⠀boy⠀who⠀heard⠀the⠀guard,\"⠀\"the⠀union⠀record⠀listed⠀the⠀two⠀names,\"⠀\"the⠀widow⠀said⠀her⠀husband⠀told⠀her⠀before⠀he⠀left.\"⠀If⠀a⠀claim's⠀source⠀is⠀unknown,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀unknown.⠀That⠀keeps⠀the⠀social⠀chronicle⠀honest⠀without⠀turning⠀into⠀a⠀police⠀case⠀summary.\n\nUse⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀for⠀the⠀material⠀consequences⠀that⠀recur:⠀lost⠀wages,⠀a⠀burned⠀door,⠀a⠀blocked⠀ditch,⠀a⠀child⠀sent⠀away,⠀a⠀storefront⠀occupied⠀by⠀another⠀owner.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀\"the⠀town⠀suffered\";⠀pick⠀the⠀particular⠀consequence⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀and⠀make⠀it⠀visible.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀condition⠀still⠀changing—the⠀trial⠀postponed,⠀the⠀body⠀not⠀found,⠀the⠀road⠀reopened⠀but⠀guarded.⠀No⠀required⠀conclusion,⠀moral,⠀or⠀legal⠀verdict⠀is⠀built⠀into⠀the⠀style.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀has⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀public⠀record,⠀it⠀remains⠀available⠀as⠀licensed⠀interiority,⠀not⠀as⠀annotation⠀to⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀reported⠀occasion⠀or⠀ongoing⠀private⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nStart⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation:⠀identify⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀material⠀means⠀or⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀crime⠀currently⠀matters.⠀Instead⠀of⠀announcing⠀these⠀elements⠀separately,⠀let⠀one⠀concrete⠀anchor⠀carry⠀them:⠀the⠀counter⠀where⠀the⠀ticket⠀was⠀bought,⠀the⠀alley⠀where⠀the⠀engine⠀block⠀sits,⠀the⠀envelope⠀a⠀character⠀turns⠀over,⠀the⠀appointment⠀notice⠀pinned⠀by⠀the⠀elevator.⠀If⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀mechanism⠀is⠀unfamiliar,⠀give⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀to⠀remain⠀readable,⠀in⠀the⠀sentence⠀where⠀it⠀first⠀appears⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀following⠀line⠀if⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀natural⠀flow.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀glossary⠀paragraph.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀action⠀in⠀clear⠀spatial⠀sequence⠀with⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀verbs.⠀A⠀character⠀walks⠀in,⠀the⠀door⠀swings,⠀a⠀hand⠀goes⠀to⠀the⠀drawer,⠀keys⠀drop⠀on⠀the⠀desk.⠀Track⠀these⠀movements⠀consistently⠀and⠀use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀changes⠀physical⠀location⠀or⠀speaker.⠀Practical⠀dialogue⠀should⠀carry⠀bargaining⠀or⠀demand⠀according⠀to⠀each⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀register;⠀light-novel⠀readability⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀quick⠀one-line⠀exchanges.⠀A⠀worker⠀may⠀give⠀a⠀long⠀practical⠀explanation;⠀a⠀relative⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀memory-laden⠀phrases.\n\nPlace⠀private⠀response⠀where⠀it⠀actually⠀occurs⠀in⠀time.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀before⠀answering⠀a⠀question,⠀during⠀the⠀long⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀manager⠀to⠀check⠀the⠀file,⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀leaves.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀fixed⠀public-before-private⠀order.⠀The⠀full⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀remains⠀available⠀even⠀in⠀a⠀fast-paced⠀exchange,⠀including⠀feelings,⠀reasons,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀offense.⠀Known⠀culpability⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀hidden⠀to⠀create⠀suspense;⠀if⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀who⠀did⠀it,⠀the⠀tension⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀exposure,⠀access,⠀or⠀divided⠀loyalty.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀negotiation,⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀thinking,⠀or⠀right⠀after⠀one⠀finding⠀changes⠀nothing⠀yet.⠀No⠀forced⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀chase,⠀or⠀phase⠀change⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀concrete⠀sound,⠀object,⠀or⠀landscape⠀feature⠀already⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀passage's⠀emotional⠀movement.⠀A⠀metal⠀tool⠀striking⠀stone,⠀a⠀blocked⠀drain,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀scorched⠀oil,⠀a⠀child's⠀shoe⠀left⠀at⠀the⠀door—any⠀such⠀materially⠀present⠀thing⠀may⠀gather⠀force⠀through⠀return⠀and⠀variation.⠀Develop⠀it⠀through⠀syntax:⠀predicate⠀upon⠀predicate,⠀an⠀image⠀opening⠀into⠀a⠀second⠀that⠀modifies⠀the⠀first,⠀a⠀sentence⠀curving⠀from⠀physical⠀perception⠀into⠀authorized⠀recollection⠀or⠀half-formed⠀comparison.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀arises⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀actually⠀sees,⠀hears,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀handles.⠀The⠀figure⠀may⠀become⠀privately⠀meaningful,⠀lose⠀meaning,⠀or⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀because⠀the⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀name⠀what⠀it⠀carries.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀offense's⠀sequence⠀concrete⠀even⠀as⠀rhythm⠀extends.⠀Show⠀preparation,⠀exchange,⠀injury,⠀concealment,⠀or⠀consequence⠀through⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀exact⠀nouns⠀joined⠀by⠀and.⠀A⠀lyrical⠀phrase⠀may⠀briefly⠀slow⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀then⠀resume⠀work⠀or⠀speech.⠀Let⠀a⠀direct⠀line,⠀a⠀practical⠀movement,⠀or⠀a⠀terse⠀answer⠀interrupt⠀a⠀shaped⠀passage:⠀the⠀contrast⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀style,⠀not⠀a⠀failure⠀of⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀certify⠀the⠀recurring⠀image⠀as⠀a⠀moral⠀verdict.⠀It⠀may⠀feel⠀like⠀guilt⠀to⠀the⠀teller,⠀but⠀that⠀remains⠀private⠀association,⠀not⠀evidence⠀assembled⠀by⠀the⠀narration.⠀If⠀the⠀object⠀also⠀has⠀actual⠀forensic⠀or⠀practical⠀significance,⠀preserve⠀that⠀causal⠀role⠀unchanged;⠀lyricism⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀it⠀new⠀explanatory⠀power.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀figure⠀only⠀when⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀or⠀memory⠀prompts⠀attention.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀in⠀every⠀paragraph⠀or⠀resolve⠀in⠀recognition.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀sounding⠀once⠀more,⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀setting⠀the⠀object⠀down,⠀or⠀with⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀continuing⠀over⠀the⠀sound.⠀The⠀crime⠀stays⠀present⠀because⠀the⠀material⠀sequence⠀stays⠀present;⠀the⠀figure⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀sequence⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀teller,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀thematic⠀announcement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nUse⠀a⠀present⠀material⠀thing—a⠀torn⠀pocket,⠀a⠀knife⠀scar⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀gravel⠀under⠀a⠀known⠀tread,⠀a⠀sentence⠀once⠀said⠀and⠀now⠀repeated—to⠀enter⠀authorized⠀memory.⠀Start⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀perception,⠀then⠀follow⠀the⠀association⠀into⠀a⠀particular⠀occasion.⠀Recall⠀its⠀texture⠀fully:⠀what⠀was⠀handled,⠀said,⠀smelled,⠀or⠀begun.⠀Keep⠀then⠀and⠀now⠀distinct.⠀What⠀the⠀character⠀knew,⠀wanted,⠀or⠀ignored⠀at⠀the⠀earlier⠀time⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀time;⠀later⠀knowledge⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present.⠀A⠀shift⠀may⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀realizes⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene⠀around⠀that⠀realization.\n\nRender⠀the⠀remembered⠀event⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀as⠀the⠀present.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀job⠀finished,⠀a⠀debt⠀paid,⠀a⠀meal⠀shared,⠀an⠀injury⠀inflicted,⠀or⠀a⠀chance⠀not⠀taken.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀hold⠀what⠀it⠀held⠀then—relief,⠀hunger,⠀affection,⠀disgust,⠀fear,⠀pleasure—rather⠀than⠀automatically⠀becoming⠀sorrow⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀past.⠀Small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀can⠀enter⠀through⠀ordinary⠀fact:⠀the⠀address⠀changed,⠀the⠀tool⠀is⠀worn,⠀the⠀person⠀no⠀longer⠀answers.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀fully⠀pleasurable⠀in⠀memory.\n\nDo⠀not⠀resolve⠀reflection⠀into⠀a⠀confession,⠀lesson,⠀repair,⠀or⠀new⠀course⠀of⠀action.⠀The⠀crime⠀may⠀stand⠀beside⠀the⠀memory⠀without⠀absorbing⠀it.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀inside⠀the⠀recollection,⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀object⠀rests⠀in⠀their⠀hand,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀is⠀simply⠀known.⠀Follow⠀the⠀current⠀response⠀boundary;⠀no⠀compulsory⠀outward⠀action⠀is⠀required.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀chosen⠀viewpoint⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀access.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nCompose⠀an⠀account⠀whose⠀ownership⠀is⠀settled⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀but⠀which⠀is⠀told⠀through⠀the⠀formal⠀lens⠀of⠀modern⠀memoir.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀participant⠀recalling⠀an⠀earlier⠀self,⠀or⠀may⠀be⠀presenting⠀another⠀supplied⠀participant's⠀remembered⠀story⠀within⠀the⠀fiction's⠀access⠀limits;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀new⠀first-person⠀participant⠀on⠀the⠀prose.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀participant⠀coincide,⠀preserve⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀them⠀as⠀a⠀compositional⠀fact:⠀the⠀later⠀speaker⠀can⠀describe⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀heard,⠀and⠀handled,⠀but⠀cannot⠀casually⠀grant⠀the⠀former⠀self⠀post⠀hoc⠀comprehension.⠀If⠀the⠀participant⠀is⠀separate,⠀keep⠀their⠀knowledge⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀with⠀them;⠀the⠀narrator⠀recounts⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known⠀or⠀reported,⠀not⠀an⠀unowned⠀interior.\n\nOrder⠀the⠀earlier⠀crime⠀sequence⠀in⠀concrete⠀time.⠀Begin⠀with⠀preparations,⠀an⠀approach,⠀the⠀first⠀small⠀acts,⠀payment,⠀threat,⠀flight,⠀concealment,⠀or⠀whatever⠀begins⠀the⠀actual⠀offense,⠀then⠀follow⠀consequences⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀they⠀occurred.⠀Use⠀exact⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs:⠀a⠀struck⠀match,⠀a⠀turned⠀key,⠀a⠀folded⠀note,⠀water⠀rising⠀in⠀a⠀ditch.⠀Paratactic⠀and⠀can⠀join⠀steps⠀without⠀substituting⠀commentary⠀for⠀causality.⠀Let⠀practical⠀speech⠀occur⠀naturally⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀was⠀spoken,⠀carrying⠀the⠀bargains,⠀denials,⠀threats,⠀or⠀instructions⠀particular⠀participants⠀actually⠀made.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀telling⠀shifts⠀to⠀later⠀understanding,⠀mark⠀the⠀shift⠀not⠀with⠀theatrical⠀announcement⠀but⠀with⠀vantage:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀what⠀was⠀learned⠀after,⠀or⠀what⠀remains⠀unclear.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene.⠀The⠀memoir⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀remorse,⠀without⠀a⠀solved⠀case,⠀and⠀without⠀a⠀lesson⠀extracted⠀from⠀the⠀offense.⠀The⠀earlier⠀experience⠀remains⠀what⠀it⠀was;⠀the⠀later⠀account⠀remains⠀distinct.⠀Keep⠀all⠀authorized⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀beyond⠀what⠀the⠀memoir⠀records,⠀and⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀remembering,⠀composition,⠀or⠀other⠀continuation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀only⠀the⠀acts,⠀objects,⠀and⠀spoken⠀words⠀that⠀locate⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀keep⠀its⠀consequences⠀moving.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details:⠀the⠀knife's⠀handle⠀worn⠀smooth,⠀the⠀money⠀folded⠀lengthwise,⠀the⠀tire⠀cut⠀once⠀rather⠀than⠀twice.⠀Prefer⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀A⠀short⠀sentence⠀can⠀state⠀the⠀act;⠀a⠀longer⠀one⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀necessary⠀causal⠀relation.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀brevity⠀delete⠀why.⠀If⠀a⠀decision⠀required⠀hesitation,⠀show⠀the⠀pause⠀in⠀one⠀selected⠀gesture⠀or⠀line;⠀if⠀a⠀debt⠀led⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀visit,⠀include⠀the⠀visit⠀and⠀the⠀request.⠀Omission⠀leaves⠀the⠀sequence⠀inferable,⠀not⠀broken.\n\nDo⠀not⠀economize⠀voices⠀uniformly.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀give⠀a⠀one-word⠀answer;⠀another⠀may⠀explain⠀at⠀length⠀because⠀explanation⠀matters⠀to⠀that⠀person⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀negotiation⠀at⠀hand.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀contain⠀a⠀bargain,⠀a⠀withheld⠀motive,⠀or⠀a⠀conviction⠀in⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀idiom,⠀without⠀a⠀narrative⠀gloss⠀explaining⠀what⠀was⠀meant.⠀Surrounding⠀prose⠀supplies⠀only⠀the⠀placement⠀needed:⠀who⠀spoke,⠀what⠀was⠀done⠀while⠀speaking,⠀what⠀followed.⠀Let⠀an⠀exchange⠀sometimes⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀spoken⠀line.\n\nAllow⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀their⠀actual⠀extent.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀consequences⠀carefully,⠀hesitate,⠀count,⠀or⠀sit⠀with⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀act.⠀Do⠀not⠀shorten⠀that⠀thought⠀to⠀satisfy⠀a⠀word⠀limit⠀or⠀require⠀it⠀to⠀produce⠀an⠀immediate⠀outward⠀effect.⠀The⠀narration⠀remains⠀selective⠀in⠀what⠀it⠀reports,⠀not⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀experience.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀after⠀a⠀decisive⠀motion,⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀causal⠀sequence⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀chosen⠀role⠀and⠀knowledge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀face-forward.⠀Begin⠀inside⠀or⠀beside⠀a⠀concrete⠀moment⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀consequences—a⠀room⠀being⠀searched,⠀a⠀ledger⠀being⠀read,⠀a⠀runner⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀truck⠀stop,⠀a⠀wound⠀being⠀inspected.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀from⠀action⠀to⠀practical⠀speech⠀to⠀perception⠀to⠀recollection⠀and⠀back⠀without⠀transition⠀machinery⠀or⠀thematic⠀summaries.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀task⠀through⠀several⠀motions,⠀then⠀pause⠀on⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀then⠀resume⠀when⠀speech⠀or⠀another⠀act⠀takes⠀up⠀the⠀thread.⠀The⠀sequence⠀should⠀stay⠀legible⠀even⠀when⠀attention⠀drifts.\n\nLet⠀the⠀crime⠀live⠀through⠀material⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory⠀framing.⠀A⠀route,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀slip⠀of⠀paper⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀because⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀offense's⠀actual⠀sequence.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs;⠀join⠀acts⠀with⠀and⠀where⠀they⠀follow⠀directly.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀enters,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀trigger⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀take⠀only⠀the⠀space⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀would⠀give⠀it.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀object⠀a⠀symbol.⠀If⠀something⠀carries⠀private⠀meaning,⠀show⠀that⠀meaning⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀association,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator's⠀italicized⠀conclusion.\n\nPreserve⠀who⠀does⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀be⠀culprit,⠀accomplice,⠀victim,⠀investigator,⠀or⠀bystander;⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀that⠀person's⠀thought⠀while⠀others⠀remain⠀opaque.⠀Do⠀not⠀broadcast⠀private⠀perception⠀as⠀if⠀everyone⠀present⠀shares⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀plan⠀half-formed,⠀a⠀request⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀body⠀being⠀loaded⠀or⠀a⠀caller⠀not⠀picking⠀up.⠀No⠀inquiry,⠀arrest,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀phase⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀ongoing⠀conduct⠀naturally⠀stops⠀for⠀now.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise,⠀not⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Identify⠀how⠀the⠀two⠀participants⠀stand⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀offense:⠀one⠀may⠀have⠀done⠀it,⠀known⠀about⠀it,⠀profited,⠀or⠀hidden⠀it;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀be⠀protecting,⠀joining,⠀hunting,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀refusing.⠀Build⠀a⠀single⠀scene⠀around⠀an⠀exchange⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀both⠀the⠀bond⠀and⠀the⠀crime—a⠀shared⠀task⠀interrupted,⠀a⠀demand⠀made⠀across⠀a⠀familiar⠀threshold,⠀a⠀message⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀attached,⠀a⠀debt⠀recalled⠀over⠀a⠀meal.⠀Let⠀their⠀history⠀enter⠀through⠀those⠀concrete⠀channels:⠀the⠀word⠀they⠀have⠀said⠀many⠀times,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀checking⠀a⠀pocket⠀or⠀a⠀route,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀that⠀follows⠀one⠀person's⠀lie.\n\nGive⠀the⠀relationship⠀full⠀emotional⠀range⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀a⠀test.⠀Affection⠀can⠀persist⠀alongside⠀knowledge⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀done⠀wrong.⠀Anger⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀fear⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀broken⠀promise.⠀One⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀help⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀refuse,⠀agree,⠀lie,⠀or⠀bargain.⠀Private⠀motives⠀remain⠀private;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀withheld⠀fact⠀to⠀erupt⠀in⠀confession⠀or⠀every⠀argument⠀to⠀resolve⠀in⠀repair.⠀When⠀the⠀characters⠀speak,⠀let⠀their⠀speech⠀sound⠀like⠀theirs:⠀practical,⠀blunt,⠀tender,⠀or⠀evasive⠀as⠀their⠀actual⠀history⠀warrants.⠀Surrounding⠀prose⠀should⠀supply⠀their⠀acts⠀and⠀perceptions⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀offense's⠀concrete⠀sequence⠀legible⠀while⠀the⠀relationship⠀colors⠀it.⠀A⠀job⠀goes⠀forward,⠀a⠀body⠀is⠀moved,⠀evidence⠀is⠀buried⠀or⠀retrieved,⠀money⠀changes⠀hands.⠀Concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀carry⠀the⠀action;⠀paratactic⠀movement⠀keeps⠀one⠀thing⠀following⠀another⠀without⠀smoothing⠀the⠀cost.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀gesture⠀may⠀reappear⠀because⠀these⠀two⠀would⠀use⠀it,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀signal⠀growth,⠀forgiveness,⠀or⠀doom.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀warm,⠀still⠀strained,⠀or⠀still⠀unreadable,⠀while⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀continue⠀beyond⠀the⠀visible⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀as⠀if⠀repeating⠀an⠀account⠀already⠀in⠀circulation:⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀declarative⠀phrase⠀that⠀identifies⠀a⠀person⠀by⠀a⠀known⠀act⠀or⠀a⠀disputed⠀claim,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀line⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀kept:⠀The⠀third⠀time⠀the⠀dogs⠀came,⠀he⠀was⠀already⠀gone.⠀Such⠀an⠀opening⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀partially⠀wrong,⠀or⠀contested.⠀Then⠀descend⠀from⠀the⠀declaration⠀into⠀the⠀concrete⠀scene:⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀carried,⠀ridden,⠀broken,⠀said,⠀or⠀left⠀behind.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀exact⠀nouns⠀to⠀enact⠀the⠀deed⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath,⠀letting⠀the⠀paratactic⠀style⠀connect⠀one⠀act⠀to⠀another⠀until⠀the⠀sequence⠀stands⠀on⠀its⠀own.\n\nKeep⠀public⠀designation⠀separate⠀from⠀private⠀truth.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀fired⠀the⠀truck⠀or⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀would⠀not⠀speak,⠀while⠀his⠀own⠀recollection⠀or⠀fear⠀carries⠀a⠀different⠀account.⠀Do⠀not⠀correct⠀the⠀public⠀version⠀automatically⠀through⠀narrated⠀interiority;⠀instead,⠀let⠀private⠀experience⠀lie⠀visibly⠀beside⠀the⠀reputation.⠀Recurring⠀phrases⠀belong⠀to⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking:⠀they⠀may⠀return⠀at⠀moments⠀of⠀similar⠀danger,⠀similar⠀debt,⠀or⠀similar⠀refusal,⠀gaining⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀without⠀ceasing⠀to⠀be⠀the⠀community's⠀shorthand.⠀A⠀designation⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀entrance,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀something⠀people⠀might⠀actually⠀repeat,⠀not⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet.\n\nAllow⠀dialogue⠀to⠀enter⠀the⠀retelling⠀without⠀flattening⠀it.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀version⠀being⠀given,⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question;⠀a⠀speaker⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀story,⠀ignore⠀the⠀objection,⠀or⠀answer⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀register⠀altogether.⠀None⠀of⠀these⠀is⠀a⠀required⠀beat.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed,⠀while⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀are⠀still⠀unfolding,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀falling⠀silent.⠀The⠀relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀telling,⠀but⠀the⠀telling⠀does⠀not⠀settle⠀the⠀act's⠀full⠀meaning⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀wherever⠀the⠀telling,⠀deed,⠀or⠀private⠀reflection⠀actually⠀stops.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀crime⠀and⠀institutional⠀investigation⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Follow⠀a⠀relevant⠀report,⠀trace,⠀request⠀or⠀decision⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀institution's⠀available⠀roles⠀and⠀procedures.⠀The⠀chosen⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀an⠀official,⠀a⠀person⠀subject⠀to⠀the⠀process,⠀a⠀witness,⠀a⠀culprit⠀or⠀another⠀participant;⠀the⠀route⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀a⠀police⠀investigator.⠀State⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀actually⠀receive,⠀handle⠀or⠀decide,⠀distinguishing⠀a⠀messenger⠀from⠀someone⠀with⠀authority⠀to⠀act.\n\nGive⠀the⠀handling⠀concrete⠀material⠀form:⠀a⠀record⠀received,⠀a⠀place⠀visited,⠀an⠀item⠀compared,⠀an⠀instruction⠀passed⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀left⠀pending⠀where⠀those⠀acts⠀occur.⠀Linked⠀clauses⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀sequence⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀dependencies⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀step⠀into⠀a⠀discovery.⠀A⠀report⠀records⠀its⠀author's⠀claims⠀and⠀sources,⠀which⠀may⠀include⠀direct⠀observation,⠀hearsay,⠀inference⠀or⠀deliberate⠀invention.⠀Trace⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀actually⠀knows⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀the⠀file⠀as⠀everything⠀that⠀happened⠀or⠀one⠀official's⠀knowledge⠀as⠀universal.\n\nLet⠀competence,⠀error,⠀genuine⠀help⠀and⠀refusal⠀follow⠀actual⠀people⠀and⠀conditions.⠀Material⠀circumstances⠀matter⠀where⠀supported,⠀without⠀inventing⠀weather,⠀fatigue,⠀corruption⠀or⠀a⠀hidden⠀price.⠀Speech⠀keeps⠀each⠀person's⠀real⠀register,⠀and⠀all⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀beyond⠀public⠀records⠀or⠀answers.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀handling,⠀waiting,⠀speech⠀or⠀continuing⠀thought⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀pause,⠀new⠀evidence,⠀solved⠀case⠀or⠀punishment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀action⠀lines⠀as⠀concrete⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀events.⠀A⠀hand⠀sets⠀the⠀crowbar⠀on⠀the⠀seat.⠀The⠀engine⠀ticks.⠀Rain⠀moves⠀across⠀the⠀windshield.⠀The⠀door⠀opens⠀onto⠀a⠀dark⠀hallway.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀exact⠀nouns:⠀the⠀knife⠀cuts⠀the⠀tape,⠀the⠀boot⠀scrapes⠀the⠀step,⠀the⠀cash⠀drawer⠀slides⠀out.⠀Keep⠀each⠀action⠀block⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard⠀in⠀that⠀location,⠀and⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀place⠀or⠀time⠀with⠀a⠀clean⠀scene⠀heading.\n\nLet⠀cuts⠀join⠀separate⠀occasions⠀without⠀altering⠀their⠀actual⠀order⠀or⠀cause.⠀A⠀cut⠀from⠀the⠀emptied⠀safe⠀to⠀the⠀pawnshop⠀counter⠀shows⠀a⠀consequence;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀tell⠀the⠀cast⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀inferred.⠀A⠀cut⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀later⠀shows⠀what⠀has⠀changed:⠀the⠀drawer⠀is⠀closed,⠀the⠀lamp⠀is⠀on,⠀the⠀coat⠀is⠀gone.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀real⠀chronology.⠀If⠀the⠀money⠀was⠀taken⠀before⠀the⠀alarm⠀sounded,⠀the⠀cut⠀cannot⠀present⠀the⠀alarm⠀first⠀and⠀the⠀theft⠀second⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀alarm⠀caused⠀it.\n\nUse⠀speaker⠀cues⠀for⠀practical⠀exchanges.⠀Characters⠀may⠀talk⠀during⠀actual⠀work,⠀waiting⠀or⠀stillness;⠀loading⠀a⠀truck,⠀wiping⠀a⠀counter⠀or⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀gate⠀belongs⠀only⠀where⠀supported.⠀Their⠀speech⠀carries⠀bargains,⠀refusals,⠀warnings,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀business⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀A⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀short⠀and⠀plain:⠀\"Leave⠀it.\"⠀\"I⠀already⠀did.\"⠀\"Then⠀we⠀go.\"⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀witty⠀or⠀every⠀silence⠀meaningful.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀separate⠀from⠀performed⠀voice-over.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀thought,⠀memory,⠀or⠀feeling⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀material;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀voice-over⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀action.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀driver⠀fears⠀while⠀the⠀passenger⠀sees⠀only⠀his⠀hands⠀on⠀the⠀wheel.\n\nLet⠀the⠀crime's⠀acts⠀and⠀consequences⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀and⠀leave⠀behind.⠀A⠀scheme⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀tools⠀gathered,⠀the⠀route⠀taken,⠀the⠀door⠀forced,⠀the⠀receipt⠀kept.⠀Its⠀aftermath⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀blood⠀on⠀the⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀empty⠀lot,⠀the⠀unwashed⠀glass,⠀the⠀phone⠀ringing⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀chase,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀phase⠀in⠀every⠀scene.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀experience;⠀completion,⠀a⠀pending⠀call⠀or⠀a⠀cut⠀is⠀possible⠀but⠀not⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nTrack⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Who⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀door,⠀reach⠀the⠀drawer,⠀hear⠀the⠀step⠀on⠀the⠀stair,⠀or⠀stand⠀between⠀two⠀others⠀is⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀blocking,⠀not⠀convenience.⠀Use⠀stage⠀directions⠀to⠀establish⠀positions⠀and⠀physical⠀business:⠀a⠀character⠀crosses⠀to⠀the⠀window,⠀sets⠀down⠀the⠀bag,⠀turns⠀the⠀lock,⠀picks⠀up⠀the⠀knife.⠀Concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀keep⠀the⠀business⠀stageable:⠀the⠀chair⠀scrapes,⠀the⠀paper⠀tears,⠀the⠀lid⠀comes⠀off⠀the⠀box.\n\nLet⠀speech⠀and⠀movement⠀carry⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀consequences⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀crime⠀onstage.⠀Preparation⠀can⠀be⠀staged⠀through⠀the⠀tools⠀laid⠀out,⠀the⠀route⠀rehearsed,⠀the⠀money⠀counted.⠀Aftermath⠀can⠀be⠀staged⠀through⠀the⠀coat⠀dropped⠀on⠀the⠀floor,⠀the⠀drawer⠀left⠀open,⠀the⠀phone⠀unplugged.⠀A⠀confrontation⠀can⠀happen⠀across⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀or⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀one⠀character⠀cannot⠀leave.⠀The⠀physical⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀speakers⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀do.\n\nKeep⠀supported⠀offstage⠀activity⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀sees.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀enter⠀with⠀mud⠀on⠀his⠀shoes,⠀a⠀torn⠀sleeve,⠀or⠀a⠀bag⠀he⠀did⠀not⠀have⠀before;⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀infer⠀what⠀happened⠀offstage⠀without⠀the⠀play⠀certifying⠀an⠀unavailable⠀event⠀or⠀pretending⠀to⠀show⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀bring⠀the⠀offstage⠀event⠀into⠀the⠀visible⠀space⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀moves⠀there.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀asides⠀and⠀public⠀directions.⠀An⠀aside⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀an⠀audience;⠀a⠀stage⠀direction⠀describes⠀visible⠀business.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀parenthetical⠀that⠀turns⠀thought⠀into⠀action.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀woman⠀at⠀the⠀table⠀fears⠀while⠀the⠀man⠀at⠀the⠀door⠀sees⠀only⠀that⠀she⠀has⠀not⠀moved.\n\nUse⠀paratactic⠀movement⠀in⠀the⠀directions⠀where⠀it⠀serves⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence,⠀while⠀dialogue⠀retains⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀register.⠀One⠀action⠀follows⠀another:⠀he⠀sets⠀down⠀the⠀glass,⠀she⠀picks⠀up⠀the⠀envelope,⠀he⠀turns⠀to⠀the⠀door.⠀Let⠀clauses⠀follow⠀the⠀needed⠀material⠀or⠀inward⠀development⠀without⠀making⠀stopped⠀work⠀require⠀short⠀prose.⠀A⠀long⠀speech⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀bargain⠀or⠀a⠀threat;⠀a⠀short⠀line⠀can⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀will⠀not⠀say.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀action,⠀speech⠀or⠀ongoing⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀stage⠀action⠀to⠀pause.⠀The⠀crime⠀remains⠀consequential⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀confession,⠀arrest,⠀or⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaday::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀move⠀by⠀association⠀through⠀actual⠀sensation,⠀received⠀words,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀private⠀wording.⠀The⠀syntax⠀follows⠀that⠀movement:⠀a⠀smell⠀of⠀gasoline⠀brings⠀back⠀the⠀garage,⠀the⠀garage⠀brings⠀back⠀the⠀man's⠀hand⠀on⠀the⠀pump,⠀the⠀hand⠀brings⠀back⠀what⠀he⠀said⠀about⠀the⠀money.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀associations⠀grounded:⠀the⠀rag⠀in⠀the⠀bucket,⠀the⠀wire⠀on⠀the⠀fence,⠀the⠀blood⠀drying⠀on⠀the⠀step.⠀Paratactic⠀clauses⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement⠀without⠀smoothing⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀logical⠀report:⠀one⠀thing⠀comes,⠀then⠀another,⠀then⠀a⠀third.\n\nDistinguish⠀imagined⠀acts⠀from⠀memory⠀and⠀current⠀facts.⠀A⠀thought⠀of⠀the⠀gun⠀in⠀the⠀drawer⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀remembering⠀the⠀gun⠀in⠀the⠀drawer,⠀and⠀neither⠀is⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀the⠀drawer⠀standing⠀open⠀now.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀tense,⠀through⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention,⠀or⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀correction:⠀he⠀thought⠀of⠀the⠀window⠀but⠀the⠀window⠀was⠀nailed⠀shut.⠀Known⠀motives⠀remain⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀without⠀announcing⠀them.\n\nLet⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀and⠀interruption⠀enter⠀the⠀braid.⠀A⠀cramp⠀in⠀the⠀hand,⠀a⠀knock⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀child's⠀voice⠀from⠀the⠀yard,⠀the⠀cold⠀coming⠀through⠀the⠀floor:⠀these⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement,⠀not⠀distractions⠀from⠀it.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀thought⠀unfinished⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀lose⠀it⠀entirely.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀association⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀crime,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀crime-related⠀memory⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀proof.\n\nProse⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀elapsed⠀events.⠀A⠀long⠀passage⠀of⠀thought⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes⠀to⠀cross⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀kettle;⠀a⠀short⠀passage⠀can⠀cover⠀the⠀same⠀interval.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀insight,⠀a⠀spoken⠀response,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀decision⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀interiority.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀keep⠀moving⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀sits⠀still.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀crime's⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀available⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention:⠀the⠀money⠀counted⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀key⠀turned⠀in⠀the⠀lock,⠀the⠀phone⠀number⠀written⠀on⠀the⠀receipt.⠀These⠀details⠀can⠀recur⠀with⠀changed⠀significance⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀announcing⠀their⠀meaning.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀moving,⠀with⠀no⠀completed⠀action⠀and⠀no⠀forced⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀criminal⠀milieu⠀or⠀consequences⠀through⠀actual⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Keep⠀sender,⠀recipient⠀or⠀channel⠀and⠀relevant⠀time⠀legible.⠀Practical⠀wording⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀request,⠀claim,⠀bargain⠀or⠀answer,⠀while⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀and⠀register⠀remain⠀distinct.⠀Select⠀the⠀exact⠀objects,⠀amounts,⠀places⠀or⠀acts⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀exchange⠀without⠀giving⠀every⠀sender⠀the⠀same⠀spare⠀voice.\n\nDistinguish⠀composition,⠀sending,⠀delivery,⠀reading,⠀editing⠀and⠀deletion⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀channel⠀and⠀events.⠀A⠀message⠀can⠀arrive⠀after⠀it⠀was⠀sent;⠀a⠀deletion⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀what⠀copies⠀or⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀remain.⠀Track⠀which⠀content⠀each⠀person⠀actually⠀received⠀or⠀learned⠀by⠀another⠀supported⠀means,⠀preserving⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀beyond⠀the⠀current⠀exchange.⠀Receipts⠀and⠀timestamps⠀alone⠀prove⠀neither⠀intent⠀nor⠀understanding,⠀and⠀a⠀known⠀culprit⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀hidden⠀from⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀create⠀suspense.\n\nKeep⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀distinct⠀from⠀both⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀and⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀Actual⠀thoughts⠀may⠀be⠀expressed⠀in⠀a⠀message,⠀but⠀the⠀transcript⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀whole⠀mind;⠀full⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation⠀beyond⠀the⠀channel.⠀Other⠀people⠀gain⠀access⠀only⠀by⠀supported⠀means,⠀not⠀because⠀narration⠀shows⠀it.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀during⠀composition,⠀transmission,⠀reception⠀or⠀continuing⠀thought⠀without⠀an⠀incriminating⠀typo,⠀invented⠀delay,⠀public⠀reply⠀or⠀completed⠀criminal⠀phase.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nSet⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀concrete⠀detail:⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀road,⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀hand.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀exact⠀nouns⠀so⠀the⠀illustrated⠀moment⠀is⠀legible:⠀the⠀lamp⠀hangs⠀over⠀the⠀desk,⠀the⠀rain⠀streaks⠀the⠀window,⠀the⠀knife⠀lies⠀on⠀the⠀cloth.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting⠀brief⠀enough⠀to⠀leave⠀room⠀for⠀the⠀scene's⠀movement,⠀and⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀place⠀cleanly.\n\nAttribute⠀dialogue⠀clearly⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀practical⠀exchanges.⠀Characters⠀speak⠀while⠀working,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀watching:⠀\"You⠀brought⠀the⠀wrong⠀bag.\"⠀\"It⠀was⠀all⠀he⠀had.\"⠀\"Then⠀we⠀go⠀back.\"⠀Their⠀speech⠀can⠀hold⠀bargains,⠀refusals,⠀and⠀withheld⠀motives⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀quips.⠀A⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀short,⠀or⠀it⠀can⠀extend⠀into⠀a⠀longer⠀exchange⠀when⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀require⠀it.\n\nFollow⠀public⠀events⠀and⠀authorized⠀focal⠀interpretation⠀in⠀their⠀actual⠀causal⠀order,⠀allowing⠀thought⠀before,⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀outward⠀act.⠀A⠀material⠀detail⠀or⠀an⠀expression⠀can⠀orient⠀attention:⠀the⠀blood⠀on⠀the⠀cuff,⠀the⠀way⠀she⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀truck⠀outside.⠀But⠀orientation⠀is⠀not⠀proof.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀detail⠀and⠀misread⠀it,⠀or⠀notice⠀it⠀and⠀say⠀nothing,⠀or⠀notice⠀it⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning.⠀A⠀known⠀culprit⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀hidden⠀to⠀sustain⠀the⠀scene;⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀know⠀who⠀did⠀it⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀working⠀it⠀out.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀private⠀motives⠀and⠀feelings⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀What⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀thinks⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀speaks,⠀what⠀she⠀remembers⠀while⠀she⠀waits,⠀what⠀he⠀fears⠀while⠀he⠀drives:⠀these⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀layer⠀to⠀be⠀skipped.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.⠀A⠀smile⠀can⠀mean⠀nothing;⠀a⠀blank⠀face⠀can⠀conceal⠀a⠀plan;⠀a⠀shaking⠀hand⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀cold⠀or⠀fatigue.\n\nLet⠀the⠀crime's⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀carry⠀the⠀sequence:⠀the⠀money⠀counted,⠀the⠀door⠀forced,⠀the⠀receipt⠀kept,⠀the⠀phone⠀dropped⠀in⠀the⠀ditch.⠀These⠀details⠀can⠀recur⠀with⠀changed⠀significance⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀announcing⠀their⠀meaning.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀act,⠀pending⠀question⠀or⠀pause.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadadbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀through-line⠀through⠀exact⠀concrete⠀particulars.⠀What⠀is⠀underway⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀tools⠀gathered,⠀the⠀route⠀taken,⠀the⠀money⠀owed,⠀the⠀door⠀left⠀open.⠀What⠀changes⠀locally⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀object⠀moved,⠀the⠀message⠀received,⠀the⠀wound⠀dressed,⠀the⠀road⠀closed.⠀What⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀key⠀still⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀phone⠀still⠀charged,⠀the⠀truck⠀still⠀running.⠀Recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀prior⠀particular⠀briefly⠀when⠀it⠀matters:⠀the⠀gate⠀that⠀was⠀locked,⠀the⠀name⠀that⠀was⠀given,⠀the⠀amount⠀that⠀was⠀counted.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀sequence⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀and⠀motives⠀while⠀actual⠀developments⠀alter⠀or⠀leave⠀conditions⠀unchanged.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀knew⠀the⠀money⠀was⠀in⠀the⠀bag⠀does⠀not⠀forget⠀it⠀because⠀a⠀new⠀reply⠀begins.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀earlier⠀lie⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀later⠀truth-telling,⠀whether⠀it⠀follows⠀changed⠀aims,⠀stable⠀motives,⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀a⠀mistake⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀reason;⠀do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀earlier⠀event.⠀New⠀facts⠀can⠀qualify⠀an⠀old⠀explanation⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀old⠀event.⠀If⠀the⠀lock⠀was⠀repaired⠀between⠀visits,⠀that⠀repair⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀history;⠀it⠀cannot⠀be⠀omitted⠀so⠀the⠀second⠀visit⠀falsely⠀proves⠀the⠀first⠀account⠀wrong.\n\nUse⠀paratactic⠀movement⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀installment⠀readable.⠀One⠀action⠀follows⠀another:⠀he⠀checks⠀the⠀fuel,⠀she⠀counts⠀the⠀bills,⠀the⠀dog⠀crosses⠀the⠀yard,⠀the⠀light⠀goes⠀on⠀in⠀the⠀house.⠀Let⠀the⠀clauses⠀accumulate⠀when⠀the⠀work⠀accumulates,⠀and⠀give⠀continued⠀thought⠀or⠀attention⠀its⠀needed⠀extent⠀when⠀work⠀stops.⠀A⠀long⠀paragraph⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀whole⠀sequence⠀of⠀a⠀search⠀or⠀a⠀wait;⠀a⠀short⠀sentence⠀can⠀mark⠀what⠀does⠀not⠀happen.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀What⠀the⠀driver⠀thinks⠀while⠀the⠀passenger⠀sleeps,⠀what⠀the⠀woman⠀remembers⠀while⠀she⠀watches⠀the⠀road,⠀what⠀the⠀man⠀fears⠀while⠀he⠀waits⠀for⠀the⠀call:⠀these⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀installment,⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀layer⠀to⠀be⠀skipped.⠀The⠀interiority⠀can⠀continue⠀independently⠀of⠀any⠀visible⠀decision.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀think⠀through⠀a⠀problem⠀and⠀still⠀do⠀nothing⠀about⠀it⠀in⠀this⠀reply.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀work,⠀speech,⠀thought⠀or⠀composition⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀in-world⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀act.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀new⠀clue,⠀a⠀completed⠀criminal⠀phase,⠀an⠀exposure,⠀or⠀a⠀punishment⠀in⠀every⠀reply.⠀The⠀crime⠀remains⠀consequential⠀across⠀installments⠀without⠀a⠀guaranteed⠀solution⠀or⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀needing⠀something⠀from⠀another⠀person⠀inside⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath.⠀Anchor⠀that⠀need⠀in⠀concrete⠀particulars:⠀the⠀debt⠀it⠀admits,⠀the⠀loyalty⠀it⠀tests,⠀the⠀risk⠀it⠀exposes,⠀or⠀the⠀old⠀hurt⠀it⠀reopens.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀asking,⠀returning,⠀apologizing,⠀or⠀failing⠀to⠀ask⠀in⠀their⠀actual⠀circumstances,⠀so⠀the⠀request⠀stays⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀relationship⠀and⠀this⠀criminal⠀situation.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀broad⠀claim⠀appears—the⠀job⠀will⠀be⠀simple,⠀the⠀money⠀will⠀fix⠀things,⠀nobody⠀will⠀get⠀hurt,⠀the⠀arrangement⠀is⠀fair—place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀term⠀that⠀gives⠀it⠀weight:⠀the⠀locked⠀door,⠀the⠀short⠀timetable,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀answering,⠀the⠀amount⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀cover⠀what⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀source⠀may⠀believe⠀the⠀claim,⠀distrust⠀it,⠀or⠀need⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀true;⠀the⠀gap⠀itself⠀can⠀be⠀painful,⠀comic,⠀or⠀both.⠀Let⠀that⠀precise⠀contrast⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀moment,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀joke.\n\nRender⠀the⠀emotional⠀work⠀as⠀live⠀interiority.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀their⠀own⠀hesitation,⠀rehearse⠀words,⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀speak,⠀or⠀feel⠀the⠀exposure⠀of⠀a⠀direct⠀reply.⠀Strain⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀conversation⠀itself:⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀deflection,⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀that⠀dodges⠀the⠀emotional⠀one,⠀or⠀an⠀answer⠀that⠀lands⠀harder⠀than⠀either⠀person⠀expected.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀help,⠀refuse,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀offer⠀something⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀meet⠀the⠀need;⠀keep⠀their⠀response⠀their⠀own⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀plot⠀convenience.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀crime⠀material's⠀real⠀stakes:⠀evidence,⠀money,⠀access,⠀protection,⠀or⠀an⠀act's⠀consequences⠀remain⠀serious⠀and⠀unresolved⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀betrayal,⠀punishment,⠀wrong⠀answer,⠀or⠀changed⠀bond.⠀The⠀request⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀pending,⠀the⠀relationship⠀strained,⠀the⠀practical⠀problem⠀unsolved.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀remains⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say⠀everything⠀aloud.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nRun⠀the⠀response⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀which⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀is⠀moving;⠀attribute⠀every⠀line⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀speaker⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀clarity.⠀Keep⠀user-owned⠀character⠀actions,⠀speech,⠀and⠀decisions⠀under⠀the⠀user's⠀control,⠀and⠀preserve⠀established⠀NPC⠀interests,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀narrative⠀person.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀plan,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀role⠀claim⠀appears—the⠀job⠀will⠀be⠀simple,⠀the⠀contact⠀is⠀reliable,⠀the⠀hiding⠀place⠀is⠀safe—give⠀it⠀a⠀concrete⠀practical⠀term⠀within⠀the⠀playable⠀space:⠀the⠀blocked⠀route,⠀the⠀missing⠀tool,⠀the⠀person⠀not⠀where⠀they⠀were⠀supposed⠀to⠀be.⠀Let⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀large⠀assurance⠀and⠀small⠀actual⠀logistics⠀play⠀out⠀through⠀the⠀scene,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀claim⠀collapse⠀into⠀comedy⠀or⠀failure.⠀Competent⠀cooperation⠀can⠀proceed,⠀and⠀a⠀practical⠀obstacle⠀can⠀be⠀handled⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀stays⠀true⠀to⠀the⠀crime⠀situation.\n\nGive⠀each⠀NPC⠀a⠀distinct⠀response⠀to⠀pressure⠀and⠀absurdity⠀based⠀on⠀their⠀temperament⠀and⠀stake.⠀One⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀serious⠀problem⠀as⠀routine,⠀another⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀same⠀problem⠀ridiculous,⠀another⠀may⠀become⠀frightened⠀or⠀angry.⠀Do⠀not⠀give⠀all⠀characters⠀the⠀same⠀comic⠀narrator's⠀register.⠀If⠀someone⠀digresses,⠀let⠀the⠀tangent⠀stay⠀attached⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀care⠀about⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀it⠀back⠀into⠀the⠀main⠀action⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.\n\nShow⠀what⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀suspects,⠀wants,⠀or⠀decides⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀keep⠀that⠀private⠀material⠀unavailable⠀to⠀others⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives⠀and⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀refuse,⠀bargain,⠀or⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀aims.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀scene⠀boundary⠀without⠀owing⠀a⠀clue,⠀accusation,⠀joke,⠀or⠀new⠀threat;⠀the⠀plan⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀forming⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀problem⠀may⠀remain⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀crime⠀scene⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism.⠀Ground⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀scheme⠀in⠀the⠀concrete⠀distribution⠀of⠀access,⠀time,⠀money,⠀responsibility,⠀or⠀benefit:⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀the⠀building,⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀key,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀is⠀paid,⠀who⠀is⠀owed,⠀who⠀signs,⠀who⠀takes⠀the⠀risk,⠀who⠀is⠀left⠀to⠀explain.⠀Follow⠀the⠀living⠀allocation⠀in⠀ordinary⠀transactions,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀inconveniences⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀abstract⠀moral⠀summary.\n\nWhenever⠀a⠀broad⠀account⠀appears—the⠀operation⠀is⠀efficient,⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀is⠀loyal,⠀the⠀boss⠀is⠀generous,⠀the⠀arrangement⠀is⠀traditional—place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀specific⠀person⠀whose⠀use⠀of⠀it⠀bears⠀the⠀weight:⠀the⠀shopkeeper⠀staying⠀open⠀late,⠀the⠀driver⠀not⠀told⠀the⠀whole⠀route,⠀the⠀relative⠀lending⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀worker⠀paid⠀in⠀promises.⠀Let⠀that⠀precise⠀practical⠀term⠀expose⠀proportion,⠀whether⠀the⠀account⠀and⠀use⠀match⠀or⠀diverge.⠀The⠀gap⠀or⠀fit⠀does⠀the⠀satirical⠀work;⠀ridicule⠀is⠀not⠀required,⠀though⠀a⠀satirical⠀judgment⠀retains⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀circumstances.\n\nKeep⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀or⠀repeats⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀observes⠀or⠀knows.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀circulate⠀an⠀official⠀explanation,⠀family⠀maxim,⠀business⠀slogan,⠀or⠀rumor⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀certifying⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀can⠀remain⠀visible⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confrontation.⠀Stay⠀true⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀community's⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀local⠀conditions;⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀generic⠀setting⠀or⠀cast⠀identity⠀for⠀the⠀route.\n\nRender⠀private⠀experience⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀character⠀under⠀narrator⠀permissions:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀comply⠀outwardly⠀while⠀privately⠀calculating,⠀resenting,⠀doubting,⠀or⠀noticing⠀a⠀telling⠀detail.⠀Keep⠀that⠀interiority⠀from⠀spreading⠀to⠀other⠀characters⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀already⠀grants⠀them⠀access.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement⠀unchanged,⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀circulating,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀still⠀developing;⠀no⠀confession,⠀arrest,⠀reform,⠀or⠀completed⠀satire⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaead::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀through⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀economical⠀transitions⠀that⠀carry⠀actual⠀movement,⠀weight,⠀distance,⠀wear,⠀and⠀cost.⠀Render⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀sticks,⠀the⠀bag⠀heavier⠀than⠀expected,⠀the⠀stairs⠀that⠀take⠀too⠀long,⠀the⠀lock⠀that⠀resists,⠀the⠀blood⠀drying⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀money⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀fit⠀in⠀the⠀pocket.⠀Let⠀one⠀concrete⠀fact⠀lead⠀directly⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀summary⠀padding;⠀retain⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀broad⠀account⠀or⠀plan⠀meets⠀the⠀world—the⠀route⠀is⠀clear,⠀the⠀contact⠀is⠀solid,⠀the⠀timing⠀is⠀fine,⠀the⠀risk⠀is⠀acceptable—give⠀it⠀a⠀particular⠀material⠀condition:⠀the⠀traffic,⠀the⠀broken⠀light,⠀the⠀missing⠀tool,⠀the⠀wet⠀floor,⠀the⠀short⠀reach,⠀the⠀tired⠀hand.⠀The⠀contrast⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀comic⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀failure.⠀Show⠀competent⠀execution⠀working⠀through⠀difficulty,⠀so⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀large⠀wording⠀and⠀small⠀real⠀term⠀makes⠀the⠀labor⠀legible⠀and⠀keeps⠀the⠀crime's⠀practical⠀stakes⠀concrete.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀harm⠀and⠀supplied⠀stakes⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀damage.⠀Where⠀violence,⠀injury,⠀or⠀loss⠀exists⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀render⠀it⠀with⠀concrete⠀physical⠀consequence;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀wound,⠀a⠀weapon,⠀or⠀an⠀omitted⠀condition⠀just⠀to⠀raise⠀pressure.⠀Seriousness⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀at⠀stake:⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀evidence,⠀the⠀person⠀waiting,⠀the⠀time⠀spent,⠀the⠀accepted⠀risk.\n\nGive⠀roughness⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀speakers⠀who⠀own⠀it.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀short,⠀hard⠀sentences;⠀another⠀may⠀stay⠀careful,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀polite⠀under⠀the⠀same⠀pressure.⠀Keep⠀full⠀feeling⠀and⠀thought⠀available⠀beyond⠀reasoning⠀usefulness⠀or⠀an⠀immediate⠀next⠀act:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀stop,⠀remember,⠀regret,⠀or⠀notice⠀something⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀next.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀unfinished,⠀the⠀plan⠀still⠀moving,⠀or⠀the⠀cost⠀still⠀being⠀counted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀document⠀the⠀situation⠀calls⠀for—a⠀note⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀counter,⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀after⠀the⠀fact,⠀a⠀text⠀exchange,⠀a⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀a⠀signed⠀statement,⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀letter—with⠀its⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀record⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀moment⠀in⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath;⠀do⠀not⠀rotate⠀formats⠀for⠀variety.\n\nOrder⠀records⠀by⠀their⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀crime,⠀the⠀participants'⠀interests,⠀or⠀its⠀human⠀aftermath.⠀Let⠀a⠀broad⠀account⠀and⠀a⠀precise⠀practical⠀term⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀document⠀or⠀in⠀adjacent⠀ones:⠀a⠀letter⠀promising⠀everything⠀is⠀under⠀control⠀beside⠀a⠀receipt⠀showing⠀the⠀shortfall,⠀a⠀report⠀describing⠀a⠀routine⠀check⠀beside⠀a⠀note⠀about⠀the⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀claiming⠀a⠀meeting⠀time⠀beside⠀a⠀conflict⠀in⠀the⠀time⠀record.⠀Show⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀account⠀and⠀fact,⠀whether⠀they⠀match⠀or⠀diverge,⠀without⠀inventing⠀contradictions⠀or⠀adding⠀omniscient⠀commentary;⠀a⠀timestamp⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀how⠀well⠀a⠀meeting⠀went.\n\nRespect⠀what⠀each⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀author's⠀situation.⠀A⠀truthful⠀or⠀false⠀claim⠀remains⠀as⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀document⠀confess⠀or⠀turn⠀every⠀omission⠀into⠀a⠀tactic.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀writer⠀knew⠀at⠀composition⠀from⠀what⠀a⠀later⠀annotation,⠀marginal⠀note,⠀or⠀subsequent⠀record⠀reveals.⠀A⠀kept⠀or⠀unsent⠀account⠀may⠀remain⠀meaningful⠀without⠀a⠀later⠀discovery,⠀correction,⠀or⠀reply.\n\nKeep⠀full⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀artifact.⠀The⠀document⠀contains⠀only⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀record;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀their⠀complete⠀mind.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀interiority,⠀render⠀the⠀thought,⠀hesitation,⠀fear,⠀or⠀relief⠀that⠀preceded,⠀accompanied,⠀or⠀followed⠀the⠀writing⠀as⠀separate⠀private⠀experience,⠀clearly⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀record⠀unfinished,⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀filed⠀where⠀no⠀one⠀will⠀read⠀it⠀soon;⠀no⠀discovery,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀paper⠀trail⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀crime⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀care⠀delivered⠀in⠀its⠀concrete⠀form:⠀the⠀tea⠀made⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀likes⠀it,⠀the⠀blanket⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀chair,⠀the⠀door⠀locked⠀quietly⠀so⠀someone⠀can⠀sleep,⠀the⠀food⠀set⠀aside,⠀the⠀message⠀sent⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀time,⠀the⠀seat⠀saved,⠀the⠀small⠀errand⠀done⠀without⠀being⠀asked.⠀Keep⠀the⠀care⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀and⠀the⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀gesture.\n\nWhen⠀someone⠀says⠀they⠀will⠀take⠀care⠀of⠀it,⠀make⠀it⠀right,⠀keep⠀them⠀safe,⠀or⠀sort⠀it⠀out,⠀place⠀that⠀broad⠀account⠀beside⠀the⠀actual⠀small⠀or⠀practical⠀act⠀that⠀gives⠀it⠀human⠀scale.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀promise⠀to⠀collapse⠀into⠀failure⠀or⠀comedy:⠀sincere⠀planned⠀or⠀spontaneous⠀care⠀may⠀be⠀delivered⠀competently,⠀and⠀the⠀recipient⠀may⠀accept⠀it,⠀overlook⠀it,⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀or⠀be⠀too⠀tired⠀to⠀respond.⠀No⠀hidden⠀design,⠀thanks,⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀required.\n\nPreserve⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀alongside⠀the⠀warmth.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀care⠀while⠀remaining⠀angry,⠀frightened,⠀or⠀suspicious;⠀another⠀may⠀offer⠀care⠀while⠀still⠀lying,⠀withholding,⠀or⠀planning⠀something⠀the⠀recipient⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀real⠀without⠀removing⠀the⠀crime⠀material's⠀actual⠀stakes.\n\nAllow⠀danger,⠀deception,⠀or⠀refusal⠀to⠀remain⠀possible⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀comfort⠀into⠀a⠀trap.⠀A⠀kind⠀act⠀may⠀be⠀exactly⠀what⠀it⠀appears,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀sit⠀beside⠀a⠀threat,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀still-moving⠀consequence.⠀Offer⠀no⠀absolution⠀or⠀guaranteed⠀safety⠀from⠀the⠀style.⠀Let⠀private⠀feeling⠀stay⠀uncertain⠀or⠀pleasurable,⠀and⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀care⠀received,⠀the⠀problem⠀present,⠀or⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unsettled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nFrame⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀in⠀composed⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀deliberately⠀from⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀room,⠀conversation,⠀or⠀transaction.⠀Establish⠀the⠀conditions⠀that⠀give⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀meaning—the⠀street's⠀reputation,⠀the⠀family's⠀history⠀with⠀the⠀business,⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀lease,⠀the⠀custom⠀that⠀decides⠀who⠀is⠀trusted,⠀the⠀public⠀version⠀already⠀circulating—and⠀sustain⠀that⠀wider⠀frame⠀through⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀narration⠀carry⠀the⠀transition⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀broad⠀explanation⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀or⠀a⠀character's⠀speech—the⠀neighborhood⠀has⠀always⠀handled⠀its⠀own⠀affairs,⠀the⠀firm⠀looks⠀after⠀its⠀people,⠀the⠀system⠀works⠀if⠀you⠀know⠀the⠀right⠀person—place⠀beside⠀it⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀condition⠀that⠀gives⠀it⠀weight:⠀the⠀rent⠀still⠀unpaid,⠀the⠀cousin⠀not⠀told,⠀the⠀form⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀signed⠀by⠀noon,⠀the⠀favor⠀already⠀used.⠀Follow⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀detail⠀even⠀into⠀a⠀digression;⠀that⠀relation⠀can⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀tangent⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀main⠀action⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.\n\nKeep⠀narrative⠀access⠀and⠀cast⠀diction⠀distinct⠀and⠀owned.⠀The⠀formal⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀roughly,⠀evasively,⠀or⠀in⠀local⠀idiom⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀sustains⠀its⠀composed⠀distance.⠀Allow⠀permitted⠀overlap⠀or⠀free⠀indirect⠀phrasing,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀uniform⠀eloquence⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀separation⠀between⠀narrator⠀and⠀character⠀voices.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀crime⠀material's⠀serious⠀stakes⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀feeling.⠀Consequences—the⠀debt,⠀the⠀injury,⠀the⠀exposure,⠀the⠀loyalty⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀cost⠀someone⠀something—remain⠀real.⠀Render⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀understands,⠀fears,⠀wants,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀admit⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀No⠀high⠀status,⠀false⠀claim,⠀new⠀verdict,⠀compulsory⠀joke,⠀or⠀completed⠀qualification⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀still⠀in⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀practical⠀problem⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nSituate⠀the⠀telling⠀first:⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom,⠀on⠀what⠀occasion,⠀and⠀why⠀this⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀given⠀now.⠀The⠀occasion⠀may⠀be⠀persuasion,⠀entertainment,⠀delay,⠀warning,⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀mixture⠀of⠀these.⠀Give⠀the⠀listeners⠀a⠀concrete⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀telling:⠀they⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀decide⠀something,⠀wait⠀for⠀someone,⠀keep⠀a⠀confidence,⠀or⠀simply⠀choose⠀how⠀long⠀to⠀listen.\n\nMove⠀between⠀two⠀registers⠀within⠀the⠀told⠀account.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀offers⠀a⠀broad⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀consequence,⠀stay⠀with⠀the⠀large⠀claim⠀long⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀listeners⠀to⠀feel⠀its⠀shape.⠀Then⠀shift⠀into⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀terms⠀that⠀make⠀it⠀work:⠀who⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀where,⠀what⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀obtained⠀or⠀overlooked,⠀which⠀small⠀failure⠀mattered,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀alternation⠀between⠀these⠀registers⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀emphasis⠀and⠀the⠀occasion's⠀pressure.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀narrator's⠀comment⠀about⠀absurdity;⠀any⠀actual⠀explanation⠀or⠀judgment⠀retains⠀its⠀own⠀voice⠀and⠀permissions.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀two⠀levels⠀distinct⠀in⠀knowledge⠀and⠀access.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀recount⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀knew,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀learned⠀later,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀chooses⠀to⠀present.⠀The⠀outer⠀listeners⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀gap,⠀ask⠀about⠀timing⠀or⠀access,⠀weigh⠀the⠀story⠀against⠀their⠀own⠀need,⠀or⠀attend⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀not⠀guessed.⠀Their⠀responses⠀need⠀not⠀correct⠀the⠀account⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀revelation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀telling⠀affect⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀content⠀and⠀the⠀relationships⠀involved,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀performance⠀to⠀become⠀evidence,⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀change⠀anyone's⠀mind.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀connect⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀track⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀told⠀offense⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀situation.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀within⠀continuing⠀telling,⠀listening,⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀pause⠀or⠀conclusion.⠀No⠀in-world⠀pause,⠀completed⠀tale,⠀audience⠀verdict,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀is⠀mandatory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modernist/absurdist⠀route.⠀Identify⠀a⠀rule,⠀classification,⠀agreement,⠀or⠀apparently⠀reasonable⠀claim⠀that⠀operates⠀within⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation:⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀scheme,⠀a⠀restriction⠀on⠀access,⠀a⠀division⠀of⠀responsibility,⠀a⠀justification⠀offered⠀by⠀someone⠀involved.⠀Establish⠀the⠀premise⠀through⠀the⠀source's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀circumstances⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀theme.\n\nThen⠀distinguish⠀three⠀things⠀in⠀the⠀telling.⠀First,⠀what⠀the⠀premise⠀states⠀or⠀promises.⠀Second,⠀what⠀its⠀terms⠀would⠀imply⠀if⠀applied⠀consistently.⠀Third,⠀what⠀actually⠀happens⠀for⠀the⠀chosen⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀situation.⠀As⠀the⠀story⠀moves⠀through⠀these,⠀expose⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀them⠀by⠀particular⠀application:⠀show⠀the⠀promised⠀general⠀rule⠀encountering⠀a⠀concrete⠀case,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀practical⠀effect.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀expose⠀an⠀exact⠀fit,⠀a⠀real⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀general⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀terms⠀of⠀carrying⠀it⠀out.⠀Make⠀that⠀relation⠀concrete⠀through⠀actual⠀experience⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrative⠀context,⠀without⠀requiring⠀or⠀prohibiting⠀an⠀explicit⠀judgment⠀about⠀the⠀arrangement.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀implications⠀grounded⠀in⠀actual⠀world⠀mechanisms⠀and⠀outside⠀causes.⠀A⠀premise⠀can⠀have⠀real⠀effects⠀without⠀becoming⠀an⠀omnipotent⠀law;⠀other⠀people,⠀material⠀conditions,⠀timing,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀competence⠀can⠀intervene.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀trap,⠀a⠀failed⠀institution,⠀or⠀a⠀demonstration⠀merely⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀pattern.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀consideration⠀or⠀application⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion,⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀in-world⠀pause⠀or⠀completed⠀implication.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀chosen⠀person's⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀what⠀is⠀useful⠀to⠀the⠀argument.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀contradiction,⠀miss⠀it,⠀accept⠀it,⠀or⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀aspect⠀of⠀the⠀situation.⠀Different⠀people⠀respond⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀premise;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀all⠀become⠀the⠀same⠀comic⠀narrator.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀is⠀a⠀structural⠀relation⠀in⠀the⠀fiction,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀joke⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLocate⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀inside⠀the⠀actual⠀criminal⠀situation.⠀Identify⠀what⠀privilege,⠀public⠀image,⠀access,⠀or⠀desire⠀is⠀in⠀play⠀for⠀the⠀people⠀involved⠀in⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath.⠀Establish⠀these⠀through⠀the⠀supplied⠀material⠀relationships:⠀who⠀owes⠀what⠀to⠀whom,⠀what⠀an⠀old⠀arrangement⠀still⠀permits,⠀what⠀a⠀public⠀reputation⠀protects,⠀what⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀means⠀or⠀actually⠀costs,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀burden.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀imposing⠀account⠀beside⠀a⠀relevant⠀practical⠀term.⠀When⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀institution⠀presents⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀about⠀authority,⠀loyalty,⠀tradition,⠀or⠀control,⠀follow⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀specific⠀present-day⠀logistics⠀that⠀support⠀or⠀strain⠀it:⠀a⠀building's⠀condition,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀made,⠀a⠀schedule⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept,⠀a⠀small⠀task⠀that⠀requires⠀someone's⠀cooperation.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrative⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀imposing⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀particular⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀feel⠀both⠀the⠀old⠀weight⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀strain.⠀The⠀contrast⠀between⠀inherited⠀gravity⠀and⠀these⠀practical⠀particulars⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene,⠀without⠀requiring⠀dismissal⠀of⠀the⠀authority⠀as⠀hollow.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀narrator⠀or⠀character⠀judgment⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀shape⠀experience⠀without⠀proving⠀motive.⠀Urban⠀material⠀detail,⠀private⠀desire,⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀feel⠀dangerous,⠀intimate,⠀or⠀exposed,⠀but⠀a⠀beautiful⠀room,⠀an⠀unsettling⠀ritual,⠀or⠀a⠀damaged⠀object⠀matters⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀function⠀and⠀history.⠀Sincere⠀authority,⠀real⠀fraud,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀competence⠀all⠀remain⠀available⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supports.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀unmasking,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀new⠀mechanism,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀correction.\n\nPreserve⠀freely⠀offered⠀or⠀earned⠀trust⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀feeling.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀place;⠀the⠀scene⠀decides.⠀Keep⠀each⠀character's⠀actual⠀understanding⠀and⠀interests,⠀which⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀differ.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀ongoing⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀experience,⠀a⠀real⠀pause,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion⠀without⠀requiring⠀revelation⠀or⠀completed⠀confrontation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀situated⠀participant⠀testimony⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀The⠀account⠀comes⠀from⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀involved⠀in⠀or⠀affected⠀by⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀criminal⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀that⠀person's⠀position,⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀present⠀purpose.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀narrator⠀participation⠀that⠀the⠀supplied⠀material⠀does⠀not⠀support;⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀have⠀seen,⠀done,⠀heard,⠀or⠀only⠀later⠀learned⠀what⠀is⠀recounted.\n\nConvey⠀the⠀source's⠀account⠀through⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator⠀and⠀form.⠀When⠀the⠀testimony⠀offers⠀a⠀broad⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances,⠀follow⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀terms⠀the⠀source⠀chooses:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀experienced,⠀what⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀arranged,⠀what⠀was⠀observed⠀at⠀close⠀range,⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Move⠀from⠀the⠀general⠀claim⠀into⠀those⠀particulars⠀as⠀the⠀teller⠀remembers⠀or⠀selects⠀them,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀received⠀explanation⠀and⠀these⠀particulars⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀testimony⠀itself,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀narrator's⠀correction.⠀Any⠀actual⠀supported⠀correction,⠀contextual⠀explanation⠀or⠀judgment⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀its⠀permitted⠀form.\n\nDistinguish⠀three⠀layers⠀of⠀knowledge.⠀Original⠀knowledge⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀the⠀events.⠀Reported⠀explanation⠀is⠀what⠀others⠀said⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀was⠀told.⠀Present⠀interpretation⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀selects,⠀emphasizes,⠀or⠀understands.⠀Accurate⠀anticipation⠀and⠀real⠀deception⠀can⠀both⠀remain;⠀later⠀knowledge⠀does⠀not⠀rewrite⠀earlier⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀present⠀selection⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀reveal⠀the⠀whole⠀truth.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀source's⠀register⠀and⠀community⠀specific,⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀teller's⠀full⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀spoken⠀testimony.⠀No⠀confession,⠀credibility⠀verdict,⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀audience⠀response⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀testimony⠀may⠀persuade,⠀inform,⠀mislead,⠀or⠀simply⠀record.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀telling,⠀reception,⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀pause⠀or⠀conclusion,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀account⠀or⠀listener⠀reaction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀diary⠀with⠀reflective⠀notes⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀The⠀story⠀is⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀recorder's⠀dated⠀or⠀situated⠀entries,⠀written⠀by⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀position⠀in⠀or⠀near⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀criminal⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath.⠀Let⠀the⠀recorder's⠀own⠀voice,⠀habits⠀of⠀attention,⠀and⠀reason⠀for⠀writing⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀noted⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀omitted.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recorder⠀select⠀actual⠀events,⠀words,⠀or⠀practical⠀particulars⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀at⠀their⠀own⠀register⠀and⠀extent.⠀When⠀the⠀entry⠀offers⠀a⠀broad⠀explanation⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀or⠀why,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀exact⠀notation:⠀a⠀specific⠀time,⠀a⠀particular⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used,⠀a⠀small⠀task⠀that⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀done,⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀changed⠀hands,⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀recorder⠀noticed⠀but⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀understand.⠀Let⠀the⠀movement⠀from⠀the⠀general⠀explanation⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀notation⠀happen⠀through⠀the⠀recorder's⠀own⠀selection⠀as⠀the⠀entry⠀proceeds;⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀that⠀selection,⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀explanatory⠀gloss,⠀while⠀actual⠀recorded⠀explanation⠀or⠀permitted⠀narrative⠀and⠀private⠀recognition⠀may⠀remain.\n\nKeep⠀original⠀and⠀annotated⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀recorder⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀what⠀was⠀later⠀learned,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀recorder⠀now⠀reflects⠀upon.⠀A⠀later⠀note⠀does⠀not⠀retroactively⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀recorder's⠀full⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀recorded⠀wording;⠀the⠀diary⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀write,⠀not⠀the⠀complete⠀mind.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀entry⠀to⠀complete⠀itself,⠀pause⠀for⠀writing,⠀inventory⠀the⠀seasons,⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀hidden⠀original⠀motive.⠀The⠀recorder⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀across⠀entries,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀question⠀unresolved.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀writing⠀or⠀thought,⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀completed⠀entry,⠀or⠀at⠀a⠀real⠀pause.⠀No⠀stopped⠀recorder,⠀realization⠀or⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀compulsory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic/nonlinear⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀criminal⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀through⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀situated⠀source:⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀witness,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀document,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀retelling.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀account⠀to⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀time,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀know⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀remembering,⠀or⠀recording⠀at⠀each⠀shift.\n\nPlace⠀a⠀shared⠀particular⠀where⠀the⠀real⠀emphases⠀can⠀be⠀compared.⠀Choose⠀a⠀concrete⠀event,⠀object,⠀place,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀that⠀appears⠀in⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀account,⠀and⠀preserve⠀each⠀source's⠀actual⠀selection,⠀with⠀overlapping⠀or⠀different⠀aspects⠀as⠀the⠀accounts⠀support.⠀When⠀a⠀source⠀offers⠀a⠀broad⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances,⠀follow⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀terms⠀that⠀source⠀notices⠀or⠀omits,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀comparison⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀sources'⠀actual⠀selections⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀summary.⠀Scale⠀and⠀difference⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀itself,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀narrator's⠀verdict⠀on⠀accuracy,⠀while⠀any⠀actual⠀supported⠀factual⠀judgment⠀remains⠀available⠀under⠀narrator⠀authority.\n\nAllow⠀scale⠀to⠀emerge⠀without⠀a⠀truth⠀contest.⠀The⠀sources⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀equally⠀reliable,⠀and⠀they⠀need⠀not⠀converge⠀on⠀a⠀single⠀version.⠀A⠀source⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀about⠀one⠀detail⠀and⠀wrong⠀about⠀another;⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀without⠀erasing⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀source⠀experienced.⠀Preserve⠀original⠀versus⠀later⠀knowledge⠀and⠀each⠀source's⠀full⠀private⠀mind⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀permits.\n\nDo⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀neutral⠀baseline,⠀a⠀fixed⠀voice⠀count,⠀a⠀new⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀convergence⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Polyphony⠀may⠀continue⠀across⠀replies⠀with⠀each⠀account's⠀actual⠀emphasis,⠀familiar⠀or⠀different.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀within⠀a⠀continuing⠀account,⠀comparison,⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀pause⠀or⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaean::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀criminal⠀circumstance⠀is⠀underway⠀or⠀being⠀discussed.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀moves,⠀make⠀the⠀new⠀location⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀conditions⠀clear⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀descriptive⠀pause.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀information⠀its⠀needed⠀permitted⠀context.⠀When⠀a⠀scheme,⠀relationship,⠀rule,⠀or⠀piece⠀of⠀criminal-world⠀knowledge⠀matters,⠀supply⠀it⠀through⠀explanation,⠀preparation,⠀observation,⠀or⠀use⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀dump⠀background⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀begins,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀withhold⠀a⠀fact⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀already⠀knows⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀reveal.\n\nPace⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀an⠀account⠀and⠀practical⠀reception⠀with⠀flexible⠀paragraphs.⠀When⠀someone⠀offers⠀a⠀broad⠀claim⠀about⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀consequences,⠀follow⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀logistical⠀terms⠀that⠀apply:⠀what⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀arranged,⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀breaking⠀down,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀actually⠀do.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀give⠀private⠀response⠀its⠀own⠀space⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reaction⠀needs⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀large⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀term⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀responses,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀narrator's⠀joke,⠀while⠀any⠀actual⠀witty⠀or⠀plain⠀commentary⠀retains⠀its⠀permitted⠀voice.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀actual⠀knowledge.⠀Reactions⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀owner;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀comic⠀beat.⠀Keep⠀each⠀character's⠀actual⠀understanding⠀and⠀response,⠀shared⠀or⠀different.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀during⠀continuing⠀thought⠀or⠀action⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀pause⠀or⠀conclusion;⠀no⠀result,⠀demonstration,⠀completed⠀exchange⠀or⠀in-world⠀pause⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀sound,⠀image,⠀or⠀phrase⠀actually⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀memory.⠀Develop⠀it⠀through⠀syntax,⠀repetition,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀sentence⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀offense,⠀the⠀scheme,⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀feeling;⠀let⠀the⠀cadence⠀and⠀associations⠀make⠀it⠀felt.⠀The⠀image⠀may⠀be⠀ordinary—a⠀ringing⠀phone,⠀a⠀stain⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀door⠀closes—but⠀it⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀crime⠀and⠀this⠀moment.\n\nThen⠀let⠀the⠀imagery⠀collide⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀particular⠀from⠀the⠀criminal⠀situation:⠀the⠀amount⠀that⠀was⠀short,⠀the⠀key⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits,⠀the⠀witness⠀who⠀was⠀looking⠀the⠀wrong⠀way,⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀took⠀too⠀long.⠀The⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀grand⠀phrase⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀exact⠀fact⠀is⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀fact⠀to⠀deflate⠀the⠀feeling⠀or⠀the⠀feeling⠀to⠀ennoble⠀the⠀fact.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀sense⠀the⠀absurd⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀crime—how⠀a⠀large⠀plan⠀depended⠀on⠀a⠀tiny⠀detail,⠀how⠀a⠀profound⠀betrayal⠀fit⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀afternoon.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀available.⠀The⠀imagery⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀narrator's⠀perception⠀or⠀authorized⠀association,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Other⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀fact⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀register;⠀they⠀need⠀not⠀echo⠀the⠀figurative⠀language.⠀Genuine⠀feeling⠀may⠀persist⠀without⠀a⠀correction,⠀an⠀improved⠀mood,⠀or⠀an⠀outward⠀return.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀the⠀association⠀while⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀remain⠀concrete⠀and⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀current⠀particular—a⠀familiar⠀sound,⠀an⠀object⠀still⠀in⠀use,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀again,⠀a⠀place⠀now⠀changed—open⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀recollection⠀of⠀an⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀milieu,⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀Move⠀between⠀the⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀present⠀to⠀be⠀only⠀loss.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change:⠀the⠀chair⠀that⠀was⠀moved,⠀the⠀money⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀counted⠀twice,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀stopped⠀answering.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀original⠀account⠀from⠀the⠀remembered⠀version⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀interpretation.⠀Use⠀tense⠀shifts,⠀qualifiers,⠀and⠀careful⠀attributions⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀was⠀believed⠀then,⠀what⠀someone⠀else⠀claimed,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀understood⠀differently.⠀A⠀broad⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀can⠀meet⠀its⠀practical⠀instance:⠀the⠀plan⠀that⠀sounded⠀reasonable,⠀the⠀sum⠀that⠀seemed⠀enough,⠀the⠀promise⠀that⠀depended⠀on⠀a⠀detail⠀no⠀one⠀checked.⠀Let⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀large⠀claim⠀reveal⠀itself⠀through⠀the⠀small⠀exact⠀fact⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀mock.⠀Do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀original⠀person's⠀knowledge⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀narrator⠀wiser⠀or⠀to⠀insert⠀a⠀belated⠀secret⠀intent.\n\nLet⠀familiar⠀meaning⠀or⠀real⠀change⠀remain.⠀An⠀attachment⠀may⠀persist,⠀a⠀place⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀used,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀pleasure⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀pleasurable.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀loss,⠀a⠀moral,⠀an⠀improved⠀mood,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀interpretation.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀boundary;⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀continuing⠀reflection⠀while⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀and⠀their⠀human⠀aftermath⠀remain⠀concrete⠀and⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀construction.⠀Link⠀actual⠀encounters⠀through⠀a⠀recognizable⠀aim⠀in⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath:⠀the⠀same⠀debt,⠀the⠀same⠀missing⠀person,⠀the⠀same⠀shipment,⠀the⠀same⠀arrangement⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀completed⠀or⠀undone.⠀Each⠀encounter⠀must⠀retain⠀resources,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀from⠀the⠀one⠀before.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀may⠀depend⠀on⠀what⠀was⠀gained,⠀promised,⠀or⠀learned⠀earlier,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀advance⠀the⠀aim⠀by⠀a⠀fixed⠀amount.⠀The⠀movement⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quest⠀with⠀a⠀progress⠀bar;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀collisions⠀between⠀the⠀continuing⠀concern⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀happen⠀to⠀meet⠀it.\n\nLet⠀relevant⠀local⠀accounts⠀meet⠀their⠀real⠀use.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀offers⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀criminal⠀concern,⠀show⠀whether⠀it⠀fits,⠀helps,⠀or⠀misses.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀supply⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀that⠀solves⠀a⠀small⠀problem;⠀another⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀fool;⠀another⠀may⠀cooperate⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀friend.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀person⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀scheme,⠀every⠀host⠀to⠀be⠀hostile,⠀or⠀every⠀encounter⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀trick,⠀a⠀new⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀a⠀step⠀forward.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀its⠀particular⠀consequences:⠀the⠀plan⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀the⠀threat⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀working⠀telephone,⠀the⠀reputation⠀that⠀cannot⠀survive⠀a⠀small⠀errand.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀satirical⠀eye⠀notice⠀these⠀mismatches,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀the⠀same⠀comic⠀narrator.\n\nFull⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀actual⠀conclusions⠀remain⠀available.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀continuing⠀concern⠀still⠀underway,⠀without⠀a⠀moral,⠀a⠀completed⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀encounter⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaear::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀broad⠀claim,⠀one⠀practical⠀fact,⠀and⠀one⠀response⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀its⠀human⠀aftermath.⠀Use⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀For⠀example,⠀the⠀claim⠀that⠀the⠀plan⠀was⠀simple;⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀door⠀was⠀already⠀locked;⠀the⠀response⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀said⠀nothing.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀fact⠀remain⠀inferable⠀without⠀restating⠀it.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀the⠀absurd⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀crime—how⠀a⠀large⠀intention⠀depended⠀on⠀a⠀tiny⠀detail—through⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀alone.\n\nCut⠀repeated⠀framing⠀rather⠀than⠀necessary⠀cause,⠀private⠀recognition,⠀or⠀emotional⠀repetition.⠀If⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀needs⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀to⠀reason⠀through⠀a⠀decision,⠀keep⠀the⠀thought⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀delete⠀causality.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀every⠀speaker⠀to⠀a⠀terse⠀line⠀or⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀a⠀three-part⠀beat.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀stock⠀tough,⠀and⠀a⠀serious⠀feeling⠀may⠀remain⠀serious⠀without⠀being⠀announced.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator⠀and⠀cast⠀register.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀explanatory⠀gloss⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀thought⠀or⠀a⠀necessary⠀perceptual⠀link.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀the⠀plain⠀fact⠀that⠀follows⠀it,⠀without⠀a⠀joke.⠀No⠀lie⠀exposure,⠀new⠀information,⠀or⠀final⠀deflation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀still⠀concrete⠀and⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀with⠀natural⠀movement⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Keep⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀milieu,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀scene:⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀moved,⠀who⠀is⠀waiting,⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀gone⠀wrong,⠀or⠀what⠀still⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀said.⠀Any⠀necessary⠀explanation⠀or⠀criminal⠀context⠀must⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀form,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀interrupt⠀lived⠀scene⠀experience⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀situation⠀would⠀actually⠀interrupt⠀it.⠀Explanatory⠀prose⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀fictional⠀pause.\n\nLet⠀a⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀or⠀apparently⠀reasonable⠀premise⠀meet⠀its⠀actual⠀terms⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀plan⠀in⠀broad⠀terms—\"we⠀move⠀the⠀money⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀notices\"—and⠀then⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀dialogue⠀shows⠀the⠀particular⠀detail⠀that⠀complicates⠀it:⠀the⠀elevator⠀is⠀out,⠀the⠀envelope⠀is⠀the⠀wrong⠀size,⠀the⠀accountant⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀office⠀next⠀door.⠀Let⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀appear⠀through⠀this⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀life⠀without⠀a⠀joke⠀after⠀every⠀beat.⠀A⠀digression⠀may⠀open⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀and⠀remain⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀problem,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀return⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.\n\nPreserve⠀serious⠀feeling,⠀accurate⠀claims,⠀independent⠀voices,⠀and⠀actual⠀outcomes.⠀Different⠀people⠀respond⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀criminal⠀circumstances;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀all⠀become⠀the⠀same⠀comic⠀narrator.⠀No⠀new⠀threat,⠀correction,⠀puzzle⠀solution,⠀or⠀investigative⠀turn⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀the⠀scene⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀remains⠀underway.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀current⠀and⠀remembered⠀moments⠀for⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀permitted⠀history.⠀Use⠀scene⠀selection,⠀private⠀language,⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀and⠀consequences⠀that⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀bond.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀a⠀shared⠀habit,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀can⠀carry⠀meaning⠀without⠀being⠀explained⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀every⠀time⠀it⠀appears.⠀When⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀enter,⠀let⠀them⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀relationship's⠀specific⠀texture:⠀the⠀routine⠀that⠀becomes⠀suspicious,⠀the⠀joke⠀that⠀becomes⠀an⠀alibi,⠀the⠀kindness⠀that⠀becomes⠀a⠀liability.\n\nPlace⠀what⠀participants⠀say⠀or⠀expect⠀beside⠀the⠀practical⠀terms⠀of⠀complicity,⠀victimization,⠀care,⠀or⠀other⠀actual⠀criminal⠀consequences.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀roles⠀by⠀default:⠀the⠀more⠀outwardly⠀confident⠀partner⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀culprit,⠀the⠀more⠀cautious⠀one⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀victim,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀offers⠀help⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀hiding⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀Accurate⠀shared⠀understanding,⠀sincere⠀help,⠀and⠀real⠀disagreement⠀may⠀all⠀remain.⠀Let⠀a⠀broad⠀claim⠀about⠀loyalty⠀or⠀protection⠀meet⠀its⠀exact⠀practical⠀instance:⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀done,⠀the⠀secret⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept,⠀the⠀money⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀promised.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀large⠀emotional⠀claim⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀small⠀exact⠀failure⠀that⠀undermines⠀it,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀relationship⠀into⠀a⠀joke.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀channels.⠀One⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀remains⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀No⠀pair-only⠀frame,⠀confession,⠀changed⠀status,⠀secret⠀motive,⠀or⠀forward⠀movement⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀criminal⠀circumstances⠀both⠀still⠀concrete⠀and⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaeau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrasing.⠀Begin⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀formulaic⠀or⠀measured⠀statement⠀that⠀identifies⠀the⠀deed⠀as⠀something⠀heard⠀or⠀remembered:⠀\"It⠀is⠀said⠀that...\",⠀\"They⠀tell⠀how...\",⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀declaration⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀taken,⠀broken,⠀or⠀done.⠀Relate⠀an⠀actual⠀criminal⠀act⠀to⠀its⠀source's⠀remembered⠀account:⠀who⠀is⠀said⠀to⠀have⠀done⠀it,⠀what⠀was⠀taken⠀or⠀broken,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀claims⠀it⠀meant.⠀Keep⠀the⠀deed⠀at⠀its⠀supplied⠀scale.⠀A⠀theft⠀remains⠀a⠀theft,⠀a⠀scheme⠀remains⠀a⠀scheme,⠀and⠀a⠀killing⠀remains⠀a⠀killing⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀gives⠀it⠀remembered⠀cadence.\n\nLet⠀a⠀practical⠀term⠀confirm⠀or⠀qualify⠀the⠀description⠀within⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀broad⠀account⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀plan⠀was⠀bold⠀or⠀the⠀loss⠀was⠀total;⠀the⠀actual⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀source's⠀account⠀may⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀left⠀open,⠀the⠀amount⠀that⠀was⠀miscounted,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀placed⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀shrink⠀the⠀act⠀into⠀a⠀mock⠀hero⠀or⠀a⠀modest⠀errand,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀inflate⠀a⠀small⠀offense⠀into⠀legendary⠀doom.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀precise⠀logistical⠀term⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀joke⠀or⠀a⠀diminished⠀deed.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀practical⠀fact⠀creates⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀this⠀at⠀every⠀transition.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀source⠀and⠀narrator⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀within⠀one⠀telling⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀or⠀an⠀external⠀task.⠀Full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀beyond⠀reputation:⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀or⠀dangerous⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀experienced⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀way.⠀No⠀punishment,⠀completed⠀verdict,⠀or⠀next⠀modest⠀deed⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀remembered⠀account⠀still⠀in⠀tension⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
