obligation.⠀Divided⠀loyalty⠀is⠀practical:⠀someone⠀may⠀help⠀the⠀culprit⠀and⠀still⠀report⠀them,⠀protect⠀a⠀coworker⠀and⠀still⠀demand⠀repayment,⠀or⠀remain⠀silent⠀and⠀still⠀change⠀the⠀locks.⠀Let⠀cooperation⠀and⠀refusal⠀both⠀appear.\n\nInclude⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀interiority⠀during⠀preparation⠀and⠀aftermath.⠀Show⠀the⠀calculation⠀before⠀the⠀act:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀tells⠀themselves,⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀admit,⠀what⠀they⠀hope⠀to⠀avoid.⠀Show⠀the⠀physical⠀sensation⠀of⠀waiting⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀recognizing⠀that⠀someone⠀has⠀noticed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀to⠀others;⠀they⠀may⠀reassure⠀a⠀parent⠀while⠀knowing⠀the⠀money⠀is⠀gone,⠀or⠀accept⠀blame⠀calmly⠀while⠀planning⠀to⠀leave.\n\nLet⠀the⠀aftermath⠀unfold⠀through⠀work⠀and⠀domestic⠀consequences.⠀A⠀job⠀may⠀be⠀lost,⠀a⠀shop⠀may⠀close,⠀a⠀marriage⠀may⠀continue⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀silence,⠀a⠀colleague⠀may⠀move⠀away.⠀The⠀crime⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀punishment⠀or⠀full⠀exposure.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀returning⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀consequences⠀remain⠀unfinished:⠀washing⠀dishes,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀call,⠀locking⠀a⠀door,⠀sitting⠀down⠀to⠀a⠀meal⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀speaks⠀during.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness,⠀seasonal⠀inventory,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀Japanese⠀temperament⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀gives⠀a⠀region⠀or⠀season,⠀let⠀it⠀shape⠀names,⠀food,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀and⠀practical⠀arrangements.⠀Any⠀strangeness⠀remains⠀psychological⠀and⠀social:⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀behaves⠀as⠀if⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀still⠀binds⠀them,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀feels⠀different⠀after⠀an⠀argument,⠀a⠀coincidence⠀that⠀seems⠀to⠀confirm⠀a⠀private⠀fear.⠀Treat⠀such⠀strangeness⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀supernatural⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadajam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀crime⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀that⠀arises⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀household,⠀or⠀workplace,⠀where⠀people⠀know⠀each⠀other's⠀habits⠀and⠀depend⠀on⠀each⠀other's⠀cooperation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting's⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀generic⠀Latin⠀American⠀landscape⠀or⠀a⠀magical-realist⠀default.\n\nOpen⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀routine⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀crime's⠀pressure⠀enter⠀through⠀small⠀disturbances:⠀a⠀rent⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀paid,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀arrives⠀without⠀notice,⠀a⠀shop⠀that⠀stays⠀open⠀later,⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀evening's⠀plan.⠀Describe⠀the⠀routine⠀exactly:⠀the⠀preparation⠀of⠀food,⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀a⠀bus⠀or⠀train,⠀the⠀shared⠀work⠀of⠀closing⠀a⠀shop⠀or⠀office.⠀These⠀details⠀are⠀not⠀background;⠀they⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀crime⠀will⠀cost⠀and⠀who⠀will⠀notice.\n\nMake⠀the⠀offense⠀concrete⠀and⠀motivated⠀by⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀situation.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀steal⠀from⠀an⠀employer,⠀falsify⠀a⠀record,⠀hide⠀a⠀relative,⠀accept⠀a⠀bribe,⠀break⠀a⠀contract,⠀or⠀help⠀someone⠀escape.⠀Show⠀the⠀incentive⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀need⠀or⠀loyalty:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀medical⠀expense,⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀sibling,⠀a⠀fear⠀of⠀exposure.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀a⠀type;⠀let⠀the⠀choice⠀be⠀deliberate⠀and⠀uneasy,⠀with⠀consequences⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀partly⠀foresee.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀calm,⠀even⠀attention⠀for⠀moments⠀of⠀high⠀tension.⠀When⠀a⠀confrontation⠀occurs,⠀describe⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀the⠀people,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀fan⠀or⠀traffic,⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀spoken⠀and⠀the⠀pause⠀after⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀ordinary⠀details⠀during⠀the⠀crisis:⠀a⠀cup⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀counter,⠀a⠀child's⠀voice⠀from⠀another⠀room,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain.⠀The⠀strangeness⠀of⠀the⠀moment⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀familiar⠀setting⠀and⠀the⠀act⠀taking⠀place⠀inside⠀it.\n\nShow⠀the⠀city⠀and⠀neighborhood⠀as⠀a⠀network⠀of⠀specific⠀relationships⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀chorus.⠀Neighbors⠀may⠀know⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀truth,⠀a⠀relative⠀may⠀suspect⠀but⠀not⠀ask,⠀an⠀employer⠀may⠀choose⠀to⠀overlook⠀a⠀small⠀theft⠀because⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀obligation.⠀Divided⠀loyalty⠀is⠀practical:⠀someone⠀may⠀help⠀the⠀culprit⠀and⠀still⠀report⠀them,⠀protect⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀and⠀still⠀demand⠀repayment,⠀or⠀remain⠀silent⠀and⠀still⠀change⠀the⠀locks.⠀Let⠀cooperation⠀and⠀refusal⠀both⠀appear.\n\nInclude⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀interiority⠀during⠀preparation⠀and⠀aftermath.⠀Show⠀the⠀calculation⠀before⠀the⠀act:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀tells⠀themselves,⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀admit,⠀what⠀they⠀hope⠀to⠀avoid.⠀Show⠀the⠀physical⠀sensation⠀of⠀waiting⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀recognizing⠀that⠀someone⠀has⠀noticed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀to⠀others;⠀they⠀may⠀reassure⠀a⠀parent⠀while⠀knowing⠀the⠀money⠀is⠀gone,⠀or⠀accept⠀blame⠀calmly⠀while⠀planning⠀to⠀leave.\n\nLet⠀the⠀aftermath⠀unfold⠀through⠀urban⠀and⠀domestic⠀consequences.⠀A⠀household⠀may⠀lose⠀its⠀income,⠀a⠀shop⠀may⠀close,⠀a⠀marriage⠀may⠀continue⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀silence,⠀a⠀relative⠀may⠀move⠀away.⠀The⠀crime⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀punishment⠀or⠀full⠀exposure.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀returning⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀consequences⠀remain⠀unfinished:⠀washing⠀dishes,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀call,⠀locking⠀a⠀door,⠀sitting⠀down⠀to⠀a⠀meal⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀speaks⠀during.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀magical⠀realism,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀Latin⠀American⠀temperament⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀gives⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀community,⠀let⠀it⠀shape⠀names,⠀food,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀and⠀practical⠀arrangements.⠀Any⠀strangeness⠀remains⠀psychological⠀and⠀social:⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀behaves⠀as⠀if⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀still⠀binds⠀them,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀feels⠀different⠀after⠀an⠀argument,⠀a⠀coincidence⠀that⠀seems⠀to⠀confirm⠀a⠀private⠀fear.⠀Treat⠀such⠀strangeness⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀supernatural⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
